zf_sl_02_01=Steel Tail
desc_zf_sl_02_01_1=Within the range of your array, teammates who are attacked by the enemy will lower the enemy's external attack value by 5% for 5 seconds each time they are attacked. This state lasts for 40 seconds.<br>With the arrays of the Royal Guard and Jianghu, enemy's external attack value is reduced by 6%;  with Wanderer's Valley and guild arrays the value is reduced by 4%.
desc_zf_sl_02_01_2=(Array Required) When a friendly player is attacked within the array, the attacker's External Attack is reduced by 7% for 5 seconds. Lasts 2 minutes.<br>Reduction increases to 8% in the Royal Guard and Jianghu Arrays. Reduction decerases to 6% in the Wanderer's Valley and Guild Arrays.
desc_zf_sl_02_01_3=(Array Required) When a friendly player is attacked within the array, the attacker's External Attack is reduced by 9% for 5 seconds. Lasts 2 minutes.<br>Reduction increases to 10% in the Royal Guard and Jianghu Arrays. Reduction decerases to 8% in the Wanderer's Valley and Guild Arrays.
zf_sl_02_02=Indestructible
desc_zf_sl_02_02_1=Members within the array receive a buff that can absorb up to 750 damage.
desc_zf_sl_02_02_2=Members within the array receive a buff that can absorb up to 900 damage.
desc_zf_sl_02_02_3=Members within the array receive a buff that can absorb up to 1050 damage.
