zf_wd_02_01=Get Burned
desc_zf_wd_02_01_1=Attach an effect to friendly targets in array area, under this effect, there is a 30% chance to trigger an effect when player get hit, this effect is increasing 2% Internal Attack Damage power, last 6s, can stack 5 times at most, last 1m.
desc_zf_wd_02_01_2=(Array Required) Attach a Buff to a friendly player. Players with the Buff will have 30% chance to increase their Internal Attack Damage by 2% for 6 seconds when attacked. Can be stacked up to 4 times, lasts 40 seconds.
desc_zf_wd_02_01_3=(Array Required) Attach a Buff to a friendly player. Players with the Buff will have 30% chance to increase their Internal Attack Damage by 2% for 6 seconds when attacked. Can be stacked up to 6 times, lasts 1 minute.
zf_wd_02_02=Steal The Sun
desc_zf_wd_02_02_1=Attach an effect to yourself, makes your each attack has a 20% chance to drain 1% of enemy's Energy, last 9s.
desc_zf_wd_02_02_2=Each attack has 30% chance to absorb 1% Energy from an enemy.
desc_zf_wd_02_02_3=Each attack has 40% chance to absorb 1% Energy from an enemy.
zf_em_02_01=Butterflies in Flowers
desc_zf_em_02_01_1=Increase team members' Evasion by 30%. Lasts 20 seconds.
desc_zf_em_02_01_2=(Array Required) Increases Evasion by 40% for all friendly players within the array. Lasts 20 seconds.
desc_zf_em_02_01_3=(Array Required) Increases Evasion by 50% for all friendly players within the array. Lasts 20 seconds.
jn_tg29_051=Meteor Hammer
desc_jn_tg29_051_1=<s>
zf_em_02_02=Falling Flowers
desc_zf_em_02_02_1=A skill that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy and lowers its defenses by 200 for 10 seconds<br>Damage increased by 50% for Scholars and Jianghu Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% for Tangmen and Guild Arrays
desc_zf_em_02_02_2=Deals 550 damage to enemies within a rectangular region in front of you, lowering their defense by 250 and lasting 10 seconds.<br>With Scholars and Jianghu arrays damage done is increased by 50%, and with Tangmen and guild arrays damage dealt is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_em_02_02_3=Deals 650 damage to enemies within a rectangular region in front of you, lowering their defense by 300 and lasting 10 seconds.<br>With Scholars and Jianghu arrays damage done is increased by 50%, and with Tangmen and guild arrays damage dealt is reduced by 50%.
