zs_suicide=Break Meridians
desc_zs_suicide_1=Gather chi until it bursts out of body, and all of meridians and channels break. Death follows shortly. <br/><font color="#FF0000"> (Cannot be used in fighting)</font>
zf_jz_02_01=Dancing Lotus Leaves
desc_zf_jz_02_01_1=Every member within the array recovers 30 Energy every 2 seconds. Lasts 6 seconds.
desc_zf_jz_02_01_2=(Array Required) Friendly players within the array will recover 35 Energy every 2 seconds. Lasts 6 seconds.
desc_zf_jz_02_01_3=(Array Required) Friendly players within the array will recover 40 Energy every 2 seconds. Lasts 6 seconds.
zf_jz_02_02=catch moon in water
desc_zf_jz_02_02_1=A skill that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy.<br>Damage increased by 50% for Beggar's Sect and Jianghu Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% in Emei and Guild Arrays.
desc_zf_jz_02_02_2=Deal 750 damage to enemies within a fan-shaped vicinity in front of you<br>With Beggar's Sect and Jianghu arrays damage dealt is increased by 50%, while Emei and guild arrays' effectiveness are reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_jz_02_02_3=Deal 900 damage to enemies within a fan-shaped vicinity in front of you<br>With Beggar's Sect and Jianghu arrays damage dealt is increased by 50%, while Emei and guild arrays' effectiveness are reduced by 50%.
zf_jl_02_01=Spiritual Regulation
desc_zf_jl_02_01_1=Enemies within the range of the array will have their movements consume 5% more Energy for 15 seconds.<br>With Shaolin and Jianghu arrays, enemy movements consume 6% more Energy; with Beggar's Sect and guild arrays they consume 4%.
desc_zf_jl_02_01_2=Enemies within the range of the array will have their movements consume 10% more Energy for 15 seconds.<br>With Shaolin and Jianghu arrays, enemy movements consume 12% more Energy; with Beggar's Sect and guild arrays they consume 8%.
desc_zf_jl_02_01_3=Enemies within the range of the array will have their movements consume 15% more Energy for 15 seconds.<br>With Shaolin and Jianghu arrays, enemy movements consume 18% more Energy; with Beggar's Sect and guild arrays they consume 12%.
