zf_jh_01_01=Wind And Thunder On The Plains
desc_zf_jh_01_01_1=Single blow that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target within a ten meter radius. Targets in the Total Eradication state will receive double damage.<br>Damage increased by 50% for the 28 Constellations Array. Damage decreased by 50% for the Vigor Return and School Arrays.
zf_jhts_01_001=Miraculous Healing Skill
desc_zf_jhts_01_001_1=Dispel enemy's Buff (Evasion). (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
zf_jhts_01_002=After Rain the Sky Looks Blue
desc_zf_jhts_01_002_1=Dispel friendly target's Debuff (Silence). (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
zf_jh_02_01=Return Tiger to the Mountain
desc_zf_jh_02_01_1=A single attack, dealing one-time {@0:伤害包} damage and lowering the target's attack power by 5%. Effect can be stacked three times and lasts four seconds.<br>Damage increased by 50% for the Three Talents Array and Guild Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% for the Six Combinations Array and School Arrays.
zf_jhts_02_001=The Spirit of Thunder
desc_zf_jhts_02_001_1=Mighty punch, can interrupt Wu Zhen's Heaven Thunder Shake Earth skill. (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
zf_jhts_02_002=Five Elements Protect Body
desc_zf_jhts_02_002_1=Reduce taken damage from special skill for all targets in array area. (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
zf_jhts_02_003=Five Elements Become One
zf_jhts_02_004=The Spirit of Golden Light
desc_zf_jhts_02_004_1=Weaken target, can interrupt Guo Li's Thunder Bullet. (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
zf_jh_03_01=An Unexpected Talent
desc_zf_jh_03_01_1=An attack skill that deals {@0:伤害包} damage and breaks the target's armor, reducing External Parry by 1%. Can be stacked five times and lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increased by 50% with Wind and Sand Array and Guild Arrays. Damage decreased by Three Sword Array and School Arrays.
desc_zf_jh_03_01_2=Single attack skill that deals 1200 damage. Causes Break Armor debuff which reduces External Parry by 2%. Stacks 5 times. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_zf_jh_03_01_3=Single attack skill that deals 1400 damage. Causes Break Armor debuff which reduces External Parry by3%. Stacks 5 times. Lasts 6 seconds.
zf_jh_03_02=Total Annihilation
desc_zf_jh_03_02_1=3.5 meter AOE attack that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_zf_jh_03_02_2=A 3.5-meter rectangular range of attack inflicting 1, 200 damage<br>Damage increased by 50% for Wind and Sand Array and Guild Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% in Trinity Array and School Arrays.
desc_zf_jh_03_02_3=A 3.5-meter rectangular range of attack inflicting 1, 350 damage<br>Damage increased by 50% for Wind and Sand Array and Guild Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% in Trinity Array and School Arrays.
zf_jhts_03_001=Absolute Order
desc_zf_jhts_03_001_1=Several players gather their Energy together to send it to team member in danger, to recover massive HP and Energy instantly. (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
jn_tg06_015=Spirit Snake Emerges - Parry
