zf_jh_04_01=Fast as Lightning
desc_zf_jh_04_01_1=At close range this deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target.<br>Damage increased by 50% for Fishing Net Array and Guild Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% in 28 Constellations Array and School Arrays.
desc_zf_jh_04_01_2=Deal 900 damage to a target at a close distance.
desc_zf_jh_04_01_3=Deal 1000 damage to a target at a close distance.
zf_jh_04_02=Autumn Wind Scuttling Fallen Leaves
desc_zf_jh_04_02_1=3m radius cone attack that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_zf_jh_04_02_2=Within a 3-meter radius, conical attack range, deal 850 damage<br>In Fishing Net arrays and guild arrays effectiveness is increased by 50%, and in the 28 Constellation array and School arrays, effectiveness is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_jh_04_02_3=Within a 3-meter radius, conical attack range, deal 950 damage<br>In Fishing Net arrays and guild arrays effectiveness is increased by 50%, and in the 28 Constellation array and School arrays, effectiveness is reduced by 50%.
