zf_jh_05_01=Be Loose But Never Miss
desc_zf_jh_05_01_1=A single attack that deals {@0:伤害包} damage, lowering the target's attack speed by 5%. Can be stacked three times. Lasts 3 seconds.<br>Effect increased by 50% in Six Combinations Array and Guild Arrays. Effect decreased by 50% in Wind and Sand Array and School Arrays.
zf_jh_05_02=Tight Encirclement
desc_zf_jh_05_02_1=Reduce 30% movement speed in a 5m radius cone (max. 6 targets). Lasts 7 seconds.
