desc_zf_jh_06_01_1=Grant "Six Directions" buff which increases Brawn by 2% for all targets in array.
desc_zf_jh_06_01_2=Grant "Six Directions" buff which increases Brawn by 4% for all targets in array.
desc_zf_jh_06_01_3=Grant "Six Directions" buff which increases Brawn by 6% for all targets in array.
zf_jh_06_02=Push With Overwhelming Momentum
desc_zf_jh_06_02_1=Obtain a status that lasts for 50 seconds. Within the duration, you will have 20% chance to lower your enemy's Internal and External Parrys by 1% for 15 seconds with a 5 times maximum.<br>With the Vigor Returns Array and Guild Arrays, you will have an additional 5 seconds in effect duration and maximum increases by 1. With Fishing Net Array and School Arrays, you will have 5 seconds reduction in effect duration and maximum reduces by 1.
desc_zf_jh_06_02_2=Obtain a status that lasts for 50 seconds. Within the duration, you will have 25% chance to lower your enemy's Internal and External Parrys by 2% for 15 seconds with a 5 times maximum.<br>With the Vigor Returns Array and Guild Arrays, you will have an additional 5 seconds in effect duration and maximum increases by 1. With Fishing Net Array and School Arrays, you will have 5 seconds reduction in effect duration and maximum reduces by 1.
desc_zf_jh_06_02_3=Obtain a status that lasts for 50 seconds. Within the duration, you will have 30% chance to lower your enemy's Internal and External Parrys by 3% for 15 seconds with a 5 times maximum.<br>With the Vigor Returns Array and Guild Arrays, you will have an additional 5 seconds in effect duration and maximum increases by 1. With Fishing Net Array and School Arrays, you will have 5 seconds reduction in effect duration and maximum reduces by 1.
