zf_wd_01_02=Wind Blows The Willow
zf_wd_02_03=Dam the River
desc_zf_wd_02_03_1=An attack that reduces the enemy's movement speed by 20% and hit rate by 50% for 6 seconds.<br>With the Tangmen and Jianghu arrays, its effectiveness is reduced by 7 seconds. With the Royal Guard and guild arrays the effect lasts only 5 seconds.
desc_zf_wd_02_03_2=Enemies falling within the vicinity of the array will have their movement speed reduced by 20% and hit rating reduced by 50% for 7 seconds.<br>With Tangmen and Jianghu arrays this effect last 8 seconds, and with Royal Guard and guild arrays it lasts 6 seconds.
desc_zf_wd_02_03_3=All enemies within the range of effect will have their movement speed reduced by 20%, and their hit rating will be reduced by 50% for 8 seconds.<br>With Tangmen and Jianghu arrays this effect lasts 9 seconds, and with Royal Guard and guild arrays it lasts 7 seconds.
zf_jy_01_02=Invulnerable
zf_gb_01_02=Dirty Face
zf_jl_01_01=Deep Grief
zf_jl_01_02=Overwhelmed
zf_jy_02_01=Kill Dragon With Anger
desc_zf_jy_02_01_1=Makes individual enemies dizzy for three seconds, afterwards slowing down their movement speed by 30% for five seconds.<br>With Wudang and Jianghu sects movement speed is reduced for 6 seconds. With Shaolin and guild sects it is reduced for only 4 seconds.
desc_zf_jy_02_01_2=Dizzies 4 enemies for 4 seconds. Afterwards, their movement speed is reduced by 40% for 5 seconds.<br>Speed is reduced for 6 seconds in Wudang and Guild Arrays. Speed is reduced for 4 seconds in Shaolin and Guild Arrays.
desc_zf_jy_02_01_3=Dizzies 4 enemies for 5 seconds. Afterwards, their movement speed is reduced by 40% for 5 seconds.<br>Speed is reduced for 6 seconds in Wudang and Guild Arrays. Speed is reduced for 4 seconds in Shaolin and Guild Arrays.
zf_jy_02_02=Thundering Ruin
desc_zf_jy_02_02_1=Deals 600 damage to target with less than 20% HP.
desc_zf_jy_02_02_2=Deals 1500 damage to target with less than 20% HP.
desc_zf_jy_02_02_3=Deals 1800 damage to target with less than 20% HP.
zf_tm_02_01=Five Poisons
desc_zf_tm_02_01_1=This causes the enemy target to lose 100 HP and 80 inner skill every three seconds for 9 seconds.<br>With Emei and Jianghu arrays the effect lasts for 12 seconds, and with Wudang and guild arrays the effect lasts for only 6 seconds.
desc_zf_tm_02_01_2=This causes the enemy target to lose 150 HP and 100 inner skill every three seconds for 9 seconds.<br>With Emei and Jianghu arrays the effect lasts for 12 seconds, and with Wudang and guild arrays the effect lasts for only 6 seconds.
desc_zf_tm_02_01_3=This causes the enemy target to lose 200 HP and 120 inner skill every three seconds for 9 seconds.<br>With Emei and Jianghu arrays the effect lasts for 12 seconds, and with Wudang and guild arrays the effect lasts for only 6 seconds.
