zf_gb_02_02=Chickens Fly Dogs Leap
desc_zf_gb_02_02_1=An attack that reduces the enemy's defenses by 250 points and hit rating by 3%, lasting for 15 seconds.<br>Duration increases to 18 seconds for Wanderer's Valley and Jianghu Arrays. Duration decreases to 12 seconds for Scholars and Guild Arrays.
desc_zf_gb_02_02_2=Enemies in the vicinity of this array will have their defense reduced by 350 and hit rate reduced by 5 for 15 seconds.<br>With Wanderer's Valley and Jianghu arrays it is effective for 18 seconds, whereas with Scholars and guild arrays it is effective for 12 seconds.
desc_zf_gb_02_02_3=Enemies in the vicinity of this array will have their defense reduced by 450 and hit rate reduced by 7 for 15 seconds.<br>With Wanderer's Valley and Jianghu arrays it is effective for 18 seconds, whereas with Scholars and guild arrays it is effective for 12 seconds.
