desc_cs_jl_shuangci03_1=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
