cs_gb_ksbf04=Cry for the World
desc_cs_gb_ksbf04_5=A series of deceptive movements result in {@0:伤害包} damage to target, breaking through his/her defenses. Within 15 seconds, target loses energy whenever he/she uses Flying Skills. <br>The target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font>. During this state, the more drunk the attacker, the more damage he or she inflicts.
cs_gb_ksbf05=Wandering Soul
desc_cs_gb_ksbf05_1=A block move. If successful you gain a 30% chance to increase your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunken state</font>.
desc_cs_gb_ksbf05_2=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 40% if you parry successfully.
desc_cs_gb_ksbf05_3=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 50% if you parry successfully.
desc_cs_gb_ksbf05_4=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 60% if you parry successfully.
desc_cs_gb_ksbf05_5=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 70% if you parry successfully.
