cs_sl_dmgf02=Buddha Saves the Soul
desc_cs_sl_dmgf02_1=Charge at a target and strike, dealing {@0:伤害包}. The power will increase along with brawn.<br> (This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach your target quickly.)
desc_cs_sl_dmgf02_2=Charging movement, gathering Brawn into head of staff to attack target, dealing {@0:伤害包}. The power will increase along with Brawn.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_cs_sl_dmgf02_3=Charging movement, gathering Brawn into head of staff to attack target, dealing {@0:伤害包}. The power will increase along with Brawn.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
