cs_sl_dmgf05=Myriad Buddhas Return
desc_cs_sl_dmgf05_1=Knock surrounding enemies into the air, dealing  {@0:伤害包}. Airborne targets will be thrown further away.
desc_cs_sl_dmgf05_2=Attack with staff a thousand times making the wind sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. If the target is in the air, you can continuously knock target away.
desc_cs_sl_dmgf05_3=Attack with staff a thousand times making the wind sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. If the target is in the air, you can continuously knock target away.
desc_cs_sl_dmgf05_4=Attack with staff a thousand times making the wind sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. If the target is in the air, you can continuously knock target away.
desc_cs_sl_dmgf05_5=Attack with staff a thousand times making the wind sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. If the target is in the air, you can continuously knock target away.
cs_sl_dmgf06=Boundless Dharma
desc_cs_sl_dmgf06_1=Attack the ground, knocking back and stunning surrounding enemies. Deals {@0:伤害包} and slows their movement speed, preventing them from attacking or using Flying Skills.
desc_cs_sl_dmgf06_2=Pound the ground - deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, knocks them away, and shocks their Meridians. (Opponents will be slowed, and unable to attack or use their Flying ability.)
desc_cs_sl_dmgf06_3=Pound the ground - deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, knocks them away, and shocks their Meridians. (Opponents will be slowed, and unable to attack or use their Flying ability.)
desc_cs_sl_dmgf06_4=Pound the ground - deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, knocks them away, and shocks their Meridians. (Opponents will be slowed, and unable to attack or use their Flying ability.)
desc_cs_sl_dmgf06_5=Fall the staff and attack the ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies and knock them away, shocking their merdians. (Reduce movement speed in a short period, cannot use flying skills and attack.)
cs_jl_shuangci04=Viper Flicks Tongue
desc_cs_jl_shuangci04_1=Charging move, wield sting like a snake spits out it's tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
