cs_jl_shuangci06=Shura Rots the Bone
desc_cs_jl_shuangci06_1=Feint sting your enemy once, release poison force, and erode enemies in front, then deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking an enemy's parry, this skill will make them bleed and lose the ability to use a Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_cs_jl_shuangci06_2=Feint sting your enemy once, release poison force, and erode enemies in front, then deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking an enemy's parry, this skill will make them bleed and lose the ability to use a Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_cs_jl_shuangci06_3=Feint sting your enemy once, release poison force, and erode enemies in front, then deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking an enemy's parry, this skill will make them bleed and lose the ability to use a Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_cs_jl_shuangci06_4=Feint sting your enemy once, release poison force, and erode enemies in front, then deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking an enemy's parry, this skill will make them bleed and lose the ability to use a Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_cs_jl_shuangci06_5=Feint sting your enemy once, release poison force, and erode enemies in front, then deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking an enemy's parry, this skill will make them bleed and lose the ability to use a Flying Skill for a period of time.
