cs_jz_wyjf03=A Drop In The Sea
desc_cs_jz_wyjf03_1=Boundless Mental Skill will create a Boundless chi area. Team members affected by this chi area will inflict additional softness damage with their attacks.<br> (This skill will cost 1% of Max Energy per second.)
cs_jz_wyjf04=Sword Returns to the Summit
desc_cs_jz_wyjf04_1=Turn your sword back and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If this attack breaks your enemy's parry, it will damage his meridians and make him lose Energy.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf04_2=Turn your sword back and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If this attack breaks your enemy's parry, it will damage his meridians and make him lose Energy.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf04_3=Turn your sword back and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If this attack breaks your enemy's parry, it will damage his meridians and make him lose Energy.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf04_4=Turn your sword back and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If this attack breaks your enemy's parry, it will damage his meridians and make him lose Energy.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf04_5=Turn your sword back and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If this attack breaks your enemy's parry, it will damage his meridians and make him lose Energy.
cs_jz_wyjf05=Turn Weapon Around
cs_jz_wyjf06=Pierce the Sky in Rage
desc_cs_jz_wyjf06_1=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf06_2=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf06_3=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf06_4=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_cs_jz_wyjf06_5=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
