cs_jy_jgd01=Devour by Demons
desc_cs_jy_jgd01_1=Attack three times quickly, each attack deals {@0:伤害包}.
cs_jy_jgd02=Demonic Shadow
desc_cs_jy_jgd02_1=Double attacks, each attack deals {@0:伤害包}.
cs_jy_jgd03=Cry of the Damned
desc_cs_jy_jgd03_1=Reduce 30% defense and movement speed for around enemies, last 6s, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
cs_jy_jgd04=Demonic Possession
desc_cs_jy_jgd04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包}, if your enemy is blocking, this will break their parry and cause them to be unable to move. Lasts 3s.
cs_jy_jgd05=Trapped by the Dead
desc_cs_jy_jgd05_1=A successful parry will reduce the attacker's Melee Damage by 30%.
cs_jy_jgd07=Prayer of the Thousand Souls
desc_cs_jy_jgd07_1=Gorgeous single target skill, each attack deals {@0:伤害包}.
