cs_jz_xytf02=Jade of the Autumn Fog
desc_cs_jz_xytf02_1=Charging Skill, this serious kicking skill will deal {@0:伤害包} to a target. A coordinated use of <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
