desc_cs_tm_jsc01_3=Charge towards the target and attack several times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. If <font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> is activated, the impact force will deal additional Yin damage. <br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_cs_tm_jsc01_4=Charge towards the target and attack several times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. If <font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> is activated, the impact force will deal additional Yin damage. <br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
