cs_gb_lhz02=Every Step A Lotus
desc_cs_gb_lhz02_1=A charging move. Gather chi to push palm twice quickly and deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect all enemies around the target.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
