desc_cs_jy_shd01_4=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one blow. Your enemy will be hit by the chi force and will take {@0:伤害包}.<br>If your enemy has the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
desc_cs_jy_shd01_5=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one blow. Your enemy will be hit by the chi force and will take {@0:伤害包}.<br>If your enemy has the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
