cs_jh_jybgz01=Sudden Movement
desc_cs_jh_jybgz01_1=When the Nine Yin White Bone Claw is cultivated for many years and has accumulated giant yin chi, the claw force can hurt people meters away, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
