desc_cs_jh_jybgz01_5=When the Nine Yin White Bone Claw is cultivated for many years and has accumulated giant yin chi, the claw force can hurt people meters away, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
cs_jh_jybgz02=Search for the Hidden
desc_cs_jh_jybgz02_1=The persons cultivate Nine Yin White Bone Claw have sharp fingers, they use human skull to cultivate this martial art. So great ptomaines are accumulated in the fingertips, the one hit by these fingers will take {@0:伤害包}, if he is in Skeleton Pawn state, he will lose HP continuously.
