cs_jh_jybgz05=Phantoms of the Nethers
desc_cs_jh_jybgz05_1=The most yin skill of Nine Yin White Bone Claw, will cause the user's skin become cold and hard, reduce taken damages, and the attacker will be affected by this cold poison, so he must cost more Energy to resist it.
desc_cs_jh_jybgz05_2=The most yin skill of Nine Yin White Bone Claw, will cause the user's skin become cold and hard, reduce taken damages, and the attacker will be affected by this cold poison, so he must cost more Energy to resist it.
