cs_jh_jybgz06=Skeleton Claw
desc_cs_jh_jybgz06_1=Special mental skill of Nine Yin White Bone Claw, increase its power by enemies' skulls. Each time kill an enemy, the power of skill will be increased by 1 level, and each level will attach extra yin damages on skills of Nine Yin White Bone Claw.
