cs_wd_qfjf02=Turbulent Rapids
desc_cs_wd_qfjf02_1=Gather chi movement, wave sword chi to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi to knock them down.<br>This skill can be released instantly in the air, and there is a chance to knock down target. The chance will increase along with <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze"</font> level amount on your body.
desc_cs_wd_qfjf02_2=Gather chi movement, wave sword chi to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi to knock them down.<br>This skill can be released instantly in the air, and there is a chance to knock down target. The chance will increase along with <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze"</font> level amount on your body.
