desc_cs_wd_qfjf02_5=Gather chi movement, wave sword chi to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi to knock them down.<br>This skill can be released instantly in the air, and there is a chance to knock down target. The chance will increase along with <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze"</font> level amount on your body.
cs_wd_qfjf03=Pure Spring Flows Forth
desc_cs_wd_qfjf03_1=Continuous sword chi gather into a line, heavily strike enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi, the remaining force can cause target to be unable to block in 3 seconds.
