desc_cs_tm_fgzyc02_4=Charging movement, approach enemy and stab continuously to deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Shapeshift"</font>, you can deal extra damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
