desc_cs_sl_wtgf01_1=Strike the ground dealing {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies. <br>Enemies affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> take extra hardness damage.
desc_cs_sl_wtgf01_2=Use staff to attack ground in front, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> at the moment, he will take extra hardness damage.
