cs_sl_wtgf02=Red Dusk Pierces the Sun
desc_cs_sl_wtgf02_1=Charge at an enemy and dealing {@0:伤害包} to a target, reducing their movement speed. <br>Slowed enemies take additional damage if the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff is active.<br> (This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach targets quickly.)
desc_cs_sl_wtgf02_2=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_cs_sl_wtgf02_3=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_cs_sl_wtgf02_4=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_cs_sl_wtgf02_5=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
