desc_cs_sl_lzs01_1=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_cs_sl_lzs01_2=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_cs_sl_lzs01_3=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_cs_sl_lzs02_1=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_cs_sl_lzs02_2=Gather chi into your grasp, and cast it from a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop them from using their Flying ability.
desc_cs_sl_lzs02_3=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_cs_sl_lzs03_1=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_cs_sl_lzs03_2=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_cs_sl_lzs03_3=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
