cs_jy_shd07_sky=Art of a Thousand Spirits (Air)
desc_cs_jy_shd07_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in the air. When you hit the ground you will repel enemies in the area. If an enemy has the Soul Losing Blade Wound, the wound will be torn apart, otherwise this will inflict the Soul Losing Blade Wound on your enemy.
