cs_jh_xlsbz01=The Proud Dragon Repents
desc_cs_jh_xlsbz01_1=General principle of the Dragon Subduing Slap. When entering combo status, you can store combo "Chi Force", which increases once every 10s. "Chi Force" will increase power of the Dragon Subduing Slap skills. (Using the skills of the set will all cost "Chi Force".)
