desc_cs_jh_xlsbz11_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies, this attack is from the ground, opposite to The Soaring Dragon in the Sky, this can bring down enemies in the air, and they cannot jump for a while after being brought down.
cs_jh_xlsbz12=Ride the Six Dragons
