cs_jh_xlsbz16=Treading On Thin Ice
desc_cs_jh_xlsbz16_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If you break parry successfully and shock your enemy, when they use a skill, they will instead inflict damage upon themselves, and fail.
