cs_em_lbc06_sky=Departed Kin (Air)
desc_cs_em_lbc06_sky_1=A rapid charge attack from above, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets on the ground. If the target is in the Loathsome Clouds and Rain state, extra damage is added and the enemy is knocked away. The more one's own Parting Sorrow stacks, the more damage is done.
