desc_clone003_yeloukai_6a_1=Mental skill of Wudang, by change breathing method to exert sword power. If in yang state, each time use sword skill will give you one pure yang chi, which increases extra yang damage for you. If in yin state, each time use sword skill will give you one pure yin chi, which reduces your taken damages. Each changing will convert pur yang chi into Energy, convert pur yin chi into HP.
clone003_yeloukai_6b=Protect the Flowers
desc_clone003_yeloukai_6b_1=Mental skill of Wudang, by change breathing method to exert sword power. If in yang state, each time use sword skill will give you one pure yang chi, which increases extra yang damage for you. If in yin state, each time use sword skill will give you one pure yin chi, which reduces your taken damages. Each changing will convert pur yang chi into Energy, convert pur yin chi into HP.
clone003_qianxizhi_1a=Aurora Thunder Slash
desc_clone003_qianxizhi_1a_1=Several fierce chops directed the enemy, great might temporarily places the target under the influence of Dark Moon Blade Cut, inflicting additional damage over a short period.
