desc_clone003_qianxizhi_1b_1=Several fierce chops directed the enemy, great might temporarily places the target under the influence of Dark Moon Blade Cut, inflicting additional damage over a short period.
clone003_qianxizhi_2a=Split the World
desc_clone003_qianxizhi_2a_1=An unpredictable movement that inflicts damage to players in front. If the target tries to block, the block will be broken and the target will come under the influence of Dark Moon Blade Cut and suffer blade injuries for continued damage over a short period.
clone003_qianxizhi_2b=Split the World
desc_clone003_qianxizhi_2b_1=An unpredictable movement that inflicts damage to players in front. If the target tries to block, the block will be broken and the target will come under the influence of Dark Moon Blade Cut and suffer blade injuries for continued damage over a short period.
