desc_zf_jh_01_01_2=A single attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target within a ten-meter  fan-shaped radius. Targets in the Total Eradication state will receive double damage.<br> Damage dealt with the 28 Constellations and Guild arrays is increased by 50%, while damage dealt with the Vigor Return and School arrays is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_jh_01_01_3=A single attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target within a ten-meter  fan-shaped radius. Targets in the Total Eradication state will receive double damage.<br> Damage dealt with the 28 Constellations and Guild arrays is increased by 50%, while damage dealt with the Vigor Return and School arrays is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_jh_02_01_2=A single attack, dealing one-time {@0:伤害包} damage and lowering the target's attack power by 5%. This state can be stacked three times and lasts four seconds.<br>With the Three Talents Array and guild arrays, damage done is reduced by 50%, and with the Six Combinations and School arrays, effectiveness is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_jh_02_01_3=A single attack, dealing one-time {@0:伤害包} damage and lowering the target's attack power by 5%. This state can be stacked three times and lasts four seconds.<br>With the Three Talents Array and guild arrays, damage done is reduced by 50%, and with the Six Combinations and School arrays, effectiveness is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_jh_05_01_2=A single attack that deals {@0:伤害包} damage, lowering the target's attack speed by 5%. Can be stacked three times, and lasts three seconds<br>With the Six Combinations and guild arrays, it is 50% more effective. With the Wind and Sand Array and School arrays, effectiveness is reduced 50%.
desc_zf_jh_05_01_3=A single attack that deals {@0:伤害包} damage, lowering the target's attack speed by 5%. Can be stacked three times, and lasts three seconds<br>With the Six Combinations and guild arrays, it is 50% more effective. With the Wind and Sand Array and School arrays, effectiveness is reduced 50%.
desc_zf_jh_05_02_2=Reduce 30% movement speed of at most 6 targets in an awl area with 5m radius, last 7s.
desc_zf_jh_05_02_3=Reduce 30% movement speed of at most 6 targets in an awl area with 5m radius, last 7s.
desc_CS_sl_djgq05_6=Defense state - successful parry make attacker receive 26 hardness backfire (Damage depends on internal skills)
desc_CS_sl_djgq05_7=Defense state - successful parry make attacker receive 30 hardness backfire (Damage depends on internal skills)
desc_CS_sl_djgq06_6=A steady and quick strike that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_djgq06_7=A steady and quick strike that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_djgq03_6=Calm your heart and gather chi, scatter opponents with the power of your hands and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_djgq03_7=Calm your heart and gather chi, scatter opponents with the power of your hands and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_djgq02_6=External skill changed from Lion Roaring Skill, the roar can shake the heaven and hell, stun enemies with 5 meters for 3 seconds, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_djgq02_7=External skill changed from Lion Roaring Skill, the roar can shake the heaven and hell, stun enemies with 5 meters for 3 seconds, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_djgq07_6=Charge at the enemy and punch twice to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
desc_CS_sl_djgq07_7=Charging movement, get close to enemy and punch twice to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_tjj04_6=A yang attack, the enemies affected by sword chi will take {@0:伤害包}, and suffer a internal injury: movement speed is reduced, continuous loss of HP.
desc_CS_wd_tjj04_7=A yang attack, the enemies affected by sword chi will take {@0:伤害包}, and suffer a internal injury: movement speed is reduced, continuous loss of HP.
desc_CS_wd_tjj06_6=Defense state - each successful parry will recover your 13 Energy (Recover value depends on internal skills)
desc_CS_jl_shuangci01_6=Release chi force and activate acupoints, increase 30% your own movement speed, and lose Energy continuously at the same time.<br>The chi force will affect surrounding enemies, making them lose Energy when using flying skill.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci01_7=Release chi force and activate acupoints, increase 30% your own movement speed, and lose Energy continuously at the same time.<br>The chi force will affect surrounding enemies, making them lose Energy when using flying skill.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_6=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 9 times at most.<br>Deal 180 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_7=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 10 times at most.<br>Deal 200 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci03_6=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci03_7=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf02_6=Spit out <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> at enemies in front, reduce their movement speed and hit rate.<br> (Cannot use this skill if you aren't drunk.)
desc_CS_gb_ksbf02_7=Spit out <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> at enemies in front, reduce their movement speed and hit rate.<br> (Cannot use this skill if you aren't drunk.)
desc_CS_gb_ksbf03_6=Wield staff to attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> onto enemy.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf03_7=Wield staff to attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> onto enemy.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf05_6=A defensive state. When performing a successful parry there is an 80% chance the your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> state will be increased.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf05_7=A defensive state. When performing a successful parry there is an 90% chance the your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> state will be increased.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf01_6=Charging move, attack three times, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_gb_ksbf01_7=Charging move, attack three times, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_em_yxc02_6=A charging move  that breaks through obstacles and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>(This move can be used alongside a Flying Skill to quickly approach enemies.)
desc_CS_em_yxc02_7=A charging move  that breaks through obstacles and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>(This move can be used alongside a Flying Skill to quickly approach enemies.)
desc_CS_gb_ksbf06_6=Strike target like crazy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf06_7=Strike target like crazy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf02_6=Charging movement, gathering Brawn into head of staff to attack target, dealing {@0:伤害包}. The power will increase along with Brawn.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_sl_dmgf02_7=Charging move - focuses your Brawn into the head of your staff to strike your target and deal {@0:伤害包}. The power of the blow will reflect your Brawn.<br> (Use this move with your Flying ability for a swift approach.)
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_6=Defense Dexterity, receive enemy's attack by strong inner force, Shock the attack and cause 26 damage (Damage depends on Melee Damage)
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_7=Defense Dexterity, receive enemy's attack by strong inner force, Shock the attack and cause 30 damage (Damage depends on Melee Damage)
desc_CS_sl_dmgf05_6=Attack with staff for thousand times, make wind blow, sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is in air, can continuously throw target away.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf05_7=Attack with staff for thousand times, make wind blow, sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is in air, can continuously throw target away.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf06_6=Fall the staff and attack the ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies and punch them away, shock their merdians (Reduce movement speed in a short period, target cannot use flying skills and attack).
desc_CS_sl_dmgf06_7=Fall the staff and attack the ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies and punch them away, shock their merdians (Reduce movement speed in a short period, target cannot use flying skills and attack).
desc_CS_jl_shuangci04_6=Charging movement, wield sting like snake spits out tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_shuangci04_7=Charging movement, wield sting like snake spits out tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_shuangci07_6=A poisonous ailment explodes in the enemy's body, jolting nearby enemies as well. This maneuver fills you with bloodlust, increasing the power of your Perish Blade by 100%, each stroke drawing rivers of blood. Thereafter, when you execute The Spirit Leaves the Body double sting movement you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Enhanced Endurance</font> state.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci07_7=A poisonous ailment explodes in the enemy's body, jolting nearby enemies as well. This maneuver fills you with bloodlust, increasing the power of your Perish Blade by 100%, each stroke drawing rivers of blood. Thereafter, when you execute The Spirit Leaves the Body double sting movement you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Enhanced Endurance</font> state.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci08_6=Attach Insect poison on the weapon, each parry will asborb enemy 20 HP (Absorbing value depends on internal skill)
desc_CS_jl_shuangci08_7=Attach insect poison on the weapon, each parry will asborb enemy 24 HP (Absorbing value depends on internal skill)
desc_CS_wd_tjj01_6=Charging skill, wield sword and attack twice, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_tjj01_7=Charging skill, wield sword and attack twice, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_tjj07_6=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_wd_tjj07_7=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_em_jdmz02_6=Slowly circulate chi, accelerating the target's chi flow. This removes blood clots and jolts nearby enemies; When used on oneself, the <br>movement can send enemies flying.
desc_CS_em_jdmz02_7=Slowly circulate chi, accelerating the target's chi flow. This removes blood clots and jolts nearby enemies; When used on oneself, the <br>movement can send enemies flying.
desc_CS_em_jdmz03_6=Soft Energy is released, and a palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the target; break the enemy's parry and reduce their rage.
