desc_CS_sl_djgq04_7=Feint attack, knocks down enemy and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If enemy tries to block will take extra hardness damage.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci06_6=Feint sting target once, release poison force, erode enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking enemy's parry, this skill will make him bleed and lose ability to use Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci06_7=Feint sting target once, release poison force, erode enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking enemy's parry, this skill will make him bleed and lose ability to use Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf03_6=Boundless Mental Skill will create a Boundless chi area. The team member affected by this chi area will inflict softness damage with their attacks.<br> (This skill will cost 1% of Max Energy per second.)
desc_CS_jz_wyjf03_7=Boundless Mental Skill will create a Boundless chi area. The team member affected by this chi area will inflict softness damage with their attacks.<br> (This skill will cost 1% of Max Energy per second.)
desc_CS_jz_wyjf04_6=Turn back sword and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will damage his merdians and make him lose Energy.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf04_7=Turn back sword and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will damage his merdians and make him lose Energy.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf06_6=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf06_7=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_6=Charging skill, this serious kicking skill will deal {@0:伤害包} to target. A coordinated use of <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_7=Charging skill, this serious kicking skill will deal {@0:伤害包} to target. A coordinated use of <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf03_6=Jump and turn back to kick, kick away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf03_7=Jump and turn back to kick, kick away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_6=Defense move, a successful parry will activate legs potential <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font> (Increase your movement speed and 26 yin damage, increase power for all skills of Leisure Kick - The skill damage can be increased for multiple times).
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_7=Defense move, a successful parry will activate legs potential <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font> (Increase your movement speed and 30 yin damage, increase power for all skills of Leisure Kick - The skill damage can be increased for multiple times).
desc_CS_wd_lyjf03_6=Charging movement, stab twice from both sides to deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_lyjf03_7=Charging movement, stab twice from both sides to deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_lyjf04_6=Raise sword to attack, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, break enemy's parry and reduce movement speed.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf04_7=Raise sword to attack, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, break enemy's parry and reduce movement speed.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf05_6=A defensive movement. After you parry an enemy's attack, you can render them lethargic, reducing their Brawn by 60 points for 12 seconds.<br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> buff, this move boosts your own true Yang chi; <br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> buff your true Yin chi will be boosted.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf05_7=A defensive movement. After you parry an enemy's attack, you can render them lethargic, reducing their Brawn by 60 points for 14 seconds.<br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> buff, this move boosts your own true Yang chi;<br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> buff your true Yin chi will be boosted.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf06_6=Skill contains sword, sword contains skill, the twin swords attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf06_7=Skill contains sword, sword contains skill, the twin swords attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_6=Leisure meaning, lightsome attack, kick target continuously and deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_7=Leisure meaning, lightsome attack, kick target continuously and deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_tm_jsc01_6=Charge towards the target and attack several times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. If <font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> is activated, the impact force will deal additional Yin damage. <br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_tm_jsc01_7=Charge towards the target and attack several times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. If <font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> is activated, the impact force will deal additional Yin damage. <br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_tm_jsc02_6=Throw a dart that paralyzes a target and deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_tm_jsc02_7=Throw a dart that paralyzes a target and deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_tm_jsc03_6=A golden snake method. When you circulate chi, your own movement speed jumps 50% and attacks from the <font color="#FFAE00">Backfire</font> set will have added soft damage for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_tm_jsc03_7=A golden snake method. When you circulate chi, your own movement speed jumps 50% and attacks from the <font color="#FFAE00">Backfire</font> set will have added soft damage for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_tm_jsc04_6=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_tm_jsc04_7=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_tm_jsc05_6=Successful parry absorbs enemy's force and attach 26 Yin damage to your attack, lasting for 10 seconds (Damage depends on internal skill)
desc_CS_tm_jsc05_7=Successful parry absorbs enemy's force and attach 30 Yin damage to your attack, lasting for 10 seconds (Damage depends on internal skill)
desc_CS_em_yxc04_6=Defense Dexterity - use parry to reduce enemy's stamina (Reduce stamina by 45, lasting for 40 seconds).
desc_CS_em_yxc04_7=Defense Dexterity - use parry to reduce enemy's stamina (Reduce stamina by 50, lasting for 45 seconds).
desc_CS_tm_jsc06_6=Dance in the air, striking continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Activate<font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> before using this skill to greatly increase your critical strike chance.
desc_CS_tm_jsc06_7=Dance in the air, striking continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Activate<font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> before using this skill to greatly increase your critical strike chance.
desc_CS_jl_zfd03_6=Chop continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The enemy will take <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_CS_jl_zfd03_7=Chop continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The enemy will take <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_CS_jl_zfd04_6=Merciless attack, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The enemy tries to block will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
