desc_CS_gb_lsbf02_6=Charging movement, swing weapon to attack target, deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will take even more damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
