desc_CS_sl_wtgf03_6=A thunderous, smashing strike dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>The strength of this attack can destroy an enemy's parry and thrust him into the <font color="#FFAE00">Cutoff</font> state, which impairs his movement.
