desc_CS_sl_wtgf04_6=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry, you can add the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> buff to yourself, which boosts your movement speed by 45%.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf04_7=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry, you can add the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> buff to yourself, which boosts your movement speed by 50%.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf05_6=Create wind in plain, jump to selected area, and sweep surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}, and stun them for a while.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf05_7=Create wind in plain, jump to selected area, and sweep surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}, and stun them for a while.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf06_6=Staff technique as explained in Buddha's Protector Manual. Execute several heavy attacks to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and knock down the enemy with the final strike.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf06_7=Staff technique as explained in Buddha's Protector Manual. Execute several heavy attacks to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and knock down the enemy with the final strike.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz01_5=An effortless palm strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz01_6=An effortless palm strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz02_5=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz02_6=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz04_5=Slowly cultivate your chi to release ice Energy around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies and boost your companions' Brawn.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz04_6=Slowly cultivate your chi to release ice Energy around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies and boost your companions' Brawn.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz05_5=Raises the Dexterity and removes any movement debuffs for self and surrounding allies
desc_CS_em_pxcyz05_6=Raises the Dexterity and removes any movement debuffs for self and surrounding allies
desc_CS_em_pxcyz06_5=A blocking movement. After blocking, you will be able to block most debuffs for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz07_5=Snow and ice surge to freeze the target, dealing {@0:伤害包}.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Invade by Cold Air</font>Decreases the enemy's movement speed and prevents them from using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz07_6=Snow and ice surge to freeze the target, dealing {@0:伤害包}.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Invade by Cold Air</font>Decreases the enemy's movement speed and prevents them from using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd01_6=Chop with blade, the icy force deals {@0:伤害包} to target, and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Chase Soul"</font>.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd01_7=Chop with blade, the icy force deals {@0:伤害包} to target, and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Chase Soul"</font>.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd02_6=A flying strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Damage inflicted corresponds to the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing Needle</font> and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd02_7=A flying strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Damage inflicted corresponds to the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing Needle</font> and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd03_6=Turn body and attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>The force will hurt enemy's merdians, make target lose extra Energy when use flying skill.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd03_7=Turn body and attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>The force will hurt enemy's merdians, make target lose extra Energy when use flying skill.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd04_6=Use trick to tease fool, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. Can break enemy's parry and repel him.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd04_7=Use trick to tease fool, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. Can break enemy's parry and repel him.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd06_6=Dance like a demon and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies. The amount of damage you inflict corresponds to the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing</font> stacks and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd06_7=Dance like a demon and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies. The amount of damage you inflict corresponds to the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing</font> stacks and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf02_sky_6=Breeze Sword Chi attacks target's mind, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, if target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, then target cannot move or use skills.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf02_sky_7=Breeze Sword Chi attacks target's mind, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, if target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, then target cannot move or use skills.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf06_sky_6=Breeze helps to reinforce Sword Qi, attack continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}. If target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, will take more damage.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf06_sky_7=Breeze helps to reinforce Sword Qi, attack continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}. If target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, will take more damage.
desc_CS_sl_lzs01_4=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_sl_lzs01_5=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_sl_lzs01_6=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_sl_lzs02_4=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_CS_sl_lzs02_5=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_CS_sl_lzs02_6=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_CS_sl_lzs03_4=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_CS_sl_lzs03_5=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_CS_sl_lzs03_6=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_4=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_5=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
