desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_4=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_5=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_6=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_4=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_5=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_6=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_4=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_5=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_6=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_4=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_5=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_6=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_4=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_5=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_6=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_6=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_7=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_6=Jump into the air and charge as you descend, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in the area of effect; <br>If the enemy is stunned as a result of the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, he will be knocked into the air and will suffer extra damage. This won't occur if you use the effect while on the ground.<br>The higher the number of your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>, the more damaging the movement is.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_7=Jump into the air and charge as you descend, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in the area of effect; <br>If the enemy is stunned as a result of the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, he will be knocked into the air and will suffer extra damage. This won't occur if you use the effect while on the ground.<br>The higher the number of your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>, the more damaging the movement is.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_6=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_7=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc08_6=Heed not the common concerns and distinctions of life and death. Amid bouts of fury and sorrow, unleash your potential. Greatly increase movement speed, the power of your movements for this set, and your defense for 20 seconds.
desc_CS_em_lbc08_7=Heed not the common concerns and distinctions of life and death. Amid bouts of fury and sorrow, unleash your potential. Greatly increase movement speed, the power of your movements for this set, and your defense for 20 seconds.
desc_CS_em_lbc02_6=A charging movement with a turning stab, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This adds Rage to your character, the ammount depending on how much your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>is stacked.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_em_lbc02_7=A charging movement with a turning stab, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This adds Rage to your character, the ammount depending on how much your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>is stacked.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jz_lyfh01_6=Your sword's chi sweeps enemies in front of you to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After the strike your <font color="#FFAE00">Hero's Tears</font> chi becomes focused. If you continuously use this move your chi will become explosive, preventing the enemy from using flying skills.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh01_7=Your sword's chi sweeps enemies in front of you to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After the strike your <font color="#FFAE00">Hero's Tears</font> chi becomes focused. If you continuously use this move your chi will become explosive, preventing the enemy from using flying skills.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh02_6=A charging movement. A leisurely uppercut that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This destabilizes the enemy's lower body knocks him into the air.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jz_lyfh02_7=A charging movement. A leisurely uppercut that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This destabilizes the enemy's lower body knocks him into the air.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jz_lyfh03_6=Brilliant sword chi pushed the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When you use this move to break an enemy's block, it destabilizes the enemy's lower body, barring him from using flying skills.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh03_7=Brilliant sword chi pushed the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When you use this move to break an enemy's block, it destabilizes the enemy's lower body, barring him from using flying skills.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh04_6=Combine the word and body, successful parry has 25% chance to counter-stun: make enemy paralyzed for 5 seconds, can not move. <br>(counter-stun CD is 12 seconds)
desc_CS_jz_lyfh04_7=Combine the word and body, successful parry has 25% chance to counter-stun: make enemy paralyzed for 5 seconds, can not move. <br>(counter-stun CD is 10 seconds)
desc_CS_jz_lyfh06_6=Devastate surrounding opponents by creating a field of pure inner energy: This increases the might of your own external and internal skills and increases your ability to regenerate HP.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh06_7=Devastate surrounding opponents by creating a field of pure inner energy: This increases the might of your own external and internal skills and increases your ability to regenerate HP.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh07_6=The wind swirls and dances, and attack surrounding enemies while moving to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. If the enemies' legs are numbed they will receive extra damage.<br>(Once this movement has been executed it cannot be interrupted.)
desc_CS_jz_lyfh07_7=The wind swirls and dances, and attack surrounding enemies while moving to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. If the enemies' legs are numbed they will receive extra damage.<br>(Once this movement has been executed it cannot be interrupted.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf01_sky_6=Powerful leg skill, attack enemy in front three times to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf01_sky_7=Powerful leg skill, attack enemy in front three times to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_sky_6=A highly effective kicking skill that consecutively strikes enemies twice to deal {@0:伤害包}. When accompanying the Xiaoyao Sect's skills, it is even more effective. This skill can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_sky_7=A highly effective kicking skill that consecutively strikes enemies twice to deal {@0:伤害包}. When accompanying the Xiaoyao Sect's skills, it is even more effective. This skill can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
