desc_CS_jz_xytf03_sky_7=Circle kick enemy in air, deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf04_sky_6=Fly kick enemy to {@0:伤害包}, if enemy is blocking, he will be beaten down and take internal injury, reduce mvoement speed and take damages over time.
desc_CS_jz_xytf04_sky_7=Fly kick enemy to {@0:伤害包}, if enemy is blocking, he will be beaten down and take internal injury, reduce mvoement speed and take damages over time.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_sky_6=Defense move of Leisure Kick, each successful parry will activate Leisure Skill to increase movement speed and attack, and also increase power of all skills of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_sky_7=Defense move of Leisure Kick, each successful parry will activate Leisure Skill to increase movement speed and attack, and also increase power of all skills of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_sky_6=The most powerful move of Leisure Kick, attack enemy continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_sky_7=The most powerful move of Leisure Kick, attack enemy continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_wd_tjq04_4=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_CS_wd_tjq04_5=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_CS_wd_tjq04_6=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_CS_wd_tjq01_4=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_wd_tjq01_5=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_wd_tjq01_6=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_wd_tjq03_4=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_CS_wd_tjq03_5=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_CS_wd_tjq03_6=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_CS_wd_tjq06_4=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
desc_CS_wd_tjq06_5=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
desc_CS_wd_tjq06_6=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf07_6=Yin and Yang sword chi attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target, use it in air can bring down target in air, and at the same time:<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yang"</font> state, attacking target in air when you are in air can deal 1.5 times of damage.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin"</font> state, whil attacking target in air when you are in air can increase your rage.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf07_7=Yin and Yang sword chi attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target, use it in air can bring down target in air, and at the same time:<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yang"</font> state, attacking target in air when you are in air can deal 1.5 times of damage.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin"</font> state, whil attacking target in air when you are in air can increase your rage.
desc_CS_jy_yzq06_6=Eagle attacks hearts, deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies.
desc_CS_jy_yzq06_7=Eagle attacks hearts, deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf07_6=The force of a falling mountain - this attack deals {@0:伤害包}. This skill is used in midair, stunning enemies for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf07_7=The force of a falling mountain - this attack deals {@0:伤害包}. This skill is used in midair, stunning enemies for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_yzq07_6=Stretch out arm and tear around enemies, deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When in air, can select area on the ground to use skill, knock down enemies in area and attach a same effect with <font color="#FFAE00">"Peck Eye and Scramble for Pearl"</font>.
desc_CS_jy_yzq07_7=Stretch out arm and tear around enemies, deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When in air, can select area on the ground to use skill, knock down enemies in area and attach a same effect with <font color="#FFAE00">"Peck Eye and Scramble for Pearl"</font>.
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc07_6=Fly in air, strike target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target is on the ground, the skill will make him lose HP and be unable to use flying skill.<br>If target is in smoke mist, he will be paralyzed.
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc07_7=Fly in air, strike target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target is on the ground, the skill will make him lose HP and be unable to use flying skill.<br>If target is in smoke mist, he will be paralyzed.
desc_CS_em_yxc07_6=Jump gracefully, then strike at the enemy's ankles while they are airborne to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This reduces their movement speed and disables flying skills.
desc_CS_em_yxc07_7=Jump gracefully, then strike at the enemy's ankles while they are airborne to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This reduces their movement speed and disables flying skills.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf07_6=Shoot a sword chi, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>Use this skill on the ground can punch target in air away, and deal special internal injury (When gets hit by Boundless Sword skills, target will take extra softness damage).
desc_CS_jz_wyjf07_7=Shoot a sword chi, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>Use this skill on the ground can punch target in air away, and deal special internal injury (When gets hit by Boundless Sword skills, target will take extra softness damage).
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_5=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_6=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
desc_CS_em_jdmz07_6=A rainbow-like move. A rapid palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is airborne, you can use this maneuver to knock him away.
desc_CS_em_jdmz07_7=A rainbow-like move. A rapid palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is airborne, you can use this maneuver to knock him away.
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_6=Charging movement, gather strength to kick target and deal {@0:伤害包}. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, and jump up to attack target in air, you will greatly increase the chance to double the damage of the skill.<br> (This skill canbe used in conjunction with Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_7=Charging movement, gather strength to kick target and deal {@0:伤害包}. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, and jump up to attack target in air, you will greatly increase the chance to double the damage of the skill.<br> (This skill canbe used in conjunction with Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_shd07_6=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_7=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf07_6=Charging skill, wield sword and attack several times, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is unable to block, will take extra damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_qfjf07_7=Charging skill, wield sword and attack several times, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is unable to block, will take extra damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf07_4=Rise from the ground and use the staff to launch the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Attaches <font color="#FFAE00">“Fallen”</font>: Unable to jump.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf07_5=Rise from the ground and use the staff to launch the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Attaches <font color="#FFAE00">“Fallen”</font>: Unable to jump.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf07_6=Rise from the ground and use the staff to launch the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Attaches <font color="#FFAE00">“Fallen”</font>: Unable to jump.
riding_Clone004_taomasuo=Lasso
desc_riding_Clone004_taomasuo_1=Pull down the Tartar Cavalry from the horseback and only use it to those in front of you.
desc_CS_gb_lhz07_6=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target.<br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.)
desc_CS_gb_lhz07_7=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target.<br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.)
desc_CS_wd_tjq02_4=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_wd_tjq02_5=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_wd_tjq02_6=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_5=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_6=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd04_5=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_CS_jy_dqd04_6=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_5=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 13 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_6=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 13 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering. (There is a chance to attach 1 time to attacker.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd07_5=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd07_6=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_lhz08_6=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lhz08_7=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh08_6=The secret skill of the fallen hero. A soft sword skill of relentless attacks. Charge and strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jz_lyfh08_7=The secret skill of the fallen hero. A soft sword skill of relentless attacks. Charge and strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_wd_tjq08_4=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
desc_CS_wd_tjq08_5=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
desc_CS_wd_tjq08_6=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf07_sky_6=Deal {@0:伤害包}, use this skill in air can dive and strike ground heavily, stun enemies in area for 3s.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf07_sky_7=Deal {@0:伤害包}, use this skill in air can dive and strike ground heavily, stun enemies in area for 3s.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_sky_6=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in air, you can fall quickly, repel targets in area. When target has Soul Losing Blade Wound, the wound will be torn apart, or the skill will attach Soul Losing Blade Wound on target.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_sky_7=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in air, you can fall quickly, repel targets in area. When target has Soul Losing Blade Wound, the wound will be torn apart, or the skill will attach Soul Losing Blade Wound on target.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_sky_5=Deals {@0:伤害包}. When this attack is executed in mid-air, the attacker drops down quickly to inflict damage in an area-of-effect, reducing the dexterity of targets.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_sky_6=Deals {@0:伤害包}. When this attack is executed in mid-air, the attacker drops down quickly to inflict damage in an area-of-effect, reducing the dexterity of targets.
desc_CS_jh_dldm02_6=The iron cord is sharp, its movements cunning. This move inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on enemies.<br>If you break the enemy's parry, this movement can cause him to suffer <font color="#FFAE00">Turbid Blood</font>, and when struck by the iron claws he will suffer extra external damage.
desc_CS_jh_dldm02_7=The iron cord is sharp, its movements cunning. This move inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on enemies.<br>If you break the enemy's parry, this movement can cause him to suffer <font color="#FFAE00">Turbid Blood</font>, and when struck by the iron claws he will suffer extra external damage.
desc_CS_jh_dldm03_6=The thieving claws of a ghost ensnare the enemy and deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be tightly bound and cannot move.<br>This move will not be successful if executed while close to the enemy.
desc_CS_jh_dldm03_7=The thieving claws of a ghost ensnare the enemy and deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be tightly bound and cannot move.<br>This move will not be successful if executed while close to the enemy.
desc_CS_jh_dldm05_6=Persistent like a ghost giving chase, this movement inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy; <br>If the enemy does not parry in time, you can pull him to you, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font>.<br>This move is difficult to pull off if the enemy is too close to you.
desc_CS_jh_dldm05_7=Persistent like a ghost giving chase, this movement inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy; <br>If the enemy does not parry in time, you can pull him to you, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font>.<br>This move is difficult to pull off if the enemy is too close to you.
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_sky_6=Kick target quickly and continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, if you and target are all in air, the chance to double the damage of the skill will be greatly increased.
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_sky_7=Kick target quickly and continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, if you and target are all in air, the chance to double the damage of the skill will be greatly increased.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf07_6=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
desc_CS_gb_lsbf07_7=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
desc_CS_jh_dldm06_6=Sharp claws fly at opponents around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If the enemies are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font> state, your flying claws can inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Power of the Iron Chain</font>, and damage is increased.
desc_CS_jh_dldm06_7=Sharp claws fly at opponents around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If the enemies are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font> state, your flying claws can inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Power of the Iron Chain</font>, and damage is increased.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_5=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_6=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_6=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_7=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_6=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_7=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_6=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_7=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_6=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_7=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_6=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 10 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_7=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 11 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz05_6=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz05_7=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz07_6=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
desc_CS_jl_fgz07_7=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
desc_CS_jy_yzq07_sky_6=Charge to target's location from air, and tear enemies in area apart, deal {@0:伤害包} and attach a same effect with "Peck Eye and Scramble for Pearls".
desc_CS_jy_yzq07_sky_7=Charge to target's location from air, and tear enemies in area apart, deal {@0:伤害包} and attach a same effect with "Peck Eye and Scramble for Pearls".
desc_CS_jy_shd03_6=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_shd03_7=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_2=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_3=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_4=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_5=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_6=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_2=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_3=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_4=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_5=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_6=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf04_2=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for 3.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf04_3=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for four seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf04_4=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for 4.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf04_5=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for five seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf04_6=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for 5.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf05_2=Hurl your blade like the mighty sun illuminating the sky, hitting enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>The dazzling knife blade adds <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state to the target, and as a result if the enemy circulates chi or performs any movement, the effect has a chance based on the number of stacks to increase.<br>(If the enemy target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state or has reached the limit, you will be able to inflict additional unblockable damage.
