desc_CS_jh_fmzf05_2=A sensitive movement. Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using moves from the Mad Devil set are increased by 25%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf05_3=A sensitive movement. Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using moves from the Mad Devil set are increased by 30%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
