desc_CS_jh_fmzf06_2=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf06_3=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
