desc_CS_jh_fmzf06_6=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_2=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 30% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_3=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 30% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_4=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 30% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_5=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 25% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_6=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 20% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_em_jdmz05_6=A charging move. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
desc_CS_em_jdmz05_7=A charging move. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd01_2=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd01_3=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
