desc_CS_jh_ghqd02_2=A sharp dagger turns as it flies, full of searing energy. The attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage at enemies in front of you. <br>At the same time, attack adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Theft of Souls"</font> internal damage: every time the target uses Flying Skills, more internal damage is sustained. <br>After a period of time, the internal damage is triggered, resulting in massive injury.
