desc_CS_jh_ghqd03_2=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd03_3=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
