desc_CS_jh_ghqd07_2=A veritable soul-stealing dance of seven lethal grabs. Consecutively strike the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Each attack can trigger the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage and <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, inflicting additional external damage.
