desc_CS_jh_dpgx08_2=A blood sacrifice that gives you the power of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Demon Comes to the World</font>, which protects your chi. The effect reduces damage taken by 40%. After you execute this move, ensuing moves from this set will not use up any HP.
desc_CS_jh_dpgx08_3=A blood sacrifice that gives you the power of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Demon Comes to the World</font>, which protects your chi. The effect reduces damage taken by 40%. After you execute this move, ensuing moves from this set will not use up any HP.
