desc_CS_jy_yzq08_6=Charging movement, used only against target knocked on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_yzq08_7=Charging movement, used only against target knocked on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_em_lbc06_sky_6=A rapid charge attack from above, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets on the ground. If the targe is in the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, extra damage is added and the enemy is knocked away. The more one's own Parting Sorrow stacks, the more damage is done.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_sky_7=A rapid charge attack from above, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets on the ground. If the targe is in the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, extra damage is added and the enemy is knocked away. The more one's own Parting Sorrow stacks, the more damage is done.
desc_CS_em_lbc03_sky_6=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_CS_em_lbc03_sky_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
