desc_CS_jz_lyfh01_a_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, when attack ends, you will get one unit of chi. In a while, the chi will break out, infusing your next skill with the ability to destabilize your target, causing him to be unable to use flying skill.
CS_jz_lyfh02_a=Flying Swallow Returns
desc_CS_jz_lyfh02_a_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemy, AND when target is unstable, use sword to launch enemy into sky. This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
