CS_single_wanwgc=All Return to the Earth
desc_CS_single_wanwgc_1=The myriad things of the world all face the same end. This move places you in the <font color="#FFAE00"></font> state, which allows you to break from from movement restrictions and diseases. It also allows you to convert damage taken into an HP boost.
desc_CS_single_wanwgc_2=The myriad things of the world all face the same end. This move places you in the <font color="#FFAE00"></font> state, which allows you to break from from movement restrictions and diseases. It also allows you to convert damage taken into an HP boost.
