Npc_sl_djgq02=Earth-shaking
desc_Npc_sl_djgq02_1=External skill changed from Lion Roaring Skill, the roar can shake the heaven and hell, stun enemies with 5 meters for 3 seconds, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_Npc_sl_djgq02_2=External skill changed from Lion Roaring Skill, the roar can shake the heaven and hell, stun enemies with 5 meters for 3 seconds, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
