clone009_xg_jdmz=Buddhist Heart Subdues the Devil
desc_clone009_xg_jdmz_1=A strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies; the player's palm Energy destabilizes the enemy's center of gravity, reducing speed by  20%. This can be stacked three times.
clone009_xg_wqcx=Five Chi Radiating Joy
desc_clone009_xg_wqcx_1=Soft Energy is released, and a palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the target; break the enemy's parry and reduce their rage.
clone009_xg_gfty=Spirit Wind Pushes the Cloud
desc_clone009_xg_gfty_1=A charging movement. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
clone009_xg_qgch=Intrepid Spirit
desc_clone009_xg_qgch_1=A rainbow-like movement. A rapid palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is airborne, ou can use this maneuver to knock him away.
clone009_xg_ydfq=Embracing the Wind
desc_clone009_xg_ydfq_1=Feign an attack, then break the enemy's parry to deal {@0:伤害包} while restoring your own inner force.
clone009_xg_gyyy=Passing Clouds
desc_clone009_xg_gyyy_1=The sting's blade moves like smoke curling upwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
clone009_xg_xsdm=Meridian Breaking
desc_clone009_xg_xsdm_1=Wield sting to attack continuously, the special chi force can increase HP recovering speed for yourself and friendly target, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.
clone009_xg_byjr=Move Clouds and See the Sun
desc_clone009_xg_byjr_1=A charging movement that breaks through obstacles and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach enemies.
clone009_xg_yhyc=Loathsome Clouds and Rain
desc_clone009_xg_yhyc_1=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
clone009__xg_lhqy=Shadow and Spirit Depart
desc_clone009__xg_lhqy_1=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
clone009_xg_lsjs=Transcend the Worldly
desc_clone009_xg_lsjs_1=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
clone009_xg_blfy=Departed Kin
desc_clone009_xg_blfy_1=Jump into the air and charge as you descend, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in the area of effect; <br>If the enemy is stunned as a result of the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, he will be knocked into the air and will suffer extra damage. This won't occur if you use the effect while on the ground.<br>The higher the number of your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>, the more damaging the movement is.
clone009_xg_axzy=Proud Snow Chases the Cloud
desc_clone009_xg_axzy_1=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
clone009_xg_yqxf=Uplifting Melody
desc_clone009_xg_yqxf_1=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
clone009_xg_lxns=Falling Snow Turns to Frost
desc_clone009_xg_lxns_1=Slowly cultivate your chi to release ice Energy around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies and boost your companions' Brawn.
clone009_xg_xhbs=Glacier in Sea of Clouds
desc_clone009_xg_xhbs_1=Snow and ice surge to freeze the target, dealing {@0:伤害包}.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Invade by Cold Air</font>Decreases the enemy's movement speed and prevents them from using Flying Skills.
