Npc_gb_lhz01=Lotus Blooming from the Fire
desc_Npc_gb_lhz01_1=Rage attacks heart, shoot chi force from a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the chi force will affect enemies around target.
desc_Npc_gb_lhz01_2=Rage attacks heart, shoot chi force from a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the chi force will affect enemies around target.
