Npc_gb_lhz02=Every Step A Lotus
desc_Npc_gb_lhz02_1=Charging movement, gather chi to push palm twice quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
