desc_Npc_gb_lhz02_7=Charging movement, gather chi to push palm twice quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
Npc_gb_lhz03=Blooming Everywhere
desc_Npc_gb_lhz03_1=Push two palms at the same time, urge <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> to break out, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The powerful force will push enemies away and hurt them as they fall down, continuously losing HP and Brawn.<br> (This skill must be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>).
