Npc_gb_lhz07=Green Lotus
desc_Npc_gb_lhz07_1=Lotus Palm Technique, also known as <font color="#FFAE00">Killer's Hold</font>, can throw the target to the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This also creates a blast that affects surrounding enemies. <br> (This skill can only be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, and this skill can only be used on targets in the air).
desc_Npc_gb_lhz07_2=Lotus Palm Technique, also known as <font color="#FFAE00">Killer's Hold</font>, can throw the target to the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This also creates a blast that affects surrounding enemies. <br> (This skill can only be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, and this skill can only be used on targets in the air).
