Npc_gb_lhz08=Submerge the Lotus
desc_Npc_gb_lhz08_1=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
