qy_qy_wdschool_chou_kuangbao=<s>
CS_jh_qyzf01=The War
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_1=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 10 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_2=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 9 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_3=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 8 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_4=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 7 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_5=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 6 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_6=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 5 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
CS_jh_qyzf03=The Armor
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_1=The angry dragon surges forward, his scales harder than wrought iron. Cast a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your physical defense. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_2=The angry dragon surges forward, his scales harder than wrought iron. Cast a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your physical defense. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_3=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_4=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_5=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_6=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
CS_jh_qyzf04=The Elements
CS_jh_qyzf05=The Sea
desc_CS_jh_qyzf05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy. If the target attempts to parry, he will fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Faint</font> state.<br>This was a clever maneuver of the <font color="#FFAE00">Old Housekeeper</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
