CS_jh_qyzf06=The Yin Yang
desc_CS_jh_qyzf06_1=Your opposing energies surge, inflicting {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies using both your yin and yang energies;<br>Your yang chi stays in the body will yin chi is passed on to the enemy.<br>This is the kung fu of the <font color="#FFAE00">Old Housekeeper</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
