zf_lz_jh_01_04=Array Attack
desc_zf_lz_jh_01_04_1=A single attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target within a ten-meter  fan-shaped radius. Targets in the Total Eradication state will receive double damage.<br> Damage dealt with the 28 Constellations and Guild arrays is increased by 50%, while damage dealt with the Vigor Return and School arrays is reduced by 50%.
desc_zf_lz_jh_01_04_2=A single attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target within a ten-meter  fan-shaped radius. Targets in the Total Eradication state will receive double damage.<br> Damage dealt with the 28 Constellations and Guild arrays is increased by 50%, while damage dealt with the Vigor Return and School arrays is reduced by 50%.
