Npc_jz_lyfh01=Hero's Tears
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh01_4=Your sword's chi sweeps enemies in front of you to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After the strike your <font color="#FFAE00">Hero's Tears</font> chi becomes focused. If you continuously use this move your chi will become explosive, preventing the enemy from using flying skills.
