CS_jh_liusha05=Split the Earth
desc_CS_jh_liusha05_1=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha05_2=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
