CS_jh_liusha06=The Miser
desc_CS_jh_liusha06_1=Focus you inner Energy to protect your body and enhance your defense capacities. Every successful parry strengthens your own defenses.<br/>This skill is the wisdom of the unscrupulous merchant <font color="#FFAE00">Shen Yishan</font>.
