CS_jh_dl09=Wicked Storm
desc_CS_jh_dl09_1=Stab with the fury of a storm to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. As a result the enemy will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">Poor Flow of Chi</font>. The harder you hit, the greater the influence of the effect.<br/><font color="#FFAE00">Hai Qikuo</font>'s fearsome attacks originated from this.
