desc_CS_slzp_lzs03_1=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
