desc_CS_slzp_lzs04_1=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry you put the assailant under the <font color="#FFAE00">Lacking</font> effect, so that when he uses flying skills, he will exhaust his Flying Skill points more quickly. This debuff can be stacked up to three times.
desc_CS_slzp_lzs04_2=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry you put the assailant under the <font color="#FFAE00">Lacking</font> effect, so that when he uses flying skills, he will exhaust his Flying Skill points more quickly. This debuff can be stacked up to four times.
desc_CS_slzp_lzs04_3=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry you put the assailant under the <font color="#FFAE00">Lacking</font> effect, so that when he uses flying skills, he will exhaust his Flying Skill points more quickly. This debuff can be stacked up to five times.
desc_CS_slzp_lzs05_1=Charging movement, bend your arm like a bow, and then strike like a spring, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, he will be paralyzed.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
