desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf05_1=Project a cloud of dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When attempting to break the enemy's parry, this skill adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flatten"</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if he is using one in mid-air.<br>When the enemy's parry is broken, the target will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state for 3 seconds, during which he cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf05_2=Project a cloud of dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When attempting to break the enemy's parry, this skill adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flatten"</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if he is using one in mid-air.<br>When the enemy's parry is broken, the target will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state for 3 seconds, during which he cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf05_3=Project a cloud of dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When attempting to break the enemy's parry, this skill adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flatten"</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if he is using one in mid-air.<br>When the enemy's parry is broken, the target will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state for 3 seconds, during which he cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf05_4=Project a cloud of dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When attempting to break the enemy's parry, this skill adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flatten"</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if he is using one in mid-air.<br>When the enemy's parry is broken, the target will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state for 3 seconds, during which he cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf05_5=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf05_6=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf06_1=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant.<br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For 3 seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf06_2=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant;<br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For 3.5 seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf06_3=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant;<br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For 4 seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_5=Rise from the ground and use the staff to launch the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Attaches <font color="#FFAE00">“Fallen”</font>: Unable to jump.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_6=Rise from the ground and use the staff to launch the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Attaches <font color="#FFAE00">“Fallen”</font>: Unable to jump.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_5=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
