desc_CS_wdzp_tjq03_1=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
