desc_CS_em_ynjf04_2=Yu Nv Sword, the two attacks come continuously, stab target and send flying, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will attach 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Weapon</font> for yourself.<br>(This skill can only attack target in air.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf04_3=Waving sword chopping Monomer assaulting, non-locking, there is hitting effect in the sky. It can be used twice continuously in the sky, but the hitting angle is different, its track is similar to "Z", attack to add combo-hitting buff "hidden power" level 1.
