desc_zf_bp_01_01_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Celestial Gate Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Red Cloud Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_01_01_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Celestial Gate Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Red Cloud Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_02_01_2=A skill that greatly reduces attack power. Enemies caught within the area of effect will have internal and Melee Damage reduced by 6%<br>With the Four Schools Array the reduction is 6%, while with the Five Elements Eight Diagrams Array the reduction is 4%.
desc_zf_bp_02_01_3=A skill that greatly reduces attack power. Enemies caught within the area of effect will have internal and Melee Damage reduced by 7%<br>With the Four Schools Array the reduction is 6%, while with the Five Elements Eight Diagrams Array the reduction is 4%.
desc_zf_bp_04_01_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to single target, and reduce 10% defense for target for 5s.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Five Elements Eight Diagrams Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Nine Cauldrons Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_04_01_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to single target, and reduce 10% defense for target for 5s.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Five Elements Eight Diagrams Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Nine Cauldrons Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_06_01_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, and reduce 7% Evasion for target for 10s.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Nine Cauldrons Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Nine Four Symbols Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_06_01_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, and reduce 7% Evasion for target for 10s.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Nine Cauldrons Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Nine Four Symbols Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_05_01_2=In array, internal skill defense for you side reduce 10%, recover 20 Energy each second, last 6 seconds.
desc_zf_bp_05_01_3=In array, internal skill defense for you side reduce 10%, recover 20 Energy each second, last 6 seconds.
desc_zf_bp_05_02_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to single target, and reduce 10% external skill attack power for target.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Seven Kills Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Celestial Gate Array and Jianghu array.
desc_zf_bp_05_02_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to single target, and reduce 10% external skill attack power for target.<br>The damage will be increased by 50% in Seven Kills Array and school array, but it will be reduced by 50% in Celestial Gate Array and Jianghu array.
desc_CS_sl_djgq05_1=A Block technique. A successful Parry reflects hardness damage on the attacker.
