desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_1=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 3 times at most.<br>Deal 80 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_2=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 4 times at most.<br>Deal 100 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_3=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 5 times at most.<br>Deal 120 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_4=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 6 times at most.<br>Deal 140 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_5=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 8 times at most.<br>Deal 160 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_1=Attack the sky and ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you, if the attack breaks a parry, then it will seal the enemy's feet acupoints, causing the enemy to lose massive Energy for 15 seconds when using flying skills. <br>At the same time unleash  <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> on the enemy. (The damage the target takes will increase along with stacking levels of drunk state on yourself).
desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_2=Attack the sky and ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you, if the attack breaks a parry, then it will seal the enemy's feet acupoints, causing the enemy to lose massive Energy for 15 seconds when using flying skills. <br>At the same time unleash  <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> on the enemy. (The damage the target takes will increase along with stacking levels of drunk state on yourself).
