desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_4=Attack the sky and ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you, if the attack breaks a parry, then it will seal the enemy's feet acupoints, causing the enemy to lose massive Energy for 15 seconds when using flying skills. <br>At the same time unleash  <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> on the enemy. (The damage the target takes will increase along with stacking levels of drunk state on yourself).
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_1=Use Internal Force to block and damage an enemy simultaneously.
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_2=Block move - use solid Energy to defend against attack and dealt 10 points shock damage attacker at the same time  (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_3=Block move - use solid Energy to defend against attack and dealt 14 points shock damage attacker at the same time  (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_4=Block move - use solid Energy to defend against attack and dealt 17 points shock damage attacker at the same time  (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
desc_CS_sl_dmgf04_5=Block move - use solid Energy to defend against attack and dealt 21 points shock damage attacker at the same time  (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
desc_CS_jl_shuangci07_1=A poisonous ailment explodes in the enemy's body, jolting nearby enemies as well. This maneuver fills you with bloodlust, increasing the power of your Perish Blade by 100%, each stroke drawing rivers of blood. Thereafter, when you execute The Spirit Leaves the Body double sting movement you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Enhanced Endurance</font> state.
