desc_CS_jl_shuangci07_4=A poisonous ailment explodes in the enemy's body, jolting nearby enemies as well. This maneuver fills you with bloodlust, increasing the power of your Perish Blade by 100%, each stroke drawing rivers of blood. Thereafter, when you execute The Spirit Leaves the Body double sting movement you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Enhanced Endurance</font> state.
