desc_CS_tm_tmzhd02_1=A flying strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Damage inflicted corresponds to the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing Needle</font> and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
