desc_CS_sl_lzs04_1=Block move - a successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_sl_lzs04_2=Block move - a successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_sl_lzs04_3=Block move - a successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_1=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_2=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_3=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_1=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_2=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_3=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_1=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_2=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_3=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_1=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 15 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds him for three seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_2=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 20 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds him for four seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_3=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf06_1=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant; <br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For four seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf06_2=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant; <br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For five seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf06_3=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant;<br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For six seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_1=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_2=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_3=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_1=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_2=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_3=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_1=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_2=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_3=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_4=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc04_5=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_1=Jump into the air and charge as you descend, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in the area of effect; <br>If the enemy is stunned as a result of the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, he will be knocked into the air and will suffer extra damage. This won't occur if you use the effect while on the ground.<br>The higher the number of your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>, the more damaging the movement is.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_2=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_3=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_4=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
desc_CS_em_lbc06_5=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_1=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_2=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_3=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_4=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc07_5=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_CS_em_lbc08_1=No joy in life and don't fear of death. Anger motivates the potential: increase much movement speed, Move power and defense, lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_em_lbc08_2=Heed not the common concerns and distinctions of life and death. Amid bouts of fury and sorrow, unleash your potential. Greatly increase movement speed, the power of your movements for this set, and your defense for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_em_lbc08_3=Heed not the common concerns and distinctions of life and death. Amid bouts of fury and sorrow, unleash your potential. Greatly increase movement speed, the power of your movements for this set, and your defense for 14 seconds.
