CS_wd_tjq04=Golden Hen Standing on One Foot (Ancient Manual)
desc_CS_wd_tjq04_1=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_CS_wd_tjq04_2=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_CS_wd_tjq04_3=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
CS_wd_tjq01=White Crane Spreads Its Wings
desc_CS_wd_tjq01_1=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
