CS_wd_tjq03=Two Peaks Through One's Ears
desc_CS_wd_tjq03_1=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_CS_wd_tjq03_2=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_CS_wd_tjq03_3=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
CS_wd_tjq05=Seemingly Sealed Off
CS_wd_tjq06=The Wyvern Leaves the Sea
desc_CS_wd_tjq06_1=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
desc_CS_wd_tjq06_2=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
desc_CS_wd_tjq06_3=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
CS_wd_tjq07=Pluck the Peacock's Plume (Ancient Manual)
