CS_wd_tjq02=Splitting a Wild Horse's Mane
desc_CS_wd_tjq02_1=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_wd_tjq02_2=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_wd_tjq02_3=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_1=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_2=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_3=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_4=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd04_1=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_CS_jy_dqd04_2=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
