desc_CS_jy_dqd04_4=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_1=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 5 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_2=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 7 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_3=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 9 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_4=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 12 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_CS_jy_dqd07_1=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
