desc_CS_jh_dldm02_5=The iron cord is sharp, its movements cunning. This move inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on enemies.<br>If you break the enemy's parry, this movement can cause him to suffer <font color="#FFAE00">Turbid Blood</font>, and when struck by the iron claws he will suffer extra external damage.
desc_CS_jh_dldm03_1=The thieving claws of a ghost ensnare the enemy and deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be tightly bound and cannot move.<br>This move will not be successful if executed while close to the enemy.
desc_CS_jh_dldm03_2=The thieving claws of a ghost ensnare the enemy and deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be tightly bound and cannot move.<br>This move will not be successful if executed while close to the enemy.
