desc_CS_jh_dldm05_1=Persistent like a ghost giving chase, this movement inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy; <br>If the enemy does not parry in time, you can pull him to you, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font>.<br>This move is difficult to pull off if the enemy is too close to you.
desc_CS_jh_dldm05_2=Persistent like a ghost giving chase, this movement inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy; <br>If the enemy does not parry in time, you can pull him to you, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font>.<br>This move is difficult to pull off if the enemy is too close to you.
