desc_CS_jh_dldm06_1=Sharp claws fly at opponents around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If the enemies are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font> state, your flying claws can inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Power of the Iron Chain</font>, and damage is increased.
