desc_CS_jh_dldm06_5=Sharp claws fly at opponents around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If the enemies are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font> state, your flying claws can inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Power of the Iron Chain</font>, and damage is increased.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_1=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_2=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_3=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_4=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_1=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_2=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_3=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_4=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jh_dldm07_5=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_1=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_2=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_3=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_4=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz01_5=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_1=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_2=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_3=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_4=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_5=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_1=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_2=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_3=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_4=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz03_5=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_1=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 5 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_2=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 6 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_3=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 7 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_4=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 8 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz04_5=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 9 levels at most.
desc_CS_jl_fgz05_1=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz05_2=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz05_3=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
