desc_CS_jl_fgz05_5=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz06_1=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz06_2=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz06_3=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz06_4=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz06_5=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz07_1=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
desc_CS_jl_fgz07_2=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
