desc_CS_jl_fgz07_4=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
desc_CS_jl_fgz07_5=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
desc_clone009n_004_wangchuanqiushui_1=Gaze Autumn Water
desc_clone009n_004_qingtianhenhai_1=Love the Sky Loathe the Sea
desc_clone009n_004_caixiameitou_1=Free of Worries
desc_clone009n_004_beifenghuashan_1=Fan of Grievance
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_1=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_2=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_3=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_4=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_sky_2=Gather Energy for 1.5 seconds and strike hard to shock target and make him can't parry in 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_sky_3=Gather Energy for 1.5 seconds and strike hard to shock target and make him can't parry in 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_sky_4=Gather Energy for 1.5 seconds and strike hard to shock target and make him can't parry in 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tlq05_1=Your fist is like a spear, both overt and feint. Stab at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's parry you can knock him back, preventing him from moving for two seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tlq06_1=Block movement, there is a chance to activate potential when blocking, increase 30% power of "Mantis Breaks Cart", and can be released instantly in the air.
desc_CS_jh_tlq07_1=Control the foolish with cleverness. Your fist appears from the left, appearing to travel to the right. In fact it is an encircling, ringed string that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_CS_jh_tlq07_2=Control the foolish with cleverness. Your fist appears from the left, appearing to travel to the right. In fact it is an encircling, ringed string that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_CS_jh_tlq07_3=Control the foolish with cleverness. Your fist appears from the left, appearing to travel to the right. In fact it is an encircling, ringed string that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_CS_jh_tlq07_4=Control the foolish with cleverness. Your fist appears from the left, appearing to travel to the right. In fact it is an encircling, ringed string that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_1=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_1=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf04_1=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for three seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf05_1=Hurl your blade like the mighty sun illuminating the sky, hitting enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>The dazzling knife blade adds <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state to the target, and as a result if the enemy circulates chi or performs any movement, the effect has a chance based on the number of stacks to increase.<br>(If the enemy target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state or has reached the limit, you will be able to inflict additional unblockable damage.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage while grounding any airborne enemies in your range. If you strike down any airborne enemies, your chi will allow you to resist any impairments.<br>(If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> or has reached the limit, he will suffer additional, unblockable damage.)<br>(This move is uninterruptible.)
CS_jh_fmzf01=Mad Demon Devours the Sun
desc_CS_jh_fmzf01_1=Hop and jump straight up, wielding the staff effortlessly to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.
CS_jh_fmzf02=Crazed Demon Rends the Sea
desc_CS_jh_fmzf02_1=Viciously attack an enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can used with Flying Skills to approach the target quickly.
CS_jh_fmzf03=A Demon Unhinged
desc_CS_jh_fmzf03_1=Mad Qi, Mania: body instantly becomes hard like stone. You will not be restricted by any Moves, lasting for 1.5 seconds.
CS_jh_fmzf04=Vicious Devil Smashes the Hills
desc_CS_jh_fmzf04_1=Flip then deliver a flying kick, smashing enemies in front of you to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf05_1=A sensitive movement. Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using moves from the Mad Devil set are increased by 20%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
CS_jh_fmzf06=Enraged Devil Shatters Armor
desc_CS_jh_fmzf06_1=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
CS_jh_fmzf07=Demon Razes the World
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_1=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 30% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd01_1=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd02_1=A sharp dagger turns as it flies, full of searing energy. The attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage at enemies in front of you. <br>At the same time, attack adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Theft of Souls"</font> internal damage: every time the target uses Flying Skills, more internal damage is sustained. <br>After a period of time, the internal damage is triggered, resulting in massive injury.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd03_1=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd04_1=Your dagger yearns to taste blood, and this vicious strike dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage can satiate it. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, every ensuing attack will add a layer of internal damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_ghqd05_1=A simple falling strike, and your sharp dagger inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the target; <br>When you break the enemy's parry, you can cause the target to suffer even greater internal damage over a short period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd06_1=A movement of dominating energy.<br>If the opponent is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> Energy, his HP will be winnowed away; <br>If the enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, his inner Energy will be affected.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd07_1=A veritable soul-stealing dance of seven lethal grabs. Consecutively strike the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Each attack can trigger the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage and <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, inflicting additional external damage.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt01_1=Attacks continuously, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt01_2=Attacks continuously, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt01_3=Attacks continuously, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt01_4=Attacks continuously, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt01_5=Attacks continuously, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt02_1=The heart of a demon, the hands of a devil. Bring the enemy towards you, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt02_2=The heart of a demon, the hands of a devil. Bring the enemy towards you, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt02_3=The heart of a demon, the hands of a devil. Bring the enemy towards you, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt02_4=The heart of a demon, the hands of a devil. Bring the enemy towards you, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt02_5=The heart of a demon, the hands of a devil. Bring the enemy towards you, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt03_1=A charging skill. Demonic hands claw at the target, hurling him to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tmjt03_2=A charging skill. Demonic hands claw at the target, hurling him to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tmjt03_3=A charging skill. Demonic hands claw at the target, hurling him to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tmjt03_4=A charging skill. Demonic hands claw at the target, hurling him to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tmjt03_5=A charging skill. Demonic hands claw at the target, hurling him to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_1=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_2=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_3=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_4=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_5=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx02_1=A charging move. Surge forward like a mad ghost and chop at the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When your Rage points are greater than 60, the damage inflicted by your critical hit will increase by 30%.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the grater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx02_2=A charging move. Surge forward like a mad ghost and chop at the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When your Rage points are greater than 60, the damage inflicted by your critical hit will increase by 30%.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the grater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
