desc_CS_jh_dpgx04_1=Charge forward, revealing an amazing chop only at the last minute, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This move has a 100% chance of landing a critical hit on airborne targets;<br>When your rage points top 60, damage from critical hits that you land is increased by 30%.<br>(The higher your rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
