desc_CS_jh_dpgx06_1=Your blood boils and travels backwards in its veins, converting 45% of your inner Energy into 60 Rage points for up to seven seconds;<br>Every time you use this movement you can reset the duration of your Rage. The rage accumulated by this move cannot be stacked.
desc_CS_jh_dpgx07_1=Intrigue Spell, Withered Wood Rivival, it can convert all Rage into HP. 1 Rage recovers 0.2% HP.
