desc_CS_jh_tmjt04_1=A quick fist strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you break the target's parry, you put him in the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Eye</font> state: This lowers the enemy's Internal and External Parry and increases the amount of damage taken from <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font>.
