desc_CS_jh_tmjt04_5=A quick fist strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you break the target's parry, you put him in the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Eye</font> state: This lowers the enemy's Internal and External Parry and increases the amount of damage taken from <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font>.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt05_1=A defensive movement in which a demonic air surrounds your body, allowing you to add either the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font> or the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Taoist Overrun</font> state to yourself when you successfully parry. either will increase your movement speed by 20? and you will not be able to be sent flying, knocked back, knocked down, or locked. Your anti-disease activities will be limited.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt06_1=A demon of the unholy ways, you hurl a vicious poison that envelops both you and surrounding enemies. The effect lowers enemies' movement speed and prevents them from using flying skills.<br>If you use this move again or use other moves from this set after using this move once, the poison effect will be cancelled.
