desc_CS_sl_lzs05_1=Dash forward and attack with a deadly grasp. Cause {@0: damage bag};to a target.<br>Stun a target if the target activates <font color="#FFAE00">"Feint"</font> state.<br>(the stance will enable you to approach a target through a flying skill)
