desc_CS_jl_fgz06_6=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog.<br>In 2s, the around enemies cannot use flying skills.<br>Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage<br>If enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
