desc_CS_jh_jwdf01_1=A horizontal chop. Sword Energy will give targtes{@0: damage bag} and you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Flaming Yang Knife energy"</font>.<br>(If targets have the maximum<font color="#FFAE00">"Blaze"</font>flow or a multiple of three amount of it, it will deal additional damage to them.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf01_2=Brandish your blade and deliver a sweeping chop that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front. This movement give you one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font>.<br>(If the target has a multiple of 3 stacking number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> or has reached the upper limit, skill will deal extra damage ignoring parry.)
