desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_1=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font>  between your targets. Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. At most, this echo continues for 5 rounds.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_2=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 7 times at most.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_3=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj01_1=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj01_2=A sharp hit. Sword Energy will cause {@0: damage bag} to targets in the same row.<br> Targets will be granted the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"throat-blocking"</font>: they will unable to eat for a certain time period.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj01_3=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj04_1=A defensive movement. Withdraw your sword, and for every successful parry you add a 20% chance of reducing the assailant's Rage by 2 points.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj04_2=A defensive movement. Withdraw your sword, and for every successful parry you have 20% chance of reducing the assailant's Rage by 3 points.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj04_3=A defensive movement. Withdraw your sword, and for every successful parry you have 25% chance of reducing the assailant's Rage by 4 points.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj07_1=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_CS_jl_dmssj07_2=Sword Energy will deal {@0: damage bag}to a target;<br>It will cause constant damage to targets in a radius of 8m lasting 4 sec and then targets will be stunned over 3 sec <br>(If targets block or Evasion the hit, its cooldown time will be reduced by half.)
desc_CS_jl_dmssj07_3=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_CS_jl_dmssj09_1=Killing stunt, no life and no mercy, wield sword to chop hardly, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 24%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj09_2=Killing stunt, no life and no mercy, wield sword to chop hardly, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 26%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj09_3=Killing stunt, no life and no mercy, wield sword to chop hardly, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 28%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf05_1=Your sword's chi surges through the air to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and make enemies be unable to use the skills.<br>This movement causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>, and prevents the enemy from using any movements.<br>This move was one of the wild movements of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf05_2=Deal {@0: damage bag} to targets and make them unable to release any skills.<br>Activate "<font color="#FFAE00">Flaming Fire Sword energy</font>"inside enemy's body<br> It is specially used by<font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf05_3=Your sword's chi surges through the air to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and make enemies be unable to use the skills.<br>This movement causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>, and prevents the enemy from using any movements.<br>This move was one of the wild movements of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
