desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_1=Kick enemies, wield swords to stab them and produce {@0: damage bag}. It will <br>convert your own <font color="#FFAE00">"Flaming Yang Knife energy"</font>into<font color="#FFAE00">"Blaze"</font>flow and pour the flow into targets' bodies.<br>If targets receive the maximum<font color="#FFAE00">"Blaze"</font>flow or a multiple of three amount of it, their Chi Energy will negate the increase of <font color="#FFAE00">"Blaze"</font>flow and targets will be weakened with slow movement
desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_2=A flying kick smashes the target, and you then follow up with a stab to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement also converts the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font> stored in your body to <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> that is transferred to the enemy;<br>If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, true chi will prevent the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> stacks from increasing, weakening the enemy: Martial arts effectiveness and movement speed are reduced.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_4=A flying kick smashes the target, and you then follow up with a stab to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement also converts the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font> stored in your body to <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> that is transferred to the enemy;<br>If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, true chi will prevent the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> stacks from increasing, weakening the enemy: Martial arts effectiveness and movement speed are reduced.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_5=A flying kick smashes the target, and you then follow up with a stab to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement also converts the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font> stored in your body to <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> that is transferred to the enemy;<br>If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, true chi will prevent the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> stacks from increasing, weakening the enemy: Martial arts effectiveness and movement speed are reduced.
desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_6=A flying kick smashes the target, and you then follow up with a stab to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement also converts the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font> stored in your body to <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> that is transferred to the enemy;<br>If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, true chi will prevent the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> stacks from increasing, weakening the enemy: Martial arts effectiveness and movement speed are reduced.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf07_1=Shake the earth with a jolt that reaches the enemy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy get hit by the first strike, enemey will be <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>, and the second hit will prevent enemy from using <font color="#FFAE00">flying skills</font>. If the enemy blocks, the third hit will make <font color="#FFAE00">be unable to block</font>;<br>This is the famous skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf07_2=A earth-shaking combo hit.It will cause{@0: damage bag} to targets;<br>Targets will be<font color="#FFAE00">in a coma</font> after taking the 1st hit. They will be unable to release<font color="#FFAE00">flying skills</font>after taking the 2nd hit. The 3rd hit will make them impossible<font color="#FFAE00">impossible to block</font>;<br>It is the speical skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font>in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf07_3=Shake the earth with a jolt that reaches the enemy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy get hit by the first strike, enemey will be <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>, and the second hit will prevent enemy from using <font color="#FFAE00">flying skills</font>. If the enemy blocks, the third hit will make <font color="#FFAE00">be unable to block</font>;<br>This is the famous skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
