desc_CS_em_ynjf02_1=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_CS_em_ynjf03_1=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf05_1=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
desc_CS_em_ynjf06_1=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf07_1=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_CS_em_ynjf08_1=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
desc_CS_em_ynjf04_1=Yu Nv Sword, the two attacks come continuously, stab target and send flying, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will attach 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Weapon</font> for yourself.<br>(This skill can only attack target in air.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd01_1=Throw the heart digging claw out, bind the enemies in selected area to together for 2 seconds, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>The bound enemies will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bloody Death Blade</font>, and then they will burn friendly targets in 5 meters around, last 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_xsd03_1=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd06_1=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance, let enemy pay with blood for blood. Each successful parry will give you 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> (Can stack to 3 floors at most): Make this set's attack attach 20% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 floor of Blood Thirsty Will.
desc_CS_jy_xsd07_1=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_1=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_2=Use Chi to manipulate a van and cause {@0: damage bag} to targets. It has a chance of making a target unable to release any skills over a certain period time<br/>It is specially used by Longmen Inn's<font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font>.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_3=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_4=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_5=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_6=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
