desc_CS_jz_yxjf01_4=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state, reducing his movement speed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf02_4=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_4=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf04_4=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.<br>If this attack breaks the target's parry, target will be paralyzed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf06_4=Create a protective screen of sound for 16 seconds.Targets within the screen will lose HP repeatedly.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf07_4=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj01_4=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj02_4=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj04_4=Every time you parry succesfully, you gain a 30% chance of reducing  your attacker's Rage by 5 points.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj06_4=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj07_4=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_CS_jl_dmssj08_4=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
desc_CS_jl_dmssj09_4=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 30%, this skill will deal double damage.
desc_CS_tm_ywt01_2=Viciously hurl a dart at a target, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(For this move you can charge up your Energy for added effect.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt01_3=Viciously hurl a dart at a target, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(For this move you can charge up your Energy for added effect.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt01_4=Viciously hurl a dart at a target, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(For this move you can charge up your Energy for added effect.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt05_2=A stun movement, deals {@0: 伤害包} to target. When you break the enemy's defense you can use this move to poison them, debuffing the enemy with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state. The effect, which is similar to Vertigo, lasts 3.5 seconds.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state will be canjailed if the target is attacked.
desc_CS_tm_ywt05_3=A stun movement, deals {@0: 伤害包} to target. When you break the enemy's defense you can use this move to poison them, debuffing the enemy with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state. The effect, which is similar to Vertigo, lasts 4 seconds.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state will be canjailed if the target is attacked.
desc_CS_tm_ywt05_4=A stun movement, deals {@0: 伤害包} to target. When you break the enemy's defense you can use this move to poison them, debuffing the enemy with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state. The effect, which is similar to Vertigo, lasts 4 seconds.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state will be canjailed if the target is attacked.
desc_CS_tm_ywt06_2=A secret move of the king of the underworld. Hurl an <font color="#FFAE00">Oil Bomb</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect:<br>The first enemy caught in the trap will be paralyzed for 2 seconds and take attached damage;<br>Affected enemies also have their movement speed reduced by 25% and their Flying Skills are limited. (This debuff cannot be stacked);<br>Affected enemies will also have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> debuff added to them, with one stack added each second for a maximum of 25 stacks.<br>(The trap lasts 30 seconds and its effects last 30 seconds when triggered.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt06_3=A secret move of the king of the underworld. Hurl an <font color="#FFAE00">Oil Bomb</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect:<br>The first enemy caught in the trap will be paralyzed for 2 seconds and take attached damage;<br>Affected enemies also have their movement speed reduced by 30% and their Flying Skills are limited. (This debuff cannot be stacked);<br>Affected enemies will also have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> debuff added to them, with one stack added each second for a maximum of 25 stacks.<br>(The trap lasts 30 seconds and its effects last 30 seconds when triggered.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt06_4=A secret move of the king of the underworld. Hurl an <font color="#FFAE00">Oil Bomb</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect:<br>The first enemy caught in the trap will be paralyzed for 2 seconds and take attached damage;<br>Affected enemies also have their movement speed reduced by 35% and their Flying Skills are limited. (This debuff cannot be stacked);<br>Affected enemies will also have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> debuff added to them, with one stack added each second for a maximum of 25 stacks.<br>(The trap lasts 30 seconds and its effects last 30 seconds when triggered.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt07_2=The rains turn to shooting stars. Shoot at the enemy in the range of 15 meters to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be executed while moving.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt07_3=The rains turn to shooting stars. Shoot at the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, making him rigid.<br>(This movement can be executed while moving.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt07_4=The rains turn to shooting stars. Shoot at the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, making him rigid.<br>(This movement can be executed while moving.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt02_2=The clever fox has many burrows, slipping in and out of them with ease. A stab attack in which you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage then leap away.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt02_3=The clever fox has many burrows, slipping in and out of them with ease. A stab attack in which you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage then leap away.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt02_4=The clever fox has many burrows, slipping in and out of them with ease. A stab attack in which you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage then leap away.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt03_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage by consecutively hurling three darts; <br>The attack deals extra damage with each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font>.
desc_CS_tm_ywt03_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage by consecutively hurling three darts; <br>The attack deals extra damage with each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font>.
desc_CS_tm_ywt03_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage by consecutively hurling three darts; <br>The attack deals extra damage with each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font>.
desc_CS_tm_ywt04_2=Passion inside the body burns. Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect:<br>When it is triggered, it can cause enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies in the trap suffer continuous damage. (If they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> state, they suffer even greater damage. More stacks, more damage.)<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Scald"</font> effect to them (add damage).<br>(The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered. Updating hidden weapon skill can increase the damage.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt04_3=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered.
desc_CS_tm_ywt04_4=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered.
desc_CS_em_ynjf01_2=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to targets in front of you.<br>Charge up the attack to increase damage, when full charged: unable to be stagger by enemy attacks when using the skill and knock back the the enemy in front.
desc_CS_em_ynjf01_3=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to targets in front of you.<br>Charge up the attack to increase damage, when full charged: unable to be stagger by enemy attacks when using the skill and knock back the the enemy in front.
desc_CS_em_ynjf01_4=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to targets in front of you.<br>Charge up the attack to increase damage, when full charged: unable to be stagger by enemy attacks when using the skill and knock back the the enemy in front.
desc_CS_em_ynjf02_2=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_CS_em_ynjf02_3=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_CS_em_ynjf02_4=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_CS_em_ynjf03_2=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf03_3=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf03_4=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf05_2=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
desc_CS_em_ynjf05_3=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
desc_CS_em_ynjf05_4=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
desc_CS_em_ynjf06_2=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf06_3=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf06_4=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_CS_em_ynjf07_2=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_CS_em_ynjf07_3=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_CS_em_ynjf07_4=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_CS_em_ynjf08_2=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
desc_CS_em_ynjf08_3=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
