desc_CS_jy_xsd01_2=Bind enemies in an area of effect for 2.5 seconds, dealing {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Targets are inflicted with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloody Blade"</font>, burning their allies in a 5-meter radius for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_xsd01_3=Bind enemies in an area of effect for 3 seconds, dealing {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Targets are inflicted with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloody Blade"</font>, burning their allies in a 5-meter radius for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_xsd01_4=Bind enemies in an area of effect for 3 seconds, dealing {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Targets are inflicted with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloody Blade"</font>, burning their allies in a 5-meter radius for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_xsd03_2=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd03_3=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd03_4=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd05_2=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.<br>If you break your target's parry, you inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Red Dust"</font> to enemy, whose attack power is greatly reduced and can only be recovered slowly.
desc_CS_jy_xsd05_3=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.<br>If you break your target's parry, you inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Red Dust"</font> to enemy, whose attack power is greatly reduced and can only be recovered slowly.
desc_CS_jy_xsd05_4=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.<br>If you break your target's parry, you inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Red Dust"</font> to enemy, whose attack power is greatly reduced and can only be recovered slowly.
desc_CS_jy_xsd06_2=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance, let enemy pay with blood for blood. Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Blood Thirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 5 times at most): Make this set's attack attach 20% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Blood Thirsty Will.
desc_CS_jy_xsd06_3=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance, let enemy pay with blood for blood. Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Blood Thirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 7 times at most): Make this set's attack attach 20% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Blood Thirsty Will.
desc_CS_jy_xsd06_4=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance, let enemy pay with blood for blood. Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Blood Thirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 10 times at most): Make this set's attack attach 20% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Blood Thirsty Will.
desc_CS_jy_xsd07_2=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_CS_jy_xsd07_3=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_CS_jy_xsd07_4=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_2=Drink enemy's blood, kick target down on the ground, and then chop with blade to kill target, deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>The movement will drain the enemy's blood, to recover your own HP. The draining effect is 25%. (If your attack is blocked, there won't be the effect.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_3=Drink enemy's blood, kick target down on the ground, and then chop with blade to kill target, deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>The movement will drain the enemy's blood, to recover your own HP. The draining effect is 30%. (If your attack is blocked, there won't be the effect.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_4=Drink enemy's blood, kick target down on the ground, and then chop with blade to kill target, deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>The movement will drain the enemy's blood, to recover your own HP. The draining effect is 35%. (If your attack is blocked, there won't be the effect.)
