CS_jh_yqq02=Wild Shot Fist (II)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_1=Sprinting Move, elbowing hammerblow, destroying everything. Cause {@0:伤害包} to target and decrease target's internal skill critical hit multiple.<br>You will not be struck, repelled or knocked down in whole attack process.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
