desc_CS_jh_yqq02_8=Sprinting Move, elbowing hammerblow, destroying everything. Cause {@0:伤害包} to target, decrease target's internal skill critical hit multiple and shock nearby enemy (at most 3 enemies).<br>You will not be struck, repelled or knocked down in whole attack process.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
