CS_jh_yqq05=Wild Shot Fist (V)
desc_CS_jh_yqq05_1=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 4 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
desc_CS_jh_yqq05_2=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 5 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
desc_CS_jh_yqq05_3=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 6 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
desc_CS_jh_yqq05_4=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 7 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
desc_CS_jh_yqq05_5=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 8 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
desc_CS_jh_yqq05_6=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 10 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
CS_jh_yqq06=Wild Shot Fist (VI)
