CS_jh_jhdf01=Supreme Soul-Strike
desc_CS_jh_jhdf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Gain "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: When this effect reaches 6 stacks, using this skill again will remove all stacks of "Peerlessness" and knock back the target.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf01_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Gain "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: When this effect reaches 6 stacks, using this skill again will remove all stacks of "Peerlessness" and knock back the target.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf01_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Gain "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: When this effect reaches 5 stacks, using this skill again will remove all stacks of "Peerlessness" and knock back the target.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf01_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Gain "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: When this effect reaches 5 stacks, using this skill again will remove all stacks of "Peerlessness" and knock back the target.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf01_5=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Gain "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: When this effect reaches 4 stacks, using this skill again will remove all stacks of "Peerlessness" and knock back the target.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf01_6=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Gain "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: When this effect reaches 4 stacks, using this skill again will remove all stacks of "Peerlessness" and knock back the target.
CS_jh_jhdf02=Furious Whirlwind
desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_1=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and cause {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 10 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_2=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and cause {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 12 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_3=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and cause {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 14 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_4=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and deal {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 16 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_5=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and deal {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 18 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_6=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and deal {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 20 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
CS_jh_jhdf03=A Thousand Weights Fall to the Earth
desc_CS_jh_jhdf03_1=Land hard, dealing{@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies and stunning targets on the ground for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf03_2=Land hard, dealing{@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies and stunning targets on the ground for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf03_3=Land hard, dealing{@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies and stunning targets on the ground for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf03_4=Land hard, dealing{@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies and stunning targets on the ground for 2 seconds.
