CS_jh_jhdf04=Destroy the Heart
CS_jh_jhdf05=Move Like a Shadow
CS_jh_jhdf06=Cold Fury
desc_CS_jh_jhdf06_1=Successful parry under the "Peerlessness" state has a 20% chance to reflect 30% damage received back at the attacker.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf06_2=Successful parry under the "Peerlessness" state has a 20% chance to reflect 40% damage received back at the attacker.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf06_3=Successful parry under the "Peerlessness" state has a 30% chance to reflect 40% damage received back at the attacker.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf06_4=Successful parry under the "Peerlessness" state has a 30% chance to reflect 50% damage received back at the attacker.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf06_5=Successful parry under the "Peerlessness" state has a 40% chance to reflect 50% damage received back at the attacker.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf06_6=Successful parry under the "Peerlessness" state has a 40% chance to reflect 60% damage received back at the attacker.
CS_jh_jhdf07=Protect the Flowers
desc_CS_jh_jhdf07_1=Create a barrier to absorb some damage received. If the barrier is not broken after certain amount of damage absorbed, the user will enter Furious State.<br>Furious State: Increases the damage of all skills in this set by 50% and decreases Defense by 100% for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf07_2=Create a barrier to absorb some damage received. If the barrier is not broken after certain amount of damage absorbed, the user will enter Furious State.<br>Furious State: Increases the damage of all skills in this set by 50% and decreases Defense by 100% for 6 seconds.
CS_jh_jhdf08=Raging Storm of Blades
CS_jy_xsd08_sky=Cold blood drinking (in the air)
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 20%.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_sky_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 25%.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_sky_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 30%.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_sky_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 35%.
CS_jh_hyjf01=Sudden Snow
CS_jh_hyjf02=Sharp Frost and Shadow Snow
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_1=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_2=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_3=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_4=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_5=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_6=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
CS_jh_hyjf03=Snow Storm
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_1=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_2=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_3=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_4=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_5=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_6=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
CS_jh_hyjf04=Walking in the Snow
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_1=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_2=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_3=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_4=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_5=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_6=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
CS_jh_hyjf05=Shattered Ice Becomes Snow
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 1 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 1 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 7 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 1 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 1 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 9 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_5=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 1 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_6=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 2 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 10 seconds.
CS_jh_hyjf06=Facing Wind and Snow
desc_CS_jh_hyjf06_1=Cold posture, sword perseverance: When parrying successfully, you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Perseverance"</font> state, it can accumulate at most 3 tiers:<br>Activate self-esteem nature. The release process of "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Flying Snow" and "Traceless Falling Snow" is in Endurance state (consume one tier "Perseverance" state for each release).<br>Subside fury, decrease Rage consumption of "Disappointment Snow" (Each one tier "Perseverance" state will decrease 1 Rage consumption, each attack will consume one tier "Perseverance" state).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf06_2=Cold posture, sword perseverance: When parrying successfully, you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Perseverance"</font> state, it can accumulate at most 4 tiers:<br>Activate self-esteem nature. The release process of "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Flying Snow" and "Traceless Falling Snow" is in Endurance state (consume one tier "Perseverance" state for each release).<br>Subside fury, decrease Rage consumption of "Disappointment Snow" (Each one tier "Perseverance" state will decrease 1 Rage consumption, each attack will consume one tier "Perseverance" state).
