desc_CS_jh_hyjf06_5=Cold posture, sword perseverance: When parrying successfully, you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Perseverance"</font> state, it can accumulate at most 7 tiers:<br>Activate self-esteem nature. The release process of "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Flying Snow" and "Traceless Falling Snow" is in Endurance state (consume one tier "Perseverance" state for each release).<br>Subside fury, decrease Rage consumption of "Disappointment Snow" (Each one tier "Perseverance" state will decrease 1 Rage consumption, each attack will consume one tier "Perseverance" state).
