Npc_em_lbc05=Far and Removed
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_1=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point.
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_2=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. There is also a chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_3=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. There is also a slightly greater chance of adding on more rage point on top of that.
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_4=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds two additional rage points.
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_5=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds two additional rage points. There is also the chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_6=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds two additional rage points. There is also a slightly greater chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_Npc_em_lbc05_7=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds three additional rage points.
Npc_em_lbc06=Departed Kin
desc_Npc_em_lbc06_1=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
