Npc_em_lbc08=Death Do Us Part
desc_Npc_em_lbc08_1=No joy in life and don't fear of death. Anger motivates the potential: increase much movement speed, Move power and defense, lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_em_lbc08_2=Heed not the common concerns and distinctions of life and death. Amid bouts of fury and sorrow, unleash your potential. Greatly increase movement speed, the power of your movements for this set, and your defense for 12 seconds.
