Npc_gb_ksbf04=Cry for the World
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf04_1=Attack the sky and ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you, if the attack breaks a parry, then it will seal the enemy's feet acupoints, causing the enemy to lose massive Energy for 15 seconds when using flying skills. <br>At the same time unleash  <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> on the enemy. (The damage the target takes will increase along with stacking levels of drunk state on yourself).
