Npc_gb_ksbf05=Wandering Soul
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_1=A block move. If successful you gain a 30% chance to increase your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunken state</font>.
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_2=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 40% if you parry successfully.
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_3=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 50% if you parry successfully.
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_4=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 60% if you parry successfully.
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_5=Defense status - will probably strengthen <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> by 70% if you parry successfully.
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_6=A defensive state. When performing a successful parry there is an 80% chance the your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> state will be increased.
desc_Npc_gb_ksbf05_7=A defensive state. When performing a successful parry there is an 90% chance the your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunk</font> state will be increased.
