Npc_jl_fgz02=Blood Frozen in Seven Steps
desc_Npc_jl_fgz02_1=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
