desc_Npc_jl_fgz02_5=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jl_fgz02_6=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jl_fgz02_7=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
Npc_jl_fgz03=Chisel Bone and Smash Marrow
desc_Npc_jl_fgz03_1=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz03_2=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
