Npc_jl_fgz04=Erode Body and Heart
desc_Npc_jl_fgz04_1=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 5 levels at most.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz04_2=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 6 levels at most.
