Npc_jl_fgz06=Nail Heart and Pierce Bone
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_1=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_2=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_3=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_4=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_5=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_6=A rotting bone kill. Throw Poison bottle into a specific area and release toxic fog.<br>Targets will be unable to use flying skills for 2 secs.<br>Targets will gain constant damage.<br>Targets will be stunned when they try to come out from the toxic fog.
desc_Npc_jl_fgz06_7=A rotting bone kill. Throw Poison bottle into a specific area and release toxic fog.<br>Targets will be unable to use flying skills for 2 secs.<br>Targets will gain constant damage.<br>Targets will be stunned when they try to come out from the toxic fog.
Npc_jl_fgz07=Carry Bones and Hear Voices
desc_Npc_jl_fgz07_1=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
