Npc_jl_shuangci01=Dark Wind of Nine Hells
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci01_1=Release chi force and activate acupoints, increase 30% your own movement speed, and lose Energy continuously at the same time.<br>The chi force will affect surrounding enemies, making them lose Energy when using flying skill.
