Npc_jl_shuangci02=Dark Poison Destroys The Wood
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_1=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 3 times at most.<br>Deal 80 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_2=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 4 times at most.<br>Deal 100 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_3=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 5 times at most.<br>Deal 120 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_4=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 6 times at most.<br>Deal 140 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_5=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 8 times at most.<br>Deal 160 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_6=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 9 times at most.<br>Deal 180 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci02_7=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 10 times at most.<br>Deal 200 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
Npc_jl_shuangci03=Evil Ghosts Fight for Food
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci03_1=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
