Npc_jl_shuangci04=Viper Flicks Tongue
desc_Npc_jl_shuangci04_1=Charging movement, wield sting like snake spits out tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
