desc_Npc_jl_shuangci08_7=Attach insect poison on the weapon, each parry will asborb enemy 24 HP (Absorbing value depends on internal skill)
Npc_jy_shd01=Wherefore Art Thy Soul
desc_Npc_jy_shd01_1=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one handsome flourish. The enemy gets hit by the chi force and takes {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
