Npc_jy_shd03=Reviving Spirit
desc_Npc_jy_shd03_1=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
