Npc_jy_shd04=Soul Bound
desc_Npc_jy_shd04_1=Simple blade skill, chop towards head to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Enemy's parry will be broken, and target will take <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, taking continuous damage for a period of time.
