Npc_jy_shd07=Art of a Thousand Spirits
desc_Npc_jy_shd07_1=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
