Npc_sl_wtgf02=Red Dusk Pierces the Sun
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_1=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_2=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_3=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_4=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_5=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_6=A charging attack in which chi surges through your staff as it sweeps enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage, slowing their movement speed; <br>If you are currently on the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> state, your movement will slow the enemy's movement even more effectively;  If the target has seven stacks of movement speed reduction, he will be unable to use flying skills for a short period.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf02_7=A charging attack in which chi surges through your staff as it sweeps enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage, slowing their movement speed; <br>If you are currently on the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> state, your movement will slow the enemy's movement even more effectively;  If the target has four stacks of movement speed reduction, he will be unable to use flying skills for a short period.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
Npc_sl_wtgf03=Crack the Whip
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf03_1=Strike heavily, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you.<br>Your powerful force can break an enemy's parry instantly, and attaches <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> to the nemy: Target Immobilized.
