Npc_sl_wtgf04=Shoes Worn on Yellow Stone
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_1=A blocking technique. Succesful Parries grant the<font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff, increasing movement speed.
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_2=Block move - a successful parry will add <font color="#FFAE00">Put On Shoes</font> to yourself, increasing your movement speed.
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_3=Block move - a successful parry will add <font color="#FFAE00">Put On Shoes</font> to yourself, increasing your movement speed.
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_4=Block move - a successful parry will add <font color="#FFAE00">Put On Shoes</font> to yourself, increasing your movement speed.
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_5=Block move - a successful parry will add <font color="#FFAE00">Put On Shoes</font> to yourself, increasing your movement speed.
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_6=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry, you can add the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> buff to yourself, which boosts your movement speed by 45%.
desc_Npc_sl_wtgf04_7=A defensive movement. When you successfully parry, you can add the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> buff to yourself, which boosts your movement speed by 50%.
