Npc_tm_fgzyc03=Dazed and Blinded
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc03_1=Light stab, confuse enemy's eyes, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>This skill can break enemy's parry and reduce movement speed.
