Npc_tm_fgzyc04=Transform in Many Steps
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_1=Block move - each successful parry can let you breathe in one <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift Chi</font>.
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_2=Block move - each successful parry can let you breathe in one <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift Chi</font>.
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_3=Block move - each successful parry can let you breathe in one <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift Chi</font>.
