desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_5=Block move - each successful parry can let you breathe in one <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift Chi</font>.
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_6=A defensive movement. Every time you parry an enemy's attack you can intake a breath of <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift</font> chi. Each stack of this buff increases your movement speed by 4%, and can be stacked a maximum of six times.
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_7=A defensive movement. Every time you parry an enemy's attack you can intake a breath of <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift</font> chi. Each stack of this buff increases your movement speed by 5%, and can be stacked a maximum of six times.
Npc_tm_fgzyc05=Stalk in Stealth
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc05_1=Stealth technique: Throws a smoke bomb to create a special mist that makes enemies in mist lose HP continuously and disable their flying skills.<br>Allies in mist can use the smoke to increase their Evasion and Melee Damage.
