Npc_tm_fgzyc07=Skim the Surface
desc_Npc_tm_fgzyc07_1=Fly in air, strike target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target is on the ground, the skill will make him lose HP and be unable to use flying skill.<br>If target is in smoke mist, he will be paralyzed.
