desc_Npc_tm_jsc01_3=Charging movement. Stab the target several times to inflict damage. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Following"</font> Balance, the impact force can be converted into extra Yin damage.<br>(This move can be used with Flying Skills to get close to the enemies quickly.)
