Npc_tm_jsc03=Following Madness
desc_Npc_tm_jsc03_1=Gold Snake Mental Skill: Increases movement speed by 30% for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc03_2=Gold Snake Mental Skill: Increases movement speed by 35% for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc03_3=Gold Snake Mental Skill: Increases movement speed by 40% for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc03_4=Gold Snake Mental Skill: Increases movement speed by 45% for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc03_5=Gold Snake Mental Skill: Increases movement speed by 50% for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc03_6=A golden snake method. When you circulate chi, your own movement speed jumps 50% and attacks from the <font color="#FFAE00">Backfire</font> set will have added soft damage for 15 seconds.
