Npc_tm_jsc04=Swing the Tail
desc_Npc_tm_jsc04_1=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc04_2=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
desc_Npc_tm_jsc04_3=Swing dagger and feint attack, inflict damage to the enemies in front.<br>If the enemy tries to block, he will be pushed away and paralyzed (Reduce 30% speed. It lasts 8 seconds).
desc_Npc_tm_jsc04_4=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
