Npc_tm_tmzhd06=Sky Demon Descends to Earth
desc_Npc_tm_tmzhd06_1=Dance like a demon and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies. The amount of damage you inflict corresponds to the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing</font> stacks and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
Npc_wd_lyjf01=Yin and Yang intersect
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf01_1=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf01_2=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf01_3=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
