desc_Npc_wd_lyjf05_3=Block move - a successful parry will reduce the attacker's Brawn, and at the same time:<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, will give you one piece of yang chi.<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, will give you one piece of yin chi.
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf05_4=Block move - a successful parry will reduce the attacker's Brawn, and at the same time:<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, will give you one piece of yang chi.<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, will give you one piece of yin chi.
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf05_5=Block move - a successful parry will reduce the attacker's Brawn, and at the same time:<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, will give you one piece of yang chi.<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, will give you one piece of yin chi.
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf05_6=A defensive movement. After you parry an enemy's attack, you can render them lethargic, reducing their Brawn by 60 points for 12 seconds.<br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> buff, this move boosts your own true Yang chi; <br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> buff your true Yin chi will be boosted.
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf05_7=A defensive movement. After you parry an enemy's attack, you can render them lethargic, reducing their Brawn by 60 points for 14 seconds.<br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> buff, this move boosts your own true Yang chi;<br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> buff your true Yin chi will be boosted.
Npc_wd_lyjf06=One Level within Another
desc_Npc_wd_lyjf06_1=Skill contains sword, sword contains skill, the twin swords attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
