Npc_wd_qfjf01=Clear Sound and Gentle Rhythm
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf01_1=Attack with ease, the fierce chi of the sword sweeps enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and make him take extra damage when using flying skill.
