Npc_wd_qfjf03=Pure Spring Flows Forth
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf03_1=Continuous sword chi gather into a line, heavily strike enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi, the remaining force can cause target to be unable to block in 3 seconds.
