Npc_wd_qfjf05=Pure Awakening
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf05_1=Block move - purge spirit, each successful parry will strengthen your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi exists, Turbulent Rapids will cast for less time, and Noble Influence will deal more damage.
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf05_2=Block move - purge spirit, each successful parry will strengthen your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi exists, Turbulent Rapids will cast for less time, and Noble Influence will deal more damage.
