desc_Npc_wd_qfjf05_5=Block move - purge spirit, each successful parry will strengthen your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi exists, Turbulent Rapids will cast for less time, and Noble Influence will deal more damage.
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf05_6=A defensive movement. Purge your heart and spirit. With each successful parry you add the <font color="#FFAE00">Cleansing Wind</font> buff which improves your sword strikes for 20 seconds: This reduces your Cloudy Jing Clear Wei chi circulation period and increases the damage from your Noble Influence sword strike.
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf05_7=A defensive movement. Purge your heart and spirit. With each successful parry you add the <font color="#FFAE00">Cleansing Wind</font> buff which improves your sword strikes for 22 seconds: This reduces your Cloudy Jing Clear Wei chi circulation period and increases the damage from your Noble Influence sword strike.
Npc_wd_qfjf06=A Chance Meeting
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf06_1=Stunt of Breeze Sword, the sharp sword Chi attacks around enemies to deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> Qi, will take more damage. <br>It's better to use the skill in air.
