Npc_wd_qfjf07=A Gentle Breeze Blows
desc_Npc_wd_qfjf07_1=Charging skill, wield sword and attack several times, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is unable to block, will take extra damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
