CS_jh_sbz01=Dragon Slap
desc_CS_jh_sbz01_1=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 2 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sbz01_2=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 3 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sbz01_3=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 4 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sbz01_4=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 5 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sbz01_5=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 5 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sbz01_6=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 5 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
CS_jh_sbz02=Dragon Cuff
desc_CS_jh_sbz02_1=Hit the target's face to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the targetsstill under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>, also fall under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>, which randomizes the target's key bindings for 6 seconds. (The duration can be stacked with the stack count of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> effect.)
