CS_jh_sbz03=Blind Dragon
desc_CS_jh_sbz03_1=Stab your enemy's eyes, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When you succeed in breaching the enemy's parry, you inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Eye Stab"</font>, blurring the target's vision for 3 seconds.
