desc_Npc_em_lbc02_7=A charging movement with a turning stab, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This adds Rage to your character, the ammount depending on how much your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>is stacked.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
Npc_em_lbc03=Loathesome Clouds And Rain
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_1=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_2=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_3=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_4=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_5=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_6=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_7=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
Npc_em_lbc03_sky=Loathesome Clouds And Rain
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_5=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_6=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
desc_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
