huodong_qiandao=Use items
desc_huodong_qiandao_1=<s>
fb_Npc_sl_djgq05=Blocking Horse Step
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq05_1=Block move - a successful parry will activate potential, attach hardness damage on your attack.
fb_Npc_sl_djgq06=Flower-Stirring Step
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq06_1=Execute a series of rapid attacks.
fb_Npc_sl_djgq03=Step Forward For A Thump
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq03_1=Calm your heart and gather chi, push a fist and punch enemies in front away, deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_sl_djgq02=Earth-shaking
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq02_1=External skill changed from Lion Roaring Skill, the roar can shake the heaven and hell, stun enemies with 5 meters for 3 seconds, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_sl_djgq07=Fleeing Steps Steal the Heart
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq07_1=Charging movement, get close to enemy and punch twice to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_sl_djgq04=Feint Step Intercepts Elbow
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq04_1=Feint attack, knocks down enemy and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If enemy tries to block will take extra hardness damage.
fb_Npc_sl_djgq08=Two Locks Copy the Sky
desc_fb_Npc_sl_djgq08_1=Punch from both sides, three fist wind attack enemies in front, deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_gb_lhz01=Lotus Blooming from the Fire
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz01_1=Rage attacks heart, shoot chi force from a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the chi force will affect enemies around target.
fb_Npc_gb_lhz02=Every Step a Lotus
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz02_1=Charging movement, gather chi to push palm twice quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_gb_lhz03=Blooming Everywhere
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz03_1=Push two palms at the same time, urge <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> to break out, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The powerful force will push enemies away and hurt them as they fall down, continuously losing HP and Brawn.<br> (This skill must be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>).
fb_Npc_gb_lhz04=Lotus Sharing One Root
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz04_1=Push palm once, create a force to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will reduce his movement speed, and cause him not to be able to use flying skill.
fb_Npc_gb_lhz05=Give the Buddha Borrowed Flowers
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz05_1=Block move - each successful parry can convert attacker's force into <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> and store it.<br>(Higher level of skill, more <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> can be stored.)
fb_Npc_gb_lhz06=Falling Flower and Flowing Water
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz06_1=Use skill like in water, palm force blows like wind, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.
fb_Npc_gb_lhz07=Green Lotus
fb_Npc_gb_lhz08=Submerge the Lotus
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz08_1=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj01=Lion shakes head
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj01_1=Charging skill, wield sword and attack twice, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_wd_tjj02=Parade of Pegasus
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj02_1=Special mental skill, can switch the rate of HP and Energy.<br>Once this skill reaches a higher level, the cost in chi when switching will be less.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj03=Ring the moon
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj03_1=Special breathing mental skill, can recover some Energy in a short period.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj04=Swallow Stirs Up Waves
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj04_1=A yang attack, the enemies affected by sword chi will take {@0:伤害包}, and suffer a internal injury: movement speed is reduced, continuous loss of HP.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj05=Dragonfly touches on water
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj05_1=Attack with sword slightly, break the parry of enemies in front, deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If enemy is unable to block, the attack will drain his Energy.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj06=Rhinoceros watches moon
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj06_1=Block move - each successful parry will recover your Energy.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj07=Tai Chi Sword Dance
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj07_1=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj08=Swallow Flies Over Pool
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj08_1=A yin attack, the enemies affected by the sword chi will be repelled, and take {@0:伤害包}, lose Energy in a while.
fb_Npc_wd_tjj09=Plum Blossoms in the Wind
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjj09_1=Gather chi to shoot sword chi to around air, bring down all enemies in the area, and deal {@0:伤害包}, make them be unable to use Flying Skill for 5 seconds.
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh01=Hero's Tears
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh01_1=Sprinkle the Sword Chi to sweep away the enemies in front and inflict damage;<br>After attacking, it will condense <font color="#FFAE00">"Hero's Tear"</font> Chi. If you continue using this move, Chi will burn out: It will make the lower section of the enemy be unstable (He can't use Flying Skills).
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh02=Flying Swallow Returns
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh02_1=A charging move. A leisurely uppercut to inflict damage;<br>If the lower section of the target is unstable, he will be uppercut to the sky.<br>(This move can be used with Flying Skills to get close to the enemy quickly.)
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh03=Reticent Flower
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh03_1=The colorful Sword's Chi goes straight to inflict damage to the enemies in front;<br>When succeeding in breaking defense, you can make the lower section of the enemy be unstable (He can't use Flying Skills).
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh04=Whisper of Falling Dust
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh04_1=Combine the word and body, successful parry has chance to counter-stun: make enemy paralyzed, can not move.
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh05=Flying Flowers and Falling Leaves
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh05_1=A charging move. Colorful Sword's Chi to assault the target and inflict damage;<br>When the move is executed on the ground, you can strike down the targets in the sky and paralyze their legs: Reduce the speed and bar their Flying Skills.<br>(This move can be used with Flying Skills to get close to the enemy quickly.)
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh06=Plum Blossom and Spring Rain
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh06_1=Devastate surrounding opponents by creating a field of pure inner energy: This increases the might of your own external and internal skills and increases your ability to regenerate HP.
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh07=Snow Moon's Wind Flower
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh07_1=Dance with sword, attack while moving and inflict damage to the enemies surrounded. If the legs of the enemy are paralyzed, he will be injured much more seriously.<br>(This move can't be interrupted when executed.)
fb_Npc_jz_lyfh08=Flowers Reflected in Moon
desc_fb_Npc_jz_lyfh08_1=Rush towards the target and deal damage.
fb_Npc_tm_mhb01=Meteor Chases the Moon
desc_fb_Npc_tm_mhb01_1=Throw a dart quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
fb_Npc_tm_mhb02=Flying Flowers
desc_fb_Npc_tm_mhb02_1=Flying flowers look beautiful, throw 3 darts continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
fb_Npc_tm_mhb03=Infatuation
desc_fb_Npc_tm_mhb03_1=Let your chi flow in reverese and imbue your arms with energy. This improves the damage of your throwing darts, adding soft damage to each target you hit. This move also reduces the target's movement speed.<br>(The effect only applies to Vertigo Dart.)
fb_Npc_tm_mhb04=Summon Spirits
desc_fb_Npc_tm_mhb04_1=A dart takes soul, contains Energy, can break enemy's parry and deal {@0:伤害包}. If enemy trys to block, will cost more parry endurance.
fb_Npc_tm_mhb05=Soul With Moving Threads
desc_fb_Npc_tm_mhb05_1=Block move - each successful parry will increase your movement speed.
fb_Npc_tm_mhb06=soul chasing
desc_fb_Npc_tm_mhb06_1=Stunt of Vertigo Dart, attach yin damage on your attack, last 30s. If enemy tried to block, will cost more parry endurance.
fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd06=Sky Demon Descends to Earth
desc_fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd06_1=Dance like a demon and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies. The amount of damage you inflict corresponds to the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing</font> stacks and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
fb_Npc_tm_fbpg=Taste My Dart
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fbpg_1=Normal dart attack. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq01=Eagles cleaving the sky
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq01_1=This counter-attack drains the target's HP.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq02=Eagle flies a long way
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq02_1=Bent fingers like a claw, attacking enemy directly. Deal damage to target. Claw can scratch skin and suck target's HP.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
fb_Npc_jy_yzq03=Peck Eye and Fight for Pearls
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq03_1=This skill strenghtens and enables the attacks to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Peck Eyes and Fight for Pearls"</font> onto the targets: Affected targets lose HP, are slowed, and has a chance to fall when using Flying Skills. Anyone attacking the affected targets can steal HP from them.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq04=The Roc Displays its Wings
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq04_1=Deals damage to enemies in front.<br>This attack can break through enemy's parry, knocking them down, can reducing their Movement Speed.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq05=Golden Pheasant Shakes Feather
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq05_1=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed and the power of <font color="#FFAE00">"Eagle Claw Fist"</font> attacks will increase.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq06=Divine Eagle's Ninefold Attack
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq06_1=Descend like an eagle and deal damage to surrounding enemies.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq07=Lightning Hawk Strikes
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq07_1=Deals damage to surrounding enemies.<br>You can select an area on the ground to attack while using this skill in mid-air. The attack will knock down all enemies in the selected area and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Peck Eyes and Fight for Pearls"</font>.
fb_Npc_jy_yzq07_sky=Lightning Hawk Strikes
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq07_sky_1=Attack targets on the ground, deal damage to them and inflict "Peck Eyes and Fight for Pearls"
fb_Npc_jy_yzq08=Hawk Flies and Tiger Feasts
desc_fb_Npc_jy_yzq08_1=Sprint posture, aim at desperate target on the ground, desperate scratch can deal damage to target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf01=Buddha's Light
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf01_1=Looks like shadown but it's ture, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies.
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf02=Buddha Saves the Soul
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf02_1=Charging move - focuses your Brawn into the head of your staff to strike your target and deal {@0:伤害包}. The power of the blow will reflect your Brawn.<br> (Use this move with your Flying ability for a swift approach.)
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf03=Heal the World
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf03_1=Use thousand kilograms strength to sweep enemies in front, if this attack breaks enemy's parry, the remaining force will stun surrounding enemies.
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf04=Golem Subdues Evil
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf04_1=This defensive stance draws from your Energy to shock your attackers.
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf05=Myriad Buddhas Return
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf05_1=Attack with staff for thousand times, make wind blow, sweep surrounding enemies and deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is in air, can continuously throw target away.
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf06=Boundless Dharma
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf06_1=Fall the staff and attack the ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies and punch them away, shock their merdians (Reduce movement speed in a short period, target cannot use flying skills and attack).
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf07=Sakyamuni Comes to Earth
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf07_1=The force of a falling mountain - this attack deals {@0:伤害包}. This skill is used in midair, stunning enemies for 3 seconds.
fb_Npc_sl_dmgf07_sky=Sakyamuni Comes to Earth
desc_fb_Npc_sl_dmgf07_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包}, use this skill in air can dive and strike ground heavily, stun enemies in area for 3s.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz01=Buddhist Heart Subdues the Devil
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz01_1=A strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies; the player's palm Energy destabilizes the enemy's center of gravity, reducing speed by  20%. This can be stacked three times.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz02=Auspicious Beginning
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz02_1=Slowly circulate chi, accelerating the target's chi flow. This removes blood clots and jolts nearby enemies; When used on oneself, the <br>movement can send enemies flying.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz03=Five Chi Radiating Joy
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz03_1=Soft Energy is released, and a palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the target; break the enemy's parry and reduce their rage.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz04=Holding Sand Against the Current
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz04_1=A clever defense move. When parrying you can destabilize the enemy's center of gravity, reducing movement speed by 20%. This can be stacked up to three times.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz05=Spirit Wind Pushes the Cloud
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz05_1=A charging movement. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz06=Buddha's Golden Aura
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz06_1=A merciful move that gives your party a protective chi that reduces damage taken for a short period.
fb_Npc_em_jdmz07=Intrepid Spirit
desc_fb_Npc_em_jdmz07_1=A rainbow-like movement. A rapid palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is airborne, ou can use this maneuver to knock him away.
fb_Npc_sl_wtgf01=Hidden Tiger Hears the Wind
desc_fb_Npc_sl_wtgf01_1=Use staff to attack ground in front, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> at the moment, he will take extra hardness damage.
fb_Npc_sl_wtgf02=Red Dusk Pierces the Sun
desc_fb_Npc_sl_wtgf02_1=Charge an enemy and sweep with your staff,  dealing {@0:伤害包} to target and slow him. <br>Slowed enemies will receive additional damage if you have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff.<br> (Use this move with your Flying abilities for a swift approach.)
fb_Npc_sl_wtgf03=Crack the Whip
desc_fb_Npc_sl_wtgf03_1=Strike heavily, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you.<br>Your powerful force can break an enemy's parry instantly, and attaches <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> to the nemy: Target Immobilized.
fb_Npc_sl_wtgf04=Shoes Worn on Yellow Stone
desc_fb_Npc_sl_wtgf04_1=A blocking technique. Succesful Parries grant the<font color="#FFAE00">"Put On Shoes"</font> buff, increasing movement speed.
fb_Npc_sl_wtgf05=Dragon Soaring Over the Plain
desc_fb_Npc_sl_wtgf05_1=Create wind in plain, jump to selected area, and sweep surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}, and stun them for a while.
fb_Npc_sl_wtgf06=White Dragon Returns to the Sea
desc_fb_Npc_sl_wtgf06_1=Staff technique as explained in Buddha's Protector Manual. Execute several heavy attacks to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and knock down the enemy with the final strike.
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc01=Attack with Shadows and Sand
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc01_1=Stab three times immediately, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc02=Flame Tree Silvery Flower
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc02_1=Charging movement, approach enemy and stab continuously to deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Shapeshift"</font>, you can deal extra damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc03=Dazed and Blinded
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc03_1=Light stab, confuse enemy's eyes, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>This skill can break enemy's parry and reduce movement speed.
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc04=Transform in Many Steps
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc04_1=Block move - each successful parry can let you breathe in one <font color="#FFAE00">Shapeshift Chi</font>.
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc05=Stalk in Stealth
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc05_1=Stealth technique: Throws a smoke bomb to create a special mist that makes enemies in mist lose HP continuously and disable their flying skills.<br>Allies in mist can use the smoke to increase their Evasion and Melee Damage.
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc06=Grab the Shadow Catch the Wind
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc06_1=Stunt of Shadow Chasing Sting, move like wind, dagger shadow is chaotic, the enemy affected by the force will take {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc07=Skim the Surface
desc_fb_Npc_tm_fgzyc07_1=Fly in air, strike target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target is on the ground, the skill will make him lose HP and be unable to use flying skill.<br>If target is in smoke mist, he will be paralyzed.
fb_Npc_jy_shd01=Wherefore Art Thy Soul
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd01_1=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one handsome flourish. The enemy gets hit by the chi force and takes {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
fb_Npc_jy_shd02=Soul Destruction
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd02_1=Wield blade outrageously, the blade chi will impact enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then this attack will knock target down.
fb_Npc_jy_shd03=Reviving Spirit
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd03_1=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
fb_Npc_jy_shd04=Soul Bound
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd04_1=Simple blade skill, chop towards head to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Enemy's Parry will be broken, and target will take <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, taking continuous damage for a period of time.
fb_Npc_jy_shd05=Borrow the Body to Trick the Soul
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd05_1=Hiding the intent to kill, take the chance to strike your enemy while blocking. Your enemy suffers continuous damage for a while (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
fb_Npc_jy_shd06=Soul Departs in Nine Turns
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd06_1=Dance of Death, a chopping finishing-move that will deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, he will take extra damage.
fb_Npc_jy_shd07=Art of a Thousand Spirits
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd07_1=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
fb_Npc_jy_shd07_sky=Art of a Thousand Spirits
desc_fb_Npc_jy_shd07_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in air, you can fall quickly, repel targets in area. When target has Soul Losing Blade Wound, the wound will be torn apart, or the skill will attach Soul Losing Blade Wound on target.
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf01=Yin and Yang intersect
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf01_1=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf02=Sun and Moon Move as One
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf02_1=Sun is Yang, Moon is Yin, switch and circle, sweep enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf03=Extremes Break the Void
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf03_1=Charging movement, stab twice from both sides to deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf04=Back from Yin and Yang
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf04_1=Raise sword to attack, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, break enemy's parry and reduce movement speed.
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf05=Sword born from Tai Chi
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf05_1=Block move - a successful parry will reduce the attacker's Brawn, and at the same time:<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, will give you one piece of yang chi.<br>When you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, will give you one piece of yin chi.
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf06=One Level within Another
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf06_1=Skill contains sword, sword contains skill, the twin swords attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
fb_Npc_wd_lyjf07=Yin and Yang Aligned
desc_fb_Npc_wd_lyjf07_1=Yin and Yang sword chi attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target, use it in air can bring down target in air, and at the same time:<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yang"</font> state, attacking target in air when you are in air can deal 1.5 times of damage.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin"</font> state, whil attacking target in air when you are in air can increase your rage.
fb_Npc_tm_jsc01=Hidden Dragon
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc01_1=Charge towards the target and attack several times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. If <font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> is activated, the impact force will deal additional Yin damage. <br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_tm_jsc02=Flick One's Tongue
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc02_1=Throw a dart that paralyzes a target and deals {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_tm_jsc03=Following Madness
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc03_1=Gold Snake Mental Skill: Increases movement speed by 30% for 15 seconds.
fb_Npc_tm_jsc04=Swing the Tail
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc04_1=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
fb_Npc_tm_jsc05=Possessed
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc05_1=Block move - a successful parry can convert enemy's force into your own power, attaches yin damage to your attacks.
fb_Npc_tm_jsc06=Swallow the Whale
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc06_1=Dance in the air, striking continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Activate<font color="#FFAE00">"Following Madness"</font> before using this skill to greatly increase your critical strike chance.
fb_Npc_tm_jsc07=Backfire
desc_fb_Npc_tm_jsc07_1=Attack twice, dealing damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}
fb_Npc_jl_fgz01=Poison Hand
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz01_1=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
fb_Npc_jl_fgz02=Blood Frozen in Seven Steps
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz02_1=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_jl_fgz03=Chisel Bone and Smash Marrow
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz03_1=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
fb_Npc_jl_fgz04=Erode Body and Heart
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz04_1=Defense move, use poison to protect heart, when you block successfully, you can make attacker fall into <font color="#FFAE00">Erode Heart</font> state: Deal 2 poison damage per second, last 7 seconds, this effect can stack 5 levels at most.
fb_Npc_jl_fgz05=Penetrating Poison Mist
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz05_1=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
fb_Npc_jl_fgz06=Nail Heart and Pierce Bone
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz06_1=Bone Corrosion Secret Move, throw Poison Bottle and give out poison fog. Enemy in the rang will get continuous damage: if enemy wants to cross the poison fog, he will be stunned.
fb_Npc_jl_fgz07=Carry Bones and Hear Voices
desc_fb_Npc_jl_fgz07_1=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci01=Dark Wind of Nine Hells
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci01_1=Release chi force and activate acupoints, increase 30% your own movement speed, and lose Energy continuously at the same time.<br>The chi force will affect surrounding enemies, making them lose Energy when using flying skill.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci02=Dark Poison Destroys The Wood
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci02_1=Release xuan poison to activate potential to increase power of Sting Skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 3 times at most.<br>Deal 80 external damage to around enemies who get affected by poison gas, this skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci03=Evil Ghosts Fight for Food
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci03_1=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci04=Viper Flicks Tongue
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci04_1=Charging movement, wield sting like snake spits out tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci05=Spirit Leaves the Body
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci05_1=Sting soul and dance like devil, attack enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci06=Shura Rots The Bone
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci06_1=Feint sting target once, release poison force, erode enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking enemy's parry, this skill will make him bleed and lose ability to use Flying Skill for a period of time.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci07=Rampaging Plague
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci07_1=A poisonous ailment explodes in the enemy's body, jolting nearby enemies as well. This maneuver fills you with bloodlust, increasing the power of your Perish Blade by 100%, each stroke drawing rivers of blood. Thereafter, when you execute The Spirit Leaves the Body double sting movement you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Enhanced Endurance</font> state.
fb_Npc_jl_shuangci08=Burrowing Poisonous Insect
desc_fb_Npc_jl_shuangci08_1=Block move - attach insects to your weapon and each parry will drain the enemy's blood.
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf01=Snake Coiled on Green Bamboo
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf01_1=Sweep and stab, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf02=Flying Dragon
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf02_1=Charging movement, swing weapon to attack target, deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will take even more damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf03=Snake in the Mouse Lair
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf03_1=Sweep with power, the chi force will strike enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}, and knock down the targets get affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>.
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf04=Viper's Bite and Bee's Sting
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf04_1=Gather strength into one point, find weakness and attack it, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, then enemy will be knocked down, and be infected with more fierce <font color="#FFAE00">"High Snake Poison"</font>.
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf05=Changshan Moutain Snake
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf05_1=Block move - Each successful parry will ignite your fighting will and dealt 7 points yang damage to your enemy (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf06=Ruthless Long Snake
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf06_1=Move like a snake, and attack continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
fb_Npc_gb_lsbf07=Snake Gliding and Rat Scurrying
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lsbf07_1=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf01=Birds Cry and Apes Wail
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf01_1=Charging move, attack three times, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf02=Wailing At The Dead End
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf02_1=Spit out <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> at enemies in front, reduce their movement speed and hit rate.<br> (Cannot use this skill if you aren't drunk.)
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf03=To Mourn A Dead Mother
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf03_1=Wield staff to attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> onto enemy.
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf04=Cry for the World
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf04_1=Attack the sky and ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you, if the attack breaks a parry, then it will seal the enemy's feet acupoints, causing the enemy to lose massive Energy for 15 seconds when using flying skills. <br>At the same time unleash  <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> on the enemy. (The damage the target takes will increase along with stacking levels of drunk state on yourself).
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf05=Wandering Soul
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf05_1=A block move. If successful you gain a 30% chance to increase your <font color="#FFAE00">Drunken state</font>.
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf06=Fallen Soul's Lament
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf06_1=Strike target like crazy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_gb_ksbf07=Cry Without Tears
desc_fb_Npc_gb_ksbf07_1=Wield staff to attack in air, the chi Force hits target and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If you are in Drunken state, then it will cost one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Drunk"</font> state, blasting the target and tossing him away.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf01=Three Stacks of Falling Plum
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf01_1=Quickly attack from three directions, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf02=Jade of the Autumn Fog
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf02_1=Charging skill, this serious kicking skill will deal {@0:伤害包} to target. A coordinated use of <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_jz_xytf03=Snake Shakes Tail
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf03_1=Jump and turn back to kick, kick away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf04=Ice Dissolves and Leaves Scatter
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf04_1=Feint kick, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, break enemy's parry, and knock him down, deal internal injury: Target's movement speed is reduced and takes continuous damage.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf05=Damage Not a Hair
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf05_1=Block move - a successful parry will strengthen the legs with <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font>, increasing your movement speed, attack power, and power of all leisure kick skills.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf06=Green Shadows of A Maiden
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf06_1=Leisure meaning, lightsome attack, kick target continuously and deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf07=Winter Plum Blooms
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf07_1=Charging movement, gather strength to kick target and deal {@0:伤害包}. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, and jump up to attack target in air, you will greatly increase the chance to double the damage of the skill.<br> (This skill canbe used in conjunction with Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_jz_xytf01_sky=Three Stacks of Falling Plum
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf01_sky_1=Powerful leg skill, attack enemy in front three times to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf02_sky=Jade of the Autumn Fog
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf02_sky_1=A highly effective kicking skill that consecutively strikes enemies twice to deal {@0:伤害包}. When accompanying the Xiaoyao Sect's skills, it is even more effective. This skill can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf03_sky=Snake Shakes Tail
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf03_sky_1=Circle kick enemy in air, deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf04_sky=Ice Dissolves and Leaves Scatter
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf04_sky_1=Fly kick enemy to {@0:伤害包}, if enemy is blocking, he will be beaten down and take internal injury, reduce mvoement speed and take damages over time.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf05_sky=Damage Not a Hair
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf05_sky_1=Defense move of Leisure Kick, each successful parry will activate Leisure Skill to increase movement speed and attack, and also increase power of all skills of Leisure Kick.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf06_sky=Green Shadows of A Maiden
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf06_sky_1=The most powerful move of Leisure Kick, attack enemy continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
fb_Npc_jz_xytf07_sky=Winter Plum Blooms
desc_fb_Npc_jz_xytf07_sky_1=Kick target quickly and continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, if you and target are all in air, the chance to double the damage of the skill will be greatly increased.
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf01=Heart of Blue Water
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf01_1=Turn sword and stab, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf02=Boundless Sea and Sky
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf02_1=Charging movement, raise and stab target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf03=A Drop in the Sea
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf03_1=Boundless Mental Skill will create a Boundless chi area. The team member affected by this chi area will inflict softness damage with their attacks.<br> (This skill will cost 1% of Max Energy per second.)
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf04=Sword Returns to the Summit
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf04_1=Turn back sword and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will damage his merdians and make him lose Energy.
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf05=Turn Weapon Around
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf05_1=Block move, defend against an enemy's attack, and accelerate your Energy recovering speed.
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf07=One Sweep Into Nothingness
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf07_1=Shoot a sword chi, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>Use this skill on the ground can punch target in air away, and deal special internal injury (When gets hit by Boundless Sword skills, target will take extra softness damage).
fb_Npc_jz_wyjf08=Pierce the Sky in Rage
desc_fb_Npc_jz_wyjf08_1=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
fb_Npc_em_yxc01=Passing Clouds
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc01_1=The sting's blade moves like smoke curling upwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
fb_Npc_em_yxc02=The Renegade
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc02_1=A charging movement that breaks through obstacles and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach enemies.
fb_Npc_em_yxc03=Embracing the Wind
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc03_1=Feign an attack, then break the enemy's parry to deal {@0:伤害包} while restoring your own inner force.
fb_Npc_em_yxc04=Immortals Showing the Path
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc04_1=Block move, use softness to dispel an attack and decrease your attacker's stamina.
fb_Npc_em_yxc05=The rosy clouds are slowly rising
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc05_1=Circulate chi as a special form of accupoint skills and help your teammates break up blood clots;<br>When circulating chi, you will obtain Rosy Cloud chi. This will add softness damage to your sting.
fb_Npc_em_yxc06=Meridian Breaking
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc06_1=Wield sting to attack continuously, the special chi force can increase HP recovering speed for yourself and friendly target, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_em_yxc07=Morning Clouds and Evening Rain
desc_fb_Npc_em_yxc07_1=Jump gracefully, then strike at the enemy's ankles while they are airborne to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This reduces their movement speed and disables flying skills.
fb_Npc_em_lbc01=Kindred Death
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc01_1=A seizing motion that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This movement places you in the <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> stance: It raises your Parting Sorrow Sting movement's hit rating and can be stacked.
fb_Npc_em_lbc02=Parting Sorrow
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc02_1=A charging movement with a turning stab, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This adds Rage to your character, the ammount depending on how much your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>is stacked.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_em_lbc03=Loathesome Clouds And Rain
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc03_1=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
fb_Npc_em_lbc04=Shadow and Spirit Depart
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc04_1=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
fb_Npc_em_lbc05=Far and Removed
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc05_1=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point.
fb_Npc_em_lbc06=Departed Kin
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc06_1=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
fb_Npc_em_lbc07=Transcend the Worldly
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc07_1=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
fb_Npc_em_lbc08=Death Do Us Part
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc08_1=No joy in life and don't fear of death. Anger motivates the potential: increase much movement speed, Move power and defense, lasting for 10 seconds.
fb_Npc_em_lbc03_sky=Loathesome Clouds And Rain
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc03_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies in that vicinity to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this move becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this movement becomes uninterruptible.
fb_Npc_em_lbc06_sky=Departed Kin
desc_fb_Npc_em_lbc06_sky_1=A rapid charge attack from above, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets on the ground. If the targe is in the Loathesome Clouds and Rain state, extra damage is added and the enemy is knocked away. The more one's own Parting Sorrow stacks, the more damage is done.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf01=Clear Sound and Gentle Rhythm
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf01_1=Attack with ease, the fierce chi of the sword sweeps enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and make him take extra damage when using flying skill.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf02=Turbulent Rapids
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf02_1=Gather chi movement, wave sword chi to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi to knock them down.<br>This skill can be released instantly in the air, and there is a chance to knock down target. The chance will increase along with <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze"</font> level amount on your body.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf03=Pure Spring Flows Forth
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf03_1=Continuous sword chi gather into a line, heavily strike enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi, the remaining force can cause target to be unable to block in 3 seconds.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf04=Blow Away in the Clear Wind
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf04_1=Stab once, the sharp sword chi deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, he will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi and knocked down.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf05=Pure Awakening
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf05_1=Block move - purge spirit, each successful parry will strengthen your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi exists, Turbulent Rapids will cast for less time, and Noble Influence will deal more damage.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf06=A Chance Meeting
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf06_1=Stunt of Breeze Sword, the sharp sword Chi attacks around enemies to deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> Qi, will take more damage. <br>It's better to use the skill in air.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf07=A Gentle Breeze Blows
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf07_1=Charging skill, wield sword and attack several times, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is unable to block, will take extra damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf02_sky=Turbulent Rapids
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf02_sky_1=Breeze Sword Chi attacks target's mind, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, if target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, then target cannot move or use skills.
fb_Npc_wd_qfjf06_sky=A Chance Meeting
desc_fb_Npc_wd_qfjf06_sky_1=Breeze helps to reinforce Sword Qi, attack continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}. If target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, will take more damage.
fb_Npc_born_mscz01=Black Tiger Pluck Out the Heart
desc_fb_Npc_born_mscz01_1=If your target does not parry against this attack, the target will be stunned.
fb_Npc_born_mscz02=The Dangerous
desc_fb_Npc_born_mscz02_1=Deal damage to selected target. Meanwhile, beat the target back for 3 meters if the target doesn't parry.
fb_Npc_born_mscz03=Poison hand and erode bone
desc_fb_Npc_born_mscz03_1=Deal damage to selected target. Meanwhile, knock the target down if the target doesn't parry.
fb_Npc_jl_zfd01=Cut Down the Hua Mountain
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd01_1=Mighty blow, the blade chi will hurt enemy meters away, and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, target will take extra yang damage.
fb_Npc_jl_zfd02=Fast Blades Shred the Grass
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd02_1=Charging movement, roll and attack target to deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is taking <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, will take extra yang damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_jl_zfd03=Dragon Carries the Wind
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd03_1=Chop continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The enemy will take <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
fb_Npc_jl_zfd04=Cut in Half
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd04_1=Merciless attack, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The enemy tries to block will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
fb_Npc_jl_zfd05=moon chasing
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd05_1=Block move - a successful parry will activate potential, attach hardness damage on your attack.
fb_Npc_jl_zfd06=Unavoidable Storm
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd06_1=Blood rain and blade wind will come like a storm, attack enemies while moving, deal {@0:伤害包}, and make them suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>.
fb_Npc_jl_zfd07=Lightning Speed Strike
desc_fb_Npc_jl_zfd07_1=Chase Wind on the Ground: The blade is like wind, attack and punch away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, when target suffers <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, target will take extra hardness damage.<br/>Chase Lightning in Air: chi force is like lightning, attack selected area to deal {@0:伤害包}, and at the same time the enemies suffering <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> will be unable to use skills, and take extra hardness damage.
