jn_tgfb02_054=West Cuts Green Feather
desc_jn_tgfb02_054_1=2 seconds to cast. Targets within 4 meters take damage and are slowed by 50% for 5 seconds. Afterwards, they lose consciousness for another 4 seconds.
jn_tgfb02_055=The Silver Bottle is Suddenly Broken
desc_jn_tgfb02_055_1=Instantly attack all targets within a 4-meter radius range, dealing physical damage and damage to their Energy.
