desc_jn_tg01_051_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range.
desc_jn_tg01_052_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range.
desc_jn_tg02_051_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range, dealing Internal Attack Damage and reducing target's External Attack Damage by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_jn_tg03_031_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range.
desc_jn_tg03_032_1=Instantly attack targets within 5 meters. Targets receive physical damage, and their External Attack Damage is reduced by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_jn_tg04_071_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range. Target receives physical damage.
desc_jn_tg04_072_1=2 seconds to cast. Targets within 4 meters take damage and are slowed by 50% for 12 seconds.
desc_jn_tg07_021_1=Instantly attack targets within 4 meters, clearing all player buffs, reducing target's External Attack Damage and Accuracy by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_jn_tg07_022_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range. Target receives physical damage.
desc_jn_tg07_024_1=Prepare two seconds and add a state to yourself to immunize external skill damage 50% (other damages exclusive). It lasts fifteen seconds.
desc_clone015_fanli_02_1=Targets suffer continuous Soft Damage in a 5m-radius area of effect. External skill attack is increased by 30%. Effect lasts 10 seconds. In Normal Mode, damage is 100 and 2% Max HP is restored every 2 seconds. In Hard Mode, damage is 150 and 3% Max HP is restored every 2 seconds. In Hell Mode, damage is 200 and 4% Max HP is restored every 2 seconds.
desc_clone015_fanli_04_1=Targets around you take damage, and are knocked down if they fail to parry.
desc_clone015_fanli_06_1=Throw your targets in two directions. Affected targets cannot use Flying Skills. This effect lasts 6 seconds in Normal Mode, 8 seconds in Hard Mode, and 10 seconds in Hell Mode.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_01_1=Kick the target in front of you, pushing it away and causing damage.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_02_1=Increase your chance to dodge by 100%.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_03_1=Deal damage to targets within 6 meters, and gain the "Drunk Step" effect for 5 seconds: The affected will receive damage and be dazed by 5 seconds if the affected moves.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_04_1=Increase your attack power by 100%. Cooldown is 20 seconds.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_05_1=Deal damage in a 6m x 20m rectangular area in front of you. You can deal damage against up to 4 targets in Normal Mode, 6 targets in Hard Mode, and 12 targets in Hell mode.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_06_1=Deal damage to targets behind you, while negating all damage you receive from behind. Effect lasts 20 seconds.
desc_clone015_wanzuimeng_07_1=Increase your defense by 100%. Cooldown is 20 seconds.
desc_clone015_zhugeyao_02_1=Poison a random target for 5 seconds. Target receives 100 damage per second in Normal Mode, 150 damage in Hard Mode, and 200 damage in Hell Mode. The poison will infect other players within a 2-meter radius.
desc_clone015_zhugeyao_03_1=Inflict damage to targets in front of you, knocking them down.
desc_clone015_zhugeyao_04_1=Inflict damage to targets within 8 meters in a 120-degree arc. Targets both in mid-air and on the ground are affected.
desc_clone015_zhugeyao_05_1=Targets within a 30-meter area of effect receive little damage, but have "Low Morale"; their Stamina is reduced by half. Cooldown for this skill is 5 seconds in Normal Mode, 10 seconds in Hard Mode and 15 seconds in Hell Mode.
desc_clone015_zhugeyao_06_1=Create a protective screen of sound with your weapon for 10 seconds. Targets within the screen will bleed, losing HP repeatedly.
clone015_shenxiaolan_01=Flying Flowers and Falling Leaves
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_01_1=Deal damage to targets within five meters. Mid-air targets will be thrown to the ground, slowed, and unable to use Flying Skills for a period of time.
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_02_1=Summon an NPC within 10 meters to heal you for 10 seconds. You will recover 1% Max HP every 2 seconds in Normal Mode, 2% in Hard Mode, and 3% in Hell Mode.
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_03_1=Move to the front of the target, knocking it down.
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_04_1=Inflict continuous damage in an area of effect around the target.
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_05_1=Inflict damage to surrounding targets silence all who fail to parry for 6 seconds.
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_06_1=Inflict damage to targets within 8 meters. Targets who fail to parry will be be knocked back by a second attack.
desc_clone015_shenxiaolan_07_1=Inflict damage in surrounding targets.
clone015_zhugeqingtian_01=Fire and Ice
desc_clone015_zhugeqingtian_01_1=Attach "Ice" state to a target, causing damage and and decreasing movement speed. Attach "Fire" state to another target in the surrounding area with effect. The states of "Ice" and "Fire" will be removed when two targets come near each other within a time period, or else both will suffer massive damage.
desc_clone015_zhugeqingtian_03_1=Execute 2 consecutive attacks. First attack prevents target from using Flying Skills and knocks down any mid-air target. Second attack damages targets on the ground and knocks them back.
desc_clone015_zhugeqingtian_05_1=Deal damage against a target within 6 meters. The attack will rebound, striking another target within 5 meters. The attack rebounds at most 3 times.
desc_clone015_zhugeqingtian_06_1=Create a protective screen of sound with your weapon for 16 seconds. Your targets within the screen will lose HP repeatedly.
desc_clone015_zhugeqingtian_07_1=Inflict massive damage to targets within 20 meters. Targets in mid-air will fall to the ground.
desc_clone015_yeqianniang_02_1=Summon an NPC within 20 meters for 2 seconds. The NPC will paraylze targets within 2 meters.
desc_clone015_yeqianniang_05_1=Inflict damage within a 20-meter area of effect for 10 seconds. Targets bleed, losing 1% Max HP per second.
desc_clone015_yeqianniang_06_1=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font>  between your targets. Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. At most, this echo continues for 5 rounds.
desc_clone015_qiaoyunhe_01_1=This skill will add "Confusion" to targets within 10 meters for 6 seconds. During this time, target's key assignment will be randomized. Afterwards, targets will lose up to 10% of their HP if they do not have "Pierce the Sky in Rage" skill.
desc_clone015_qiaoyunhe_02_1=Deal damage against target in front of you, and raise one of the three following shields. The Invulnerability Shield negates 20% damage in Normal Mode, 40% in Hard Mode, and 60% in Hell Mode. The Reflection Shield reflects 20% of damage back to the target in Normal Mode, 40% in Hard Mode, and 60% in Hell Mode. The Explosive Shield will inflict an AOE damage after a given period of time.
desc_clone015_qiaoyunhe_03_1=Deal damage and repel targets within 5 meters. When targets are hit, they cannot use Flying Skills for 10 seconds.
clone015_qiaoyunhe_05=Chi of Five Cattles
desc_clone015_qiaoyunhe_05_1=This buff negates 20% damage for 6 seconds in Normal Mode, 8 seconds in Hard Mode and 10 seconds in Hell Mode. During this time, there is 5% chance of instantly defeating the target when receiving attacks. Afterwards, targets within 5 meters are knocked down.
desc_clone015_qiaoyunhe_06_1=Inflict damage to targets within 10 meters. Affected targets cannot use Flying Skills for 5 seconds.
desc_clone015_qiaoyunhe_07_1=It takes 10 seconds to execute the "Southern Snow" skill around your target, and another 1 second to trigger the area of effect. Targets will be paralyzed and bleed for 5 seconds, losing 10% HP per second.
desc_clone015_gebufan_01_1=Inflict damage three times to targets within 6 meters in a 120-degree arc.
clone015_gebufan_02=Winter Plum Blooms
desc_clone015_gebufan_02_1=Inflict continuous damage in a 4m-radius area of effect around your target.
desc_clone015_haidaotouzi_03_1=Sacrifice 5% of your current HP to inflict massive damage against one target.
