desc_clone015_qianguanyun_04_1=Gain the "Internal Energy Defense" effect, granting you 100% protection against damage for 5 seconds. All Energy will be drained after the effect and you cannot attack for 5 seconds.
clone015_qianguanyun_05=Winter Plum Blooms
desc_clone015_qianguanyun_05_1=Inflict continuous damage in a 3m-radius area of effect around your target.
desc_clone015_qianguanyun_06_1=Inflict damage in a 10m area of effect around yourself. Targets will be knocked back if they failed to parry the attack. When a target is hit, your attack and movement speed will increase by 30%. This effect lasts 10 seconds.
