desc_jn_tg02_054_1=2 seconds to cast. Targets within 4 meters take damage and are slowed by 50% for 5 seconds. Afterwards, they lose consciousness for another 4 seconds.
desc_jn_tg02_055_1=Instantly attack all targets within a 4-meter radius range, dealing physical damage and damage to their Energy.
desc_jn_tg29_061_1=Inflict damage to a target in melee range. 5 seconds cooldown.
desc_jn_tg29_062_1=2 seconds to cast. This skill grants a buff, increasing Attack Power by 50% but decreasing Accuracy and Defense by 20%. This skill cannot be interrupted.
desc_jn_tg29_063_1=1 second to cast. The attack inflicts medium damage and knock back all targets within a 3-meter radius range, reducing their Accuracy by 80% for 6 seconds. The debuff inflicted upon the enemy cannot be removed. 40 seconds cooldown.
