desc_jn_tg27_051_1=3 seconds to cast, immune to all damage while casting. Decreases the caster's Defense and Evasion by 80% for 6 seconds, dealing medium damage to all enemies within a 10-meter radius. Additionally, there is a 40% chance to inflict a damage buff upon the enemy, causing them to lose 2% Max HP and Max Energy each second for 6 seconds. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_jn_tg27_052_1=1 second to cast, dealing damage to enemy in a melee range and inflict a debuff. Enemy affected with the debuff loses 5% Max HP each second for 5 seconds and is slowed by 50% for 10 seconds. This debuff cannot be removed.
desc_jn_tg27_053_1=2 seconds to cast, increasing Movement Speed and Evasion by 60% for 10 seconds. Afterwards, negate damage received by 100% for 6 seconds. 40 seconds cooldown.
desc_jn_tg27_054_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range. Target receives External Attack Damage.
desc_jn_tg27_055_1=Instantly attack a target in melee range.
