desc_jn_tg28_053_1=Instantly inflict physical damage to a single target.
desc_jn_tg28_054_1=2 seconds to cast, inflicting damage and debuffs to all targets within a 5-meter radius range. Affected target's External Attack Damage and Movement Speed is reduced by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_jn_tg28_055_1=2 seconds to cast, summoning 3 minions to join the battle.
