desc_CS_single_jinqb_1=Consume <font color="#FFAE00">10 liang</font> silver coins, throw them as hidden weapons, inflict {@0:伤害包} to the target;<br>Can make target <font color="#FFAE00">dazzle</font>: Reduce speed by 90%.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
