desc_CS_single_qiankyz_1=Throw silver coin to decide the future, throw <font color="#FFAE00">10 liang</font> silver coins, make {@0:伤害包} to the target in front 20 meter fan-shaped range.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
desc_CS_single_qiankyz_2=Throw silver coin to decide the future, throw <font color="#FFAE00">40 liang</font> silver coins, make {@0:伤害包} to the target in front 20 meter fan-shaped range.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
desc_CS_single_qiankyz_3=Throw silver coin to decide the future, throw <font color="#FFAE00">70 liang</font> silver coins, make {@0:伤害包} to the target in front 20 meter fan-shaped range.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
desc_CS_single_qiankyz_4=Throw silver coin to decide the future, throw <font color="#FFAE00">100 liang</font> silver coins, make {@0:伤害包} to the target in front 20 meter fan-shaped range.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
desc_CS_single_qiankyz_5=Throw silver coin to decide the future, throw <font color="#FFAE00">125 liang</font> silver coins, make {@0:伤害包} to the target in front 20 meter fan-shaped range.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
desc_CS_single_qiankyz_6=Throw silver coin to decide the future, throw <font color="#FFAE00">150 liang</font> silver coins, make {@0:伤害包} to the target in front 20 meter fan-shaped range.<br>(Consumption of silver coin <font color="#FFAE00">occupies</font> up of daily use, when daily silver coins are not enough, if related deduction button is selected, then <font color="#FFAE00">consume all the silvers</font>).
desc_CS_tm_ywt05_1=The Move of Ecstasy. Cause {@0:伤害包} to the target. Break Defense successfully and then Poison Gas invaded, which made the target <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font>(The effect is like Dizziness.) Last 3 seconds.<br>Being attacked will interrupt the state of <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font>.
desc_CS_tm_ywt06_1=Hell King Secret Skill. Throw <font color="#FFAE00">Kerosene Trap</font>. Affecting within a radius of 5 meters and have a special effect:<br>paralyze the first target into the Trap for 2 seconds and attach Damage;<br>in the Trap enemies decrease the speed continuously by 20 percent (the continuous effect will not be superposed);<br>enemies will be added <font color="#FFAE00">"Ghost"</font> state in the Trap, superpose 1 level every second, 20 levels at the most.<br>(Existing 30 seconds after setting the Trap; effect will last 30 seconds after triggering the Trap.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt07_1=The rains turn to shooting stars. Shoot at the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, making him rigid.<br>(This movement can be executed while moving.)
desc_CS_tm_ywt04_1=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered.
