desc_bossxl_xinmo_007_1=Jump into the center of the area while your Rage increases, HP is sacrificed, and Heartbeat is 1 per second. As you cause continuous damage, your Heartbeat increases to 2.5 per second.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh01_1=Your sword's chi sweeps enemies in front of you to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After the strike your <font color="#FFAE00">Hero's Tears</font> chi becomes focused. If you continuously use this move your chi will become explosive, preventing the enemy from using flying skills.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh01_2=Your sword's chi sweeps enemies in front of you to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After the strike your <font color="#FFAE00">Hero's Tears</font> chi becomes focused. If you continuously use this move your chi will become explosive, preventing the enemy from using flying skills.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh01_3=Your sword's chi sweeps enemies in front of you to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After the strike your <font color="#FFAE00">Hero's Tears</font> chi becomes focused. If you continuously use this move your chi will become explosive, preventing the enemy from using flying skills.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh02_1=A charging movement. A leisurely uppercut that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This destabilizes the enemy's lower body knocks him into the air.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh02_2=A charging movement. A leisurely uppercut that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This destabilizes the enemy's lower body knocks him into the air.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh02_3=A charging movement. A leisurely uppercut that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This destabilizes the enemy's lower body knocks him into the air.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh03_1=Brilliant sword chi pushed the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When you use this move to break an enemy's block, it destabilizes the enemy's lower body, barring him from using flying skills.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh03_2=Brilliant sword chi pushed the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When you use this move to break an enemy's block, it destabilizes the enemy's lower body, barring him from using flying skills.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh03_3=Brilliant sword chi pushed the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When you use this move to break an enemy's block, it destabilizes the enemy's lower body, barring him from using flying skills.
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh05_1=A charging movement that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When executed on the ground, this movement can strike down airborne targets and numb their legs, reducing movement speed and barring their flying skills.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh05_2=A charging movement that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When executed on the ground, this movement can strike down airborne targets and numb their legs, reducing movement speed and barring their flying skills.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
