desc_Npc_jz_lyfh05_4=A charging movement that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>When executed on the ground, this movement can strike down airborne targets and numb their legs, reducing movement speed and barring their flying skills.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jz_lyfh07_1=The wind swirls and dances, and attack surrounding enemies while moving to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. If the enemies' legs are numbed they will receive extra damage.<br>(Once this movement has been executed it cannot be interrupted.)
