desc_CS_em_ynjf01_1=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to targets in front of you.<br>Charge up the attack to increase damage, when full charged: unable to be stagger by enemy attacks when using the skill and knock back the the enemy in front.
desc_CS_jy_xsd05_1=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.<br>If you break your target's parry, you inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Red Dust"</font> to enemy, whose attack power is greatly reduced and can only be recovered slowly.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_1=Blood Killing. Like eating raw meat and drinking blood. Kick over the Target, kill with a Dagger, and cause {@0:伤害包}.<br>Drink the enemies' blood at the same time to heal its own Wounds. Blood Drinking effect is 20 percent. (Attacking will be parried and having no effect of Blood Drinking.)
