desc_CS_sl_lhq06_5=Remove your debuffs with this skill. <br>While under the <font color="#FFAE00">"Divert"</font> effect, your attack power is increased.<br>While under the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, your defense is increased.
