desc_CS_jh_qbgf02_1=This charging staff attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> state, your charging distance and speed will increase. (Use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
