CS_jh_qbgf03=Faked Death
desc_CS_jh_qbgf03_1=Your staff does {@0:伤害包} damage to all targets in front of you. <br>Upon breaking target's parry, inflict<font color="#FFAE00"> Despair</font> onto target, who falls to the ground when he uses a Flying Skill. This effect lasts 4 seconds.
