CS_jh_qbgf04=Undefeatable
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_1=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 6 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 11 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_2=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 8 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 15 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_3=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 9 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 19 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_4=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 11 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 22 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_5=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 14 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 27 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_6=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
CS_jh_qbgf05=Arrows of Lies
