desc_CS_jh_qbgf05_5=Throw your staff like a boomerang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br> Targets both on the ground and in the air are knocked back.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ask for Defeat"</font> effect, this skill cannot be parried by your target.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf05_6=Throw your staff like a boomerang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br> Targets both on the ground and in the air are knocked back.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ask for Defeat"</font> effect, this skill cannot be parried by your target.
CS_jh_qbgf06=Devil's Mirror
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 50% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 60% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_3=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 70% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_4=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 80% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_5=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 90% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_6=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 99% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
CS_jh_qbgf07=Feigned Defeat
desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_1=Charge towards target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> effect, charging distance and speed are increased.<br>(Use this skill with a Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_2=Charge towards target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> effect, charging distance and speed are increased.<br>(Use this skill with a Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_3=Charge towards target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> effect, charging distance and speed are increased.<br>(Use this skill with a Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_4=Charge towards target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> effect, charging distance and speed are increased.<br>(Use this skill with a Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_5=Charge towards target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> effect, charging distance and speed are increased.<br>(Use this skill with a Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_6=Charge towards target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>With the <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated"</font> effect, charging distance and speed are increased.<br>(Use this skill with a Flying Skill to approach target.)
CS_jh_qbgf08=God of Lies
desc_CS_jh_qbgf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>If the target is a human player, inflict additional damage equals to 2% of the target's current HP.<br>You can move while using the skill.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf08_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>If the target is a human player, inflict additional damage equals to 2% of the target's current HP.<br>You can move while using the skill.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf08_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>If the target is a human player, inflict additional damage equals to 2% of the target's current HP.<br>You can move while using the skill.
