CS_jh_ttg01=Head of Acolyte
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_1=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 3 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_2=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 4 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_3=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 5 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_4=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 6 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_5=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 7 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_6=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 8 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
CS_jh_ttg07=Head of Buddha
desc_CS_jh_ttg07_1=Strike your target repeatedly with your head to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_ttg07_2=Strike your target repeatedly with your head to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
