CS_jh_ttg03=Head of Golem
desc_CS_jh_ttg03_1=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
desc_CS_jh_ttg03_2=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
desc_CS_jh_ttg03_3=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
