desc_CS_jh_ttg03_5=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
desc_CS_jh_ttg03_6=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
CS_jh_ttg04=Head of Steel
CS_jh_ttg05=Head of Dharma
desc_CS_jh_ttg05_1=Strike the ground with your head, inflicting {@0:伤害包} in an area of effect. <br>Targets will be knocked down and pulled towards you.
desc_CS_jh_ttg05_2=Strike the ground with your head, inflicting {@0:伤害包} in an area of effect. <br>Targets will be knocked down and pulled towards you.
desc_CS_jh_ttg05_3=Strike the ground with your head, inflicting {@0:伤害包} in an area of effect. <br>Targets will be knocked down and pulled towards you.
desc_CS_jh_ttg05_4=Strike the ground with your head, inflicting {@0:伤害包} in an area of effect. <br>Targets will be knocked down and pulled towards you.
