CS_jh_ttg06=Head of Arhat
CS_jh_ttg02=Head of Fire
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_1=Headbutt a target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>You can charge up this skill for 2 seconds before release; the longer you charge up, the more damage you inflict. Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> while using this skill at full-charge, which makes you immune to parries and knock-backs.<br>(The maximum charging distance is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_2=Headbutt a target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>You can charge up this skill for 2 seconds before release; the longer you charge up, the more damage you inflict. Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> while using this skill at full-charge, which makes you immune to parries and knock-backs.<br>(The maximum charging distance is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_3=Headbutt a target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>You can charge up this skill for 2 seconds before release; the longer you charge up, the more damage you inflict. Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> while using this skill at full-charge, which makes you immune to parries and knock-backs.<br>(The maximum charging distance is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_4=Headbutt a target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>You can charge up this skill for 2 seconds before release; the longer you charge up, the more damage you inflict. Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> while using this skill at full-charge, which makes you immune to parries and knock-backs.<br>(The maximum charging distance is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_5=Headbutt a target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>You can charge up this skill for 2 seconds before release; the longer you charge up, the more damage you inflict. Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> while using this skill at full-charge, which makes you immune to parries and knock-backs.<br>(The maximum charging distance is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_6=Headbutt a target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>You can charge up this skill for 2 seconds before release; the longer you charge up, the more damage you inflict. Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> while using this skill at full-charge, which makes you immune to parries and knock-backs.<br>(The maximum charging distance is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_dgjj01_1=This skill deals {@0:伤害包} damage, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Weakness</font> for 3 seconds: Receives additional damage when using skills and refresh the effect period.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when are locked down, or when recovering from damage.
desc_CS_jh_dgjj02_1=Knock enemies back, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage. If target is wielding a sword, the target will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Sword"</font> condition for 5 seconds, during which the target cannot use sword skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when your are locked down by a sword skill.
desc_CS_jh_dgjj03_1=Repel targets in front of you, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage. If target is wielding a blade, the target will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Blade"</font> condition for 5 seconds, during which the target cannot use blade skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when you are locked down by a blade skill.
desc_CS_jh_dgjj04_1=Stun targets in front of you, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage. If target is wielding a staff, the target gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Lance"</font> condition for 5 seconds, during which the target cannot use staff skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when you are locked down by a staff skill to deal massive damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">(This skill can only be used with the Heaven Sword.)</font>
desc_CS_jh_dgjj05_1=Stop your targets from using Flying Skills, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage. If target is wielding dagger type weapons, the target will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Whip"</font> condition for 5 seconds, during which the target cannot use dagger skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when you are locked down by a dagger skill.
desc_CS_jh_dgjj06_1=Stop your targets from using Flying Skills, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage. If target is wielding a Flying Claw, the target will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Chain"</font> condition for 5 seconds, during which he cannot use Flying Claw skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when you are locked down by a Flying Claw skill.
desc_CS_jh_dgjj07_1=Knock down targets around you, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage. If target is attacking unarmed, the target will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Arm"</font> condition for 5 seconds, during which the target cannot use empty-hand attack skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Full Swing</font>: You can still use this skill when you are locked down by an empty-hand attack to deal massive damage.<br><font color="#FF3030">(This skill can only be used with Heaven Sword.)</font>
desc_CS_jh_dgjj08_1=Become <font color="#FFAE00">Unbreakable</font>: You are immune to Hidden Weapon attacks, and any damage you would receive is reflected to the attacker.
desc_CS_jh_dgjj09_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When your target's parry is breached, both the target's buffs and your own debuffs are removed. <br><font color="#FF3030">(This skill can only be used with Heaven Sword.)</font>
