CS_jh_flxmz01=Shifting Storm
desc_CS_jh_flxmz01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font>, receiving more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Uplifting Wind"</font>. This condition can be stacked 8 times.
