CS_jh_flxmz04=Scene Stealer
desc_CS_jh_flxmz04_1=Attack with your staff, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front of you.<br>When the target's parry is broken by the attack, the target's recovery time increases by 1 second and unable to parry for an additional 0.5 second.
desc_CS_jh_flxmz04_2=Attack with your staff, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front of you.<br>When the target's parry is broken by the attack, the target's recovery time increases by 1 second and unable to parry for an additional 1 second.
