CS_jh_ncd03=Dagger Cloaked in Yellow
desc_CS_jh_ncd03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br>You can move freely while using this skill, as well as gaining the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> effect.
