CS_jh_ncd06=Dagger Cloaked in Red
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs small amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs some amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_3=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs partial amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_4=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs large amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_5=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs great amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_6=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs massive amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
