CS_jh_ncd05_hide_01=Dagger of Swift Defense
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_hide_01_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_hide_01_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>(This defensive skill is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by a feint attack.)
