clone005_zs_bz=Casting Breath Chop
desc_clone005_zs_bz_1=Move behind one target, and cause damage to one ground target. Causes 100 continued HP back damage effect on target, which continuously bleeds for 5 seconds. If the target is in the air, then only minor damage is caused with no back damage effect.
clone005_zs_ydjk=Tacit Blade
desc_clone005_zs_ydjk_1=Stick the blade into the ground and cause damage to surrounding targets in a 6 meter radius. Knock targets that do not parry flying
clone005_zs_lzzh=Slash Across River
desc_clone005_zs_lzzh_1=Cause damage to targets within 8 meter arc. If target has back damage, then causes damage to target one extra time.
clone005_zs_nzqg=Eliminate Thousand Forces
desc_clone005_zs_nzqg_1=Cause nine-ring explosion effect to target in front. Continuously cause damage to target in front. The first strike on targets will stun them.
clone005_zs_ygwz=Thousand League Silver Light
desc_clone005_zs_ygwz_1=During preparation, forbids flying skills of targets within range. Causes continuous damage to ground targets. After finished using skill, gives you added power exhaustion effect, so they cannot attack for 5 seconds.
