desc_clone005_zs_pg_1=<s>
clone005_zz_fmszh=Lion Roars at Buddha's Gate
desc_clone005_zz_fmszh_1=Roar causes damage to surrounding targets and adds after-shock effect to targets, so their hit rate drops 20% for 10 seconds.
clone005_zz_nphs=Buddha Fist Lotus Strike
desc_clone005_zz_nphs_1=Move behind one target and give a fierce attack on the ground, continuously causing damage and knocking them down. The first hit of the target causes all surrounding players to be stunned.
clone005_zz_tycx=Shadow Legs to the Clouds
desc_clone005_zz_tycx_1=Cause damage in a forward arc. The last attack knocks targets that do not parry flying (no shadow leg special effect).
clone005_zz_bjztz=Tower of the Venerable One
desc_clone005_zz_bjztz_1=Octagonal tower array, calls four tower Guardians, difficulty level 6, hell mode 8.
clone005_zz_qsfy=Thousand Hand Buddha Seal
desc_clone005_zz_qsfy_1=Randomly create and conceal multiple NPCs in the surrounding area, bundled with damage effect in a 2 meter radius (special effect uses large palm downward explosion).
clone005_zz_01=Buddha's Halo Shines Bright
desc_clone005_zz_01_1=<s>
clone005_zz_xuzhao=Feint Step Intercepts Elbow
desc_clone005_zz_xuzhao_1=Cause a small amount of damage to surrounding targets and knock them down to the ground. If the target parries, then the refresh is longer when they fall to the ground.
clone005_zz_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone005_zz_pg_1=<s>
clone005_stzx_tdr=Backfire
desc_clone005_stzx_tdr_1=Cause damage to one target and add poison effect, with continuous bleeding and loss of energy.
clone005_stzx_mlmj=Dazed and Blinded
desc_clone005_stzx_mlmj_1=Cause damage with white powder (mist entity) in an arc. Add blind dazed effect to target. Press button to cause disorder, with 20% reduction in defense.
clone005_stzx_yyxh=Moving Moon and Stars
clone005_stzx_qbwj=Thousand Dart Annihilation
desc_clone005_stzx_qbwj_1=Launch poison darts with Bone Softening Powder at surrounding targets. Hitting the target adds bone softening paralysis effect. Movement speed and attack speed drops 50% for 20 seconds.
clone005_stzx_lspfz=Evil Darkness Breaking Array
desc_clone005_stzx_lspfz_1=Call four thieves. Call 6 in hard mode, call 8 in hell mode.
clone005_stzx_tj=Swallow the Whale
desc_clone005_stzx_tj_1=Move to the side of one target and cause damage multiple times.
clone005_stzx_01=The Sun Breaks the Sky
desc_clone005_stzx_01_1=<s>
clone005_stzx_xuzhao=Chase Wind and Eat Soul
desc_clone005_stzx_xuzhao_1=Cause a small amount of damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then the target gets extra 20% dark damage for 15 seconds.
clone005_stzx_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone005_stzx_pg_1=<s>
clone005_mwgs_dx=Call Your Bluff
desc_clone005_mwgs_dx_1=Cause damage to target in front and add "Feint" to targets that do not parry. Movement speed decreases.
clone005_mwgs_dlfq=The Circle of the Great Buddha
desc_clone005_mwgs_dlfq_1=Pull nearby targets to you. Vertically knock target flying accompanied by your own jump to cause damage to target. Give target added 20% defense decrease effect for 8 seconds.
clone005_mwgs_lxpk=Dragon Elephant Breaks the Void
desc_clone005_mwgs_lxpk_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets. Give targets added great elephant energy effect, with attack decreasing by 10%. With parry, there is extra exhaustion of energy, continuing for 20 seconds. If the target has defense decrease effect, then cause additional damage to target.
clone005_mwgs_hlcs=Fire Dragon Pierces the Mountain
desc_clone005_mwgs_hlcs_1=Use this two-handed fire attack to cause continuous damage to a target and continuously knock them back (hitting target adds a flaming effect). If the target has dragon elephant inner power effect, then it receives extra hard damage (beating-back move frame appears).
clone005_mwgs_fdsh=Buddha Shifts Mountain
desc_clone005_mwgs_fdsh_1=Two-handed cross combination forbids target from using flying skills, while charging for 3 seconds. During charge, it forbids targets in a 10 meter radius from using flying skills. Hitting target causes continuous damage.
clone005_mwgs_01=One Finger of Zen Meditation
desc_clone005_mwgs_01_1=<s>
clone005_mwgs_xuzhao=Legs of the Buddha's Guardian
desc_clone005_mwgs_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then the dragon elephant inner power effect is added to the target.
clone005_mwgs_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone005_mwgs_pg_1=<s>
clone005_qk_brbx=Cold Blade Icy Heart
desc_clone005_qk_brbx_1=Cause damage to one target and add chopping damage effect for continuous bleeding.
clone005_qk_lmj=Annihilating Fracture Strike
desc_clone005_qk_lmj_1=Cause damage to target in front and knocks them flying. Adds stun effect for 4 seconds.
clone005_qk_rdhy=Man and Blade as One
desc_clone005_qk_rdhy_1=During preparation, makes you enter state of being one with the blade. When attacked, it records the attack times. After preparation is finished, the damage amount is decided by the number of attack times recorded. The more attacks there are, the greater the damage. When there are 6 or fewer attacks, there is minor damage. When there are 7 to 12 attacks, there is a moderate amount of damage. When there are more than 12 attacks, there is major damage.
clone005_qk_jkx=Ultimate Crazy Evil
desc_clone005_qk_jkx_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock them back. If the target has chopping damage effect, then it causes damage one extra time.
clone005_qk_sfjm=The Vanquisher
desc_clone005_qk_sfjm_1=During preparation, all surrounding targets are forbidden to use flying skills for 10 seconds. After preparation is over, it causes great damage to surrounding ground targets, and their skills are sealed for 6 seconds.
clone005_qk_01=Irresistible Talent
desc_clone005_qk_01_1=<s>
clone005_qk_xuzhao=Blade Cuts Emotions
desc_clone005_qk_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then give yourself increase of attack speed and movement speed by 50% for 20 seconds.
clone005_qk_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone005_qk_pg_1=<s>
clone005_fr_cbtx=Fleeing Steps Steal the Heart
desc_clone005_fr_cbtx_1=Cause damage to one target.
clone005_fr_lbph=Flower-Stirring Step
desc_clone005_fr_lbph_1=Cause continuous damage to targets in front.
clone005_fr_fzjc=Unbending Grass in Wind
desc_clone005_fr_fzjc_1=Cause damage to targets in front and knock them flying. After skill finishes, create hidden NPC for target, and bind fallen palm special effect. Causes damage to surrounding targets and seal their skills (those that are knocked down and get up in the same place will be damaged in this way, but those that get up quickly can evade it.)
clone005_fr_nfjs=Angry Buddha Arrives from Above
desc_clone005_fr_nfjs_1=After preparing the skill, continuously yell in anger at the surrounding area and raise your arm strength by 20 points. Hitting targets damages them.
clone005_fr_nhxt=Angry Sea Howling Sky
desc_clone005_fr_nhxt_1=Continuously attack above you as the camera shakes, with a large amount of rocks falling down. Causes large amount of damage to surrounding targets. Add bone breaking effect to targets. They continuously suffer damage when they try to move.
clone005_fr_01=Thunder Sweep
desc_clone005_fr_01_1=<s>
clone005_fr_xuzhao=Cut the Gold and Sever the Jade
desc_clone005_fr_xuzhao_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets. If target parries, then you add extra hard damage to attack for 20 seconds.
clone005_fr_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone005_fr_pg_1=<s>
clone005_zzhen_fhtf=Hidden Tiger Hears the Wind
desc_clone005_zzhen_fhtf_1=Cause damage to targets in front.
clone005_zzhen_zlqk=Staff Disturbs Qiankun
desc_clone005_zzhen_zlqk_1=Cause damage to targets in front and cripple targets. Movement speed and attack speed are reduced by 60% for 10 seconds.
clone005_zzhen_fmszh=Lion Roars at Buddha's Gate
desc_clone005_zzhen_fmszh_1=Lion roar causes damage to surrounding targets and adds shock damage effect. Targets requesting to move exhaust their energy. If the target carries a crippling effect, then damage one extra time is received.
clone005_zzhen_hxgr=Red Dusk Pierces the Sun
desc_clone005_zzhen_hxgr_1=Use magic staff to continuously attack targets in front. Hit on the first strike reduces target speed by 50%. If target parries, then bloodthirsty effect is added for yourself and attack power is increased, with +20 arm strength points for 10 seconds.
clone005_zzhen_clgh=White Dragon Returns to the Sea
desc_clone005_zzhen_clgh_1=Continuously cause damage to surrounding targets, and knock them down on last strike.
clone005_zzhen_01=Precarious Heavy Strike
desc_clone005_zzhen_01_1=<s>
clone005_zzhen_xuzhao=One Staff Sweeps the Void
desc_clone005_zzhen_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then it erases all of the target's rage and seals their skills for 4 seconds.
