desc_clone005_zzhen_pg_1=<s>
clone005_mrj_dq=Shield and Spear
desc_clone005_mrj_dq_1=Cause damage to targets in front, knocking them back. Hitting target adds armor breaking effect, with defense decreasing by 10% for 10 seconds.
clone005_mrj_qmtc=All-Around Sudden Pierce
desc_clone005_mrj_qmtc_1=Throw hidden bound wooden spikes at feet of target, and cause damage to targets in a 2 meter radius. Hitting targets adds foot fracture effect, with movement speed reduced by 50%, causing damage for 10 seconds.
clone005_mrj_fhsl=Wind Fire Twin Wheels
desc_clone005_mrj_fhsl_1=During preparation, target is knocked backward, and hitting targets moves target to your side and causes continuous damage. A hit on the first strike give the target the effect of forbidding flying skills for 8 seconds.
clone005_mrj_ddsy=Ambush On All Sides Array
desc_clone005_mrj_ddsy_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets, and special effect uses sudden pierce of the ground with blade. All targets add severed tendon effect and cannot move for 4 seconds.
clone005_mrj_smmf=Blade Swipes Over All
desc_clone005_mrj_smmf_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and give those surrounding you added damage to buff circle when moving for 10 seconds (after the blade falls to the ground, those moving with injuries from the blade will bleed).
clone005_mrm_qmtc=All-Around Sudden Pierce
desc_clone005_mrm_qmtc_1=Throw wooden spikes under your own feet and cause damage to surrounding targets.
