desc_clone013_tmy_ybpp_1=Cause damage to targets straight ahead in a 120° arc 5 meters ahead, knocking targets back and reducing their speed by 50% for 8 seconds.
clone013_tmy_lwsc=Light Steps
desc_clone013_tmy_lwsc_1=Suddenly move to the side of a player. Causes damage to player and shock other team members within a 1 meter radius. Clear hatred of target. You gain worry-forgetting buff and temporarily increase arm power by 20 points and movement speed by 50%.
clone013_tmy_yys=Mystical Shadow Shuttle
desc_clone013_tmy_yys_1=Fire hidden poison dagger at any random player. Causes damage and add shadow raid debuff for 5 seconds, with movement speed decreased by 50%, causing 100 points of damage every second.
clone013_tmy_bfzy=Grab the Shadow Catch the Wind
desc_clone013_tmy_bfzy_1=Cause continuous AOE damage to surrounding players.
clone013_tmy_zmhh=Murky Web
desc_clone013_tmy_zmhh_1=Continuously fire 4 hidden weapon nets in a 20 meter radius. Causes continuous damage to targets within a 2 meter radius and 50% reduced speed.
clone013_tmy_01=Leaning on the Embroidery Needle
desc_clone013_tmy_01_1=<s>
clone013_tmy_xuzhao=Swing the Tail
desc_clone013_tmy_xuzhao_1=A feint attack that deals damage to enemies in front of you. {@0:伤害包}<br>Blocking enemies will be pushed away and paralyzed and slowed by 30% for 8 seconds.
clone013_tmy_qg=Breeze Captures Moon
desc_clone013_tmy_qg_1=<s>
