desc_clone013_tmy_pg_1=<s>
clone013_tmj_hxhx=Red Apricot Smiling
desc_clone013_tmj_hxhx_1=Give yourself a laughing effect and become immune to damage coming from targets in front of you.
clone013_tmj_bcns=Green Grass Concentrates Thoughts
desc_clone013_tmj_bcns_1=Randomly select one player to release it on. Causes AOE damage to surrounding targets in 5 meter radius. Stack up three-pest and three-herb debuff, and movement causes capture.
clone013_tmj_qznj=Stalk in Stealth
desc_clone013_tmj_qznj_1=Stealth technique: Throws a smoke bomb to create a special mist that makes enemies in mist lose HP continuously and disable their flying skills.<br>Allies in mist can use the smoke to increase their Evasion and Melee Damage.
clone013_tmj_ygsn=Parrot Flies Over Long Grass
clone013_tmj_qlmk=Firebird Cries Out
desc_clone013_tmj_qlmk_1=Continuously knock surrounding targets flying into the air. This skill can be used in a combo attack.
