desc_clone013_tmj_01_1=<s>
clone013_tmj_xuzhao=Soup of Oblivion
desc_clone013_tmj_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then they faint for 4 seconds.
clone013_tmj_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone013_tmj_pg_1=<s>
clone013_tjz_dyxkz=Swinging Blade Cuts Across
desc_clone013_tjz_dyxkz_1=Charge one player to cause 10% damage to their Max HP and make them faint for 3 seconds.
clone013_tjz_hkz=Swinging Chop Crosses the Void
desc_clone013_tjz_hkz_1=Cause a small amount of damage to targets in a 120° arc 5 meters ahead. If the target is in the air, then knocking them flying causes one instance of major damage.
clone013_tjz_lkz=Swinging Chop Seizes the Void
desc_clone013_tjz_lkz_1=Cause great damage to surrounding ground targets and knock them down. If the target is in the air, then it causes minor damage.
clone013_tjz_skz=Swinging Chop Smashes the Void
desc_clone013_tjz_skz_1=One charge causes 5% Max HP damage to target. If the target's hit points are less than 20% Max HP, then it instantly chops them to death.
clone013_tjz_smzhh=Ransom Life Chasing Soul
desc_clone013_tjz_smzhh_1=Start preparation for the skill. Add buff to all surroundings. This buff will create a Soul Eating Crock with low hit points in a range of 10 meters around the player. Each Soul Eating Crock gives surrounding players Level-1 soul losing effect. After the skill is prepared, it pulls all players in surrounding area with soul eating effect to your side and causes damage to them. The degree of damage is decided by the level of soul losing effect. The damage for levels 1 to 10 is 1% to 10% Max HP, respectively.
