clone013_txy_tmjs=Flying Flowers
desc_clone013_txy_tmjs_1=Cause continuous damage to targets in front.
clone013_txy_ghms=Rip the Heart
desc_clone013_txy_ghms_1=Cause continuous damage to targets in front.
clone013_txy_dyly=Flowing Melodies
desc_clone013_txy_dyly_1=Pull surrounding targets to you and create an NPC underfoot to cause continuous damage within a certain range.
clone013_txy_sxjz=Blood Drinking Sword Mound
desc_clone013_txy_sxjz_1=Rotate the tip of the sword point, when preparation for skill starts, decreases speed by 20% for surrounding targets. Continuously cast spell on the ground to shoot up giant swords. Causes major damage to targets that are hit.
