clone013_ta_nfcg=Uncontrollable Rage
desc_clone013_ta_nfcg_1=Knock surrounding targets flying and increase your own attack effect for 20 seconds. When the effect finishes, you faint for 3 seconds.
clone013_ta_nhly=Anger Burns All
desc_clone013_ta_nhly_1=Create a flaming pyre under the selected target. When the pyre finishes, it will cause major damage to targets within range.
clone013_ta_lzsg=Reverse Godly Skill
