clone013_tq_mxsm=Dazzling Infatuation
desc_clone013_tq_mxsm_1=Crushing poison powder gives players in surroundings bewildering debuff. Hit rate decreases by 50% and the target falls into a dazed state for 15 seconds (using special effect of Wanderer's Nail Heart and Pierce Bone).
clone013_tq_xynm=Bright Raiment Angry Horse
