desc_clone011_duanmanyin_sxjx_1=Using a one finger skill, cause damage to a single target and cause them to fall down and lose a large amount of Chi and Blood if they use flying skills.
clone011_duanmanyin_yyz=One Yang Finger
desc_clone011_duanmanyin_yyz_1=Using a one finger skill, cause damage to one target within 20 meters ahead. Knock them flying and seal their skills.
clone011_duanmanyin_zdqs=Severing Wound
desc_clone011_duanmanyin_zdqs_1=Attack surrounding targets using a triple combo within a 5 meter radius . The damage on the first two strikes continuously knocks them flying vertically. The third strike causes major damage and stuns the target.
clone011_duanmanyin_xuzhao=Reject Pride and Embrace Patience
desc_clone011_duanmanyin_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, their rage is erased.
clone011_duanmanyin_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone011_duanmanyin_pg_1=<s>
clone011_yewue_sszs=Twin Corpse Beheading
desc_clone011_yewue_sszs_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets in 8 meter radius and adds corpse stench to two targets, and these two stand side by side. When time is up, it causes 50% Max HP damage to all players.
clone011_yewue_xyey=Evil Colors and Words
desc_clone011_yewue_xyey_1=Cause minor damage to all forward targets in an arc. Targets that parry will have the panic effect added. Movement speed and attack speed are decreased by 50%.
clone011_yewue_fsah=Dropping the Head to Comfort the Soul
desc_clone011_yewue_fsah_1=Damage increases at closer distances.
clone011_yewue_xuzhao=Nine Spirit Corpse Bind
desc_clone011_yewue_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then flying skills are forbidden and speed is reduced.
clone011_yewue_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone011_yewue_pg_1=<s>
clone011_yxs_cxer=Invading by Ruse
desc_clone011_yxs_cxer_1=Knock down and cause damage to all surrounding targets that do not parry.
clone011_yxs_ysth=Move Mountain Fill Sea
desc_clone011_yxs_ysth_1=Create hidden and bound effect at feet of target three times in a row. One second later, cause damage to surrounding targets in a 1 meter radius (up-jutting boulders). Normal difficulty causes 10% max HP damage.
clone011_yxs_lbsx=Pull Up Mountain
desc_clone011_yxs_lbsx_1=Reflect 100% damage.
clone011_yxs_01=Tracking Wolf
desc_clone011_yxs_01_1=The co-op skill of Yue Xingshen
clone011_yxs_xuzhao=Boundless Charging Bull
desc_clone011_yxs_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then they are knocked back and stunned.
clone011_yxs_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone011_yxs_pg_1=<s>
clone011_yqx_ylqm=Confused and Lost Heart
desc_clone011_yqx_ylqm_1=Gives bonus immunity effect to all forward targets so they cannot use objects.
clone011_yqx_xzyy=Signs of Stars and Moon
desc_clone011_yqx_xzyy_1=Cause AOE damage to surrounding targets in a 15 meter radius and knock targets back 8 meters that do not parry.
clone011_yqx_dstx=Submerge the Lotus
desc_clone011_yqx_dstx_1=Knocks surrounding targets flying backward within a 5 meter range that do not parry and causes damage.
clone011_yqx_01=Qinhuai's Protective Mat
desc_clone011_yqx_01_1=<s>
clone011_yqx_xuzhao=Stepping Lightly Over Mystic Waves
desc_clone011_yqx_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are knocked flying into the air.
clone011_yqx_pg=Normal Attack
desc_clone011_yqx_pg_1=<s>
clone011_daren_kthd=Cry for the World
desc_clone011_daren_kthd_1=Breaks defense and knocks the target down.
clone011_dazhi_shxshch=Snake Gliding and Rat Scurrying
desc_clone011_dazhi_shxshch_1=Lower limbs paralysis makes movement difficult, and then there is a slow recovery. When poisoned, if the target is in the air, then they are directly tripped up. They cannot use flying skills for a short period of time. While poisoned, they continuously lose Chi and blood.
clone011_dayong_qtzk=Wailing At The Dead End
desc_clone011_dayong_qtzk_1=Cause damage to targets in an arc and knock them down. Add Wine Mist effect, reducing speed and decreasing hit rate.
clone011_daxin_ylrs=Submerge the Lotus
desc_clone011_daxin_ylrs_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock them flying. Increase your own arm strength.
clone011_dali_rskb=To Mourn A Dead Mother
desc_clone011_dali_rskb_1=Cause damage to targets in front within an arc.
clone011_lhz_hzsl=Lotus Blooming from the Fire
desc_clone011_lhz_hzsl_1=Rage attacks heart, shoot chi force from a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the chi force will affect enemies around target.
clone011_lhz_bblh=Every Step a Lotus
desc_clone011_lhz_bblh_1=Charging movement, gather chi to push palm twice quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
clone011_lhz_bdkh=Blooming Everywhere
desc_clone011_lhz_bdkh_1=Push two palms at the same time, urge <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> to break out, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The powerful force will push enemies away and hurt them as they fall down, continuously losing HP and Brawn.<br> (This skill must be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>).
clone011_lhz_lotg=Lotus Sharing One Root
desc_clone011_lhz_lotg_1=Push palm once, create a force to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will reduce his movement speed, and cause him not to be able to use flying skill.
clone011_lhz_jhxf=Give the Buddha Borrowed Flowers
desc_clone011_lhz_jhxf_1=Block move - each successful parry can convert attacker's force into <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> and store it.<br>(Higher level of skill, more <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> can be stored.)
clone011_lhz_lhls=Falling Flower and Flowing Water
desc_clone011_lhz_lhls_1=Use skill like in water, palm force blows like wind, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.
clone011_lhz_jtbl=Green Lotus
desc_clone011_lhz_jtbl_1=Lotus Palm Technique, also known as <font color="#FFAE00">Killer's Hold</font>, can throw the target to the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This also creates a blast that affects surrounding enemies. <br> (This skill can only be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, and this skill can only be used on targets in the air).
clone011_lhz_ylrs=Submerge the Lotus
desc_clone011_lhz_ylrs_1=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
clone011_xg_lnj=Continuous Bow and Arrow
desc_clone011_xg_lnj_1=<s>
clone011_xg_cdj=Poisoned Arrow
desc_clone011_xg_cdj_1=<s>
