desc_clone011_xg_lmsb_1=<s>
clone011_xg_hfzr=Dealing with Trouble
desc_clone011_xg_hfzr_1=<s>
clone011_ksbf_qtzk=Wailing At The Dead End
desc_clone011_ksbf_qtzk_1=Spit out <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> at enemies in front, reduce their movement speed and hit rate.<br> (Cannot use this skill if you aren't drunk.)
clone011_ksbf_rskb=To Mourn A Dead Mother
desc_clone011_ksbf_rskb_1=Wield staff to attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> onto enemy.
clone011_ksbf_kthd=Cry for the World
desc_clone011_ksbf_kthd_1=Attack the sky and ground, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you, if the attack breaks a parry, then it will seal the enemy's feet acupoints, causing the enemy to lose massive Energy for 15 seconds when using flying skills. <br>At the same time unleash  <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> on the enemy. (The damage the target takes will increase along with stacking levels of drunk state on yourself).
clone011_ksbf_nkyt=Birds Cry and Apes Wail
desc_clone011_ksbf_nkyt_1=Charging move, attack three times, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
clone011_ksbf_shlp=Fallen Soul's Lament
desc_clone011_ksbf_shlp_1=Strike target like crazy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
clone011_ksbf_ykwl=Cry Without Tears
desc_clone011_ksbf_ykwl_1=Wield staff to attack in air, the chi Force hits target and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If you are in Drunken state, then it will cost one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Drunk"</font> state, blasting the target and tossing him away.
clone011_lsbf_lsfd=Flying Dragon
desc_clone011_lsbf_lsfd_1=Charging movement, swing weapon to attack target, deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will take even more damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
clone011_lsbf_srsx=Snake in the Mouse Lair
desc_clone011_lsbf_srsx_1=Sweep with power, the chi force will strike enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}, and knock down the targets get affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>.
clone011_lsbf_skfz=Viper's Bite and Bee's Sting
desc_clone011_lsbf_skfz_1=Gather strength into one point, find weakness and attack it, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, then enemy will be knocked down, and be infected with more fierce <font color="#FFAE00">"High Snake Poison"</font>.
clone011_lsbf_fscs=Ruthless Long Snake
desc_clone011_lsbf_fscs_1=Move like a snake, and attack continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
clone011_lsbf_spqz=Snake Coiled on Green Bamboo
desc_clone011_lsbf_spqz_1=Sweep and stab, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
clone011_lsbf_sxsc=Snaking and Squirming
desc_clone011_lsbf_sxsc_1=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
desc_clone009_zyc_mlhs_1=Cause damage to targets in front and knock them back.
clone009_zyc_fhly=Flower Shadow
desc_clone009_zyc_fhly_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and immobilize.
desc_clone009_zyc_jaqm_1=Continuous knock flying the surrounding targets and cause damage.
desc_clone009_zyc_cbhm_1=Jade maiden sword directly stabs target and knocks it flying into the air.
clone009_zyc_chjy=Crippling Rainbow Sword
desc_clone009_zyc_chjy_1=Cause major damage to surrounding targets. Can be reduced by leaping into the air.
