desc_clone009_zyc_01_1=Co-op Skill
clone009_zyc_xuzhao=Hero's Sword Crashes Down
desc_clone009_zyc_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
clone009_zrz_gyzt=Ghostly Wings Obscure the Sky
desc_clone009_zrz_gyzt_1=Allows surrounding targets to recover. It can be cut off after receiving a certain amount of damage.
clone009_zrz_gycs=Haunted by Ghost
desc_clone009_zrz_gycs_1=Cause major damage to targets in front within rectangle-shaped range.
clone009_zrz_gztx=Ghost Claw Plucks Heart
desc_clone009_zrz_gztx_1=Cause damage to single target and seal skills for 5 seconds.
clone009_zrz_gklh=Ghost Cry Wolf Howl
desc_clone009_zrz_gklh_1=Adds reflective damage protection to surrounding friendly targets.
clone009_zrz_yhsg=Dark Soul Gnaws Bone
desc_clone009_zrz_yhsg_1=Recover 1% Max HP each 60 seconds for 600 seconds.
clone009_zrz_jybgz=Nine Yin Bone Claw
desc_clone009_zrz_jybgz_1=Nine Yin Bone Claw
clone009_jmst_dhz=Rainbow Mending Needle
desc_clone009_jmst_dhz_1=Hidden weapon skill causes faint effect in an arc.
clone009_jmst_lxqd=Finding One's Way in the Snow
desc_clone009_jmst_lxqd_1=Cause damage to targets along straight line and add knock down effect.
clone009_jmst_gfty=Spirit Wind Pushes the Cloud
desc_clone009_jmst_gfty_1=Cause damage to units along straight line for 30 meters and knock them back.
clone009_jmst_sykt=Auspicious Beginning
desc_clone009_jmst_sykt_1=Ricochets off surrounding targets and causes damage.
clone009_jmst_sjlh=Four Seasons Reincarnation
desc_clone009_jmst_sjlh_1=Call four disciples for help. Trigger in sequence.
clone009_jmst_myjz=Meiyan's Array
desc_clone009_jmst_myjz_1=Give yourself reflective damage effect and reflect 50% of damage from the back.
desc_clone009_jmst_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then they are knocked down.
clone009_syx_hjsdl=Horizontal Sword Wave
desc_clone009_syx_hjsdl_1=Cause damage to targets in front in an arc. Knock them flying and they regain energy when stationary.
clone009_syx_jdqy=Gushing Spring of Potion
desc_clone009_syx_jdqy_1=Damaging skill that knocks flying ground targets. Also adds to target's energy and clears hatred.
clone009_syx_bshql=Caged Dragon of Green Water
desc_clone009_syx_bshql_1=Cause damage. Immobilize single targets and continuously restore energy.
clone009_syx_jzshr=Double-Bladed Turning Sword
desc_clone009_syx_jzshr_1=Cause damage to single players. If player's energy is insufficient, then it causes great damage.
clone009_syx_jjqy=Sword Strikes Blue Clouds
desc_clone009_syx_jjqy_1=Cause long-range damage to one target.
clone009_syx_jdrc=The Potion of the Lake
desc_clone009_syx_jdrc_1=Continuously cast spell, repeatedly bounce off targets. Add chaos effect. When finished casting spell, enter energy depletion state for immobilization and ease of damage.
clone009_syx_01=The Sword of the Phoenix
desc_clone009_syx_01_1=Co-op Skill
clone009_syx_xuzhao=Returning Wind Broken Wave
desc_clone009_syx_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then they are stunned.
clone009_jkpp_jdfg=Buddha's Golden Aura
desc_clone009_jkpp_jdfg_1=Subtract 50% of damage, and reduce movement speed by 50%.
clone009_jkpp_yhyc=Loathesome Clouds And Rain
desc_clone009_jkpp_yhyc_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and stun effect.
clone009_jkpp_blfy=Departed Kin
desc_clone009_jkpp_blfy_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock flying targets in the state of Stunned by Loathsome Rain. Attach your own Pain of Separation level damage and clear your own Pain of Separation effect.
clone009_jkpp_xsdm=Meridian Breaking
desc_clone009_jkpp_xsdm_1=Cause continuous damage to surrounding targets and absorb some damage to transform it into your own Chi and blood.
clone009_jkpp_yzxw=The rosy clouds are slowly rising
desc_clone009_jkpp_yzxw_1=Enhance your own Chi and blood recovery speed so that you are immune to depletion effect for a certain time. Erase your own hatred.
clone009_jkpp_fxxm=Buddhist Heart Subdues the Devil
desc_clone009_jkpp_fxxm_1=Cause damage to targets plus speed reduction effect. Produce splashing effect.
desc_clone009_jkpp_jaqm_1=Knock flying surrounding targets and cause damage.
desc_clone009_jkpp_xyyj_1=For use against targets in air. Piece the target into the ground and shock surrounding targets. Add wise heart effect damage and clear wide heart effect.
clone009_jkpp_01=The Renegade
desc_clone009_jkpp_01_1=<s>
clone009_jkpp_xuzhao=Shadow and Spirit Depart
desc_clone009_jkpp_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then it reduces their rage and energy.
clone009_jyst_wcqs=Gaze Autumn Water
desc_clone009_jyst_wcqs_1=Cause damage to targets in front in a rectangular range. Reduce their defense and knock them down. Erase your own hatred.
clone009_jyst_qthh=Uplifting Melody
desc_clone009_jyst_qthh_1=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock them flying. Reduce speed and forbid flying skills. Give yourself spirit calming effect.
clone009_jyst_cxmt=Free of Worries
desc_clone009_jyst_cxmt_1=Cause damage to one target plus grudge outbreak effect.
clone009_jyst_cccd=Great Misery
desc_clone009_jyst_cccd_1=Cause all surrounding targets to go into faint. Damage received is eliminated. Give yourself confusion effect.
clone009_jyst_cfhs=Fan of Grievance
desc_clone009_jyst_cfhs_1=Cause continuous damage to one target within range.
clone009_jyst_01=Heavenly Sage Bends Plum Branch
desc_clone009_jyst_01_1=Co-op Skill
clone009_jyst_xuzhao=Bewildering Flowers
desc_clone009_jyst_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are immobilized.
clone009_myst_tygy=Celestial Element Unity
desc_clone009_myst_tygy_1=Cause apportioned damage to all surrounding targets within range and knock them back.
clone009_myst_tyzg=Celestial Element Dipper
desc_clone009_myst_tyzg_1=Release one fog that can block certain damage. Absorb sufficient damage and then the fog buff will disappear and shock away surrounding enemies.
clone009_myst_tylyz=Tianyuan Thunder Array
desc_clone009_myst_tylyz_1=Call a few Emei advanced disciples to help out. You can continuously recover 1,000 HP every two seconds.
clone009_myst_zqdl=The Purple Air Comes From The East
desc_clone009_myst_zqdl_1=Cause damage to all surrounding targets and clear Buddha's Golden Aura effect.
clone009_myst_fymm=Chant of Buddha
desc_clone009_myst_fymm_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets and adds silence effect.
clone009_myst_dlz=Duoluo's Finger
clone009_myst_01=Triple Chaos Strike
desc_clone009_myst_01_1=Co-op Skill
clone009_myst_xuzhao=Pure Elemental in One Breath
desc_clone009_myst_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
clone009n_shou_gangfengtuiyun=Spirit Wind Pushes the Cloud
desc_clone009n_shou_gangfengtuiyun_1=A charging movement. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
clone009n_shou_jindingfoguang=Buddha's Golden Aura
desc_clone009n_shou_jindingfoguang_1=A merciful move that gives your party a protective chi that reduces damage taken for a short period.
clone009n_shuangci_lichoubiexu=Parting Sorrow
desc_clone009n_shuangci_lichoubiexu_1=A charging movement with a turning stab, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This adds Rage to your character, the ammount depending on how much your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>is stacked.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
clone009n_shuangci_shengsilibie=Farewell to Life and Death
desc_clone009n_shuangci_shengsilibie_1=No joy in life and don't fear of death. Anger motivates the potential: increase much movement speed, Move power and defense, lasting for 10 seconds.
clone009n_shuangci_lishijuesu=Transcend the Worldly
desc_clone009n_shuangci_lishijuesu_1=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
clone009n_ci_boyunjianri=The Renegade
desc_clone009n_ci_boyunjianri_1=A charging movement that breaks through obstacles and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach enemies.
clone009n_ci_xuansiduanmai=Meridian Breaking
desc_clone009n_ci_xuansiduanmai_1=Wield sting to attack continuously, the special chi force can increase HP recovering speed for yourself and friendly target, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.
clone009n_shou_aoxuezhuiyun=Proud Snow Chases the Cloud
desc_clone009n_shou_aoxuezhuiyun_1=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
clone009n_shou_xuetaimeigu=Noble and Pure
desc_clone009n_shou_xuetaimeigu_1=Clear icy air raises your own balance and your companions' balance, simultaneously eliminating any movement impairments.
clone009n_shou_xuehaibingshan=Glacier in Sea of Clouds
desc_clone009n_shou_xuehaibingshan_1=An advanced movement. Snow and ice surge and a freezing gust picks up, inflicting {@0:伤害包} on all incoming enemies;<br><font color="#FFAE00">Icy Air Invasion</font> slows the enemy's movement speed and prevents the enemy from using Flying Skills.
clone009n_ci_guoyanyunyan=Passing Clouds
desc_clone009n_ci_guoyanyunyan_1=The sting's blade moves like smoke curling upwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
clone019_yingyan_lzdm=Eye Catching
desc_clone019_yingyan_lzdm_1=Eagle Eye Transformation concentrates energy. Brawn and accuracy greatly increased.
clone019_yingyan_lzj=Soaring Peerless Eagle
desc_clone019_yingyan_lzj_1=Scratch all targets in front and cause continuous bleeding damage.
clone019_yingyan_zfz=Eagle Returns to Lonely Perch
desc_clone019_yingyan_zfz_1=Cause damage to all surrounding targets. If target has scratching effect, the add Fatal Injury effect in replace of the scratching effect.
clone019_yingyan_qylw=Summoning the Heavenly Eagle
desc_clone019_yingyan_qylw_1=Call many mature eagles to help. The normal attack of mature eagles also has a chance probability of causing a stun effect.
clone019_yingyan_yjck=Shapeless Shadow
desc_clone019_yingyan_yjck_1=Cause all targets in front to receive continuous damage and continuously knock them back. If the target moves, it receives additional damage.
clone019_yingyan_cs=Savage Feeding
desc_clone019_yingyan_cs_1=Savage Feeding continues for a relatively longer time. When a certain amount of damage is received, then it can be cut off. After it is successful, your own hit points are recovered.
clone019_yingyan_fzzc=Beating Wings in the Wind
desc_clone019_yingyan_fzzc_1=Flapping both wings, create a hurricane under your feet. The targets in the range of the hurricane have their speed reduced. They receive continuous damage and are knocked flying backward.
clone019_yingyan_01=Cycling Scratch Strike
desc_clone019_yingyan_01_1=Cycling Claw Strike
clone019_yingyan_xuzhao=Colorful Cone
desc_clone019_yingyan_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are knocked down.
clone019_hwt_lqw=Greedy Ghosts in Hell
desc_clone019_hwt_lqw_1=Attack in a fan shape in front of you. The players who are struck will get the Vulnerable effect.
clone019_hwt_typt=Heroic Soul Destroyer
clone019_hwt_tyst=Whispering Frenzy of Thoughts
clone019_hwt_yjys=No Worries
clone019_hwt_xmzj=Absolute Focus
desc_clone019_hwt_xmzj_1=Cause fixed damage to all surrounding players; can be cut off. After it is cut off, demon possession is reduced by one level.
clone019_hwt_01=Endless Flow of Hatred
desc_clone019_hwt_01_1=The co-op skill of He Wentao
clone019_hwt_xuzhao=The Division of Life and Death
desc_clone019_hwt_xuzhao_1=After successfully breaking down the defense, you add the buff. You can add extra Yin Damage and Yang Damage with each attack.
clone019_yanchuchu_xhd=Mental and Spiritual Extermination
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_xhd_1=Spray poison mottled powder on all targets in front. Causes continuous bleeding damage. After level 5, produces great damage.
clone019_yanchuchu_tmd=Rotten Muscles and Brittle Bones
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_tmd_1=Cause poisonous damage to all surrounding targets plus speed reduction and flying skills forbidding effect.
clone019_yanchuchu_cxpx=Evil Ghosts Fight for Food
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_cxpx_1=Rub poison essence on yourself and reflect 100% of poisonous damage from surprise attacks from behind.
clone019_yanchuchu_dmqj=Enfeebling Poison
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_dmqj_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. For 10 seconds, targets will fall over if they try to move.
clone019_yanchuchu_dsyy=Nail Heart and Pierce Bone
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_dsyy_1=Randomly throw blue toxic fog under the feet of a target. They expend Chi and blood energy for 10 seconds, and flying skills are forbidden. Press key to dislocate.
clone019_yanchuchu_xuzhao=Aching Heart
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If target parries, then the Heart Ache Inch Poison effect is added. Receives damage when moving.
clone019_yaojian_gsfz=Black Coffin Buried Bones
desc_clone019_yaojian_gsfz_1=Randomly drop an ancient coffin in the range of the target. Causes damage to targets in range and knock them down. Also create three skeletons.
clone019_yaojian_chq=Tears of the Corpse
desc_clone019_yaojian_chq_1=Add panic effect to all surrounding targets. Reduce some ownership attributes.
clone019_yaojian_slmf=Corpse Puppet Esoteric Spell
desc_clone019_yaojian_slmf_1=Use corpse refinement esoteric spell to call all corpse to your side. Make the corpses temporarily immune to control. Increase movement speed and attack speed.
clone019_yaojian_slft=Rampaging Plague
desc_clone019_yaojian_slft_1=Release your own potential. Shock away surrounding targets. Give yourself corpse power. Attach greater additional damage to attack power for 15 seconds. Completely transform corpse poison to corpse stench. Causes major damage to players.
clone019_yaojian_xuzhao=Dance of Death
desc_clone019_yaojian_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then it adds corpse poison and knock-flying effect.
clone019_licheng_yyz=Black Lightning
desc_clone019_licheng_yyz_1=Cleave all targets in an arc and cause speed reduction and blindness effect.
clone019_licheng_hsz=Ten-Thousand Brittle Bones
desc_clone019_licheng_hsz_1=Leap to random target and knock them down.
clone019_licheng_pds=Swiftly Sailing Warships
desc_clone019_licheng_pds_1=Shock away surrounding targets and cause damage.
clone019_licheng_xuzhao=Broken Spear Drowns in Sand
desc_clone019_licheng_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
clone019_shantianming_jh=Astonishing Spirit Boots
desc_clone019_shantianming_jh_1=Cause damage to all targets in a 120° arc in front of you. After knocking them down, adds bleeding effect.
clone019_shantianming_sxld=Destroy the Heart and Break the Gall
desc_clone019_shantianming_sxld_1=Terrorize surrounding targets. Lower target attack power and defense power.
clone019_shantianming_cqzr=Diving Swan
desc_clone019_shantianming_cqzr_1=This mid-air skill causes damage to targets and must add weakness effect.
clone019_shantianming_rqqc=Dark Poison Destroys The Wood
desc_clone019_shantianming_rqqc_1=When activated, causes minor damage to surrounding targets. Attach additional damage to your own attack Give yourself added Dark Poison Halo. Targets that enter range of halo receive continuous damage. However, you receive 50% additional damage.
clone019_shantianming_dcrq=Great Perfection Seems Incomplete
desc_clone019_shantianming_dcrq_1=A charging stance. A NPC will be created within a certan fange when the skill is released. A halo will appear. Players will be immun to any damage while staying inside the halo and will recieve massive damage when out of the halo
desc_clone019_shantianming_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If target parries, then they expend rage and add bonus immunity state effect.
clone019_zhanying_pg=Talons of the Eagle
desc_clone019_zhanying_pg_1=Mature eagle normal attack includes the probability of causing the stun effect.
clone019_yinfeng_awtr=Obscure the Sky to Block the Sun
desc_clone019_yinfeng_awtr_1=Cause damage to all surrounding targets, and add Blinding Bewilderment effect. Reduce dexterity and spirit. The boundaries are fuzzy.
clone019_yinfeng_ymy=Tracking the Mysterious Shadow
desc_clone019_yinfeng_ymy_1=Cause damage to targets in a 15 meter arc in front of you, and also give yourself an added hiding effect. Lowers defense power and raises evasion power.
clone019_yinfeng_jxfh=Endless Shatter of the Dark Underworld
desc_clone019_yinfeng_jxfh_1=Cause damage to all surrounding targets in a 10 meter radius. Knock all players flying backward.
clone019_yinfeng_xuzhao=Falling Shadow of Hatred
desc_clone019_yinfeng_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then their skills are sealed.
clone019_mazhalan_xxzh=God-Destruction Insanity
desc_clone019_mazhalan_xxzh_1=Cause damage to all surrounding targets. Directly get Soul Destroying Poison. Directly explode. Causes damage to yourself and all players within 5 meters range.
clone019_mazhalan_ygdm=Dark Venom of Heaven
desc_clone019_mazhalan_ygdm_1=When the poison is in deadly form, surrounding players go up one buff level. If flying skills are not used within 5 seconds, then it causes split second killing damage to all surrounding players.
clone019_mazhalan_xuzhao=Shura Rots The Bone
desc_clone019_mazhalan_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, they are knocked flying into the air and receive major Yin Damage.
clone019_hulahual_wdg=Thousand Poison Worm
desc_clone019_hulahual_wdg_1=With normal attack, each time the target is hit, there is a chance to add Soul Eating Insect, Life-Eating Poison, or Bloodletting Poison effect to the target.
clone019_yanchuchu_jiazhao=Lose Heart
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_jiazhao_1=Add parry effect for yourself. With each successful parry, there is a chance to accumulate poison essence for yourself.
clone019_foshi_ryq=Blazing Hot Chi
desc_clone019_foshi_ryq_1=Inject the extremely hot Chi into the giant sword to make it able to reflect partial damage.
clone019_licheng_jiazhao=Mystical Dragon Deterrence
desc_clone019_licheng_jiazhao_1=Add parry effect for yourself. Each successful parry attaches heavy damage to your attack.
clone019_xiuluowang_ssz=One Boundless Chop
desc_clone019_xiuluowang_ssz_1=Cause apportioned damage to all targets along a straight line.
clone019_xiuluowang_ymjhz=Dark Underworld Absolute Array
desc_clone019_xiuluowang_ymjhz_1=Place down the Dark Underworld Absolute Array and call four Wanderers Sect experts to help you.
