desc_clone019_xiuluowang_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then their skills are sealed and speed reduced.
clone019_haidaotouzi_01=Glacier Cracks Like Thunder
desc_clone019_haidaotouzi_01_1=Release ice column in front of you. The explosion causes damage to surrounding targets and freezes them.
clone019_dujuan_01=Inferno Engulfs the Earth
desc_clone019_dujuan_01_1=Click on the ground around the target to create a lake of fire which erupts and then sends the target flying up into the air.
clone019_yinfeng_mmlyz=Fiery Blade of the Underworld
desc_clone019_yinfeng_mmlyz_1=Cause damage to all targets along a straight line and add Dark Flame effect. Causes continuous damage to surrounding targets
clone019_foshi_xuzhao=Kneel to Watch Moon
desc_clone019_foshi_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to targets. If the target parries, they are also stunned.
clone019_foshi_hbq=Frost Aura
desc_clone019_foshi_hbq_1=Inject extremely cold Chi into the giant sword to make attackers expend extra energy when attacking the giant sword.
clone019_foshi_jiazhao=Thousand Circling Swords
desc_clone019_foshi_jiazhao_1=Add parry effect for yourself. With each successful parry, the target's skills are sealed.
clone019_yinfeng_lht=Lightning Speed Strike
desc_clone019_yinfeng_lht_1=Cause damage to all targets in front. Knock them flying and seal their skills.
