CS_ng_jh_306_01=Madness of the Stars
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_01_1=<font color="#9932CD">-Seize the Despot Mid-Air, Show No Mercy-</font><br>Evil Skill Close Rotation - Envelopes target in melee strikes. Evil Produces Change - Knock nearby enemies away and cause {@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Chi Invasion - Targets continuously lose blood for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_01_2=<font color="#9932CD">-Seize the Despot Mid-Air, Show No Mercy-</font><br>Evil Skill Close Rotation, Involves surrounding enemies in melee, Evil Produces Change, knock melee enemies flying and cause {@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Chi Invasion, cause targets to continuously lose blood for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_01_3=<font color="#9932CD">-Seize the Despot Mid-Air, Show No Mercy-</font><br>Evil Skill Close Rotation, Involves surrounding enemies in melee, Evil Produces Change, knock melee enemies flying and cause {@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Chi Invasion, cause targets to continuously lose blood for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_01_4=<font color="#9932CD">-Seize the Despot Mid-Air, Show No Mercy-</font><br>Evil Skill Close Rotation, Involves surrounding enemies in melee, Evil Produces Change, knock melee enemies flying and cause {@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Chi Invasion, cause targets to continuously lose blood for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_01_5=<font color="#9932CD">-Seize the Despot Mid-Air, Show No Mercy-</font><br>Evil Skill Close Rotation, Involves surrounding enemies in melee, Evil Produces Change, knock melee enemies flying and cause {@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Chi Invasion, cause targets to continuously lose blood for 10 seconds.
CS_ng_jh_306_02=Summon Demons and Spirits
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_02_1=<font color="#9932CD">-Explore the Earth and Pass Through Hell, Drink Blood-</font><br>Demonic Nature Appears - Knock target to the ground and strike. Deals target{@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Nature Advances - Siphons off a large amount of target's Chi and energy.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_02_2=<font color="#9932CD">-Explore the Earth and Pass Through Hell, Drink Blood-</font><br>Demonic Nature Appears, push enemy to ground, lower fist for heavy strike, cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Nature Advances, crack enemy's bones, final strike siphons off large amount of target's Chi and energy.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_02_3=<font color="#9932CD">-Explore the Earth and Pass Through Hell, Drink Blood-</font><br>Demonic Nature Appears, push enemy to ground, lower fist for heavy strike, cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Nature Advances, crack enemy's bones, final strike siphons off large amount of target's Chi and energy.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_02_4=<font color="#9932CD">-Explore the Earth and Pass Through Hell, Drink Blood-</font><br>Demonic Nature Appears, push enemy to ground, lower fist for heavy strike, cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Nature Advances, crack enemy's bones, final strike siphons off large amount of target's Chi and energy.
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_02_5=<font color="#9932CD">-Explore the Earth and Pass Through Hell, Drink Blood-</font><br>Demonic Nature Appears, push enemy to ground, lower fist for heavy strike, cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br>Evil Nature Advances, crack enemy's bones, final strike siphons off large amount of target's Chi and energy.
CS_ng_jh_306_03=Dance of the Demon
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_03_1=<font color="#9932CD">-Melting Attainment and Destroying Chi, Reverse Spin Qiankun-</font><br>Demonic Dance of the Beasts, Making the Heroes Quake - Surrounding targets receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>Sun and Moon Absorb Stars, Ravine of Unquenchable Desire - Drain energy from surrounding targets and knock them away. (The max power extraction is 30 levels, and your own power essence explodes out in a continuous time period)<br/><font color="#CFB53B">After it explodes out, there is a power conflict, so breath disruption backfires, Demon Possession, becoming weakened, Sit and Breath can alleviate slowness. </font>
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_03_2=<font color="#9932CD">-Melting Attainment and Destroying Chi, Reverse Spin Qiankun-</font><br>Demonic Dance of the Beasts, Making the Heroes Quake, Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Sun and Moon Absorb Stars, Ravine of Unquenchable Desire, continuously extract power from surrounding enemies, and finally throw them flying into the air without mercy. (The max power extraction is 30 levels, and your own power essence explodes out in a continuous time period)<br/><font color="#CFB53B">After it explodes out, there is a power conflict, so breath disruption backfires, Demon Possession, becoming weakened, Sit and Breath can alleviate slowness. </font>
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_03_3=<font color="#9932CD">-Melting Attainment and Destroying Chi, Reverse Spin Qiankun-</font><br>Demonic Dance of the Beasts, Making the Heroes Quake, Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Sun and Moon Absorb Stars, Ravine of Unquenchable Desire, continuously extract power from surrounding enemies, and finally throw them flying into the air without mercy. (The max power extraction is 30 levels, and your own power essence explodes out in a continuous time period)<br/><font color="#CFB53B">After it explodes out, there is a power conflict, so breath disruption backfires, Demon Possession, becoming weakened, Sit and Breath can alleviate slowness. </font>
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_03_4=<font color="#9932CD">-Melting Attainment and Destroying Chi, Reverse Spin Qiankun-</font><br>Demonic Dance of the Beasts, Making the Heroes Quake, Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Sun and Moon Absorb Stars, Ravine of Unquenchable Desire, continuously extract power from surrounding enemies, and finally throw them flying into the air without mercy. (The max power extraction is 30 levels, and your own power essence explodes out in a continuous time period)<br/><font color="#CFB53B">After it explodes out, there is a power conflict, so breath disruption backfires, Demon Possession, becoming weakened, Sit and Breath can alleviate slowness. </font>
desc_CS_ng_jh_306_03_5=<font color="#9932CD">-Melting Attainment and Destroying Chi, Reverse Spin Qiankun-</font><br>Demonic Dance of the Beasts, Making the Heroes Quake, Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Sun and Moon Absorb Stars, Ravine of Unquenchable Desire, continuously extract power from surrounding enemies, and finally throw them flying into the air without mercy. (The max power extraction is 30 levels, and your own power essence explodes out in a continuous time period)<br/><font color="#CFB53B">After it explodes out, there is a power conflict, so breath disruption backfires, Demon Possession, becoming weakened, Sit and Breath can alleviate slowness. </font>
CS_ng_jh_507_01=Flying Disc Threads the Needle
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_01_1=<font color="#9932CD">- Turning Back the Yinyang, Horned Finger Seizes the Needle-</font><br>Haughty Weaving Body, Ride the Clouds in the Wind - Launch needles at target dealing {@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets pierced by needles are immobilized for 1 second; the last needle damages their tendons, leaving them unable to use flying skills for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_01_2=<font color="#9932CD">- Turning Back the Yinyang, Horned Finger Seizes the Needle-</font><br>Haughty Weaving Body, Ride the Clouds in the Wind, launch needles at enemy in front, causes {@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets pierced deeply by needles are immobilized for 1 second; the last needle damages their tendons, causing target to be unable to use flying skills for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_01_3=<font color="#9932CD">- Turning Back the Yinyang, Horned Finger Seizes the Needle-</font><br>Haughty Weaving Body, Ride the Clouds in the Wind, launch needles at enemy in front, causes {@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets pierced deeply by needles are immobilized for 1 second; the last needle damages their tendons, causing target to be unable to use flying skills for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_01_4=<font color="#9932CD">- Turning Back the Yinyang, Horned Finger Seizes the Needle-</font><br>Haughty Weaving Body, Ride the Clouds in the Wind, launch needles at enemy in front, causes {@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets pierced deeply by needles are immobilized for 1 second; the last needle damages their tendons, causing target to be unable to use flying skills for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_01_5=<font color="#9932CD">- Turning Back the Yinyang, Horned Finger Seizes the Needle-</font><br>Haughty Weaving Body, Ride the Clouds in the Wind, launch needles at enemy in front, causes {@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets pierced deeply by needles are immobilized for 1 second; the last needle damages their tendons, causing target to be unable to use flying skills for 5 seconds.
CS_ng_jh_507_02=Wasp of Snow
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_02_1=<font color="#9932CD">-Potion Shaping Skeleton, Threading Needle Guide-</font><br>Sword Chi Transformation, Silk Flying Needles - Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets in contact with the spider's silk cannot move for 6 seconds. Attacking cab remove the spider's web.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_02_2=<font color="#9932CD">-Potion Shaping Skeleton, Threading Needle Guide-</font><br>Sword Chi Transformation, Silk Flying Needles, cause enemies in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets that are touched and stuck by spider's silk cannot move for 6 seconds, when soft spider's web is attacked by external power, it can be automatically cut open.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_02_3=<font color="#9932CD">-Potion Shaping Skeleton, Threading Needle Guide-</font><br>Sword Chi Transformation, Silk Flying Needles, cause enemies in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets that are touched and stuck by spider's silk cannot move for 6 seconds, when soft spider's web is attacked by external power, it can be automatically cut open.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_02_4=<font color="#9932CD">-Potion Shaping Skeleton, Threading Needle Guide-</font><br>Sword Chi Transformation, Silk Flying Needles, cause enemies in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets that are touched and stuck by spider's silk cannot move for 6 seconds, when soft spider's web is attacked by external power, it can be automatically cut open.
desc_CS_ng_jh_507_02_5=<font color="#9932CD">-Potion Shaping Skeleton, Threading Needle Guide-</font><br>Sword Chi Transformation, Silk Flying Needles, cause enemies in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>Targets that are touched and stuck by spider's silk cannot move for 6 seconds, when soft spider's web is attacked by external power, it can be automatically cut open.
