fb_Npc_jh_dldm01=Iron Force and Steal Fist
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm01_1=Pummeling fists fly at the enemy, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the enemy does not parry, he will fall under the <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Might of the Iron Fist</font> state: Enemies hit by the <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Claw Explores Darkness</font> attack will suffer even greater damage.<br>If the enemy is under five stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Approaching</font>, he will be beaten back.
fb_Npc_jh_dldm02=Ghost Shadow Scares Goose
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm02_1=The iron cord is sharp, its movements cunning. This move inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on enemies.<br>If you break the enemy's parry, this movement can cause him to suffer <font color="#FFAE00">Turbid Blood</font>, and when struck by the iron claws he will suffer extra external damage.
fb_Npc_jh_dldm03=White Bones Claim the Soul
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm03_1=The thieving claws of a ghost ensnare the enemy and deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be tightly bound and cannot move.<br>This move will not be successful if executed while close to the enemy.
fb_Npc_jh_dldm04=Possessed by Ghosts
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm04_1=Tie to your arm a steel cord, tough and unyielding, that greets the enemy. After you parry, use this to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Approaching</font> state to the enemy for eight seconds. The effect can be stacked.
fb_Npc_jh_dldm05=Ghost Claw Explores Darkness
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm05_1=Persistent like a ghost giving chase, this movement inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy; <br>If the enemy does not parry in time, you can pull him to you, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font>.<br>This move is difficult to pull off if the enemy is too close to you.
fb_Npc_jh_dldm06=The Scent of Bloodshed
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm06_1=Sharp claws fly at opponents around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If the enemies are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Qi and Blood Disorder</font> state, your flying claws can inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Power of the Iron Chain</font>, and damage is increased.
fb_Npc_jh_dldm07=Desert Ghost
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dldm07_1=The lonely spirit descends to the earth, and a thousand claws grab for the enemy's heart, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>Enemies that do not parry will be knocked back.
fb_Npc_jh_yqq01=Wild Shot Fist-1
desc_fb_Npc_jh_yqq01_1=Flying steps, falling fist strike. Cause {@0:伤害包} to the front target.<br>(Ignore damage and decrease target's defense for external skills.)
fb_Npc_jh_yqq02=Wild Shot Fist-2
desc_fb_Npc_jh_yqq02_1=Charging Skill, Flipping Fracture Strike, Elegantly Unpretentious: targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
fb_Npc_jh_yqq03=Wild Shot Fist-3
desc_fb_Npc_jh_yqq03_1=Charging Skill, Scratching Base Strike, Wrapped Fist Strike: Targets receive {@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding target. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
fb_Npc_jh_yqq04=Wild Shot Fist-4
desc_fb_Npc_jh_yqq04_1=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
fb_Npc_jh_yqq05=Wild Shot Fist-5
desc_fb_Npc_jh_yqq05_1=Wild nature appearing, modesty. After every successful parry, gain state: Attack ignoring target and decrease parry by 2.5%. It can be accumulated 10 tiers (Each attack will consume one tier when this Move is used to attack parrying enemy).
fb_Npc_jh_yqq06=Wild Shot Fist-6
desc_fb_Npc_jh_yqq06_1=Wild Nature Explosion, Disordered Wilderness, Confidently Advance with Fists: Squeezed targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down.
fb_Npc_jh_sbz06=Pit Dragon with Regret
desc_fb_Npc_jh_sbz06_1=Falling movement. The palm is powerful. Suppress the target and kneel down to slap the face. Then strike the enemy down on the ground. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
fb_Npc_jh_sbz05=The Soaring Dragon in the Sky
desc_fb_Npc_jh_sbz05_1=Charge towards the target to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This skill can be charged. When fully charged for 1.5 seconds, enemies are knocked back.
fb_Npc_jh_sbz04=Black dragon swings tail
desc_fb_Npc_jh_sbz04_1=Slippery movement while striking a cool posture. If Endurance is successful: You may have a chance to make the enemies who have <font color="#FFAE00">"Low Dragon"</font> mark Faint.
fb_Npc_jh_sbz03=Hiding a Dragon is Useless
desc_fb_Npc_jh_sbz03_1=Pretend to slap the target's face, but stab his eyes on the sly. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>When you succeed in breaking the enemy's defenses, add <font color="#FFAE00">"Hiding Dragon"</font> state to the target: Make the target's eyes hazy and cause hallucination. The scenes in this view become misty. This state will last for 3 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_sbz02=Dragons Without Hands
desc_fb_Npc_jh_sbz02_1=Hit the target's face to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the targetsstill under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>, also fall under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>, which randomizes the target's key bindings for 6 seconds. (The duration can be stacked with the stack count of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> effect.)
fb_Npc_jh_sbz01=Low Dragon in the Field
desc_fb_Npc_jh_sbz01_1=Slap enemies in the face and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies in front. <br>Inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Low Dragon"</font> marks to enemies: Reduce the hit rate of Internal and External Skills. It can be stacked 2 times at most. <br>Also add <font color="#FFAE00">"Kicking Someone When They're Down"</font> state: The enemy can be lashed after being heavily wounded. This state will last 20 seconds.
desc_fb_Npc_jy_dqd07_1=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_fb_Npc_jy_dqd06_1=Violent Rage, dance of metempsychosis, force from the netherworld erodes the target and causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Teeter the target's body: there is a great possibility of falling when starting to attack or using flying skill. If the target is in the air, it will fall directly.
desc_fb_Npc_jy_dqd05_1=Parry move of Emotion Breaking Blade, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Break Love</font> blade force, can stack 5 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Emotion Breaking Blade skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_fb_Npc_jy_dqd04_1=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_fb_Npc_jy_dqd03_1=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_fb_Npc_jy_dqd02_1=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf01_1=Brandish your blade and deliver a sweeping chop that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front. This movement give you one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font>.<br>(If the target has a multiple of 3 stacking number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> or has reached the upper limit, skill will deal extra damage ignoring parry.)
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf02_1=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf03_1=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf04_1=A defense movement. A serene chi enters your blade, and when you successfully block ten of an enemy's attacks, and the enemy is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> energy, his breathing will be thrown into chaos and he will not be able to execute any movement for three seconds.
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf05_1=Hurl your blade like the mighty sun illuminating the sky, hitting enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>The dazzling knife blade adds <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state to the target, and as a result if the enemy circulates chi or performs any movement, the effect has a chance based on the number of stacks to increase.<br>(If the enemy target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state or has reached the limit, you will be able to inflict additional unblockable damage.
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf06_1=A flying kick smashes the target, and you then follow up with a stab to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement also converts the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font> stored in your body to <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> that is transferred to the enemy;<br>If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, true chi will prevent the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> stacks from increasing, weakening the enemy: Martial arts effectiveness and movement speed are reduced.
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jwdf07_1=Sun Chaser. The burning fire shoots up to the sky. Throw enemies in front of you into sky and resist their blades with Chi. Multiple chops inflict {@0:伤害包}; <br>Every time you hit the enemy's body, the player will activate a layer of hidden <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning"</font> air hidden in the enemy's body and make it explode. When the attack ends, the rest <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning"</font> air will be ignited.
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd01=Deadly Shout
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd01_1=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd02=Take the Soul and Life
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd02_1=A sharp dagger turns as it flies, full of searing energy. The attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage at enemies in front of you. <br>At the same time, attack adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Theft of Souls"</font> internal damage: every time the target uses Flying Skills, more internal damage is sustained. <br>After a period of time, the internal damage is triggered, resulting in massive injury.
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd03=Endless Inferno
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd03_1=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd04=Whirlwind of Death
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd04_1=Your dagger yearns to taste blood, and this vicious strike dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage can satiate it. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, every ensuing attack will add a layer of internal damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd05=Eternal Struggle
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd05_1=A simple falling strike, and your sharp dagger inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the target; <br>When you break the enemy's parry, you can cause the target to suffer even greater internal damage over a short period.
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd06=Soul Entrapment
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd06_1=A movement of dominating energy.<br>If the opponent is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> Energy, his HP will be winnowed away; <br>If the enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, his inner Energy will be affected.
fb_Npc_jh_ghqd07=Hell on Earth
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ghqd07_1=A veritable soul-stealing dance of seven lethal grabs. Consecutively strike the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Each attack can trigger the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage and <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, inflicting additional external damage.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq01=White Crane Spreads Its Wings
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq01_1=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq02=Splitting a Wild Horse's Mane
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq02_1=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_wd_tjq03=Two Peaks Through One's Ears
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq03_1=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq04=Golden Hen Standing on One Foot (Ancient Manual)
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq04_1=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq05=Seemingly Sealed Off
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq05_1=Overcome hardness with softness. Circulate your chi and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> effect, which removes any debuffs placed on you and absorbs some damage; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> is broken or when its effect naturally wears off, the damage it absorbs will be transferred to nearby enemies.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq06=The Wyvern Leaves the Sea
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq06_1=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq07=Pluck the Peacock's Plume (Ancient Manual)
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq07_1=Outflank the enemy with this move and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Dispel</font> buff to yourself: Absorb damage while recovering your inner Energy and HP.
fb_Npc_wd_tjq08=Opening the Tai Chi
desc_fb_Npc_wd_tjq08_1=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq01=Strike the Seven Stars
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq01_1=Cunning fist skill, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq02=Mantis Flips the Cart
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq02_1=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_jh_tlq03=Inquistive Mantis
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq03_1=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq04=Mantis Breaks Cart
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq04_1=Charging Skill -  After concentrating energy, burst through the air to attack, dealing targets {@0:damage packet}; <br>When you have<font color="#f9fc00">State of Concentration</font>or<font color="#FFAE00">“Burning Rage”</font>: You can knock back targets and inflict them with<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>status (Unable to defend for 3 seconds). You gain<font color="#FFAE00">“Deeper Damage”</font>for a short period, dealing additional damage.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq04_sky=Mantis Breaks Cart (Air)
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq04_sky_1=Gather Energy for 1.5 seconds and strike hard to shock target and make him can't parry in 3 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq05=Pierce Throat with Two Fingers
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq05_1=Your fist is like a spear, both overt and feint. Stab at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's parry you can knock him back, preventing him from moving for two seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq06=Mantis Spreads Wings
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq06_1=Block movement, there is a chance to activate potential when blocking, increase 30% power of "Mantis Breaks Cart", and can be released instantly in the air.
fb_Npc_jh_tlq07=Mantis Stalks a Cicada
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tlq07_1=Control the foolish with cleverness. Your fist appears from the left, appearing to travel to the right. In fact it is an encircling, ringed string that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs01_1=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs02_1=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs03_1=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs04_1=Block move - a successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked.
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs05_1=Charging movement, bend your arm like a bow, and then strike like a spring, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, he will be paralyzed.<br> (This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs06_1=Soar without casting a shadow and claw at the enemy's heart to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and applying one level of Emptiness to him; <br>If you execute this attack while on the ground and hit an airborne enemy, the target will be grounded and will suffer additional damage.
desc_fb_Npc_sl_lzs07_1=Move like a wandering dragon, attack with claw, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf01_1=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf02_1=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf03_1=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf04_1=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf05_1=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 15 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds him for three seconds.
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf06_1=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant; <br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For four seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf07_1=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
desc_fb_Npc_gb_dgbf08_1=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf01=Mad Demon Devours the Sun
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf01_1=Hop and jump straight up, wielding the staff effortlessly to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf02=Crazed Demon Rends the Sea
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf02_1=Viciously attack an enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can used with Flying Skills to approach the target quickly.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf03=A Demon Unhinged
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf03_1=Mad Qi, Mania: body instantly becomes hard like stone. You will not be restricted by any Moves, lasting for 1.5 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf04=Vicious Devil Smashes the Hills
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} and knock down one target in the selected area. Adds "Devil Follow": for each time they get hit, they will be knocked down twice, causing "Fall Damage". When they get hit by the skills of this set, they will take extra damage. Lasts 10 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf05=Descend Into Madness
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf05_1=A sensitive movement. Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using moves from the Mad Devil set are increased by 20%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf06=Enraged Devil Shatters Armor
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf06_1=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf07=Demon Razes the World
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf07_1=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 30% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf08=Dance of the Mad Demon
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf08_1=Attack all enemies in front of you and deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf09=Inner Demon Pushes the Spirit
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf09_1=A soul-destroying move. Fly over and charge at your target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can only be used against airborne targets.)
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf02_sky=Crazed Demon Rends the Sea (Air)
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf02_sky_1=Attack enemy insanely, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
fb_Npc_jh_fmzf08_sky=Dance of the Mad Demon (Air)
desc_fb_Npc_jh_fmzf08_sky_1=Inflict a crazed strike on the enemy to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt01=Devil Tramples Seven Stars
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt01_1=Attack continuously, deal {@0:伤害包}.
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt02=Demon Arises from the Void
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt02_1=The heart of a demon, the hands of a devil. Bring the enemy towards you, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage.
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt03=Heartless Demon
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt03_1=A charging skill. Demonic hands claw at the target, hurling him to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt04=To Search with the Demon's Eye
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt04_1=A quick fist strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you break the target's parry, you put him in the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Eye</font> state: This lowers the enemy's Internal and External Parry and increases the amount of damage taken from <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt05=Demon and Villain Parting Ways
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt05_1=A defensive movement in which a demonic air surrounds your body, allowing you to add either the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font> or the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Taoist Overrun</font> state to yourself when you successfully parry. either will increase your movement speed by 20? and you will not be able to be sent flying, knocked back, knocked down, or locked. Your anti-disease activities will be limited.
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt06=Crossing the Demon's Breath
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt06_1=A demon of the unholy ways, you hurl a vicious poison that envelops both you and surrounding enemies. The effect lowers enemies' movement speed and prevents them from using flying skills.<br>If you use this move again or use other moves from this set after using this move once, the poison effect will be cancelled.
fb_Npc_jh_tmjt07=Magical Rampage
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx01=Demons Dance
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx01_1=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx02=Demons Plunder the Soul
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx02_1=A charging move. Surge forward like a mad ghost and chop at the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When your Rage points are greater than 60, the damage inflicted by your critical hit will increase by 30%.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the grater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx03=Demon Shadow Devours the Soul
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx03_1=Break through the air with lethal chops to enemies in front of you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you break a parry, you can hit the enemy and leave him more vulnerable to critical hits;<br>If your Rage points top 60, when you break an enemy's parry you can send him flying.<br>(The higher your rage points, the greater your chance of landing a critical hit.)
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx04=Thousand Ghosts Ensnare the Heart
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx04_1=Charge forward, revealing an amazing chop only at the last minute, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This move has a 100% chance of landing a critical hit on airborne targets;<br>When your rage points top 60, damage from critical hits that you land is increased by 30%.<br>(The higher your rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx05=Evil Destroys All
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx05_1=Defense stance, Genuine Chi surrounds the body, when the Endurance is successful: Reduce target's tenacity and make it easier to suffer a Critical Hit. <br>When your rage is over 60, you won't consume HP during next attack.
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx06=Evil Spirit Cracks the Skull
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx06_1=Your blood boils and travels backwards in its veins, converting 45% of your inner Energy into 60 Rage points for up to seven seconds;<br>Every time you use this movement you can reset the duration of your Rage. The rage accumulated by this move cannot be stacked.
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx07=Rain of Ghost Blood
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx07_1=Intrigue Spell, Withered Wood Rivival, it can convert all Rage into HP. 1 Rage recovers 0.2% HP.
fb_Npc_jh_dpgx08=Descent of the Demon
desc_fb_Npc_jh_dpgx08_1=A blood sacrifice that gives you the power of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Demon Comes to the World</font>, which protects your chi. The effect reduces damage taken by 40%. After you execute this move, ensuing moves from this set will not use up any HP.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf01=Aurora Thunder Slash
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf01_1=A lightning strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font> and will be dealt continued damage that increases with stacks.<br>This is one of the moves that <font color="#FFAE00">Qian Xizhi</font> likes to use.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf02=Chi of the Returning Sword
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf02_1=Wield a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will cause him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block he will suffer damage if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often used this move to break enemy's parries.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf03=Shadow of the Sword
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf03_1=A movement that concentrates <font color="#FFAE00">Setting Sun Sword Chi</font> to protect oneself. After you parry you can cause <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> to fill the enemy's body while restoring some of your own inner energy.<br>This movement comes from <font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font>'s defense movements.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf04=Thirst for Blood
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf04_1=The setting sun bleeds as the sword swings. Your sword's chi sweeps the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry, he will be <font color="#FFAE00">Restrained</font>: If he uses flying skills he will suffer damage.<br>This move is one of the master skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Lifeng</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf05=Grievous Lament
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf05_1=Your sword's chi surges through the air to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and make enemies be unable to use the skills.<br>This movement causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>, and prevents the enemy from using any movements.<br>This move was one of the wild movements of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf06=The Red Dragon
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf06_1=A hidden sword sudden strikes, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry, a fire pit will be created around the enemy's position, preventing him from using flying skills and also causing him to take damage.<br>It's said that this move was associated with <font color="#FFAE00">Wei Buji</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf07=Silver Hook
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf07_1=Two dragons emerge from the sea, iron edges and silver claws. Charge towards the target and swiftly execute three strikes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)<br><font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Lifeng</font> often used this skill, to deadly effect.
fb_Npc_jh_cyjf08=The Cruel World
desc_fb_Npc_jh_cyjf08_1=Your sword is like the setting sun searing the heavens. Wield it to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage upon surrounding enemies, and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>;<br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> and will be sent flying.<br>(The greater the effect of Lihuo Chi, the more the enemy will be sent flying.)<br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf01=The War
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf01_1=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 10 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf02=The Flame
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf02_1=Like a ghost pursuing its victim relentlessly, charge at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and cause him to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Tongues of Fire</font> state.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)<br>This was the master skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Guo Di</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf03=The Armor
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf03_1=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf04=The Elements
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf04_1=The five elements converge at the enemy's head, and his defenses vanish, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage. This movement increases you movement speed;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, his meridians will be affected. Movement speed will be increased, but he will suffer continued damage.<br>This movement is one of the master skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Tian Feng</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf05=The Sea
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy. If the target attempts to parry, he will fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Faint</font> state.<br>This was a clever maneuver of the <font color="#FFAE00">Old Housekeeper</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf06=The Yin Yang
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf06_1=Your opposing energies surge, inflicting {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies using both your yin and yang energies;<br>Your yang chi stays in the body will yin chi is passed on to the enemy.<br>This is the kung fu of the <font color="#FFAE00">Old Housekeeper</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
fb_Npc_jh_qyzf07=The Wrath
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qyzf07_1=Shake the earth with a jolt that reaches the enemy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy get hit by the first strike, enemey will be <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>, and the second hit will prevent enemy from using <font color="#FFAE00">flying skills</font>. If the enemy blocks, the third hit will make <font color="#FFAE00">be unable to block</font>;<br>This is the famous skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha01=World in a Fan
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha01_1=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha02=Bright Sun and Moon
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha02_1=Radiant like the sun and the moon, your two swords slash at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br/>This is the core skill of the Shaoxiaship of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Zhi'an</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha03=Steady Accumulation
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha03_1=Strike with sufficient preparation, concentrating all you might to attack the enemy to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. The longer you charge up for the attack, the more damage you can inflict. You can boost your damage to a maximum of 100%.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha04=Sand Piper Seizes the Waves
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha04_1=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha05=Split the Earth
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha05_1=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha06=The Miser
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha06_1=Focus you inner Energy to protect your body and enhance your defense capacities. Every successful parry strengthens your own defenses.<br/>This skill is the wisdom of the unscrupulous merchant <font color="#FFAE00">Shen Yishan</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha07=Flowers Through the Mist
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha07_1=Strike at the enemy's parry from an unexpected angle to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, causing the enemy to lose focus and hallucinate. This attack also causes the enemy to injure himself.<br/>This movement is one of the vicious methods of <font color="#FFAE00">Lu Xiaojiang</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha08=Deadly Quicksand
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha08_1=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (138 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
fb_Npc_jh_liusha09=Sand Tornado
desc_fb_Npc_jh_liusha09_1=A small tornado sweeps the earth, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies directly in front of you and lifting them into the air.<br/>A wild gust swirls the sands as the setting sun bleeds into the sky. The fires of Longmen Inn never go out, such is power of that place, cunning and shifting like the sands.
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs01=Dual Thunder Rocks the Earth
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs01_1=Slam the ground with both palms to deal {@0:damage packet}. Shock away all surrounding targets (Airborne targets are not damaged).
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs02=Heaven Frightening Finger Shake
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs02_1=Pull down airborne targets and deal{@0:damage packet} (Only effective against airborne targets)
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs03=Evil Wyvern Strikes Back
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs03_1=Grab targets from the ground and throw them behind you to deal{@0:damage packet} (Cool down with Toss into Clouds)
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs04=Toss into the Clouds
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs04_1=Damage targets on the ground and throw them forward to deal{@0:damage packet} (Using Evil Wyvern on Flying targets forces them into cool down)
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs05=Scatter Flowers into the Pines
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs05_1=Deal {@0:damage packet}, break target's defense and knock them down.
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs06=Wrapped Gold Strands
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs06_1=Parrying can be reflected on the enemy's attack within the attack range for 2 seconds (make enemy skills fail).
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs07=Chaotic Dance on the Wild Wind
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs07_1=Attack targets with "Chaotic Dance on the Wild Wind" and deal {@0:damage packet}
fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs08=First Wind of Spring
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jsfcs08_1=Continuously add a status effect each second. Increase base damage by 5% with each stacked level. After using, the status level decreases by one level each second.
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf01=Sudden Snow is Changeable
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf01_1=Standing on wall, spraying sword Qi. Chop front enemy and Deal {@0:伤害包} to them.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Surprise Snow"</font> state: Decrease Yan Xing and Cloud penetrating speed, it can be accumulated 3 times. (The third time attack will make target dizzy for 1 second.)
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf02=Sharp Frost and Shadow Snow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf02_1=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf03=Flying snow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf03_1=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf04=Walking in Snow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf04_1=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf05=Shattered Ice Becomes Snow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf05_1=Shatter weakness for a quick victory. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 1 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 6 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf06=Face the Wind and Ignore the Snow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf06_1=Cold posture, sword perseverance: When parrying successfully, you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Perseverance"</font> state, it can accumulate at most 3 tiers:<br>Activate self-esteem nature. The release process of "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Flying Snow" and "Traceless Falling Snow" is in Endurance state (consume one tier "Perseverance" state for each release).<br>Subside fury, decrease Rage consumption of "Disappointment Snow" (Each one tier "Perseverance" state will decrease 1 Rage consumption, each attack will consume one tier "Perseverance" state).
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf07=Traceless Falling Snow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf07_1=Rapid Shadow. Sprint to the selected region, knock down enemy within range and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy.
fb_Npc_jh_hyjf08=Snow without Trace
desc_fb_Npc_jh_hyjf08_1=Shadowless Seamless jump sword cut: The jump of range of enemy attack (attack with one second stiffness), up Zhanji the three times; the <br> If the target there <font color="#FFAE00"> "Jingxue" </font> state more, the higher the damage. <br> (cast moves need 10 rage attack every time consumes 10 rage)
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf01=Unparalleled Soul-breaking
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf01_1=Peerless Gentian Root, blade smashing soul, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Using the Move once will give you "<font color="#FFAE00">Peerlessness</font>" effect: After accumulating 6 levels, use this Move to strike target into the air, at the same time your "Peerlessness" state will be cleared.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Fang Wuhen</font> once used this Move to defeat many heroes.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf02=Whirlwind anger chop
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf02_1=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and cause {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 10 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf03=Drop of a Thousand Weight
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf03_1=With the force of 1,000 weights, fall to the ground and fight. Jump high into the air and come crashing down. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby target and make target on the ground within range Faint for 1 second. <br>Only <font color="#FFAE00">Wanyan Lasuo</font> can release this powerful Move.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf04=Heart Destroying
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf04_1=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: Impact target and inflict them with {@0:damage packet}. Deal target additional “<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and increase the“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuous damage and deals "Poison Explosion" to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" deals additional damage at level 6. <br> (Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)<br>This was <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>'s favored technique.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf05=Move like a shadow
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf05_1=Advancing courageously, moving like a shadow. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Break defense successfully to add "<font color="#FFAE00">Pursuing and Attack</font>" effect to target: Suffer continuous damage and decrease skill damage by 3%. This effect can stack 3 times at most, and lasts 10 seconds.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Xing Zhongtian</font> likes to use this Move to torture his enemy.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf06=Cold Fury
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf06_1=Resentful attitude, cunning counterattack. 20% probability to reflect 30% damage when holding Endurance successfully. Also gives you "Peerlessness" effect. <br>It was <font color="#FFAE00">A Lutai</font>'s Military fighting skill.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf07=Protect the Flowers
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf07_1=The sentiment of a falling flower. Protect the Flowers. Give yourself defending shield that absorbs some damage. The shield will go Furious if it isn't broken.<br>go Furious effect: Increase this Move attack by 50% and decrease defense by 100% for 5 seconds. <br>It is <font color="#FFAE00">Huerte</font>'s frequently-used Move.
fb_Npc_jh_jhdf08=Raging Storm of Blades
desc_fb_Npc_jh_jhdf08_1=Ever-shifting blade, circling around rapidly. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to target within range. <br>Blade spins around you, causing continuous damage to nearby targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Ma Jier</font> always uses this Move to torture prisoners.
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf01=Feigned Defeat
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf01_1=Sweep with staff, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in 5 meter radius in front. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> state, attacks may Knock Back the enemy (The repelling effect ignores Endurance).
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf02=Lord's View
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf02_1=Charge up and wield your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">No Failure</font> state, you may increase charging distance and speed. <br>(The skill can be used with flying skills to approach the target.)
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf03=Will of Death
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf03_1=Prepare the staff and concentrate your power to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to all enemies in front; <br>Upon breaking the target's Endurance, give the<font color="#FFAE00"> Desperation </font> buff to target: Fall to the ground when using Flying Skills. This lasts for 4 seconds and the effects are removed after triggered.
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf04=Undefeated
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf04_1=Control your footsteps and Recover, freely switching between two stances: <br> <font color="#f9fc00">Flaunting Stance</font> Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> buff: Skill <font color="#FFAE00">[Feigned Defeat]</font> range increases by 3 meters, <font color="#FFAE00">[Admitted Defeat]</font> range increase by 8 meters, ranges for other skills of the set increase by 2 meters;<br> <font color="#f9fc00">Restraining Stance</font> Upon enduring an attack, gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Unbeatable</font> buff: Increase damage by 6 points of each hit in the move, <font color="#FFAE00">[Evil Wind Slays the God]</font> with a bonus of 11 points; Increase the charge distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">[Lord's View] and [Winner's Rule]</font>.
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf05=Admitted Defeat
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf05_1=Throw your staff, which will hit the target and return to your hand, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The target will be Knocked Back if on the ground. The target will be sent flying if in air. <br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Failure</font> state, the flying and Knock Back effects of the skill will ignore the target's Endurance.
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf06=Turning Tables
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf06_1=Give yourself the <font color="#FFAE00">Turning Tables</font> state. The next time you take a hit, 50% of the damage taken will be reflected, and the attacker's acupoints will be hit for 1 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf07=Winner's Rule
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf07_1=Charging move. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">No Failure</font> state, you may increase charging distance and speed. <br>(The skill can be used with flying skills to approach the target.)
fb_Npc_jh_qbgf08=Evil Wind Slays the God
desc_fb_Npc_jh_qbgf08_1=Evil rises again to seek enemies. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>Each attack with the skill will give extra damage equal to 2% of the target's HP (Only available to players). <br>(You can move when using the skill.)
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf01=Flowing Water and Cloud
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf01_1=Draw your body back and shake your sword. Its Sword Chi is terrible. Cut the target and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf02=Thunder is Fast. The Clouds are Mysterious
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf02_1=Flowing Cloud Fast Sword - Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>Inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font> status: Gain an extra 15% damage after being attacked by this set.
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf03=Broken Rain and Clouds
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf03_1=The clouds have not dissipated. The attack of the sword is over. Sword Chi shoots out like a shock of yarn. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front. <br>Paralyze for 3 seconds and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Break Rain Residual Cloud"</font> state to him.
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf04=Clouds Come Up From Dragon
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf04_1=Hold the sword and restrain Chi. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies in the chosen region. The range is 20 meters. <br>If there is a <font color="#FFAE00">"Break Rain Residual Cloud"</font> state on the target, then the target will be hit away.
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf05=Cloud Ocean Sad Thoughts
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf05_1=Head down; sword drawn. Sword Chi flies out and inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the target in front. <br>If you succeed in breaking defense, the target will not be able to use Flying Skills for a time.
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf06=Tailor the Moon and Carve the Cloud
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf06_1=Flowing cloud script. Change from the defensive to the offensive. If the Parry is successful: Release <font color="#FFAE00">Flowing Cloud Sword Chi</font> to the target: Sword Chi shoots off, inflict damage to the target and reduce 30% speed. The decelerate effect will affect enemies within 8 meters of the target. (Interval Time for triggering is 6 seconds.)
fb_Npc_jh_lyjf07=Disappear In A Flash
desc_fb_Npc_jh_lyjf07_1=Turn back to hide in the flowers and wave the sword like a butterfly's wings. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies around you and attack send them flying.
fb_Npc_tm_ywt01=Reaper's Rage
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt01_1=Viciously hurl a dart at a target, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(For this move you can charge up your Energy for added effect.)
fb_Npc_tm_ywt02=Rip the Heart
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt02_1=The clever fox has many burrows, slipping in and out of them with ease. A stab attack in which you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage then leap away.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
fb_Npc_tm_ywt03=Hunt the Soul
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage by consecutively hurling three darts; <br>The attack deals extra damage with each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font>.
fb_Npc_tm_ywt04=Wicked Spirit Blocks the Way
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt04_1=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered.
fb_Npc_tm_ywt05=Soup of Oblivion
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt05_1=A stun movement, deals {@0: 伤害包} to target. When you break the enemy's defense you can use this move to poison them, debuffing the enemy with the <font color="#FFAE00">Unconcious</font> state. The effect, which is similar to Vertigo, lasts three seconds.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Unconcious</font> state will be cancelled if the target takes any damage.
fb_Npc_tm_ywt06=Wronged Ghost at Your Feet
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt06_1=A secret move of the king of the underworld. Hurl an <font color="#FFAE00">Oil Bomb</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect and snares enemies caught in it for three seconds. They also take considerable damage; <br>Affected enemies also have their movement speed reduced by 20% and their flying skills are limited. This debuff cannot be stacked; <br>Affected enemies will also have the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> debuff added to them, with one stack added each second for a maximum of 25 stacks.<br>(The trap lasts 30 seconds and its effects last 30 seconds when triggered.)
fb_Npc_tm_ywt07=Brush of the Underworld Judge
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt07_1=The rains turn to shooting stars. Shoot at the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, making him rigid.<br>(This movement can be executed while moving.)
fb_Npc_tm_ywt08=Record of the Underworld Judge
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt08_1=It's very risky. Blow up all the <font color="#FFAE00">Explosive Traps</font> set by Wild Ghost Startles the Spirit quickly.
fb_Npc_tm_ywt09=Rage of the Lost Souls
desc_fb_Npc_tm_ywt09_1=Set a explosive trap. It only can be triggered manually.
fb_Npc_XJSkill_ywt06=Paralyzed
desc_fb_Npc_XJSkill_ywt06_1=<s>
fb_Npc_XJSkill_ywt04=Fire up the flame
desc_fb_Npc_XJSkill_ywt04_1=<s>
fb_Npc_XJSkill_ywt09=Explosion
desc_fb_Npc_XJSkill_ywt09_1=<s>
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf01_1=Standing with a sword, One Look Enamored the Whole City. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>This skill can gather strength and increase skill power. After built up and released, the skill can punch enemies in front away.
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf02_1=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf03_1=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf04_1=Yu Nv Sword, the two attacks come continuously, stab target and send flying, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will attach 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Weapon</font> for yourself.<br>(This skill can only attack target in air.)
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf05_1=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf06_1=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf07_1=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_fb_Npc_em_ynjf08_1=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd01=Bath the World with Blood
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd01_1=Throw the heart digging claw out, bind the enemies in selected area to together for 2 seconds, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>The bound enemies will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bloody Death Blade</font>, and then they will burn friendly targets in 5 meters around, last 6 seconds.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd02=Eradication
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd02_1=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd03=Chaotic Battlefield
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd03_1=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
fb_Npc_jy_xsd04=Bloody Battle
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd04_1=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd05=Bloody Dust
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd05_1=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd06_1=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance, let enemy pay with blood for blood. Each successful parry will give you 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> (Can stack to 3 floors at most): Make this set's attack attach 20% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 floor of Blood Thirsty Will.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd07=Kill Indiscriminately
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd07_1=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd08=Bloody Edge
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd08_1=Drink enemy's blood, kick target down on the ground, and then chop with blade to kill target, deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target. The movement will drain the enemy's blood, to recover your own HP. The draining effect is 20%.
fb_Npc_jy_xsd08_sky=Cold blood drinking (in the air)
desc_fb_Npc_jy_xsd08_sky_1=Brutal Violence Move. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, absorb fresh blood continuously from target to and replenish your own HP. HP absorption is 20%.
desc_fb_Npc_jz_yxjf01_1=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state, reducing his movement speed.
desc_fb_Npc_jz_yxjf02_1=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_fb_Npc_jz_yxjf03_1=The unique skill of the jade flute is to shake the sword and release a wave of sound at the target. It will <font color="#FFAE00">rebound</font> continuously among the enemies. <br>The damage to the targets who were attacked with Sound Wave's Rebounding: Attack damage, Stunned for 1 second and being limited to use flying skill for only 2 seconds. <br>At most, rebound and shoot will occur 5 times at most.
desc_fb_Npc_jz_yxjf04_1=Your sword and your will are one, and you carry a frigid bearing to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, the target will be paralyzed.
desc_fb_Npc_jz_yxjf06_1=Use sound as a sword and use your sword to make sound. Create a protective screen of a flute sound: The enemies will lose HP continuously within the protective screen. It will last sixteen seconds.
desc_fb_Npc_jz_yxjf07_1=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj01=Silenced by the Sword
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj01_1=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj02=Returning Wind Seizes the Moon
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj02_1=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj03=Cleave by the Green Sword
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj03_1=Store your might in this sword, and drill the target to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's defenses, you clear a large amount of the target's buffs and cancel his anti-disease buffs for a set period.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj04=Reflect the Sword
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj04_1=A defensive movement. Withdraw your sword, and for every successful parry you add a 20% chance of reducing the assailant's Rage by 2 points.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj05=Kneel to Watch Moon
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj05_1=A cloud-penetrating movement. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their movements. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj06=Lower Head and Kneel
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj06_1=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj07=Backstep and Counter
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj07_1=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj08=Passage of Time
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj08_1=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
fb_Npc_jl_dmssj09=Defy the Heaven
desc_fb_Npc_jl_dmssj09_1=Killing stunt, no life and no mercy, wield sword to chop hardly, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 24%, the skill will deal double damage.
fb_Npc_jh_ttg01=Boy Worshiping the Buddha
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg01_1=Charging move. Use your head to attack the enemy and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>At the same time, give the <font color="#FFAE00">Aching Head</font> state to target: When using this skill, you may increase the damage it deals. Each state you gain will increase damage by 5%. This may be stacked 3 times at most and lasts 15 seconds. <br>(The skill can be used with flying skills to approach the target.)
fb_Npc_jh_ttg02=Flying Moth Darts into Fire
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg02_1=Charge up, wait for your chance, then charge forward and butt into the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The skill requires 2 seconds. The damage dealt will increase along with casting time. After charging, you will receive a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Endure</font> state when you use the skill. You can then ignore blocking and being punched away. <br>(The max charging distance of the skill is 20 meters.)
fb_Npc_jh_ttg03=Warrior Knocks the Bell
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg03_1=Twisting Kick, Overhead Fierce Struggle: Targets in front of you receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>If this skill hits the target 3 times within 60 seconds, they will be launched.
fb_Npc_jh_ttg04=Child Hits the Drum
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg04_1=Wildly shake your head and attack the target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>After breaking the target's endurance, cause the target to have <font color="#FFAE00">Roar</font> state: this stuns for 3 seconds.
fb_Npc_jh_ttg05=Newborn Bull Fights the Tiger
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg05_1=Use your head to strike the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in area. <br>The chi wave will knock down nearby enemies and drag them close to you.
fb_Npc_jh_ttg06=Arhat's Crouching
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg06_1=Concentrate Chi Silently, Contract Muscles and Withdraw Bones: After landing this skill, you obtain the<font color="#FFAE00">“Mind's Focus”</font>effect: Absorb a small amount of parry damage and become immune to stuns. Active for 5 seconds. (Regulate the breath for 30 seconds)
fb_Npc_jh_ttg07=Bodhi's Brush
desc_fb_Npc_jh_ttg07_1=Use your head to attack target continuously to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.
fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd01=Persistent Ghost
desc_fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd01_1=Chop with blade, the icy force deals {@0:伤害包} to target, and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Chase Soul"</font>.
fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd02=Haunted Travel
desc_fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd02_1=A flying strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Damage inflicted corresponds to the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing Needle</font> and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd03=One Longly Soul Attracts Another
desc_fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd03_1=Turn body and attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>The force will hurt enemy's merdians, make target lose extra Energy when use flying skill.
fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd04=Wild Ghost Snare
desc_fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd04_1=Use trick to tease fool, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. Can break enemy's parry and repel him.
fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd05=Ghostly Shadow Feint Step
desc_fb_Npc_tm_tmzhd05_1=Block Move - Move like a ghost. Successful parry can greatly increase movement speed. Effect lasts 2 seconds. <br>The attacker has a certain chance of gaining the <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> effect.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz01=Finding One's Way in the Snow
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz01_1=An effortless palm strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz02=Proud Snow Chases the Cloud
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz02_1=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz03=Snow Amid A Gentle Breeze
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz03_1=A movement of wind and snow that levels swirling ice at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包};<br>When you break the target's parry, you can gain HP and improve blood circulation.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz04=Falling Snow Turns to Frost
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz04_1=Slowly cultivate your chi to release ice Energy around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies and boost your companions' Brawn.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz05=Noble and Pure
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz05_1=Clear icy air raises your own balance and your companions' balance, simultaneously eliminating any movement impairments.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz06=Goose Steps on Snow
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz06_1=A blocking movement. After blocking, you will be able to block most debuffs for 6 seconds.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz07=Glacier in Sea of Clouds
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz07_1=An advanced movement. Snow and ice surge and a freezing gust picks up, inflicting {@0:伤害包} on all incoming enemies;<br><font color="#FFAE00">Icy Air Invasion</font> slows the enemy's movement speed and prevents the enemy from using Flying Skills.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz08=Uplifting Melody
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz08_1=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
fb_Npc_em_pxcyz08_sky=Uplifting Melody (Air)
desc_fb_Npc_em_pxcyz08_sky_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}. When this attack is executed in mid-air, the attacker drops down quickly to inflict damage in an area-of-effect, reducing the dexterity of targets.
Npc_jh_tmjt01=Devil Tramples Seven Stars
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt01_1=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: Deal damage to enemies in front of you.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt01_2=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: causes damage to enemies in front.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt01_3=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: causes damage to enemies in front.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt01_4=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: causes damage to enemies in front.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt01_5=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: causes damage to enemies in front.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt01_6=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: causes damage to enemies in front.
Npc_jh_dpgx01=Demons Dance
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx01_1=Attacking while moving deals damage to enemies in front of you; <br>Each critical hit decreases<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>. 2 second Chi recovery time.<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit stuns for 0.5 seconds. <br> (The higher your rage, the higher the critical hit rate)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx01_2=Waving dagger during free movement, cause damage to enemies in front; <br>With each critical hit, reduce<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>2-second recover Chi time'<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit comes with 0.5 seconds of the stun effect. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx01_3=Waving dagger during free movement, cause damage to enemies in front; <br>With each critical hit, reduce<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>2-second recover Chi time'<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit comes with 0.5 seconds of the stun effect. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx01_4=Waving dagger during free movement, cause damage to enemies in front; <br>With each critical hit, reduce<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>2-second recover Chi time'<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit comes with 0.5 seconds of the stun effect. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx01_5=Waving dagger during free movement, cause damage to enemies in front; <br>With each critical hit, reduce<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>2-second recover Chi time'<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit comes with 0.5 seconds of the stun effect. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx01_6=Waving dagger during free movement, cause damage to enemies in front; <br>With each critical hit, reduce<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>2-second recover Chi time'<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit comes with 0.5 seconds of the stun effect. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
Npc_jh_tlq01=Strike the Seven Stars
desc_Npc_jh_tlq01_1=Cunning Fist Drill, Fast and Fierce Repeated Strikes: Deal damage to target.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq01_2=Fist Power Drill, Fast and Fierce Repeated Strikes: causes damage to target.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq01_3=Fist Power Drill, Fast and Fierce Repeated Strikes: causes damage to target.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq01_4=Fist Power Drill, Fast and Fierce Repeated Strikes: causes damage to target.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq01_5=Fist Power Drill, Fast and Fierce Repeated Strikes: causes damage to target.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq01_6=Fist Power Drill, Fast and Fierce Repeated Strikes: causes damage to target.
Npc_jh_tmjt02=Demon Arises from the Void
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt02_1=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: Pull target toward yourself and damage them.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt02_2=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: throw target to your direction and cause damage to them.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt02_3=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: throw target to your direction and cause damage to them.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt02_4=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: throw target to your direction and cause damage to them.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt02_5=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: throw target to your direction and cause damage to them.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt02_6=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: throw target to your direction and cause damage to them.
Npc_jh_dpgx02=Demons Plunder the Soul
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx02_1=Charging Skill, Fast as Fleeing Soul: Repeatedly chop target. Once your rage is above 60, your critical hit rate is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage, the higher the critical hit rate is)<br> (Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx02_2=Charging Skill, Fast as Fleeing Soul: repeatedly chop target to cause damage, and when your rage is greater than 60, the critical hit rate is raised by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx02_3=Charging Skill, Fast as Fleeing Soul: repeatedly chop target to cause damage, and when your rage is greater than 60, the critical hit rate is raised by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx02_4=Charging Skill, Fast as Fleeing Soul: repeatedly chop target to cause damage, and when your rage is greater than 60, the critical hit rate is raised by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx02_5=Charging Skill, Fast as Fleeing Soul: repeatedly chop target to cause damage, and when your rage is greater than 60, the critical hit rate is raised by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx02_6=Charging Skill, Fast as Fleeing Soul: repeatedly chop target to cause damage, and when your rage is greater than 60, the critical hit rate is raised by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
Npc_jh_tlq02=Mantis Flips the Cart
desc_Npc_jh_tlq02_1=Flexibly Recoiling, Continuous Nimble Strike: Deals damage to targets; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font> is active, you can knock targets down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)
desc_Npc_jh_tlq02_2=Flexibly Recoiling, Continuous Nimble Strike: causes damage to targets; <br>When you have<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>, then you can knock them down. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tlq02_3=Flexibly Recoiling, Continuous Nimble Strike: causes damage to targets; <br>When you have<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>, then you can knock them down. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tlq02_4=Flexibly Recoiling, Continuous Nimble Strike: causes damage to targets; <br>When you have<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>, then you can knock them down. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tlq02_5=Flexibly Recoiling, Continuous Nimble Strike: causes damage to targets; <br>When you have<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>, then you can knock them down. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tlq02_6=Flexibly Recoiling, Continuous Nimble Strike: causes damage to targets; <br>When you have<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>, then you can knock them down. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
Npc_jh_tmjt03=Heartless Demon
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt03_1=Charge and lacerate target with demon claws and vigorously throw them. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt03_2=Charging skill, scratch target with demon claws and vigorously throw them to cause them damage. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt03_3=Charging skill, scratch target with demon claws and vigorously throw them to cause them damage. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt03_4=Charging skill, scratch target with demon claws and vigorously throw them to cause them damage. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt03_5=Charging skill, scratch target with demon claws and vigorously throw them to cause them damage. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt03_6=Charging skill, scratch target with demon claws and vigorously throw them to cause them damage. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
Npc_jh_dpgx03=Demon Shadow Devours the Soul
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx03_1=Breaking Emptiness Chop - Attack targets in front of you; <br>When countering a parry, you can knock the target down and temporarily deal higher critical damage; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, you can launch the target when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage, the higher the critical hit rate)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx03_2=Breaking Emptiness Chop, forcefully kill enemies in front to cause damage; <br>When countering the parry, you can knock down the target and cause higher critical hit damage to them for a period of time; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, then you can even knock the target flying when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx03_3=Breaking Emptiness Chop, forcefully kill enemies in front to cause damage; <br>When countering the parry, you can knock down the target and cause higher critical hit damage to them for a period of time; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, then you can even knock the target flying when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx03_4=Breaking Emptiness Chop, forcefully kill enemies in front to cause damage; <br>When countering the parry, you can knock down the target and cause higher critical hit damage to them for a period of time; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, then you can even knock the target flying when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx03_5=Breaking Emptiness Chop, forcefully kill enemies in front to cause damage; <br>When countering the parry, you can knock down the target and cause higher critical hit damage to them for a period of time; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, then you can even knock the target flying when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx03_6=Breaking Emptiness Chop, forcefully kill enemies in front to cause damage; <br>When countering the parry, you can knock down the target and cause higher critical hit damage to them for a period of time; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, then you can even knock the target flying when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)
Npc_jh_tlq03=Inquistive Mantis
desc_Npc_jh_tlq03_1=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq03_2=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq03_3=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq03_4=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq03_5=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq03_6=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
Npc_jh_tmjt04=To Search with the Demon's Eye
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt04_1=Skill of Emptiness, Instantaneous Palm Thrust: Deal damage to targets in front of you; <br>When countering the target's parry, inflict <font color="#FFAE00">“Devil's Eye”</font>state: Decreases internal and external defense power and increases<font color="#FFAE00">[Crossing The Demon's Breath]</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt04_2=Skill of Emptiness, Instantaneous Palm Thrust: cause damage to targets in front; <br>When countering the target's parry, give them added<font color="#FFAE00">“Devil's Eye”</font>state: Reduce internal and external defense power, raise<font color="#FFAE00">[Crossing The Demon's Breath]</font>to cause damage.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt04_3=Skill of Emptiness, Instantaneous Palm Thrust: cause damage to targets in front; <br>When countering the target's parry, give them added<font color="#FFAE00">“Devil's Eye”</font>state: Reduce internal and external defense power, raise<font color="#FFAE00">[Crossing The Demon's Breath]</font>to cause damage.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt04_4=Skill of Emptiness, Instantaneous Palm Thrust: cause damage to targets in front; <br>When countering the target's parry, give them added<font color="#FFAE00">“Devil's Eye”</font>state: Reduce internal and external defense power, raise<font color="#FFAE00">[Crossing The Demon's Breath]</font>to cause damage.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt04_5=Skill of Emptiness, Instantaneous Palm Thrust: cause damage to targets in front; <br>When countering the target's parry, give them added<font color="#FFAE00">“Devil's Eye”</font>state: Reduce internal and external defense power, raise<font color="#FFAE00">[Crossing The Demon's Breath]</font>to cause damage.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt04_6=Skill of Emptiness, Instantaneous Palm Thrust: cause damage to targets in front; <br>When countering the target's parry, give them added<font color="#FFAE00">“Devil's Eye”</font>state: Reduce internal and external defense power, raise<font color="#FFAE00">[Crossing The Demon's Breath]</font>to cause damage.
Npc_jh_dpgx04=Thousand Ghosts Ensnare the Heart
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx04_1=Infinite Dagger Edge: Attack with skillful strikes; <br>Skill has a 100% critical hit rate against airborne targets; <br>When your rage is greater than 60, critical hit damage is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage, the higher the critical hit rate)<br> (Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx04_2=Charging Skill, Infinite Dagger Edge: make amazing strike to cause target damage; <br>Skill has 100% critical hit against mid-air targets; <br>when your rage is greater than 60, then the critical hit damage is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx04_3=Charging Skill, Infinite Dagger Edge: make amazing strike to cause target damage; <br>Skill has 100% critical hit against mid-air targets; <br>when your rage is greater than 60, then the critical hit damage is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx04_4=Charging Skill, Infinite Dagger Edge: make amazing strike to cause target damage; <br>Skill has 100% critical hit against mid-air targets; <br>when your rage is greater than 60, then the critical hit damage is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx04_5=Charging Skill, Infinite Dagger Edge: make amazing strike to cause target damage; <br>Skill has 100% critical hit against mid-air targets; <br>when your rage is greater than 60, then the critical hit damage is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx04_6=Charging Skill, Infinite Dagger Edge: make amazing strike to cause target damage; <br>Skill has 100% critical hit against mid-air targets; <br>when your rage is greater than 60, then the critical hit damage is increased by 30%. <br> (The higher your rage is, the higher the critical hit rate of your skill is.)<br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)
Npc_jh_tlq04=Mantis Breaks Cart
desc_Npc_jh_tlq04_1=Attack by bursting through the air; <br>When you have<font color="#f9fc00">State of Concentration</font>or <font color="#FFAE00">“Burning Rage”</font>: Knock away targets and inflict<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>status (Unable to defend for 3 seconds). You also receive<font color="#FFAE00">“Deeper Damage”</font>status(Deal additional damage).
desc_Npc_jh_tlq04_2=Charge Skill, after concentrating energy, burst through the air to attack, cause targets damage; <br>When you have<font color="#f9fc00">State of Concentration</font>or have<font color="#FFAE00">“Burning Rage”</font>: you can knock back targets and give targets<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>state (cannot defend for 3 seconds). You allow yourself to have<font color="#FFAE00">“Deeper Damage”</font>effect for a short time (deal additional damage with each attack).
desc_Npc_jh_tlq04_3=Charge Skill, after concentrating energy, burst through the air to attack, cause targets damage; <br>When you have<font color="#f9fc00">State of Concentration</font>or have<font color="#FFAE00">“Burning Rage”</font>: you can knock back targets and give targets<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>state (cannot defend for 3 seconds). You allow yourself to have<font color="#FFAE00">“Deeper Damage”</font>effect for a short time (deal additional damage with each attack).
