desc_Npc_jh_tlq04_5=Charge Skill, after concentrating energy, burst through the air to attack, cause targets damage; <br>When you have<font color="#f9fc00">State of Concentration</font>or have<font color="#FFAE00">“Burning Rage”</font>: you can knock back targets and give targets<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>state (cannot defend for 3 seconds). You allow yourself to have<font color="#FFAE00">“Deeper Damage”</font>effect for a short time (deal additional damage with each attack).
desc_Npc_jh_tlq04_6=Charge Skill, after concentrating energy, burst through the air to attack, cause targets damage; <br>When you have<font color="#f9fc00">State of Concentration</font>or have<font color="#FFAE00">“Burning Rage”</font>: you can knock back targets and give targets<font color="#FFAE00">“Broken Cart”</font>state (cannot defend for 3 seconds). You allow yourself to have<font color="#FFAE00">“Deeper Damage”</font>effect for a short time (deal additional damage with each attack).
Npc_jh_tmjt05=Demon and Villain Parting Ways
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt05_1=A defensive movement in which a demonic air surrounds your body, allowing you to add either the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font> or the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Taoist Overrun</font> state to yourself when you successfully parry. either will increase your movement speed by 20? and you will not be able to be sent flying, knocked back, knocked down, or locked. Your anti-disease activities will be limited.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt05_2=When in<font color="#FFAE00">“Crossing The Demon's Breath”</font>or<font color="#FFAE00">“Taking the Magical Path”</font>status, movement speed is increased by 25%. You cannot be launched, knocked back, knocked down, or locked.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt05_3=When in<font color="#FFAE00">“Crossing The Demon's Breath”</font>or<font color="#FFAE00">“Taking the Magical Path”</font>status, movement speed is increased by 25%. You cannot be launched, knocked back, knocked down, or locked.
