Npc_jh_dpgx05=Evil Destroys All
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx05_1=Defense stance, Genuine Chi surrounds the body, when the Endurance is successful: Reduce target's tenacity and make it easier to suffer a Critical Hit. <br>When your rage is over 60, you won't consume HP during next attack.
