Npc_jh_tmjt06=Crossing the Demon's Breath
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt06_1=A demon of the unholy ways, you hurl a vicious poison that envelops both you and surrounding enemies. The effect lowers enemies' movement speed and prevents them from using flying skills.<br>If you use this move again or use other moves from this set after using this move once, the poison effect will be cancelled.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt06_2=Make you and your enemies poisoned. Slow enemies' movement speed and make them unable to release a Flying Skill with 4% additional Yin damage done to them. <br>When release this skill again or other skills, poison effects will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt06_3=Make you and your enemies poisoned. Slow enemies' movement speed and make them unable to release a Flying Skill with 4% additional Yin damage done to them. <br>When release this skill again or other skills, poison effects will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt06_4=Make you and your enemies poisoned. Slow enemies' movement speed and make them unable to release a Flying Skill with 4% additional Yin damage done to them. <br>When release this skill again or other skills, poison effects will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt06_5=Make you and your enemies poisoned. Slow enemies' movement speed and make them unable to release a Flying Skill with 4% additional Yin damage done to them. <br>When release this skill again or other skills, poison effects will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_tmjt06_6=Twisted Path of the Demon: Spread strange poison on your body to infect surrounding targets;  decreasing their movement speed and disabling their Flying Skills. Those attack receive extra 8% Yin Damage. <br> Re-using this skill again will clear the poison effect.
Npc_jh_dpgx06=Evil Spirit Cracks the Skull
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx06_1=Your blood boils and travels backwards in its veins, converting 45% of your inner Energy into 60 Rage points for up to seven seconds;<br>Every time you use this movement you can reset the duration of your Rage. The rage accumulated by this move cannot be stacked.
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx06_2=A furious attack. Meridian converse. Converting 40% Energy into 60 Rage points for 7 secs. <br>able to reset the duration of the effect every time when using this stance.(Rage points can not stack up)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx06_3=A furious attack. Meridian converse. Converting 35% Energy into 60 Rage points for 7 secs. <br>able to reset the duration of the effect every time when using this stance.(Rage points can not stack up)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx06_4=A furious attack. Meridian converse. Converting 30% Energy into 60 Rage points for 7 secs. <br>able to reset the duration of the effect every time when using this stance.(Rage points can not stack up)
desc_Npc_jh_dpgx06_5=A furious attack. Meridian converse. Converting 25% Energy into 60 Rage points for 7 secs. <br>able to reset the duration of the effect every time when using this stance.(Rage points can not stack up)
