desc_Npc_jh_tlq06_1=Block movement, there is a chance to activate potential when blocking, increase 30% power of "Mantis Breaks Cart", and can be released instantly in the air.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq06_2=Low the body and use arms to protect yourself, it has 35% rate to motivate potential: increase power of Mantis Breaks Cart by 30%, and it can be used in the air at once.
desc_Npc_jh_tlq06_3=Low the body and use arms to protect yourself, it has 40% rate to motivate potential: increase power of Mantis Breaks Cart by 30%, and it can be used in the air at once.
