desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_f_1=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: Targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>and additional<font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (females only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If target also has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Males only)</font>, then they enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>status: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are immobilized for 1 second. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)
