desc_CS_jh_mlyqj08_f_3=Spilling the Good Wine, Piercing the Twilight Mist: Cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br> This skill can knock down mid-air targets.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj08_f_4=Spilling the Good Wine, Piercing the Twilight Mist: Cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br> This skill can knock down mid-air targets.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj08_f_5=Spilling the Good Wine, Piercing the Twilight Mist: Cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br> This skill can knock down mid-air targets.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj08_f_6=Spilling the Good Wine, Piercing the Twilight Mist: Cause targets{@0:damage packet}; <br> This skill can knock down mid-air targets.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_m_1=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: Target receives {@0:damage pack}; <br>Targets receive additional <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Males only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If the target also has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Females only)</font>, then they will enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>status: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are immobilized for 1 second. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the target)
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_m_2=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: cause targets {@0:damage pack}; <br>give targets added<font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (males only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If target simultaneously has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (females only)</font>, then it causes them to enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>state: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are finally immobilized for 1 second. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_m_3=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: Target receives {@0:damage pack}; <br>Targets receive additional <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Males only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If the target also has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Females only)</font>, then they will enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>status: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are immobilized for 2 seconds. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the target)
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_m_4=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: cause targets {@0:damage pack}; <br>give targets added<font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (males only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If target simultaneously has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (females only)</font>, then it causes them to enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>state: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are finally immobilized for 2 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_m_5=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: Target receives {@0:damage pack}; <br>Targets receive additional <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Males only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If the target also has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (Females only)</font>, then they will enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>status: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are immobilized for 3 seconds. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the target)
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_m_6=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: cause targets {@0:damage pack}; <br>give targets added<font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (males only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If target simultaneously has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (females only)</font>, then it causes them to enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>state: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are finally immobilized for 3 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj06_m_1=Gentleness Like Water, Waves of Emotion Sword, Disperse the Clouds Into Fog: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>When using this skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>status, you may move freely. Each strike from this adds a sealing effect. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Dreams</font>: When a married couple use this skill simultaneously they receive an additional 10% damage bonus.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj06_m_2=Gentleness Like Water, Waves of Emotion Sword, Disperse the Clouds Into Fog: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>When using this skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>status, you may move freely. Each strike from this adds a sealing effect. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Dreams</font>: When a married couple use this skill simultaneously they receive an additional 20% damage bonus.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj06_m_3=Gentleness Like Water, Waves of Emotion Sword, Disperse the Clouds Into Fog: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>When using this skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>status, you may move freely. Each strike from this adds a sealing effect. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Dreams</font>: When a married couple use this skill simultaneously they receive an additional 30% damage bonus.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj06_m_4=Gentleness Like Water, Waves of Emotion Sword, Disperse the Clouds Into Fog: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>When using this skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>status, you may move freely. Each strike from this adds a sealing effect. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Dreams</font>: When a married couple use this skill simultaneously they receive an additional 40% damage bonus.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj06_m_5=Gentleness Like Water, Waves of Emotion Sword, Disperse the Clouds Into Fog: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>When using this skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>status, you may move freely. Each strike from this adds a sealing effect. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Dreams</font>: When a married couple use this skill simultaneously they receive an additional 50% damage bonus.
desc_CS_jh_mlyqj06_m_6=Gentleness Like Water, Waves of Emotion Sword, Disperse the Clouds Into Fog: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>When using this skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>status, you may move freely. Each strike from this adds a sealing effect. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Golden Dreams</font>: When a married couple use this skill simultaneously they receive an additional 60% damage bonus.
