jn_drtg_001=Mad God Descends
desc_jn_drtg_001_1=Extremely strong mental skill: Givers user Super Armor status and 50% of damage dealt is recovered as HP. Active for 2 minutes.
jn_drtg_002=Venomously Slander Someone
desc_jn_drtg_002_1=Provoke targets into a rage state and cause all enemies within 50 meters to attack you. Also deal an additional 10 damage to enemies within 20 meters. Active for 2 minutes.
jn_drtg_003=Explosive Attack
jn_drtg_004=Rule the World
desc_jn_drtg_004_1=Stun all targets within a 15 meter radius, inflict them with "Vulnerable" status and clears their Super Armor effect. <br/>[Vulnerable]: Target receives an additional 100% damage.
jn_drtg_005=Protect One's Body
jn_drtg_006=Move Like the Wind
desc_jn_drtg_006_1=When using the mighty flying skill, movement speed increases 100%., and energy bursts produce a whirlwind that sweeps away nearby enemies. Lasts 30 seconds.
jn_drtg_007=Turn the Tide
desc_jn_drtg_007_1=With Chi protection, damage decreased by 90% for 15 seconds. When the protection effect ends, the Chi bursts, damaging surrounding targets to the equivalent to your max HP. Each attack also has a chance to stimulate the protection Chi, dealing 10% damage to surrounding targets.
jn_drtg_008=Uncontrollable Rage
desc_jn_drtg_008_1=Uncontrollable Rage - Immediately gain 50 rage points and an additional 10 each second for 10 seconds.
jn_drtg_009=All Rivers Run into the Sea
desc_jn_drtg_009_1=Absorb the World's Essence - Instantly recover all energy and  continue recovering energy every 30 seconds for 2 minutes.
