bossxl_xinmo_002_a=Endless Rancor
desc_bossxl_xinmo_002_a_1=Deal damage to all targets within 10 meters. Targets are launched when they parry.
bossxl_xinmo_003_a=Return to the Voice
desc_bossxl_xinmo_003_a_1=Deal damage to the area surrounding the target and stun them.
bossxl_xinmo_004_a=Wise Man Gets Irritated
desc_bossxl_xinmo_004_a_1=Flash to the target, inflict damage to him and splash surrounding targets.
bossxl_xinmo_006_a=Grievance Reaches the Sky
desc_bossxl_xinmo_006_a_1=Randomly and continuously cast four sky-reaching black mists on the surrounding area. Targets in range will suffer continuous damage for 10 seconds. Skill active for 8 seconds with 2 second intervals.
CS_jh_cljf01=Heart to heart
CS_jh_cljf02=Love at First Sight
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_1=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>After countering a target's parry, their skill damage is decreased by 30% for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_2=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>After countering a target's parry, their skill damage is decreased by 30% for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_3=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>After countering a target's parry, their skill damage is decreased by 40% for 7 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_4=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>After countering a target's parry, their skill damage is decreased by 40% for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_5=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>After countering a target's parry, their skill damage is decreased by 50% for 9 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_6=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Targets in front receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>After countering a target's parry, their skill damage is decreased by 50% for 10 seconds.
CS_jh_cljf03=Twin Swords of Love Birds
CS_jh_cljf04=Water-Milk Fusion
desc_CS_jh_cljf04_1=Unlimited Affection, Water and Milk Inseparable: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>status. Can be stacked up to 6 levels for 7 seconds; In this state, using<font color="#FFAE00">[Hand and Heart Connection]</font> will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_cljf04_2=Unlimited Affection, Water and Milk Inseparable: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>status. Can be stacked up to 6 levels for 8 seconds; In this state, using<font color="#FFAE00">[Hand and Heart Connection]</font> will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_cljf04_3=Unlimited Affection, Water and Milk Inseparable: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>status. Can be stacked up to 6 levels for 9 seconds; In this state, using<font color="#FFAE00">[Hand and Heart Connection]</font> will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_cljf04_4=Unlimited Affection, Water and Milk Inseparable: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>status. Can be stacked up to 6 levels for 10 seconds; In this state, using<font color="#FFAE00">[Hand and Heart Connection]</font> will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_cljf04_5=Unlimited Affection, Water and Milk Inseparable: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>status. Can be stacked up to 6 levels for 11 seconds; In this state, using<font color="#FFAE00">[Hand and Heart Connection]</font> will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_cljf04_6=Unlimited Affection, Water and Milk Inseparable: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>status. Can be stacked up to 6 levels for 12 seconds; In this state, using<font color="#FFAE00">[Hand and Heart Connection]</font> will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font> status.
CS_jh_cljf05=Connected Hand and Heart
CS_jh_cljf06=Willing Minds
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_1=Fluttering Eyelashes, Concentrated Brow: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Sword Force<font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Disrupt the targets meridians and limit their Chi recovery by 11 points.
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_2=Fluttering Eyelashes, Concentrated Brow: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Sword Force<font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Disrupt the targets meridians and limit their Chi recovery by 15 points.
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_3=Fluttering Eyelashes, Concentrated Brow: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Sword Force<font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Disrupt the targets meridians and limit their Chi recovery by 18 points.
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_4=Fluttering Eyelashes, Concentrated Brow: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Sword Force<font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Disrupt the targets meridians and limit their Chi recovery by 22 points.
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_5=Fluttering Eyelashes, Concentrated Brow: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Sword Force<font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Disrupt the targets meridians and limit their Chi recovery by 27 points.
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_6=Fluttering Eyelashes, Concentrated Brow: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Sword Force<font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Disrupt the targets meridians and limit their Chi recovery by 32 points.
CS_jh_cljf07=Lips to Lips
desc_CS_jh_cljf07_1=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also receive<font color="#FFAE00">Co-Dependency</font>status: When attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 1 second. One level of the status is expended each time you are attacked.
desc_CS_jh_cljf07_2=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: cause surrounding enemies {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also give yourself extra<font color="#FFAE00">Co-Dependency</font>state: When attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 1 second. One level of the state is expended each time you are attacked.
desc_CS_jh_cljf07_3=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also receive<font color="#FFAE00">Co-Dependency</font>status: When attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 1.5 seconds. One level of the status is expended each time you are attacked.
desc_CS_jh_cljf07_4=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also receive<font color="#FFAE00">Co-Dependency</font>status: When attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 1.5 seconds. Two levels of the status is expended each time you are attacked.
desc_CS_jh_cljf07_5=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: Surrounding targets receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also receive<font color="#FFAE00">Co-Dependency</font>status: When attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 2 seconds. Two levels of the status is expended each time you are attacked.
desc_CS_jh_cljf07_6=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: cause surrounding enemies {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also give yourself extra<font color="#FFAE00">Co-Dependency</font>state: When attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 2 seconds. Two levels of the state are expended each time you are attacked.
