desc_clone015_yeqianniang_04_1=Cause the "Dark Hatred" of those in vicinity to explode, dealing damage to targets within 1 meter.
desc_clone015_yeqianniang_07_1=Deal continuous damage to targets within in 5 meters. If the target parries, they enter "Allured" status: Decreased attack power, directional keys are temporarily re-arranged and will fall to the ground if airborne.
desc_clone015_qianguanyun_03_1=Inflict damage three times to targets within 8 meters in a 120-degree arc.
clone019_jiyun=Stunned
clone019_foshi_yuancheng=Lighting the Buddha Lamp
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc05_1=潜行秘技，投掷烟雾弹产生特殊烟雾，使烟雾范围内的敌人不断流失气血，且意乱心烦无法使用轻功；<br>处于烟雾范围中的友方，可借助烟雾提升自身闪避和外功伤害。
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc05_2=潜行秘技，投掷烟雾弹产生特殊烟雾，使烟雾范围内的敌人不断流失气血，且意乱心烦无法使用轻功；<br>处于烟雾范围中的友方，可借助烟雾提升自身闪避和外功伤害。
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc05_3=潜行秘技，投掷烟雾弹产生特殊烟雾，使烟雾范围内的敌人不断流失气血，且意乱心烦无法使用轻功；<br>处于烟雾范围中的友方，可借助烟雾提升自身闪避和外功伤害。
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc05_4=潜行秘技，投掷烟雾弹产生特殊烟雾，使烟雾范围内的敌人不断流失气血，且意乱心烦无法使用轻功；<br>处于烟雾范围中的友方，可借助烟雾提升自身闪避和外功伤害。
desc_CS_tm_fgzyc05_5=潜行秘技，投掷烟雾弹产生特殊烟雾，使烟雾范围内的敌人不断流失气血，且意乱心烦无法使用轻功；<br>处于烟雾范围中的友方，可借助烟雾提升自身闪避和外功伤害。
bossxl_xinmo_005=Return to the Beginning
desc_bossxl_xinmo_006_1=Create 3 patches of Black Fog that last for 10 seconds. Targets within the Black Fog receive continuous damage. Cooldown for skill is 2 seconds.
itmski_sleep=Lay Down to Rest
desc_Npc_sl_djgq04_3=Feint body movement, tumble the enemy and inflict {@0:伤害包}damage to him;<br>If the enemy wants to parry, he will be tumbled even more fiercely. (Get extra hard damage.)
desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_1=Poison chain, deadly attack, sprint target and deal {@0:伤害包} to target. Add "<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Origin</font>" to target and deepen "<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>" effect.<br>"Poison Explosion" effect: Suffer continuous damage and infect nearby target with "Poison Explosion", accumulate 6 tiers "Poison Explosion" to cause extra damage.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)<br>It was <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>'s unique Move.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_2=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: impact target and cause them {@0:damage packet}. Give target added“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and deepen“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuously damaged, and can also pass "Poison Explosion" effect to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" causes additional damage when reaching level 6. <br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)<br>This was the favorite technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_3=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: impact target and cause them {@0:damage packet}. Give target added“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and deepen“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuously damaged, and can also pass "Poison Explosion" effect to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" causes additional damage when reaching level 6. <br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)<br>This was the favorite technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_4=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: impact target and cause them {@0:damage packet}. Give target added“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and deepen“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuously damaged, and can also pass "Poison Explosion" effect to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" causes additional damage when reaching level 6. <br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)<br>This was the favorite technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_5=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: impact target and cause them {@0:damage packet}. Give target added“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and deepen“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuously damaged, and can also pass "Poison Explosion" effect to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" causes additional damage when reaching level 6. <br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)<br>This was the favorite technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_6=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: impact target and cause them {@0:damage packet}. Give target added“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and deepen“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuously damaged, and can also pass "Poison Explosion" effect to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" causes additional damage when reaching level 6. <br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)<br>This was the favorite technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_1=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Initiate a leaping attack{@0:damage packet} (Attacks immobilize for 1 second) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of three slashes; <br>If the target is in the <font color="#FFAE00">“Startling Snow”</font>state, then, the higher this state the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points and each attack consumes 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_2=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Initiate a leaping attack{@0:damage packet} (Attacks immobilize for 1 second) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of four slashes; <br>If the target is in the <font color="#FFAE00">“Startling Snow”</font>state, then, the higher this state the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points and each attack consumes 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_3=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Initiate a leaping attack{@0:damage packet} (Attacks immobilize for 1 second) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of five slashes; <br>If the target is in the <font color="#FFAE00">“Startling Snow”</font>state, then, the higher this state the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points and each attack consumes 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_4=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Initiate a leaping attack{@0:damage packet} (Attacks immobilize for 1 second) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of six slashes; <br>If the target is in the <font color="#FFAE00">“Startling Snow”</font>state, then, the higher this state the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points and each attack consumes 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_5=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Initiate a leaping attack{@0:damage packet} (Attacks immobilize for 1 second) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of seven slashes; <br>If the target is in the <font color="#FFAE00">“Startling Snow”</font>state, then, the higher this state the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points and each attack consumes 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_6=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Initiate a leaping attack{@0:damage packet} (Attacks immobilize for 1 second) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of eight slashes; <br>If the target is in the <font color="#FFAE00">“Startling Snow”</font>state, then, the higher this state the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points and each attack consumes 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_1=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 15% extra damage from skills of this set.
desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_2=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 20% extra damage from skills of this set.
desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_3=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 25% extra damage from skills of this set.
desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_4=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 30% extra damage from skills of this set.
desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_5=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 35% extra damage from skills of this set.
desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_6=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 40% extra damage from skills of this set.
desc_fb_Npc_gb_lhz07_1=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target.<br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.)
