clone_damage7=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_dftc_01_1=A target in a 3m x 10m rectangular area in front of you will suffer damage, and will be knocked down.
desc_Boss_4nei_dftc_02_1=Attacking a collapsed target
desc_Boss_4nei_dftc_03_1=Charge towards the target to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This skill can be charged. When fully charged for 1.5 seconds, enemies are knocked back.
desc_Boss_4nei_dftc_xz_1=After overcoming the defense, your target's vision will become blurry.
desc_Boss_4nei_gbd_01_1=A target in a 3m x 6m rectangular area in front of you will suffer damage, and be knocked back.
desc_Boss_4nei_gbd_03_1=You will do damage to a target within a radius of 5 meters, and cause his keystrokes to be randomized.
desc_Boss_4nei_gbd_04_1=You will do damage to a target within a radius of 5 meters, and cause him to steadily lose health and start a new Flying Skill count.
desc_Boss_4nei_gbd_xz_1=After overcoming the defense, your target's skills will be sealed.
desc_Boss_4nei_jgr_01_1=A target in a 3m x 10m rectangular area in front of you will suffer damage, and will be debuffed. He and the people around him will lose health whenever he uses a skill. This lasts 5 seconds.
desc_Boss_4nei_jgr_03_1=After you damage a target in the air and knock him down, that player cannot use Flying Skills, and will suffer a 90% speed reduction
desc_Boss_4nei_jgr_04_1=You will do damage to a player within a radius of 5 meters, and be launched into the air. You will be injured and your speed will be reduced 50% when you land.
desc_Boss_4nei_jgr_xz_1=After overcoming the defense, your target will fall down each time he uses a skill.
desc_Boss_4nei_mtd_stz01_1=You will damage the player in front of you and stun him for 3 seconds
desc_Boss_4nei_mtd_stz02_1=Players within a range of 5 meters will be knocked back, and will have a 50% speed reduction; lasts 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_4nei_mtd_stz03_1=Gives you a buff, and lasts 10 seconds. Any nearby players in the air will have their Flying Skill points reduced by 50 points.
desc_Boss_4nei_mtd_stz04_1=You will give a buff to your target, and he will explode if you use a skill within 8 seconds, causing tremendous damage to you and people around you.
desc_Boss_4nei_mtd_stz05_1=After overcoming the defense, players will be unable to parry within 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_4nei_wd_01_1=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_wd_02_1=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_wd_03_1=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_wd_04_1=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_xcj_005_01_1=<s>
