desc_Boss_4nei_xcj_007_03_1=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_xcj_007_04_1=<s>
desc_Boss_4nei_xdy_02_1=You will do damage to a target within a radius of 5 meters, and cause him to be debuffed. The debuff effect will make him lose 50 points of health per second. It lasts 30 seconds, and can accumulate to 10 times.
desc_Boss_4nei_xdy_03_1=A player in a 3m x 10m rectangular area in front of you will suffer damage, and be stunned.
desc_Boss_4nei_xdy_04_1=Randomly gives your target a debuff. This debuff can be driven off using any Skill, and driving it off will cause nearby players to be infected. The target will cause great damage to himself if he does not drive it off.
desc_Boss_4nei_xdy_xz_1=After overcoming the defense, your target's Dark Spirit Never Fades effect will simply explode, and each level will be converted into 600 points of Yin damage
desc_CS_em_jdmz01_8=A strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies; the player's palm Energy destabilizes the enemy's center of gravity, reducing speed by  20%. This can be stacked three times.
desc_CS_em_jdmz01_9=A strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies; the player's palm Energy destabilizes the enemy's center of gravity, reducing speed by  20%. This can be stacked three times.
desc_CS_em_jdmz02_8=Slowly circulate chi, accelerating the target's chi flow. This removes blood clots and jolts nearby enemies; When used on oneself, the <br>movement can send enemies flying.
desc_CS_em_jdmz02_9=Slowly circulate chi, accelerating the target's chi flow. This removes blood clots and jolts nearby enemies; When used on oneself, the <br>movement can send enemies flying.
desc_CS_em_jdmz03_8=Soft Energy is released, and a palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the target; break the enemy's parry and reduce their rage.
desc_CS_em_jdmz03_9=Soft Energy is released, and a palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the target; break the enemy's parry and reduce their rage.
desc_CS_em_jdmz05_8=A charging movement. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
desc_CS_em_jdmz05_9=A charging movement. Stay close to the target and repeatedly strike to inflict {@0:伤害包}. <br>This movement can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach your opponent.
desc_CS_em_jdmz07_8=A rainbow-like movement. A rapid palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is airborne, ou can use this maneuver to knock him away.
desc_CS_em_jdmz07_9=A rainbow-like movement. A rapid palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is airborne, ou can use this maneuver to knock him away.
desc_CS_em_lbc01_10=A seizing motion that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This movement places you in the <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> stance: It raises your Parting Sorrow Sting movement's hit rating and can be stacked up to 40 levels.
