desc_CS_em_lbc06_10=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
