desc_CS_em_pxcyz01_7=An effortless palm strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz01_8=An effortless palm strike that deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz02_7=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz02_8=A charging attack. Frigid palms continuously strike to overwhelm the opponent, inflicting {@0:伤害包} and weakening the opponent's power.<br>This move can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz03_7=A movement of wind and snow that levels swirling ice at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包};<br>When you break the target's parry, you can gain HP and improve blood circulation.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz03_8=A movement of wind and snow that levels swirling ice at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包};<br>When you break the target's parry, you can gain HP and improve blood circulation.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz04_7=Slowly cultivate your chi to release ice Energy around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies and boost your companions' Brawn.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz04_8=Slowly cultivate your chi to release ice Energy around you, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies and boost your companions' Brawn.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz05_7=Clear icy air raises your own balance and your companions' balance, simultaneously eliminating any movement impairments.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz05_8=Clear icy air raises your own balance and your companions' balance, simultaneously eliminating any movement impairments.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz07_7=An advanced movement. Snow and ice surge and a freezing gust picks up, inflicting {@0:伤害包} on all incoming enemies;<br><font color="#FFAE00">Icy Air Invasion</font> slows the enemy's movement speed and prevents the enemy from using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz07_8=An advanced movement. Snow and ice surge and a freezing gust picks up, inflicting {@0:伤害包} on all incoming enemies;<br><font color="#FFAE00">Icy Air Invasion</font> slows the enemy's movement speed and prevents the enemy from using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_7=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_8=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_sky_7=Deals {@0:伤害包}. When this attack is executed in mid-air, the attacker drops down quickly to inflict damage in an area-of-effect, reducing the dexterity of targets.
desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_sky_8=Deals {@0:伤害包}. When this attack is executed in mid-air, the attacker drops down quickly to inflict damage in an area-of-effect, reducing the dexterity of targets.
