desc_CS_em_yxc06_10=Special Chi can accelerate the healing of your bruises and those of your allies. The remaining power may give your enemies concussion and cause {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_em_yxc06_11=Wield sting to attack continuously, the special chi force can increase HP recovering speed for yourself and friendly target, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.
