desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_7=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf01_8=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_7=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf02_8=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_7=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf03_8=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_7=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf04_8=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_7=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_8=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf07_7=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf07_8=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_7=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_dgbf08_8=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf01_8=Charging move, attack three times, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_gb_ksbf01_9=Charging move, attack three times, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_gb_ksbf03_8=Wield staff to attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> onto enemy.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf03_9=Wield staff to attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to surrounding enemies, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Wine Mist"</font> onto enemy.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_8=A surprise attack on heaven and earth that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If used to break a block the movement closes accupoints on the enemy's feet. This causes the enemy to lose a large amount of inner Energy when using a Flying Skill within 19 seconds of being hit by this attack; <br>The movement also ignites the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> state, and the deeper the enemy's state of inebriation, the more damage he takes.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_9=A surprise attack on heaven and earth that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If used to break a block the movement closes accupoints on the enemy's feet. This causes the enemy to lose a large amount of inner Energy when using a Flying Skill within 19 seconds of being hit by this attack; <br>The movement also ignites the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> state, and the deeper the enemy's state of inebriation, the more damage he takes.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf06_8=Strike target like crazy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf06_9=Strike target like crazy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_8=This staff attack inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in the air. <br>If you are drunk, this will use up a <font color="#FFAE00">"Drunken Effect" </font>level, causing your target to suffer explosive damage and be knocked into the air. This can only be used against airborne targets.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_9=Wield staff to attack in air, the chi Force hits target and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If you are in Drunken state, then it will cost one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Drunk"</font> state, blasting the target and tossing him away.
desc_CS_gb_lhz01_8=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage with your palms to your target. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus Chi," </font>your Chi will extend to targets near your opponent. <br>You will no longer use up <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus Chi"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lhz01_9=Fiery Rage Psychological Attack, Palm Spits Force does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">“Lotus Chi," </font>your Chi will extend to targets near your opponent. <br>(you will no longer use up <font color="#FFAE00">“Lotus Chi"</font>)
desc_CS_gb_lhz02_8=This charging two-fist attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus Chi," </font>the force of this skill will extend to targets near your opponent. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly. You will no longer use up <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus Chi"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lhz02_9=Charge Skill, Aroused Flying Fists does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">“Lotus Chi," </font>the force of this Skill will extend to targets near your opponent. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary; you will no longer use up <font color="#FFAE00">“Lotus Chi"</font>)
desc_CS_gb_lhz03_8=Push two palms at the same time, urge <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> to break out, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The powerful force will push enemies away and hurt them as they fall down, continuously losing HP and Brawn.<br> (This skill must be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>).
desc_CS_gb_lhz03_9=Push two palms at the same time, urge <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font> to break out, dealing {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The powerful force will push enemies away and hurt them as they fall down, continuously losing HP and Brawn.<br> (This skill must be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>).
desc_CS_gb_lhz04_8=Push palm once, create a force to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will reduce his movement speed, and cause him not to be able to use flying skill.
desc_CS_gb_lhz04_9=Push palm once, create a force to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will reduce his movement speed, and cause him not to be able to use flying skill.
desc_CS_gb_lhz05_8=When you parry successfully in this defensive stance, your adversary's strength will be converted to your <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus Chi," </font>which you can stack up to a maximum of 16 levels.
desc_CS_gb_lhz05_9=When you parry successfully in this defensive stance, your adversary's strength will be converted to your <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus Chi," </font>which you can stack up to a maximum of 18 levels.
desc_CS_gb_lhz06_8=Use skill like in water, palm force blows like wind, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.
desc_CS_gb_lhz06_9=Use skill like in water, palm force blows like wind, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>, the force will affect enemies around target.
desc_CS_gb_lhz07_8=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target.<br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.)
desc_CS_gb_lhz07_9=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target.<br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.)
desc_CS_gb_lhz08_8=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lhz08_9=Draw surrounding enemies to yourself, deal {@0:伤害包} to them, and increase 20% power of Lotus Palm skills temporarily.<br>If you have already learned skill <font color="#FFAE00">Borrow Flower as a Gift</font>, you will get extra <font color="#FFAE00">"Lotus chi"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf01_8=Sweep and stab, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf01_9=Sweep and stab, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf02_8=Charging movement, swing weapon to attack target, deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will take even more damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_gb_lsbf02_9=Charging movement, swing weapon to attack target, deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will take even more damage.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_gb_lsbf03_8=Sweep with power, the chi force will strike enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}, and knock down the targets get affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf03_9=Sweep with power, the chi force will strike enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}, and knock down the targets get affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf04_8=Gather strength into one point, find weakness and attack it, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, then enemy will be knocked down, and be infected with more fierce <font color="#FFAE00">"High Snake Poison"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf04_9=Gather strength into one point, find weakness and attack it, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, then enemy will be knocked down, and be infected with more fierce <font color="#FFAE00">"High Snake Poison"</font>.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf05_8=Each successful parry will stoke your Fighting Spirit, adding 35 Yang damage to your attack (damage will be affected by your Melee damage).
desc_CS_gb_lsbf05_9=Each successful parry will stoke your Fighting Spirit, adding 41 Yang damage to your attack (damage will be affected by your Melee damage).
desc_CS_gb_lsbf06_8=Move like a snake, and attack continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf06_9=Move like a snake, and attack continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font>, target will be hurt more badly.
desc_CS_gb_lsbf07_8=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
desc_CS_gb_lsbf07_9=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_10=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Cause targets in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>When countering target's parry, reduce their skill damage by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_11=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Cause targets in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>When countering target's parry, reduce their skill damage by 50% for 10 seconds.
