desc_CS_jh_cljf02_7=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Cause targets in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>When countering target's parry, reduce their skill damage by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_8=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Cause targets in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>When countering target's parry, reduce their skill damage by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf02_9=Wholehearted Sword, Equally Touched: Cause targets in front{@0:damage packet}; <br>When countering target's parry, reduce their skill damage by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_10=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also makes you enter<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state: You cannot stand still, and it causes continuous damage to surrounding enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 1 second. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you get<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each level increases this routine skill's power by 15% and recovers Chi and energy. The burst and recovery last for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, increase the<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_11=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also makes you enter<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state: You cannot stand still, and it causes continuous damage to surrounding enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 1 second. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you get<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each level increases this routine skill's power by 15% and recovers Chi and energy. The burst and recovery last for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, increase the<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
