desc_CS_jh_cyjf01_10=A lightning strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font> and will be dealt continued damage that increases with stacks.<br>This is one of the moves that <font color="#FFAE00">Qian Xizhi</font> likes to use.
