desc_CS_jh_cyjf05_9=Your sword's chi surges through the air to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and make enemies be unable to use the skills.<br>This movement causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>, and prevents the enemy from using any movements.<br>This move was one of the wild movements of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf06_10=A hidden sword sudden strikes, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry, a fire pit will be created around the enemy's position, preventing him from using flying skills and also causing him to take damage.<br>It's said that this move was associated with <font color="#FFAE00">Wei Buji</font>.
