desc_CS_jh_cyjf07_10=Two dragons emerge from the sea, iron edges and silver claws. Charge towards the target and swiftly execute three strikes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)<br><font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Lifeng</font> often used this skill, to deadly effect.
