desc_CS_jh_cyjf08_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, causing them to suffer even more damage from <font color="#FFAE00">"Blazing Sword". </font> <br>If your enemy is unable to parry in time, and you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Blazing Chi" </font>in your body, he will be thrown. <br>Knocking an opponent back requires at least 4 levels of <font color="#FFAE00">"Blazing Chi." </font>The greater your Chi, the more times your enemy can be thrown. <br>This was the powerful attack that made <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji </font>famous.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf08_11=Your sword is like the setting sun searing the heavens. Wield it to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage upon surrounding enemies, and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>;<br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> and will be sent flying.<br>(The greater the effect of Lihuo Chi, the more the enemy will be sent flying.)<br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf08_12=Your sword is like the setting sun searing the heavens. Wield it to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage upon surrounding enemies, and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>;<br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> and will be sent flying.<br>(The greater the effect of Lihuo Chi, the more the enemy will be sent flying.)<br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
