desc_CS_jh_dldm02_10=The iron cord is sharp, its movements cunning. This move inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on enemies.<br>If you break the enemy's parry, this movement can cause him to suffer <font color="#FFAE00">Turbid Blood</font>, and when struck by the iron claws he will suffer extra external damage.
