desc_CS_jh_flxmz01_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font>, receiving more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Uplifting Wind"</font>. This condition can be stacked 8 times.
desc_CS_jh_flxmz01_8=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font>, receiving more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Uplifting Wind"</font>. This condition can be stacked 8 times.
desc_CS_jh_flxmz02_7=Charge at the enemy, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font>, receiving more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Uplifting Wind"</font>. This condition can be stacked 8 times. <br>(You may use a Flying Skill to approach target before using this skill.)
desc_CS_jh_flxmz02_8=Charge at the enemy, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font>, receiving more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Uplifting Wind"</font>. This condition can be stacked 8 times. <br>(You may use a Flying Skill to approach target before using this skill.)
desc_CS_jh_flxmz04_7=Attack with your staff, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front of you.<br>When the target's parry is broken by the attack, the target's recovery time increases by 1 second and unable to parry for an additional 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_flxmz04_8=Attack with your staff, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front of you.<br>When the target's parry is broken by the attack, the target's recovery time increases by 1 second and unable to parry for an additional 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf01_7=Hop and jump straight up, wielding the staff effortlessly to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf01_8=Hop and jump straight up, wielding the staff effortlessly to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf02_7=Viciously attack an enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can used with Flying Skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf02_8=Viciously attack an enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can used with Flying Skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf02_sky_7=Attack enemy insanely, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf02_sky_8=Attack enemy insanely, deal {@0:伤害包}, this skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf04_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} and knock down one target in the selected area. Adds "Devil Follow": for each time they get hit, they will be knocked down twice, causing "Fall Damage". When they get hit by the skills of this set, they will take extra damage. Lasts 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf04_8=Deal {@0:伤害包} and knock down one target in the selected area. Adds "Devil Follow": for each time they get hit, they will be knocked down twice, causing "Fall Damage". When they get hit by the skills of this set, they will take extra damage. Lasts 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf06_7=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf06_8=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_7=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 20% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf07_8=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 20% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and inner Energy to their best levels. This move will also allow you to reset part of the movement's chi recovery time, and damage done from movements of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Devil</font> set will increase by 50% while movement speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">Negative Effects</font>: You own inner Energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf08_7=Attack all enemies in front of you and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf08_8=Attack all enemies in front of you and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf08_sky_7=Inflict a crazed strike on the enemy to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf08_sky_8=Inflict a crazed strike on the enemy to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_fmzf09_7=A soul-destroying move. Fly over and charge at your target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can only be used against airborne targets.)
desc_CS_jh_fmzf09_8=A soul-destroying move. Fly over and charge at your target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can only be used against airborne targets.)
desc_CS_jh_ghqd01_7=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd01_8=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd02_7=A sharp dagger turns as it flies, full of searing energy. The attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage at enemies in front of you. <br>At the same time, attack adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Theft of Souls"</font> internal damage: every time the target uses Flying Skills, more internal damage is sustained. <br>After a period of time, the internal damage is triggered, resulting in massive injury.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd02_8=A sharp dagger turns as it flies, full of searing energy. The attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage at enemies in front of you. <br>At the same time, attack adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Theft of Souls"</font> internal damage: every time the target uses Flying Skills, more internal damage is sustained. <br>After a period of time, the internal damage is triggered, resulting in massive injury.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd04_7=Your dagger yearns to taste blood, and this vicious strike dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage can satiate it. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, every ensuing attack will add a layer of internal damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_ghqd04_8=Your dagger yearns to taste blood, and this vicious strike dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage can satiate it. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, every ensuing attack will add a layer of internal damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_ghqd05_7=A simple falling strike, and your sharp dagger inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the target; <br>When you break the enemy's parry, you can cause the target to suffer even greater internal damage over a short period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd05_8=A simple falling strike, and your sharp dagger inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage on the target; <br>When you break the enemy's parry, you can cause the target to suffer even greater internal damage over a short period.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd06_7=A movement of dominating energy.<br>If the opponent is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> Energy, his HP will be winnowed away; <br>If the enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, his inner Energy will be affected.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd06_8=A movement of dominating energy.<br>If the opponent is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> Energy, his HP will be winnowed away; <br>If the enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, his inner Energy will be affected.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd07_7=A veritable soul-stealing dance of seven lethal grabs. Consecutively strike the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Each attack can trigger the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage and <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, inflicting additional external damage.
desc_CS_jh_ghqd07_8=A veritable soul-stealing dance of seven lethal grabs. Consecutively strike the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Each attack can trigger the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage and <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, inflicting additional external damage.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf01_7=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target gains <font color="#FFAE00">"Sudden Snow" </font>status: Reduces "Wild Goose" and "Jump across the Cloud" flying skills speed, can stack 3 times. You will stun your target for 1 second when using it for the third time.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf01_8=Standing on wall, spraying sword Qi. Chop front enemy and Deal {@0:伤害包} to them.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Surprise Snow"</font> state: Decrease Yan Xing and Cloud penetrating speed, it can be accumulated 3 times. (The third time attack will make target dizzy for 1 second.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_7=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_8=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_7=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_8=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_7=Clear negative effects such as restrictions on movement (Slowed, Paralysis, prohibition on Flying Skill), greatly increasing movement speed (speed will progressively increase to the normal level), and become temporarily immune to movement restrictions. If you are in the "Proud Snow" effect, using this skill will cause you to lose a "Proud Snow" level and obtain the Yellow Armor effect.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf04_8=Icy Cold Heart, Wash Sword in Huanhua Stream: Clears negative effects such as restrictions on movement (Slowed, Paralysis, prohibition on Flying Skill), greatly increasing movement speed (speed will progressively increase to the normal level), and you will be temporarily immune to movement restrictions. If you are in the “Proud Snow” state, using this Skill will cause you to lose a “Proud Snow” level and obtain the Yellow Armor effect.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 2 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf05_8=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target in front of you.<br>When target's parry is breached, attaches a debuff to the target: The target will be stunned for 2 second each time Flying Skills are used, the state lasts 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf07_7=Rapid Shadow. Sprint to the selected region, knock down enemy within range and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf07_8=Rapid Shadow. Sprint to the selected region, knock down enemy within range and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy.
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_7=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Cause surrounding enemies leaping attack{@0:damage packet}(attack immobilizes for 1 second), with eight strokes at most; <br>If the target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Startling Snow"</font> state, then the higher this state, the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points, and each attack expends 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_8=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Cause surrounding enemies leaping attack{@0:damage packet}(attack immobilizes for 1 second), with eight strokes at most; <br>If the target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Startling Snow"</font> state, then the higher this state, the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points, and each attack expends 10 rage points.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy in front of you. <br>After using this skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light," </font>and you can keep up to 9 beams.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf01_2=Three Marvels Six Rites, Far from the Nine Palaces, wielding your sword causes {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy in front of you; <br>After using this Skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>and you can keep up to 9 beams.
