desc_CS_jh_jgjf02_1=Flip over and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf02_2=Up and Down are Transposed, Nine Stars at Opposition, a flying slash causes {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
