desc_CS_jh_jgjf03_8=Roaming Three Evading Five, Imperial Sword Attack for Punishment, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>When you overcome the enemy's parry, if you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Harmony with Others” </font>state: This Skill will not be sealed the first five times it is used.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf04_1="Wear Nine Tread One" upon successful parry: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Shield Armor" </font>status, which reflects 50% damage, and can stack up to 5 levels, 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Secret Chant" </font>status, adding damage to your attack. This can stack up to 5 levels. 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light," </font>which can stack up to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of  increases, additional damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf04_2=Wear Nine Tread One, Spreading Rebellion, when your parry is successful: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Xun Jia” </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Secret Chant” </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase)
