desc_CS_jh_jhdf02_10=Evil wind and spinning blade, jump anger chop. Sprint and deal {@0:伤害包} to target within range, strike target on the ground within range into the air.<br>(Target in the air is free from it, sprint range is 20 meters.)<br>You can see that <font color="#FFAE00">Lahuertuo</font> is powerful, greatly admired.
