desc_CS_jh_jhdf04_10=Continuous Poison Explosion, Heart-Destroying Death Strike: impact target and cause them {@0:damage packet}. Give target added“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Source</font>”and deepen“<font color="#FFAE00">Poison Explosion</font>”effect; <br>“Poison Source” effect: Continuously damaged, and can also pass "Poison Explosion" effect to surrounding targets; "Poison Explosion" causes additional damage when reaching level 6. <br> (This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach opponent.)<br>This was the favorite technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Liu Fangshuo</font>.
