desc_CS_jh_jwdf02_10=A one-handed blade attack in which you leisurely chop at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>(If the target has three stacks or more of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, he will suffer additional damage.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
