desc_CS_jh_jwdf03_10=Wield your blade for a thunderous chop, with waves of your chi surging as you deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, you add chaotic chi to the enemy, and the effect lasts seven seconds. The target continues to lose HP and becomes dizzy for one second every three seconds.
