desc_CS_jh_jwdf05_10=Hurl your blade like the mighty sun illuminating the sky, hitting enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>The dazzling knife blade adds <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state to the target, and as a result if the enemy circulates chi or performs any movement, the effect has a chance based on the number of stacks to increase.<br>(If the enemy target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state or has reached the limit, you will be able to inflict additional unblockable damage.
