desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_10=A flying kick smashes the target, and you then follow up with a stab to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement also converts the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sun Blade Chi</font> stored in your body to <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> that is transferred to the enemy;<br>If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font>, true chi will prevent the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> stacks from increasing, weakening the enemy: Martial arts effectiveness and movement speed are reduced.
