desc_CS_jh_jwdf07_10=Sun Chaser. The burning fire shoots up to the sky. Throw enemies in front of you into sky and resist their blades with Chi. Multiple chops inflict {@0:伤害包}; <br>Every time you hit the enemy's body, the player will activate a layer of hidden <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning"</font> air hidden in the enemy's body and make it explode. When the attack ends, the rest <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning"</font> air will be ignited.
