desc_CS_jh_jwdf08_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage while grounding any airborne enemies in your range. If you strike down any airborne enemies, your chi will allow you to resist any impairments.<br>(If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> or has reached the limit, he will suffer additional, unblockable damage.)<br>(This move is uninterruptible.)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf08_11=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage while grounding any airborne enemies in your range. If you strike down any airborne enemies, your chi will allow you to resist any impairments.<br>(If the target has three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> or has reached the limit, he will suffer additional, unblockable damage.)<br>(This move is uninterruptible.)
