desc_CS_jh_liusha01_7=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_8=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha02_7=Radiant like the sun and the moon, your two swords slash at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br/>This is the core skill of the Shaoxiaship of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Zhi'an</font>.
desc_CS_jh_liusha02_8=Radiant like the sun and the moon, your two swords slash at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br/>This is the core skill of the Shaoxiaship of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Zhi'an</font>.
desc_CS_jh_liusha03_7=Strike with sufficient preparation, concentrating all you might to attack the enemy to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. The longer you charge up for the attack, the more damage you can inflict. You can boost your damage to a maximum of 100%.
desc_CS_jh_liusha03_8=Strike with sufficient preparation, concentrating all you might to attack the enemy to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. The longer you charge up for the attack, the more damage you can inflict. You can boost your damage to a maximum of 100%.
desc_CS_jh_liusha04_7=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to targets nearby, leaving your opponents paralyzed and immobile for 3.5 seconds, but with strength for parrying (length of time will be affected by the decreasing rule). <br/>This skill is a variation on the blade technique of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang </font>of the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha04_8=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha05_7=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha05_8=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha06_7=Focus you inner Energy to protect your body and enhance your defense capacities. Every successful parry strengthens your own defenses.<br/>This skill is the wisdom of the unscrupulous merchant <font color="#FFAE00">Shen Yishan</font>.
desc_CS_jh_liusha06_8=Focus you inner Energy to protect your body and enhance your defense capacities. Every successful parry strengthens your own defenses.<br/>This skill is the wisdom of the unscrupulous merchant <font color="#FFAE00">Shen Yishan</font>.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_7=Brutally stomp your target onto the ground for 5 seconds, and each second does 5% damage to your HP. This may not exceed 472 damage, but can be affected by increased damage.<br>This skill may only be used against fallen targets. <br/>This skill is a trick of the dog spayer <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing </font>of Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_8=Brutally stomp your target onto the ground for 5 seconds, and each second does 5% damage to your HP. This may not exceed 544 damage, but can be affected by increased damage.<br>This skill may only be used against fallen targets. <br/>This skill is a trick of the dog spayer <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing </font>of Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha09_7=A small tornado sweeps the earth, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies directly in front of you and lifting them into the air.<br/>A wild gust swirls the sands as the setting sun bleeds into the sky. The fires of Longmen Inn never go out, such is power of that place, cunning and shifting like the sands.
desc_CS_jh_liusha09_8=A small tornado sweeps the earth, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies directly in front of you and lifting them into the air.<br/>A wild gust swirls the sands as the setting sun bleeds into the sky. The fires of Longmen Inn never go out, such is power of that place, cunning and shifting like the sands.
