desc_CS_jh_lyjf02_10=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Run Like Thunder and Billow Like Cloud"</font>, receiving 40% extra damage from skills of this set.
