desc_CS_jh_lyjf03_10=The clouds have not dissipated. The attack of the sword is over. Sword Chi shoots out like a shock of yarn. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front. <br>Paralyze for 3 seconds and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Break Rain Residual Cloud"</font> state to him.
