desc_CS_jh_lyjf04_10=Hold the sword and restrain Chi. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies in the chosen region. The range is 20 meters. <br>If there is a <font color="#FFAE00">"Break Rain Residual Cloud"</font> state on the target, then the target will be hit away.
