desc_CS_jh_lyjf06_10=Flowing cloud script. Change from the defensive to the offensive. If the Parry is successful: Release <font color="#FFAE00">Flowing Cloud Sword Chi</font> to the target: Sword Chi shoots off, inflict damage to the target and reduce 30% speed. The decelerate effect will affect enemies within 8 meters of the target. (Interval Time for triggering is 6 seconds.)
