desc_CS_jh_mlyqj02_f_10=Knitted Brow Sword, Chill Cuts Through: cause targets {@0:damage packet}; <br>give targets added<font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (females only)</font> for 10 seconds. <br>If target simultaneously has <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Lashes (males only)</font>, then it causes them to enter<font color="#f9fc00">Knitted Brow Willow</font>state: Movement speed gradually decreases until they are finally immobilized for 3 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skill to quickly approach the opponent.)
