desc_CS_jh_mzjf04_1=Recover 2000 Parry Endurance points, and the status <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>is removed. <br>You will also gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>effect: When using Mozi's Sword  to attack your opponent, each blow will add damage equivalent to 3% of the current parry (to a maximum of 80 additional points), and will restore 2 Rage points. This effect will continue for 12 seconds. <br>When your Parry Endurance is less than 30%, Using a Skill will put you in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect)<br> The amount of Parry Endurance you can restore will depend on how much you have cultivated.
