desc_CS_jh_mzjf05_1=This attack give you <font color="#FFAE00">"Universal Love" </font>status: When using Mozi's Sword Technique to attack an enemy, your enemy enters a <font color="#FFAE00">"Non-Aggression" </font>effect. <br><font color="#FFAE00">"Non-Aggression" </font>effect: There is a 20% chance of being interrupted when using this skill, and your skill will be sealed for 3 seconds. The effect can stack up to 2 levels, and will continue for 15 seconds. (Each time your target uses a Skill, this will remove one level of the <font color="#FFAE00">"Non-Aggression" </font>effect.
