desc_CS_jh_mzjf07_1=When you parry successfully, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Decides Destiny" </font>effect. Each level can reduce <font color="#f9fc00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>cooldown by 1 second, and increase conversion value by 4% (converts Rage into Parry Endurance). This effect can stack up to 5 levels.
