desc_CS_jh_ncd05_7="Dagger of Swift Defense" allows you to <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter" </font>: When attacked by an enemy in the parry effect, you can interrupt your enemy's skill and counter-attack. The status will last for 5 seconds. <br>(counter-attack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increasesing skill level can intensify counter-attack damage)
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_8=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_hide_01_7=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_hide_01_8=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
