desc_CS_jh_ncd05_hide_8=Damage
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_7="Protect the Flowers" and acquire the <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red" </font>effect: you can absorb massive damage for 10 seconds. <br>When the effect is broken, you can use  <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow" </font>to attain <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>status.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_8=Shadow Fragrance, Protect the Flowers, you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Dagger Cloaked in Red” </font>state: you can absorb massive Damage for 10 seconds; <br>When the state is broken, you can use the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow" </font>to attain <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>status.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_hide_7=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Cloak of Daggers"</font> effect, which absorbs damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_CS_jh_ncd06_hide_8=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Cloak of Daggers"</font> effect, which absorbs damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
