desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_13=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_14=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_15=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_16=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_17=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_18=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_19=Switch freely betwen two stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font> <br> Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect to increase the range of the following skills: <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat"</font> increases by 3 meters. <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies"</font> increases by 8 meters. All other attacks increase their range by 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font><br>Upon successful parry, gain <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect. This increases damage by 16 points for each subsequent attack. <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies"</font> gains 32 points of damage. Charge distance and speed for <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Defeat"</font> are also increased.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_7=Switch freely between two stances: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font>: When your parry is successful, you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ask for Defeat" </font>effect:  <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat" </font>will have an extra range of 3 meters,  <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies" </font>will have an extra range of 8 meters, and other skills in the combination will have an extra range of 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font>: When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated" </font>status: Will increase damage from each blow in the combination by 19 points, increase damage from  <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies" </font>by an additional 37 points. and increase the charging distance and speed of  <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender" and "Feigned Defeat." </font>
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_8=Switch freely between two stances: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font>: When your parry is successful, you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ask for Defeat" </font>effect:  <font color="#FFAE00">"False Retreat" </font>will have an extra range of 3 meters,  <font color="#FFAE00">"Arrows of Lies" </font>will have an extra range of 8 meters, and other skills in the combination will have an extra range of 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font>: When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Undefeated" </font>status: Will increase damage from each blow in the combination by 22 points, increase damage from  <font color="#FFAE00">"God of Lies" </font>by an additional 43 points. and increase the charging distance and speed of  <font color="#FFAE00">"Feigned Surrender" and "Feigned Defeat." </font>
desc_CS_jh_qbgf05_10=Throw your staff, which will hit the target and return to your hand, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The target will be Knocked Back if on the ground. The target will be sent flying if in air. <br>If you have the <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Failure</font> state, the flying and Knock Back effects of the skill will ignore the target's Endurance.
