desc_CS_jh_qbgf07_10=Charging move. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">No Failure</font> state, you may increase charging distance and speed. <br>(The skill can be used with flying skills to approach the target.)
