desc_CS_jh_qbgf08_10=Evil rises again to seek enemies. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>Each attack with the skill will give extra damage equal to 2% of the target's HP (Only available to players). <br>(You can move when using the skill.)
