desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_13=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 5 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
