desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If your opponent's <font color="#FFAE00">"Iron Force" </font>effect is at 4 levels or more, this skill will knock your opponent <font color="#FFAE00">unconscious</font>. <br>This skill is the specialty of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen </font>of Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_8=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If your opponent's <font color="#FFAE00">"Iron Force" </font>effect is at 3 levels or more, this skill will knock your opponent <font color="#FFAE00">unconscious</font>. <br>This skill is the specialty of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen </font>of Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf03_10=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
