desc_CS_jh_qyzf05_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on the enemy. If the target attempts to parry, he will fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Faint</font> state.<br>This was a clever maneuver of the <font color="#FFAE00">Old Housekeeper</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
