desc_CS_jh_sbz01_10=Slap your enemies' faces, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>: Internal and External Attack Accuracy is decreased, can be stack up to 5 times.<br>Targets are also inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font>, sustaining additional injury after taking heavy damage. This effect lasts 20 seconds.
