desc_CS_jh_sbz02_10=Hit the target's face to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the targetsstill under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>, also fall under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>, which randomizes the target's key bindings for 6 seconds. (The duration can be stacked with the stack count of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> effect.)
