desc_CS_jh_tlq02_5=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_6=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_7=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq02_8=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_6=Gain the special effect "Mantis Breaks Cart". You can switch freely between two effects: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Chi</font>: Ensures that you will not be knocked down, thrown, or your HP recovery interrupted while "Mantis Breaks Cart" is in progress. You will gain the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning Rage" </font>if you are attacked while using the skill. <br/><font color="#FFFFA5">Concentration</font>: You cannot be thrown, knocked down, or have your HP recovery interrupted during the use of this skill.
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_7=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_8=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_5=This charging attack inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>When you are in a <font color="#f9fc00">Concentration </font>or in <font color="#FFAE00"">"Burning Rage"</font>, you can knock your target back, and give your target the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Broken Cart" </font>effect, denying him the use of Flying Skill or defensive action for 3 seconds. You will gain the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Amplify damage" </font>effect for a period of time, inflicting additional Hard damage.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_6=A stored energy attack. Charge up and burst through the air to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">concentration</font> state or have been <font color="#FFAE00">enraged</font>, you can knock the enemy back and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state to your target, which disables his defenses for three seconds. The attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Deepen Damage</font> effect, which increases external hard damage taken with each blow.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_7=A stored energy attack. Charge up and burst through the air to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">concentration</font> state or have been <font color="#FFAE00">enraged</font>, you can knock the enemy back and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state to your target, which disables his defenses for three seconds. The attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Deepen Damage</font> effect, which increases external hard damage taken with each blow.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_8=A stored energy attack. Charge up and burst through the air to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">concentration</font> state or have been <font color="#FFAE00">enraged</font>, you can knock the enemy back and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state to your target, which disables his defenses for three seconds. The attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Deepen Damage</font> effect, which increases external hard damage taken with each blow.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_sky_5=Gather Energy for 1.5 seconds and strike hard to shock target and make him can't parry in 3 seconds.
