desc_CS_jh_tlq06_5=You have a 45% chance of reaching your potential when your parry is successful: Increases power of "Mantis Breaks Cart" by 35%, and instantly executes a skyward leap.
desc_CS_jh_tlq06_6=Tou have a 45% chance of reaching your potential when your parry is successful: Increases power of "Mantis Breaks Cart" by 40%, and instantly executes a skyward leap.
