desc_CS_jh_tmjt05_6=A defensive movement in which a demonic air surrounds your body, allowing you to add either the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font> or the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Taoist Overrun</font> state to yourself when you successfully parry. either will increase your movement speed by 45% and you will not be able to be sent flying, knocked back, knocked down, or locked. Your anti-disease activities will be limited.
desc_CS_jh_tmjt06_10=Twisted Path of the Demon: spread strange poison on your body to corrode your body and surrounding enemies; also lowers movement speed of enemies and makes them unable to use flying skills. Those attack receive extra 8% Yin Damage. <br> When using this skill again or other routine skill, then it clears the poison essence effect.
