desc_CS_jh_tmjt06_9=Twisted Path of the Demon: spread strange poison on your body to corrode your body and surrounding enemies; also lowers movement speed of enemies and makes them unable to use flying skills. Those attack receive extra 8% Yin Damage. <br> When using this skill again or other routine skill, then it clears the poison essence effect.
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_7=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 8 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg01_8=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 8 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_7=Charge up, wait for your chance, then charge forward and butt into the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The skill requires 2 seconds. The damage dealt will increase along with casting time. After charging, you will receive a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Endure</font> state when you use the skill. You can then ignore blocking and being punched away. <br>(The max charging distance of the skill is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg02_8=Charge up, wait for your chance, then charge forward and butt into the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The skill requires 2 seconds. The damage dealt will increase along with casting time. After charging, you will receive a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Endure</font> state when you use the skill. You can then ignore blocking and being punched away. <br>(The max charging distance of the skill is 20 meters.)
desc_CS_jh_ttg03_7=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
desc_CS_jh_ttg03_8=Do a kick-and-head-butt combo that does {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>Execute this combo 3 times in a row to knock back your target.
desc_CS_jh_ttg04_7=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front. <br>You will put your target in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Crack of Thunder" </font>effect when you overcome his parry, stunning him for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_ttg04_8=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Break your target's parry to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Crack of Thunder"</font>, stunning the target for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_ttg05_7=Use your head to strike the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in area. <br>The chi wave will knock down nearby enemies and drag them close to you.
desc_CS_jh_ttg05_8=Use your head to strike the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in area. <br>The chi wave will knock down nearby enemies and drag them close to you.
desc_CS_jh_ttg06_7=Gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Mind's Focus" </font>effect after a parry is successful: You can absorb immense parry damage, and the effect will continue for 5 seconds. Cooldown is 30 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_ttg06_8=Frozen Chi Sealed Sound, Pull Back Sinew and Bone, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Mind's Focus” </font>effect after a parry is successful: You can absorb immense parry Damage, and the effect will continue for 5 seconds. (Regulated Breathing time is 30 seconds)
desc_CS_jh_ttg07_7=Use your head to attack target continuously to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_ttg07_8=Use your head to attack target continuously to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_yydf01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to an enemy in front of you. <br><font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies'</font>: Skill becomes a charging attack, damage increases.
