desc_CS_jh_yydf04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect when using this skill, and you may use Flying Skills. <br>"<font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies"</font>: damage increases, You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>effect when using this skill/
