desc_CS_jh_yydf05_1=Enter the <font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies" </font>effect, increasing the levels of your other skills. This effect has six levels, and lasts for for 60 seconds. One level is removed for each blow you strike, and the "A Kind Person Has No Enemies" effect is completely lost if you switch to another weapon or use a skill in another effect.<br> You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>when using this skill.
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_1=Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter" </font>effect: When parrying an enemy's attack, you can dismantle his skill and counter-attack. This effect lasts for 5 seconds. <br>Counter-attack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Cultivate this skill to increase the damage of its counter-attack. <br>"<font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies"</font>: Damage is increased, and your counter-attack has a range of 25 meters.
