desc_CS_jh_yydf06_2=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds.  <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move.  Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage) <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Skill Damage increases, your counterattack has a range of 25 meters"
