desc_CS_jh_yydf07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you. When defeating an enemy parry: <br>Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds. <br>"<font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies"</font>: damage is increased, and the range of your attacks increases to 20 meters in front of you.
