desc_CS_jh_zq01_1=Trip targets in front to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Dong Bin Raises a Jug"</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these skills. This effect lasts for for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status. <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike.
desc_CS_jh_zq01_2=Turn and Lift a Jug, Force of a Thousand Tons, causes Enemies in front to Stumble and deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">“Dong Bin Raises a Jug”</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these Skills, and the state will continue for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this Skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status.  <br>(The grade of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>state is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike)
