desc_CS_jh_zq02_1=The <font color="#FFAE00">"False Sleep" </font>effect lets you recover your Blood Stasis to mitigate loss of health. When attacked, you can counter-attack against nearby enemies, and knock them down. The effect lasts for 5 seconds. <br>The counter-attack has a range of 5 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect during your counter-attack. With increased skill level, you can increase damage of counter-attack.
desc_CS_jh_zq02_2=Turn Elbow Bend Knee, Drunken Crouch Intoxicated Sleep, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“False Sleep” </font>state: When attacked by enemies, you can counterattack against nearby enemies, and knock them down. The state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(The counterattack has a range of 5 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state during your counterattack. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
