desc_CS_jh_zq02_hide_1=Fall to the ground, and recover your health. Gain Yellow Armor and execute a counter-attack against your attacker within 5 meters, knocking him to the ground.
desc_CS_jh_zq02_hide_2=You have collapsed, continuing to heal your bruises; you will gain Yellow Armor and counterattack your target when you are attacked within 5 meters, and knock your opponent to the ground
