desc_CS_jh_zq04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front. <br>If your counter-attack is successful, you can knock your target back, and put him in an <font color="#FFAE00">"Elder Guo Throws the Cup" </font>effect: He will have difficulty hitting the target in his next attack. The effect will last 5 seconds. If you are on the first level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike," </font>the effect will last an additional 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_zq04_2=Drunkenly Throwing the Cup, Give a Roundhouse Kick while on Your Back, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>If your counterattack is successful, you can knock your target back, and put him in an <font color="#FFAE00">“Elder Guo Throws the Cup” </font>state: He will have difficulty hitting the target next attack; the state will last 5 seconds. (If you are on the first level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike," </font>the state will last an additional 1 second)
