desc_CS_jh_zq05_1=When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status: Effectiveness will increase when you use <font color="#f9fc00">"Xiangzi Plays the Flute," "Elder Guo Throws the Cup," or "Imperial Uncle's Neck Lock"</font>. This status can be accumulated up to 3 times, and will continue for 8 seconds. (If you are in <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status and cannot attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>, parrying will ensure that your Energy is restored as long as you are not fallen to the ground or resting.
