desc_CS_jh_zq08_1=Attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status: Your movements will be slowed, but your evasion will improve. This effect lasts for for 8 seconds. <br>The greater your Alcohol Tolerance, the more potent this effect will be. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is low, your movement speed will be decreased by 20%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 5%. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is moderate, your movement speed will be decreased by 15%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 10%. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is high, your movement speed will be decreased by 10%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 15%. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is massive, your movement speed will be decreased by 5%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 20%. <br>This effect will automatically be cleared after evading your opponent's attack, and you will receive a level 3 <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike." </font> <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike. You cannot receive level 3 <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>unless you parry.
