desc_CS_jl_dmssj01_10=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
