desc_CS_jl_dmssj02_10=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj02_11=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
