desc_CS_jl_dmssj05_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target with Sword Chi. <br>You can send enemies in the air flying when you are on the ground, and increase their Energy consumption. <br>The greater their consumption, the greater the damage they suffer. A special recovery skill will enable it to be used 3 times within 4 seconds before  cools down.
desc_CS_jl_dmssj05_11=A cloud-penetrating movement. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their movements. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
