desc_CS_jl_dmssj06_10=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
