desc_CS_jl_dmssj07_10=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
