desc_CS_jl_dmssj08_10=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
