desc_CS_jl_fgz01_10=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
