desc_CS_jl_fgz01_9=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_CS_jl_fgz02_10=A charging attack. Circle your front leg and attack with brutal palm strikes that penetrate the skin to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>This movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Stanching</font> effect; if the enemy is already in the <font color="#FFAE00">Erode the Heart</font> state, the two poisons will mix to form the <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Frozen in Seven Steps</font>: This effect takes time but gradually slows the enemy's movement speed. When the poison takes effect the enemy falls down and sustains damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
