desc_CS_jl_fgz03_10=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
