desc_CS_jl_fgz06_10=A rotting bone kill. Throw Poison bottle into a specific area and release toxic fog.<br>Targets will be unable to use flying skills for 2 secs.<br>Targets will gain constant damage.<br>Targets will be stunned when they try to come out from the toxic fog.
