desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_8=Release dark poison to increase stabbing power, but poison damage will reduce your Max HP by 200 points. This is stackable 10 times. <br>Nearby enemies within the range of the Poison Gas will suffer 220 External attack damage. This skill cannot be used if your Max HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_9=Release dark poison to increase stabbing power, but poison damage will reduce your Max HP by 200 points. This is stackable 10 times. <br>Nearby enemies within the range of the Poison Gas will suffer 240 External attack damage. This skill cannot be used if your Max HP is too low.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci03_8=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci03_9=Throw insect to infect yourself, and inflict yin damage with sting skills. Each time your sting penetrates enemy's body, it eats enemy's flesh.<br>Surrounding enemies infected by insects will lose HP continuously when they use flying skill.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci04_8=Charging movement, wield sting like snake spits out tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_shuangci04_9=Charging movement, wield sting like snake spits out tongue, attack three times to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_shuangci05_8=Sting soul and dance like devil, attack enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci05_9=Sting soul and dance like devil, attack enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci06_8=Feint sting target once, release poison force, erode enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking enemy's parry, this skill will make him bleed and lose ability to use Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci06_9=Feint sting target once, release poison force, erode enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>After breaking enemy's parry, this skill will make him bleed and lose ability to use Flying Skill for a period of time.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci08_8=Each time you parry your enemy's attack, you will absorb 29 points of his health. The vampiric effect will be affected by Internal attack damage).
desc_CS_jl_shuangci08_9=Each time you parry your enemy's attack, you will absorb 37 points of his health. The vampiric effect will be affected by Internal attack damage).
desc_CS_jl_zfd03_8=Chop continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The enemy will take <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_CS_jl_zfd03_9=Chop continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The enemy will take <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_CS_jl_zfd04_8=Merciless attack, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The enemy tries to block will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_CS_jl_zfd04_9=Merciless attack, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The enemy tries to block will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_8=When you parry successfully in this defensive stance, add 35 points Hardness damage to your attack (damage may be affected by Internal Skill).
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_9=When you parry successfully in this defensive stance, add 41 points Hardness damage to your attack (damage may be affected by Internal Skill).
desc_CS_jl_zfd06_8=A whistling storm of knifes and a rain of blood. Sweep up enemy targets in an area of effect to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The enemy will be jolted into the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state by your inexorable Energy and will be unable to use movements of any sort.
desc_CS_jl_zfd06_9=A whistling storm of knifes and a rain of blood. Sweep up enemy targets in an area of effect to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The enemy will be jolted into the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state by your inexorable Energy and will be unable to use movements of any sort.
desc_CS_jl_zfd07_sky_8=<s>
desc_CS_jl_zfd07_sky_9=<s>
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_7=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jy_dqd02_8=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_7=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd03_8=A charging movement of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd04_7=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_CS_jy_dqd04_8=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_7=When your parry is successful, a <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless" </font>blow will be dealt to the attacker. This skill can stack up to 14 levels. Each attack with Heartless Skill will trigger a damaging blow, and the blow will then disappear. There is a chance the attacker may add a level.
desc_CS_jy_dqd05_8=When your parry is successful, a <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless" </font>blow will be dealt to the attacker. This skill can stack up to 15 levels. Each attack with Heartless Skill will trigger a damaging blow, and the blow will then disappear. There is a chance the attacker may add a level.
desc_CS_jy_dqd06_7=Violent Rage, dance of metempsychosis, force from the netherworld erodes the target and causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Teeter the target's body: there is a great possibility of falling when starting to attack or using flying skill. If the target is in the air, it will fall directly.
desc_CS_jy_dqd06_8=Violent Rage, dance of metempsychosis, force from the netherworld erodes the target and causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Teeter the target's body: there is a great possibility of falling when starting to attack or using flying skill. If the target is in the air, it will fall directly.
desc_CS_jy_dqd07_7=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_dqd07_8=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jy_shd01_8=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one handsome flourish. The enemy gets hit by the chi force and takes {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
desc_CS_jy_shd01_9=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one handsome flourish. The enemy gets hit by the chi force and takes {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
desc_CS_jy_shd02_8=Wield blade outrageously, the blade chi will impact enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then this attack will knock target down.
desc_CS_jy_shd02_9=Wield blade outrageously, the blade chi will impact enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then this attack will knock target down.
desc_CS_jy_shd03_8=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_shd03_9=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_shd04_8=Simple blade skill, chop towards head to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Enemy's parry will be broken, and target will take <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, taking continuous damage for a period of time.
desc_CS_jy_shd04_9=Simple blade skill, chop towards head to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Enemy's parry will be broken, and target will take <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, taking continuous damage for a period of time.
desc_CS_jy_shd05_8=Hiding the intent to kill, take the chance to strike your enemy while blocking. Your enemy suffers continuous damage for a while (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
desc_CS_jy_shd05_9=Hiding the intent to kill, take the chance to strike your enemy while blocking. Your enemy suffers continuous damage for a while (Damage dealt is influenced by Melee Damage).
desc_CS_jy_shd06_8=Dance of Death, a chopping finishing-move that will deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, he will take extra damage.
desc_CS_jy_shd06_9=Dance of Death, a chopping finishing-move that will deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, he will take extra damage.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_8=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_9=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_sky_8=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in air, you can fall quickly, repel targets in area. When target has Soul Losing Blade Wound, the wound will be torn apart, or the skill will attach Soul Losing Blade Wound on target.
desc_CS_jy_shd07_sky_9=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in air, you can fall quickly, repel targets in area. When target has Soul Losing Blade Wound, the wound will be torn apart, or the skill will attach Soul Losing Blade Wound on target.
desc_CS_jy_xsd01_5=Bind enemies in an area of effect for 3 seconds, dealing {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Targets are inflicted with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloody Blade"</font>, burning their allies in a 5-meter radius for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_xsd01_6=Bind enemies in an area of effect for 3 seconds, dealing {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Targets are inflicted with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloody Blade"</font>, burning their allies in a 5-meter radius for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jy_xsd03_5=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd03_6=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jy_xsd05_5=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_CS_jy_xsd05_6=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_CS_jy_xsd06_5=Each successful parry will give you one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font>, which be stacked up to 10 levels. A 25% Vampiric effect to this attack, and each attack will use up 1 level of Bloodthirsty Will.
desc_CS_jy_xsd06_6=Each successful parry will give you one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font>, which be stacked up to 10 levels. A 30% Vampiric effect to this attack, and each attack will use up 1 level of Bloodthirsty Will.
desc_CS_jy_xsd07_5=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_CS_jy_xsd07_6=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_5=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Absort your target's health to heal your wounds. Vampiric effectiveness is 40% There is no Vampiric effectiveness if your attack is parried..
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_6=Blooding Killing, Eat Hair and Drink Blood, kick your target over, drop your blade and strangle, causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>You can also suck your enemy's fresh blood and recovery from your injuries. Blood-sucking effectiveness is 40% (There is no blood-sucking effectiveness if your attack is parried.).
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_sky_5=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. Drain blood from your target to replenish your own HP. Vampiric effectiveness is 40%.
desc_CS_jy_xsd08_sky_6=Bloodthirsty Brutal Skill, will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target; you will be able to obtain limitless fresh blood from your target, which will replenish your HP; blood sucking effectiveness is 40%
