desc_CS_jz_wyjf03_8=Boundless Mental Skill will create a Boundless chi area. The team member affected by this chi area will inflict softness damage with their attacks.<br> (This skill will cost 1% of Max Energy per second.)
desc_CS_jz_wyjf03_9=Boundless Mental Skill will create a Boundless chi area. The team member affected by this chi area will inflict softness damage with their attacks.<br> (This skill will cost 1% of Max Energy per second.)
desc_CS_jz_wyjf04_8=Turn back sword and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will damage his merdians and make him lose Energy.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf04_9=Turn back sword and deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. If this attack breaks enemy's parry, it will damage his merdians and make him lose Energy.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf06_8=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf06_9=An advanced mental skill of Boundless Sword, wield sword with rage to create a powerful chi area of effect. In this area, you and your teammates will inflict greater softness damage, and recover Energy more quickly.
desc_CS_jz_wyjf07_8=Shoot a sword chi, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>Use this skill on the ground can punch target in air away, and deal special internal injury (When gets hit by Boundless Sword skills, target will take extra softness damage).
desc_CS_jz_wyjf07_9=Shoot a sword chi, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>Use this skill on the ground can punch target in air away, and deal special internal injury (When gets hit by Boundless Sword skills, target will take extra softness damage).
desc_CS_jz_xytf01_8=Quickly attack from three directions, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf01_9=Quickly attack from three directions, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf01_sky_8=Powerful leg skill, attack enemy in front three times to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf01_sky_9=Powerful leg skill, attack enemy in front three times to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_8=Charging skill, this serious kicking skill will deal {@0:伤害包} to target. A coordinated use of <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_9=Charging skill, this serious kicking skill will deal {@0:伤害包} to target. A coordinated use of <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_sky_8=A highly effective kicking skill that consecutively strikes enemies twice to deal {@0:伤害包}. When accompanying the Xiaoyao Sect's skills, it is even more effective. This skill can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_jz_xytf02_sky_9=A highly effective kicking skill that consecutively strikes enemies twice to deal {@0:伤害包}. When accompanying the Xiaoyao Sect's skills, it is even more effective. This skill can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the enemy.
desc_CS_jz_xytf03_8=Jump and turn back to kick, kick away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf03_9=Jump and turn back to kick, kick away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf03_sky_8=Circle kick enemy in air, deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf03_sky_9=Circle kick enemy in air, deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf04_sky_8=Fly kick enemy to {@0:伤害包}, if enemy is blocking, he will be beaten down and take internal injury, reduce mvoement speed and take damages over time.
desc_CS_jz_xytf04_sky_9=Fly kick enemy to {@0:伤害包}, if enemy is blocking, he will be beaten down and take internal injury, reduce mvoement speed and take damages over time.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_8=This defensive stance activates your <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill" </font>potential. When your parry is successful, you increase your movement speed and gain 35 points Yin damage, boosting the power of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_9=This defensive stance activates your <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill" </font>potential. When your parry is successful, you increase your movement speed and gain 41 points Yin damage, boosting the power of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_sky_8=Defense move of Leisure Kick, each successful parry will activate Leisure Skill to increase movement speed and attack, and also increase power of all skills of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_jz_xytf05_sky_9=Defense move of Leisure Kick, each successful parry will activate Leisure Skill to increase movement speed and attack, and also increase power of all skills of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_8=Leisure meaning, lightsome attack, kick target continuously and deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_9=Leisure meaning, lightsome attack, kick target continuously and deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> can make this skill more powerful.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_sky_8=The most powerful move of Leisure Kick, attack enemy continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf06_sky_9=The most powerful move of Leisure Kick, attack enemy continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, cooperate with Leisure Skill can affect with more powerful force.
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_8=Charging movement, gather strength to kick target and deal {@0:伤害包}. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, and jump up to attack target in air, you will greatly increase the chance to double the damage of the skill.<br> (This skill canbe used in conjunction with Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_9=Charging movement, gather strength to kick target and deal {@0:伤害包}. If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, and jump up to attack target in air, you will greatly increase the chance to double the damage of the skill.<br> (This skill canbe used in conjunction with Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_sky_8=Kick target quickly and continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, if you and target are all in air, the chance to double the damage of the skill will be greatly increased.
desc_CS_jz_xytf07_sky_9=Kick target quickly and continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}, when you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Leisure Skill"</font> state, if you and target are all in air, the chance to double the damage of the skill will be greatly increased.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf01_5=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state, reducing his movement speed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf01_6=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state, reducing his movement speed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf02_5=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf02_6=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_5=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_6=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf04_5=Your sword and your will are one, and you carry a frigid bearing to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, the target will be paralyzed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf04_6=Your sword and your will are one, and you carry a frigid bearing to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, the target will be paralyzed.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf06_5=Use sound as a sword and use your sword to make sound. Create a protective screen of a flute sound: The enemies will lose HP continuously within the protective screen. It will last sixteen seconds.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf06_6=Use sound as a sword and use your sword to make sound. Create a protective screen of a flute sound: The enemies will lose HP continuously within the protective screen. It will last sixteen seconds.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf07_5=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf07_6=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
desc_CS_sl_djgq02_8=External skill changed from Lion Roaring Skill, the roar can shake the heaven and hell, stun enemies with 5 meters for 3 seconds, and deal {@0:伤害包}.
