desc_CS_sl_wtgf01_8=Use staff to attack ground in front, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> at the moment, he will take extra hardness damage.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf01_9=Use staff to attack ground in front, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> at the moment, he will take extra hardness damage.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf02_8=A charging attack in which chi surges through your staff as it sweeps enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage, slowing their movement speed; <br>If you are currently on the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> state, your movement will slow the enemy's movement even more effectively;  If the target has four stacks of movement speed reduction, he will be unable to use flying skills for a short period.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_sl_wtgf02_9=A charging attack in which chi surges through your staff as it sweeps enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage, slowing their movement speed; <br>If you are currently on the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> state, your movement will slow the enemy's movement even more effectively;  If the target has four stacks of movement speed reduction, he will be unable to use flying skills for a short period.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_sl_wtgf03_8=Strike heavily, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you.<br>Your powerful force can break an enemy's parry instantly, and attaches <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> to the nemy: Target Immobilized.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf03_9=Strike heavily, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you.<br>Your powerful force can break an enemy's parry instantly, and attaches <font color="#FFAE00">"Cutoff"</font> to the nemy: Target Immobilized.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf05_8=Create wind in plain, jump to selected area, and sweep surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}, and stun them for a while.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf05_9=Create wind in plain, jump to selected area, and sweep surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}, and stun them for a while.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf06_8=Staff technique as explained in Buddha's Protector Manual. Execute several heavy attacks to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and knock down the enemy with the final strike.
desc_CS_sl_wtgf06_9=Staff technique as explained in Buddha's Protector Manual. Execute several heavy attacks to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and knock down the enemy with the final strike.
