desc_CS_tm_jsc05_8=When your parry is successful, you will make your opponent's power available for your own use, adding 35 points of Yin damage to your attack. It will last 10 seconds (damage will be affected by Internal attack damage).
desc_CS_tm_jsc05_9=When your parry is successful, you will make your opponent's power available for your own use, adding 41 points of Yin damage to your attack. It will last 10 seconds (damage will be affected by Internal attack damage).
