desc_CS_tm_tmzhd01_8=Chop with blade, the icy force deals {@0:伤害包} to target, and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Chase Soul"</font>.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd01_9=Chop with blade, the icy force deals {@0:伤害包} to target, and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Chase Soul"</font>.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd02_8=A flying strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Damage inflicted corresponds to the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing Needle</font> and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd02_9=A flying strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Damage inflicted corresponds to the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing Needle</font> and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd03_8=Turn body and attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>The force will hurt enemy's merdians, make target lose extra Energy when use flying skill.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd03_9=Turn body and attack quickly, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>The force will hurt enemy's merdians, make target lose extra Energy when use flying skill.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd04_8=Use trick to tease fool, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. Can break enemy's parry and repel him.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd04_9=Use trick to tease fool, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. Can break enemy's parry and repel him.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_8=. When your parry is successful, your movement speed and adds 35 points Yin damage, boosting the power of Leisure Kick.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_9=When you parry successfully in this defensive stance, it will instantly boost your movement ability, which will last for 6 seconds. <br>There is a chance it will give the <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul" </font>effect to the attacker.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd06_8=Dance like a demon and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies. The amount of damage you inflict corresponds to the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing</font> stacks and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd06_9=Dance like a demon and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies. The amount of damage you inflict corresponds to the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Chasing</font> stacks and the target's <font color="#FFAE00">proximity</font> to you.
