desc_CS_tm_ywt04_10=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered.
