desc_CS_tm_ywt05_10=A stun movement, deals {@0: 伤害包} to target. When you break the enemy's defense you can use this move to poison them, debuffing the enemy with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state. The effect, which is similar to Vertigo, lasts 4 seconds.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font> state will be canjailed if the target is attacked.
