desc_CS_tm_ywt06_10=A secret move of the king of the underworld. Hurl an <font color="#FFAE00">Oil Bomb</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect:<br>The first enemy caught in the trap will be paralyzed for 2 seconds and take attached damage;<br>Affected enemies also have their movement speed reduced by 35% and their Flying Skills are limited. (This debuff cannot be stacked);<br>Affected enemies will also have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> debuff added to them, with one stack added each second for a maximum of 25 stacks.<br>(The trap lasts 30 seconds and its effects last 30 seconds when triggered.)
