desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_10=In a <br><font color="#FFAE00">Yang </font>effect, you will absorb pure Yang Chi every time you use your sword, additionally increasing the Yang damage of the attack. With <font color="#FFAE00">"Yang Cuts Yin," </font>pure Yang Chi will be converted into Energy and cause damage to your target. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Yin </font>is a effect where you will absorb pure Yin Chi every time you use your sword, additionally increasing your damage reduction. When <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin Cuts Yang,"</font> the ultimate Yin Chi will restore health and cause your target to faint.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_11=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_12=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
