desc_CS_wd_lyjf07_10=Yin and Yang sword chi attack together, deal {@0:伤害包} to target, use it in air can bring down target in air, and at the same time:<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yang"</font> state, attacking target in air when you are in air can deal 1.5 times of damage.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin"</font> state, whil attacking target in air when you are in air can increase your rage.
