desc_CS_wd_qfjf01_8=Attack with ease, the fierce chi of the sword sweeps enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and make him take extra damage when using flying skill.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf01_9=Attack with ease, the fierce chi of the sword sweeps enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and make him take extra damage when using flying skill.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf02_8=Gather chi movement, wave sword chi to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi to knock them down.<br>This skill can be released instantly in the air, and there is a chance to knock down target. The chance will increase along with <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze"</font> level amount on your body.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf02_9=Gather chi movement, wave sword chi to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi to knock them down.<br>This skill can be released instantly in the air, and there is a chance to knock down target. The chance will increase along with <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze"</font> level amount on your body.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf02_sky_8=Breeze Sword Chi attacks target's mind, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, if target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, then target cannot move or use skills.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf02_sky_9=Breeze Sword Chi attacks target's mind, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in area, if target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, then target cannot move or use skills.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf03_8=Continuous sword chi gather into a line, heavily strike enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi, the remaining force can cause target to be unable to block in 3 seconds.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf03_9=Continuous sword chi gather into a line, heavily strike enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi, the remaining force can cause target to be unable to block in 3 seconds.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf04_8=Stab once, the sharp sword chi deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, he will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi and knocked down.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf04_9=Stab once, the sharp sword chi deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If enemy tries to block, he will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> chi and knocked down.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf05_8=In this defensive stance, each successful parry will give you even more <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze" </font>Sword Chi, which will last for 24 seconds. When <br><font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze" </font>Sword Chi is present, "Turbulent Rapids" Chi-gathering time will be shorter, "Pure Spring Flows Forth" damage will be greater.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf05_9=In this defensive stance, each successful parry will give you even more <font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze" </font>Sword Chi, which will last for 26 seconds. When <br><font color="#FFAE00">"Breeze" </font>Sword Chi is present, "Turbulent Rapids" Chi-gathering time will be shorter, "Pure Spring Flows Forth" damage will be greater.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf06_8=Stunt of Breeze Sword, the sharp sword Chi attacks around enemies to deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> Qi, will take more damage. <br>It's better to use the skill in air.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf06_9=Stunt of Breeze Sword, the sharp sword Chi attacks around enemies to deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>When target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">"Foul"</font> Qi, will take more damage. <br>It's better to use the skill in air.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf06_sky_8=Breeze helps to reinforce Sword Qi, attack continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}. If target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, will take more damage.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf06_sky_9=Breeze helps to reinforce Sword Qi, attack continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}. If target is affected by your "Foul" Qi, will take more damage.
desc_CS_wd_qfjf07_8=Charging skill, wield sword and attack several times, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is unable to block, will take extra damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_qfjf07_9=Charging skill, wield sword and attack several times, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. When target is unable to block, will take extra damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_tjj01_8=Charging skill, wield sword and attack twice, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_tjj01_9=Charging skill, wield sword and attack twice, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_wd_tjj04_8=A yang attack, the enemies affected by sword chi will take {@0:伤害包}, and suffer a internal injury: movement speed is reduced, continuous loss of HP.
desc_CS_wd_tjj04_9=A yang attack, the enemies affected by sword chi will take {@0:伤害包}, and suffer a internal injury: movement speed is reduced, continuous loss of HP.
desc_CS_wd_tjj05_8=Overcome the parry of the enemy in front of you, causing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>You will recover your Energy if your enemy's defenses have already been broken.
desc_CS_wd_tjj05_9=Stab slightly, break parry of enemies in front of you, deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the enemy cannot block, this attack will drain enemy's Energy.
desc_CS_wd_tjj06_8=In this defensive stance, you will recover 18 points of Energy for each parry of your opponent's attack (degree of recovery will be influenced by your Internal attack damage).
desc_CS_wd_tjj06_9=In this defensive stance, you will recover 21 points of Energy for each parry of your opponent's attack (degree of recovery will be influenced by your Internal attack damage).
desc_CS_wd_tjj07_8=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_wd_tjj07_9=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_wd_tjj08_8=A yin attack, the enemies affected by the sword chi will be repelled, and take {@0:伤害包}, lose Energy in a while.
desc_CS_wd_tjj08_9=A yin attack, the enemies affected by the sword chi will be repelled, and take {@0:伤害包}, lose Energy in a while.
desc_CS_wd_tjj09_8=Gather Chi to shoot sword Chi to around air, bring down all enemies in the area, and deal {@0: 伤害包}, make them be unable to use Flying Skill in 5s.
desc_CS_wd_tjj09_9=Gather Chi to shoot sword Chi to around air, bring down all enemies in the area, and deal {@0: 伤害包}, make them be unable to use Flying Skill in 5s.
desc_CS_wd_tjq01_10=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
