desc_CS_wd_tjq05_10=With <font color="#FFAE00">"Grappling Force"</font>, you can remove your negative conditions and absorb some of your damage. <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">"Grappling Force" </font>is broken or time runs out, nearby enemies will suffer concussion (damage will be equivalent to all of Max absorption).
desc_CS_wd_tjq05_11=Overcome hardness with softness. Circulate your chi and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> effect, which removes any debuffs placed on you and absorbs some damage; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> is broken or when its effect naturally wears off, the damage it absorbs will be transferred to nearby enemies.
