desc_CS_wd_tjq06_10=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
