desc_CS_wdzp_tjq01_10=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
