desc_CS_wdzp_tjq05_10=Overcome hardness with softness. Circulate your chi and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> effect, which removes any debuffs placed on you and absorbs some damage; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> is broken or when its effect naturally wears off, the damage it absorbs will be transferred to nearby enemies (the damage is half of the maximum absorbed amount).
