desc_CS_wdzp_tjq08_10=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
desc_CS_wdzp_tjq08_11=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
