desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf01_1=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf02_1=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf03_1=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf04_1=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf05_1=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 15 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds him for three seconds.
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf06_1=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant; <br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For four seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf07_1=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
desc_Qygp_gb_dgbf08_1=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs01_1=Mighty blow, attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, reducing target's movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs02_1=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs03_1=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs04_1=Block move - a successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked.
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs05_1=Charging movement, bend your arm like a bow, and then strike like a spring, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, he will be paralyzed.<br> (This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs06_1=Soar without casting a shadow and claw at the enemy's heart to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and applying one level of Emptiness to him; <br>If you execute this attack while on the ground and hit an airborne enemy, the target will be grounded and will suffer additional damage.
desc_Qygp_sl_lzs07_1=Move like a wandering dragon, attack with claw, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq01_1=Your fist is icy as it smashes your opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This move also debuffs the target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky</font> effect, slowing their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq02_1=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq03_1=A cunning attack inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage on enemies in front of you. When you break an enemy's defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint attacks.<br>If you use this move within five seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq04_1=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq05_1=Overcome hardness with softness. Circulate your chi and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> effect, which removes any debuffs placed on you and absorbs some damage; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> is broken or when its effect naturally wears off, the damage it absorbs will be transferred to nearby enemies.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq06_1=The dragon emerges from the sea, bursting with energy. This movement inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage on surrounding enemies;<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you;<br>If you strike within five seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skill abilities.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq07_1=Outflank the enemy with this move and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Dispel</font> buff to yourself: Absorb damage while recovering your inner Energy and HP.
desc_Qygp_wd_tjq08_1=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
