desc_caijivip01_1=Gathering Skill Book
desc_clone007_csdz_01_2=The co-op skill of Tao Master Cang Song
desc_clone007_csdz_dch_2=Attack by Point in the Vast Sea will cause damage to players in a 5 meter radius at about 10% / 15% / 20% MAX HP per second.
desc_clone007_csdz_qws_2=Click on a player, who will be immobilized after being hit. It will cause energy depletion to all surrounding players.
desc_clone007_csdz_xdfy_2=The stars circle the moon and seal he sky and lock the land to force all player's within a 10 meter radius to lay down arms and launch.
desc_clone007_csdz_xuzhao_2=Select sword attack, cause smaller damage to surrounding enemies. When breaking enemy's parry, it knocks them flying.
desc_clone007_csdz_yqlj_2=Unending Sword Chi collects along one line. Causes damage to targets along the straight line ahead. Also makes them unable to parry.
desc_clone007_csdz_zjqw_2=Passion Potion Sword Chi makes fan shape. Causes damage to enemies in target range and knocks them down.
desc_clone007_lhs_01_2=The co-op skill of Lu Hanshan
desc_clone007_lhs_dbtx_2=Cause damage in direct proportion to currently expended MP to targets in front.
desc_clone007_lhs_dmsz_2=Attack with Yin, and all enemies in front will be knocked back. Give yourself a buff that will absorb the target's energy when attacked.
desc_clone007_lhs_jlty_2=Knock down targets in air and add buff. Use skill to cause blood loss.
desc_clone007_lhs_qmlw_2=Cause surrounding players to be knocked down.
desc_clone007_lhs_xuzhao_2=After breaking a parry, the target continuously loses energy.
desc_clone007_lhs_xxdf_2=Guide one strong martial arts skill. If you cannot output 15,000 damage to cut off this skill in 6 seconds, then all 100% max HP damage is caused to all targets within range, and their MP will be depleted.
desc_clone007_ssy_sds_2=Quickly approach one player and cause damage to players in an arc in front. Attacked players can carry dispelling buff. It produces an effect with a range of 10 meters after 5 seconds. The distress cloud continues for 20 seconds, and causes continuous 2% bleeding and 10 flying skill points every second.
desc_clone007_ssy_xuzhao_2=If their parry is countered, then they receive additional damage and are knocked flying into the air.
desc_clone007_ssy_ymfz_2=Cause damage to all players. Knock them flying and stun them for 5 seconds.
desc_clone007_ssy_ynsy_2=Attack two players in vicinity. Add deep resentment buff. If they do not use Circle the Moon Three Times within 7 seconds, then causes Max HP * 0.5 damage and puts them in faint for 5 seconds.
desc_clone007_ts_dbcj_2=Cause damage and stun targets in a straight line ahead. Clears hatred.
desc_clone007_ts_xczr_2=Charge at one target, causing them to be stunned. Clears hatred.
desc_clone007_ts_xuzhao_2=After breaking the parry, adds burning buff to target. Expends Chi and blood when moving.
desc_clone007_ts_zrjh_2=The Soul of Zhu Rong Breaks the Seal
desc_clone007_wwdz_dkcx_2=Kills the entire group instantly as soon as hit points are lower than 10%.
desc_clone007_wwdz_lqw_2=Attack in a fan shape in front of you. The players who are struck will get the Vulnerable effect.
desc_clone007_wwdz_xuzhao_2=After successfully breaking down the defense, you add the buff. You can add extra Yin Damage and Yang Damage with each attack.
desc_clone007_xzdz_tg1s_2=After taking in Chi, a defensive aura can be formed around the body to prevent direct damage. Release explosion 12 seconds later.
desc_clone007_xzdz_tg2s_2=Collect Chi in palm, and consume all current fogs. Causes damage to all players.
desc_clone007_xzdz_xuzhao_2=Cause smaller damage to surrounding players. After breaking the parry, you can press the button to cause disorder for target.
desc_clone007_ytdz_01_2=The co-op skill of Tao Master Yuan Tong
desc_clone007_ytdz_jtdd_2=Release one skill that can be cut off at 2,000 damage points. If it is not cut off, all surrounding players are knocked flying into the air.
desc_clone007_ytdz_smzn_2=Use Tai Chi Eight Diagrams power to seal combat site. All surrounding targets using flying skills within 10 seconds will receive additional damage.
desc_clone007_ytdz_tgbdb_2=Cause damage to players in a straight line ahead and knock them back.
desc_clone007_ytdz_xuzhao_2=If you successfully break the enemy's defense, then their speed is reduced and their flying skills are forbidden.
desc_clone007_ytdz_yhcs_2=Knock all targets behind you flying into the air. Causes damage and clears hatred.
desc_clone007_ytdz_ylcl_2=Knock all targets straight ahead flying into the air. Causes damage and clears hatred.
desc_clone009_jkpp_01_2=<s>
desc_clone009_jkpp_blfy_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock flying targets in the state of Stunned by Loathsome Rain. Attach your own Pain of Separation level damage and clear your own Pain of Separation effect.
desc_clone009_jkpp_fxxm_2=Cause damage to targets plus speed reduction effect. Produce splashing effect.
desc_clone009_jkpp_jaqm_2=Knock flying surrounding targets and cause damage.
desc_clone009_jkpp_jdfg_2=Subtract 50% of damage, and reduce movement speed by 50%.
desc_clone009_jkpp_xsdm_2=Cause continuous damage to surrounding targets and absorb some damage to transform it into your own Chi and blood.
desc_clone009_jkpp_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then it reduces their rage and energy.
desc_clone009_jkpp_xyyj_2=For use against targets in air. Piece the target into the ground and shock surrounding targets. Add wise heart effect damage and clear wide heart effect.
desc_clone009_jkpp_yhyc_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and stun effect.
desc_clone009_jkpp_yzxw_2=Enhance your own Chi and blood recovery speed so that you are immune to depletion effect for a certain time. Erase your own hatred.
desc_clone009_jmst_dhz_2=Hidden weapon skill causes faint effect in an arc.
desc_clone009_jmst_gfty_2=Cause damage to units along straight line for 30 meters and knock them back.
desc_clone009_jmst_lxqd_2=Cause damage to targets along straight line and add knock down effect.
desc_clone009_jmst_myjz_2=Give yourself reflective damage effect and reflect 50% of damage from the back.
desc_clone009_jmst_sjlh_2=Call four disciples for help. Trigger in sequence.
desc_clone009_jmst_sykt_2=Ricochets off surrounding targets and causes damage.
desc_clone009_jmst_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then they are knocked down.
desc_clone009_jyst_01_2=Co-op Skill
desc_clone009_jyst_cccd_2=Cause all surrounding targets to go into faint. Damage received is eliminated. Give yourself confusion effect.
desc_clone009_jyst_cfhs_2=Cause continuous damage to one target within range.
desc_clone009_jyst_cxmt_2=Cause damage to one target plus grudge outbreak effect.
desc_clone009_jyst_qthh_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock them flying. Reduce speed and forbid flying skills. Give yourself spirit calming effect.
desc_clone009_jyst_qthh_3=<s>
desc_clone009_jyst_wcqs_2=Cause damage to targets in front in a rectangular range. Reduce their defense and knock them down. Erase your own hatred.
desc_clone009_jyst_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are immobilized.
desc_clone009_myst_01_2=Co-op Skill
desc_clone009_myst_fymm_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets and adds silence effect.
desc_clone009_myst_tygy_2=Cause apportioned damage to all surrounding targets within range and knock them back.
desc_clone009_myst_tylyz_2=Call a few Emei advanced disciples to help out. You can continuously recover 1,000 HP every two seconds.
desc_clone009_myst_tyzg_2=Release one fog that can block certain damage. Absorb sufficient damage and then the fog buff will disappear and shock away surrounding enemies.
desc_clone009_myst_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
desc_clone009_myst_zqdl_2=Cause damage to all surrounding targets and clear Buddha's Golden Aura effect.
desc_clone009_syx_01_2=Co-op Skill
desc_clone009_syx_bshql_2=Cause damage. Immobilize single targets and continuously restore energy.
desc_clone009_syx_hjsdl_2=Cause damage to targets in front in an arc. Knock them flying and they regain energy when stationary.
desc_clone009_syx_jdqy_2=Damaging skill that knocks flying ground targets. Also adds to target's energy and clears hatred.
desc_clone009_syx_jdrc_2=Continuously cast spell, repeatedly bounce off targets. Add chaos effect. When finished casting spell, enter energy depletion state for immobilization and ease of damage.
desc_clone009_syx_jjqy_2=Cause long-range damage to one target.
desc_clone009_syx_jzshr_2=Cause damage to single players. If player's energy is insufficient, then it causes great damage.
desc_clone009_syx_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then they are stunned.
desc_clone009_zrz_gklh_2=Adds reflective damage protection to surrounding friendly targets.
desc_clone009_zrz_gycs_2=Cause major damage to targets in front within rectangle-shaped range.
desc_clone009_zrz_gyzt_2=Allows surrounding targets to recover. It can be cut off after receiving a certain amount of damage.
desc_clone009_zrz_gztx_2=Cause damage to single target and seal skills for 5 seconds.
desc_clone009_zrz_jybgz_2=Nine Yin Bone Claw
desc_clone009_zrz_yhsg_2=Recover 1% Max HP each 60 seconds for 600 seconds.
desc_clone009_zyc_01_2=Co-op Skill
desc_clone009_zyc_cbhm_2=Jade maiden sword directly stabs target and knocks it flying into the air.
desc_clone009_zyc_chjy_2=Cause major damage to surrounding targets. Can be reduced by leaping into the air.
desc_clone009_zyc_fhly_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and immobilize.
desc_clone009_zyc_jaqm_2=Continuous knock flying the surrounding targets and cause damage.
desc_clone009_zyc_jaqm_3=<s>
desc_clone009_zyc_mlhs_2=Cause damage to targets in front and knock them back.
desc_clone009_zyc_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
desc_clone011_zhzhd_xgqa_2=<s>
desc_clone015_dujuan_jiazhao_1=Gain a parry effect, and each successful parry will cause your attacker to lose extra HP.
desc_clone015_yeqianniang_jiazhao_1=Gain a parry effect, and each successful parry will poison your attacker.
desc_clone017_dxs_01_2=The co-op skill of Ding Xiaoshan
desc_clone017_dxs_cgfc_2=Cause continuous burning damage to area beyond a 5 meter radius from you.
desc_clone017_dxs_fmash_2=The release of this skills knocks targets in range flying vertically and continuously knocks them flying.
desc_clone017_dxs_jlhs_2=Cause damage to targets in front within an arc and knock them down.
desc_clone017_dxs_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
desc_clone017_dxs_xxzh_2=Throw kindling at one target, When the kindling explodes, it can infect all nearby players within range.
desc_clone017_dxs_zhhbm_2=Heal all friendly targets in range. Prepare for 5 seconds. When receiving 2,000 damage points, can be cut off. When starting to prepare, give yourself the effect of reflecting damage.
desc_clone017_gh_lcfj_2=Charge at one target and add flying skills forbidding effect.
desc_clone017_lcy_01_2=The co-op skill of Lu Changyuan
desc_clone017_lcy_fycx_2=Launch charge at one target. Nauseate target.
desc_clone017_lcy_hlcd_2=Cause damage to one target and knock them flying. Clear this target's hatred.
desc_clone017_lcy_jdpy_2=Wield Sword Chi against players in straight line ahead and knock back targets in range.
desc_clone017_lcy_txjz_2=Place one sword array at your feet. Increase your own attack speed and absorb a certain amount of damage, transforming it into hit points. However, you receive additional damage.
desc_clone017_lcy_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are knocked down.
desc_clone017_lcy_yfmjz_2=Swing Sword around rapidly and strike surrounding targets
desc_clone017_qct_jhyx_2=Cause minor damage to a single target. If the target does not parry, they are stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_clone017_qct_sscr_2=Automatically explodes when your hit points are lower than 50%. If Ding Xiaoshan is alive, then Ding Xiaoshan is made to recover 5% max Chi and hit points.
desc_clone017_shh_01_2=The co-op skill of Shen Hao
desc_clone017_shh_jzlh_2=Continuously attack one target. If the target has blade damage, then deal additional damage.
desc_clone017_shh_nhshh_2=Slash continuously and cause damage to all targets in front. Transform blade damage to blade skill. If the target parries, then there is probability they will be knocked down.
desc_clone017_shh_pg_2=Spread blade-chopping Chi against one target. Causes blade damage to target and bleeding effect.
desc_clone017_shh_pkz_2=Cause cutting damage to all targets in front. If the target has blade damage, then deal additional damage and knock them down.
desc_clone017_shh_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If target parries, then it immobilizes them, and they cannot parry for a long time.
desc_clone017_shh_xwbf_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets. If targets have blade damage, then it causes explosion, additional damage, and immobilization.
desc_clone017_shhl_01_2=Fingers turn into claws to directly strike the enemy's face and cause damage to target.
desc_clone017_shhl_shyjd_2=Divine Eagle's Nine-Fold Attack, causes continuous damage to surrounding targets.
desc_clone017_shhl_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then they are knocked down.
desc_clone017_shhl_yjchk_2=Cause damage to all surrounding targets. Suck blood and temporarily immobilize.
desc_clone017_shhl_yxtj_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock them down.
desc_clone017_shhl_yyhsh_2=Continuously attack a target that has fallen to the ground and splash surrounding targets.
desc_clone017_shhl_zhmzhzh_2=Release Peck Eye and Fight for Pearls against all targets within range of one target. There is bleeding and decrease of speed. There is probability of falling to the ground and being hit by blood sucking attack when using flying skills.
desc_clone017_skk_01_2=The co-op skill of Shi Kongkong
desc_clone017_skk_dstx_2=Shock surrounding targets, launching them into the air and causing continuous damage.
desc_clone017_skk_fzsx_2=Spread poison powder at the feet of one target; causes continuous damage to targets within range. If a target is in the air, they are knocked to the ground and receive major damage.
desc_clone017_skk_sgts_2=Cause damage to targets along straight line in front and knocks them flying.
desc_clone017_skk_sjzx_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and puts in faint.
desc_clone017_skk_xpy_2=<s>
desc_clone017_skk_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, then they expend energy.
desc_clone017_wzl_01_2=The co-op skill of Guang Gong
desc_clone017_wzl_jshnd_2=Cause all surrounding targets to fall into daze. Reduces hit rate and increases rage.
desc_clone017_wzl_jytx_2=Increase your own perception to max and take the opportunity to attack. When the enemy target exposes a weakness, they will be killed in a split second. If the enemy target is stationary, they will not expose their weakness when they defend. When the skill is completely released, you fall into a vulnerable immobilized state.
desc_clone017_wzl_lxfd_2=Slash out with Sword Chi. Knock down all targets along straight line.
desc_clone017_wzl_qsyrzh_2=Call up six sword array disciples; place array down to increase your movement speed.
desc_clone017_wzl_qxpy_2=Cause damage to surrounding targets and knock them flying into the air.
desc_clone017_wzl_sdqm_2=Continuously cast spell to cause damage to surrounding targets.
desc_clone017_wzl_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, they are stunned.
desc_clone017_wzl_zqdl_2=Concentrate refinement of Sword Chi protection. Become immune to damage from behind.
desc_clone017_yzp_01_2=The co-op skill of Yue Zhipeng
desc_clone017_yzp_bwwq_2=Cause damage to targets in the air and directly spear them into the ground.
desc_clone017_yzp_chhlr_2=Spread in a circle and cause damage to targets in range. Targets are knocked down by the first hit and knocked flying by the second hit.
desc_clone017_yzp_dmgy_2=Forbids flying skills to all targets around a certain target and rains the Misty Cloud effect on their head. Causes continuous damage to all targets within range. Targets in mid-air receive major damage.
desc_clone017_yzp_hmq_2=Cause major damage to all targets behind you.
desc_clone017_yzp_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If the target parries, they receive additional damage effect.
desc_clone017_yzp_zhzhq_2=Cause damage to one target; also adds a bleeding effect.
desc_clone017_zhcf_01_2=Charge skill. Burning blade. Burning flesh and boiling blood. Causes damage to targets.
desc_clone017_zhcf_01_3=<s>
desc_clone017_zhcf_gjshj_2=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
desc_clone017_zhcf_gshwl_2=Cause damage to targets in front and cause blood loss damage.
desc_clone017_zhcf_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are knocked back.
desc_clone017_zhcf_xxshh_2=Randomly bind together all targets within range of a target. Add bloody blade Chi effect. Causes continuous damage to surrounding friendly targets.
desc_clone017_zhcf_xzhbf_2=Wave blade to strike into ground and shake all surrounding targets until they down.
desc_clone019_dujuan_01_2=Click on the ground around the target to create a lake of fire which erupts and then sends the target flying up into the air.
desc_clone019_haidaotouzi_01_2=Release ice column in front of you. The explosion causes damage to surrounding targets and freezes them.
desc_clone019_hulahual_wdg_2=With normal attack, each time the target is hit, there is a chance to add Soul Eating Insect, Life-Eating Poison, or Bloodletting Poison effect to the target.
desc_clone019_hwt_01_2=The co-op skill of He Wentao
desc_clone019_hwt_xmzj_2=Cause fixed damage to all surrounding players; can be cut off. After it is cut off, demon possession is reduced by one level.
desc_clone019_hwt_xuzhao_2=After successfully breaking down the defense, you add the buff. You can add extra Yin Damage and Yang Damage with each attack.
desc_clone019_licheng_01_2=<s>
desc_clone019_licheng_dcrq_2=A charging stance. A NPC will be created within a certan fange when the skill is released. A halo will appear. Players will be immun to any damage while staying inside the halo and will recieve massive damage when out of the halo
desc_clone019_licheng_hsz_2=Leap to random target and knock them down.
desc_clone019_licheng_pds_2=Shock away surrounding targets and cause damage.
desc_clone019_licheng_plz_2=Deal massive damage to targets in the same row and knock them down.
desc_clone019_licheng_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then their raged is erased.
desc_clone019_licheng_yyz_2=Cleave all targets in an arc and cause speed reduction and blindness effect.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_01_2=Southern Palace Plate
desc_clone019_mazhalan_sxg_2=Sacrifice your HP to inflict the "Bloodthirsty Insect" effect to surrounding targets, causing continuous HP loss. Each time an affected player uses the Flying Skill, the effective time for "Bloodthirsty Insect" will reset.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_sy_2=Targets within a rectangular area of effect are poisoned, gradually losing Energy. Each time an affected player uses the Flying skill, the effective time for the skill will reset.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, they are knocked flying into the air and receive major Yin Damage.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_xxzh_2=Cause damage to all surrounding targets. Directly get Soul Destroying Poison. Directly explode. Causes damage to yourself and all players within 5 meters range.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_xyft_2=Build a Blood Pond within the scope of a target, inflict continuous damages to the ambient targets and consume Flying Skill.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_ygdm_2=When the poison is in deadly form, surrounding players go up one buff level. If flying skills are not used within 5 seconds, then it causes split second killing damage to all surrounding players.
desc_clone019_shantianming_01_2=Shan Wuliang's Assembled Moves
desc_clone019_shantianming_by_2=Create a crescent shadow blade. Do harm to targets in a straight line and add a buff to them. Every time they use a flying skill they will go into Bleeding. They will not be able to jump for 20 seconds.
desc_clone019_shantianming_cqzr_2=This mid-air skill causes damage to targets and must add weakness effect.
desc_clone019_shantianming_dcrq_2=A charging stance. A NPC will be created within a certan fange when the skill is released. A halo will appear. Players will be immun to any damage while staying inside the halo and will recieve massive damage when out of the halo
desc_clone019_shantianming_jh_2=Cause damage to all targets in a 120° arc in front of you. After knocking them down, adds bleeding effect.
desc_clone019_shantianming_rqqc_2=When activated, causes minor damage to surrounding targets. Attach additional damage to your own attack Give yourself added Dark Poison Halo. Targets that enter range of halo receive continuous damage. However, you receive 50% additional damage.
desc_clone019_shantianming_sxld_2=Terrorize surrounding targets. Lower target attack power and defense power.
desc_clone019_shantianming_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to targets in front. If target parries, then they expend rage and add bonus immunity state effect.
desc_clone019_shantianming_zk_2=Deal constant damage to targets nearby and grant additional block damage to hitted targets.
desc_clone019_wh_01_2=The co-op skill of Buddha's messenger
desc_clone019_wh_djl_2=If you simultaneously have icy and fiery buffs, then you can directly kill the enemy in a split second.
desc_clone019_wh_jctz_2=Add one sword array for yourself. Causes continuous damage to surroundings. After it is finished, it stuns people.
desc_clone019_wh_jhyj_2=Choose 1/2/3 players and make them carry icy buff. After it is finished, cause damage to surroundings and immobilization.
desc_clone019_wh_mbjl_2=Invincible Chop
desc_clone019_wh_xuzhao_2=After breaking the parry, cause additional damage to the target and lose a certain amount of energy every second.
desc_clone019_wh_zyfy_2=Choose 1/2/3 players and make them carry fiery buff. Place one flame under their feet every second.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_01_2=Liu Yu's combination skills
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_cxpx_2=Rub poison essence on yourself and reflect 100% of poisonous damage from surprise attacks from behind.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_dmqj_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. For 10 seconds, targets will fall over if they try to move.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_dsyy_2=Randomly throw blue toxic fog under the feet of a target. They expend Chi and blood energy for 10 seconds, and flying skills are forbidden. Press key to dislocate.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_tmd_2=Cause poisonous damage to all surrounding targets plus speed reduction and flying skills forbidding effect.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_wdcq_2=Poison a target and cause transmissible damage to other targets nearby, lasting 10s.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_xhd_2=Spray poison mottled powder on all targets in front. Causes continuous bleeding damage. After level 5, produces great damage.
desc_clone019_yanchuchu_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If target parries, then the Heart Ache Inch Poison effect is added. Receives damage when moving.
desc_clone019_yaojian_01_2=Lan Xuexin's Assembled Moves
desc_clone019_yaojian_chq_2=Add panic effect to all surrounding targets. Reduce some ownership attributes.
desc_clone019_yaojian_gsfz_2=Randomly drop an ancient coffin in the range of the target. Causes damage to targets in range and knock them down. Also create three skeletons.
desc_clone019_yaojian_sbs_2=Body corpses will explode and cause massive damage to targets around bone corpses. A boss monster will recover the maximum HP by 1% as each body corpse explode.
desc_clone019_yaojian_slft_2=Release your own potential. Shock away surrounding targets. Give yourself corpse power. Attach greater additional damage to attack power for 15 seconds. Completely transform corpse poison to corpse stench. Causes major damage to players.
desc_clone019_yaojian_slmf_2=Use corpse refinement esoteric spell to call all corpse to your side. Make the corpses temporarily immune to control. Increase movement speed and attack speed.
desc_clone019_yaojian_swfl_2=Strike all targets in a straight line and have them corpse poisoned. This corpse poison can be stacked; it inflicts a small amount of damage each second.
desc_clone019_yaojian_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then it adds corpse poison and knock-flying effect.
desc_clone019_yingyan_01_2=Cycling Claw Strike
desc_clone019_yingyan_cs_2=Savage Feeding continues for a relatively longer time. When a certain amount of damage is received, then it can be cut off. After it is successful, your own hit points are recovered.
desc_clone019_yingyan_fzzc_2=Flapping both wings, create a hurricane under your feet. The targets in the range of the hurricane have their speed reduced. They receive continuous damage and are knocked flying backward.
desc_clone019_yingyan_lzdm_2=Eagle Eye Transformation concentrates energy. Brawn and accuracy greatly increased.
desc_clone019_yingyan_lzj_2=Deal damage to targets in sight and cause them to bleed
desc_clone019_yingyan_qylw_2=Call many mature eagles to help. The normal attack of mature eagles also has a chance probability of causing a stun effect.
desc_clone019_yingyan_xuzhao_2=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target parries, then they are knocked down.
desc_clone019_yingyan_yjck_2=Cause all targets in front to receive continuous damage and continuously knock them back. If the target moves, it receives additional damage.
desc_clone019_yingyan_zfz_2=Deal damage to targets nearby and grant deadly damage to targets having minor scraches.
