desc_CS_em_lbc01_7=A seizing motion that deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This movement places you in the <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> stance: It raises your Parting Sorrow Sting movement's hit rating and increases your ability to break the enemy's block. This state can be stacked.
desc_CS_em_lbc03_1=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
