desc_CS_em_lbc05_1=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point.
desc_CS_em_lbc05_2=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. There is also a chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_CS_em_lbc05_3=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. There is also a slightly greater chance of adding on more rage point on top of that.
desc_CS_em_lbc05_4=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds two additional rage points.
desc_CS_em_lbc05_5=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds two additional rage points. There is also the chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_CS_em_lbc05_6=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds two additional rage points. There is also a slightly greater chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_CS_em_lbc05_7=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds three additional rage points.
desc_CS_em_yxc06_1=挥刺连舞，特殊气劲可加速恢复自身及友方淤血；余力亦可震伤周边敌人造成{@0:伤害包}。
desc_CS_em_yxc06_2=挥刺连舞，特殊气劲可加速恢复自身及友方淤血；余力亦可震伤周边敌人造成{@0:伤害包}。
desc_CS_em_yxc06_3=挥刺连舞，特殊气劲可加速恢复自身及友方淤血；余力亦可震伤周边敌人造成{@0:伤害包}。
desc_CS_em_yxc06_4=挥刺连舞，特殊气劲可加速恢复自身及友方淤血；余力亦可震伤周边敌人造成{@0:伤害包}。
desc_CS_em_yxc06_5=挥刺连舞，特殊气劲可加速恢复自身及友方淤血；余力亦可震伤周边敌人造成{@0:伤害包}。
desc_CS_em_yxc06_6=Wield sting to attack continuously, the special chi force can increase HP recovering speed for yourself and friendly target, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_em_yxc06_7=Wield sting to attack continuously, the special chi force can increase HP recovering speed for yourself and friendly target, and the remained force will shock surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_6=A surprise attack on heaven and earth that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If used to break a block the movement closes accupoints on the enemy's feet. This causes the enemy to lose a large amount of inner Energy when using a Flying Skill within 17 seconds of being hit by this attack; <br>The movement also ignites the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> state, and the deeper the enemy's state of inebriation, the more damage he takes.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_7=A surprise attack on heaven and earth that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If used to break a block the movement closes accupoints on the enemy's feet. This causes the enemy to lose a large amount of inner Energy when using a Flying Skill within 19 seconds of being hit by this attack; <br>The movement also ignites the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> state, and the deeper the enemy's state of inebriation, the more damage he takes.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_1=挥棍破空而击，气劲对空中目标造成{@0:伤害包}；<br>若自己在醉酒状态,则消耗一层<font color="#FFAE00">“醉意”</font>，使目标受到一次爆炸伤害并被击飞（对空中的敌人才能触发）。
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_2=挥棍破空而击，气劲对空中目标造成{@0:伤害包}；<br>若自己在醉酒状态,则消耗一层<font color="#FFAE00">“醉意”</font>，使目标受到一次爆炸伤害并被击飞（对空中的敌人才能触发）。
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_3=挥棍破空而击，气劲对空中目标造成{@0:伤害包}；<br>若自己在醉酒状态,则消耗一层<font color="#FFAE00">“醉意”</font>，使目标受到一次爆炸伤害并被击飞（对空中的敌人才能触发）。
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_4=挥棍破空而击，气劲对空中目标造成{@0:伤害包}；<br>若自己在醉酒状态,则消耗一层<font color="#FFAE00">“醉意”</font>，使目标受到一次爆炸伤害并被击飞（对空中的敌人才能触发）。
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_5=挥棍破空而击，气劲对空中目标造成{@0:伤害包}；<br>若自己在醉酒状态,则消耗一层<font color="#FFAE00">“醉意”</font>，使目标受到一次爆炸伤害并被击飞（对空中的敌人才能触发）。
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_6=Wield staff to attack in air, the chi Force hits target and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If you are in Drunken state, then it will cost one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Drunk"</font> state, blasting the target and tossing him away.
desc_CS_gb_ksbf07_7=Wield staff to attack in air, the chi Force hits target and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>If you are in Drunken state, then it will cost one level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Drunk"</font> state, blasting the target and tossing him away.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_1=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_2=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_3=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_4=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_1=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_2=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_3=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_4=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_1=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Surrounding targets receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also adds<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>status: Unable to stand still and deal continuous damage to surrounding targets. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>status is not stopped within 4 seconds, surrounding targets are stunned for 1 second. Also, based on your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you receive<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each stacked level increases this skill's power by 15% and recovers both Chi and energy. Active for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used under <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>'s level is increased. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_2=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also makes you enter<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state: You cannot stand still, and it causes continuous damage to surrounding enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 1 second. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you get<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each level increases this routine skill's power by 15% and recovers Chi and energy. The burst and recovery last for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, increase the<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_3=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Surrounding targets receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also adds<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>status: Unable to stand still and deal continuous damage to surrounding targets. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>status is not stopped within 4 seconds, surrounding targets are stunned for 2 seconds. Also, based on your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you receive<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each stacked level increases this skill's power by 15% and recovers both Chi and energy. Active for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used under <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>'s level is increased. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_4=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also makes you enter<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state: You cannot stand still, and it causes continuous damage to surrounding enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 2 seconds. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you get<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each level increases this routine skill's power by 15% and recovers Chi and energy. The burst and recovery last for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, increase the<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_5=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Surrounding targets receive{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also adds<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>status: Unable to stand still and deal continuous damage to surrounding targets. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>status is not stopped within 4 seconds, surrounding targets are stunned for 3 seconds. Also, based on your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you receive<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each stacked level increases this skill's power by 15% and recovers both Chi and energy. Active for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used under <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>'s level is increased. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cljf05_6=Coiled Branches Underground, Heart and Hand Dedication: Cause surrounding enemies{@0:damage packet}; <br>Also makes you enter<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state: You cannot stand still, and it causes continuous damage to surrounding enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 3 seconds. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level, you get<font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each level increases this routine skill's power by 15% and recovers Chi and energy. The burst and recovery last for 10 seconds. <br>( This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. Based on your own<font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font>level, increase the<font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Sword</font>level. Clear one level of Dancing Sword state each time you are attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_cyjf08_1=Your sword is like the setting sun searing the heavens. Wield it to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage upon surrounding enemies, and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>;<br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> and will be sent flying.<br>(The greater the effect of Lihuo Chi, the more the enemy will be sent flying.)<br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf08_2=Your sword is like the setting sun searing the heavens. Wield it to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage upon surrounding enemies, and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>;<br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> and will be sent flying.<br>(The greater the effect of Lihuo Chi, the more the enemy will be sent flying.)<br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
