desc_CS_jh_hyjf01_1=Standing on wall, spraying sword Qi. Chop front enemy and Deal {@0:伤害包} to them.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Surprise Snow"</font> state: Decrease Yan Xing and Cloud penetrating speed, it can be accumulated 3 times. (The third time attack will make target dizzy for 1 second.)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf01_2=Standing on wall, spraying sword Qi. Chop front enemy and Deal {@0:伤害包} to them.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Surprise Snow"</font> state: Decrease Yan Xing and Cloud penetrating speed, it can be accumulated 3 times. (The third time attack will make target dizzy for 1 second.)
