desc_CS_jh_lbwb02_1=Deplete Flying Skill: <font color="#f9fc00">100</font><br/>When Chi and Hp are below 50%, Dominating Super Armor (Red) activates when attacked. Active for 5 seconds.<br/>Use [Wild Shot Fist] with [100 Divine Transformations] together (Can be stacked together up to 10 times): No longer consumes Rage and Energy, damages targets within 10 meters and increases their original effect <br/><font color="#f9fc00">[Wild Shot Fist - 1]</font>: Damage inflicted increased by 20%<br/><font color="#f9fc00">[Wild Shot Fist - 2]</font>: Strikes target's meridian point; after "Divine Speed of 100 Faces" reverts to its original level, targets with struck accupoints and knocked away. <br/><font color="#f9fc00">[Wild Shot Fist - 3]</font>: Recover your Chi and HP (Recovered amount equal to the skill's damage)<br/><font color="#f9fc00">[Wild Shot Fist - 4]</font>: Cannot be overcome by Overt Moves. If target's Endurance is broken, they will be unable to parry for 10 seconds.<br/>
desc_CS_jh_liusha04_1=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha04_2=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
