desc_CS_jh_liusha08_1=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (138 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_2=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (164 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_3=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (236 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_4=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (288 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_5=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (348 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_liusha08_6=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (407 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
