desc_CS_jh_ncd05_5=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_CS_jh_ncd05_6=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds.(Upgrading the skill will increase the damage of the counter-attack.)<br>This defensive skill is not effective against one of the Super Armors (red or yellow), and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_CS_jh_ncd07_1=If you reuse the last skills used from this set, the cooldown for this skill will be reset.<br>When you reuse <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font>, you can ignore target's parry while dealing damage.<br>When you reuse <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> , you can deal damage to nearby enemies when "Dagger Cloaked in Red" has been interrupted.
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_1=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_2=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_3=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_tlq03_4=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_1=A stored energy attack. Charge up and burst through the air to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">concentration</font> state or have been <font color="#FFAE00">enraged</font>, you can knock the enemy back and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state to your target, which disables his defenses for three seconds. The attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Deepen Damage</font> effect, which increases external hard damage taken with each blow.
desc_CS_jh_tlq04_2=A stored energy attack. Charge up and burst through the air to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">concentration</font> state or have been <font color="#FFAE00">enraged</font>, you can knock the enemy back and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state to your target, which disables his defenses for three seconds. The attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Deepen Damage</font> effect, which increases external hard damage taken with each blow.
