desc_CS_jh_tlq04_4=A stored energy attack. Charge up and burst through the air to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">concentration</font> state or have been <font color="#FFAE00">enraged</font>, you can knock the enemy back and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state to your target, which disables his defenses for three seconds. The attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Deepen Damage</font> effect, which increases external hard damage taken with each blow.
desc_CS_jh_tlq05_2=Your fist is like a spear, both overt and feint. Stab at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's parry you can knock him back, preventing him from moving for two seconds.
