desc_CS_jh_tmjt05_2=A defensive movement in which a demonic air surrounds your body, allowing you to add either the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Breath</font> or the <font color="#FFAE00">Devil Taoist Overrun</font> state to yourself when you successfully parry. either will increase your movement speed by 20? and you will not be able to be sent flying, knocked back, knocked down, or locked. Your anti-disease activities will be limited.
