desc_CS_jl_dmssj05_1=A cloud-penetrating movement. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their movements. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
