desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_1=Block Move - Move like a ghost. Successful parry can greatly increase movement speed. Effect lasts 2 seconds. <br>The attacker has a certain chance of gaining the <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> effect.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_2=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed increases for 2.5 seconds. <br>There is a chance to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> onto the attacker.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_3=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed increases for 3 seconds. <br>There is a chance to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> onto the attacker.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_4=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed increases for 3.5 seconds. <br>There is a chance to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> onto the attacker.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_5=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed increases for 4 seconds. <br>There is a chance to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> onto the attacker.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_6=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed increases for 4.5 seconds. <br>There is a chance to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> onto the attacker.
desc_CS_tm_tmzhd05_7=Every time you parry successfully with this defensive stance, your Movement Speed increases for 5 seconds. <br>There is a chance to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Drifting Soul"</font> onto the attacker.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_1=两仪心法，可调息切换阴阳状态，以发挥剑法优势：<br><font color="#FFAE00">阳</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳纯阳真气，额外提升招式阳伤害；<font color="#FFAE00">“阳切阴”</font>时会将纯阳真气转换为内力并对目标造成伤害。<br><font color="#FFAE00">阴</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳至阴真气，额外提升自身伤害减免；<font color="#FFAE00">“阴切阳”</font>时会将至阴真气化生，恢复淤血并令目标昏迷。
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_2=两仪心法，可调息切换阴阳状态，以发挥剑法优势：<br><font color="#FFAE00">阳</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳纯阳真气，额外提升招式阳伤害；<font color="#FFAE00">“阳切阴”</font>时会将纯阳真气转换为内力并对目标造成伤害。<br><font color="#FFAE00">阴</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳至阴真气，额外提升自身伤害减免；<font color="#FFAE00">“阴切阳”</font>时会将至阴真气化生，恢复淤血并令目标昏迷。
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_3=两仪心法，可调息切换阴阳状态，以发挥剑法优势：<br><font color="#FFAE00">阳</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳纯阳真气，额外提升招式阳伤害；<font color="#FFAE00">“阳切阴”</font>时会将纯阳真气转换为内力并对目标造成伤害。<br><font color="#FFAE00">阴</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳至阴真气，额外提升自身伤害减免；<font color="#FFAE00">“阴切阳”</font>时会将至阴真气化生，恢复淤血并令目标昏迷。
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_4=两仪心法，可调息切换阴阳状态，以发挥剑法优势：<br><font color="#FFAE00">阳</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳纯阳真气，额外提升招式阳伤害；<font color="#FFAE00">“阳切阴”</font>时会将纯阳真气转换为内力并对目标造成伤害。<br><font color="#FFAE00">阴</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳至阴真气，额外提升自身伤害减免；<font color="#FFAE00">“阴切阳”</font>时会将至阴真气化生，恢复淤血并令目标昏迷。
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_5=两仪心法，可调息切换阴阳状态，以发挥剑法优势：<br><font color="#FFAE00">阳</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳纯阳真气，额外提升招式阳伤害；<font color="#FFAE00">“阳切阴”</font>时会将纯阳真气转换为内力并对目标造成伤害。<br><font color="#FFAE00">阴</font>状态下，每次使用剑法会吸纳至阴真气，额外提升自身伤害减免；<font color="#FFAE00">“阴切阳”</font>时会将至阴真气化生，恢复淤血并令目标昏迷。
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_6=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_CS_wd_lyjf01_7=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_CS_wd_tjj05_1=A swift sword slash. Break target's block and cause {@0: damage bag} to the target;<br>It enables you to absorb target's Energys after breaking target's block.
