desc_CS_wd_tjj05_6=Stab slightly, break parry of enemies in front of you, deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the enemy cannot block, this attack will drain enemy's Energy.
desc_CS_wd_tjj05_7=Stab slightly, break parry of enemies in front of you, deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the enemy cannot block, this attack will drain enemy's Energy.
desc_CS_wd_tjj06_7=Defense state - each successful parry will recover your 17 Energy (Recover value depends on internal skills)
desc_CS_wd_tjq05_1=Overcome hardness with softness. Circulate your chi and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> effect, which removes any debuffs placed on you and absorbs some damage; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> is broken or when its effect naturally wears off, the damage it absorbs will be transferred to nearby enemies.
