desc_Clone017_atk_1=<s>
desc_jn_drtg_003_1=Damage targets and infuse them with ordinary inner power, causing them to explode upon death, damaging all targets within 10 meters. Damage is equivalent to their max HP.
desc_jn_drtg_005_1=Max HP raised by 30% for 2 minutes. Produce a protection effect and absorb damage equivalent to max HP. Active for 2 minutes before shield is broken. When shield is active, your Super Armor is weakened.
