desc_cs_wd_lyjf01_1=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_cs_wd_lyjf01_2=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_cs_wd_lyjf01_3=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_cs_wd_lyjf01_4=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
desc_cs_wd_lyjf01_5=Mental skill of Yin Yang Sword, can switch between yin and yang states, to make special effects.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yang</font> state, each attack will drain Yang chi to deal extra yang damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yang to Yin"</font> will convert Yang chi into Energy and deal damage to target.<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Yin</font> state, each attack will drain Yin chi, reduce extra taken damage. <font color="#FFAE00">"Switch from Yin to Yang"</font> will convert Yin chi into HP and stun target.
