desc_Boss_em_lbc01_1=A seizing motion that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This movement places you in the <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> stance: It raises your Parting Sorrow Sting movement's hit rating and can be stacked.
