desc_Boss_em_lbc01_7=A seizing motion that deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This movement places you in the <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> stance: It raises your Parting Sorrow Sting movement's hit rating and increases your ability to break the enemy's block. This state can be stacked.
