desc_Boss_em_lbc05_1=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point.
desc_Boss_em_lbc05_2=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. There is also a chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_Boss_em_lbc05_3=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the movement places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. There is also a slightly greater chance of adding on more rage point on top of that.
