desc_Boss_em_lbc07_1=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
