desc_Boss_jl_zfd07_1=Chase Wind on the Ground: The blade is like wind, attack and punch away enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}, when target suffers <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, target will take extra hardness damage.<br/>Chase Lightning in Air: chi force is like lightning, attack selected area to deal {@0:伤害包}, and at the same time the enemies suffering <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> will be unable to use skills, and take extra hardness damage.
