desc_Boss_wd_qfjf05_6=A defensive movement. Purge your heart and spirit. With each successful parry you add the <font color="#FFAE00">Cleansing Wind</font> buff which improves your sword strikes for 20 seconds: This reduces your Cloudy Jing Clear Wei chi circulation period and increases the damage from your Noble Influence sword strike.
