desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_1=A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times. <br>Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of skills.<br>This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_2=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_3=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_4=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_5=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
