desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_7=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf02_8=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf03_1=Violet Mist of Doom inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflicts target with <font color="#FF3030">"Evil Influence"</font> at the same time player's <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> invades target. Every skill will be disabled for a short time when used. Lasts for 15 seconds. Each skill disabled removes 1 stackable effect of Evil Influence. <br>Can transform at most 1 stackable effect of "Evil Influence" into "Evil Wind".<br>As movement speed increases, target receives more damage.<br>This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf03_2=Drifting shadow and flying immortal, the purple air comes from the east{@0:伤害包}. <br>Causes to target <font color="#FF3030">"Poisoned by Evil Wind"</font> at the same time player's <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> invades target. Every skill will be sealed for a short time when used. Lasts for 15 seconds. Each Seal Skill removes 1 stack of Poisoned by Evil Wind.  <br>(Can transform at most 1 stack of "Evil Influence" into "Poisoned by Evil Wind")<br> (Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf03_3=Violet Mist of Doom inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflicts target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> at the same time player's <font color="#FF3030">"Evil Influence"</font> invades target. Every skill will be disabled for a short time when used. Lasts for 15 seconds. Each skill disabled removes 1 stackable effect of Evil Influence. <br>Can transform at most 2 stacked effects of "Evil Influence" into "Evil Wind".<br>As movement speed increases, target receives more damage.<br>This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf03_4=Drifting shadow and flying immortal, the purple air comes from the east{@0:伤害包}. <br>Causes to target <font color="#FFAE00">"Poisoned by Evil Wind"</font> at the same time player's <font color="#FF3030">"Evil Influence"</font> invades target. Every skill will be sealed for a short time when used. Lasts for 15 seconds. Each Seal Skill removes 1 stack of Poisoned by Evil Wind.  <br>(Can transform at most 2 stack of "Evil Influence" into "Poisoned by Evil Wind")<br> (Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
desc_CS_jh_bxjf03_5=Violet Mist of Doom inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflicts target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> at the same time player's <font color="#FF3030">"Evil Influence"</font> invades target. Every skill will be disabled for a short time when used. Lasts for 15 seconds. Each skill disabled removes 1 stackable effect of Evil Influence. <br>Can transform at most 3 stacked effects of "Evil Influence" into "Evil Wind".<br>As movement speed increases, target receives more damage.<br>This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.
