desc_CS_jh_hjdf07_2=The blade has become me, and I am the blade. The blade is in the dance and the dance has become the blade. Causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">Unconsciousness</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(Player may move freely when using skill, status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use)
