desc_CS_jh_jsjf04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking down the enemy's defense: <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds, while also adding <font color="#FFAE00">"Provocation"</font> state: If attacked within 5 seconds target will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds.
