desc_CS_jh_jsjf06_1=When successfully defending an attack, there is a chance of inflicting the target with <font color="#CD2626">Snake Miasma</font>. The effect becomes explosive when stacked 3 times, and the target will enter the state of <font color="#FFAE00">"Eat Through Heart and Bone"</font>: Target will continue to suffer loss of HP and Energy, and will remain paralyzed for 2 seconds after the state ends.
desc_CS_jh_jsjf06_2=When successfully defending an attack, there is a chance of inflicting the target with <font color="#CD2626">Snake Miasma</font>. The effect becomes explosive when stacked 3 times, and the target will enter the state of <font color="#FFAE00">"Eat Through Heart and Bone"</font>: Target will continue to suffer loss of HP and Energy, and will remain paralyzed for 2.5 seconds after the state ends.
