desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_1=This jump-and-kick combo may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies in front of you (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds). <br>first attack: Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly..
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_2=Flying jump steps and a jump-kick chain. This move may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies in front of you (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds).  <br>First strike: causes in target {@0:伤害包}(can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent).
