desc_CS_jh_kxtd03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets.<br>Causes additional damage to enemies already on the ground. <br>Player will have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> after finishing three consecutive kicks.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd03_2=The heaven and earth become upside down, swing-around kick, causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>Causes additional damage to enemies already on the ground.  <br>(player will have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using skills after player finishes three continuous kicks)
