desc_CS_jh_kxtd06_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font>. Player may dismantle enemy skills and perform a counterattack when attacked by enemies for 5 seconds. <br>Will add <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain. <br>Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attack. Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd06_2=What seems real is fake, and what seems fake is real. Will cause player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Shift from Defense to Attack"</font>. Player may dismantle enemy skills and perform a counterattack when attacked by enemies, lasts for 5 seconds.  <br>Will add <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain.  <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move.  Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
