desc_CS_jh_kxtd07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry causes: knock back the target; adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain.
