desc_CS_jh_lhbwq01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Successful hit adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Pounces for Prey"</font> to self, which increases the damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">"Tiger Hunts the Rabbit"</font> by 10% for every effect of Pounces for Prey. Lasts 30 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq01_2=The dragon and tiger are subdued, demons and gods respect you. You pounce and hit enemies in front of you causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>Successful hit adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Pouncing"</font> to self, which increases the damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">"Tiger Hunts the Rabbit"</font> by 10% for every stack of Pouncing. Lasts 30 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.
