desc_CS_jh_lhbwq03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When player has the <font color="#FF3030">"Become a Dragon"</font> effect, this skill will transform into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>. <br>"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon" is more powerful and does not cost any energy.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq03_2=The flying cloud sets out a dawn array, one's killing will is as red as the bridge, explosive punch causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>When player has the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, this skill will transform into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>.  <br>("Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon" is more powerful and does not cost any energy to use)
