desc_CS_jh_lhbwq04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the beginning of skill, player enters <font color="#FFAE00">"Overlord Arrives"</font> state and cannot be knocked back or knocked down for 5 seconds. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
