desc_CS_jh_lhbwq06_1=Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon Flight"</font> buff, which gives player 100% vampiric effect for all skills within the set. Every blow removes 1 stackable effect of Dragon Flight. Lasts 15 seconds. May be stacked once.
