desc_CS_jh_myjf05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry stacks 4 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and disable Flying skills. Lasts 4 seconds. 1 stacked effect is removed every second.
desc_CS_jh_myjf05_2=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry stacks 5 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and disable Flying skills. Lasts 4 seconds. 1 stacked effect is removed every second.
desc_CS_jh_myjf05_3=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry stacks 5 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and disable Flying skills. Lasts 5 seconds. 1 stacked effect is removed every second.
desc_CS_jh_myjf05_4=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry stacks 6 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and disable Flying skills. Lasts 5 seconds. 1 stacked effect is removed every second.
desc_CS_jh_myjf05_5=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry stacks 6 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and disable Flying skills. Lasts 6 seconds. 1 stacked effect is removed every second.
desc_CS_jh_myjf05_6=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry stacks 7 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and disable Flying skills. Lasts 7 seconds. 1 stacked effect is removed every second.
desc_CS_jh_myjf05_7=The clouds move apart and the moon appears, the flower spirit play with the shadows. Jump strike causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>A successful break through of enemy's parry and stacks 7 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and prohibits flying skills. Lasts 7 seconds. 1 stack is removed every second.
