desc_CS_jh_sfj02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as added with <font color="#FF3030">"Mystical Beast (negative)"</font> status, which reduces its moving speed by 10% and Flying Skill for a distance of about 1m for 5 seconds. <br>At the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">"Mystical Beast (positive)"</font> status, which increases moving speed by 10%, Flying Skill for a distance of 1m, and charging distance of 10m for 5 seconds. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_sfj02_2=Heavenly Beast creates wind and shoots dagger from the sky: This will cause the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as added with <font color="#FF3030">"Heavenly Beast (negative)"</font> status which reduces its moving speed by 10% and Flying Skill for a distance of about 1m for 5 seconds; <br>at the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Beat (positive)"</font> status which increases its moving speed by 10%, and Flying Skill for a distance of 1m and charging distance of 10m for 5 seconds. <br>(The strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)
desc_CS_jh_sfj02_3=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as added with <font color="#FF3030">"Mystical Beast (negative)"</font> status, which reduces its moving speed by 20% and Flying Skill for a distance of about 2m for 5 seconds. <br>At the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">"Mystical Beast (positive)"</font> status, which increases moving speed by 20%, , Flying Skill for a distance of 2m, and charging distance of 10m for 5 seconds. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
