desc_CS_jh_sfj04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Howler"</font> state for 5 seconds. When executing the attack <font color="#f9fc00">Howling Storm</font>, ranged attack distance doubles. This effect is cleared after the attack is executed. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
