desc_CS_jh_sfj06_1=This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> state: When in a defensive state and under attack by enemy, it can render the enemy's attack ineffective, in order to execute the charging strike used in the last time. This state can persist for 5 seconds. <br>Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attack. Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_sfj06_2=Lying in Wait in Leisure: This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> state: When in a defensive state and under attack by enemy, it can render the enemy's strike ineffective in order to launch the charging strike used in the last time. This state can be maintained for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
