desc_CS_jh_sfj07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can throw undefended targets, and prohibit Flying Skill for 3 seconds. <br>If the player is in a <font color="#FFAE00">"Mystical Beast (positive)"</font> state, he/she will be able to throw the target 3 times.
