desc_CS_jh_sfj08_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking, any enemy who dared to attack would be stunned. The same target will be stunned if hit within 6 seconds, with the stunning effect decreasing each time. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
