desc_CS_jh_tlw07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Also creates a <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font>: Enemies within 5 m will be unable to use their Flying Skill. <br>At the same time the player obtains 2 stacked effects of <font color="#FFAE00">"Veil of Silk"</font>: When another attack is executed, the player can switch position with <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font> and damage nearby enemies. This status can persist for 10 seconds, and can be stacked 2 times. Each switch of position will result in removal of 1 stacked effect. <br>Only one "Dance Shadow" may exist. The new "Dance Shadow" made will replace the previous one.<br>When executing the attack in the "Veil of Silk", it will be in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_tlw07_2=Display of flirtatious behavior and causes the enemies within the selected range to{@0:伤害包};<br> Also creates a <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font>: Enemies within 5 me will be unable to use their Flying Skill; <br>at the same the player obtains 2 levels of <font color="#FFAE00">"Veil of Silk"</font>: When another strike is launched, the player can interchange position with <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font> and cause hurt to surrounding enemies. This status can be maintained for 10 seconds, and can be added to 2 levels. Each interchange of position will result in elimination of 1 level. <br>(Only one "Dance Shadow" may exist at any one time; the new "Dance Shadow" made will replace the previous one)<br>(when launching the strike in the "Veil of Silk", it will be in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.)
