desc_CS_jh_wlbgg04_1=When the defense is successful, the player will obtain 1 stacked effect of<font color="#FFAE00">"Silent Hibernation"</font> status for 15 seconds. <br>When the status is stacked 10 times, it will activate <font color="#FFAE00">"Rise to the Top"</font> status: If the <font color="#f9fc00">"Vertical Hand"</font> is successfully executed, it can be reused within 10 seconds.
