desc_CS_jh_wlbgg05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The first attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who fail to parry, and the second attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who fail to parry.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg05_2=Coiling spear extracts the soul and the Golden Dragon swings its tail: This cause the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> The spear strikes with Dragon's form and Tiger's Awe: The first strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> enemies who do not defend themselves, and the second strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who do not defend themselves.
