desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target to the position selected by the mouse, and stun all enemies within the range for 3 seconds, as well as cause damage. <br>This attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state. The maximum range of throw is 20m.<br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_2=Lifting with the spear and locking the throat with kick: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Capturing the Dragon and taming the Tiger with uplifting spear: This will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target to the position selected by the mouse, and render unconscious all enemies within the range for 3 seconds, as way as cause hurt. <br>(This strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; the maximum range of throw is 20m)<br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
