desc_CS_single_fcqt_1=Can remove most negative effects and cause concussion to nearby enemies.
desc_CS_single_fcqt_2=Live simply and serenely but fare serenely towards a high goal and occupy your heart with nothing else. Be few of desires and clean of heart. Chi circulates quickly. Can remove most negative effects and cause Concussion in surrounding enemies.
desc_CS_single_fcqt_3=Live simply and serenely but fare serenely towards a high goal and occupy your heart with nothing else. Be few of desires and clean of heart. Chi circulates quickly. Can remove most negative effects and cause Concussion in surrounding enemies.
desc_CS_single_fzqx_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Uphold Righteousness"</font> effect to allies. The effect has <br>25% chance of giving you a positive buff: all attributes increase by 10 for 60 seconds. <br>20% chance of giving you a positive buff: movement speed increases 20% for 20 seconds. <br>5% chance of giving you a positive buff: immunity to stun for 10 seconds. <br>25% chance of giving you a debuff: all attributes decrease by 5 for 30 second. <br>20% chance of giving you a debuff: movement speed decreases 10% for 10 seconds. <br>5% chance of giving you a debuff: Faint for 5 seconds.<br>The skill consumes 1 Medicated Wooden Needle and 5 medical points.
desc_CS_single_fzqx_2=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Uphold Righteousness"</font> effect to allies. The effect has <br>30% chance of giving you a positive buff: all attributes increase by 10 for 60 seconds. <br>24% chance of giving you a positive buff: movement speed increases 20% for 20 seconds. <br>6% chance of giving you a positive buff: immunity to stun for 10 seconds. <br>20% chance of giving you a debuff: all attributes decrease by 5 for 30 second. <br>16% chance of giving you a debuff: movement speed decreases 10% for 10 seconds. <br>4% chance of giving you a debuff: Faint for 5 seconds.<br>The skill consumes 1 Iron Medical Needle and 5 medical points.
desc_CS_single_fzqx_3=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Uphold Righteousness"</font> effect to allies. The effect has <br>35% chance of giving you a positive buff: all attributes increase by 10 for 60 seconds. <br>28% chance of giving you a positive buff: movement speed increases 20% for 20 seconds. <br>7% chance of giving you a positive buff: immunity to stun for 10 seconds. <br>15% chance of giving you a debuff: all attributes decrease by 5 for 30 second. <br>12% chance of giving you a debuff: movement speed decreases 10% for 10 seconds. <br>3% chance of giving you a debuff: Faint for 5 seconds.<br>The skill consumes 1 Silver Medical Needle and 5 medical points.
desc_CS_single_hg_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Removes target's <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_single_hg_2=Loosen tendons and relax your bones. Knock on bones and suck out the marrow. It is as soft as cotton and breaks everywhere. Causes in target {@0:伤害包}, and removes target's <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_single_hg_3=Loosen tendons and relax your bones. Knock on bones and suck out the marrow. It is as soft as cotton and breaks everywhere. Causes in target {@0:伤害包}, and removes target's <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_single_lh_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Disable Flying skills and cause Blurred Vision to target for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_single_lh_2=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Disable Flying skills and cause Blurred Vision to target for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_single_lh_3=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Disable Flying skills and cause Blurred Vision to target for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_single_mshc_1=Re-attaches target male player's <font color="#FF3030">manhood</font>. Target is no longer castrated but enters <font color="#f9fc00">Weakened</font> state: attack and defense decrease 50%. <br>The skill can only be used in the Restoration Room and consumes 1 Gold Medical Needle and 50 medical points.
desc_CS_single_qmdj_1=<br>Inflict <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> to targets in a 8m area of effect, and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Gain <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Peach Trees in Full Blossom</font>effects: increased movement speed and immunity to damage. <br>This is an evasive maneuver, which you can use only when your HP is below 30%. If you attack, <font color="#FF3030">Peach Trees in Full Blossom</font> will be cancelled.
desc_CS_single_qmdj_2=The peach tree is young and elegant, brilliant are its flowers. Exhausts 30% of player's energy:<br> <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> of all enemies within a 8-meter radius and cause {@0:伤害包}. Player enters <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Escape</font> state: grants rapid movements and immunity from damage. <br>(An escape skill. Can only use this skill when player's HP is below 30%. Attacking an enemy will remove the <font color="#FF3030">Escape</font> effect)
desc_CS_single_qmdj_3=The peach tree is young and elegant, brilliant are its flowers. Exhausts 30% of player's energy:<br> <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> of all enemies within a 8-meter radius and cause {@0:伤害包}. Player enters <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Escape</font> state: grants rapid movements and immunity from damage. <br>(An escape skill. Can only use this skill when player's HP is below 30%. Attacking an enemy will remove the <font color="#FF3030">Escape</font> effect)
desc_CS_single_tzst_1=Inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage.. <br>Decrease target's rage and knock back target.
desc_CS_single_tzst_2=Gather force in one's middle finger and shoot. This finger skill is peerless. Causes in target {@0:伤害包}. <br>Scatter target's rage and knock back target.
desc_CS_single_tzst_3=Gather force in one's middle finger and shoot. This finger skill is peerless. Causes in target {@0:伤害包}. <br>Scatter target's rage and knock back target.
desc_CS_sj_syxz01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Golden Needle"</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 18 times. Lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz01_2=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Golden Needle"</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 19 times. Lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
