desc_CS_sj_syxz01_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Golden Needle"</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 26 times. Lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Successful break of parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Soul Breaker"</font> to target, causing target to become dazed. The target's next attack has a low chance of hitting the player. Lasts 3 seconds. <br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
