desc_CS_sj_syxz03_1=Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">"Web"</font> status: reduces amount of energy needed to use skills in the same set. Can be stacked 4 times. Lasts 18 seconds. <br>One stacked effect of<font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> will be cleared when this attack is executed.
