desc_CS_sj_syxz03_9=Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">"Web"</font> status: reduces amount of energy needed to use skills in the same set. Can be stacked 4 times. Lasts 26 seconds. <br>One stacked effect of<font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> will be cleared when this attack is executed.
desc_CS_sj_syxz04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the target loses HP by more than 50%, it will trigger secondary damage. <br>Damage from this attack is determined by the time it takes to charge the skill, which cannot exceed 3 seconds. If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also knock back the target.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz04_2=Charged-force strike with total focus and no regard for distance: This causes the target to {@0:伤害包};<br> If the target loses blood by more than 50%, it will trigger second injury. <br>(The injury from this strike is determined by the time it takes to charge the force, charging of force cannot exceed 3 seconds. If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also be accompanied with a 'knock back' effect)<br>(The higher the player's medical value, the greater the skill's injury)
