desc_CS_sj_syxz04_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the target loses HP by more than 50%, it will trigger secondary damage. <br>Damage from this attack is determined by the time it takes to charge the skill, which cannot exceed 3 seconds. If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also knock back the target.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz05_1=Target receives <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> or <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an enemy, the attack will give it <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an ally, the attack will grant him/her <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>: Receive additional damage for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>: Absorbs 97% of damage received. Status lasts 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sj_syxz05_2=Target receives <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> or <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an enemy, the attack will give it <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an ally, the attack will grant him/her <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>: Receive additional damage for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>: Absorbs 94% of damage received. Status lasts 5 seconds.
