desc_CS_sj_syxz06_1=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Will add to the target (self or an ally)<font color="#FFAE00">"Clearing Meridians"</font> status: HP will be restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 5 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz06_2=Force-charging strike as if in deep ravine and the hand is grasping the tiger; if force-charging is successful: <br>Will add to the target (team-mate or the individual)<font color="#FFAE00">"Enlivening Veins"</font> status: Certain amount of energy-flow will be restored every second; this status will maintain for 5 seconds. <br>(Charge time is 5 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery not restricted by Bruised effects) <br>(The higher your medical points, the more efficient the skill is and the more HP you recover)
