desc_CS_sj_syxz06_9=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Will add to the target (self or an ally)<font color="#FFAE00">"Clearing Meridians"</font> status: HP will be restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>Attack power and HP recovery are increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_1=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 15% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 85% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_2=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 20% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 80% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_3=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 25% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 75% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_4=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 30% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 70% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_5=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 35% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 65% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_6=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 40% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 60% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_7=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 45% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 55% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_8=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 50% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 50% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_9=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 55% of target's maximum HP and Energy. The healer gives up 45% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz08_1=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Allies within 15m receive <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> status: great amounts of HP and Energy are restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 5 seconds, with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> in effect while charging.<br>Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz08_2=Force-charging strike, Tai Xuan is everywhere unseen and undetected. If force-charging is successful: <br>It is possible to enable team-mates within a range of 15m to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Maid Spreading Flower"</font> status: Significant amount of energy and blood-flow will be restored every second; this status will maintain for 5 seconds. <br>(Charge time is 5 seconds, <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status during charging) <br>(Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery not restricted by Bruised effects) <br>(The higher your medical points, the more efficient the skill is and the more HP you recover)
