desc_CS_th_bhcs04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If target already has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Vastness"</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's defense has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds. <br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs04_2=The white waves reach the skies and the song subdues the sun and moon. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Shang</font> melody. Stabs the target and then the heart, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target already has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's defense has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds.  <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
