desc_CS_th_bhcs06_2=The tide rises, surprising the heavens. The tides fall and demons cry. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Jue</font> melody. Music of the flute is awe inspiring and causes enemies within 8-meter radius to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
