desc_CS_th_bhcs07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Every blow adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Vastness"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds. <br>If target has 6 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury. <br>Internal Injury applies only to other players. Damage is based on attacking player's own attributes.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs07_2=Not yet proficient with the flute. The music of the tides is magnificent. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font> melody. Playing notes Impacts the target, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every blow adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>(Internal Injury is only effective on other players; damage done is based on player's own attributes) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs07_3=Not yet proficient with the flute. The music of the tides is magnificent. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font> melody. Playing notes Impacts the target, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every blow adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>(Internal Injury is only effective on other players; damage done is based on player's own attributes) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
