desc_CS_xjz_wmcf01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Adds to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Out of Ink"</font> status: It will be attacked by "Flood of Black Ink" and will be briefly fainted. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
