desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_1=This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while parrying, the attack is negated. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font>: damage over time, enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds. <br>Counterattack can persist for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attacks.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_10=This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while parrying, the attack is negated. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font>: damage over time, enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds. <br>Counterattack can persist for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attacks.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_2=Hidden heaven and earth lying in wait for right opportunity This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while in defense status, it is possible to render such attack ineffective. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Qiankun Energy Field</font>: Continuous damage, enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field will exist for 8 seconds. <br>(Counterattack prevention can be maintained for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint moves)<br>(Increase in the strike's level can increase counterattack injury)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
