desc_CS_xjz_wmcf04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When breaking down the enemy's defense, player steals the target's HP and Energy, while inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">"Vacuum"</font>: target is slowed and cannot use Flying skills for 5 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
