desc_CS_yh_hsqs01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Skill has 10% of adding <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> to target. Target's vision is blurred, and his next attack has high chance of being evaded.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs01_2=Even before she spoke, the atmosphere was already filled with the fragrance of orchids. Your graceful strike causes in target {@0:伤害包}; <br>Fragrant Flowers, skill has 10% of adding <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Thorn"</font> to target. Causes Blurred and next attack has high chance of being evaded.
