desc_CS_yh_hsqs05_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Shifting Flowers"</font> status to self: 60% of damage sustained will be shifted to a random enemy within 10 meters of player when taking damage. Status lasts for 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if there are no enemies within range, or the damage is not caused by another player.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs05_2=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Shifting Flowers"</font> status to self: 70% of damage sustained will be shifted to a random enemy within 10 meters of player when taking damage. Status lasts for 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if there are no enemies within range, or the damage is not caused by another player.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs05_3=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Shifting Flowers"</font> status to self: 80% of damage sustained will be shifted to a random enemy within 10 meters of player when taking damage. Status lasts for 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if there are no enemies within range, or the damage is not caused by another player.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs05_4=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Shifting Flowers"</font> status to self: 90% of damage sustained will be shifted to a random enemy within 10 meters of player when taking damage. Status lasts for 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if there are no enemies within range, or the damage is not caused by another player.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs05_5=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Shifting Flowers"</font> status to self: 100% of damage sustained will be shifted to a random enemy within 10 meters of player when taking damage. Status lasts for 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if there are no enemies within range, or the damage is not caused by another player.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in a 5m radius. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen Flowers"</font> to enemies, causing paralysis for 3 seconds. <br>If enemy already has <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> status, enemy becomes stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs06_2=The flower wilts as soon as it blossoms. The beautiful flowers all vie for supremacy. A tactful blow causes in target: {@0:伤害包} Damage may ripple out to targets within a 5-meter radius and <br>add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Flowers"</font> to enemies, causing Paralysis for 3 seconds.  <br>If enemy already has <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Thorn"</font> status, enemy becomes Stunned for 3 seconds.
