desc_Npc_gb_dgbf04_6=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf05_1=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 15 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds him for three seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf05_2=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 20 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds him for four seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf05_3=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf05_4=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf05_5=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf05_6=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf06_1=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant; <br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For four seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf06_2=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant; <br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For five seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf06_3=A defensive movement. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to the assailant;<br>There is also a chance to render the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Disarmed</font>: For six seconds he will not be able to use weapon attacks.<br>(The more stacks of Instigate on the enemy, the greater his chance of being Disarmed.)
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf07_1=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
desc_Npc_gb_dgbf07_2=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
