desc_Npc_jh_dldm03_1=The thieving claws of a ghost ensnare the enemy and deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be tightly bound and cannot move.<br>This move will not be successful if executed while close to the enemy.
