desc_Npc_jh_dldm04_1=Tie to your arm a steel cord, tough and unyielding, that greets the enemy. After you parry, use this to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Approaching</font> state to the enemy for eight seconds. The effect can be stacked.
