desc_Npc_jh_ghqd01_1=Causes damage to target. <br>Also causes <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Life"</font> Internal Injury: player will receive reflected damage when skill is activated. The more Internal Injuries, the higher the reflected damage. <br>After Internal Injury accumulates for a certain amount of time, it will explode and cause even more damage.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd01_2=Accumulated Chi is like a thorn, Snared Life flies; causes damage in target. <br>Also causes <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Life"</font> Internal Injury: player will receive reflected damage when skill is activated. The more Internal Injuries, the higher the reflected damage.  <br>After Internal Injury accumulates for a certain amount of time, it will explode and cause damage.
