desc_Npc_jh_ghqd02_1=Causes damage to enemies. <br>Deals additional <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Soul"</font> Internal Injury: damage to energy for each flying skill use. The more Internal Injuries, the higher the damage. <br>After Internal Injury accumulates for a certain amount of time, it will explode and cause even more damage.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd02_2=Sharpened dagger flies up and down, Chi forces shooting around indiscriminately. Causes damage to enemies in front. <br>Deals additional <font color="#FFAE00">"Soul Taker"</font> Internal Injury: damage to energy for each flying skill use. The more Internal Injuries, the higher the damage.  <br>After Internal Injury accumulates for a certain amount of time, it will explode and cause damage.
