desc_Npc_jh_ghqd03_1=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd03_2=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd03_3=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd03_4=Your chi is like a taut spring. Burst through the air and strike the enemy. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage, this move will cause him to suffer dizziness;<br>If the target is suffering from <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, the internal damage will take effect and movement speed will be reduced. The target will also be unable to perform flying skills.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd04_1=Causes damage to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Life"</font> Internal Injuries, every attack will increase 1 stackable effect of internal Injury. <br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd04_2=A bloodthirsty dagger goes for the throat. Causes damage to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Life"</font> Internal Injuries, every attack will increase 1 layer of Internal Injury.  <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent)
