desc_Npc_jh_ghqd05_1=Causes damage to target. <br>Breaking the target's parry causes an increase to damage done to target after causing Internal Injury.
desc_Npc_jh_ghqd05_2=An incomplete style, sweeping your dagger. Use your spirit to contuse your target and cause damage. Breaking the target's parry<br> causes an increase to damage done to target after causing Internal Injury.
