desc_Npc_jh_ghqd07_1=Unleash a combo of attacks.<br>Every blow can trigger the <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Life"</font> Internal Injury or <font color="#FFAE00">"Snared Soul"</font> Internal Injury within the target to cause additional damage.
