desc_Npc_jh_jwdf01_1=Adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Yangyang Blade Chi"</font>. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount to target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, the skill will cause additional damage regardless of parry.
