desc_Npc_jh_jwdf03_1=Causes damage to target. <br>A successful Break Defense instills Irregular Chi in the target for 7 seconds. The target loses HP continuously and becomes stunned for 1 second every 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf03_2=Brandish a blade for a heavy blow, the wave of Chi churning and twisting. Causes damage in enemies in front. <br>A successful Break Defense instills Irregular Chi in the target for 7 seconds. The target loses HP continuously and becomes Stunned for 1 second every 3 seconds.
