desc_Npc_jh_jwdf04_1=When the player successfully blocks the enemy's attack 10 times and if enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi within him, the enemy will be unable to use skills.
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf04_2=A defensive posture, soothe your Chi and put down your blade. When the player successfully blocks the enemy's attack 10 times and if enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi within him, the enemy's Chi will become Irregular and will be unable to use skills.
