desc_Npc_jh_jwdf05_1=Attack enemies in front causing damage. <br>The blade scalds the target and instills <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi into the target. When the target gathers Chi to use skills, the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount has a chance to explode and increase. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount to target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, the skill will cause additional damage regardless of parry.
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf05_2=The thrown blade spins in the air, burning the sun and brightening the skies. Attack enemies in front causing damage. <br>The blade Scalds the target and instills <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi into the target. When the target gathers Chi to use skills, the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount has a chance to explode and increase.  <br>(If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount in target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, the skill will cause additional damage regardless of parry)
