desc_Npc_jh_jwdf06_1=Damage the target. <br>The skill transforms the <font color="#FFAE00">"Yangyang Blade Chi"</font> into <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi and forcibly instills it into the target's body. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount to target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, Chi can suppress the increase of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount, slowing and weaken the target.
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf06_2=A flying kick knocks down the target and, in the same breath, raises the blade to pierce the target's body, causing damage. <br>At the same time, the move transforms the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flame Sun Blade Chi"</font> in the player's body into <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi and forcibly instills it into the target's body. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount in target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, Chi can suppress the increase of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount and at the same time weaken the target (decreases efficiency and movement speed).
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf06_3=A flying kick knocks down the target and, in the same breath, raises the blade to pierce the target's body, causing damage. <br>At the same time, the move transforms the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flame Sun Blade Chi"</font> in the player's body into <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi and forcibly instills it into the target's body. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount in target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, Chi can suppress the increase of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount and at the same time weaken the target (decreases efficiency and movement speed).
