desc_Npc_jh_jwdf07_1=Damage the target. <br>Every hit to the enemy's body will activate 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi and make it explode. When attack is done, the rest of the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi will explode as well.
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf07_2=Kuafu chases the sun and the flames soar into the sky, throwing the enemy in front into the sky and slashing multiple times to cause damage. <br>Every hit to the enemy's body will activate 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi and make it explode. When attack is down, the rest of the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi will explode as well.
