desc_Npc_jh_jwdf08_1=Damage nearby targets.<br>Strikes down airborne enemies within range, and knocks back enemies within range on the ground. The whirling Chi force helps player resist all debuffs while skill is in use. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount to target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, the skill will cause additional damage regardless of parry.<br>This skill cannot be interrupted.
desc_Npc_jh_jwdf08_2=Lift up the blade in place, swing, and whirl. Causes damage in surrounding enemies. <br>Strikes down airborne enemies within range simultaneously and knocks back enemies within range on the ground. The whirling Chi force helps player resist all debuffs while using skill.  <br>(If the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fire"</font> Chi amount in the target is a multiple of 3 or has reached the maximum, the skill will cause additional damage regardless of parry) <br>(This skill cannot be interrupted)
