desc_Npc_jh_sbz01_1=Damage the target.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status: decreases internal and external attack accuracy. Can be stacked 2 times. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font> effect: can still be lashed after being seriously wounded. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz01_2=Damage the target.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status: decreases internal and external attack accuracy. Can be stacked 3 times. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font> effect: can still be lashed after being seriously wounded. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz01_3=Damage the target.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status: decreases internal and external attack accuracy. Can be stacked 4 times. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font> effect: can still be lashed after being seriously wounded. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz01_4=Damage the target.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status: decreases internal and external attack accuracy. Can be stacked 5 times. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font> effect: can still be lashed after being seriously wounded. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz01_5=A big slap on the face causes damage to enemies in front. <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status: decreases internal and external attack accuracy. Can be stacked 5 times.  <br>At the same time, adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font> effect: can still be lashed after being Gravely Wounded. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz01_6=A big slap on the face causes damage to enemies in front. <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status: decreases internal and external attack accuracy. Can be stacked 5 times.  <br>At the same time, adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Add Insult to Injury"</font> effect: can still be lashed after being Gravely Wounded. Lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz02_1=Causes damage to target. <br>If target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status, target will be debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>: keyboard settings randomized. Lasts for 6 seconds. Time will lengthen according to the number <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> stacked.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz02_2=A one-on-one challenge is risky. When you hit a person, aim for their face. Causes damage to target. <br>If target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status, target will become <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>: keyboard settings randomized. Lasts for 6 seconds (time will lengthen according to the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>).
desc_Npc_jh_sbz02_3=A one-on-one challenge is risky. When you hit a person, aim for their face. Causes damage to target. <br>If target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> status, target will become <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>: keyboard settings randomized. Lasts for 6 seconds (time will lengthen according to the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>).
