desc_Npc_jh_sbz03_1=Causes damage to target. <br>A successful Break Defense adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Eye-Stab"</font> to target, whose vision becomes unclear as he starts to hallucinate. Vision is blurred for 3 seconds.
