desc_Npc_jh_sbz05_1=A ferocious strike causes damage to enemies in front. <br>Skill can be charged. At full-charge, skill can knock back all enemies (charge time is 1.5 seconds).
desc_Npc_jh_sbz05_2=Snap your wrist and do not be afraid of straining your back. A ferocious strike causes damage to enemies in front. <br>Skill can be charged. At full-charge, skill can knock back all enemies (charge time is 1.5 seconds).
