desc_Npc_jh_sbz06_1=Knock your target down with your bare palms.
desc_Npc_jh_sbz06_2=Knock your enemies into a hole with strong palms. Target of suppression will fall on his knees. Slap his face like crazy and finish with a final swing to send him to the ground and cause damage.
