desc_Npc_jh_ttg01_1=Charging move. Use your head to attack the enemy and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>At the same time, give the <font color="#FFAE00">Aching Head</font> state to target: When using this skill, you may increase the damage it deals. Each state you gain will increase damage by 5%. This may be stacked 3 times at most and lasts 15 seconds. <br>(The skill can be used with flying skills to approach the target.)
desc_Npc_jh_ttg01_2=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 4 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_Npc_jh_ttg01_3=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 5 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_Npc_jh_ttg01_4=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 6 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_Npc_jh_ttg01_5=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 7 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_Npc_jh_ttg01_6=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 8 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
desc_Npc_jh_ttg02_1=Charge up, wait for your chance, then charge forward and butt into the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The skill requires 2 seconds. The damage dealt will increase along with casting time. After charging, you will receive a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Endure</font> state when you use the skill. You can then ignore blocking and being punched away. <br>(The max charging distance of the skill is 20 meters.)
