desc_Npc_jy_dqd03_1=Charging attack. <br>If target's defense has been broken and target cannot parry, skill will cause a large amount of hard damage. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_Npc_jy_dqd03_2=Charge skill, Slay Dragons in Rage with chain of sword slashes, causing damage to target. <br>If target's defense has been broken and target cannot parry, skill will cause a large amount of hard damage.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
