desc_Npc_jy_dqd04_1=Damage your target. <br>Breaking the target's parry impacts Chi, and the target's body is paralyzed.
desc_Npc_jy_dqd04_2=A tyrannical attack, the crushing blow causes damage to enemies in front. <br>Breaking the target's parry impacts Chi, and the target's body is Paralyzed: length of time that target cannot parry is prolonged and target becomes Paralyzed.
