desc_Npc_jy_dqd05_1=Successful parry instills <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi to attacker. Every attack by a Heartless Skill will then trigger Heartless Chi to deal extra damage. Afterwards, the Chi disappears.
desc_Npc_jy_dqd05_2=Merciless stance, successful parry instills <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi to attacker. Every attack by a Heartless skill will then trigger Heartless Chi to deal extra damage. Afterwards, the Chi disappears.
