desc_Npc_jy_dqd06_1=Heartless and Violent Rage, a swiveling dance, Hell Chi invades target causing damage. <br>Makes target teeter: has large chance of falling when trying to use skills or using Flying skills. When in the air, the target will fall to the ground.
