desc_Npc_jy_dqd07_1=Charging attack. <br>Charge at the target in the air, Attacking the target down to the ground to cause Internal Injury. Flying skills are disabled, and there is a certain chance that attack skills will be disabled. <br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.
