desc_Npc_th_bhcs02_1=Plays the musical note <font color="#9932CD">"Fa"</font>. Music of the flute inflicts {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets and causes target to become paralyzed for 3 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Npc_th_bhcs02_2=Peach blossoms fly and willows sway in the wind; adds <font color="#9932CD">Zhi</font> melody. Music of the flute causes in surrounding enemies {@0:伤害包} and causes target to become Paralyzed for 3 seconds.  <br>(Players equipped with single swords can only do 70% of potential damage)
