desc_Npc_th_bhcs06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Npc_th_bhcs06_2=The tide rises, surprising the heavens. The tides fall and demons cry. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Jue</font> melody. Music of the flute is awe inspiring and causes enemies within 8-meter radius to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Players equipped with single swords can only do 70% of potential damage)
