desc_Npc_wd_tjq02_1=A charging movement that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within five seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
