desc_Npc_wd_tjq04_6=A secret tai chi movement that can freely switch between two movements: <br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Stance</font>: If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> state, each time you successfully parry you can use the <font color="#FFAE00">Softness Power</font>: This moves the assailant's Energy to one side, damaging nearby enemies.<br>Its <font color="#FFAE00">Attack Movement</font> allows you to add the <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font> buff when you successfully parry. With this effect, your attacks from the Tai Chi Fist set will have added Yin damage. Each attack consumes one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Lead Force</font>.
desc_Npc_wd_tjq05_1=Overcome hardness with softness. Circulate your chi and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> effect, which removes any debuffs placed on you and absorbs some damage; <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grabbing Force</font> is broken or when its effect naturally wears off, the damage it absorbs will be transferred to nearby enemies.
