desc_Npc_wd_tjq07_1=Outflank the enemy with this move and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Dispel</font> buff to yourself: Absorb damage while recovering your inner Energy and HP.
desc_Npc_wd_tjq07_2=Outflank the enemy with this move and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Dispel</font> buff to yourself: Absorb damage while recovering your inner Energy and HP.
desc_Npc_wd_tjq07_3=Outflank the enemy with this move and add the <font color="#FFAE00">Dispel</font> buff to yourself: Absorb damage while recovering your inner Energy and HP.
desc_Npc_wd_tjq08_1=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
desc_Npc_wd_tjq08_2=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
