desc_Npc_xjz_xyz01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Adds to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Out of Ink"</font> status: It will be attacked by "Flood of Black Ink" and will be briefly fainted. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Npc_xjz_xyz02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Npc_xjz_xyz05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Create a <font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Path Aura</font> to deal damage over time. Enemies who attempt to <font color="#FF3030">escape</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field can persist for 8 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_001_1=Damage target.<br>Skill has 10% of adding<font color="#FFAE00"> </font>"Bright Butterflies" to target: Target's vision is blurred, and his next attack has high chance of being evaded.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_002_1=Damage target.<br>Attacks ignore external and internal defense when target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Dancing Butterflies"</font> status.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_003_1=Inflict damage. <br>Successful break defense adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> (target's vision is blurred, and his next attack has high chance of being evaded) and <font color="#FFAE00">"Twinkling Flowers"</font>, during which target may not parry for a long time. 10 points of energy will be absorbed when attacked.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_004_1=Successful parry grants 10% chance to knock player back and adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Dancing Butterflies"</font>: internal and external defense will be ignored when attacked. Lasts 10 seconds (35-second trigger interval).
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_005_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Shifting Flowers"</font> status to self: 60% of damage sustained will be shifted to a random enemy within 10 meters of player when taking damage, status lasts for 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if there are no enemies within range, or the damage is not caused by another player.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_006_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in a 5m radius. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen Flowers"</font> to enemies, causing paralysis for 3 seconds. <br>If enemy already has <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> status, enemy becomes stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs_007_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Ignore target's internal and external defense when attacking if target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Dancing Butterflies"</font> status.
