desc_test_item_thd2_003_1=Conceal your name
desc_wgm_arrest_01_1=Hitting the target has a certain chance stunning the target. The lower the target's HP, the higher your accuracy. The skill can be used on event NPCs. Cooldown time is 2 minutes.
desc_wgm_rmqy_01_1=<s>
desc_wmp_cc_1n_csz_1=Gather chi into claw, and throw it at a distance, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> state, then you can stop him from using flying skill.
desc_xjz_01_1=Create a small campfire. When people eat food around the fire they will gain extra beneficial buffs. Effects are based on level of food and level of the campfire.
desc_xjz_01_2=Create a medium campfire. When people eat food around the fire they will gain extra beneficial buffs. Effects are based on level of food and level of the campfire.
desc_xjz_01_3=Create a large campfire. When people eat food around the fire they will gain extra beneficial buffs. Effects are based on level of food and level of the campfire.
desc_yhgmz_jd_1=<s>
desc_zf_em_01_03_1=Can be used by Emei disciples in forbidden instances.) Adds "Dark Light Gathers on Top" to surrounding allies. Effect: immune to damage for the next attack. Recovers HP after immunity is removed and attacks gain additional Yin damage.
desc_zf_gb_01_03_1=Can be used by Beggar's Sect disciples in forbidden instances.) Adds "Lay Down Weapons" to surrounding allies. Effect: immune to all damage for a certain amount of time. Recover a fixed amount of HP every time attacked. Attacks gain additional Yang damage.
desc_zf_jl_01_03_1=Can be used by Wanderer's Valley disciples in forbidden instances) Adds "Steal Soul and Weep Blood" to surrounding allies. Effect: absorbs a fixed amount of damage and then causes damage to surrounding targets. Absorbs HP when attacking.
desc_zf_jy_01_03_1=Can be used by Royal Guards disciples in forbidden instances) Adds "Disdain for the World" to surrounding allies. Effect: reduces damage, reflects a fixed amount of damage, and recovers from Bruising gradually.
desc_zf_jz_01_03_1=Can be used by Scholar disciples in forbidden instances) Adds "Beautiful Plum Blossom" to surrounding allies. Effect: reduces damage, gradually increases player's rage.
desc_zf_sl_01_05_1=Can be used by Shaolin disciples in forbidden instances) Adds "Arhat Protects Body" to surrounding allies. Effect: absorbs a certain amount of damage, each attack gains additional hard damage and recovers from Bruising gradually.
desc_zf_thd_01_01_1=Single attack Skill. Deals {@0:伤害包}points of damage to targets in a 6-meter radius. Target is "lost." Once this effect is stacked 3 times, target will be knocked down.
desc_zf_thd_01_01_2=Single attack skill. Deals  {@0:伤害包}points of damage to targets in a 6-meter radius. Also adds Lost to the target. Once Lost is stacked 3 layers, target will be Felled by one blow.
desc_zf_thd_01_01_3=Single attack skill. Deals  {@0:伤害包}points of damage to targets in a 6-meter radius. Also adds Lost to the target. Once Lost is stacked 3 layers, target will be Felled by one blow.
desc_zf_thd_01_02_1=Single attack Skill. Deals {@0:伤害包}points of damage to targets in a 6-meter radius. Disables Flying skills for 3 seconds. If target was in the air, target will be struck down to the ground.
desc_zf_thd_01_02_2=Single attack skill. Deals  {@0:伤害包}points of damage to targets in a 6-meter radius. Prohibits flying skills for 3 seconds. If target was in the air, target will be struck down to the ground.
desc_zf_thd_01_02_3=Single attack skill. Deals  {@0:伤害包}points of damage to targets in a 6-meter radius. Prohibits flying skills for 3 seconds. If target was in the air, target will be struck down to the ground.
desc_zf_tm_01_03_1=Can be used by Tangmen disciples in forbidden instances) Adds "Resist Poison in the Wind" to surrounding allies. Effect: increases evasion and critical hit rate, and recovers energy after critical hits
desc_zf_wd_01_03_1=Can be used by Wudang disciples in forbidden instances) Adds "Limitless Self Examination" to surrounding allies. Effect: recover a certain amount of energy, attacks gain additional soft damage, and recover energy continuously.
desc_zhenfa_wgm_01_01_1=If target has "Hidden Energy Enters the Body" and is seriously injured, using item on target will start the castration ritual.
desc_zhenfa_wgm_01_02_1=Inspect if target can be castrated. If skill is successful, add "Hidden Energy Enters the Body" to target.
desc_zhongqiu_skill_01_1=Each time the net is cast to catch the Golden Rabbit, the latter will receive 1 point injury with the player receiving 1 reward <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill is effective only on the Golden Rabbit</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_01_a_1=Each time the net is cast to catch the Golden Rabbit, the latter will receive 2 point injury with the player receiving 2 reward <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill is effective only on the Golden Rabbit</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_02_1=Throw carrot at the Golden Rabbit to entice it <br><font color="#ff0000" >This can reduce the Golden Rabbit's mobility</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_03_1=Casting of net with 30% chance of capturing Golden Rabbit <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill can only be used on white rabbit that has not been trapped</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_03_a_1=Casting of net with 40% chance of capturing Golden Rabbit <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill can only be used on white rabbit that has not been trapped</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_03_b_1=Casting of net with 50% chance of capturing Golden Rabbit <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill can only be used on white rabbit that has not been trapped</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_03_c_1=Casting of net with 60% chance of capturing Golden Rabbit <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill can only be used on white rabbit that has not been trapped</font>
desc_zhongqiu_skill_03_d_1=Casting of net with 100% chance of capturing Golden Rabbit <br><font color="#ff0000" >This skill can only be used on white rabbit that has not been trapped</font>
