desc_CS_jh_yywd01_1=Attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Attach <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect on enemies: lose health for 8 seconds, and it can stack for 5 levels.<br>Need to learn skill <font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Wind and Moon</font> to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect.)
desc_CS_jh_yywd01_10=Attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Attach <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect on enemies: lose health for 8 seconds, and it can stack for 5 levels.<br>(Need to learn skill <font color="#f9fc00">Wind and Moon don't Have a Border</font> to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect.)
