desc_CS_jh_yywd05_1=Use Blade Chi to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect, then <font color="#f9fc00">send him flying</font>. <br>While skill is being used, you cannot move and you will be affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
