desc_CS_jh_gclhz01_1=Jets of energy cause {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Longing Heart"</font> status to the target: This status cannot persist after 3 stacked effects are added. Target is <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> for 1 second.
