desc_CS_jh_gclhz03_1=When you parry successfully against an attack: <br>Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Buck"</font> effect. Each additional stacked effect reduces damage received by 8% for 10 seconds; maximum of 2 stacked effects can be stacked. If no defense is made while under attack, 1 stacked effect will be removed.
