desc_CS_jh_gclhz06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Impregnable to Fire: the attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> nearby enemies continuously, and add <font color="#FFAE00">"Raging Flame"</font> status: Can maintain for 4 seconds. At end of status, targets are <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> and sustain injury. <br>("Raging Flame" status is cleared by being attacked)<br>The attack can be triggered by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
