desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_1=Upon successful Parry: <br>Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power Ascension</font> state: increase the power of <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>, lasts 8 seconds. <br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Power Ascension</font>, increase the movement speed for <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and increase the paralyzing effect of <font color="#f9fc00">【Wind Blowing Leaves】</font> for 2 more seconds.
