desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Generate <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>: Enemies affected will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 1 second, taking damage. (Attach Paralyze effect ignoring Parry, if you have Power Ascension, effect lasts 5 seconds)<br>(Paralyze effect decreases progressively)<br>(If you have Windriding effect, you launch the skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
