desc_CS_jh_xfz04_1=<br>Makes a <font color="#FFAE00">Incarnations Mark</font>, rendering the cooldown on the switchover from one skill set to another non-existent for teammates within a 40-metre radius around you, reducing the amount of Energy and Rage required to cast a skill by 50%. <br>This effect lasts 40 seconds in Forbidden Instances;<br>This effect only applies to the next 3 skills to cast. <br>(Applies Chi and Meridian Swells to teammates affected by this effect, granting immunity from Incarnations Mark in the coming 10 minutes)
desc_CS_jh_xfz05_1=<br>Makes a <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Mark</font>, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a specified area, paralyzing victims for 5 seconds; nullifies the effect of a stack of your <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast. <br>Grants 5 Rage to your teammates within a 20-metre radius around you every one second. Last 5 seconds. (cannot be casted on yourself)
