desc_CS_jh_xfz06_1=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a 5-metre radius. <br>If a Break Defense occurs on the victim, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Perishable</font> to it. Lasts 6 seconds. Increases the attacker's damage done by 1& each time an enemy unit affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Perishable</font> is attacked. Stacks up to 10 times. Lasts one minute.
