desc_CS_jh_xfz07_1=<br>Makes a <font color="#FFAE00">Stationary Mark</font>, granting immunity from most of the pulls, knockdowns and throws to teammates within a 20-metre radius around you. Lasts 9 seconds. Applies a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> to yourself for each successful Parry on your part. Vajra Bonus: increases damage done by Impermanence, Nihility, Thunder Mark by 20%. Stacks up to 5 times. Lasts 30 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xld01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it adds to the target an <font color="#FFAE00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status: Continuous bleeding for 8 seconds. The higher the level of <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>, the greater the damage. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.
