desc_CS_jh_xld09_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking the <font color="#f9fc00">enemy</font> will be knocked into <font color="#FF3030">Asura (enemy)</font>: Rapid-fire pressing of the button. If successful the enemy will be released from the attack, otherwise Target will continue to receive blows.  <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Momentous Night"</font>.
