desc_CS_jh_yqq01_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> every 10 seconds. The attack is executed in "Yellow Armor" status. There is also a chance to randomly obtain one of the effects of "Manic Pounding" and "Frantic Beating": <br>Manic Pounding: the attack throws the target. <br>Frantic Beating: Remove the time for catching breath in "Wild Shot Fist -2", "Wild Shot Fist - 3" and "Wild Shot Fist - 6". In addition, there will not be need to catch breath for the next attack. <br>Damage ignores target's physical defense.
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> every 10 seconds. The attack is executed in "Yellow Armor" status. There is also a chance to randomly obtain one of the effects of "Manic Pounding" and "Frantic Beating": <br>Manic Pounding: the attack throws the target. <br>Frantic Beating: Remove the time for catching breath in "Wild Shot Fist -2", "Wild Shot Fist - 3" and "Wild Shot Fist - 6". In addition, there will not be need to catch breath for the next attack. <br>Damage ignores target's physical defense.
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_9=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage, stuns the target and reduces the likelihood of internal Attack Critical Hits, while also causing concussion against nearby enemies (maximum 10 persons). <br>While attacking, the player cannot be thrown, knocked back or knocked down. <br>Instant recovery of breath when the attack is interrupted or evaded, remove time for catching breath. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_9=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage, and reduces the likelihood of internal Attack Critical Hits, while also causing concussion to nearby enemies (maximum 10 persons). <br>While attacking, the player cannot be thrown, knocked back or knocked down. <br>Instant recovery of breath when the attack is interrupted or evaded, remove time for catching breath. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_10=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_11=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_9=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq06_9=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage, and reduce likelihood of internal Attack Critical Hits, while also causing concussion to the nearby enemies (maximum 10 persons). <br>While attacking, the player will obtain the Red Super Armor status. <br>Instant recovery of breath when the attack is interrupted or evaded, remove time for catching breath, and return 80% of lost Rage.
