desc_CS_jh_yxfj07_1=Charge to mouse selected area and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>When launching the skill, you receive <font color="#FFAE00">Six Moves</font> state: increase dodge rate, upon successful dodge, you receive <font color="#FFAE00">Covered Sun</font> effect. <br>(When using the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)<br>(In Covered Sun, you can use <font color="#f9fc00">【Covered Sun and Cloud】</font>, lasts 20 seconds)
