desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>Skill has 30% chance to attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>: Target's next move has a huge chance to miss target.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs01_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an initial target and Splash damage to adjacent ones within a 8-metre radius around the initial target;<br>the skill has a 30% chance to apply <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> to the target, causing it to have a great chance to miss on its coming attack.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs01_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>Skill has 30% chance to attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>: Target's next move has a huge chance to miss target.
