desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs01_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>Skill has 30% chance to attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>: Target's next move has a huge chance to miss target.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Upon successful break of defense, attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> state (Target's next move has a huge chance to miss target) and <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font> state (will not be able to use Parry for a long time, when hit by 【Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess (Wuque)】 skills, internal force will be absorbed, amount depends on levels of attacking skill).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs03_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>When a Break Defense occurs on the victim, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> to it (Causes it to have a great chance to miss on its coming attack) as well as applies <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font> to it (Causes it to be unable to parry for a long time, as well as causes its Energy to be drained on being hit by Seven Techniques of the Flower Prince—actual amount of Energy to drain is decided by the level of the skill)
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs03_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Upon successful break of defense, attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> state (Target's next move has a huge chance to miss target) and <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font> state (will not be able to use Parry for a long time, when hit by 【Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess (Wuque)】 skills, internal force will be absorbed, amount depends on levels of attacking skill).
