desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_1=Upon successful Parry: 10% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 35 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_10=Has a 30% chance to knock back yourself and apply <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> to the attacker at the time of a successful parry on your part. (This effect cannot occur more than once every 10 seconds)
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_2=Upon successful Parry: 10% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 30 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_3=Upon successful Parry: 15% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 30 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_4=Upon successful Parry: 15% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 25 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_5=Upon successful Parry: 20% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 25 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_6=Upon successful Parry: 20% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 20 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_7=Upon successful Parry: 25% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 20 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_8=Upon successful Parry: 25% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 15 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs04_9=Upon successful Parry: 30% chance to fall back and attach attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> (Can be triggered every 15 seconds).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, also affects targets within 8 meters;<br>attach enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Flowers</font>: Paralyze for 3 seconds. <br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>, target will be stunned for 3 seconds (ignores Parry).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs06_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an initial target and Splash damage to adjacent ones within a 8-metre radius around the initial target;<br>Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Flowers</font> to enemy—paralyzing them for 3 seconds. <br>If the enemy is already affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>, stuns it for 3 seconds (this effect ignores the target's Parry)
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs06_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, also affects targets within 8 meters;<br>attach enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Flowers</font>: Paralyze for 3 seconds. <br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>, target will be stunned for 3 seconds (ignores Parry).
