desc_bosskhdtt_01_01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>if target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon's Footprint</font>, it enters <font color="#FFAE00">The Cuff</font>: Keyboard settings randomized, lasts 6 seconds (time increases based on the stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon's Footprint</font>).
desc_bosskhdtt_01_01_2=Hit the target's face to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the targetsstill under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>, also fall under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>, which randomizes the target's key bindings for 6 seconds. (The duration can be stacked with the stack count of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> effect.)
desc_bosskhdtt_01_01_3=Hit the target's face to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the targetsstill under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font>, also fall under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"The Cuff"</font>, which randomizes the target's key bindings for 6 seconds. (The duration can be stacked with the stack count of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Footprint"</font> effect.)
