desc_jlgc_boss_jn_001_1=Deal huge damage to all targets within 10 meters
desc_jlgc_boss_jn_002_1=Stun all male characters within 10 meters, all females within 10 meters receive buff
desc_jlgc_boss_jn_003_1=Deal damage to target
desc_jlgc_boss_jn_004_1=Deal huge damage to female target, minor damage to male targets
desc_jlgc_boss_jn_005_1=Deal massive damage to nearby targets
desc_jlgc_boss_jn_006_1=Deal damage to target
desc_jlgc_fz_jn_001_1=<s>
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_001_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target;<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>, skill will also affect enemies near target.
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_002_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; if you have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>, skill will also affect enemies near target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_003_1=Detonate <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; skill may blow away targets and injure them: affected targets lose HP continuously and suffer loss of Brawn. <br>(May only be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>)
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_004_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front;<br>If you breach the Parry of target, you can slow its movement speed and make it unable to use Flying Skill.
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_005_1=Defending stance, upon successful Parry, you may transfer target's attack into <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>. <br>(The better your skill is, the more <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> will be stored)
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_006_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target;<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>, skill will also affect enemies near target.
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_007_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and knock it down, also affects nearby targets: Shock all nearby enemies. <br>(Require <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use the skill, can only attack airborne target)
desc_jlgc_gb_lhz_008_1=Drag nearby enemies to you, dealing {@0:伤害包}, temporarily increase the power of lotus skills by 20%; <br>If you have learned <font color="#FFAE00">Give the Buddha Borrowed Flowers</font>, you gain extra <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_001_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy; <br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">Shock</font>, it takes additional Yang Damage.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_002_1=Charging skill, deal {@0:伤害包} to target; if target is under <font color="#FFAE00">Shock</font>, it takes additional Yang Damage<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_003_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; target will be <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_004_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>targets who attempt to parry will be <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> and cannot use skills temporarily.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_005_1=Defending stance, successful parry activate potential, attaching extra damage to your skills.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_006_1=Attack enemies on the move, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#FFAE00">shock</font> them.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_007_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy and blow them off; <br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">Shock</font>, it takes additional Yang Damage. <br/>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage in a selected area, <font color="#FFAE00">shocked</font> enemies cannot use skills and suffer addiontal damage.
desc_jlgc_jl_zfd_008_1=<s>
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_001_1=Deal damage to target and absorb HP.
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_002_1=Deal damage to target and absorb HP. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_003_1=Attack and apply <font color="#FFAE00">Eagle Eye</font> effect: targets' movement speed will be reduced, attempts on using Flying Skill may result in a knock-down, any attacks on the target absorbs HP from target.
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_004_1=Deal damage to enemies in the front; <br>Break target's Parry and knock it down, reducing its movement speed.
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_005_1=Defending stance, upon successful Parry, increase movement speed and Eagle Claw Fist power.
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_006_1=Deal damage to nearby enemies.
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_007_1=Deal damage to nearby enemies; <br>Skill may be used when airborne, knock down targets in range and attach <font color="#FFAE00">Peck Eye and Fight for Pearls</font> effect.
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_008_1=Dash to target zone while airborne, dealing damage and attaching Peck Eye and Fight for Pearls
desc_jlgc_jy_yzq_009_1=Charge skill, can only be used against knocked-down target, dealing damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_001_1=Charge, continuous kicks deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, can be used together with <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font> for greater power. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_002_1=Kick and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target in the front, can be used together with <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font> for greater power.
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_003_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front, breaking Parry and knock down foe to cause internal injury: reduce movement speed and take continuous damage.
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_004_1=Defending stance, upon successful Parry, activate <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font>(increase movement speed and 7 Yin Damage, increase the power of Leisure Kick).
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_005_1=Continuous kicks deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, can be used together with <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font> for greater power.
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_006_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target in the front, can be used together with <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font> for greater power.
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_007_1=Kick enemies in the front 3 times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage, can be used together with Leisure Skill for greater power
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_008_1=Kick enemies in the front 2 times, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage, can be used together with Leisure Skill for greater power; for this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_009_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front, can be used together with Leisure Skill for greater power
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_010_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, if target attempts to fight back, it will fall and be injured, suffering from reduced movement speed and continuous damage
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_011_1=Upon successful defense, Leisure Skill increases movement speed and attack, also increases the power of Leisure Kick
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_012_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, can be used together with Leisure Skill for greater power
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_013_1=Charge, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, if you have <font color="#FFAE00">Leisure Skill</font>, strikes against airborne targets have greater chances of dealing increased damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_jzt_xytf_014_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, upon Leisure Skill is activated, if you and your target are both airborne, you have greater chances in dealing bonus damage
desc_jlgc_ks_jn_001_1=<s>
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_001_1=Deal damage worth 5% of HP. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_002_1=Deal damage worth 3% of HP;<br>You skills apply <font color="#f9fc00">Cold as Ice</font>: The lower HP target has, the higher the damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill, max dashing distance is 20 meters)
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_003_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets; <br>You may move when using the skill, you are under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_004_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Deal 2 times the damage and recover 10 Rage if you break target's Parry.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_005_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>state: When parrying an enemy's attacks, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack, lasts 5 seconds. <br>(Counter skill, effective radius is 6m, it does not work upon Super Armor and may be restrained by Feint Moves. Increase skill stacks to boost counter damage)
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_006_1=Damage
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_007_1=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Dagger Cloaked in Red</font>: Absorb minor damage, lasts 10 seconds; <br>When the effect ends, you receive <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">【Dagger Cloaked in Yellow】</font>.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_008_1=Dance wildly, bending to and fro while regulating your breath. When you use a skill you have used within 60 seconds, the skill will reenter a cool-down period (Only for skills of the set). <br>If skill is <font color="#f9fc00">Flowing Pure Silk</font>: The skill will ignore target's Endurance and deal damage. <br>If skill is <font color="#f9fc00">Sparse Raindrop</font>: If <font color="#FFAE00">Sparse Raindrop</font> state is broken, it will deal damage to nearby enemies.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_009_1=Deal damage {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_010_1=Deal damage {@0:伤害包} to target;<br>You skills apply <font color="#f9fc00">Cold as Ice</font>: The lower HP target has, the higher the damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill, max dashing distance is 20 meters)
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_011_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br>You can move freely while using this skill, as well as gaining the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> effect.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_012_1=Sweep enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When breaching target's parry, you deal double damage and recover 10 Rage.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_013_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>state: When parrying an enemy's attacks, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack, lasts 5 seconds. <br>(Counter skill, it does not work upon Super Armor and may be restrained by Feint Moves.
desc_jlgc_npc_jn_ncd_014_1=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Cloak of Daggers</font>: Absorb minor damage, lasts 10 seconds; <br>When the effect ends, you receive <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">【Dagger Cloaked in Yellow】</font>.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_001_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front and shock nearby targets.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_002_1=Charge, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage, the higher your Brawn, the higher the damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_003_1=Strike enemies in front of you dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. If this attack breaks an enemy's Parry, the remaining force will stun surrounding enemies.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_004_1=Defending stance, hold enemy attacks and shock attacker.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_005_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; when target is airborne, you may knock it away.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_006_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies and knock them away, targets suffer from reduced movement speed, cannot use Flying Skill and any skills.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_007_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; the skill can be used when airborne and may stun enemies on the ground for 3 seconds.
desc_jlgc_sl_dmgf_008_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage, when used in the air, stun enemies on the ground for 3 seconds.
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_001_1=Charge, deal {@0:伤害包} damage, if you have <font color="#FFAE00">Following Madness</font>, deal extra Yin Damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_002_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage and paralyze target for 3 seconds.
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_003_1=Increase movement speed by 30%, lasts 15 seconds.
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_004_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Attempts to block the skill will cause the target to be blown away and paralyzed (30% reduced movement speed for 8 seconds).
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_005_1=Upon successful Parry, attach 7 Yin Damage to attacks, lasts 10 seconds (affected by internal power).
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_006_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Increase critical hit rate when used together with <font color="#FFAE00">Following Madness</font>.
desc_jlgc_tm_jsc_007_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_001_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front, affected targets will suffer extra damage when using Flying Skill.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_002_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in range and attach <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font> to make them fall. <br>Skill does not require channeling when used in the air, a chance to knock target down, the stronger your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> is, the higher the chance to knock down target.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_003_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in the front; <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font>, it can use Parry for 3 seconds.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_004_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Attempts to block the skill will cause the target to be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font> and fall.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_005_1=Defending Stance, each successful Parry boosts your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font>, lasts 10 seconds;<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> exists: 【Turbulent Rapids】 requires shorter channeling time, 【Pure Spring Flows Forth】 deals higher damage.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_006_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, each strike boosts sword chi; <br>Works better when target has <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font>; <br>Works better when used it the air.
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_007_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in range, target will be affected by Muddie, cannot move and use skills
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_008_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets, targets with Muddie take more damage
desc_jlgc_wd_qfjf_009_1=Charge and deal {@0:伤害包} damage, targets who cannot Parry take bonus damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
