desc_jn_drtg_mf_001_1=Attach self with Super Armor and absorb 50% of damage taken to recover HP, lasts 2 minutes.
desc_jn_drtg_mf_002_1=Taunt all enemies within 50 meters, and deal 10 damage to all enemies within 20 meters every second, lasts 2 minutes.
desc_jn_drtg_mf_003_1=Cause damage to targets and give them injection of ordinary inner power, causing them to explode when dying which damages all friendly forces within a 10 meter radius. Damage is equivalent to their max HP.
desc_jn_drtg_mf_004_1=Stun all enemies within 15 meters and attach Vulnerable to them, also remove their Super Armor effect. <br/>【Vulnerable】: Suffer 100% additional damage
desc_jn_drtg_mf_005_1=Recover 305 HP, and max HP is increased by 30% for 2 minutes. Produce a protection effect and absorb damage equivalent to max HP. Lasts 2 minutes before shield is broken. While you have the shield, your Super Armor is weakened (cannot be stacked).
desc_jn_drtg_mf_006_1=Increase movement speed by 100% and blow away nearby enemies, lasts 30 seconds.
desc_jn_drtg_mf_007_1=Reduce damage taken by 90% for 15 seconds, after the effect ends, deal damage equal to your max HP to all nearby enemies. Each attack has a chance to trigger Body Protecting Chi to deal damage worth 10% of your max HP to nearby enemies.
desc_jn_drtg_mf_008_1=Gain 50 Rage immediately, gain further 10 Rage in every 10 seconds.
desc_jn_drtg_mf_009_1=Recover Energy completely, in the coming 2 minutes, recover full Energy every 30 seconds.
