desc_jn_zc_lxc001_1=Lung Capacity Improves
desc_jn_zc_lxc002_1=Stun target for 10 seconds
desc_jn_zc_lxc003_1=Treasure hunt
desc_jn_zc_lxcitem001_1=Use it against experts in the camp to drive them away.<br><font color="#FF64014">Can only be used while recruiting experts, and only against experts who have been recruited.</font>
desc_jn_zc_lxcitem002_1=Use it against experts in the camp in order to render them in an uncomfortable state. There is certain degree of failure for this act. <br><font color="#FF64014">Can only be used while recruiting experts, and only against experts who have been recruited.</font>
desc_jn_zc_lxcitem003_1=When used this will cause the target to be thrown and stunned for 5 seconds.
desc_jn_zc_lxcitem004_1=After it is used it will immediately return to the user <br><font color="#FF64014">It cannot be used during a city attack.</font>
desc_jn_zc_lxcitem005_1=Cure recurring disease
