desc_CS_jh_myjf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack disables Flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>It also affects the target with <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damages nearby enemies, debuffing them with the <font color="#FFAE00">Scarce Shadow</font> state. Affected enemies' movement speed is reduced and they are grounded. The effect stacks up to five times, slows enemy speed by 14% per stack, and lasts for 2 seconds.
