desc_CS_jh_myjf02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Attack ends with a jumping dodge and creates <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around the enemy. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> after a short hiding period, player swings their sword and attacks all enemies within a 5 meter radius and cause damage (knock back effect ignores attacks). <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill proficiency.<br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.<br>Use of <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> consumes <font color="#f9fc00">Delicate Hair-Shaking Puppet</font>.
