desc_CS_jh_myjf06_1=Executing 6 parries successfully grants you the ability to <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font>, which adds the Ghost Shadow effect that reduces damage taken by 75% for 4 seconds.<br>If you stop parrying, Vanish immediately ends. Using skills from other sets will clear the Invisible Shadows state.
