desc_Boss_clone033_CG_02_1=Charges power for 3 seconds, summoning a round area that applies Disintegrating Poisoning to players. Disintegrating Poisoning—lowers the damage done by affected players by 30%. Lasts 10 seconds. If there are 5 or more players affected by Disintegrating Poisoning, great damage will be done to all players in the group.
