desc_Boss_clone033_WWH_02_1=Charges power for 3 seconds, dealing great damage to players within a 20-meter radius, throwing them and applying Sky Rage to them. Sky Rage: affected players' flying skills cost 20 times more Flying Skill Value. If there are 6 or more players affected by Sky Rage, applies Sky Blessing to itself. Sky Blessing: increases its Damage Done, Defense and Evasion by 20% , restores 2000 HP each time it takes damage. Lasts 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_clone033_WWH_03_1=Charges power for 8 seconds, dealing Instant Kill damage to the target, dealing great damage to players within a 5-meter radius around the target, as well as applying Uncontrolled Blade Chi. Can be interrupted while charging power.
desc_Boss_clone033_WWH_04_1=Charges power for 3 seconds, dealing a medium amount of damage to all players standing in a line; when the victim is meanwhile affected by Uncontrolled Blade Chi, deducts 4000 HP, throws it, and then stuns it for 5 seconds (at the time of Stun, removes Uncontrolled Blade Chi)
desc_Boss_clone033_WWH_05_1=Applies Shield (lasts 8 seconds) to itself, applying Dragon Wrath on taking critical hit . Dragon Wrath (lasts 5 seconds): increases Defense by 50%. If the Shield remains not destroyed for 8 seconds, deals 8000 HP damage to all players within a 10-meter radius and throws them. The Shield will disappear when it absorbs 30000 damage.
