desc_CS_em_pxcyz07_10=An advanced movement. Snow and ice surge and a freezing gust picks up, inflicting {@0:伤害包} on all incoming enemies;<br><font color="#FFAE00">Icy Air Invasion</font> slows the enemy's movement speed and prevents the enemy from using Flying Skills.
