desc_CS_em_pxcyz08_10=Snow swirls on the ground, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Soar through the air and strike as you descend, attacking enemies within the area of effect. Those hit will be rooted, and their abilities will be reduced.
