desc_CS_gb_dgbf05_10=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
