desc_CS_gb_ksbf04_10=A surprise attack on heaven and earth that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If used to break a block the movement closes accupoints on the enemy's feet. This causes the enemy to lose a large amount of inner Energy when using a Flying Skill within 19 seconds of being hit by this attack; <br>The movement also ignites the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Wine Mist</font> state, and the deeper the enemy's state of inebriation, the more damage he takes.
