desc_CS_gb_lhz07_10=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target.<br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.)
