desc_CS_gb_lsbf07_10=Sprit Snake Staff Technique:  Hurl snake poison and catalyze it with Energy, envenom surrounding enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">"Strange Snake Poison"</font> (Legs and feet suffer paralysis, movement speed is reduced, and recovery is slowed. If target is in air when poisoned, he will fall from air, and cannot use flying skills in a short period, losing HP continuously in poisoned period).
