desc_CS_jh_bxjf03_10=Drifting shadow and flying immortal, the purple air comes from the east{@0:伤害包}. <br>Causes to target <font color="#FFAE00">"Poisoned by Evil Wind"</font> at the same time player's <font color="#FF3030">"Evil Influence"</font> invades target. Every skill will be sealed for a short time when used. Lasts for 15 seconds. Each Seal Skill removes 1 stack of Poisoned by Evil Wind.  <br>(Can transform at most 4 stack of "Evil Influence" into "Poisoned by Evil Wind")<br> (Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
