desc_CS_jh_bxjf07_10=Evil arises from the frost and Sweep Away the Demons. Causes in targets{@0:伤害包};<br> Pressing the key again consumes 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> and allows player trigger the pursue and attack move <font color="#f9fc00">"Subdue and Punish All"</font>.  <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent)<br> (Pursue and attack skill cannot be used if player does not have 10 stacks Evil Influence)<br> (Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
