desc_CS_jh_chz06_1=Can be used to trigger the effect of <font color="#FF3030">Five Elements Flag</font>.<br>On a successful parry, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Poke Boost</font> to yourself: increase the skill range of <font color="#f9fc00">Take an Oath under Heaven</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Euphemize</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Flick Suddenly</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Flick towards the Sky</font> by 1 meter. Can stack up to 15 times. Lasts 30 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_chz07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>on nullifying the target's parry: <br>Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Mirage</font> to yourself - increases melee damage and Internal Attack Damage by 9 for a minute, can stack up to 5 times.. <br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Mirage (enemy)</font> to the target - reduces melee damage and Internal Attack Damage by 9 for a minute, can stack up to 5 times.
