desc_CS_jh_cqgf01_13=Charging movement, use brute force to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and make target unstable, with reduced dodging.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jh_cqgf01_14=Charging movement, use brute force to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and make target unstable, with reduced dodging.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jh_cqgf02_13=Feint attack the upper body but instead sweeps the lower body; causes in enemy in front of player{@0:伤害包}; causes felled by a blow and additional damage in enemy when player breaks through target's parry.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf02_14=Feint attack the upper body but instead sweeps the lower body; causes in enemy in front of player{@0:伤害包}; causes felled by a blow and additional damage in enemy when player breaks through target's parry.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf03_13=Defensive Stance. simple and useful. Each successful parry can reduce damage by 35.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf03_14=Defensive Stance. simple and useful. Each successful parry can reduce damage by 38.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_13=As forceful as a fierce tiger, rushes target in front of player causing{@0:伤害包}; skill can knock back enemies who are Staggered and cause 3 times the normal damage.  Skill can be used immediately when in the air and add "Super Armor" to player, but removes target's Dancing Flowers on the Mountains effect after a successful hit to the target
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_14=As forceful as a fierce tiger, rushes target in front of player causing{@0:伤害包}; skill can knock back enemies who are Staggered and cause 3 times the normal damage.  Skill can be used immediately when in the air and add "Super Armor" to player, but removes target's Dancing Flowers on the Mountains effect after a successful hit to the target
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_sky_13=Act like a fierce tiger and strike the target in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The move can knock an unsteady enemy back and deal 3.0 times damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_sky_14=Act like a fierce tiger and strike the target in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The move can knock an unsteady enemy back and deal 3.0 times damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_13=Swift fist attack against enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_14=Swift fist attack against enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_sky_13=Punch target like rain with fist, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_sky_14=Punch target like rain with fist, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf06_13=Simple fist fight, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf06_14=Simple fist fight, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf07_13=Wild howl and angry roar shocks the enemy's mind, causing surrounding targets to{@0:伤害包}, and adds "Seal Skill" and "Keyboard Settings Randomized" to targets to 3 seconds; player gains Frenzy, which increases damage done by skills in the same set by 30% and increases movement speed by 50%, lasts for 12 seconds
