desc_CS_jh_flxmz08_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br><font color="#f9fc00">"Wind and Thunder Stance"</font>: largely slows targets, deals damage to enemies around you. <br>If the target is affected by the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Storm</font>, deals additional damage and removes the effect. <br><font color="#4169E1">This skill won't deal critical hit other than on rainy days.</font>
