desc_CS_jh_fmzf04_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} and knock down one target in the selected area. Adds "Devil Follow": for each time they get hit, they will be knocked down twice, causing "Fall Damage". When they get hit by the skills of this set, they will take extra damage. Lasts 10 seconds.
