desc_CS_jh_ghqd01_10=Gather you chi together into a hardened point, then seize up and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>This move inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Life-Taking</font> internal damage on the target: When the enemy executes a movement he will suffer damage, and the greater the internal damage he suffers, the greater the damage from attempting to perform a move will be.<br>Internal damage only hits after it has accumulated for a brief period.
