desc_CS_jh_ghqd04_10=Your dagger yearns to taste blood, and this vicious strike dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage can satiate it. If the target is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> internal damage, every ensuing attack will add a layer of internal damage.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
