desc_CS_jh_ghqd06_10=A movement of dominating energy.<br>If the opponent is suffering <font color="#FFAE00">Life-taking</font> Energy, his HP will be winnowed away; <br>If the enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul-stealing</font> internal damage, his inner Energy will be affected.
