desc_CS_jh_hjdf01_10=The hidden blade waits for the time to strike among the many twists and turns, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf01_9=The hidden blade waits for the time to strike among the many twists and turns, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_10=The guest attacks the host, destroy the blade to end hatred. causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}; <br>a successful breakthrough of the enemy's parry adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> to player.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_9=The guest attacks the host, destroy the blade to end hatred. causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}; <br>a successful breakthrough of the enemy's parry adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> to player.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_hide_10=The road is long and I sing a song while I walk, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_hide_9=The road is long and I sing a song while I walk, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf04_10=The host deceives the guest and the binding blade is unfeeling. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf04_9=The host deceives the guest and the binding blade is unfeeling. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_10=The young is better than the old, the thrown sword stalks the soul. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_9=The young is better than the old, the thrown sword stalks the soul. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf07_10=The blade has become me, and I am the blade. The blade is in the dance and the dance has become the blade. Causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">Unconsciousness</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(Player may move freely when using skill, status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf07_9=The blade has become me, and I am the blade. The blade is in the dance and the dance has become the blade. Causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">Unconsciousness</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(Player may move freely when using skill, status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use)
desc_CS_jh_hyjf01_10=Standing on wall, spraying sword Qi. Chop front enemy and Deal {@0:伤害包} to them.<br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Surprise Snow"</font> state: Decrease Yan Xing and Cloud penetrating speed, it can be accumulated 3 times. (The third time attack will make target dizzy for 1 second.)
