desc_CS_jh_hyjf02_10=Sprint Move, cold ghost. Stab chain can Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quickness Attack</font>: Use it to increase sprint speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Collapse Without Being Attacked</font>: Decrease target's sprint speed and distance after the Move hits target.<br>(This Move can make you approach target quickly by using Flying Skill.)
