desc_CS_jh_hyjf03_10=Quick short steps moving, graceful dance. Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemy.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Invasion</font>: Restrict nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decrease Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
