desc_CS_jh_hyjf08_10=Leave No Trace, Slash Without Discretion: Cause surrounding enemies leaping attack{@0:damage packet}(attack immobilizes for 1 second), with eight strokes at most; <br>If the target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Startling Snow"</font> state, then the higher this state, the greater the damage inflicted. <br>(This skill requires 10 rage points, and each attack expends 10 rage points.)
