desc_CS_jh_jgjf01_10=Three Marvels Six Rites, Far from the Nine Palaces, wielding your sword causes {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy in front of you; <br>After using this Skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>and you can keep up to 9 beams.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf01_9=Three Marvels Six Rites, Far from the Nine Palaces, wielding your sword causes {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy in front of you; <br>After using this Skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>and you can keep up to 9 beams.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf02_10=Up and Down are Transposed, Nine Stars at Opposition, a flying slash causes {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf02_9=Up and Down are Transposed, Nine Stars at Opposition, a flying slash causes {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf03_10=Roaming Three Evading Five, Imperial Sword Attack for Punishment, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>When you overcome the enemy's parry, if you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Harmony with Others” </font>state: This Skill will not be sealed the first five times it is used.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf03_9=Roaming Three Evading Five, Imperial Sword Attack for Punishment, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>When you overcome the enemy's parry, if you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Harmony with Others” </font>state: This Skill will not be sealed the first five times it is used.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf04_10=Wear Nine Tread One, Spreading Rebellion, when your parry is successful: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Xun Jia” </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Secret Chant” </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf04_9=Wear Nine Tread One, Spreading Rebellion, when your parry is successful: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Xun Jia” </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Secret Chant” </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_10=Starts Heaven Sword Array, paralyzing enemies within a 15-meter radius and dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>While <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font> is active, applies <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> - increases speed by 20% - to your teammates and yourself. Applies <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> - increases the points cost of Flying skills by 2, increases the energy cost of skills by 20% - to enemies. The Array lasts 10 seconds. <br>.Only one Sword Array can exist at a time.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_9=Starts up Heaven Sword Array, applying Paralyze to enemies within a 15-meter radius and dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>While <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font> is active, applies <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>—increases movement speed by 20%—to your teammates and yourself; applies <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font>—increases the Flying Skill Value cost of Flying Skills by 2, increases the Energy cost of skills by 20%—to enemies. The Array lasts 10 seconds. <br>(Only one Sword Array can exist at a time)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf06_10=Inside are Nine Heavens, the Spirit is Nine Earths, unleash <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>, knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, and cause them {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>: You and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>(increases Critical Hit value by 20%, increases Accuracy by 20%), and your enemy will encounter <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting </font>(reduces External Defense by 20%); the Sword Array will last 10 seconds. <br>(Only one Sword Array can exist)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf06_9=Inside are Nine Heavens, the Spirit is Nine Earths, unleash <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>, knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, and cause them {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>: You and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>(increases Critical Hit value by 20%, increases Accuracy by 20%), and your enemy will encounter <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting </font>(reduces External Defense by 20%); the Sword Array will last 10 seconds. <br>(Only one Sword Array can exist)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_10=Six Jia Return to the Origin, Three Marvels Exhaust Principle, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the selected range; <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target to be <font color="#FFAE00">“Infatuated"</font>: Confused Key Positions, which will continue for 3 seconds; can be used twice, with an interval of 2 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, this Skill will change to the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Nine Palaces Eight Winds." </font>
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_9=Six Jia Return to the Origin, Three Marvels Exhaust Principle, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the selected range; <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target to be <font color="#FFAE00">“Infatuated"</font>: Confused Key Positions, which will continue for 3 seconds; can be used twice, with an interval of 2 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, this Skill will change to the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Nine Palaces Eight Winds." </font>
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_hide_10=Great Yin Ambush, Sixfold Unity Shifting Form, Sword Dance will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_hide_9=Great Yin Ambush, Sixfold Unity Shifting Form, Sword Dance will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf08_10=Three Beginnings Six Eras, Nine Swords Return to One, Gleaming White Sword Light Converges, pursuing your target causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>You will also cause Additional Damage depending on the amount of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light,” </font>the <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light" </font>will then be cleared. <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target <font color="#FFAE00">“Ruptured Liver and Gall”</font>: The enemy will continuously lose HP, which will continue for 5 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will cause your target to be Stunned 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf08_9=Three Beginnings Six Eras, Nine Swords Return to One, Gleaming White Sword Light Converges, pursuing your target causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>You will also cause Additional Damage depending on the amount of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light,” </font>the <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light" </font>will then be cleared. <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target <font color="#FFAE00">“Ruptured Liver and Gall”</font>: The enemy will continuously lose HP, which will continue for 5 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will cause your target to be Stunned 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf09_10=Yin Yang Right and Wrong, Visiting the Nine Palaces, Measured Pace, Death Life Sword Slash, will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the range of your stride and slash; <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, Damage will be even greater. <br>(The Attack is accompanied by rigidity, and you will be in a <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state, so you can be attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf09_9=Yin Yang Right and Wrong, Visiting the Nine Palaces, Measured Pace, Death Life Sword Slash, will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the range of your stride and slash; <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, Damage will be even greater. <br>(The Attack is accompanied by rigidity, and you will be in a <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state, so you can be attacked.)
