desc_CS_jh_jsjf06_10=Snake shadow in golden screen; when successfully defending a strike, there is a possibility of causing the target to be inflicted with <font color="#CD2626">snake miasma</font>: The virus will explode when adding to 3 levels, and the target will enter the state of <font color="#FFAE00">"Devouring the heart and sawing the bones"</font>: It will continue to suffer outflow of blood and energy, and will remain paralyzed for 5 seconds after the state ends.
