desc_CS_jh_kfdf02_10=The winds are strong and the sky is high, blade shadows link together; causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit decreases cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">"A Quick Shadow Leaves No Traces"</font> by 2 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
