desc_CS_jh_kfdf03_10=Wild winds are shadowless and the blade cuts without a trace, jump slashes enemies within range, causing{@0:伤害包}; <br>(attacks add 1 second of Rigidity)<br> can attack 4 times at most but cannot attack the same target in succession, player can be attacked during skill use.
