desc_CS_jh_kfdf07_10=Swing your blade and strike forcefully, advancing courageously, causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry reduces cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">"A Quick Shadow Leaves No Traces"</font> by 2 seconds.
