desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_10=Flying jump steps and a jump-kick chain. This move may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies in front of you (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds).  <br>First strike: causes in target {@0:伤害包}(can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent).
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_11=Flying jump steps and a jump-kick chain. This move may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies in front of you (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds).  <br>First strike: causes in target {@0:伤害包}(can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent).
