desc_CS_jh_kxtd05_10=Kick over books angrily chain kick. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}.<br> Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> to opponent at the same time, which decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd05_11=Kick over books angrily chain kick. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}.<br> Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> to opponent at the same time, which decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%.
