desc_CS_jh_kxtd07_sky_11=<s>
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq01_10=The dragon and tiger are subdued, demons and gods respect you. You pounce and hit enemies in front of you causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>Successful hit adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Pouncing"</font> to self, which increases the damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">"Tiger Hunts the Rabbit"</font> by 10% for every stack of Pouncing. Lasts 30 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq02_10=The wind and clouds start to move, the dragon sits and the tiger follows, tears into target causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>If player has 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouncing</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, changing <font color="#f9fc00">"Dragon Swimming Across the Field "</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq03_10=The flying cloud sets out a dawn array, one's killing will is as red as the bridge, explosive punch causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>When player has the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, this skill will transform into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>.  <br>("Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon" is more powerful and does not cost any energy to use)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq04_10=I have the strength to lift mountains and the spirit to take on the world. I will destroy all means of retreat and take on this battle. Deals explosive strike to the enemy causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>At the beginning of skill, player enters <font color="#FFAE00">"Advent of the Overlord"</font> state and cannot be knocked back or felled by a blow for 5 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq06_10=Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon Flight"</font> buff, which gives player 100% vampiric effect for all skills within the set. Every blow removes 1 stackable effect of Dragon Flight. Lasts 15 seconds. May be stacked 10 times.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq07_10=The tiger is weary and the dragon is tired, it is hard to tell the real and false apart. Fist swing causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Heart"</font> to enemy, causing them to take damage when using attack skills. Lasts 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq08_10=The tiger is angry and the dragon impatient, their anger like an unending stream. Deals an explosive punch, causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Tear Apart"</font> to enemies, which causes them to take on additional damage when attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 40 layers.  <br>(The moves continue without a break and do not consume energy)
desc_CS_jh_liusha01_10=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
