desc_CS_jh_liusha02_10=Radiant like the sun and the moon, your two swords slash at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br/>This is the core skill of the Shaoxiaship of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Zhi'an</font>.
