desc_CS_jh_liusha04_10=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
