desc_CS_jh_llt02_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking down the target's defense: When the number rolled is even, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for a random period of time (0 to 4 seconds).
desc_CS_jh_llt02_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking down the target's defense: When the number rolled is even, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for a random period of time (0 to 4 seconds).
desc_CS_jh_llt06_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the player is rolling dice, each attack will have <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font> effect regardless of the target's parry. Each attack will also have 100% spraying damage. <br>The range of spraying will be determined by the number rolled.
desc_CS_jh_llt06_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the player is in dice-throwing status, each attack will have <font color="#f9fc00">Common Lockout</font> effect regardless of the target's parry. Each attack will also have 100% spraying effect. <br>The range of spraying will be determined by the number rolled.
desc_CS_jh_myjf01_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br> Disables the use of Flying skills for 4 seconds. <br>Summons <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> deals damage to nearby enemies, each hit applies a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scarce Shadow</font>: slows and disables the use of Flying skills. Can stack up to 5 times. Lasts 2 seconds. Each stack slows 14%. <br>The damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> increases as the level of this skill increases.
desc_CS_jh_myjf01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack disables Flying skills for 4 seconds.<br>It also affects the target with <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damages nearby enemies, debuffing them with the <font color="#FFAE00">Scarce Shadow</font> state. Affected enemies' movement speed is reduced and they are grounded. The effect stacks up to five times, slows enemy speed by 14% per stack, and lasts for 2 seconds.
