desc_CS_jh_myjf02_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br> Summons <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> around the target. <br>When <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> appears for a few seconds, wield the sword to throw enemies within 5 meters, dealing damage. Parry is ignored when target is thrown.<br>The damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> increases as the level of this skill increases. <br>This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach.
desc_CS_jh_myjf02_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Attack ends with a jumping dodge and creates <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around the enemy. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> after a short hiding period, player swings their sword and attacks all enemies within a 5 meter radius and cause damage (knock back effect ignores attacks). <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill proficiency.<br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.<br>Use of <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> consumes <font color="#f9fc00">Delicate Hair-Shaking Puppet</font>.
