desc_CS_jh_myjf04_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>summons <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> breaks the momentum, wields the sword to cast <font color="#f9fc00">Scared Shadow</font>, after that, enemies will be knocked down, knockdown lasts 3 seconds. <br>The feint skill cast by Ghost Shadow has nothing to do with your own feint skill) <br>The damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> increases as the level of this skill increases.
desc_CS_jh_myjf04_11=Inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>Creates <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around targets. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> Momentum-breaking attack, swing your sword and use <font color="#f9fc00">"Scared Shadow"</font>. Causes knocked down in nearby enemies for 3 seconds. <br>The efficiency of feint attacks used in Ghost Shadow mode and cooldown are not correlated.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill proficiency. <br>Use of <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> consumes <font color="#f9fc00">Delicate Hair-Shaking Puppet</font>.
desc_CS_jh_myjf04_12=Inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>Creates <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around targets. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> Momentum-breaking attack, swing your sword and use <font color="#f9fc00">"Scared Shadow"</font>. Causes knocked down in nearby enemies for 3 seconds. <br>The efficiency of feint attacks used in Ghost Shadow mode and cooldown are not correlated.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill proficiency. <br>Use of <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> consumes <font color="#f9fc00">Delicate Hair-Shaking Puppet</font>.
