desc_CS_jh_myjf05_10=The clouds move apart and the moon appears, the flower spirit play with the shadows. Jump strike causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>A successful break through of enemy's parry and stacks 7 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Fright"</font>, which slows the target and prohibits flying skills. Lasts 7 seconds. 1 stack is removed every second.
