desc_CS_jh_myjf08_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Summon <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around target.<font color="#f9fc00"> Ghost Shadow </font> will jump and attack target and around enemies with 1-second rigidity inflicted per attack, up to 5 attacks. <br>The damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> increases as the level of this skill increases.
