desc_CS_jh_mzjf01_10=Ink Sword Like Steel, Whirling Horizontal Chop, Sword Chi will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target; <br>You will receive 4 extra Rage points during the attack (enemy does not parry).
desc_CS_jh_mzjf01_9=Ink Sword Like Steel, Whirling Horizontal Chop, Sword Chi will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target; <br>You will receive 4 extra Rage points during the attack (enemy does not parry).
desc_CS_jh_mzjf02_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf02_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf03_10=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf03_9=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf04_10=Recover 6200 parry endurance, and the status <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry </font>is removed. <br>You will also gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>effect: When using Mozi's Sword to attack your opponent, each strike will add damage equivalent to 3% of the current parry (to a maximum of 320 additional points), and will restore 2 rage points. This effect will continue for 12 seconds. <br>When your parry endurance is less than 30%, Using a skill will put you in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect)<br> The amount of parry endurance you can restore will depend on how much you have cultivated.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf04_9=Recover 5600 parry endurance, and the status <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry </font>is removed. <br>You will also gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>effect: When using Mozi's Sword to attack your opponent, each strike will add damage equivalent to 3% of the current parry (to a maximum of 320 additional points), and will restore 2 rage points. This effect will continue for 12 seconds. <br>When your parry endurance is less than 30%, Using a skill will put you in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect)<br> The amount of parry endurance you can restore will depend on how much you have cultivated.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf05_10=Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> to yourself: applies <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> to enemies while Mozi's Sword is active. <br>Targets affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>: has 20% chance to interrupt their skillcasting, and disable the use of skills for 3 seconds as well. Can stack up to 11 stacks. Lasts 15 seconds. (Each time targets cast a skill, removes a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>)
desc_CS_jh_mzjf05_9=Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> to yourself: applies <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> to enemies while Mozi's Sword is active. <br>Targets affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>: has 20% chance to interrupt their skillcasting, and disable the use of skills for 3 seconds as well. Can stack up to 10 stacks. Lasts 15 seconds. (Each time targets cast a skill, removes a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>)
desc_CS_jh_mzjf06_10=Inflict {@0:伤害} to enemy in front. <br>If you overcome your target's parry, you will recover 1280 Parry Endurance points, and reduce your target's Internal and External attack damage by 128 points.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf06_9=Inflict {@0:伤害} to enemy in front. <br>If you overcome your target's parry, you will recover 1280 Parry Endurance points, and reduce your target's Internal and External attack damage by 128 points.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf07_10=When you parry successfully, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Decides Destiny" </font>effect. Each level can reduce <font color="#f9fc00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>cooldown by 1 second, and increase conversion value by 4% (converts rage into parry endurance. This effect can stack up to 19 levels.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf07_9=When you parry successfully, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Decides Destiny" </font>effect. Each level can reduce <font color="#f9fc00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>cooldown by 1 second, and increase conversion value by 4% (converts rage into parry endurance. This effect can stack up to 17 levels.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your parry endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Attack Damage Reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reinforced Attack</font>: if your current parry endurance is lower than 30%, restores 20 rage for yourself at the end of the skillcasting. <br>Grants immunity from Throws, Knockdowns and Knockbacks when your parry endurance is greater than 65)
desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Attack Damage Reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reinforced Attack</font>: if your current Parry Endurance is lower than 30%, restores 20 Rage for yourself at the end of the skillcasting. <br>(Grants immunity from Throws, Knockdowns and Knockbacks when your Parry Endurance is greater than 65)
