desc_CS_jh_plbz01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If you are affected by <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Light and Heavy</font> to enemies: reduces attack by 20%, lasts 6 seconds, can stack up to 5 times, only applies to players. <br>after the use of it, removes a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>.
