desc_CS_jh_plbz05_1=At the time of a successful parry: <br>grants <font color="#FFAE00">Vertical and Horizontal</font> to yourself: while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies a second of <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to yourself. Lasts 8 seconds. Can stack up to 5 times. When Yellow Armor becomes active, removes a stack.
desc_CS_jh_plbz05_2=At the time of a successful parry: <br>grants <font color="#FFAE00">Vertical and Horizontal</font> to yourself: while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies a second of <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to yourself. Lasts 10 seconds. Can stack up to 7 times. When Yellow Armor becomes active, removes a stack.
