desc_CS_jh_qxj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}. <br>If the target successfully parries your attack for the first 5 seconds, increases the damage of your attack by 50%. <br>If the target is not a player, then it'll be forced to attack itself. <br> This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach.
