desc_CS_jh_qxj05_1=Applies a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Alioth, Fifth of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: converts damage taken into HP, removes a stack when attacked, lasts 7 seconds. <br>Restored HP is no greater than 7% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_jh_qxj05_10=Applies 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Alioth, Fifth of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: converts damage taken into HP, removes a stack when attacked, lasts 7 seconds. <br>Restored HP is no greater than 7% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_jh_qxj05_2=Applies 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Alioth, Fifth of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: converts damage taken into HP, removes a stack when attacked, lasts 7 seconds. <br>Restored HP is no greater than 7% of your maximum HP.
