desc_CS_jh_qxj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies. <br>Deals extra damage when the victim's HP is lower than 30%. <br>While skill is being used, each attack the enemy chooses not to parry, or each time you are attacked, grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Mizar, Sixth of the Seven Stars</font>: increases external defense by 100 and internal defense by 10, can stack up to 49 times, lasts 14 seconds. <br>While skill is being used, you cannot move and you will be affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qxj06_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies; <br>deals extra damage when the victim's HP is lower than 30%; <br>During the cast time, each attack (the enemy chooses not to parry) or each time you are attacked, grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Defense Star</font>: increases External Defense by 100 and Internal Defense by 10, can stack up to 49 times, lasts 14 seconds. <br>During the cast time, you cannot move and you will be affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
