desc_CS_jh_sfj01_10=Feint attack with dagger while frowning: This causes the enemy in front to{@0:伤害包};<br> once the strike hits the target it can be used again for a maximum of 2 times within 2 seconds. <br>(The second strike will be accompanied with <font color="#f9fc00">stunning and knocking away</font> effect)
desc_CS_jh_sfj01_1_10=Wielding Heavenly Chisel without any anger or pleasure: This will render the enemy in front unconscious, as well as{@0:伤害包};<br> once the strike hits the target it can be used again within 2 seconds.
