desc_CS_jh_sfj02_10=Heavenly Beast creates wind and shoots dagger from the sky: This will cause the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as added with <font color="#FF3030">"Heavenly Beast (negative)"</font> status which reduces its moving speed by 40% and Flying Skill for a distance of about 4m for 5 seconds; <br>at the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Beat (positive)"</font> status which increases its moving speed by 40%, and Flying Skill for a distance of 4m and charging distance of 10m for 5 seconds. <br>(The strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)
desc_CS_jh_sfj02_9=Heavenly Beast creates wind and shoots dagger from the sky: This will cause the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as added with <font color="#FF3030">"Heavenly Beast (negative)"</font> status which reduces its moving speed by 40% and Flying Skill for a distance of about 4m for 5 seconds; <br>at the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Beat (positive)"</font> status which increases its moving speed by 40%, and Flying Skill for a distance of 4m and charging distance of 10m for 5 seconds. <br>(The strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)
desc_CS_jh_sfj03_10=Prancing steps that ride the wind in total focus: Rapid charge to selected region and causes enemies in range to{@0:伤害包};<br> after breaking enemies' defense, they will be knocked down for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfj03_9=Prancing steps that ride the wind in total focus: Rapid charge to selected region and causes enemies in range to{@0:伤害包};<br> after breaking enemies' defense, they will be knocked down for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfj04_10=Soaring Dragon on still and moon-less night: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> at the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"All Powerful"</font> state for 5 seconds. When launching the strike <font color="#f9fc00">[Power Over Wind and Clouds]</font>, the shooting distance will increase twofold, it will be cleared after it is launched. <br>(this strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
