desc_CS_jh_sfj05_10=Wind Song Dies Abruptly and the Clouds Embrace the Wind: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Lauding Wind"</font> state for 5 seconds. When launching the strike <font color="#f9fc00">[Playing with Moon and Lauding the Wind]</font>, the charging speed will increase, it will be cleared after it is launched. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
