desc_CS_jh_sfj06_10=Lying in Wait in Leisure: This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> state: When in a defensive state and under attack by enemy, it can render the enemy's strike ineffective in order to launch the charging strike used in the last time. This state can be maintained for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_sfj06_9=Lying in Wait in Leisure: This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> state: When in a defensive state and under attack by enemy, it can render the enemy's strike ineffective in order to launch the charging strike used in the last time. This state can be maintained for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_sfj07_10=Showing Unbridled Enthusiasm when the clouds are gone and the rain has ceased: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> The strike can knock away undefended targets, and prohibit Flying Skill for 3 seconds. <br>If the player is in a <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Beast (positive)"</font> state, it will be able to knock away the target 3 times.
