desc_CS_jh_sfj08_10=The rich inner spirit is suppressed and there is overwhelming sadness; the wind obscures all traces: This causes the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> During the strike, any enemy who dared to attack would be stunned (the same target will be stunned unconscious once if hit within 6 seconds, with the stunning effect decreasing each time). <br>(The strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)
