desc_CS_jh_tlq03_10=The Mantis Heart Secret can give movements the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you.<br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
