desc_CS_jh_tlw07_10=Display of flirtatious behavior and causes the enemies within the selected range to{@0:伤害包};<br> Also creates a <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font>: Enemies within 5 me will be unable to use their Flying Skill; <br>at the same the player obtains 2 levels of <font color="#FFAE00">"Veil of Silk"</font>: When another strike is launched, the player can interchange position with <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font> and cause hurt to surrounding enemies. This status can be maintained for 10 seconds, and can be added to 2 levels. Each interchange of position will result in elimination of 1 level. <br>(Only one "Dance Shadow" may exist at any one time; the new "Dance Shadow" made will replace the previous one)<br>(when launching the strike in the "Veil of Silk", it will be in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.)
desc_CS_jh_tlw07_11=Display of flirtatious behavior and causes the enemies within the selected range to{@0:伤害包};<br> Also creates a <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font>: Enemies within 5 me will be unable to use their Flying Skill; <br>at the same the player obtains 2 levels of <font color="#FFAE00">"Veil of Silk"</font>: When another strike is launched, the player can interchange position with <font color="#f9fc00">"Dance Shadow"</font> and cause hurt to surrounding enemies. This status can be maintained for 10 seconds, and can be added to 2 levels. Each interchange of position will result in elimination of 1 level. <br>(Only one "Dance Shadow" may exist at any one time; the new "Dance Shadow" made will replace the previous one)<br>(when launching the strike in the "Veil of Silk", it will be in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.)
