desc_CS_jh_ttg01_10=Charge at the target and headbutt them for {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Inflict target with <font color="#FFAE00">"Cracking Head"</font> for 15 seconds, during which this skill inflicts an additional 5% damage. This effect can be stacked 8 times.<br>(Use Flying Skill to approach target.)
