desc_CS_jh_ttg02_10=Charge up, wait for your chance, then charge forward and butt into the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The skill requires 2 seconds. The damage dealt will increase along with casting time. After charging, you will receive a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Endure</font> state when you use the skill. You can then ignore blocking and being punched away. <br>(The max charging distance of the skill is 20 meters.)
