desc_CS_jh_ttg06_10=Frozen Chi Sealed Sound, Pull Back Sinew and Bone, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Mind's Focus” </font>effect after a parry is successful: You can absorb immense parry Damage, and the effect will continue for 5 seconds. (Regulated Breathing time is 30 seconds)
