desc_CS_jh_wlbgg01_10=Measuring the sky and sweeping all before it: This causes the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> Also adds to them the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ruler of the Heavens"</font> status: Temporary paralysis with moving speed gradually recovering within 2.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg01_9=Measuring the sky and sweeping all before it: This causes the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> Also adds to them the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ruler of the Heavens"</font> status: Temporary paralysis with moving speed gradually recovering within 2.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg02_10=Kirin takes a step and locks the spear in reverse hand: This causes the enemy in front to{@0:伤害包};<br> After breaking down the enemy's defense, will add to it <font color="#FFAE00">"Kirin Step"</font> status: Seal skill and prohibits Flying Skills for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg02_9=Kirin takes a step and locks the spear in reverse hand: This causes the enemy in front to{@0:伤害包};<br> After breaking down the enemy's defense, will add to it <font color="#FFAE00">"Kirin Step"</font> status: Seal skill and prohibits Flying Skills for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg03_10=Ground-shattering hit of the spear in preparation for stealth rebound: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包}. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg03_9=Ground-shattering hit of the spear in preparation for stealth rebound: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包}. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg05_10=Coiling spear extracts the soul and the Golden Dragon swings its tail: This cause the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> The spear strikes with Dragon's form and Tiger's Awe: The first strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> enemies who do not defend themselves, and the second strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who do not defend themselves.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg05_9=Coiling spear extracts the soul and the Golden Dragon swings its tail: This cause the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> The spear strikes with Dragon's form and Tiger's Awe: The first strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> enemies who do not defend themselves, and the second strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who do not defend themselves.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_10=Lifting with the spear and locking the throat with kick: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Capturing the Dragon and taming the Tiger with uplifting spear: This will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target to the position selected by the mouse, and render unconscious all enemies within the range for 3 seconds, as way as cause hurt. <br>(This strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; the maximum range of throw is 20m)<br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_9=Lifting with the spear and locking the throat with kick: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Capturing the Dragon and taming the Tiger with uplifting spear: This will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target to the position selected by the mouse, and render unconscious all enemies within the range for 3 seconds, as way as cause hurt. <br>(This strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; the maximum range of throw is 20m)<br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_hide_10=Lock and throw to designated position after striking
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_hide_9=Lock and throw to designated position after striking
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>When using this skill, you acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Driving the Wind</font> state: lasts 15 seconds, when you use <font color="#f9fc00">Whirlwind Kick </font>, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state. <br>You also acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Rely on Cloud</font: lasts 15 seconds, increase damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Storm Clouds </font>, max 10 stacks.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>When using this skill, you acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Windriding</font> state: lasts 15 seconds, when you use <font color="#f9fc00">【Wind Blowing Leaves】</font>, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; <br>You also acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Leaning Cloud</font>: lasts 15 seconds, increase damage of <font color="#f9fc00">【Cloud With Wind】</font>, max 10 stacks.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_sky_10=Prepare to attach NPC buff, upon hitting target, attach buff1 Whirlwind, max 10 stacks, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_sky_9=Prepare to attach NPC buff, upon hitting target, attach buff1 Whirlwind, max 10 stacks, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>If you break target's parry, apply <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> effect.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>If you break target's parry, apply <font color="#f9fc00">Blow-away</font> effect.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_sky_10=When target's defense is broken, if target is in the air, he falls to the ground. If target is on the ground, he suffers {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_sky_9=Upon successful Break Defense, if target is in the air, knock it to the ground; if target is on the ground, knock it down, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_10=At the time of a successful parry: <br>Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font>: increases damage done by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>, lasts 17 seconds <br>While <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font> is active, increases the speed of <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>, and prolongs the paralysis effect of <font color="#f9fc00">Whirlwind Kick</font> by 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_9=At the time of a successful parry: <br>grants <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font>: increases damage done by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>, lasts 16 seconds <br>While <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font> is active, increases the speed of <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>, and prolongs the paralysis effect of <font color="#f9fc00">Whirlwind Kick</font> by 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_sky_10=Parry attaches buff2 named Power Kick, you receive Yellow Armor effect during your skill preparation until the skill hits target
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_sky_9=Parry attaches buff2 named Power Kick, you receive Yellow Armor effect during your skill preparation until the skill hits target
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>Generate <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>: Enemies affected will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 1 second, taking damage. Parry is ignored during paralysis. If you are have the "Dominate" buff, effect lasts 5 seconds.<br>Paralysis gradually decreases.<br>If you have Driving the Wind effect, you launch the skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Generate <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>: Enemies affected will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 1 second, taking damage. (Attach Paralyze effect ignoring Parry, if you have Power Ascension, effect lasts 5 seconds)<br>(Paralyze effect decreases progressively)<br>(If you have Windriding effect, you launch the skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_sky_10=When target is marked, strike him contiuously. Target will be affected by a third buff, Sweeping Leaves, and will be paralyzed for 3 seconds, sufffering {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_sky_9=If you have NPC mark, strike target continuously, affected target will be attached with buff3 Sweeping Leaves and will be paralyzed for 3 seconds, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked-down</font> by the last hit. <br>Remove Paralyze after knocking target down, knock-down does not ignore parry)<br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying skill)<br> This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked-down</font> by the last hit. <br>(Remove Paralyze after knocking target down, knock-down does not ignore Parry)<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_sky_10=2 hit Charge, if combo achieves 6, ignore parry and blow away ground unit or knock down airborne unit, refer to roundhouse kick, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_sky_9=2 hit Charge, if combo achieves 6, ignore Parry and blow away ground unit or knock down airborne unit, refer to roundhouse kick, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked-down</font> by the last hit. <br>Remove Paralyze after knocking target down, knock-down does not ignore parry)<br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying skill)<br> (This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach, can charge up to 20 meters)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked-down</font> by the last hit. <br>(Remove Paralyze after knocking target down, knock-down does not ignore Parry)<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill, max charge distance is 20 meters)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_sky_10=1 hit, leap and charge, if you are airborne, kick downwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_sky_9=1 hit, leap and charge, if you are airborne, kick downwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Based on the stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Rely on Cloud</font>, deal extra damage.<br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Listening to Wind</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target for 2 second after 5 seconds. (parry does not trigger Stun effect)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Based on the stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Leaning Cloud</font>, deal extra damage;<br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Listening to Wind</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target for 2 second after 5 seconds. (Parry does not trigger Stun effect)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_sky_10=Deal extra damage based on Whirlwind, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_sky_9=Deal extra damage based on Whirlwind, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xld01_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it adds to the target an <font color="#FFAE00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status: Continuous bleeding for 8 seconds. The higher the level of <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>, the greater the damage. <br> This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach.<br>Increasing skill level can increase the damage done by Understated Beauty.
desc_CS_jh_xld01_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it adds to the target an <font color="#FFAE00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status: Continuous bleeding for 8 seconds. The higher the level of <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>, the greater the damage. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_xld03_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the enemy is in an <font color="#f9fc00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>. <br>After the enemy is thrown, it will enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Mythical Void"</font> status, and within 3 seconds it will cannot be thrown with this attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld03_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the enemy is in an <font color="#f9fc00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>. <br>After the enemy is thrown, it will enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Mythical Void"</font> status, and within 3 seconds it will cannot be thrown with this attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld04_10=Remember this night. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking, <font color="#f9fc00">the player</font> falls into <font color="#FF3030">Asura</font>: Press the key repeatedly. If successful the attack will be executed in rapid succession, otherwise the attack will be interrupted. <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Sigh of Passion"</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xld04_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking, <font color="#f9fc00">the player</font> falls into <font color="#FF3030">Asura</font>: Press the key repeatedly. If successful the attack will be executed in rapid succession, otherwise the attack will be interrupted. <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Sigh of Passion"</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xld05_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When successfully breaking defense: 30 points of the enemy's Flying skill points will be eliminated, while also adding to it <font color="#FFAE00">"Rain on Pear Blossom"</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Limbo</font> the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> continuously. The status will continue for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xld05_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When successfully breaking defense: 28 points of the enemy's Flying skill points will be eliminated, while also adding to it <font color="#FFAE00">"Rain on Pear Blossom"</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Limbo</font> the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> continuously. The status will continue for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xld06_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Each attack will add to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Tears of Blood"</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.<br>While skill is being used, you cannot move and you will be affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_CS_jh_xld06_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Each attack will add to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Tears of Blood"</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_xld08_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who are in <font color="#FFAE00">"Rain on Peach Blossom"</font> status. <br>This attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. Flying skill may be used when executing the attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld08_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who are in <font color="#FFAE00">"Rain on Peach Blossom"</font> status. <br>This attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. Flying Skill may be used when executing the attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld09_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking the <font color="#f9fc00">enemy</font> will be knocked into <font color="#FF3030">Asura (enemy)</font>: Rapid-fire pressing of the button. If successful the enemy will be released from the attack, otherwise Target will continue to receive blows. <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Momentous Night"</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xld09_9=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking the <font color="#f9fc00">enemy</font> will be knocked into <font color="#FF3030">Asura (enemy)</font>: Rapid-fire pressing of the button. If successful the enemy will be released from the attack, otherwise Target will continue to receive blows.  <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Momentous Night"</font>.
desc_CS_jh_yydf01_10=A beautifully wielded knife, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>【<font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: Skill becomes a dashing dealing more damage】
desc_CS_jh_yydf01_9=A beautifully wielded knife, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>【<font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: Skill becomes a dashing dealing more damage】
desc_CS_jh_yydf01_hide_10=A beautifully wielded knife, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_yydf01_hide_9=A beautifully wielded knife, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_yydf02_10=Continuous attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)<br>【<font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: damage dealt by skill is increased】
desc_CS_jh_yydf02_9=Continuous attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)<br>【<font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: damage dealt by skill is increased】
desc_CS_jh_yydf02_hide_10=Continuous attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_yydf02_hide_9=Continuous attack deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_yydf03_10=Fast knives stun enemies within 8m by 3 seconds (stunning effect decrease progressively), dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>【<font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: Pull max 5 enemies within 20m to you and stun them for 3 seconds, stunning effect decreases progressively】
desc_CS_jh_yydf03_9=Fast knives stun enemies within 8m by 3 seconds (stunning effect decrease progressively), dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>【<font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: Pull max 5 enemies within 20m to you and stun them for 3 seconds, stunning effect decreases progressively】
desc_CS_jh_yydf03_hide_10=Fast knives affect enemies, pull max 5 enemies within 20m to you and stun them for 3 seconds (stunning effect decrease progressively), dealing {@0:伤害包} damage
desc_CS_jh_yydf03_hide_9=Fast knives affect enemies, pull max 5 enemies within 20m to you and stun them for 3 seconds (stunning effect decrease progressively), dealing {@0:伤害包} damage
desc_CS_jh_yydf04_10=Twirl with the knife rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>(You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state when using this Skill, and you may use the Flying Skill.) <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Skill Damage increases, You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state when using this Skill"
desc_CS_jh_yydf04_9=Twirl with the knife rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>(You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state when using this Skill, and you may use the Flying Skill.) <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Skill Damage increases, You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state when using this Skill"
desc_CS_jh_yydf04_hide_10=Twirl with the knife rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>(You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state when using this Skill)
desc_CS_jh_yydf04_hide_9=Twirl with the knife rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>(You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state when using this Skill)
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_10=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds.  <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move.  Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage) <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Skill Damage increases, your counterattack has a range of 25 meters"
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_1_10=Counterattack
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_1_9=Counterattack
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_9=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds.  <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move.  Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage) <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Skill Damage increases, your counterattack has a range of 25 meters"
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_hide_10=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 25 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_hide_1_10=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 25 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_hide_1_9=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 25 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_yydf06_hide_9=Stopping and Encountering Each Other, Flying as a Pair, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“Shift from Defense to Attack” </font>state: When parrying an enemy's Attack, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack. This state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack Skill, has a range of 25 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. Increases effectiveness of Skill, enhances counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_yydf07_10=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you; when defeating an enemy Parry: <br>Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.  <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Damage is increased, and the range of your Skill increases to 20 meters in front."
desc_CS_jh_yydf07_9=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you; when defeating an enemy Parry: <br>Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.  <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Damage is increased, and the range of your Skill increases to 20 meters in front."
desc_CS_jh_yydf07_hide_10=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to any enemies within 20 meters in front of you; <br>When defeating an enemy Parry: Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_yydf07_hide_9=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to any enemies within 20 meters in front of you; <br>When defeating an enemy Parry: Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_zq01_10=Turn and Lift a Jug, Force of a Thousand Tons, causes Enemies in front to Stumble and deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">“Dong Bin Raises a Jug”</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these Skills, and the state will continue for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this Skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status.  <br>(The grade of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>state is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike)
desc_CS_jh_zq01_9=Turn and Lift a Jug, Force of a Thousand Tons, causes Enemies in front to Stumble and deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">“Dong Bin Raises a Jug”</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these Skills, and the state will continue for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this Skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status.  <br>(The grade of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>state is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike)
desc_CS_jh_zq02_10=Turn Elbow Bend Knee, Drunken Crouch Intoxicated Sleep, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“False Sleep” </font>state: When attacked by enemies, you can counterattack against nearby enemies, and knock them down. The state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(The counterattack has a range of 5 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state during your counterattack. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_zq02_9=Turn Elbow Bend Knee, Drunken Crouch Intoxicated Sleep, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“False Sleep” </font>state: When attacked by enemies, you can counterattack against nearby enemies, and knock them down. The state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(The counterattack has a range of 5 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state during your counterattack. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_zq02_hide_10=You have collapsed, continuing to heal your bruises; you will gain Yellow Armor and counterattack your target when you are attacked within 5 meters, and knock your opponent to the ground
desc_CS_jh_zq02_hide_9=You have collapsed, continuing to heal your bruises; you will gain Yellow Armor and counterattack your target when you are attacked within 5 meters, and knock your opponent to the ground
desc_CS_jh_zq03_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Zhong Li Carries the Jug </font> to it: reduces its speed by 37%, make it fall when it tries to use Flying skills, lasts 5 seconds. When target falls, the effect is removed. <br>Fallen enemies could be thrown by this skill. <br>When the skill is being activated, if <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is not active on your character, automatically applies a stack of it to your character. <br>The power of the effect <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is related to the level of the parry skill.
desc_CS_jh_zq03_9=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Zhong Li Carries the Jug </font> to it: reduces its speed by 34%, make it fall when it tries to use Flying skills, lasts 5 seconds. When target falls, the effect is removed. <br>Fallen enemies could be thrown by this skill. <br>When the skill is being activated, if <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is not active on your character, automatically applies a stack of it to your character. <br>The power of the effect <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is related to the level of the parry skill.
desc_CS_jh_zq04_10=Drunkenly Throwing the Cup, Give a Roundhouse Kick while on Your Back, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>If your counterattack is successful, you can knock your target back, and put him in an <font color="#FFAE00">“Elder Guo Throws the Cup” </font>state: He will have difficulty hitting the target next attack; the state will last 5 seconds. (If you are on the first level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike," </font>the state will last an additional 1 second)
desc_CS_jh_zq04_9=Drunkenly Throwing the Cup, Give a Roundhouse Kick while on Your Back, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>If your counterattack is successful, you can knock your target back, and put him in an <font color="#FFAE00">“Elder Guo Throws the Cup” </font>state: He will have difficulty hitting the target next attack; the state will last 5 seconds. (If you are on the first level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike," </font>the state will last an additional 1 second)
desc_CS_jh_zq05_10=When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status: Effectiveness will increase when you use <font color="#f9fc00">"Xiangzi Plays the Flute," "Elder Guo Throws the Cup," or "Imperial Uncle's Neck Lock"</font>. This status can be accumulated up to 3 times, and will continue for 17 seconds. If you are in <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status and cannot attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>, parrying will ensure that your energy is restored as long as you are not fallen to the ground or resting.
desc_CS_jh_zq05_9=When your parry is successful, you will obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status: Effectiveness will increase when you use <font color="#f9fc00">"Xiangzi Plays the Flute," "Elder Guo Throws the Cup," or "Imperial Uncle's Neck Lock"</font>. This status can be accumulated up to 3 times, and will continue for 17 seconds. If you are in <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status and cannot attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>, parrying will ensure that your energy is restored as long as you are not fallen to the ground or resting.
desc_CS_jh_zq06_10=Hit Chest Drag Feet Bout of Madness, Swinging Step Drunken Leisure, brawling with your target deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If you are at 3rd level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike,” </font>the last blow of this Skill will knock down your target (no parry). <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_zq06_9=Hit Chest Drag Feet Bout of Madness, Swinging Step Drunken Leisure, brawling with your target deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If you are at 3rd level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike,” </font>the last blow of this Skill will knock down your target (no parry). <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_zq07_10=Staggered Horn Cup Tally, Hold Wrist Throat Lock deals {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>The last strike of this Skill has a 10% chance of knocking down your target (has not parried). <br>Each level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike” </font>increases chance of knock down by 10%. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_zq07_9=Staggered Horn Cup Tally, Hold Wrist Throat Lock deals {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>The last strike of this Skill has a 10% chance of knocking down your target (has not parried). <br>Each level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike” </font>increases chance of knock down by 10%. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_zq08_10=Attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status: Your movements will be slowed, but your evasion will improve. This effect lasts for 17 seconds. <br>The greater your alcohol tolerance, the more potent this effect will be. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is low, your speed will be decreased by 20%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 5%. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is moderate, your speed will be decreased by 15%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 10%. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is high, your speed will be decreased by 10%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 15%. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is massive, your speed will be decreased by 5%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 20%. <br>This effect will automatically be cleared after evading your opponent's attack, and you will receive a level 3 <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike." </font> <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike. You cannot receive 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>unless you parry.
desc_CS_jh_zq08_9=Attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status: Your movements will be slowed, but your evasion will improve. This effect lasts for 16 seconds. <br>The greater your alcohol tolerance, the more potent this effect will be. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is low, your speed will be decreased by 20%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 5%. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is moderate, your speed will be decreased by 15%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 10%. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is high, your speed will be decreased by 10%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 15%. <br>If your alcohol tolerance is massive, your speed will be decreased by 5%, and your chance of evasion will increase by 20%. <br>This effect will automatically be cleared after evading your opponent's attack, and you will receive a level 3 <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike." </font> <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike. You cannot receive 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>unless you parry.
desc_CS_jl_shuangci02_10=Release dark poison to increase power of dagger skills, and at the same time the poison will reduce you 200 Max HP, can stack 10 times at most.<br>Deal 260 external damage to nearby enemies affected by poison gas. This skill cannot be used when your HP is too low.
