desc_CS_jl_zfd06_10=A whistling storm of knifes and a rain of blood. Sweep up enemy targets in an area of effect to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The enemy will be jolted into the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state by your inexorable Energy and will be unable to use movements of any sort.
