desc_CS_jy_dqd06_10=Violent Rage, dance of metempsychosis, force from the netherworld erodes the target and causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Teeter the target's body: there is a great possibility of falling when starting to attack or using flying skill. If the target is in the air, it will fall directly.
