desc_CS_jy_dqd07_10=A charging movement. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other movements as well<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
