desc_CS_jy_shd01_10=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one handsome flourish. The enemy gets hit by the chi force and takes {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
