desc_CS_jy_xsd06_10=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance. Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font> (Can stack 10 times at most): Attacks from this skill set gain 50% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Bloodthirsty Will.
