desc_CS_jz_yxjf03_10=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
