desc_CS_jz_yxjf07_10=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
