desc_CS_jz_yxjf07_8=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
desc_CS_jz_yxjf07_9=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a movement direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
desc_CS_sj_syxz01_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Golden Needle"</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 26 times. Lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz01_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Golden Needle"</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 26 times. Lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz02_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Successful break of parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Soul Breaker"</font> to target, causing target to become dazed. The target's next attack has a low chance of hitting the player. Lasts 12 seconds. <br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz02_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Successful break of parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Soul Breaker"</font> to target, causing target to become dazed. The target's next attack has a low chance of hitting the player. Lasts 13 seconds. <br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz03_10=Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">"Web"</font> status: reduces amount of energy needed to use skills in the same set. Can be stacked 4 times. Lasts 27 seconds. <br>One stacked effect of<font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> will be cleared when this attack is executed.
desc_CS_sj_syxz03_11=Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">"Web"</font> status: reduces amount of energy needed to use skills in the same set. Can be stacked 4 times. Lasts 28 seconds. <br>One stacked effect of<font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> will be cleared when this attack is executed.
desc_CS_sj_syxz04_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the target loses HP by more than 50%, it will trigger secondary damage. <br>Damage from this attack is determined by the time it takes to charge the skill, which cannot exceed 3 seconds. If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also knock back the target.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz04_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the target loses HP by more than 50%, it will trigger secondary damage. <br>Damage from this attack is determined by the time it takes to charge the skill, which cannot exceed 3 seconds. If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also knock back the target.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz05_10=Target receives <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> or <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an enemy, the attack will give it <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an ally, the attack will grant him/her <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>: Receive additional damage for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>: Absorbs 70% of damage received. Status lasts 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sj_syxz05_11=Target receives <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> or <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an enemy, the attack will give it <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Needle"</font> status. <br>If the target is an ally, the attack will grant him/her <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle"</font> status. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>: Receive additional damage for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>: Absorbs 67% of damage received. Status lasts 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sj_syxz06_10=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Will add to the target (self or an ally)<font color="#FFAE00">"Clearing Meridians"</font> status: HP will be restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>Attack power and HP recovery are increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz06_11=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Will add to the target (self or an ally)<font color="#FFAE00">"Clearing Meridians"</font> status: HP will be restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>Attack power and HP recovery are increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_10=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 60% of target's maximum HP and energy. The healer gives up 40% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_11=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Heal a fallen ally by restoring 65% of target's maximum HP and energy. The healer gives up 35% of his/her current HP. <br>The charging time for the skill is 3 seconds. This skill can only be used with an ally lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz08_10=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Allies within 15m receive <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> status: great amounts of HP and Energy are restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds, with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> in effect while charging.<br>Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz08_11=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Allies within 15m receive <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> status: great amounts of HP and Energy are restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds, with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> in effect while charging.<br>Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
