desc_CS_sl_wtgf02_10=A charging attack in which chi surges through your staff as it sweeps enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage, slowing their movement speed; <br>If you are currently on the <font color="#FFAE00">Put on Shoes</font> state, your movement will slow the enemy's movement even more effectively;  If the target has four stacks of movement speed reduction, he will be unable to use flying skills for a short period.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
