desc_CS_th_bhcs02_10=Peach blossoms fly and willows sway in the wind; adds <font color="#9932CD">Zhi</font> melody. Music of the flute causes in surrounding enemies {@0:伤害包} and causes target to become Paralyzed for 3 seconds.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs02_9=Peach blossoms fly and willows sway in the wind; adds <font color="#9932CD">Zhi</font> melody. Music of the flute causes in surrounding enemies {@0:伤害包} and causes target to become Paralyzed for 3 seconds.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs04_10=The white waves reach the skies and the song subdues the sun and moon. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Shang</font> melody. Stabs the target and then the heart, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target already has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's defense has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds.  <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs04_9=The white waves reach the skies and the song subdues the sun and moon. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Shang</font> melody. Stabs the target and then the heart, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target already has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's defense has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds.  <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs06_10=The tide rises, surprising the heavens. The tides fall and demons cry. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Jue</font> melody. Music of the flute is awe inspiring and causes enemies within 8-meter radius to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs06_9=The tide rises, surprising the heavens. The tides fall and demons cry. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Jue</font> melody. Music of the flute is awe inspiring and causes enemies within 8-meter radius to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs07_10=Not yet proficient with the flute. The music of the tides is magnificent. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font> melody. Playing notes Impacts the target, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every blow adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>(Internal Injury is only effective on other players; damage done is based on player's own attributes) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs07_9=Not yet proficient with the flute. The music of the tides is magnificent. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font> melody. Playing notes Impacts the target, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every blow adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>(Internal Injury is only effective on other players; damage done is based on player's own attributes) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_tm_jsc01_10=Charge, deal {@0:伤害包} damage, if you have <font color="#FFAE00">Following Madness</font>, deal extra Yin Damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
