desc_CS_xjz_wmcf01_11=Every physical thing is considered transient: This causes the enemy ahead to {@0:伤害包};<br> It also adds to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Ink"</font> status: It will be attacked by the strike "Black Ink Ruler" and will become temporarily fainted. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf02_11=Taking advantage and pressing ahead closely: Rapid whipping of the target to cause it {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_11=Hidden heaven and earth lying in wait for right opportunity This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while in defense status, it is possible to render such attack ineffective. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Qiankun Energy Field</font>: Continuous damage, enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field will exist for 8 seconds. <br>(Counterattack prevention can be maintained for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint moves)<br>(Increase in the strike's level can increase counterattack injury)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_hide_11=At the time <font color="#f9fc00">Qiankun Energy Field</font> will be created: Continuous damage and prohibits Flying Skill; enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> energy field and <font color="#FF3030">within it range</font> will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field will exist for 8 seconds. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf04_11=The wind is down and the clouds are dark; a ruler ends all: Striking the enemy in front from below causes it {@0:伤害包};<br> When breaking down the enemy's defense: Absorbs its life to restore the player's own energy and blood, while also adding to the player <font color="#FFAE00">"Ultimate Emptiness"</font> status: Slowed and Prohibit Flying Skill, will be maintained for 5 seconds. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf05_11=The ethereal clouds leave no trace: This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包};<br> At the same time there will be created <font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Energy Field</font>: Continuous damage, enemies who blindly attempt to <font color="#FF3030">escape</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds; the energy field can be maintained for 8 seconds. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf06_11=There are no boundaries to worry, and what is close may be far away: Pull target in front and knock it away to cause {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Randomly pull all targets within a range of 20m)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf07_11=Faint autumn hill in the reflection of evening mist; black ink ruler with a range of energy force: This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>Powerful energy force: If the enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Ink"</font> status each strike will cause it to be temporarily fainted. <br>(The strike is launched in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status, it is possible to move freely when launching the strike)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_yh_hsqs01_10=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Skill has 30% of adding <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> to target. Target's vision is blurred, and his next attack has high chance of being evaded.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs02_10=Flower petals fall, one is full of melancholy and confusion. Entangling Chi force causes in target: {@0:伤害包} <br>Attacks ignore external and internal defense when target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Dance"</font> status.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs03_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Upon successful break of defense, attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> (target's next attack is very likely to miss) and <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font> (will not be able to use parry for a long time. When hit by Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess, energy will be drained, amount depends on level of skill.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs04_10=Has a 35% chance to knock yourself back and apply <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> to the attacker when you parried successfully against him. This effect cannot be triggered again in less than 15 seconds.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs06_10=The flower wilts as soon as it blossoms. The beautiful flowers all vie for supremacy. A tactful blow causes in target: {@0:伤害包} Damage may ripple out to targets within a 5-meter radius and <br>add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Flowers"</font> to enemies, causing Paralysis for 3 seconds.  <br>If enemy already has <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Thorn"</font> status, enemy becomes Stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs07_10=The flower god, full of grace and beauty, descends to earth; the slow Chi force causes in target {@0:伤害包}: <br>ignores target's internal and external defense when attacking if target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Dance"</font> status.
