desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_1=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Dagger Cloaked in Red</font>: Absorb minor damage, lasts 10 seconds; <br>When the effect ends, you receive <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">【Dagger Cloaked in Yellow】</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs some amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_3=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs partial amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_4=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs large amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_5=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs great amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_6=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs massive amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_7=Shadow Fragrance, Protect the Flowers, you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Dagger Cloaked in Red” </font>state: you can absorb massive Damage for 10 seconds; <br>When the state is broken, you can use the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow" </font>to attain <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>status.
desc_Npc_jh_ncd06_8=Shadow Fragrance, Protect the Flowers, you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Dagger Cloaked in Red” </font>state: you can absorb massive Damage for 10 seconds; <br>When the state is broken, you can use the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow" </font>to attain <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>status.
