desc_Npc_jh_ncd07_1=If you reuse the last skills used from this set, the cooldown for this skill will be reset.<br>When you reuse <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font>, you can ignore target's parry while dealing damage.<br>When you reuse <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> , you can deal damage to nearby enemies when "Dagger Cloaked in Red" has been interrupted.
