desc_CS_jh_bxjf01_1=Stun target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Upon hitting target, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: Increase charging speed and set charging distance, lasts 15 seconds, maximum 10 stacks. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> level is related to power of <font color="#f9fc00">Cosmic Bloom</font>)<br>Skill damage increases with speed)<br>This set can only be used by castrated characters.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf01_10=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. Player adds 1 stacked effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> to self with every successful hit to target
desc_CS_jh_bxjf01_11=Shooting stars fly and fall from one blow; {@0:伤害包}player adds 1 level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> to self with every successful hit to target
