desc_CS_jh_bxjf01_2=Shooting stars fly and fall from one blow, striking the target while lying down; causes Stunned and {@0:伤害包}<br>adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> (increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set, lasts for 15 seconds, can be layered 10 times) to self.  <br>(Effects of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> levels and <font color="#f9fc00">"The Flower Opens and Buddha Appears"</font> levels)<br> (Damage increases with increase in player movement speed)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
