desc_CS_jh_bxjf06_1=Evil gives way as if the ground sinks and the sky collapses. Deal {@0:伤害包} yin damage to target. <br>Attach it with <font color="#FFAE00">Grand Sinister</font>: Moves have a chance to stun and damage target (interrupt skills), lasts 10 seconds. <br>Use a Flying Skill with this attack to approach the target quickly.Damage increases with the move speed being improved. <br>This set can only be used by castrated characters.
