desc_CS_jh_bxjf08_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front. <br>Consume 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: enemy is pinned for 2 seconds, remove any of your movement restrictions. <br>No bonus effect if you do not have enough <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>)<br>Skill damage increases with speed)<br>This set can only be used by castrated characters.
