desc_CS_jh_cljf06_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Lower target's HP regeneration by 54.
desc_CS_jh_cljf06_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Untapped Emotion</font>: Lower target's HP regeneration by 48.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf01_11=Charging skill, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and lower target's evasion. <br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying skill)
desc_CS_jh_cqgf01_12=Charge attack. Uses brute strength to inflict in opponent{@0:伤害包}, and targets the groin to cause opponent to stagger and decrease evasion.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_jwdf06_3=Kick target down and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Turn your <font color="#FFAE00">Yanyang Blade Chi</font> into <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> Chi and inject into target. <br>If number of <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> Chi in target is in multiples of 3 or reaches maximum, <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> Chi will stack and also weaken target: Target is weakened and slowed.
desc_CS_jh_myjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, create <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> near self. <br>Shadowless Ghost: <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> leaps and slashes targets with chosen target's range (attacks stagger target for 1 second), maximum 5 slashes. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill power)
desc_CS_jh_myjf08_2=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Summon <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around target.<font color="#f9fc00"> Ghost Shadow </font> will jump and attack target and around enemies with 1-second Rigidity inflicted per attack, up to 4 attacks.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill proficiency.<br> Use of <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> consumes <font color="#f9fc00">Delicate Hair-Shaking Puppet</font>.
desc_CS_jh_myjf08_3=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Summon <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around target.<font color="#f9fc00"> Ghost Shadow </font> will jump and attack target and around enemies with 1-second Rigidity inflicted per attack, up to 4 attacks.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> damage increases with greater skill proficiency.<br> Use of <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> consumes <font color="#f9fc00">Delicate Hair-Shaking Puppet</font>.
