desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_1=Ride the wind and wield the sword, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defense</font>: If parry endurance is over 75%, your attack ignores 5% of target's external damage reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack for attack</font>: If parry endurance is below 305, recover 20 rage after the skill is launched completely. <br>If parry endurance is above 75%, you will not be thrown, knocked down or back)
desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_2=Ride the wind and wield the sword, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defense</font>: If parry endurance is over 73%, your attack ignores 6% of target's external damage reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack for attack</font>: If parry endurance is below 305, recover 20 rage after the skill is launched completely. <br>If parry endurance is above 73%, you will not be thrown, knocked down or back)
