desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_8=Ride the wind and wield the sword, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defense</font>: If parry endurance is over 65%, your attack ignores 15% of target's external damage reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack for attack</font>: If parry endurance is below 305, recover 20 rage after the skill is launched completely. <br>If parry endurance is above 65%, you will not be thrown, knocked down or back)
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_10=You may switch freely between 2 stances: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font>: Upon successful parry, Give yourself  <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font>: skill <font color="#FFAE00">False Retreat</font> has 3-meter extra range, skill <font color="#FFAE00">Arrows of Lies</font> has 8-meter extra range, other skills in skill set have 2-meter extra range. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font>: Upon successful parry, Give yourself  <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font>: increase skill damage by 27 per hit, extra 54 for <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Wind Slaughters God</font>, increase the charging distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">Feigned Defeat and Feigned Surrender </font>.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_9=You may switch freely between 2 stances: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font>: Upon successful parry, Give yourself  <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font>: skill <font color="#FFAE00">False Retreat</font> has 3-meter extra range, skill <font color="#FFAE00">Arrows of Lies</font> has 8-meter extra range, other skills in skill set have 2-meter extra range. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font>: Upon successful parry, Give yourself  <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font>: increase skill damage by 24 per hit, extra 48 for <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Wind Slaughters God</font>, increase the charging distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">Feigned Defeat and Feigned Surrender </font>.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_10=Give yourself  <font color="#FFAE00">Devil's Mirror</font>: Next time you take hit, reflect 99% damage and attacker suffer from Strike Acupoint for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_9=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 99% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. If opponent has at least 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Force</font>, this move will definitely make target <font color="#FFAE00">faint</font>. <br>This is the iconic skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> from Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. If opponent has at least 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Force</font>, this move will definitely make target <font color="#FFAE00">faint</font>. <br>This is the iconic skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> from Green Cloud Castle.
