desc_CS_jh_slbwj05_1=Upon successful parry, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Six Forces</font> for self: Increase skill range by 2 meters.
desc_CS_jh_slbwj05_2=Upon successful Parry, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Six Covers</font> for self: Increase AOE move distance by 2 meters, charge distance by 2 meters, lasts 6 seconds).
