desc_CS_jh_tlq03_5=With Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Focused Chi State</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be knocked back or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Enraged</font> state added to you. <br/>The <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrate</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be knocked back or sent flying.
desc_CS_jh_xfz02_1=<font color="#FF3030">Nothingness</font><br>If target is hostile, deal {@0:伤害包} damage and stun it for 3 seconds. remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font>. <br>If target is friendly. remove most of its crowd control effects and attach 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. (Cannot be used on yourself, cannot be used on an ally in battle while you are not)
desc_CS_jh_xfz02_10=<br>if it's an enemy target: Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and stuns the victim for 3 seconds; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast <br>If it's a friendly target, nullifies most controlling effects and Hit Recovery effects, and applies to yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> that lasts 3 seconds. Yellow Super Armor: grants immunity from all hindering effects except stuns (cannot be casted on yourself)
