desc_CS_jh_xfz03_1=<font color="#FF3030">Empty your heart.</font><br>Summon <font color="#FFAE00">Void Mark</font>: Remove immobilization and Flying skill restriction for allies within 40 meters, and increase speed and distance of next Jump Across the Cloud by 15. <br>Increase your HP regeneration for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_11=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front. <br>Every 10 seconds, receive Yellow Armor and randomly acquire Raging Attack or Hasty Strike: <br>Raging Attack: This attack applies thrown effect. <br>Hasty Strike: Remove Chi charging period of Wild Shot Fist 2, 3 and 4, and next time you use a move, skill will not enter Chi charging state. <br>Damage ignores target's external defense reduction)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_10=Charging skill, stun target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage, also reduce its internal attack's critical hit rate, and nearby enemies (maximum 10) suffer from concussion. <br>When using the skill, you cannot be thrown, knocked back or down. <br>Instantly recover when skill is interrupted or dodged, remove Chi charging period. <br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying skill)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_11=Charging Skill, Flipping Fracture Strike, Elegantly Unpretentious: targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_10=Charging skill, stun target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage, also reduce its internal attack's critical hit rate and nearby enemies (maximum 10) suffer from concussion. <br>When using the skill, you cannot be thrown, knocked back or down. <br>Instantly recover when skill is interrupted or dodgedd, remove Chi charging period. <br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying skill.
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_11=Charging Skill, Scratching Base Strike, Wrapped Fist Strike: Targets receive {@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding target. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq06_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and lower target's internal attack's critical hit rate, also shock nearby enemies (maximum 10). <br>Receive Red Super Armor when using the skill. <br>Instantly recover when skill is interrupted or dodged, remove Chi charging period and restore 80% rage lost.
desc_CS_jh_yqq06_11=Wild Nature Explosion, Disordered Wilderness, Confidently Advance with Fists: Squeezed targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down.
desc_CS_sl_lzs06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and attach one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> to it. <br>if target is in the air, he falls to the ground and receives extra damage.
desc_CS_sl_lzs06_10=Soar without casting a shadow and claw at the enemy's heart to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and applying one level of Emptiness to him; <br>If you execute this attack while on the ground and hit an airborne enemy, the target will be grounded and will suffer additional damage.
