desc_CS_yh_hsqs03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Upon successful break of defense, attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> (target's next attack is very likely to miss) and <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font> (will not be able to use parry for a long time. When hit by Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess, energy will be drained, amount depends on level of skill.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs03_2=Flowers frown and dimples smile, dancing and turning around. Circulating Chi force causes in target {@0:伤害包}; <br>successful break defense adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Thorn"</font> (causes Blurred, next attack has high chance of being evaded) and <font color="#FFAE00">"Frowning Flower"</font> (energy will be drained when attacked by moves in "Seven Moves of the Flower God". Amount of energy absorbed is determined by level of skill) to target.
