desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_6=Act like a fierce tiger and strike the target in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The move can knock an unsteady enemy back and deal 2.5 times damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_7=Act like a fierce tiger and strike the target in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The move can knock an unsteady enemy back and deal 2.7 times damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_8=As forceful as a fierce tiger, rushes target in front of player causing{@0:伤害包}; skill can knock back enemies who are Staggered and cause 3 times the normal damage.  Skill can be used immediately when in the air and add "Super Armor" to player, but removes target's Dancing Flowers on the Mountains effect after a successful hit to the target
desc_CS_jh_flxmz03_1=Stun target with your staff for 2 seconds. Then fall onto the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state. The target will receive extra damage. <br>This skill allows you to approach your target very quickly, making it difficult to dodge. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Deals even more damage in rainy days.  </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz03_2=Stun target with your staff for 2 seconds. Then fall onto the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state. The target will receive extra damage. <br>This skill allows you to approach your target very quickly, making it difficult to dodge. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Deals even more damage in rainy days.  </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz03_3=Stun target with your staff for 2 seconds. Then fall onto the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state. The target will receive extra damage. <br>This skill allows you to approach your target very quickly, making it difficult to dodge. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Deals even more damage in rainy days.  </font>
