desc_CS_jh_flxmz03_8=Stun target with your staff for 2 seconds. Then fall onto the ground and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state. The target will receive extra damage. <br>This skill allows you to approach your target very quickly, making it difficult to dodge. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Deals even more damage in rainy days.  </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz05_1=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 6 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz05_2=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 8 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz05_3=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 10 times.  <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning.  </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz05_4=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 12 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz05_5=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 14 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz05_6=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 16 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz06_1=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 3.5 seconds, or until the target is hit.  <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 10 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day.  </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz06_2=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 4 seconds, or until the target is hit. <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 11 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz06_3=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 4.5 seconds, or until the target is hit. <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz06_4=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 5 seconds, or until the target is hit. <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 13 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz06_5=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 5.5 seconds, or until the target is hit. <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 14 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz06_6=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 6 seconds, or until the target is hit. <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 15 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day. </font>
desc_CS_jh_flxmz07_1=Attack quickly, dealing {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br>If enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state. Then the target will be pulled toward you. Each time this happens, it will remove 1 stacked effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font>. <br>You can move while using the skill.<br/><font color="#4169E1">If you execute the final strike and the target is in Anger of Thunder state. The target will be thrown and hurt by thunder and lightning.  </font>
