desc_CS_jh_flxmz08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br><font color="#f9fc00">"Wind and Thunder Stance"</font>: The target is slowed and receives damage. The damage increases as the distance between the target and the user shortens. <br>If target is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font> state, your attack does extra damage and removes the target's buffs. <br><font color="#4169E1">This skill can only score a critical hit in rainy days.
