desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_1=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 5%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 1 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 5% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_2=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 5%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 1 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 5% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_3=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 10%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 1 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 10% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_4=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 10%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 1 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 10% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_5=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 15%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 15% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_6=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 15%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 15% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_7=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 20%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 20% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_8=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 20%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 20% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jl_zfd01_1=Mighty blow, the blade chi will hurt enemy meters away, and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, target will take extra Hardness damage.
