desc_CS_jl_zfd02_1=Charging movement, roll and attack target to deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is taking <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, will take extra Hardness damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjunction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_zfd02_2=Charging movement, roll and attack target to deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is taking <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, will take extra Hardness damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjunction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_zfd02_3=Charging movement, roll and attack target to deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is taking <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, will take extra Hardness damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjunction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
