desc_CS_jl_zfd02_5=Charging movement, roll and attack target to deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is taking <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, will take extra Hardness damage.<br>(This skill can be used in conjunction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jl_zfd02_6=Charging skill, deal {@0:伤害包} to target; if target is under <font color="#FFAE00">Shock</font>, it takes additional Yang Damage<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jl_zfd02_7=Charging skill, deal {@0:伤害包} to target; if target is under <font color="#FFAE00">Shock</font>, it takes additional Yang Damage<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
