desc_CS_jl_zfd07_6=Your blade's Energy is like the wind, and its smashing strike sends enemies flying to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. When the target is under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state, he will sustain additional soft damage.<br/>Your chi is like searing lightning through the air, cutting through those within an area of effect and banning enemies under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state from using movements for a short period and causing them to endure additional hard damage.
desc_CS_jl_zfd07_7=Your blade's Energy is like the wind, and its smashing strike sends enemies flying to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. When the target is under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state, he will sustain additional soft damage.<br/>Your chi is like searing lightning through the air, cutting through those within an area of effect and banning enemies under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state from using movements for a short period and causing them to endure additional hard damage.
desc_CS_jl_zfd07_8=Your blade's Energy is like the wind, and its smashing strike sends enemies flying to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. When the target is under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state, he will sustain additional soft damage.<br/>Your chi is like searing lightning through the air, cutting through those within an area of effect and banning enemies under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state from using movements for a short period and causing them to endure additional hard damage.
desc_CS_jl_zfd07_9=Your blade's Energy is like the wind, and its smashing strike sends enemies flying to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. When the target is under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state, he will sustain additional soft damage.<br/>Your chi is like searing lightning through the air, cutting through those within an area of effect and banning enemies under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state from using movements for a short period and causing them to endure additional hard damage.
desc_jxxl_jh_cqgf02_1=Knock down your enemy to deal massive damage.
desc_karma_jh_cqgf02_1=Execute a feint attack which appears to go high, when it actually goes low. Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. When it breaks your target's parry, it will knock them down and inflict extra damage.
desc_riding_dismount_1=Passenger Dismounts
desc_riding_dismount_passenger_1=Passenger dismounts.
desc_zf_em_01_01_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array. Recover all allies' HP by 500 in area of effect.
desc_zf_em_01_02_1=Adds Rainbow In The Sky to self and absorbs 15% of incoming damage. Lasts 30 seconds.
desc_zf_gb_01_02_1=The target acquires "Dirty Face" status, which the target's External Attack Accuracy by 5% and its inner skill hit rating by 4% for 20 seconds.<br>Effect duration increased to 25 seconds for Wanderer's Valley and Jianghu Arrays. Effect duration decreased to 15 seconds for Scholars and Guild Arrays.
desc_zf_jl_01_01_1=Increases your external attack by 30%. However, you will suffer 10% extra damage when hit. Lasts 10 seconds.
desc_zf_jl_01_02_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array.  Lowers the enemy's attack power by 50% for 15 seconds.<br>With Shaolin and Jianghu arrays the effect lasts 20 seconds, and with Beggar's Sect and guild arrays the effect lasts 10 seconds.
desc_zf_jy_01_01_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array. Makes an ally gain Invincible state, improves the external attack by 20%. Lasts 15 seconds.
desc_zf_jy_01_02_1=Reduce enemy defenses by 20% for 15 seconds.<br>With Wudang and Jianghu arrays knock off an additional 100 defense points;  with Shaolin and guild arrays the amount of defense you will be able to reduce will be 100 points less.
desc_zf_jz_01_01_1=A Skill that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy and reduces movement speed by 20% for 7 seconds.<br>Damage increased by 50% for Beggar's Sect and Jianghu Arrays. Damage decreased by 50% in Emei and Guild Arrays.
desc_zf_jz_01_02_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array. It increases speed of members in array area by 20%. Lasts 10 seconds.
desc_zf_sl_01_01_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array. Makes allies in array area gain The Teachings of Arhat effect, increases external attack by 10%. Lasts 30 seconds.
desc_zf_tm_01_01_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array.  Poisons the target within area of effect and increases taken damage by 10% 30 seconds.
desc_zf_tm_01_02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} external attack damage to the enemy, poisons and reduces target's speed by 30%. Lasts 7 seconds.
desc_zf_wd_01_01_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array. Makes all team members  in array area gain Bright Sun and Moon effect, increases their attack power by 5%. Lasts 40 seconds.
desc_zf_wd_01_02_1=Add "Willow Branches in the Breeze" on self, recover Energy equal to the  amount of 50% damage received when hit. Lasts 20 seconds.
riding_kick_passenger=Kick off the mount
