desc_CS_by_gxcj04_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>This defensive attack is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by feints.
