desc_CS_by_xlxf01_1=Axe power deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When having <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: the range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.
