desc_CS_by_xyjj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Combo will trigger special effects: after <br><font color="#f9fc00">Flick</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Flèche </font>, use this attack quickly, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status; <br>after <font color="#f9fc00">Pull</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Riposte (with a successful counter)</font>, use this attack quickly, the damage will increase by 30%; <br>after <font color="#f9fc00">Wring</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Press</font>, use this attack quickly, the critical hit rate will increase by 30%.
desc_CS_by_xyjj07_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Combo will trigger special effects: after <br><font color="#f9fc00">Toss</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Penetrate</font>, use this move quickly, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status; <br>after <font color="#f9fc00">Pull</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Opposite (Counterattack successfully)</font>, use this move quickly, the damage will increase by 30%; <br>after <font color="#f9fc00">Wring</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Press</font>, use this move quickly, the critical hit rate will increase by 30%.
