desc_CS_dh_txxhjp01_1=Strikes the enemy and deals {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Taixuan</font> status to them for 30 seconds. It can be stacked 3 times.
