desc_CS_jh_mmqfj05_1=Ouch! Who beat me? Treads nearby enemies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When attacking enemies lying on the ground, you can <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> continuously and inflict <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font> to them: disfigure them, and increase damage by 5% for 30 seconds. <br>You cannot attack and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using attacks.
