desc_CS_jh_wsgf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When it does heavy damage to enemies (players only): clear the cooldown of <font color="#f9fc00">Overcome Obstacles</font>, and increase the critical hit rate of <font color="#f9fc00">Overcome Obstacles</font>. <br>Clear after critical hit is triggered.
