desc_CS_xy_jlsd07_1=You get <font color="#FFAE00">Skyfall</font> status: reduce damage taken by 10%, the attack range of attacks in the same set increases 3 meters. Lasts for 10 seconds. <br>You can cast the attack again in 10 seconds, dealing damage to enemies. The lower HP enemies have, the more damage they will get. You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. After the attack, <font color="#FFAE00">Skyfall</font> status disappears.
desc_CS_xy_jlsd07_10=You get <font color="#FFAE00">Skyfall</font> status: reduce damage taken by 50%, the attack range of attacks in the same set increases 3 meters. Lasts for 10 seconds. <br>You can cast the attack again in 10 seconds, dealing damage to enemies. The lower HP enemies have, the more damage they will get. You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. After the attack, <font color="#FFAE00">Skyfall</font> status disappears.
