desc_CS_xy_ktdj05_1=Blade Chi <font color="#f9fc00">echoes</font> constantly between enemies. <br>Targets hit by Blade Chi will get damage, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> for 2 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds. <br>Blade Chi echoes 4 times at most.
