desc_CS_xy_ktdj06_1=Blade Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> enemies within 8 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds. <br>The Knock Back effect ignores enemy's endurance. Cannot knock back the same target in 10 seconds.
