desc_CS_xy_ktdj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 8 meters. <br>When hitting the targets, inflict them <font color="#FFAE00">Exchange Sun</font> status: reduce attack speed by 50% and disable flying skills for 2 seconds. <br>During the attack, you get <font color="#FFAE00">Supreme</font> status: reduce damage taken by 75%. <br>You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. You can use Flying Skills when using the attack.
