desc_CS_xy_nrjbd04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When evading attacker's attack successfully, you can <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> him/her for 3 seconds. <br>The last attack will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who are not blocking. <br>You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. You can use Flying Skills when using the attack.
