desc_CS_xy_nrjbd07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When the target is male, the last attack will inflict <font color="#FF3030">Nutcracker</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">reduce speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> for 4 seconds.
