desc_CS_xy_shl01_1_1=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>After hitting enemies, you can use this attack again. When casting attack, you will throw <font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font> out, enemies touched by the Blaze will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 2 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a token is equipped. Equipping dagger and ruler inflicts only 70% damage.
