desc_CS_xy_shl05_1=<br>When parry 6 times successfully: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reflect</font> 20% of damage taken to attacker for 5 seconds. The status disappears when parry is canceled.
desc_CS_xy_shl05_2=<br>When parry 6 times successfully: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reflect</font> 30% of damage taken to attacker for 5 seconds. The status disappears when parry is canceled.
desc_CS_xy_shl05_3=<br>When parry 6 times successfully: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reflect</font> 40% of damage taken to attacker for 5 seconds. The status disappears when parry is canceled.
desc_CS_xy_shl05_4=<br>When parry 6 times successfully: <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reflect</font> 50% of damage taken to attacker for 5 seconds. The status disappears when parry is canceled.
