desc_Newworld_xiyu_002_1=After using the skill, you gain a shield to reduce damage received.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_003_1=After using the skill, gain Falling Snow effect. You will recover HP and Energy constantly.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_004_1=Normal Blade Attack - Soul Losing Blade
desc_Newworld_xiyu_005_1=Normal Arrow Attack
desc_Newworld_xiyu_006_1=Normal Sword Attack - Breeze Sword
desc_Newworld_xiyu_007_1=Normal Twin Daggers Attack - Departing Sting
desc_Newworld_xiyu_008_1=Normal Bare-handed Attack - Tai Chi Fist
desc_Newworld_xiyu_009_1=Normal Blade Attack - Executioner's Blade
desc_Newworld_xiyu_010_1=Normal Sword Attack - Jade Maiden Sword
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_1_001_1=The fierce Sword Chi sweeps the enemies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Target will suffer extra damage when using flying skill.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_1_002_1=Gather chi move. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and grants <font color="#FFAE00">Muddle</font> to make them fall down. <br>Skill does not require channeling when used in the air, and has chances to knock target down. The stronger your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> is, the higher chances to knock target down .
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_1_003_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddle</font>, he/she will not be able to parry in 3 seconds due to the remaining force.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_1_004_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>Attempts to block the skill will cause the target to be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddle</font> and fall down.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_1_005_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. Your Sword Chi will be increased per hit. <br>When the target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddle</font>, <br>he/she will suffer additional damage. <br>The move works better when used in the air.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_1_006_1=A charging move. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. Targets who cannot Parry take extra damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_001_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>You get <font color="#FFAE00">Pain of Separation</font> status: it raises the hit rate of Departing Sting and can be stacked 20 times.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_002_1=Charges and stuns enemies. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to them. <br>You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the move. It can be cast instantly while in the air.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_003_1=A nihilistic strike. Chi Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>After breaking the enemy's block, this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_004_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of Loathsome Clouds and Rain, it knocks he/she into air and deals extra damage (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">Pain of Separation</font> stacks you have, the more damage the move deals.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_005_1=You add 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> status every second: Defense is reduced while movement speed and attack damage are increased.  The more stacks you have, the more damage the move deals. <br>When attacking enemies in this status, damage dealt is based on the amount of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pain of Separation</font> you have.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_006_1=No joy in life and don't fear of death. Anger motivates the potential: increase movement speed, move power (of the same set) and defense significantly. Last for 10 seconds.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_2_007_1=A charging move. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>This adds Rage to you. The more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pain of Separation</font>you have, the more rage you will get. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_3_001_1=Simple blade skill, chop towards head to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Enemy's Parry will be broken, and target will take <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, taking continuous damage for a period of time.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_3_002_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy. <br>If your enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, they will take extra damage.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_3_003_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, this attack will knock target down.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_3_004_1=Enemies who are hit by Chi Force will get {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, the wound will be torn apart, and bleed excessively.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_3_005_1=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, his wound will be torn apart. Enemies not in that status will then be put under it.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_3_006_1=A charging move. Chops targets several times to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and grants <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font> to targets and takes damage over time. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_001_1=Binds enemies together for 2 seconds, and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The bound enemies will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bloody Death Blade</font>, and then they will burn friendly units in 5 meters around. Lasts 6 seconds.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_002_1=Uses the flying claw to drag the enemy towards you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_003_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>At the same time, the skill burns target and makes target take continuous damage. Lasts 6 seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_005_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>If you break the enemy's parry, you grant <font color="#FFAE00">Red Dust</font> status to enemy: reduce attack power greatly and can only be recovered slowly.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_006_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the move damage will be.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_007_1=Kicks over the target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Drains the enemies' HP to heal yourself. Drain 20% of your HP. (When attack is parried, there will be no HP Drain effect.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_001_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>This move can gather strength and increase move power. You will get Super Armor status when casting this move. It will knock enemies into air.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_002_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When breaking parry successfully, it can knock target into air, and grant 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> to yourself.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_003_1=A charging move. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets, and grants 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> to yourself. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_004_1=The sword wind will wind up enemies, and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Grant 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> to yourself.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_005_1=Stabs enemy in air, and deals {@0:伤害包} damage .<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will deal damage to nearby enemies. <br>And at the same time, extra damage will be dealt according to the stack amount of your <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font>. After using the move, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> will be removed. <br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_006_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Each attack will deal extra damage according to your stack amount of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font>.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_5_007_1=Stabs target and knocks him/her into air. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will grant 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> to yourself. <br>(This move can only attack target in air.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_001_1=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets. <br>This move grants the targets <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Force</font> effect: slow their movement speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_002_1=A cunning attack. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. When you break enemies' defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint moves. <br>If you use this move within 5 seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_003_1=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Grappling Force</font>: remove negative buffs and absorb some of the damage you took. <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Grappling Force</font> is broken or time runs out, nearby enemies will suffer concussion (damage will be equivalent to all of Max absorption).
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_004_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you. <br>If you strike within 5 seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skills.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_005_1=Outflanks the enemy with this move and grants <font color="#FFAE00">Dispelling Force</font> buff to yourself: Absorb damage while recovering your Energy and HP.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_006_1=A charging move Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>If you strike within 5 seconds of successful parrying, you can knock enemies into air. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_6_007_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>This move also steals their self-control abilities. You can drag them to you and knock them into air.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies. Your palm Energy destabilizes the enemies and reduces their speed by 20%. (This can be stacked 3 times at most.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz04_1=A defense move. When parrying you can destabilize the enemies and reduce their speed by 20%. (This can be stacked 3 times at most.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the enemy. <br>If both the enemy and you are airborne, you can use this move to knock him away.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz_02_1=Accelerates target's HP regeneration speed, removes blood clots and jolts nearby enemies. <br>When used on yourself, the move can knock nearby enemies into air.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz_03_1=A palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. Breaks targets' Parry and reduces their Rage.
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz_05_1=A charging move. Stays close to the target and repeatedly strikes to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_jdmz_06_1=A merciful move that gives your allies and you Body Protecting Chi which reduces damage taken for a short period.
desc_Npc_by_gxcj01_1=Chi Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets.
desc_Npc_by_gxcj01_10=Chi Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets.
