desc_Npc_by_gxcj02_8=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_by_gxcj02_9=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_by_gxcj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>After breaking down the targets' defense, add <font color="#FFAE00">Backyard Flower</font> status to them: lose 3% of max HP every time they use moves for 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_by_gxcj03_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>After breaking down the targets' defense, add <font color="#FFAE00">Backyard Flower</font> status to them: lose 3% of max HP every time they use moves for 10 seconds.
