desc_Npc_by_gxcj04_1=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_Npc_by_gxcj04_10=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
