desc_Npc_by_gxcj06_1=The riverside flowers are redder than fire at sunrise. The green of the river's water in spring is almost blue. How can one not recognize Suzhou?  Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
