desc_Npc_by_wgl04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When successfully breaking defense: <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> them 3 meters back, while also adding to them <font color="#FFAE00">Taoist</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Drunk Magistrate</font>，the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked into air</font> continuously. The status lasts for 5 seconds.
