desc_Npc_by_wgl05_1=When parry successfully, <br>reduce the attacker's <font color="#FFAE00"></font> HP limit by 1% (This is only effective to players), and increase the move damage in the same set by 2%. The status can be stacked. <br>Stack limit increases with greater skill proficiency.
