desc_Npc_by_xhmdl01_1=<font color="#a3ca44">We can forgive the heavens for doing bad, but if we do bad ourselves, it is unforgivable!</font> <br>Slashes and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters. <br>When hitting enemies without Endurance, grant <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font> to them for 10 seconds. Explode upon 3 stacks and <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font>  them for 2 seconds.
