desc_Npc_by_xhmdl06_1=<br>When parry successfully, <br>grant <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Blade</font> status to attacker for 8 seconds. Explode upon 10 stacks and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyze</font> enemies for 2 seconds.  <br>(When enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Blade</font> status and is attacked, he/she will have one more stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Blade</font>.)
