desc_Npc_dh_txxhjp03_1=Sword Chi flies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The first hit will <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> targets for 3 seconds. The last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> targets to you. <br>(When targets have 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Taixuan</font> status, you will ignore their Endurance when dragging.)
