desc_Npc_em_ynjf01_1=Standing with a sword, One Look Enamored the Whole City. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>This skill can gather strength and increase skill power. After built up and released, the skill can punch enemies in front away.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf01_2=Standing with a sword, One Look Enamored the Whole City. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>This skill can gather strength and increase skill power. After built up and released, the skill can punch enemies in front away.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf01_3=Standing with a sword, One Look Enamored the Whole City. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>This skill can gather strength and increase skill power. After built up and released, the skill can punch enemies in front away.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf01_4=Standing with a sword, One Look Enamored the Whole City. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>This skill can gather strength and increase skill power. After built up and released, the skill can punch enemies in front away.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf02_1=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf02_2=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
