desc_Npc_em_ynjf03_1=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_Npc_em_ynjf03_2=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
