desc_Npc_em_ynjf04_1=Yu Nv Sword, the two attacks come continuously, stab target and send flying, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will attach 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Weapon</font> for yourself.<br>(This skill can only attack target in air.)
desc_Npc_em_ynjf04_2=Yu Nv Sword, the two attacks come continuously, stab target and send flying, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will attach 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Weapon</font> for yourself.<br>(This skill can only attack target in air.)
