desc_Npc_em_ynjf05_1=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
