desc_Npc_em_ynjf06_1=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_Npc_em_ynjf06_2=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
