desc_Npc_em_ynjf07_1=When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> status, you will be immune to damage of being struck down, thrown into the air and knocked down if you parry successfully.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf07_2=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf07_3=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf07_4=A graceful stance. When you have the<font color="#FFAE00">"Dark Power"</font>, you will be immune to damage of shooting down, knocking back and knock down.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf08_1=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
desc_Npc_em_ynjf08_2=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
