desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status to them. The status can be stacked 3 times.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf01_2=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf01_3=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
