desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets, consumes 1 stack of the targets' <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status and prevent them from using feint attack.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf02_2=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf02_3=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf02_4=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy target. This also consumes one level of the enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint movements.
