desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf03_1=A charging attack. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>This consumes 1 stack of the targets' <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status and limits their parry abilities. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf03_2=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf03_3=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
