desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf03_6=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf04_1=A charging attack. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>This consumes 1 stack of the targets' <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status and limits their parry abilities. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf04_2=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf04_3=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf04_4=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf04_5=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf04_6=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When breaking enemies' parry, inflict them <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> status: enemies consume an additional 15 Flying Skill Points if they are using one in mid-air. <br>When the enemies' parry is broken, they will be put into <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> status and unable to use Flying Skills for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf05_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When breaking enemies' parry, inflict them <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> status: enemies consume an additional 20 Flying Skill Points if they are using one in mid-air. <br>When the enemies' parry is broken, they will be put into <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> status and unable to use Flying Skills for 2.5 seconds.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf05_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When breaking enemies' parry, inflict them <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> status: enemies consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if they are using one in mid-air. <br>When the enemies' parry is broken, they will be put into <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> status and unable to use Flying Skills for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf05_4=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When breaking enemies' parry, inflict them <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> status: enemies consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if they are using one in mid-air. <br>When the enemies' parry is broken, they will be put into <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> status and unable to use Flying Skills for 3.5 seconds.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf05_5=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When breaking enemies' parry, inflict them <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> status: enemies consume an additional 25 Flying Skill Points if they are using one in mid-air. <br>When the enemies' parry is broken, they will be put into <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> status and unable to use Flying Skills for 4 seconds.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf05_6=A movement that resembles a jest. Let your inner Energy project outwards, raising dust that deals {@0:伤害包} damage as it fills your target's respiratory tract.<br>When breaking the enemy's parry, this movement adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Flatten</font> state, which causes the enemy to consume an additional 25 Flying Skill points if he uses a flying skill.<br>If you use this movement to break the enemy's parry, the enemy will be put into the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, which grounds the target for five seconds.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf06_1=A defensive stance. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status to the attacker. <br>There are chances to inflict the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">disarmed</font> status: he will not be able to use weapon attacks for 3 seconds. <br>The more stacks of Taunt on the enemy, the greater chances he will be disarmed.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf06_2=A defensive stance. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status to the attacker. <br>There are chances to inflict the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">disarmed</font> status: he will not be able to use weapon attacks for 3.5 seconds. <br>The more stacks of Taunt on the enemy, the greater chances he will be disarmed.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf06_3=A defensive stance. After parrying you perform an ensnaring counter-attack, adding <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status to the attacker. <br>There are chances to inflict the attacker <font color="#FFAE00">disarmed</font> status: he will not be able to use weapon attacks for 4 seconds. <br>The more stacks of Taunt on the enemy, the greater chances he will be disarmed.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf07_1=Launches the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> status to enemy: unable to jump. When your HP is below 50%, you will ignore endurance and throw target into the air.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf07_2=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf07_3=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf07_4=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf07_5=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf07_6=Rising from the ground, send nearby enemies flying with your staff to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This skills puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen"</font> state, preventing them from jumping or using Flying Skills.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike of the combo can throw enemies within 6 meters into the air. When your HP is below 50%, you will ignore endurance and throw target into the air.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf08_2=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf08_3=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf08_4=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf08_5=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_Npc_gbzp_dgbf08_6=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_Npc_jh_bgd01_1=Gain Heaven Force. If target has Marsh Force, he will be inflicted Wind 03, Thunder 04, Fire 06 or Marsh 07. There are 20% chances that target will get all the four status. Shifting Marshes will have Yellow Armor when using attacks. The attack range of Coastal Water, Shaking Thunder, Departing Fire and Windswept is increased by 2. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
