desc_Npc_jh_bxjf01_1=Stuns and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: increase attack speed and charge distance for attacks in the same set for 15 seconds. It can be stacked 10 times. <br>The level of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> is related to <font color="#f9fc00">Cosmic Bloom</font> level. <br>Damage increases with the increase of your attack speed. <br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf01_10=Stuns and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, grant yourself 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: increase movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set for 15 seconds. It can be stacked 10 times.  <br>The level of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> is related to <font color="#f9fc00">Cosmic Bloom</font> level. <br>(Damage increases with the increase of your movement speed.) <br>(This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.)
