desc_Npc_jh_bxjf02_1=A successful parry gain <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>, which increases attack speed and charge distance of attacks in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times. <br>Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of skills. <br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf02_2=Bodhi is fundamentally not a tree; the bright mirror is also not a stand. A successful parry grants player <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>, which increases movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set. Lasts for 15 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.  <br>(Effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> increases with increase in level of set moves)<br> (This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
