desc_Npc_jh_bxjf04_1=Attacks target speedily and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly. <br>As attack speed increases, target receives more damage. <br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.
