desc_Npc_jh_bxjf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>And inflicts them <font color="#FFAE00">Evil</font> status: targets have chances to be stunned when trying to use attacks (attacks are interruptible) and take damage. Lasts for 10 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly. <br>As attack speed increases, target receives more damage. <br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf06_10=Evil gives way, the ground sinks and the sky collapses. Follow the sinister and expel evil, which is there to judge right or wrong. Disorderly blows inflict{@0:伤害包}; <br>at the same time adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Evilness"</font> to target: target has probability to become Stunned when trying to use skills (skill becomes disrupted) and takes damage. Lasts for 10 seconds.  <br>(Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed) <br>(This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
