desc_Npc_jh_bxjf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Consumes 1 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: paralyze targets for 2 seconds and Remove any attack restrictions on you. <br>No extra effects when you don't have enough stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>). <br>As attack speed increases, target receives more damage. <br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf08_10=Flying swallow through willow, evil cuts down the suggestion of spring. Causes in targets in front{@0:伤害包}:<br> consumes 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font> to causes target to be paralyzed for 2 seconds; also removes any movement restrictions on player. <br>(No extra effects when player does not have enough stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>) <br>(Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed) <br>(This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
