desc_Npc_jh_cyjf01_1=A lightning strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font> and will take continuous damage that increases with stacks. <br>This is one of the attacks that <font color="#FFAE00">Qian Xizhi</font> likes to use.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf01_2=A lightning strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font> and will be dealt continued damage that increases with stacks.<br>This is one of the moves that <font color="#FFAE00">Qian Xizhi</font> likes to use.
