desc_Npc_jh_cyjf01_6=A lightning strike that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, he will be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font> and will be dealt continued damage that increases with stacks.<br>This is one of the moves that <font color="#FFAE00">Qian Xizhi</font> likes to use.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf02_1=Wields a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will causes him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block, he will suffer damage if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often uses this attack to break enemy's parry.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf02_2=Wield a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will cause him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block he will suffer damage if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often used this move to break enemy's parries.
