desc_Npc_jh_cyjf02_6=Wield a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will cause him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block he will suffer damage if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often used this move to break enemy's parries.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf03_1=A attack that concentrates <font color="#FFAE00">Setting Sun Sword Chi</font> to protect oneself. When parry successfully, you can cause <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Chi</font> to fill the enemy's body while restoring some of your own energy. <br>This attack comes from <font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font>'s defensive skills.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf03_2=A movement that concentrates <font color="#FFAE00">Setting Sun Sword Chi</font> to protect oneself. After you parry you can cause <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> to fill the enemy's body while restoring some of your own inner energy.<br>This movement comes from <font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font>'s defense movements.
