desc_Npc_jh_cyjf05_1=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and makes enemies unable to use attacks. <br>This attack causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font>. <br>This attack is one of the wild attacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf05_2=Your sword's chi surges through the air to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and make enemies be unable to use the skills.<br>This movement causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>, and prevents the enemy from using any movements.<br>This move was one of the wild movements of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
