desc_Npc_jh_cyjf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If the enemy does not parry, a pyre will be created around the enemy, preventing him from using flying skills and also causing him to take damage. <br>It's said that this attack is associated with <font color="#FFAE00">Wei Buji</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf06_2=A hidden sword sudden strikes, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry, a fire pit will be created around the enemy's position, preventing him from using flying skills and also causing him to take damage.<br>It's said that this move was associated with <font color="#FFAE00">Wei Buji</font>.
