desc_Npc_jh_cyjf07_1=Charges towards the target and swiftly executes three strikes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Lifeng</font> often uses this skill, to deadly effect.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf07_2=Two dragons emerge from the sea, iron edges and silver claws. Charge towards the target and swiftly execute three strikes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)<br><font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Lifeng</font> often used this skill, to deadly effect.
