desc_Npc_jh_cyjf08_1=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font>. <br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Chi</font> and will be knocked into the air. <br>The greater the effect of Blazing Chi, the more times the enemy will be knocked into the air. <br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
desc_Npc_jh_cyjf08_2=Your sword is like the setting sun searing the heavens. Wield it to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage upon surrounding enemies, and their suffering will be exacerbated by <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>;<br>If the enemy does not block in time, his body will be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> and will be sent flying.<br>(The greater the effect of Lihuo Chi, the more the enemy will be sent flying.)<br>This was originally one of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>'s famous advanced skills.
