desc_Npc_jh_fmzf03_1=Your body becomes as hard as stone. You will not be restricted by any attacks, lasting for 1.5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf03_2=Your body becomes as hard as stone. You will not be restricted by any attacks, lasting for 2 seconds.
