desc_Npc_jh_fmzf03_4=Your body becomes as hard as stone. You will not be restricted by any attacks, lasting for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf03_5=Mad Qi, Mania: body instantly becomes hard like stone. You will not be restricted by any Moves, lasting for 3 seconds.
