desc_Npc_jh_fmzf05_1=Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using attacks from the Mad Demon set are increased by 20%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf05_2=Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using attacks from the Mad Demon set are increased by 25%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf05_3=Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using attacks from the Mad Demon set are increased by 30%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf05_4=Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using attacks from the Mad Demon set are increased by 35%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf05_5=Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using attacks from the Mad Demon set are increased by 40%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf05_6=A sensitive movement. Your blood expands and you slip into a crazed state, unleashing <font color="#FFAE00">Bout of Madness</font>: Damage dealt using moves from the Mad Devil set are increased by 40%, and your attacks will erode even more of your target's endurance.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf06_1=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this attack to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use attacks, his attack speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf06_2=An explosive single strike that hits a target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If you use this move to break the enemy's parry, it vexes the enemy's breathing, and for a short period he will be unable to use movements, his movement speed will be slowed, and he will not be able to use flying skills.
