desc_Npc_jh_fmzf07_5=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 25% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and energy to their best levels. This attack will also allow you to reset part of the attack's chi recovery time, and damage done from attacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Demon</font> set will increase by 50% while attack speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">negative effects</font>: You own energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
desc_Npc_jh_fmzf07_6=A secret skill of a crazed demon, taking the form of <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Demon</font>: Consumes 20% of HP and adds 50 points of Rage. In an instant you can recover your HP and energy to their best levels. This attack will also allow you to reset part of the attack's chi recovery time, and damage done from attacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Mad Demon</font> set will increase by 50% while attack speed increases by 50%; <br>Fallen Demon produces <font color="#FFAE00">negative effects</font>: You own energy consumption and damage taken will increase by 300% and you will not be able to execute parries; <br>Fallen Demon state lasts 15 seconds and restores you to your prior state afterwards. The effect is cancelled if you die while in that state.
