desc_Npc_jh_lhbwq02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If player has 10 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Pounces for Prey</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">"Become a Dragon"</font> effect, changing <font color="#f9fc00">"Dragon Swims Everywhere "</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_lhbwq02_10=The wind and clouds start to move, the dragon sits and the tiger follows, tears into target causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>If player has 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouncing</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, changing <font color="#f9fc00">"Dragon Swimming Across the Field "</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
