desc_Npc_jh_lhbwq08_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Rip and Tear"</font> to enemies, which causes them to take on additional damage when attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 40 times. <br>Execute a chain of attacks without consuming energy.
desc_Npc_jh_lhbwq08_10=The tiger is angry and the dragon impatient, their anger like an unending stream. Deals an explosive punch, causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Tear Apart"</font> to enemies, which causes them to take on additional damage when attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 40 layers.  <br>(The moves continue without a break and do not consume energy)
