desc_Npc_jh_llt04_1=With a random throw of the dice, a number will be automatically given every 5 seconds (the number will persist for 5 seconds). This status will remain for 30 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_llt05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target by 5 meters. <br>When the number rolled is in multiples of 5, twice as much injury will be caused to the target in addition to the original injury.
