desc_Npc_jh_qyzf02_1=Like a ghost pursuing its victim relentlessly, charge at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and cause him to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Flame</font> state.<br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly. <br>This was the master skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Guo Di</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
desc_Npc_jh_qyzf02_2=Charge at the enemy to deal {@0:伤害包} damage and cause him to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Tongues of Fire</font> state.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)<br>This was the master skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Guo Di</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
