desc_Npc_jh_qyzf03_1=Cast a wave of pure energy that improves your physical defense. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Force</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This attack was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">iron golem</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_Npc_jh_qyzf03_2=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_Npc_jh_qyzf03_3=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
