desc_Npc_jh_qyzf03_6=The angry dragon with scales harder than iron surges forward casted a wave of pure inner Energy that improves your External Parry. Each time an enemy attacks you will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Snare</font> effect on the enemy;<br>This move was invented by the <font color="#FFAE00">armor man</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
desc_Npc_jh_qyzf04_1=The five elements converge at the enemy's head, and his defenses vanish, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage. This attack increases you attack speed;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, his meridians will be affected. attack speed will be increased, but he will suffer continued damage. <br>This attack is one of the master skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Tian Feng</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.<br>This is the adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Tian Feng</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_Npc_jh_qyzf04_2=The five elements converge at the enemy's head, and his defenses vanish, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage. This movement increases you movement speed;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, his meridians will be affected. Movement speed will be increased, but he will suffer continued damage.<br>This movement is one of the master skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Tian Feng</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
