desc_Npc_jh_qyzf07_1=Shake the earth with a jolt that reaches the enemy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy get hit by the first strike, enemy will be <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>, and the second hit will prevent enemy from using <font color="#FFAE00">flying skills</font>. If the enemy blocks, the third hit will make <font color="#FFAE00">be unable to block</font>;<br>This is the famous skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> of Green Cloud Castle.
