desc_Npc_jh_whjf05_1=When parry 3 times successfully, <br>grant attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Knotted</font> status: move damage reduces by 3% for 15 seconds. It can have 3 stacks at most.
desc_Npc_jh_whjf05_2=When parry 4 times successfully, <br>grant attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Knotted</font> status: move damage reduces by 3% for 15 seconds. It can have 4 stacks at most.
desc_Npc_jh_whjf05_3=When parry 5 times successfully, <br>grant attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Knotted</font> status: move damage reduces by 3% for 15 seconds. It can have 5 stacks at most.
desc_Npc_jh_whjf05_4=When parry 6 times successfully, <br>grant attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Knotted</font> status: move damage reduces by 3% for 15 seconds. It can have 6 stacks at most.
desc_Npc_jh_whjf05_5=When parry 7 times successfully, <br>grant attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Knotted</font> status: move damage reduces by 3% for 15 seconds. It can have 7 stacks at most.
desc_Npc_jh_whjf05_6=When parry 8 times successfully, <br>grant attacker <font color="#FFAE00">Knotted</font> status: move damage reduces by 3% for 15 seconds. It can have 8 stacks at most.
