desc_Npc_jl_dmssj01_1=A sharp hit. Sword Energy will cause {@0: damage bag} to targets in the same row.<br> Targets will be inflicted the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"choking"</font>: they will unable to eat for a certain time period.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj01_2=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj01_3=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj01_4=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj02_1=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating blood-related skills; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Backstep and Counter</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj02_2=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj02_3=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj02_4=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj03_1=Store your might in this sword, and drill the target to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's defenses, you clear a large amount of the target's buffs and cancel his anti-disease buffs for a set period.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj03_2=Store your might in this sword, and drill the target to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's defenses, you clear a large amount of the target's buffs and cancel his anti-disease buffs for a set period.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj03_3=Store your might in this sword, and drill the target to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's defenses, you clear a large amount of the target's buffs and cancel his anti-disease buffs for a set period.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj03_4=Store your might in this sword, and drill the target to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's defenses, you clear a large amount of the target's buffs and cancel his anti-disease buffs for a set period.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj04_1=Every time you parry successfully, you gain a 20% chance of reducing your attacker's Rage by 2 points.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj04_2=Every time you parry successfully, you gain a 20% chance of reducing your attacker's Rage by 3 points.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj04_3=Every time you parry successfully, you gain a 25% chance of reducing your attacker's Rage by 4 points.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj04_4=Every time you parry successfully, you gain a 30% chance of reducing your attacker's Rage by 5 points.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj05_1=A cloud-penetrating attack. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their attacks. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj05_2=A cloud-penetrating movement. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their movements. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj05_3=A cloud-penetrating movement. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their movements. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj05_4=A cloud-penetrating movement. Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their movements. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj06_1=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this attack can send enemies flying. (This attack can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj06_2=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj06_3=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj06_4=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj07_1=Sword Energy will deal {@0: damage bag}to a target;<br>It will cause constant damage to targets in a radius of 8m lasting 4 seconds and then targets will be stunned over 3 sec. <br>If targets block or Evasion the hit, its cooldown time will be reduced by half.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj07_2=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj07_3=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj07_4=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj08_1=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this attack will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store. <br>After you store Energy the attack's power is increased.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj08_2=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj08_3=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj08_4=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj09_1=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 24%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj09_2=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 26%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj09_3=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 28%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_Npc_jl_dmssj09_4=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 30%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd01_1=Throw the heart digging claw out, bind the enemies in selected area to together for 2 seconds, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>The bound enemies will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bloody Death Blade</font>, and then they will burn friendly targets in 5 meters around, last 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd01_2=Ensnare targets in selected area for 2.5 seconds, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>The snared targets will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Executioner's Blade Chi</font>, and then they will burn friendly targets in 5 meters around, last 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd01_3=Ensnare targets in selected area for 3 seconds, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>The snared targets will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Executioner's Blade Chi</font>, and then they will burn friendly targets in 5 meters around, last 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd01_4=Bind enemies in an area of effect for 3 seconds, dealing {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Targets are inflicted with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloody Blade"</font>, burning their allies in a 5-meter radius for 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd02_1=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd02_2=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd02_3=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd02_4=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd03_1=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jy_xsd03_2=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jy_xsd03_3=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jy_xsd03_4=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jy_xsd04_1=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd04_2=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd04_3=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd04_4=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd05_1=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd05_2=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd05_3=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd05_4=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd06_1=Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 3 times at most): Attach 20% HP draining effect to this set's attacks, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Bloodthirsty Will.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd06_2=Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 5 times at most): Attach 20% HP draining effect to this set's attacks, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Bloodthirsty Will.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd06_3=Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 7 times at most): Attach 20% HP draining effect to this set's attacks, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Bloodthirsty Will.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd06_4=Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bloodthirsty Will"</font>(Can stack 10 times at most): Attach 20% HP draining effect to this set's attacks, and each attack will cost 1 stack of Bloodthirsty Will.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd07_1=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd07_2=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd07_3=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd07_4=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_1=Drink enemy's blood, kick target down on the ground, and then chop with blade to kill target, deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target. The movement will drain the enemy's blood, to recover your own HP. The draining effect is 20%.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_2=Cause {@0:伤害包}.<br>Drink the enemies' blood at the same time to heal your own wounds. Vampiric effect is 25 percent. There is no vampiric effect if this attack is parried.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_3=Cause {@0:伤害包}.<br>Drink the enemies' blood at the same time to heal your own wounds. Vampiric effect is 30 percent. There is no vampiric effect if this attack is parried.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_4=Cause {@0:伤害包}.<br>Drink the enemies' blood at the same time to heal your own wounds. Vampiric effect is 35 percent. There is no vampiric effect if this attack is parried.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 20%.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_sky_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 25%.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_sky_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 30%.
desc_Npc_jy_xsd08_sky_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target. You absorb HP from target to compensate for your own HP spent in using this skill. HP absorption efficiency is 35%.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf01_1=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Riding the Dragon</font> state, reducing his attack speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf01_2=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state, reducing his movement speed.
