desc_Npc_jz_yxjf01_6=Your sword chi surges and a falling strike deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy target;<br>This puts the enemy under the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state, reducing his movement speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf02_1=A charging attack of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. This attack also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Riding the Dragon</font> state to the target, reducing his attack speed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf02_2=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf02_3=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf02_4=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf02_5=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf02_6=A charging movement of three consecutive stabs, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;Thsi movement also adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Heart</font> state to the target, reducing his movement speed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf03_1=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font> between your targets. Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br>At most, this echo continues for 5 rounds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf03_2=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font> between your targets. Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br>At most, this echo continues for 7 rounds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf03_3=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font> between your targets. Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br>At most, this echo continues for 10 rounds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf03_4=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf03_5=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf03_6=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf04_1=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.<br>If this attack breaks the target's parry, target will be paralyzed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf04_2=Your sword and your will are one, and you carry a frigid bearing to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, the target will be paralyzed.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf04_3=Your sword and your will are one, and you carry a frigid bearing to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, the target will be paralyzed.
