desc_Npc_jz_yxjf06_1=Create a protective screen of sound with your weapon for 16 seconds. Your targets within the screen will lose HP repeatedly.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf06_2=Use sound as a sword and use your sword to make sound. Create a protective screen of a flute sound: The enemies will lose HP continuously within the protective screen. It will last sixteen seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf06_3=Use sound as a sword and use your sword to make sound. Create a protective screen of a flute sound: The enemies will lose HP continuously within the protective screen. It will last sixteen seconds.
