desc_Npc_jz_yxjf06_6=Use sound as a sword and use your sword to make sound. Create a protective screen of a flute sound: The enemies will lose HP continuously within the protective screen. It will last sixteen seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf07_1=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a attack direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded.
