desc_Npc_slzp_lzs04_1=A defensive stance. When you successfully parry you put the assailant under the <font color="#FFAE00">Lacking</font> effect, so that when he uses flying skills, he will exhaust his Flying Skill points more quickly. This debuff can be stacked up to 3 times.
desc_Npc_slzp_lzs04_2=A defensive stance. When you successfully parry you put the assailant under the <font color="#FFAE00">Lacking</font> effect, so that when he uses flying skills, he will exhaust his Flying Skill points more quickly. This debuff can be stacked up to 4 times.
desc_Npc_slzp_lzs04_3=A defensive stance. When you successfully parry you put the assailant under the <font color="#FFAE00">Lacking</font> effect, so that when he uses flying skills, he will exhaust his Flying Skill points more quickly. This debuff can be stacked up to 5 times.
desc_Npc_slzp_lzs05_1=Charging attack, bend your arm like a bow, and then strike like a spring, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, he will be paralyzed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
