desc_Npc_xjz_wmcf03_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"counter"</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while in defense status, it is possible to render such attack ineffective. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font>: Continuous damage, enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field will exist for 8 seconds. <br>Counterattack prevention can be maintained for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feints. <br>Increase in the strike level can increase counterattack injury. <br>If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike power.
