desc_Npc_xjz_wmcf03_hide_1=When <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font> is triggered, target suffers damage over time and his Flying skills are disabled. Enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field or stand <font color="#FF3030">within it range</font> will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
