desc_Npc_xjz_wmcf06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Pull a random target within 20m.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage. <br>Randomly pull all targets within a range of 20m)<br>If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of the strike power.
desc_Npc_xjz_wmcf06_2=There are no boundaries to worry, and what is close may be far away: Pull target in front and knock it away to cause {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Randomly pull all targets within a range of 20m)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
