desc_Npc_xjz_wmcf07_1=Deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包}. <br>The attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. It is possible to attack freely when attacking.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Npc_xjz_wmcf07_2=Faint autumn hill in the reflection of evening mist; black ink ruler with a range of energy force: This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>Powerful energy force: If the enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Ink"</font> status each strike will cause it to be temporarily fainted. <br>(The strike is launched in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status, it is possible to move freely when launching the strike)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
