desc_Npc_xy_jlsd07_1=You get <font color="#FFAE00">Heaven Surprise</font> status: reduce damage taken by 10%, the attack range of moves in the same set increases 3 meters. Lasts for 10 seconds. <br>You can cast the move again in 10 seconds, dealing damage to enemies (The lower HP enemies have, the more damage they will get. You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the move.) After the move, <font color="#FFAE00">Heaven Surprise</font> status disappears.
