desc_Npc_xy_shl07_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Scald all enemies within 8 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>When making the attack, you will be covered in <font color="#FF3030"> Sea of Flame </font>: continuously scald the enemies in the zone and make them <font color="#f9fc00"> Paralyzed </font> for 2 sec.
