desc_Npc_xy_shl08_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Scald attack enemies within 10 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Using this attack to have them <font color="#f9fc00">pulled</font>around you and continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock </font> the target away. <br>The effect of pulling ignores enemies' parry with a distance of 10 meters. <br>you will get<font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. When using this skill, and you may use Flying Skills.
