desc_Npc_yh_hsqs01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Skill has 10% of adding <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> to target. Target's vision is blurred, and his next attack has high chance of being evaded.
