desc_Npc_yh_hsqs05_1=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 60% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters, lasts 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range.<br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs05_2=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 70% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters, lasts 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range.<br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs05_3=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 80% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters, lasts 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range.<br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs05_4=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 90% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters, lasts 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range.<br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs05_5=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 100% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters, lasts 5 seconds. Effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range.<br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in a 5m radius. <br>Add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Fallen Flowers"</font> to enemies, causing paralysis for 3 seconds. <br>If enemy already has <font color="#FFAE00">"Bright Butterflies"</font> status, enemy becomes stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_yh_hsqs06_2=The flower wilts as soon as it blossoms. The beautiful flowers all vie for supremacy. A tactful blow causes in target: {@0:伤害包} Damage may ripple out to targets within a 5-meter radius and <br>add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Flowers"</font> to enemies, causing Paralysis for 3 seconds.  <br>If enemy already has <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Thorn"</font> status, enemy becomes Stunned for 3 seconds.
