desc_jn_lxk_ktdj_01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(The lower HP you have, the more damage enemies will get.)
desc_jn_lxk_ktdj_02_1=Dashes targets fast and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy. The charging distance of the move is 20 meters.)
desc_jn_newworld_ssg_001_1=Four monsters attack.
desc_jn_newworld_ssg_002_1=Four monsters attack.
desc_jn_newworld_ssg_003_1=Cannon attack from minions aboard the large ship.
desc_jn_newworld_ssg_004_1=Attack from elite enemies aboard the large ship.
desc_jn_sgy_nrjbd_01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_jn_sgy_nrjbd_02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>If the target is male, the last strike will bring him into<font color="#FF3030">Eggache</font>State: Reduce all damage taken by 30% and last 6 sec.
desc_jn_sgy_nrjbd_03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters. <br>Grants them <font color="#FFAE00">Hard to Find</font> status: their next attack will be evaded and cleared. The status lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_jn_sgy_nrjbd_04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby; <br>Successfully dodging the attack will make the attacker<font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font>for 3 sec；<br>The last move will<font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font>all enemies who do not parry. <br>(Using this skill increases evasion, and you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> effect, also you may use Flying Skills.)
desc_jn_tg_eat_1=<s>
desc_jn_xinjianghu_001_1=<s>
