desc_newworld_ey_01_1=Blast damage to single target. Bleeding will occur if the target does not parry, making it lose 1% HP per second. Lasts 5 seconds with 5 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_ey_02_1=Attempt to bite the target and cause damage. If the target does not parry, it will be paralyzed. Lasts 3 seconds with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_ey_03_1=Blast damage to enemies in a 180 degrees radius of 3 meters. Beat the target back for 3 meters if the target parries with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_ey_04_1=Increase Attack Power by 30% and decrease the target's parry endurance every time it parries the attack. Lasts 10 seconds with 30 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_hl_01_1=Causes damage to a single target. Effect of Dexterity will be added when hit, increasing 10% evasion chance. Lasts 3 seconds with 3 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_hl_02_1=Causes damage to a single target with 30% change of adding the effect of Exposure, blasting extra 30% damage within 4 seconds and 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_hl_03_1=Add Sly effect to yourself, becoming immune from controlling effects. Lasts 5 seconds with 5 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_hl_04_1=Causes damage to a single target and adds extra Laceration effect. parry endurance will be reduced every time it parries an attack. Lasts 6 min with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_l_01_1=Causes damage to a single target and adds extra Rip and Tear effect. 2% external attack damage will occur every time it parries an attack. Lasts 6 min with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_l_02_1=Causes damage to a single target with 20% change of adding rabies effect. Maximum 3 targets nearby will be affected, causing Keyboard settings randomized and the loss of 2% HP. Lasts 6 min with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_l_03_1=Blast damage to enemies in a 120 degrees radius of 3 meters. Slow down the targets for 3 seconds if the target parries with 8 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_l_04_1=Blast damage to enemies in a 90 degrees radius of 10 meters with the effect of Laceration. parry endurance will be reduced every time it parries an attack. Lasts 6 min with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_l_05_1=Blast damage to enemies in a 360 degrees radius of 10 meters, decreasing 30% of its attack power. Lasts 6 min with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_llmkitem_003_1=Mysterious effect from ancient mechanisms and armored automatons.
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj01_1=Chi Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets.
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>After breaking down the targets' defense, add <font color="#FFAE00">Backyard Flower</font> status to them: lose 3% of max HP every time they use moves for 10 seconds.
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj04_1=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj04_hide_1=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj05_1=It's hard to walk, it's hard to walk...Where are the old ways now? Stabs target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj05_1_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj06_1=The riverside flowers are redder than fire at sunrise. The green of the river's water in spring is almost blue. How can one not recognize Suzhou?  Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj06_1_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mijing_gxcj07_1=Drunk Stab Dance deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>You can <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> target continuously to you when using this move. <br>(You can use Flying Skills when using this move.)
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>If the target is male, the last strike will bring him into<font color="#FF3030">Eggache</font>State: Reduce all damage taken by 30% and last 6 sec.
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd02_1_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters. <br>Grants them <font color="#FFAE00">Hard to Find</font> status: their next attack will be evaded and cleared. The status lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby; <br>Successfully dodging the attack will make the attacker<font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font>for 3 sec；<br>The last move will<font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font>all enemies who do not parry. <br>(Using this skill increases evasion, and you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> effect, also you may use Flying Skills.)
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets. <br>When breaking enemy's defense successfully, <font color="#f9fc00">knock him down</font>.
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd06_1=When parry successfully, <br>you have chances to clear the Catch Breath time of all the moves in the same set. <br>(Can trigger Clear effect once in 12 seconds)
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When the target is male, the last attack will grant him <font color="#FF3030">Ball Broken</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">reduce speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> for 4 seconds.
desc_newworld_mijing_nrjbd07_1_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd01_1=Attack enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Attach <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect on enemies: lose health for 8 seconds, and it can stack for 5 levels.<br>(Need to learn skill <font color="#f9fc00">Wind and Moon don't Have a Border</font> to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect.)
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd02_1=Chop target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd02_1_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd03_1=Chop target to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy. The max distance for charge is 20 meters.)
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd04_1=When block successfully:<br>Attach <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect on enemy: lose health for 8 seconds, and it can stack for 5 levels.<br>(The lost health will increase along with the level.)
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd05_1=Use blade chi to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect, then <font color="#f9fc00">send him flying</font>.<br>(Cannot move when use the skill. When use the skill, you get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> effect.)
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd06_1=Chop enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When break enemy's block successfully, send him <font color="#f9fc00">flying</font>.
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd08_1=Chop target continuously to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Moon and Wind</font> effect, the skill will ignore enemy's external defense.
desc_newworld_miku_dmgc_01_1=Effect of Lonely Smoke, causing negative effect on the target if using flying skills
desc_newworld_miku_dmgc_02_1=The goal is to knock down the player
desc_newworld_miku_dmgc_03_1=Effect of being Sober, randomizing keyboard settings.
desc_newworld_miku_dmgc_04_1=10% slow down. This effect can be stacked.
desc_newworld_miku_dmgc_05_1=Add buff to yourself and you'll have a chance to disable target's skill when hit,
desc_newworld_miku_hlb_01_1=Decrease the target's speed. This effect can be stacked.
desc_newworld_miku_hlb_02_1=Roar and use halo to add damage-reducing buffs to the player. This effect is removable.
desc_newworld_miku_hlb_03_1=Add buffs to the player, keeping them from using skills in a certain amount of time.
desc_newworld_miku_hlb_04_1=Use Quarterstaff it to knock down players from the air.
desc_newworld_miku_hlb_05_1=Use chanting skills to reduce damage while shield is in effect.
desc_newworld_miku_hlb_06_1=Gain the chance of reducing enemies' rage by hitting the target
desc_newworld_miku_hql_01_1=Scald players in front of you.
desc_newworld_miku_hql_02_1=Paw Swipe and throw enemies
desc_newworld_miku_hql_03_1=Blast damage
desc_newworld_miku_hql_04_1=Clap forward and get started to blast damage to the enemies and cause Keyboard settings randomized for a certain amount of time.
desc_newworld_miku_hql_05_1=Summon Copper Golem.
desc_newworld_miku_hql_06_1=Regular attack, normal damage.
desc_newworld_miku_jgmr_01_1=Damages target and affects its movement speed.
desc_newworld_miku_jgmr_02_1=<s>
desc_newworld_miku_jgmr_03_1=<s>
desc_newworld_miku_jgmr_04_1=<s>
desc_newworld_miku_mjr_01_1=<s>
desc_newworld_miku_mjr_02_1=<s>
desc_newworld_miku_mjr_03_1=<s>
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf01_1=This attack uses Sword Chi to cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>You will receive 1 extra Rage point during the attack, before the enemy parries.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your parry endurance exceeds 75%, your attack will ignore 5% of your target's External Defense. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf03_1=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your parry endurance exceeds 75%, your attack will ignore 5% of your target's External Defense. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf04_1=Recover 2000 parry endurance points, and the status <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>is removed. <br>You will also gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>effect: When using Mozi's Sword to attack your opponent, each blow will add damage equivalent to 3% of the current parry (to a maximum of 80 additional points), and will restore 2 Rage points. This effect will continue for 12 seconds. <br>When your parry endurance is less than 30%, Using a Skill will put you in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect)<br> The amount of parry endurance you can restore will depend on how much you have cultivated.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf05_1=This attack give you <font color="#FFAE00">"Universal Love" </font>status: When using Mozi's Sword Technique to attack an enemy, your enemy enters a <font color="#FFAE00">"Non-Aggression" </font>effect. <br><font color="#FFAE00">"Non-Aggression" </font>effect: There is a 20% chance of being interrupted when using this skill, and your skill will be sealed for 3 seconds. The effect can stack up to 2 levels, and will continue for 15 seconds. (Each time your target uses a Skill, this will Remove one level of the <font color="#FFAE00">"Non-Aggression" </font>effect.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害} to enemy in front. <br>If you overcome your target's parry, you will recover 320 parry endurance points, and reduce your target's Internal and External attack damage by 32 points.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf07_1=When you parry successfully, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Decides Destiny" </font>effect. Each level can reduce <font color="#f9fc00">"Sword Chi of Jianghu" </font>cooldown by 1 second, and increase conversion value by 4% (converts Rage into parry endurance). This effect can stack up to 5 levels.
desc_newworld_miku_mzjf08_1=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your parry endurance exceeds 75%, your attack will ignore 5% of your target's External Defense. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reinforced attack: </font>If your current parry endurance is less than 30%, you can recover 20 points Rage after using this skill. <br>When your parry endurance exceeds 75%, this skill will keep you from being sent flying, thrown, or knocked down.
desc_newworld_miku_pt_001_1=Normal Attack - Yang Peifeng
desc_newworld_miku_pt_002_1=Normal Attack - Xu Miaozhen
desc_newworld_miku_pt_003_1=Normal Attack - Emei Disciple
desc_newworld_miku_pt_004_1=Normal Attack - Wudang Disciple
desc_newworld_miku_pt_005_1=Normal Attack - Yin Feng
desc_newworld_miku_pt_006_1=Normal Attack - Lu Qianniang
desc_newworld_miku_pt_007_1=Normal Attack - Wang Xiao
desc_newworld_miku_pt_008_1=Normal Attack - Lei Xingkong
desc_newworld_miku_pt_009_1=Normal Attack - Xuanyuan Chuqing
desc_newworld_miku_pt_010_1=Normal Attack - Master Qianzhuo
desc_newworld_miku_pt_011_1=Normal Attack - Old Curly Beard
desc_newworld_miku_pt_012_1=Normal Attack - Mao Asi
desc_newworld_miku_pt_013_1=Normal Attack - Royal Guards Disciple
desc_newworld_miku_pt_014_1=Normal Attack - Wanderer's Valley Disciple
desc_newworld_miku_pt_016_1=Normal Attack - Armored Automaton
desc_newworld_miku_pt_017_1=Normal Attack - Mechanical Puppet
desc_newworld_miku_pt_018_1=Normal Attack - Mechanical Golem
desc_newworld_miku_pt_019_1=Normal Attack - Xuanyuan Kuanglang
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Smiling</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Reduced attack Speed</font> for 20%, lasts 8 seconds, upon reaching 3 stacks, target will suffer from <font color="#FFAE00">Mercy</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>If target does not parry, then <font color="#f9fc00">struck down</font>. <br>May only be used against airborne target. <br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill, max charging distance is 20 meters.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg02_sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and knock it down. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg04_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Launch</font> all enemies in the front within 10 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>Last strike can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch</font> enemies. <br>When you are using the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg07_1=Upon successful parry: <br>Attach <font color="#FFAE00">Insane</font> state to attacker: target has to consume 5 extra Flying Skill Points to use Flying Skill.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Upon breaking parry, attach <font color="#FFAE00">No Flower</font> state: attempts in using Flying Skill causes target to be <font color="#f9fc00">blown away</font>, effect lasts max 5 seconds.
desc_newworld_miku_szzhg09_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch</font> targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Insane</font>. <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state when using this Skill, when using the skill, you may also use Flying Skill at the same time)
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front;<br>Enemies affected by sword Chi will be attached with <font color="#FFAE00">Lost</font>: Reduce internal and external accuracy by 10%, lasts 10 seconds.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj03_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds. In <font color="#FF3030">Draw the Sword</font>state: Receive special effect when using Upward attack and Sword Chi Flute Heart. <br>Counterattack, effective radius is 20 meters, not effective against Uper Armor effect, vulnerable against feints)<br>In Draw the Sword state, cannot attack when you are parrying)
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj03_hide_1=Additional hidden effect is to be revealed at a later time.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>In <font color="#FF3030">Draw the Sword</font>state: Sword Chi may <font color="#f9fc00">Launch</font> target who does not parry.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj04_hide_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>In <font color="#FFAE00">Draw the Sword</font>state: Sword Chi may <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> target who does not parry.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>May only use the skill when you have <font color="#FFAE00">Block the Sun</font>)<br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target;<br>Upon breaking enemy parry: <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> it for 3 seconds and Pull it to your side. <br>In <font color="#FFAE00">Draw the Sword</font>state, change attack style to: charge to mouse area and break defense. <br>Max mouse selection distance is 20 meters.
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj06_hide_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target;<br>Upon breaking enemy parry: <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> it for 3 seconds and drag it to your side. <br>In <font color="#FFAE00">Draw the Sword</font>state, change move style to: charge to mouse area and break defense. <br>(Max mouse selection distance is 20 meters)
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj07_1=Charge to mouse selected area and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>When launching the skill, you receive <font color="#FFAE00">Six Exits</font> state: increase evasion rate, upon successful evasion, you receive <font color="#FFAE00">Block the Sun</font> effect. <br>When using the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)<br>In Block the Sun, you can use <font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Covers the Sun</font>, lasts 20 seconds) <br>When using the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)<br>In Block the Sun, you can use <font color="#f9fc00"> Cloud Covers the Sun </font>, lasts 20 seconds)
desc_newworld_miku_yxfj08_1=Continuously attack target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_01_1=A startling move that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage on the enemies in the line in front of you.<br>This move causes the enemies to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Locked Throat</font> state and for a set period of time will not be able to eat.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_02_1=Grip the sword and strike consecutively, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>When you deal a critical hit to the target you can reduce his extravasated blood. This prevents him from activating the blood; <br>If the enemy is made dizzy by the <font color="#FFAE00">Movements of the Sparrow</font> effect, he will be knocked down.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_03_1=Store your might in this sword, and drill the target to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's defenses, you clear a large amount of the target's buffs and cancel his anti-disease buffs for a set period.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_04_1=A defensive movement. Withdraw your sword, and for every successful parry you add a 20% chance of reducing the assailant's Rage by 2 points.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_05_1=Focus your sword's chi and release it abruptly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>You can sent airborne enemies flying and exhaust their attacks. They suffer damage for the amount exhausted;<br>This is a special chi-adjusting method can can be used up to three times in four seconds before its cooldown begins.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_06_1=A merciless maneuver. Taking your sword firmly in hand, you stab the earth and jump, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>The final strike of this movement can send enemies flying. This move can only be used on enemies that are lying on the ground.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_07_1=A counterstrike with your sword's chi that deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When the target is within 8 meters of you, he will sustain continuous damage; 4 seconds after executing the move if the enemy is still in your vicinity he will be rendered dizzy for 3 seconds. <br>(If the skill is blocked or Evasiond by target, then the cooldown period of using this skill next time will be halved.)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_08_1=A stored Energy strike. Let your sword's Energy flow radiantly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>Enemies hit by this move will be stunned, and the duration of the effect depends on how much Energy you store.<br>(After you store Energy the movement's power is increased.)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dmssj_09_1=Killing stunt, no life and no mercy, wield sword to chop hardly, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 24%, the skill will deal double damage.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dqd_02_1=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to target.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dqd_03_1=A charging attack of consecutive chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target;<br>If the target's defense is broken or cannot parry, he will suffer massive hard damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dqd_04_1=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any attacks and will effectively be stunned.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dqd_05_1=Parry attack of Heartless, when you block successfully, add a piece of <font color="#FFAE00">Heartless</font> blade force, can stack 5 times at most. So each time target gets hurt by Heartless skill, will trigger a piece of blade force to deal damage, and the blade force will vanish after triggering.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dqd_06_1=Violent Rage, dance of metempsychosis, force from the netherworld erodes the target and causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>Teeter the target's body: there is a great possibility of falling when starting to attack or using flying skill. If the target is in the air, it will fall immediately.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_dqd_07_1=A charging attack. Fall like blistering rain, unleashing a series of chops that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>If you are strike airborne enemies, they will be grounded and will suffer internal damage, preventing them from using flying skills and possibly other attacks as well. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_01_1=Draw your body back and shake your sword. Its Sword Chi is terrible. Cut the target and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_02_1=Flowing Cloud Fast Sword - Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>Inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Running Thunder and Hiding Cloud"</font> status: Gain an extra 15% damage after being attacked by this set. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front. <br>Paralyze for 3 seconds and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">"Break Rain Residual Cloud"</font> state to him.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_04_1=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 20 meters.<br> If targets suffer from <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Rain and Remnant Cloud"</font>, they are thrown into the air.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_05_1=This sword attack deals {@0:伤害包} to the target in front of you.<br>If the target's parry is breached, the target will not be able to use Flying Skills for a long time.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_06_1=If the Parry is successful: Release <font color="#FFAE00">Flowing Cloud Sword Chi</font> to the target: Sword Chi shoots off, inflict damage to the target and reduce 30% speed. The decelerate effect will affect enemies within 8 meters of the target. Interval time for triggering effect is 6 seconds.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_lyjf_07_1=Slash nearby enemies, causing {@0:伤害包} and throwing them into the air.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_01_1=Leap over target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_01_hide_1=Deal damage {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>Gain <font color="#f9fc00">"Cold as Ice"</font> effect: When target has lower HP, the skill will deal more damage. <br>Use Flying Skill to approach target. Maximum charging distance is 20 meters.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_02_hide_1=Deal damage {@0:伤害包} to target;<br>You skills apply <font color="#f9fc00">Cold as Ice</font>: The lower HP target has, the higher the damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill, max dashing distance is 20 meters)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets; <br>You may attack when using the skill, you are under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_03_hide_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br>You can move freely while using this skill, as well as gaining the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Armor"</font> effect.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Deal 2 times the damage and recover 10 Rage if you break target's Parry.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_04_hide_1=Sweep enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When breaching target's parry, you deal double damage and recover 10 Rage.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_05_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds. <br>Counter skill, effective radius is 6m, it does not work upon Super Armor and may be restrained by feints. Increase skill stacks to boost counter damage)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_05_hide_01_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds. <br>This defensive skill is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by a feint attack.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_05_hide_1=Recovered
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_06_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Dagger Cloaked in Red"</font> effect, which absorbs small amount of damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_06_hide_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Cloak of Daggers"</font> effect, which absorbs damage and lasts 10 seconds.<br>If this effect is interrupted, you can gain <font color="#FF3030">"Red Armor"</font> effect when using the <font color="#f9fc00">"Dagger Cloaked in Yellow"</font> skill.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ncd_07_1=When you use a skill you have used within 60 seconds, the skill will reenter a cool-down period (only for skills within the same set). <br>If skill is <font color="#f9fc00">Dagger Cloaked in Yellow</font>: The skill will ignore target's endurance and deal damage. <br>If skill is <font color="#f9fc00">Dagger Cloaked in Red</font>: If <font color="#FFAE00">Dagger Cloaked in Red</font> state is broken, it will deal damage to nearby enemies.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; for each extra enemy nearby, deal 15% bonus damage.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; also deal 30% splash damage to nearby foes. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_03_1=When attacked, deal 36 damage to attacker. The damage is affected by internal and externa skills.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>if you break target's Parry, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Mystical Dragon Assault</font> to target: In 4 seconds, deal 1 to 150 random damage, and cause Stun effect for 1 second(s). Parry does not trigger Stun effect.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_05_1=Once the player defends successful it will be added <font color="#FFAE00">"Six Directions"</font> status: Increases range of skills in this set by 2 meters.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_06_1=Pull nearby targets to you and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Targets who parry will not be pulled.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_slbwj_07_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; for each extra enemy nearby, deal 15% bonus damage. <br>When casting the skill, you receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and may attack freely.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_01_1=Cunning fist skill, deal {@0:伤害包} to your target.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_02_1=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_03_1=Give your attacks the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Chi</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be thrown or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Burning Rage</font> state added to you</font>. <br/>The <font color="#FFFFA5">Concentration</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be thrown or sent flying.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_04_1=This charging attack inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>When you are in a <font color="#f9fc00">Concentration </font>or in <font color="#FFAE00"">"Burning Rage"</font>, you can knock your target back, and give your target the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Broken Cart" </font>effect, denying him the use of Flying Skill or defensive action for 3 seconds. You will gain the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Amplify damage" </font>effect for a period of time, inflicting additional Hard damage.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_04sky_1=Gather Energy for 1.5 seconds and strike hard to shock your target, making them unable to parry for 3 seconds.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_05_1=Your fist is like a spear, both overt and feint. Stab at the opponent to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>When you break the enemy's parry you can knock him back, preventing him from moving for two seconds.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_06_1=You have a 30% chance of reaching your potential when your parry is successful: Increases power of "Mantis Breaks Cart" by 30%, and instantly executes a skyward leap.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_tlq_07_1=A deceptive string of attacks that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_01_1=Throw the heart digging claw out, bind the enemies in selected area to together for 2 seconds, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>The bound enemies will be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bloody Death Blade</font>, and then they will burn friendly targets in 5 meters around, last 6 seconds.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_02_1=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_03_1=Charge skill, the blade is burning, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>At the same time, the skill will burn target and make target take continuous damage, last 6s.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_04_1=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_05_1=Break blood channel and chop, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front. <br>When Break Defense succeeds, you will give the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Dust of the Earth"</font>: Greatly reduce the enemy's attack power, which will recover slowly.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_06_1=Seek revenge for the smallest grievance, let enemy pay with blood for blood. Each successful parry will give you 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> (Can stack to 3 floors at most): Make this set's attack attach 20% HP draining effect, and each attack will cost 1 floor of Blood Thirsty Will.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_07_1=Bathe in blood and burn sky, chop once with all your strength, deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the skill damage will be.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_08_1=Drink enemy's blood, kick target down on the ground, and then chop with blade to kill target, deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the target. The movement will drain the enemy's blood, to recover your own HP. The draining effect is 20%.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_xsd_08sky_1=Brutal Violence Move. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, absorb fresh blood continuously from target to and replenish your own HP. HP absorption is 20%.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_yf_01_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mikuboss_yf_02_1=<s>
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_001_1=Standing with a sword, One Look Enamored the Whole City. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>This skill can gather strength and increase skill power. After built up and released, the skill can punch enemies in front away.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_002_1=Sword waves like a star, wipes the clouds away from sky, deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>When succeed to break parry, it can punch target away, and attach 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_03_1=Charge skill, light as goose, quick as dragon, deal {@0: 伤害包} to target, and attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> to yourself.<br>(This skill can use Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_04_1=Yu Nv Sword, the two attacks come continuously, stab target and send flying, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will attach 1 floor of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Weapon</font> for yourself.<br>(This skill can only attack target in air.)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_05_1=Like Phoenix dances in sky, whirl body and fly, the sword wind will wind up around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Attach 1 floor <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> for yourself at the same time.
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_06_1=An alone goose is flying in the sky. Stab enemy in air with the sword, deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>After knocking enemy down on the ground, the remaining force will shock around enemies.<br>And at the same time, according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body to attach extra damage. After using the skill, the <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> will be removed.<br>(This skill can only be used on target in air.)
desc_newworld_mikuboss_ynjf_08_1=Walk with small steps and return wind and snow, the sword looks like it will disappear from the world. Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>Each attack will attach extra damage according to the floor number of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Force</font> on your body.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_01_1=A seizing motion that deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This movement places you in the <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> stance: It raises your Parting Sorrow Sting movement's hit rating and can be stacked.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_02_1=A charging movement with a turning stab, inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This adds Rage to your character, the ammount depending on how much your <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font>is stacked.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_03_1=Stab as you ascend, then rain clanging metal upon the enemy, charging at enemies within an area of effect. This stuns the enemy and inflicts {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>This movement is unblockable and can be swiftly executed in mid-air.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_03sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} within the vicinity. The power of this massive strike causes enemies to become dizzy. If used while airborine, this attack becomes unblockable. When in the Death Do Us Part mode, this attack becomes uninterruptible.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_04_1=A nihilistic strike inflicting {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>After breaking the enemy's block this move eliminates the enemy's rage and additional soft damage is inflicted. The amount of soft damage inflicted depends on how much rage was eliminated.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_05_1=A defense stance. If your parry is successful, the attack places your character in the <font color="#FFAE00">Departing Sorrow</font> state and adds one additional rage point. <br>There is also a chance of adding one more rage point on top of that.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_06_1=Strike the earth from the air and deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target is under the dizzying effect of "Loathsome Clouds and Rain," the attack inflicts greater damage from the air (no such effect when attacking from the ground). <br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">"Pain of Separation"</font> effect is stacked on the player, the more damage is inflicted.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_06sky_1=A rapid charge attack from above, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets on the ground. If the targe is in the Loathsome Clouds and Rain state, extra damage is added and the enemy is knocked away. The more one's own Parting Sorrow stacks, the more damage is done.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_07_1=This movement allows you to add one layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">Death Do Us Part</font> state to your character every second: Defense is reduced, but movement speed and damage inflicted from your hits are increased. The more you stack this state, the more damage you deal<br>When attacking enemies in this state, damage dealt is based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Parting Sorrow</font> you have.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_lbc_08_1=No joy in life and don't fear of death. Anger motivates the potential: increase much movement speed, Move power and defense, lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf02sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in range, target will be affected by Muddle, cannot attack and use skills.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front, affected targets will suffer extra damage when using Flying Skill.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in range and attach <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font> to make them fall. <br>Skill does not require channeling when used in the air, a chance to knock target down, the stronger your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> is, the higher the chance to knock down target.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in the front; <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font>, it can use Parry for 3 seconds.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Attempts to block the skill will cause the target to be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font> and fall.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_05_1=Block attack. Each successful parry will strengthen your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> Sword Chi exists, Turbulent Rapids will cast for less time, and Pure Spring Flows Forth will deal more damage.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, each strike boosts sword chi; <br>Works better when target has <font color="#FFAE00">Muddie</font>; <br>Works better when used it the air.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_06sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets, targets with Muddle take more damage.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_qfjf_07_1=Charge and deal {@0:伤害包} damage, targets who cannot Parry take bonus damage. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_01_1=Gather Energy in the blade, then attack in one handsome flourish. The enemy gets hit by the chi force and takes {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then the wound will be torn apart, and continue to bleed.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_02_1=Wield blade outrageously, the blade chi will impact enemies in front and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, then this attack will knock target down.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_03_1=Charging move, chop enemies several times to deal {@0:伤害包}. The force will inflict the <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, and your enemy will take continous damage for a while.<br> (This skill can be used alongside a Flying Skill to approach an enemy quickly.)
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_04_1=Simple blade skill, chop towards head to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Enemy's parry will be broken, and target will take <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, taking continuous damage for a period of time.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_05_1=Parry and counter enemy attacks, dealing continuous damage for a period of time. Damage dealt is affected by Melee Damage.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_06_1=Dance of Death, a chopping finishing-move that will deal {@0:伤害包} to target.<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, he will take extra damage.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_07_1=Your soul soars through the nine heavens to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies;<br>If you execute this move while airborne you can select an area of effect on the ground and knock back enemies in it. If the targets is under the influence of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade</font>, his wounds will bleed more profusely. Enemies not in that state will then be put under it.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_shd_07sky_1=Deal {@0:伤害包}, when you are in the air. When you hit the ground you will repel enemies in the area. If an enemy is wounded by Soul Losing Blade, the wound will be torn apart, otherwise this will inflict the Soul Losing Blade wound on your enemy.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd01_1=Mighty blow, the blade chi will hurt enemy meters away, and deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>When target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, target will take extra hard damage.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd02_1=Charging attack, roll and attack target to deal {@0:伤害包}. When target is taking <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>, will take extra hard damage.<br>This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd03_1=Chop continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front. The enemy will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and will temporarily be unable to use skills.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd04_1=Merciless attack, deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If an enemy tries to block, they will suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font> and will temporarily be unable to use skills.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd05_1=Block attack - a successful parry will activate potential and attach hard damage to your attacks.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd06_1=Attack enemies while moving, deal {@0:伤害包}, and make them suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd07_1=Send enemies flying to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. When the target is under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state, he will sustain additional hard damage. <br/>Your chi is like searing lightning through the air, cutting through those within an area of effect and banning enemies under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> state from using attacks for a short period and causing them to endure additional hard damage.
desc_newworld_mikunpc_zfd07sky_1=Shock your enemies while you're in the air.
desc_newworld_s_01_1=Blast damage to single target. Bleeding will occur if the target does not parry, making it lose 1% HP per second. Lasts 5 sec with 5 sec cooldown.
desc_newworld_s_02_1=Causes damage to a single target with 30% chance of adding a layer of Snake Venom. Increases 10% of internal skills and flying skills per stack, 5 Stacks tops. Lasts 1 min on every stack with 3 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_s_03_1=Causes damage to a single target. If the target is in the Snake Venom state, parry endurance will be reduced every time it parries an attack. Lasts 6 min with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_s_04_1=Blast damage to enemies in a 360 degrees radius of 3 meters. Venom Strikes the Heart will be gained if the target does not parry, making it unable to jump and lose 2% HP per second. Lasts 5 seconds with 6 seconds cooldown.
desc_newworld_wmd_001_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_002_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_003_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_004_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_005_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_006_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_007_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_008_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_009_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_010_1=<s>
desc_newworld_wmd_011_1=<s>
desc_newworld_xiyu_jwd_bff01_1=<s>
desc_newworld_xiyu_jwd_bff02_1=<s>
desc_newworld_xiyu_jwd_bff03_1=<s>
desc_newworld_xiyu_jwd_bff04_1=<s>
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj01_1=Charging skill, wield sword and attack twice, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj02_1=Special mental skill, can switch the rate of HP and Energy.<br>Once this skill reaches a higher level, the cost in chi when switching will be less.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj03_1=Special breathing mental skill, can recover some Energy in a short period.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj04_1=A yang attack. Enemies affected by the sword's chi will take {@0:伤害包} and suffer an internal injury. They will be slowed and suffer damage over time.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj05_1=A swift sword slash. Break target's block and cause {@0: damage bag} to the target;<br>It enables you to absorb target's Energy after breaking target's block.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj06_1=Block attack, each successful parry will recover your Energy.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj07_1=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj08_1=A yin attack. Enemies affected by the sword's chi will be repelled and take {@0:伤害包} and lose Energy for a time.
desc_newworld_xiyu_tjj09_1=Attack enemies and deal {@0: damage bag}. Targets hit will be unable to release any flying skills over 5 secs.
