desc_skill_home_gust01_1=Help the home owner clean up the house to increase the its durability within the daily limit.
desc_skill_home_gust02_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 10 Taels<br> to help the home owner clean up the mess caused by vandals.
desc_skill_home_gust04_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 20 Taels<br> to dance for the home owner and win the attention of the crowds.
desc_skill_home_master07_1=Greet the visitors and strengthen them. Visitors can gain a buff of extra 50% cultivation speed, which lasts 30 minutes.
desc_skill_home_master08_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 20 Taels<br> to dance for the visitors.
desc_skill_home_master_01_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 10 Taels<br> to clean up the mess caused by unexpected guests.
desc_skill_home_master_02_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 3 Taels<br> to use acupoints to immobilize people.
desc_skill_home_master_03_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 3 Taels<br> to subdue criminals.
desc_skill_home_master_04_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 3 Taels<br> to strip the unexpected guests and tie them up.
desc_skill_home_master_05_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 5 Taels<br> to expel the unexpected guests. If they entered the room by lock-picking, then they are unable to do so in the next 3 hours.
desc_skill_home_thief01_1=Vandalize the home, leaving dirty water on the floor.
desc_skill_home_thief02_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 3 Taels<br> to forge a demolition order to reduce a home's durability within daily limits.
desc_skill_home_thief05_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 3 Taels<br> to vandalize the home, greatly reducing its durability.
desc_skill_home_thief06_1=Silver Cost: <img src="gui\common\money\yyb.png" valign="center" only="line" data="" /> 20 Taels<br> to dance for the home owner and win his sympathy.
