desc_skill_jhpk_01_1=Use it on players to find out if they are hostile towards you.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_flxmz01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. <br>Targets are inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font>, receiving more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Uplifting Wind"</font>. This condition can be stacked 8 times.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_flxmz04_1=Attack with your staff, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front of you.<br>When the target's parry is broken by the attack, the target's recovery time increases by 1 second and unable to parry for an additional 0.5 second.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_flxmz05_1=When you parry successfully, your attacker enters the <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state, during which the target receives more damage from your <font color="#f9fc00">"Stormrunner"</font> attack. Your <font color="#f9fc00">"Force of Vacuum"</font> attack now can also knock your target back. This effect lasts 20 seconds, and can be stacked at most 6 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in a rainy day, the enemy trying to attack you can be injured by thunder and lightning. </font>
desc_sz_Npc_jh_flxmz06_1=Stun enemies in an area of effect for 3.5 seconds, or until the target is hit. <br>Create a <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font> that prevents targets from using Flying skills. This field lasts 10 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Makes the target dazed for 5 seconds when it is released in a rainy day.  </font>
desc_sz_Npc_jh_flxmz07_1=Attack quickly, dealing {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br>If enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font> state. Then the target will be pulled toward you. Each time this happens, it will Remove 1 stacked effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Anger of Thunder"</font>. <br>You can attack while using the skill.<br/><font color="#4169E1">If you execute the final strike and the target is in Anger of Thunder state. The target will be thrown and hurt by thunder and lightning.  </font>
desc_sz_Npc_jh_flxmz08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br><font color="#f9fc00">"Wind and Thunder Stance"</font>: The target is slowed and receives damage. The damage increases as the distance between the target and the user shortens. <br>If target is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Storm"</font> state, your attack does extra damage and removes the target's buffs. <br><font color="#4169E1">This skill can only score a critical hit in rainy days.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_hjdf02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>A successful break of the enemy's parry adds 3 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> to player.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_hjdf04_1=Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_hjdf06_1=Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_hjdf07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">fainting</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 stacked effect. <br>Player may attack freely when status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use.
desc_sz_Npc_jh_hjdf_01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Add 3 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> to player with successful attack to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers for 15 seconds.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to an enemy in front of you. <br><font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: Skill becomes a charging attack, damage increases.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf01_hide_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf02_1=With a flurry of cuts, inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.<br>"<font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: damage is increased.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf02_hide_1=With a flurry of cuts, inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf03_1=Stuns enemies within 8 meters for 3 seconds (stun effectiveness decreases steadily), and causes {@0:伤害包} damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">'The Benevolent is Invincible'</font>: Pull max 5 enemies within 20m to you and stun them for 3 seconds, stunning effect decreases progressivelyPulls up to 5 enemies within 20 meters to your side, and stuns them for 3 seconds (stun effectiveness decreases steadily), and causes {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf03_hide_1=Pulls up to 5 enemies within 20 meters to your side, and stuns them for 3 seconds (stun effectiveness decreases steadily), and causes {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf04_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect when using this skill, and you may use Flying Skills. <br>"<font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: damage increases, You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>effect when using this skill/
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf04_hide_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>effect when using this skill, and you may use Flying Skills.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf05_1=Enter the <font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies" </font>effect, increasing the levels of your other skills. This effect has six levels, and lasts for for 60 seconds. One level is removed for each blow you strike, and the "A Kind Person Has No Enemies" effect is completely lost if you switch to another weapon or use a skill in another effect.<br> You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>when using this skill.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf07_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to any enemies in front of you. <br>When defeating an enemy Parry: Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: damage is increased, and the range of your attacks increases to 20 meters in front of you.
desc_xsh_Npc_jh_yydf07_hide_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to any enemies within 20 meters in front of you. <br>When defeating an enemy parry, Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.
