desc_BSZ_skill_bwy_gdj_1=Deals a small amount of damage and applies Speechless with Sadness. Speechless with Sadness: Renders the target silenced for 10 seconds; Uses the target to knock down all nearby units and apply Weep to them. Weep: Keyboard shortcuts get mixed up and forbids the use of Flying Skills for 10 seconds.
desc_BSZ_skill_hlmd_gdj_1=Deals a small amount of damage to targets within range. Converts 50% of your total damage dealt into HP. Grants 20 stacks of Soul. Soul: Stacks up to 50 times; Each stack of Soul can nullify an incoming damage.
desc_BSZ_skill_tdzl_gdj_1=Uses Feint to nullify target parry, dealing a small amount of damage and paralyzing the target for 2 seconds.
desc_BSZ_skill_thc_gdj_1=Gathers strength for 3 seconds, dealing a medium amount of damage to nearby enemies and applying a 6-second Lament For Kismet to them. Lament For Kismet: Each of your Crit has a chance to stun targets affected by Lament For Kismet.
desc_BSZ_skill_xc_gdj_1=Deals a small amount of damage to targets within range and sends them flying. If more than 30 targets are hit, enter a state of Chi Exhausted. Chi Exhausted: Decreases External Defense to 100% for 3 seconds.
desc_BSZ_skill_xjt_gdj_1=Deals a small amount of damage to targets within range. Applies Fiend to them. Fiend: your movement deals a medium amount of damage to targets within range and sends them flying—When this damage is done 5 times, knock down yourself and deal great damage. Fiend lasts 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_JYZ_xmc_01_1=Deals one-hit kill level damage. Gathers strength for 4 seconds. Leaves an area of potent poison on the ground.
desc_Boss_JYZ_xmc_02_1=Grants yourself a shield that absorbs damage
desc_Boss_JYZ_xmc_03_1=Knocks back nearby enemies and deals area of effect damage
desc_Boss_JYZ_xmc_04_1=Uses multiple hits to deal damage
desc_Boss_JYZ_xmc_05_1=Uses Jade Bee Poison Needles to deal damage to 30 random targets. Targets affected by Jade Bee Poison Needles have their Attack reduced 100% and lose 5% Energy and 1% HP every second.
desc_Boss_JYZ_xmc_06_1=Deals damage. Nullifying an enemy parry will cause the enemy to be Paralyzed for 3 seconds and clear its Threat.
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and debuffs them with <font color="#FFAE00">A Halt to the Rain</font>: Attack of <font color="#f9fc00">Cold Bronze Ringing</font> causes temporary fainting. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>You can move freely while using this skill, as well as gaining <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. <br>This move can be used within five seconds. After being used three times or more, it will be accompanied with <font color="#f9fc00">Knocking Away</font>. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and with the final strike <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Away</font> the enemy who does not parry. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf05_1=Ride chariots to crush those mountain strongholds. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Stampede</font>: Your next attack will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> target for three seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf06_1=The national insult is yet to be avenged. Your servants' shame: When will it be erased? Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Uncontrollable Rage</font>: Gives you two Rage every second, increases external attack damage by 10%, inflicts extra 10% damage when you are attacked and lasts 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf07_1=I looked up and yelled, feeling excited. After parrying a critical strike, enter <font color="#FFAE00">Making Blood Boil</font>: Reduces received damage by 20% for three seconds. It's only available once within 25 seconds.
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_cf_yjqf08_sky_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Boss_dbz_wgh01_1=When a target who does not parry is attacked, its HP Recovery Speed will be reduced by 90% for five seconds.
desc_Boss_dbz_wgh02_1=After successfully using the skill, you will only receive one point of damage if attacked. It lasts five seconds.
desc_Boss_dbz_wgh03_1=Deals damages to enemies within 10 meters with an AoE attack and decreases their HP Recovery Speed by 90%. Lasts five seconds.
desc_Boss_dbz_wgh04_1=Deals damages to enemies within 15 meters with an AoE attack. Targets who fail to parry will be knocked away and forbidden to use flying skills with continuous energy loss for 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_dbz_wgh05_1=If enemy's parry is broken, Knocks Down target and decreases its HP Recovery Speed by 90% for five seconds.
desc_Boss_gm_txjj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters. <br>Debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Nimble Batwing Sleeves</font>: Decreases 100 points of external defense and five points of internal defense. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 10 times.
desc_Boss_gm_txjj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Boss_gm_txjj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>This move will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Away</font> the enemy who does not parry. <br>Charge up the skill to increase its damage and range.
desc_Boss_gm_txjj04_1=Buffs teammates nearby with <font color="#FFAE00">Twilight Upon Snowy Mountains</font>: Absorbs damage (5% of Max HP) when you are under attack. Lasts 15 seconds.
desc_Boss_gm_txjj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within selected area. <br>Debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Enormous Generosity</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Decreases speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disables flying skills</font>. Lasts two seconds. Can be stacked up to five times. <br>(Do not move when using the skill.)
desc_Boss_gm_txjj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, makes target <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for three seconds.
desc_Boss_gm_txjj07_1=With a successful parry, <br>you and your teammates nearby enter <font color="#FFAE00">Strolling</font>: Inflicts 16 points of softness damage with your attack (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). Lasts five seconds.
desc_Boss_gm_txjj08_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Back</font> enemies and recovers 258 HP for you and your teammates nearby (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill.)
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw01_1=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Three Demon Faces</font>: With a success parry, you will debuff target with one <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and get a 5% chance to own one <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can own at most 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>The enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> can be activated by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, leading to some <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you 10 Rage.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Joy</font> (Damage increased by 10% and movement speed increased by 30%). Lasts four seconds.  <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If target debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> is not in defense status, you can ignore its <font color="#f9fc00">external defense</font>. <br>It takes three<font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters. Targets debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> will be <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for three seconds. <br>It takes three<font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 10 meters. Targets debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font>. <br>It takes three<font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw08_1=Gain one <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_Boss_nlb_tmw09_1=Forces enemies within 12 meters to dance with you andDeals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill.)
desc_Boss_xd_xdj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If your HP is below 75%, <font color="#f9fc00">Vampire</font> will be added to your attack. The lower your current HP is, the greater the Vampiric effect will be.
desc_Boss_xd_xdj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>This move will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Away</font> the enemy who does not parry.
desc_Boss_xd_xdj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, you will gain four stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Drinking</font>: A <font color="#f9fc00">Vampire</font> will be added to your attack and target will lose one stack of effect.
desc_Boss_xd_xdj04_1=<br>If enemy's parry is broken, you will gain <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>: Change <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Chant</font>. <br>The more you parry, the more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Chant</font> will be. <br>With more than five parries in <font color="#FF3030">Blood Weep</font>, a Stun will be added to <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Chant</font> attack.
desc_Boss_xd_xdj04_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>With more than five parries in <font color="#FF3030">Blood Weep</font>, a Stun will be added to the attack.
desc_Boss_xd_xdj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>Deals 30% splash damage to enemies nearby if their killing wills are no less than 600. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Boss_xd_xdj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Deals 30% splash damage to enemies nearby if their killing wills are no less than 600. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Boss_xd_xdj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>The lower your current HP is, the greater the skill damage will be. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> will be added to the attack when your HP is below 50%. <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill and you may use flying skills as well.)
desc_Boss_xdm_dt_yx_02_1=Gathers strength, buffing yourself with a 8-second Snatch the Burning Firewood that causes you to take an additional 1,000 HP damage each time you're hit. 8 seconds later, buffs yourself with Overhead Slash, increasing your damage dealt by 300%, Movement Speed by 20% for 8 seconds.
desc_Boss_xdm_dt_yx_03_1=Applies The Underworld Ruler to 5 targets in range. Targets affected by The Underworld Ruler deal 5% HP damage to two targets in 5 meters. Each time The Underworld Ruler takes effect, applies a stack of Dazed to targets affected by The Underworld Ruler. Targets affected by 5 stacks of Dazed will have their keyboard shortcuts mixed up for 5 seconds.
desc_Boss_xdm_dt_yx_04_1=The more far away targets within 20 meters are from you, the more damage they take.
desc_Boss_xdm_dt_yx_05_1=Deals great damage to multiple targets and knocks them back. If 5 or more targets are hit, removes Rage of all enemies, slows them by 50% for 5 seconds and causes them to be unable to gain Rage.
desc_Boss_xdm_gdj_BD_001_1=Slashes the target with great force, dealing massive damage. If the slash is not parried, decreases target External Defense by 100% for 10 seconds. If the slash is parried, sends the target flying.
desc_Boss_xdm_gdj_DS_001_1=Gathers strength for 6 seconds, then buffs yourself with a 10-second Subdue Soul that knocks down targets within 3 meters continuously and deals some damage to them. Sends them flying when Subdue Soul is over. (Dealing 25,000 total damage to this NPC while it's gathering strength will interrupt this skill and make the NPC take 10,000 HP damage.)
desc_Boss_xdm_gdj_KD_001_1=Sprays a special type of liquid under target foot, causing approaching targets to be poisoned (Causes a loss of 5% HP every 5 seconds) and have their keyboard shortcuts mixed up.
desc_Boss_xdm_sddh_q01_1=Deals damage to all targets and debuffs them. (The debuff causes a loss of 50 HP every second. Stacks up 10 times. Lasts 30 seconds.)
desc_Boss_xdm_sddh_q02_1=Deals a small amount of damage to a target. Deals great massive damage to targets standing 3 meters away from that target, sends them flying and causes them to be silenced for 10 seconds
desc_Boss_xdm_sddh_q03_1=Deals damage to multiple targets and applies a 5-second Stun to them
desc_Boss_xdm_sddh_q04_1=Debuffs a random target will a debuff that bounces to another target in 3 meters every 5 seconds. When there are 5 bounces, deals massive damage to the then-current target. (If the debuff stops its bounce before there are 5 bounces, deals a small amount of damage to the then-current target.)
desc_Boss_xdm_sddh_q05_1=Throws a bomb that detonates to deal great damage to the target
desc_Boss_xdm_smdh_01_1=Sink 'N' Float Combo: Deals damage, knocks down the target with the first hit and sends the target flying with the second hit
desc_Boss_xdm_smdh_02_1=Blood Fetter: Silences the target for 5 seconds if the hit of this skill is not parried by the target
desc_Boss_xdm_smdh_03_1=Blood Shortage: Snatches the target's weapon for 5 seconds if the hit of this skill is parried by the target
desc_Boss_xdm_smdh_04_1=Deals area of effect damage to targets nearby
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 4% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 10% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts Seven seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 5% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 6% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_4=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 7% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_5=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 8% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_6=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 9% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_7=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 10% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts four seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_8=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 10% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts five seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf01_9=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When hitting the enemy who does not parry, you can convert 10% of its <font color="#f9fc00">External Attack Accuracy</font> to yours. Lasts six seconds. Cannot be stacked. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>Each <font color="#FFAE00">critical strike</font> reduces Chi restoration time by one second for other skills in this move. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_cf_bwqf02_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>Each <font color="#FFAE00">critical strike</font> reduces Chi restoration time by one second for other skills in this move. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
