desc_CS_cf_bwqf07_1=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Unfavorable Timing</font> and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> with a successful parry: If you are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked away</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> in five seconds, enemies nearby will get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 45 seconds. (When <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> is activated, <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> will disappear.) The more seriously you are injured, the better <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> will be.
desc_CS_cf_bwqf07_10=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Unfavorable Timing</font> and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> with a successful parry: If you are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked away</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> in 10 seconds, enemies nearby will get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 25 seconds. (When <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> is activated, <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> will disappear.) The more seriously you are injured, the better <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> will be.
desc_CS_cf_bwqf07_2=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Unfavorable Timing</font> and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> with a successful parry: If you are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked away</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> in 5 seconds, enemies nearby will get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 40 seconds. (When <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> is activated, <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> will disappear.) The more seriously you are injured, the better <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> will be.
desc_CS_cf_bwqf07_3=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Unfavorable Timing</font> and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> with a successful parry: If you are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked away</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> in 5 seconds, enemies nearby will get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 35 seconds. (When <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> is activated, <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> will disappear.) The more seriously you are injured, the better <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> will be.
desc_CS_cf_bwqf07_4=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Unfavorable Timing</font> and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> with a successful parry: If you are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked away</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> in 5 seconds, enemies nearby will get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 30 seconds. (When <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> is activated, <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> will disappear.) The more seriously you are injured, the better <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> will be.
desc_CS_cf_bwqf07_5=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Unfavorable Timing</font> and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> with a successful parry: If you are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked away</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> in 5 seconds, enemies nearby will get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 25 seconds. (When <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> is activated, <font color="#FFAE00">Never Give Up</font> will disappear.) The more seriously you are injured, the better <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> will be.
