desc_CS_eqp_lzzy_1=Uses internal energy against damage. Lasts 15 seconds. A maximum of 20% of your HP can be used.
desc_CS_eqp_zzcf_1=Gain Resurgence and Overwhelmingly Sharp within five seconds: Accuracy and critical hit rates will be greatly increased. Your attack ignores target's parry.
desc_CS_gm_txjj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in 20 meters.<br>Applies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Silk Mesh Light Sleeves</font>—Reduces External Defense by 100 and Internal Defense by 5 for 10 seconds. Stacks up to 10 times.— to them.
