desc_CS_jh_bgd01_1=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage and stuns targets. Increases the attack range of Water, Thunder, Fire and Wind by 2 meters.<br>If the target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Puddle </font>, applies Wind, Thunder, Fire or Puddle to it.(There is a 20% chance to apply all these four debuffs to the target.)<br>Protects you with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> when you cast Puddle.
