desc_CS_jh_bgd02_1=Grants you a 7-second <font color="#FF3030">Earth </font>. While Earth is active, you will be immune to Knockdowns, Throwns and Knockbacks. Earth is a single-use effect.<br>If <font color="#FF3030">Mountain</font> is active on you when Earth is over, you will be restored to the same stats (HP and Energy) you had when Earth took effect.
