desc_CS_jh_bgd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Wind</font> to the target.<br>When <font color="#FF3030">Water</font> is active on you, knocks down targets not in the parrying.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
