desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_1=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Three Demon Faces</font>: With a success parry, you will debuff target with one <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and get a 5% chance to own one <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can own at most 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>The enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> can be activated by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, leading to some <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_10=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Three Demon Faces</font>: With a success parry, you will debuff target with one <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and get a 50% chance to own one <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can own at most 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>The enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> can be activated by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, leading to some <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
