desc_CS_nlb_yzx04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs the enemy with <font color="#FFAE00">Arching Heart</font>: If using skills within eight seconds, target gets <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for two seconds. <font color="#f9fc00">This</font> can be activated once.
