desc_CS_shxb_db_001_1=Recover Stolen Goods
desc_CS_shxb_db_1=Plunder Goods
desc_CS_single_bpyz_1=Flying needle deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, causes the target to be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Poisoned</font> for 10 seconds. (Targets affected by Poisoned take an additional 10% damage.)
desc_CS_single_bpyz_2=Flying needle deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, causes the target to be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Poisoned</font> for 10 seconds. (Targets affected by Poisoned take an additional 12% damage.)
desc_CS_single_bpyz_3=Flying needle deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, causes the target to be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 4 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Poisoned</font> for 10 seconds. (Targets affected by Poisoned take an additional 15% damage.)
desc_CS_single_dbgx_1=Blade Chi splashes against the target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, applies the effect of <font color="#FF3030">Tarnished Goddess</font> that causes the target to lose a large (Total loss of HP maxes out at 10% of the target's maximum HP) amount of HP over 10 seconds as well as to be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Tarnished Goddess</font> can only be used against players.
desc_CS_single_dbgx_2=Blade Chi splashes against the target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, applies the effect of <font color="#FF3030">Tarnished Goddess</font> that causes the target to lose a large (Total loss of HP maxes out at 12% of the target's maximum HP) amount of HP over 10 seconds as well as to be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Tarnished Goddess</font> can only be used against players.
desc_CS_single_dbgx_3=Blade Chi splashes against the target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, applies the effect of <font color="#FF3030">Tarnished Goddess</font> that causes the target to lose a large (Total loss of HP maxes out at 15% of the target's maximum HP) amount of HP over 10 seconds as well as to be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 20%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Tarnished Goddess</font> can only be used against players.
desc_CS_single_hfkl_1=Whirl in mid-air and attack enemies within 15 meters with Hidden Weapons, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Reduces 30% of target's <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> and 20% of <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Damage</font>. Lasts 10 seconds. <br>Cannot move when using the skill to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_single_hfkl_2=Whirl in mid-air and attack enemies within 15 meters with Hidden Weapons, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Reduces 30% of target's <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> and 20% of <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Damage</font>. Lasts 10 seconds. <br>Cannot move when using the skill to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_single_hfkl_3=Whirl in mid-air and attack enemies within 15 meters with Hidden Weapons, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Reduces 30% of target's <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> and 20% of <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Damage</font>. Lasts 10 seconds. <br>Cannot move when using the skill to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_single_lyq_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> enemies within 15 meters for two seconds and debuff them with <font color="#ff3030">Burning</font>, inflicting up to 5% of HP loss within five seconds (Burning works only with players). <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_single_lyq_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> enemies within 15 meters for three seconds and debuff them with <font color="#ff3030">Burning</font>, inflicting up to 7% of HP loss within seven seconds (Burning works only with players). <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_single_lyq_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> enemies within 15 meters for four seconds and debuff them with <font color="#ff3030">Burning</font>, inflicting up to 9% of HP loss within nine seconds (Burning works only with players). <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_single_mz_1=Changfeng Escorts can mount a horse <font color="#f9fc00">In Battle</font>. <br>(It can only be used on horses. Horse Whistle at the top of Backpack will be preferentially selected.)
desc_CS_single_mz_2=Escorts from Changfeng Escort Agency may get on horse <font color="#f9fc00">during a battle</font>. <br>(For horse mount only)
desc_CS_single_mz_3=Escorts from Changfeng Escort Agency may get on horse <font color="#f9fc00">during a battle</font>. <br>(For horse mount only)
desc_CS_single_nljqh_1=Place Heartless Flowers that will spray Toxic Fog. <br>Deals <font color="#f9fc00">40</font> points of Yin Damage each second to enemies within 15 meters (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). Reduces <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> by 20% and drops him down if target is flying. <br>Heartless Flower lasts 15 seconds.
desc_CS_single_nljqh_2=Place Heartless Flowers that will spray Toxic Fog. <br>Deals <font color="#f9fc00">55</font> points of Yin Damage each second to enemies within 15 meters (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). Reduces <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> by 20% and drops him down if target is flying. <br>Heartless Flower lasts 17 seconds.
desc_CS_single_nljqh_3=Place Heartless Flowers that will spray Toxic Fog. <br>Deals <font color="#f9fc00">72</font> points of Yin Damage each second to enemies within 15 meters (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage). Reduces <font color="#f9fc00">Movement Speed</font> by 20% and drops him down if target is flying. <br>Heartless Flower lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_single_sjhb_1=This skill is meant to be used by an intertwined pair. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, sends the target flying non-stop.
desc_CS_single_sjhb_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>This move will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Away</font> the enemy who does not parry. <br>Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Red Armor</font> when using the skill. <br><font color="#ff0000">(Using the skill requires one Ancient Tomb Destiny.)</font>
desc_CS_single_sjhb_3=This skill is meant to be used by an intertwined pair. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, sends the target flying non-stop.
desc_CS_single_tly_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters. <br>Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill, debuffing the enemy who does not parry with <font color="#ff3030">Confusion</font> for three seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_single_tly_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters. <br>Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill, debuffing the enemy who does not parry with <font color="#ff3030">Confusion</font> for three seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_single_tly_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters. <br>Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill, debuffing the enemy who does not parry with <font color="#ff3030">Confusion</font> for three seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_CS_single_xd_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within range and stuns them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_single_xd_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within range and stuns them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_single_xd_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within range and stuns them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_single_xhb_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and debuffs target with <font color="#FF3030">Soul Departure</font>: Makes target lose 2% of his current HP and Energy. Lasts eight seconds. (This effect works only with players and will not lead to death.)
desc_CS_single_xhb_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and debuffs target with <font color="#FF3030">Soul Departure</font>: Makes target lose 2% of his current HP and Energy. Lasts 10 seconds. (This effect works only with players and will not lead to death.)
desc_CS_single_xhb_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and debuffs target with <font color="#FF3030">Soul Departure</font>: Makes target lose 2% of his current HP and Energy. Lasts 12 seconds. (This effect works only with players and will not lead to death.)
desc_CS_single_xzqw_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Pulls nearby enemies to your location and sends them flying.<br>(The lower your HP, the higher damage dealt to enemies)
desc_CS_single_xzqw_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Pulls nearby enemies to your location and sends them flying.<br>(The lower your HP, the higher damage dealt to enemies)
desc_CS_single_xzqw_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Pulls nearby enemies to your location and sends them flying.<br>(The lower your HP, the higher damage dealt to enemies)
desc_CS_single_yfs_1=Summons a swarm of bees that sting enemies in 15 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Bee stings can wound enemies in the face and cause 300-second of disfiguring and unsightly <font color="#FFAE00">Bee Sting Swelling</font>.<br>With bees fluttering, humming and flitting around, enemies will be totally <font color="#FFAE00">Disorientated</font>: 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard shortcuts get mixed up</font>.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Bee Sting Swelling</font> can only be used against players.
desc_CS_single_yfs_2=Summons a swarm of bees that sting enemies in 15 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Bee stings can wound enemies in the face and cause 300-second of disfiguring and unsightly <font color="#FFAE00">Bee Sting Swelling</font>.<br>With bees fluttering, humming and flitting around, enemies will be totally <font color="#FFAE00">Disorientated</font>: 4-second <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard shortcuts get mixed up</font>.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Bee Sting Swelling</font> can only be used against players.
desc_CS_single_yfs_3=Summons a swarm of bees that sting enemies in 15 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Bee stings can wound enemies in the face and cause 300-second of disfiguring and unsightly <font color="#FFAE00">Bee Sting Swelling</font>.<br>With bees fluttering, humming and flitting around, enemies will be totally <font color="#FFAE00">Disorientated</font>: 5-second <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard shortcuts get mixed up</font>.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Bee Sting Swelling</font> can only be used against players.
desc_CS_single_yfz_1=Throws a needle that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the target for 2 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">debilitates</font> the target for 10 seconds (Debilitate: Reduces Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 20%.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Dehibilate</font> only works against players.
desc_CS_single_yfz_2=Throws a needle that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the target for 2 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">debilitates</font> the target for 10 seconds (Debilitate: Reduces Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 25%.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Dehibilate</font> only works against players.
desc_CS_single_yfz_3=Throws a needle that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the target for 2 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">debilitates</font> the target for 10 seconds (Debilitate: Reduces Brawn, Dexterity, Breath, Spirit and Stamina by 30%.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Dehibilate</font> only works against players.
desc_CS_single_zdhl_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>The enemy who does not parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for two seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
