desc_CS_xd_dyshd02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Converts 25% of the damage you deal into HP.<br>Grants you a stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> each time you hit a target using the first hit of a skill. Each stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> can absorb 50% incoming damage.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
