desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_1=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 2%. Stacks up twice.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_10=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 5%. Stacks up 10 times.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_2=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 2%. Stacks up 3 times.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_3=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 3%. Stacks up 4 times.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_4=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 3%. Stacks up 5 times.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_5=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 4%. Stacks up 6 times.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_6=Parrying an attack<br>grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>: Increases the damage done by each skill under this skillset by 4%. Stacks up 7 times.<br>(When done with a skill or when a skill gets interrupted, nullifies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Momentum</font>.)
