desc_CS_xd_xdj03_1=A covert and close range AOE skill that deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Nullifying an enemy parry grants you 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Drink</font>. Blood Drink: The damage done by each skill under this skillset also partly transmutes into your HP. Each time you deal damage, nullifies a stack of Blood Drink.
desc_CS_xd_xdj03_10=A covert and close range AOE skill that deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Nullifying an enemy parry grants you 8 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Drink</font>. Blood Drink: The damage done by each skill under this skillset also partly transmutes into your HP. Each time you deal damage, nullifies a stack of Blood Drink.
