desc_CS_xd_xdj04_1=<br>Parrying an attack enters you into a state of <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font> changes into <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>the more parries are made, the greater damage will be done by <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>while in the state of <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>, making 5 or more parries grants <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font> so that each attack applies the effect of Stun.
