desc_Npc_cf_yjqf05_1=Ride chariots to crush those mountain strongholds. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Stampede</font>: Your next attack will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> target for three seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
