desc_Npc_cf_yjqf06_1=The national insult is yet to be avenged. Your servants' shame: When will it be erased? Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Uncontrollable Rage</font>: Gives you two Rage every second, increases external attack damage by 10%, increases extra 10% damage when you are attacked and lasts 7 seconds.
