desc_Npc_gm_ynsxj07_1=Parrying an attack<br>has a chance to grant <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Shade</font>: Largely increases Evasion and causes enemy Charge skills to be unable to lock onto your character. Lasts 2 seconds. Takes 45 seconds to cool down.<br>Switching to another skillset will nullify the effect of Willow Shade.
desc_Npc_gm_ynsxj07_2=Parrying an attack<br>has a chance to grant <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Shade</font>: Largely increases Evasion and causes enemy Charge skills to be unable to lock onto your character. Lasts 2 seconds. Takes 40 seconds to cool down.<br>Switching to another skillset will nullify the effect of Willow Shade.
