desc_Npc_jh_flxmz05_1=With a successful parry, debuffs attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>: Increases more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Stormrunner</font> and buffs <font color="#f9fc00">Force of Vacuum</font> with a Knock Away effect. Lasts 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to six times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in the rain, enemies who are trying to attack you can possibly be struck by lightning. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz05_2=With a successful parry, debuffs attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>: Increases more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Stormrunner</font> and buffs <font color="#f9fc00">Force of Vacuum</font> with a Knock Away effect. Lasts 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to eight times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in the rain, enemies who are trying to attack you can possibly be struck by lightning. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz05_3=With a successful parry, debuffs attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>: Increases more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Stormrunner</font> and buffs <font color="#f9fc00">Force of Vacuum</font> with a Knock Away effect. Lasts 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to 10 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in the rain, enemies who are trying to attack you can possibly be struck by lightning. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz05_4=With a successful parry, debuffs attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>: Increases more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Stormrunner</font> and buffs <font color="#f9fc00">Force of Vacuum</font> with a Knock Away effect. Lasts 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to 12 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in the rain, enemies who are trying to attack you can possibly be struck by lightning. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz05_5=With a successful parry, debuffs attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>: Increases more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Stormrunner</font> and buffs <font color="#f9fc00">Force of Vacuum</font> with a Knock Away effect. Lasts 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to 14 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in the rain, enemies who are trying to attack you can possibly be struck by lightning. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz05_6=With a successful parry, debuffs attacker with <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>: Increases more damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Stormrunner</font> and buffs <font color="#f9fc00">Force of Vacuum</font> with a Knock Away effect. Lasts 20 seconds. Can be stacked up to 16 times. <br/><font color="#4169E1">When parrying in the rain, enemies who are trying to attack you can possibly be struck by lightning. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz06_1=Dazes all target enemies. (This effect decreases progressively. It ends after 3.5 seconds or after getting attacked.) <br>Creates <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font>: Stagnates the air, leaving target enemies unable to use flying skills. Lasts 10 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Dazes the enemy and freezes his vision for five seconds when unleashing the skill in the rain. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz06_2=Dazes all target enemies. (This effect decreases progressively. It ends after 4 seconds or after getting attacked.) <br>Creates <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font>: Stagnates the air, leaving target enemies unable to use flying skills. Lasts 11 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Dazes the enemy and freezes his vision for five seconds when unleashing the skill in the rain. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz06_3=Dazes all target enemies. (This effect decreases progressively. It ends after 4.5 seconds or after getting attacked.) <br>Creates <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font>: Stagnates the air, leaving target enemies unable to use flying skills. Lasts 12 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Dazes the enemy and freezes his vision for five seconds when unleashing the skill in the rain. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz06_4=Dazes all target enemies. (This effect decreases progressively. It ends after five seconds or after getting attacked.) <br>Creates <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font>: Stagnates the air, leaving target enemies unable to use flying skills. Lasts 13 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Dazes the enemy and freezes his vision for five seconds when unleashing the skill in the rain. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz06_5=Dazes all target enemies. (This effect decreases progressively. It ends after 5.5 seconds or after getting attacked.) <br>Creates <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font>: Stagnates the air, leaving target enemies unable to use flying skills. Lasts 14 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Dazes the enemy and freezes his vision for five seconds when unleashing the skill in the rain. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz06_6=Dazes all target enemies. (This effect decreases progressively. It ends after 6 seconds or after getting attacked.) <br>Creates <font color="#FFAE00">Storm Chi Field</font>: Stagnates the air, leaving target enemies unable to use flying skills. Lasts 15 seconds. <br/><font color="#4169E1">Dazes the enemy and freezes his vision for five seconds when unleashing the skill in the rain. </font>
desc_Npc_jh_flxmz07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies around you. <br>Throws enemies affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>. Each throwing removes a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>. <br>Can move your character while casting this skill)<br/><font color="#4169E1">when it's a rainy day, at the time of the last hit of this skill, throws targets affected by Anger of Thunder high into the air to inflict thunder and lightning damage on them. </font>
