desc_Npc_jh_kxtd02_1_1=This jump-and-kick combo may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies in front of you (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds). <br>first attack: Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly..
