desc_Npc_jh_kxtd04_1_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. The higher your jump, the more damage you cause (height is calculated based on your starting position). <br>Skill will go into cooldown if you use the same skill on the same opponent consecutively within 6 seconds; player will jump again, and will knock down target if opponent is already on the ground. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_kxtd04_1_10=Kicking the nose and climbing on one's face, trampling on the enemy's head, causes{@0:伤害包}. The higher your jump, the more damage you cause (height is calculated based on your starting position).  <br>Skill will go into cooldown if you use the same skill on the same opponent consecutively within 6 seconds; player will jump again after using skill, and will deal Felled by a Blow to opponent if opponent is already on the ground.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
