desc_Npc_jh_liusha01_1=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
