desc_Npc_jh_liusha03_1=Strike with sufficient preparation, concentrating all you might to attack the enemy to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. The longer you charge up for the attack, the more damage you can inflict. You can boost your damage to a maximum of 100%.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha03_2=Strike with sufficient preparation, concentrating all you might to attack the enemy to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. The longer you charge up for the attack, the more damage you can inflict. You can boost your damage to a maximum of 100%.
