desc_Npc_jh_liusha03_6=Strike with sufficient preparation, concentrating all you might to attack the enemy to inflict {@0: 伤害包} damage. The longer you charge up for the attack, the more damage you can inflict. You can boost your damage to a maximum of 100%.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha04_1=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha04_2=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
