desc_Npc_jh_liusha04_5=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha04_6=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry.<br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha05_1=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha05_2=Energy surges through your sword and you strike at the ground to raise two mighty Energy waves, one larger than the other. The first wave disables the targets' flying skills while the second, more powerful Energy wave knocks them back. (This can only be used on the ground, as opposed to the water's surface.)<br/>This move was made famous by <font color="#FFAE00">Sima Huifeng</font> of the Longmen Inn.
