desc_Npc_jh_liusha06_6=Focus you inner Energy to protect your body and enhance your defense capacities. Every successful parry strengthens your own defenses.<br/>This skill is the wisdom of the unscrupulous merchant <font color="#FFAE00">Shen Yishan</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha07_1=Strike at the enemy's parry from an unexpected angle to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, causing the enemy to lose focus and hallucinate. This attack also causes the enemy to injure himself.<br/>This movement is one of the vicious methods of <font color="#FFAE00">Lu Xiaojiang</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha07_2=Strike at the enemy's parry from an unexpected angle to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, causing the enemy to lose focus and hallucinate. This attack also causes the enemy to injure himself.<br/>This movement is one of the vicious methods of <font color="#FFAE00">Lu Xiaojiang</font>.
