desc_Npc_jh_liusha08_1=Trample target into earth hardly, last 5 seconds, and deal damage with value of 5% current HP per second (138 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is one of stunts of Hell Dog <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font> in Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha08_2=Tramples down target into earth. Lasts five seconds. Deals damage equal to 5% of target's current HP every second. (Up to 164 points of damage. Can be affected by damage bonus.) <br/>This move is one of <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing's</font>  stunts, who is known as Hellhound of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha08_3=Tramples down target into earth. Lasts five seconds. Deals damage equal to 5% of target's current HP every second. (Up to 236 points of damage. Can be affected by damage bonus.) <br/>This move is one of <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing's</font>  stunts, who is known as Hellhound of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha08_4=Tramples down target into earth. Lasts five seconds. Deals damage equal to 5% of target's current HP every second. (Up to 288 points of damage. Can be affected by damage bonus.) <br/>This move is one of <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing's</font>  stunts, who is known as Hellhound of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha08_5=Tramples down target into earth. Lasts five seconds. Deals damage equal to 5% of target's current HP every second. (Up to 348 points of damage. Can be affected by damage bonus.) <br/>This move is one of <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing's</font>  stunts, who is known as Hellhound of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha08_6=Tramples down target into earth. Lasts five seconds. Deals damage equal to 5% of target's current HP every second. (Up to 407 points of damage. Can be affected by damage bonus.) <br/>This move is one of <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing's</font>  stunts, who is known as Hellhound of Longmen Inn.
desc_Npc_jh_liusha09_1=A small tornado sweeps the earth, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies directly in front of you and lifting them into the air.<br/>A wild gust swirls the sands as the setting sun bleeds into the sky. The fires of Longmen Inn never go out, such is power of that place, cunning and shifting like the sands.
