desc_Npc_jh_qxj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front. <br>Each attack grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bloodthirsty</font> to yourself: converts 1% of the damage you do into HP, can stack up to 10 times, lasts 14 seconds.<br>If the target attacked is not a player, increases your <font color="#FF3030">Hatred</font>.
