desc_Npc_jh_qxj05_1=Applies a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Alioth, Fifth of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: converts damage taken into HP, removes a stack when attacked, lasts 7 seconds. <br>Restored HP is no greater than 7% of your maximum HP.
desc_Npc_jh_qxj05_2=Applies 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Alioth, Fifth of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: converts damage taken into HP, removes a stack when attacked, lasts 7 seconds. <br>Restored HP is no greater than 7% of your maximum HP.
desc_Npc_jh_qxj05_3=Applies 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Alioth, Fifth of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: converts damage taken into HP, removes a stack when attacked, lasts 7 seconds. <br>Restored HP is no greater than 7% of your maximum HP.
desc_Npc_jh_qxj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies. <br>Deals extra damage when the victim's HP is lower than 30%. <br>While skill is being used, each attack the enemy chooses not to parry, or each time you are attacked, grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Mizar, Sixth of the Seven Stars</font>: increases external defense by 100 and internal defense by 10, can stack up to 49 times, lasts 14 seconds. <br>While skill is being used, you cannot move and you will be affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
