desc_Npc_jh_xfz02_1=<font color="#FF3030">Nothingness</font><br>If target is hostile, deal {@0:伤害包} damage and stun it for 3 seconds. remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font>. <br>If target is friendly. remove most of its crowd control effects and attach 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. (Cannot be used on yourself, cannot be used on an ally in battle while you are not)
desc_Npc_jh_xfz02_10=<br>if it's an enemy target: Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and stuns the victim for 3 seconds; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast <br>If it's a friendly target, nullifies most controlling effects and Hit Recovery effects, and applies to yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> that lasts 3 seconds. Yellow Super Armor: grants immunity from all hindering effects except stuns (cannot be casted on yourself)
