desc_Npc_jh_xfz07_1=<br>Makes a <font color="#FFAE00">Stationary Mark</font>, granting immunity from most of the pulls, knockdowns and throws to teammates within a 20-metre radius around you. Lasts 9 seconds. Applies a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> to yourself for each successful Parry on your part. Vajra Bonus: increases damage done by Impermanence, Nihility, Thunder Mark by 20%. Stacks up to 5 times. Lasts 30 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_zq01_1=Trip targets in front to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Dong Bin Raises a Jug"</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these skills. This effect lasts for for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status. <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike.
desc_Npc_jh_zq01_10=Turn and Lift a Jug, Force of a Thousand Tons, causes Enemies in front to Stumble and deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">“Dong Bin Raises a Jug”</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these Skills, and the state will continue for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this Skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status.  <br>(The grade of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>state is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike)
