desc_Npc_jh_zq03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage <br>to nearby enemies, which gives them a <font color="#FFAE00">"Zhong Li Carries the Altar" </font>effect: movement speed is decreased by 10%, and they will fall when using the Flying Skill, clearing this effect. This effect lasts for 5 seconds. <br>This skill can knock back collapsed enemies. <br>When you start to use this skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status. <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike.
