desc_Npc_jh_zq06_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If you are at level 3 of <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike," </font>the last blow of this skill will knock down your target (no parry). <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_zq06_10=Hit Chest Drag Feet Bout of Madness, Swinging Step Drunken Leisure, brawling with your target deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If you are at 3rd level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike,” </font>the last blow of this Skill will knock down your target (no parry). <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
