desc_Npc_jh_zq07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>The last strike of this skill has a 10% chance of knocking down your target, if he does not parry. <br>Each level of <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>increases chance of knock down by 10%. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_zq07_10=Staggered Horn Cup Tally, Hold Wrist Throat Lock deals {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>The last strike of this Skill has a 10% chance of knocking down your target (has not parried). <br>Each level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike” </font>increases chance of knock down by 10%. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
