desc_Npc_jh_zq08_9=Attain <font color="#FFAE00">"Fairy Offers Wine" </font>status: Your movements will be slowed, but your evasion will improve. This effect lasts for for 15 seconds. <br>The greater your Alcohol Tolerance, the more potent this effect will be. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is low, your movement speed will be decreased by 20%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 5%. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is moderate, your movement speed will be decreased by 15%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 10%. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is high, your movement speed will be decreased by 10%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 15%. <br>If your Alcohol Tolerance is massive, your movement speed will be decreased by 5%, and your chance of Evasion will increase by 20%. <br>This effect will automatically be cleared after evading your opponent's attack, and you will receive a level 3 <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike." </font> <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike. You cannot receive level 3 <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>unless you parry.
desc_Npc_nlb_tmw01_1=Enter <font color="#f9fc00">Three Demon Faces</font>: With a success parry, you will debuff target with one <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and get a chance to own one <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can own at most 10<font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>The enemy's <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> can be activated by <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, leading to some <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>. <br>It costs three <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
