desc_Npc_nlb_tmw08_1=Gain one <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>. <br>It costs three <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
