desc_Npc_nlb_yzx03_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Sorrow of Departure Expression</font>: A successful parry leads to one <font color="#FFAE00">Sorrow of Departure</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">It</font> can be stacked up to nine times. Lasts 30 seconds. <br>It takes three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Sorrow of Departure</font> to use <font color="#f9fc00">Sorrow of Departure Expression (Hidden)</font>: Inject internal energy into the seeds and spread them to get <font color="#FFAE00">Vine Barrier</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Vine Barrier</font> deals external attack damage to enemies within five meters and twines around their legs, making them <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for two seconds.
