desc_Npc_xd_dyshd02_1=Deals {@0 : 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When attacking, it also inflicts the Vampiric effect equal to 25% of the damage.<br>The first hit on the targets grants you a stack of Soul state. Each stack of Soul can reduce the damage taken from one strike by 50%.<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
