desc_Npc_xd_xdj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>The lower your HP is, the greater damage the skill damage will be; <br>while your HP is less than 50%, applies <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> to every attack.<br>(During the cast time, you will be protected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>. You can use Flying Skills when casting this skill.)
