desc_gmp_hd_txjj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in 20 meters.<br>Applies the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Silk Mesh Light Sleeves</font>—Reduces External Defense by 100 and Internal Defense by 5 for 10 seconds. Stacks up to 10 times.— to them.
desc_gmp_hd_txjj02_1=<s>
desc_gmp_hd_txjj03_1=Sprout Thousands Of Buds. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, <font color="#f9fc00">sends</font> it flying.<br>The longer time you gather strength for this skill, the greater damage will be dealt.
desc_gmp_hd_txjj04_1=Grants nearby teammates the effect of<font color="#FFAE00"> Mountain Dusk Snow</font> that absorbs incoming damage equal to 5% of their own respective HPs over 15 seconds.
desc_gmp_hd_txjj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a target.<br>Each hit of this skill applies<font color="#FFAE00"> Tribute To The Matronly</font> to the enemy: <font color="#f9fc00">Slow</font> the target and <font color="#f9fc00">Forbid the use of Flying Skills </font>. Lasts 2 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times.<br>
desc_gmp_hd_txjj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When enemy parry is destroyed, applies a 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> to it.
desc_gmp_hd_txjj07_1=Parrying an attack grants you and nearby teammates<font color="#FFAE00"> Walk Past </font>: Your hit deals additional damage for 5 seconds.
desc_gmp_hd_txjj08_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Knocks back</font> nearby enemies. Heals you and nearby teammates for a certain amount of HP over time for 5 seconds.<br>(During the cast time, you will be protected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>)
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj02_1=<s>
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When you finish casting the skill, you will flee from the hit location immediately to avoid taking subsequent enemy damage.
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Causes enemies hit to be in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font>, The last hit of this skill sends targets flying if that hit is not parried by the target.
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the hit of the skill is not parried by the target, knocks down the target.
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj07_1=Parrying an attack<br>has a chance to grant <font color="#FFAE00">Willow Shade</font>: Largely increases Evasion and causes enemy Charge skills to be unable to lock onto your character. Lasts 2 seconds. Takes 45 seconds to cool down.<br>Switching to another skillset will nullify the effect of Willow Shade.
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj08_1=<s>
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj01_1=A yin attack. Enemies affected by the sword's chi will be repelled and take {@0:伤害包} and lose Energy for a time.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj02_1=Special mental skill, can switch the rate of HP and Energy.<br>Once this skill reaches a higher level, the cost in chi when switching will be less.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj03_1=A unique breathing technique that recovers some Energy in a short period.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj04_1=A yang attack. Enemies affected by the sword's chi will take {@0:伤害包} and suffer an internal injury. They will be slowed and suffer damage over time.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj05_1=Overcome the parry of the enemy in front of you, causing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>You will recover your Energy if your enemy's defenses have already been broken.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj06_1=Block movement, each successful parry will recover your Energy.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj07_1=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj08_1=A yin attack, the enemies affected by the sword chi will be repelled, and take {@0:伤害包}, lose Energy in a while.
desc_gmp_newworld_tjj09_1=Attack enemies and deal {@0: damage bag}. The hitted targets will be unable to release any flying skills over 5 secs.
