desc_jn_boss_srz0101_1=Attacking while moving deals damage to enemies in front of you; <br>Each critical hit decreases<font color="#FFAE00">[Demons Plunder the Soul]</font>. 2 second Chi recovery time.<br>When you have more than 60 rage, each critical hit stuns for 0.5 seconds. <br> (The higher your rage, the higher the critical hit rate)
desc_jn_boss_srz0102_1=Breaking Emptiness Chop - Attack targets in front of you; <br>When countering a parry, you can knock the target down and temporarily deal higher critical damage; <br>When your rage is higher than 60, you can launch the target when countering the parry. <br> (The higher your rage, the higher the critical hit rate)
desc_jn_boss_srz0103_1=Demon Heart and Ghost Hands, Thoughts of Desire Thriving: Pull target toward yourself and damage them.
desc_jn_boss_srz0105_1=Charge and lacerate target with demon claws and vigorously throw them. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach target)
desc_jn_boss_srz0106_1=Blood Killing. Like eating raw meat and drinking blood. Kick over the Target, kill with a Dagger, and cause {@0:伤害包}.<br>Drink the enemies' blood at the same time to heal its own Wounds. Blood Drinking effect is 20 percent. (Attacking will be parried and having no effect of Blood Drinking.)
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_001_1=Secret of Metal
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_002_1=Secret of Wood
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_003_1=Secret of Water
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_004_1=Secret of Fire
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_005_1=Secret of Earth
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_006_1=Cosmic Six Stance. Pulls back five players nearby and debuffs them with Paralyze.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_007_1=Cosmic Six Stance. Knocks Down Paralyzed players and debuffs players who are not Paralyzed with Slow Down.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_008_1=Cosmic Six Stance. Single target skill. Charges to target and debuffs him with Stun.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_009_1=Cosmic Six Stance. AoE attack. Attaches buffs to eight players within 10 yards, costing them more Flying Skill Points when using Flying Skills.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_010_1=Cosmic Six Stance. Loading skill. After the skill is loaded, inflicts damage to players in the back 120 degree arc and attaches buffs to them, causing temporary vision loss if they move.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_011_1=Cosmic Six Stance. Knocks Away up to 20 players within eight yards and givens you buffs that can reflect 100% of your damage back.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_012_1=Leisure Staff. Inflicts damage to players in the front 150 degree arc and debuffs one of the players with Paralyze. Other players may click to remove this effect.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_013_1=Leisure Staff. Knocks Down up to six players within five yards and add special buffs to them.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_014_1=Leisure Staff. Increases movement speed with a speed-up buff.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_015_1=Leisure Staff. Stuns players in the front 180 degree arc within 10 meters and attaches Stun buffs to them, making them act like laughing.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_016_1=Leisure Staff. Attaches Exquisite buffs to players who get hit: When buff ends, male players' facial textures will be changed and female players will lose Internal Energy and get fainted.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_017_1=Heaven Split Blade. Knocks Down male players and Paralyzes female players.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_018_1=Heaven Split Blade. Pulls back any players within 10 yards.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_019_1=Heaven Split Blade. Summons NPCs for help.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_020_1=Heaven Split Blade. Adds Flame to front players, causing constant HP loss: Players with more than 50% HP will not be able to use Flying Skills for five seconds and players with less than 50% HP will suffer keyboard settings randomized for three seconds.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_021_1=Heaven Split Blade. Deals damage to players ranging between 5 to 30 yards and adds special buffs to them.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_022_1=Firmament Sword. Charges a single target and disables his skills with a bleeding effect.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_023_1=Firmament Sword. Attaches defense breaking buffs to targets, making them unable to parry within three seconds. Knocks Down target if the player does not parry.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_024_1=Firmament Sword. Increases movement speed and deals damage to players nearby by knocking them away.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_025_1=Firmament Sword. Deals damage to the player on the back and attaches a stack of buff to him. If the player still has this buff after NPCs have been released, he will get a Slow-down buff and faint when it reaches 10 stacks.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_026_1=Firmament Sword. Unleashes Sword Chi. Add special effect to front players and gain a Shield for a 20% Damage Reduction.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_027_1=Swaying Palm. When target is hit, debuffs him with Wind effect, inflicting extra damage if he is attacked by Fire Burning.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_028_1=Swaying Palm. Knocks Back players in the front 180 degree arc within 10 meters.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_029_1=Swaying Palm. Deals more damage if targets is debuffed with Wind effect; if not, inflicts damage by debuffing him with Fire effect.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_030_1=Drifting Palm. Target gets Paralyzed with a Lightning Strike. His teammates approaching him will be knocked away.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_031_1=Drifting Palm. Pulls Back any players within 15 yards and debuff them, causing continuous damage and disabling flying skills.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_032_1=Escort Novice
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_033_1=Escort
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_034_1=Escort. Charges a single target and debuffs him with Bleeding effect.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_035_1=Escort. Strikes floor and stuns all players within five yards.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_036_1=Escort. Knocks Down players in the front 120 degree arc within 8 yards.
desc_jn_cfbj_dbdh_037_1=Escort. Knocks Away players in the front 180 degree arc within 8 yards.
