desc_jn_gmphd_01_027_1=Leng Qingqian's ultimate skill: Deals some damage to the multiple enemies. If the target is airborn, it will be grounded; if the target is on the ground, she adds the No-Flying-Skill debuff onto the target and paralyzes the target for a few seconds.
desc_jn_gmphd_01_028_1=Leng Qingqian's ultimate skill: Inflicts some effects to the enemies in a 10-yard-radius area. The skill sends the non-Enduring enemy flying and deals some random damage (1-10,000) to the Enduring enemy. The skill also creates three swords in a 10-yard-radius area, dealing sustained damage to the enemies nearby.
