desc_lmbj_bdyw_001_1=Escort Leader Exclusive Skill - Lion Roaring: Stuns enemies nearby for three seconds. Stuns bandit leader debuffed with Song of Integrity with a 30 seconds cooldown.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_002_1=Repairman Exclusive Skill - Song of Integrity: Provides 80% Damage Reduction for Caravans. Controls bandit leader. When Stirring the Mountains and Sea is used, increases damage equal to 10% of target's Max HP. Cooldown: 10 seconds.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_003_1=Escort Leader Exclusive Skill: Randomly debuffs one player with Test Taker to take a quiz with Local Bully. Cooldown: 10 seconds.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_004_1=Escort Leader Exclusive Skill: Debuffs yourself with Test Taker to take a quiz with Local Bully. Cooldown: 20 seconds.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_jiasu1_1=Escort Leader Exclusive Skill: Increases caravan speed when it displays One or Two above caravan. Cooldown: 10 seconds.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_jiasu3_1=Escort Leader Exclusive Skill: Increases caravan speed when it displays Three or Four above caravan. Cooldown: 10 seconds.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_jiasu4_1=Escort Leader Exclusive Skill: Increases caravan speed when it displays Five or Six above caravan. Cooldown: 10 seconds.
desc_lmbj_bdyw_psdh_1=Escort Novice Exclusive Skill - Stirring the Mountains and Sea: Knocks Away targets with combo palm strikes. Debuffs bandit leader with Song of Integrity, dealing damage equal to 10% of his Max HP and knocks him away. Cooldown: 10 seconds.
