desc_nlb_dy_01_1=Deals damage equal to 10% of target's Max HP plus 200 points. (Requirements: Dance With Heart stack one or higher, Nianluo stack four.)
desc_nlb_dy_02_1=Deals damage equal to 30% of target's Max HP plus 200 points. (Requirements: Dance With Heart stack two or higher, Nianluo stack eight.)
desc_nlb_dy_03_1=Gains a protection against opponent's interference skills during a dance fight. (Requirements: Dance With Heart stack three or higher, Nianluo stack six.)
desc_nlb_dy_04_1=Causes keyboard settings randomized for 20 seconds. (Requirements: Dance With Heart stack four or higher, Nianluo stack eight.)
desc_nlb_dy_05_1=Gains Dance With Heart stack six after using it. (Activated when reaching Dance With Heart stack five.)
desc_nlb_dy_06_1=Deals huge damage to the enemy. (Requirements: Dance With Heart stack five, Nianluo stack 15.)
desc_pet_dismiss_huli_1=Dismiss the  Fox
desc_pet_dismiss_mianyang_1=Disband your Pets
desc_pet_huli_act01_1=Use it to disguise as a tiger
desc_pet_mianyang_act01_1=Caress it and put you in a good mood (Increases attack distance of Wild Goose Flying Skill and Jump Across the Cloud)
desc_pet_mianyang_act02_1=It is circling around you.
desc_pet_mianyang_act03_1=It is now disguising as a wolf.
desc_pet_new_huli_warning_1=Your pet seems to sense some dangerous traps nearby. Its uneasiness alerts you. <br>Increase your ability to observe traps for five minutes.
desc_pet_search_1_1_1=Search for Minks
desc_pet_search_4_1_1=Search for Minks
desc_pet_search_7_1_1=Search for Minks
desc_pet_search_huli_1_1=Search people
desc_riding_gongji_1=Deals damage equal to 20% of target's current HP. (Works only with the leader, costing 80 points of Thirsty.)
desc_riding_heshui_1=Use Drinking Water to you or your teammates.
desc_riding_qusan_1=It can clear the debuff of the dust storm. (Use it on the escort, costing 30 Thirsty.)
desc_skill_gdj_xdm_xgzm_1=Blood Coffin and Blood Blade come up
desc_skill_gumu_buniao001_01_1=Use a special technique to attract sparrows nearby closer to you and catch the sparrow nearest to you.
desc_skill_gumu_buniao001_1=Use a special technique to attract sparrows nearby closer to you and catch the sparrow nearest to you.
desc_skill_gumu_buniao002_01_1=Dash forward and catch the sparrow far away.
desc_skill_gumu_buniao002_1=Dash forward and catch the sparrow far away.
desc_skill_gumu_buniao003_01_1=Reach out suddenly and catch the sparrow nearby.
desc_skill_gumu_buniao003_1=Reach out suddenly and catch the sparrow nearby.
desc_skill_gumu_bushoujia_1=<s>
desc_skill_gumu_huoshi001_1=Reach out and catch the running rabbit.
desc_skill_gumu_huoshi002_1=Dash forward and catch the rabbit there.
desc_skill_hpzz_bc_002_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Restores 50% HP for all allies within a 10-meter radius. Also gains a stack of Yu Xi Pill. Stacks up to five times and restores 50% HP. Lasts 15 seconds.
desc_skill_hpzz_bc_003_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Plant a Bai Rong Spore Flower in a selected area and it will produce pollen-covered spores in the next six seconds. Each spore lasts 30 seconds. By touching it players can get one packet of pollen.
desc_skill_hpzz_bc_004_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Buffs yourself or your allies with Nurture Flowers With Blood effect, dealing 20% HP damage. Target will not be able have this buff in the next two minutes.  Target gets 30 packets of pollen.
desc_skill_hpzz_fs_002_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Builds Flower Barrier in a selected area, slowing down all NPCs within three meters by 95%. Lasts five seconds.
desc_skill_hpzz_fs_003_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Sprinkles a target within 15 meters with pollen, slowing down his speed by 95%.
desc_skill_hpzz_fs_004_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Leaves allies immune from all damage for 15 seconds. Also keeps them immune to damage caused by explosive monsters.
desc_skill_hpzz_jg_004_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Deals Instant Kill damage to target.
desc_skill_hpzz_kz_002_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Sprinkles in a selected area with poison pollen, slowing down all attackers within three meters by 50%. Lasts five seconds.
