desc_skill_nlb_dhl_002_1=Wear blue flower basket
desc_skill_nlb_dhl_003_1=Wear purple flower basket
desc_skill_nlb_dhl_004_1=Wear pink flower basket
desc_skill_nlb_hf_zw_001_1=Gains attribute alteration effect for War Dance skills.
desc_skill_nlb_hf_zw_002_1=Gains attribute alteration effect for War Dance skills.
desc_skill_nlb_hf_zw_003_1=Gains attribute alteration effect for War Dance skills.
desc_skill_nlb_hf_zw_004_1=Gains attribute alteration effect for War Dance skills.
desc_skill_nlb_hfsj_csml_1=Use pollen on target, making him stunned and keyboard settings randomized.
desc_skill_nlb_hfsj_dw_1=Use it on you or a target. Flowers will be falling in the next 10 minutes and butterflies will gather around every 10 seconds.
desc_skill_nlb_hfsj_qlfc_1=Use it to lure a swarm of flies towards target, decreasing jumping height by two points. Only in water can this debuff be removed.
desc_skill_nlb_hfsj_qmw_1=All the non battle players within five meters will dance by force.
desc_skill_nlb_hfsj_whff_1=Use it on you or a target. Gains Wake and Falling Flower effects when using flying skills. And increases restoration speed of flying skills.
desc_skill_nlb_hfsj_xxms_1=If it's a female target, she will be disfigured for one minute. If it's a male target, he will fall to his knees, shouting: whip me hard!
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_TH01_1=Kettle-shooting task complete. Go find Wang Wanquan and exchange for rewards.
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_TH_1=Flower Arrow Pitch-pot
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_budie01_1=It's not easy to catch butterflies. Take a break.
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_budie_1=Catch the Butterfly
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_ty01_1=He's getting it. No way, it's mine. Check this out. <br>Use it on players looking for Iron Beak Eagle's excrement, leaving them <font color="#FF0000">Paralyzed and unable to use skills for five seconds</font>.
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_ty02_1=Go to hell and let it go. <br>Use it on players looking for Iron Beak Eagle's excrement, <font color="#FF0000">knocking them away</font>.
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_ty03_1=Check this out. <br>Use it on players looking for Iron Beak Eagle's excrement, leaving them <font color="#FF0000">in to chaos for five seconds</font>.
desc_skill_nlb_huahui_ty04_1=Take my fist.  <br>Use it on players looking for Iron Beak Eagle's excrement, leaving them <font color="#FF0000">unable to use flying skills for five seconds</font>.
desc_skill_nlb_hwcq_1=<br>Attach Red Net to teammates nearby, providing a shield effect that absorbs damage. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Increases Critical Hit Damage by 2%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 100 points of HP damage when attacking. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Increases movement speed and decreases flying skill consumption. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the effects mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_hwcq_2=<br>Attach Red Net to teammates nearby, providing a shield effect that absorbs damage. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Increases Critical Hit Damage by 4%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 120 points of HP damage when attacking. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Increases movement speed and decreases flying skill consumption. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the effects mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_hwcq_3=<br>Attach Red Net to teammates nearby, providing a shield effect that absorbs damage. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Increases Critical Hit Damage by 6%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 140 points of HP damage when attacking. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Increases movement speed and decreases flying skill consumption. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the effects mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_hwcq_4=<br>Attach Red Net to teammates nearby, providing a shield effect that absorbs damage. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Increases Critical Hit Damage by 8%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 160 points of HP damage when attacking. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Increases movement speed and decreases flying skill consumption. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the effects mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_hwcq_5=<br>Attach Red Net to teammates nearby, providing a shield effect that absorbs damage. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Increases Critical Hit Damage by 10%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 180 points of HP damage when attacking. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Increases movement speed and decreases flying skill consumption. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the effects mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_hwcq_6=<br>Attach Red Net to teammates nearby, providing a shield effect that absorbs damage. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Increases Critical Hit Damage by 12%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 200 points of HP damage when attacking. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Increases movement speed and decreases flying skill consumption. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the effects mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_llz_001_1=Lightly dance, dealing huge damage to targets within five meters. Knocks Away all targets with the third strike and remove their Rage.
desc_skill_nlb_llz_002_1=Summon seven baskets before preparing the skill, buffing players within five yards with Refreshing Fragrance. 10 seconds for preparing the skill. After 10 seconds, players without Refreshing Fragrance will suffer huge damage and a slow-down effect.
desc_skill_nlb_llz_004_1=One second for preparing the skill. Creates a Poison Powder zone for five targets within 50 meters. The zone area is eight by eight meters. Creates a Dust In The Wind zone if it's a female target. Debuffs target in the zone with a 10-second Panic, causing a 0.5-second faint every three seconds and removing Dust In The Wind and Peerlessness. Creates a Peerlessness zone if it's a male target. Debuffs target in the zone with Vertigo, causing keyboard settings randomized for 10 seconds and removing Dust In The Wind and Peerlessness.
desc_skill_nlb_llz_006_1=One second for preparing the skill. Causes Instant Kill damage to target who does not parry. Target who parries will be fainted for five seconds. And it also deals a little damage to him.
desc_skill_nlb_lsw_1=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Light Steps</font>. Increases 25 points of Dexterity and Movement Speed by 15%. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Gain Flap Wings every time you move and then a stacked of Flying Bird, increasing one point jumping height and recovering flying skill points every 10 seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Increases damage when teammates break target's defense in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Slows Down all enemies within 50 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Increases teammates' Brawn, Breath, Dexterity, Spirit, Stamina and Movement Speed. When target who does not parry is attacked, debuffs them with Wing Sweep and stack up to knock them away. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_lsw_2=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Light Steps</font>. Increases 30 points of Dexterity and Movement Speed by 15%. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Gain Flap Wings every time you move and then a stacked of Flying Bird, increasing one point jumping height and recovering flying skill points every 10 seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Increases damage when teammates break target's defense in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Slows Down all enemies within 50 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Increases teammates' Brawn, Breath, Dexterity, Spirit, Stamina and Movement Speed. When target who does not parry is attacked, debuffs them with Wing Sweep and stack up to knock them away. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_lsw_3=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Light Steps</font>. Increases 35 points of Dexterity and Movement Speed by 15%. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Gain Flap Wings every time you move and then a stacked of Flying Bird, increasing one point jumping height and recovering flying skill points every 10 seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Increases damage when teammates break target's defense in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Slows Down all enemies within 50 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Increases teammates' Brawn, Breath, Dexterity, Spirit, Stamina and Movement Speed. When target who does not parry is attacked, debuffs them with Wing Sweep and stack up to knock them away. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_lsw_4=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Light Steps</font>. Increases 40 points of Dexterity and Movement Speed by 15%. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Gain Flap Wings every time you move and then a stacked of Flying Bird, increasing one point jumping height and recovering flying skill points every 10 seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Increases damage when teammates break target's defense in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Slows Down all enemies within 50 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Increases teammates' Brawn, Breath, Dexterity, Spirit, Stamina and Movement Speed. When target who does not parry is attacked, debuffs them with Wing Sweep and stack up to knock them away. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_lsw_5=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Light Steps</font>. Increases 45 points of Dexterity and Movement Speed by 15%. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Gain Flap Wings every time you move and then a stacked of Flying Bird, increasing one point jumping height and recovering flying skill points every 10 seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Increases damage when teammates break target's defense in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Slows Down all enemies within 50 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Increases teammates' Brawn, Breath, Dexterity, Spirit, Stamina and Movement Speed. When target who does not parry is attacked, debuffs them with Wing Sweep and stack up to knock them away. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_lsw_6=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Light Steps</font>. Increases 50 points of Dexterity and Movement Speed by 15%. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Gain Flap Wings every time you move and then a stacked of Flying Bird, increasing one point jumping height and recovering flying skill points every 10 seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Increases damage when teammates break target's defense in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Slows Down all enemies within 50 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Increases teammates' Brawn, Breath, Dexterity, Spirit, Stamina and Movement Speed. When target who does not parry is attacked, debuffs them with Wing Sweep and stack up to knock them away. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_myc_1=<br> Debuffs target with Dream. Costs more points to use flying skills. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Reduces Critical Hit Damage by 2%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 15 points of HP damage when getting attacked. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Disable flying skills for one second once using them five times in a row. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the consequences mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_myc_2=<br> Debuffs target with Dream. Costs more points to use flying skills. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Reduces Critical Hit Damage by 4%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 20 points of HP damage when getting attacked. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Disable flying skills for one second once using them five times in a row. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the consequences mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_myc_3=<br> Debuffs target with Dream. Costs more points to use flying skills. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Reduces Critical Hit Damage by 6%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 25 points of HP damage when getting attacked. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Disable flying skills for one second once using them five times in a row. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the consequences mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_myc_4=<br> Debuffs target with Dream. Costs more points to use flying skills. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Reduces Critical Hit Damage by 8%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 30 points of HP damage when getting attacked. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Disable flying skills for one second once using them four times in a row. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the consequences mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_myc_5=<br> Debuffs target with Dream. Costs more points to use flying skills. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Reduces Critical Hit Damage by 10%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 35 points of HP damage when getting attacked. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Disable flying skills for one second once using them four times in a row. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the consequences mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_myc_6=<br> Debuffs target with Dream. Costs more points to use flying skills. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen</font>: Reduces Critical Hit Damage by 12%. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen</font>: Inflicts extra 40 points of HP damage when getting attacked. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen</font>: Disable flying skills for one second once using them three times in a row. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen</font>: With all the consequences mentioned above. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
