desc_skill_nlb_tlshw_1=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Heaven Dance</font>. When attacking, you will get a 25% chance of converting target's energy into yours, recovering 25 points of energy. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Debuffs enemy with Heaven Soul Dance - Elastic Heart, decreasing his Brawn and Dodge Ability. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Gets a chance to increase the Critical Hit Damage caused by teammates in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Debuffs enemy with Heaven Soul Dance - Confusion every time he attacks. It stacks up and causes keyboard settings randomized. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Teammates' attack will cause splash damage to another three targets within three meters. Repeatedly attacking target with Vampiric critical hits will cause him to faint. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
desc_skill_nlb_tlshw_2=<br>Buffs all teammates within 50 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Heaven Dance</font>. When attacking, you will get a 25% chance of converting target's energy into yours, recovering 30 points of energy. <br>After using the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing</font> will be activated and <font color="#FFAE00">Red Armor</font> will be available. War Dance will no longer be removed when getting attacked. <br>Gain extra War Dance with <font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen, Slaughter Pollen, Confusion Pollen and Soul Eating Pollen</font>. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Elastic Heart Pollen:</font> Debuffs enemy with Heaven Soul Dance - Elastic Heart, decreasing his Brawn and Dodge Ability. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Slaughter Pollen:</font> Gets a chance to increase the Critical Hit Damage caused by teammates in the next five seconds. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Confusion Pollen:</font> Debuffs enemy with Heaven Soul Dance - Confusion every time he attacks. It stacks up and causes keyboard settings randomized. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Soul Eating Pollen:</font> Teammates' attack will cause splash damage to another three targets within three meters. Repeatedly attacking target with Vampiric critical hits will cause him to faint. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill cannot be used in Safe Zones.</font>
