desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target and Splash damage to adjacent ones within a 8-meter radius around the target;<br>the skill has a 10% chance to grant <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> to the target, causing the target's next attack to be evaded in a great chance. <br>Attacks ignore external and internal defense when the target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font> status.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an initial target and Splash damage to adjacent ones within a 8-metre radius around the initial target;<br>If the target is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignores the target's Internal and External Defense while attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_5=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_6=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_7=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_8=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs02_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, affect all targets within 8 meters;<br>If target has <font color="#FFAE00">Dancing Butterflies</font>, ignore its internal and external defense when attacking.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs05_1=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 60% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 20 meters. Lasts for 5 seconds (effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range). <br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>When you are casting the skill, you can cast other moves of the skill set to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> effect.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs05_2=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 70% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 20 meters. Lasts for 5 seconds (effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range). <br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>When you are casting the skill, you can cast other moves of the skill set to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> effect.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs05_3=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 80% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 20 meters. Lasts for 5 seconds (effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range). <br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>When you are casting the skill, you can cast other moves of the skill set to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> effect.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs05_4=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 90% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 20 meters. Lasts for 5 seconds (effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range). <br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>When you are casting the skill, you can cast other moves of the skill set to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> effect.
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs05_5=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font>: upon taking damage, 100% of the damage taken will be transferred to a random enemy within 20 meters. Lasts for 5 seconds (effect will not be triggered if no available target is within range). <br>When you are casting the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> state. <br>When you are casting the skill, you can cast other moves of the skill set to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> effect.
