desc_CS_by_gxcj01_11=Chi Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets.
desc_CS_by_gxcj01_12=Chi Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets.
desc_CS_by_gxcj02_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_by_gxcj02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_by_gxcj03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>After breaking target's parry, adds <font color="#FFAE00">Backyard Flower</font> status to them: they lose 3% of max HP every time they use attacks for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_by_gxcj03_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>After breaking down the targets' defense, add <font color="#FFAE00">Backyard Flower</font> status to them: lose 3% of max HP every time they use moves for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_by_gxcj04_11=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_CS_by_gxcj04_12=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_CS_by_gxcj04_hide_11=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_CS_by_gxcj04_hide_12=Grants yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current move and counter back. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_CS_by_gxcj05_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_by_gxcj05_12=It's hard to walk, it's hard to walk...Where are the old ways now? Stabs target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_by_gxcj06_11=Deal {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_by_gxcj06_12=The riverside flowers are redder than fire at sunrise. The green of the river's water in spring is almost blue. How can one not recognize Suzhou?  Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_by_gxcj07_11=Drunken dance deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>You can <font color="#f9fc00">pull</font> target continuously to you when using this attack.  <br>You can use Flying Skills when using this attack.
desc_CS_by_gxcj07_12=Drunk Stab Dance deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>You can <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> target continuously to you when using this move. <br>(You can use Flying Skills when using this move.)
desc_CS_by_wgl01_11=Sword Chi flies to targets and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Taoist</font> effect into air.
desc_CS_by_wgl01_12=Sword Chi flies to targets and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Taoist</font> effect into air.
desc_CS_by_wgl02_11=Chops target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_by_wgl02_12=Chops target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_by_wgl03_11=Chops target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_by_wgl03_12=Chops target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_by_wgl04_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Upon successfully breaking parry: <font color="#f9fc00">knocks</font> them 3 meters back, while also adding to them <font color="#FFAE00">Taoist</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Drunken Judge</font>, the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked into air</font> continuously. The status lasts for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_by_wgl04_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When successfully breaking defense: <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> them 3 meters back, while also adding to them <font color="#FFAE00">Taoist</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Drunk Magistrate</font>，the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked into air</font> continuously. The status lasts for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_by_wgl06_11=Sword Chi flies to enemies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When hitting enemies who are not blocking, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_by_wgl06_12=Sword Chi flies to enemies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When hitting enemies without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_by_wgl07_11=Dance Sword Chi deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>You cannot attack and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using attacks.
desc_CS_by_wgl07_12=Dance Sword Chi deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(You cannot move and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using moves.)
desc_CS_by_xhmdl01_11=Slashes and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters. <br>When hitting enemies who are not blocking, inflicts <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font> to them for 10 seconds. Explodes upon 3 stacks and <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_by_xhmdl01_12=<font color="#a3ca44">We can forgive the heavens for doing bad, but if we do bad ourselves, it is unforgivable!</font> <br>Slashes and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters. <br>When hitting enemies without Endurance, grant <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font> to them for 10 seconds. Explode upon 3 stacks and <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font>  them for 2 seconds.
