desc_CS_by_xlxf01_11=Axe power deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: the range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> the target.  <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.
desc_CS_by_xlxf01_12=Axe Power deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When having <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Extermination</font> status: the shooting range of the move is double and you have chances to <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.)
desc_CS_by_xlxf02_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: the range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> the target. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, reduces cooldown of all your attacks by 10%. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.
desc_CS_by_xlxf02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When having <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Extermination</font> status: the shooting range of the move is double and you have chances to <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, reduce Catch breath time of all your moves by 10%. <br>(This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.)
desc_CS_by_xlxf03_11=Slashes targets and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: the range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> the target. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, reduces cooldown of all your attack by 10%. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skills to approach target quickly. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.
