desc_CS_hs_hsjf07_1=Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">Indistinct Green Mountain</font> state for 2 seconds. You have a very good chance of evading enemy attacks, and launching a counterattack afterwards. <br>Using a skill that lets you charge towards your target will cancel this effect. <br>The more this effect is stacked, the more damage you can avoid.
desc_CS_hs_hsjf07_10=Castle faint water span, southern autumn do not withered grass. Review of the potential enemy, jianjue dark lead. Make itself into the <font color="#FFAE00"> "Castle faint" </font> status: a greater chance to evade enemy moves, and after a successful dodge enemy damage, state sustainable 2 seconds. <br> (use of non-locking assault moves can advance out of the state) <br> (moves to enhance the number of layers can be increased after a successful dodge the damage)
