desc_CS_hs_hsjf08_1=Your spinning sword deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Each attack debuffs the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Falling Leaves</font> for 8 seconds, lowering his or her internal defense by 3%. This effect can be stacked up to 7 times.
desc_CS_hs_hsjf08_10=Boundless Xiao Xiao Lamu, endless rolling to the Yangtze River. Sword Tuidi, spinner fencing, the target for {@ 0: package harm}; each hit to add <font color="#FFAE00"> "Fall" </font> status: 3% lower power inside and outside the defense, 8 seconds, stacking 7 layers.
