desc_CS_hs_kfkj01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. Quickly execute this attack 3 times, and your 4th attack will create a 15-meter area of effect that <font color="#f9fc00">throws</font> your targets.
desc_CS_hs_kfkj01_10=Race, and I do not know it by the. Xuanshen seated step, sword Hengqiao on front inflict {@0:伤害包}. Cast three times over a period of time, the next moves will play before the enemy within a range of 15 meters in body damage and <font color="#f9fc00"> knock </font>.
