desc_CS_hs_kfkj07_1=Pull targets within a 8-meter radius towards yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font>, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_hs_kfkj07_10=Whistling wind, clouds Dragon. Dunshen spin sword, jump to plug the enemies within the range of 8 meters to pull themselves and <font color="#f9fc00"> down </font>, resulting in {@0:伤害包}.
