desc_CS_hs_kfkj08_1=Move your sword with the wind, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_hs_kfkj08_10=Autumn in August high wind howling, the volume on my house triple Mao. Wind sword dance, Jianqi horizon, the target for {@0:伤害包}.
