desc_CS_jh_ahlj01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_ahlj01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach target.)
desc_CS_jh_ahlj04_hide_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Away</font> enemies who do not parry.
desc_CS_jh_ahlj04_hide_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Away</font> enemies who do not parry.
desc_CS_jh_ahlj05_hide_11=Keep calm and the world is yours.
desc_CS_jh_ahlj05_hide_12=Keep calm and the world is yours.
desc_CS_jh_ahlj06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Away</font> enemies who do not parry. <br>When using this skill, you will be buffed with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_ahlj06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Away</font> enemies who do not parry. <br>When using this skill, you will be buffed with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_bgd01_11=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to the targets. <br>If the target is debuffed with <font color="#FF3030">Puddle </font>, applies Wind, Thunder, Fire or Puddle to it. (There is a 20% chance to apply all these four debuffs to the target.)<br>Protects you with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when Puddle is activated. Increases the attack range of Water, Thunder, Fire and Wind by 2 meters.
desc_CS_jh_bgd01_12=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage and stuns targets. Increases the attack range of Water, Thunder, Fire and Wind by 2 meters.<br>If the target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Puddle </font>, applies Wind, Thunder, Fire or Puddle to it. (There is a 20% chance to apply all these four debuffs to the target.)<br>Protects you with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> when you cast Puddle.
desc_CS_jh_bgd02_11=Grants you a 7-second <font color="#FF3030">Earth</font>. While Earth is active, you will be immune to knockdowns, throws and knockbacks. Earth is a single-use effect.<br>If <font color="#FF3030">Mountain</font> is active when Earth is over, you will be restored to the same stats (HP and Energy) you had when Earth took effect.
desc_CS_jh_bgd02_12=Grants you a 7-second <font color="#FF3030">Earth </font>. While Earth is active, you will be immune to Knockdowns, Throwns and Knockbacks. Earth is a single-use effect.<br>If <font color="#FF3030">Mountain</font> is active on you when Earth is over, you will be restored to the same stats (HP and Energy) you had when Earth took effect.
desc_CS_jh_bgd03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Wind</font> to the target.<br>When <font color="#FF3030">Water</font> is active, knocks down targets not parrying. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_bgd03_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Wind</font> to the target.<br>When <font color="#FF3030">Water</font> is active on you, knocks down targets not in the parrying.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
desc_CS_jh_bgd04_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Thunder</font> to the target. Deals additional damage to the target if the target is affected by both<br><font color="#FF3030">Fire</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Thunder</font>.
desc_CS_jh_bgd04_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Thunder</font> to the target. Deals additional damage to the target if the target is afffected by both<br><font color="#FF3030">Fire</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Thunder</font>.
desc_CS_jh_bgd05_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Nullifying a parry grants you <font color="#FF3030">Water</font>. If the target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Wind </font>, stuns the target for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_bgd05_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Nullifying a parry grants you <font color="#FF3030">Water </font>. If the target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Wind </font>, stuns the target for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_bgd06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Fire</font> to targets. If a target is affected by both<br><font color="#FF3030"> Fire</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Thunder </font>, deals additional damage to the target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_bgd06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Applies <font color="#FF3030">Fire</font> to targets. If a target is affected by both<br><font color="#FF3030"> Fire</font> and <font color="#FF3030">Thunder </font>,deals additional damage to the target.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
desc_CS_jh_bgd07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and applies<font color="#FF3030"> Puddle</font> to the target. Puddle: <font color="#f9fc00">Slows and forbids the use of Flying Skills</font> for 8 seconds.<br>If you have <font color="#FF3030">Sky</font> active on you, <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> will be granted and your hit will have a 2-second Stun effect.
desc_CS_jh_bgd07_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and applies<br><font color="#FF3030"> Puddle</font> to the target. Puddle: <font color="#f9fc00">Slows and forbids the use of Flying Skills</font> for 8 seconds.<br>If you have <font color="#FF3030">Sky</font> active on you, <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> will be granted and your hit will have a 2-second Stun effect.
desc_CS_jh_bgd08_11=<br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FF3030">Mountain</font> effect, increasing your external defense by 40% for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_bgd08_12=<br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FF3030">Mountain</font> effect, increasing your external defense by 42% for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf01_15=Charging skill, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target and lowers target's evasion.  <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf01_16=Charging movement, use brute force to deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and make target unstable, with reduced dodging.<br> (This skill can be used in conjuction with a Flying Skill to approach target quickly.)
desc_CS_jh_cqgf02_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies. When it breaks your target's parry, it will knock them down and inflict extra damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf02_16=Execute a feint attack which appears to go high, when it actually goes low. Deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. When it breaks your target's parry, it will knock them down and inflict extra damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf03_15=This simple yet effective block reduces damage received by 41.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf03_16=This simple yet effective block reduces damage received by 44.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage; skill can knock back enemies who are staggered and cause 3 times the normal damage. Skill can be used immediately when in the air and adds Super Armor to player, but removes target's Dancing Flowers on the Mountains effect after a successful hit to the target
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_16=As forceful as a fierce tiger, rushes target in front of player causing{@0:伤害包}; skill can knock back enemies who are Staggered and cause 3 times the normal damage.  Skill can be used immediately when in the air and add "Super Armor" to player, but removes target's Dancing Flowers on the Mountains effect after a successful hit to the target
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_sky_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage; skill can knock back enemies who are staggered and cause 3 times the normal damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf04_sky_16=Act like a fierce tiger and strike the target in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. The move can knock an unsteady enemy back and deal 3.0 times damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_15=Swift fist attack against enemy, deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_16=Swift fist attack against enemy, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_sky_15=Punch target, deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf05_sky_16=Punch target like rain with fist, deal {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf06_15=Simple fist fight, deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf06_16=Simple fist fight, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf07_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets, whose skills are disabled and keyboard settings are randomized for 3 seconds. Player gains Frenzy, which increases damage done by skills in the same set by 30% and increases movement speed by 50% for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_cqgf07_16=Wild howl and angry roar shocks the enemy's mind, causing surrounding targets to{@0:伤害包}, and adds "Seal Skill" and "Keyboard Settings Randomized" to targets to 3 seconds; player gains Frenzy, which increases damage done by skills in the same set by 30% and increases movement speed by 50%, lasts for 12 seconds
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_10=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_11=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_12=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_9=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you;<br>Every critical strike reduces <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Takes Soul</font> chi restoration time by two seconds;<br>When your own Rage points are below 60, every critical hit you land will bring with it half a second of stun effect.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx02_10=A charging move. Surge forward like a mad ghost and chop at the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When you have more than 60 Rage points, the damage inflicted by your critical hit will increase by 30%. <br>(The higher your Rage points, the greater your chance of landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx02_11=A charging move. Surge forward like a mad ghost and chop at the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When your Rage points are greater than 60, the damage inflicted by your critical hit will increase by 30%.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the grater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
