desc_CS_jh_dpgx02_9=A charging move. Surge forward like a mad ghost and chop at the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. When your Rage points are greater than 60, the damage inflicted by your critical hit will increase by 30%.<br>(The higher your Rage points, the grater the chance of you landing a critical hit.)<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx03_10=Break through the air with lethal chops to enemies in front of you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you break a parry, you can hit the enemy and leave him more vulnerable to critical hits;<br>If you have more than 60 Rage points, when you break an enemy's parry you can send him flying. <br>(The higher your rage points, the greater your chance of landing a critical hit.)
desc_CS_jh_dpgx03_11=Break through the air with lethal chops to enemies in front of you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you break a parry, you can hit the enemy and leave him more vulnerable to critical hits;<br>If your Rage points top 60, when you break an enemy's parry you can send him flying.<br>(The higher your rage points, the greater your chance of landing a critical hit.)
