desc_CS_jh_gwc03_11=Hurl a <font color="#FF3030">Dagger Shadow</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> your targets, inflicting 226 Yin damage. This damage is determined by your melee power and internal skill. <br> While <font color="#FF3030">Dagger Shadow</font> is in flight, quickly excute this skill again to move towards <font color="#FF3030">Dagger Shadow</font>'s current location. This will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> nearby enemies and inflict damage to them.
