desc_CS_jh_gwc06_11=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>: If you get hit when parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts five seconds. <br>(This defensive move is not effective against Super Armor, and can be defeated by Feint Moves.)
desc_CS_jh_gwc06_12=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>: If you get hit when parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts five seconds. <br>(This defensive skill is not effective against Super Armor, and can be overpowered by a feint attack.)
