desc_CS_jh_gwc07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>Each strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> target. <br>You cannot move and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using attacks.
