desc_CS_jh_hjdf01_11=The hidden blade waits for the time to strike among the many twists and turns, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf01_12=The hidden blade waits for the time to strike among the many twists and turns, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_11=The guest attacks the host, destroy the blade to end hatred. causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}; <br>a successful breakthrough of the enemy's parry adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> to player.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_12=The guest attacks the host, destroy the blade to end hatred. causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}; <br>a successful breakthrough of the enemy's parry adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> to player.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_hide_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Slow Force</font> to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 times, lasts for 15 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf02_hide_12=The road is long and I sing a song while I walk, causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> buff to player with successful strike to non-parrying target, buff can be stacked 5 layers, lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf04_11=The host deceives the guest and the binding blade is unfeeling. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf04_12=The host deceives the guest and the binding blade is unfeeling. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf04_hide_1=This skill is not available at this time.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_11=The young is better than the old, the thrown sword stalks the soul. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_12=The young is better than the old, the thrown sword stalks the soul. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit to target who has not parried and causes additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf07_11=The blade has become me, and I am the blade. The blade is in the dance and the dance has become the blade. Causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">Unconsciousness</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(Player may move freely when using skill, status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf07_12=The blade has become me, and I am the blade. The blade is in the dance and the dance has become the blade. Causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">Unconsciousness</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(Player may move freely when using skill, status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use)
desc_CS_jh_htxf05_1=Disable target's skills. If target did not block, you gain Yellow Super Armor for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf01_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy. <br>After using this skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Light</font> and you can keep up to 9 beams.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf01_12=Three Marvels Six Rites, Far from the Nine Palaces, wielding your sword causes {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy in front of you; <br>After using this Skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>and you can keep up to 9 beams.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf02_11=Flip over and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf02_12=Up and Down are Transposed, Nine Stars at Opposition, a flying slash causes {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf03_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy. <br>When you break the enemy's parry, if you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Harmony with Others</font> effect: this skill will not be sealed the first five times it is used.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf03_12=Roaming Three Evading Five, Imperial Sword Attack for Punishment, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>When you overcome the enemy's parry, if you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Harmony with Others” </font>state: This Skill will not be sealed the first five times it is used.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf04_11=When your parry is successful: You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will receive <font color="#FFAE00">Shield Armor </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will receive <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Light</font> which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf04_12=Wear Nine Tread One, Spreading Rebellion, when your parry is successful: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Xun Jia” </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Secret Chant” </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_11=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> (increases movement speed by 20%), enemies will get <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> (increases Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skills and increase Energy cost by 20% when using a skill). The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>(Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf05_12=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 20%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 20% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf06_11=Unleashes <font color="#f9fc00">Earth Sword Array</font> to knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, causing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Earth Sword Array</font>, you and your teammates will receive <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>, which increases Critical Hit value by 20%, and increases Accuracy by 20%. Your enemy will receive <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting </font>, which reduces External Defense by 20%. This array lasts for 10 seconds. <br>(Only one array can exist at a time.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf06_12=Inside are Nine Heavens, the Spirit is Nine Earths, unleash <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>, knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, and cause them {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>: You and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>(increases Critical Hit value by 20%, increases Accuracy by 20%), and your enemy will encounter <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting </font>(reduces External Defense by 20%); the Sword Array will last 10 seconds. <br>(Only one Sword Array can exist)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the selected area. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target to be <font color="#FFAE00">Infatuated</font>: Keyboard settings are randomized, which will last for 3 seconds. It can be used twice, with an interval of 2 seconds.  <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, this skill will change to <font color="#f9fc00">Nine Palaces Eight Winds</font>.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_12=Six Jia Return to the Origin, Three Marvels Exhaust Principle, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the selected range; <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target to be <font color="#FFAE00">“Infatuated"</font>: Confused Key Positions, which will continue for 3 seconds; can be used twice, with an interval of 2 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, this Skill will change to the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Nine Palaces Eight Winds." </font>
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_hide_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf07_hide_12=Great Yin Ambush, Sixfold Unity Shifting Form, Sword Dance will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>(You can use Flying Skill with this Skill to quickly approach your adversary.)
desc_CS_jh_jgjf08_11=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>You will also cause additional damage depending on the amount of <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Light, </font>the <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Light </font>will then be cleared. <br>If you are in a effect of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Ruptured Liver and Gall</font>: The enemy will continuously lose HP, which will last for 5 seconds.  <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will stun your target for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf08_12=Three Beginnings Six Eras, Nine Swords Return to One, Gleaming White Sword Light Converges, pursuing your target causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>You will also cause Additional Damage depending on the amount of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light,” </font>the <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light" </font>will then be cleared. <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target <font color="#FFAE00">“Ruptured Liver and Gall”</font>: The enemy will continuously lose HP, which will continue for 5 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will cause your target to be Stunned 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf09_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within range. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, damage will be even greater. <br>You will be in a <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor </font>effect, so you are still vulnerable to attack.
desc_CS_jh_jgjf09_12=Yin Yang Right and Wrong, Visiting the Nine Palaces, Measured Pace, Death Life Sword Slash, will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the range of your stride and slash; <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, Damage will be even greater. <br>(The Attack is accompanied by rigidity, and you will be in a <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state, so you can be attacked.)
desc_CS_jh_jzbf06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Breaking target's parry causes target to fail to parry again 5 seconds later.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf06_12=Scheme to destroy one's momentum before scheming to take one's pieces. Causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}; <br>breaking through target's parry causes target to become Break Defense again 5 seconds later.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf01_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Successful hit decreases cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Leaves No Trace</font> by 1 second. Skills can be used while moving.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf01_13=Black clouds are above and wild winds are blowing in one's face, causes to target in front of player{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit decreases cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">"A Quick Shadow Leaves No Traces"</font> by 1 second.  <br>(Skills can be used while moving)
desc_CS_jh_kfdf02_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. Successful hit decreases cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Leaves No Trace</font> by 2 seconds. This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf02_13=The winds are strong and the sky is high, blade shadows link together; causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>successful hit decreases cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">"A Quick Shadow Leaves No Traces"</font> by 2 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_kfdf03_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. Attacks add 1 second of rigidity. Can attack 4 times at most but cannot attack the same target in succession. Player can be attacked during skill use.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf03_13=Wild winds are shadowless and the blade cuts without a trace, jump slashes enemies within range, causing{@0:伤害包}; <br>(attacks add 1 second of Rigidity)<br> can attack 4 times at most but cannot attack the same target in succession, player can be attacked during skill use.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf04_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf04_13=Steps as fast as wind, wind as sharp as blades, the wave of blades roll and surge; strangles target, causing{@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf07_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. A successful break of enemy's parry reduces cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">Shadow Leaves No Trace</font> by 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf07_13=Swing your blade and strike forcefully, advancing courageously, causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry reduces cooldown for <font color="#f9fc00">"A Quick Shadow Leaves No Traces"</font> by 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd01_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd01_13=Cultivate your moral character and right your steps, tighten your foot and kick. Causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd01_sky_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd01_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_12=This jump-and-kick combo may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds).  First attack: Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_13=Flying jump steps and a jump-kick chain. This move may be used three times in a row. The third jump and twist kick can knock back enemies in front of you (continuous skill use must be completed within 3 seconds).  <br>First strike: causes in target {@0:伤害包}(can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent).
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_sky_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_1_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_2_12=Second attack: Inflicts {@0:伤害包} on target. Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_2_13={@0:伤害包}Second strike: causes in target (can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent).
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_2_sky_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_2_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_3_12=Third strike: Jump and kick, knocking back enemy to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_3_13=Third strike: jump and twist, kicking upside-down, knock back enemy in front and causes{@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_3_sky_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd02_3_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd03_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets. Causes additional damage to enemies already on the ground. Player will have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> after finishing three consecutive kicks.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd03_13=The heaven and earth become upside down, swing-around kick, causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>Causes additional damage to enemies already on the ground.  <br>(player will have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using skills after player finishes three continuous kicks)
