desc_CS_jh_kxtd03_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd04_1_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. The higher your jump, the more damage you cause (height is calculated based on your starting position). Skill will go into cooldown if you use the same skill on the same opponent consecutively within 6 seconds; player will jump again, and will knock down target if opponent is already on the ground. This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd04_1_13=Kicking the nose and climbing on one's face, trampling on the enemy's head, causes{@0:伤害包}. The higher your jump, the more damage you cause (height is calculated based on your starting position).  <br>Skill will go into cooldown if you use the same skill on the same opponent consecutively within 6 seconds; player will jump again after using skill, and will deal Felled by a Blow to opponent if opponent is already on the ground.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
