desc_CS_jh_kxtd05_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Deadly</font> to opponent at the same time, which decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd05_13=Kick over books angrily chain kick. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}.<br> Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> to opponent at the same time, which decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd05_sky_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd05_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd06_12=Gains <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>: If you get hit when parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts five seconds. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Deadly</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain. <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Improvement of skill level increases counter damage.)
desc_CS_jh_kxtd06_13=What seems real is fake, and what seems fake is real. Will cause player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Shift from Defense to Attack"</font>. Player may dismantle enemy skills and perform a counterattack when attacked by enemies, lasts for 5 seconds.  <br>Will add <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain.  <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move.  Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_kxtd06_hide_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd06_hide_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd07_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry causes: knock back the target; adds <font color="#FFAE00">Deadly</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd07_13=One moves effectively yet quietly, the phantom step kick. Causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}.  <br>A successful break of enemy's parry causes: knock back the target; adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Deadly"</font> (decreases all forms of HP recovery by 50%) to opponent when you complete the three-kick chain.
desc_CS_jh_kxtd07_sky_12=<s>
desc_CS_jh_kxtd07_sky_13=<s>
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Successful hit adds <font color="#FFAE00">Pounces for Prey</font> to self, which increases the damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Tiger Hunts the Rabbit</font> by 10% for every effect of Pounces for Prey. Lasts 30 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq01_12=The dragon and tiger are subdued, demons and gods respect you. You pounce and hit enemies in front of you causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>Successful hit adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Pouncing"</font> to self, which increases the damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">"Tiger Hunts the Rabbit"</font> by 10% for every stack of Pouncing. Lasts 30 seconds. Can be stacked 10 times.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If player has 10 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Pounces for Prey</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">Become a Dragon</font> effect, changing <font color="#f9fc00">Dragon Swims Everywhere</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq02_12=The wind and clouds start to move, the dragon sits and the tiger follows, tears into target causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>If player has 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouncing</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, changing <font color="#f9fc00">"Dragon Swimming Across the Field "</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq02_speed_1=The wind and clouds start to move, the dragon sits and the tiger follows, tears into target causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>If player has 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouncing</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, changing <font color="#f9fc00">"Dragon Swimming Across the Field "</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq03_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When player has the <font color="#FF3030">Become a Dragon</font> effect, this skill will transform into <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon</font>.  <br>Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon is more powerful and does not cost any energy.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq03_12=The flying cloud sets out a dawn array, one's killing will is as red as the bridge, explosive punch causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>When player has the <font color="#FF3030">"Dragon Transformation"</font> effect, this skill will transform into <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon"</font>.  <br>("Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon" is more powerful and does not cost any energy to use)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the beginning of skill, player enters <font color="#FFAE00">Overlord Arrives</font> state and cannot be thrown or knocked down for 5 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq04_12=I have the strength to lift mountains and the spirit to take on the world. I will destroy all means of retreat and take on this battle. Deals explosive strike to the enemy causing{@0:伤害包}. <br>At the beginning of skill, player enters <font color="#FFAE00">"Advent of the Overlord"</font> state and cannot be knocked back or felled by a blow for 5 seconds.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq06_11=When blocking an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Flight</font> effect. Your next attack from this skill set becomes vampiric, absorbing 100% damage. This 15-second effect can be stacked up to 11 times. Each time you attack, 1 stack is consumed.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq06_12=When blocking an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Flight</font> effect. Your next attack from this skill set becomes vampiric, absorbing 100% damage. This 15-second effect can be stacked up to 12 times. Each time you attack, 1 stack is consumed.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq07_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Heart</font> to enemy, causing them to take damage when using attack skills. Lasts 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq07_12=The tiger is weary and the dragon is tired, it is hard to tell the real and false apart. Fist swing causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Heart"</font> to enemy, causing them to take damage when using attack skills. Lasts 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq08_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Rip and Tear</font> to enemies, which causes them to take on additional damage when attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 40 times. <br>Execute a chain of attacks without consuming energy.
desc_CS_jh_lhbwq08_12=The tiger is angry and the dragon impatient, their anger like an unending stream. Deals an explosive punch, causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Tear Apart"</font> to enemies, which causes them to take on additional damage when attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">"Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon"</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 40 layers.  <br>(The moves continue without a break and do not consume energy)
desc_CS_jh_llt01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When the number rolled is odd, the attack will gain <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzing</font> effect which can last for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_llt01_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When the number rolled is odd, the attack will gain <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzing</font> effect which can persist for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_llt02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking target's parry: When the number rolled is even, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for a random period of time (0 to 4 seconds).
desc_CS_jh_llt02_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking down the target's defense: When the number rolled is even, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for a random period of time (0 to 4 seconds).
desc_CS_jh_llt05_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target by 5 meters. <br>When the number rolled is in multiples of 2, twice as much injury will be caused to the target in addition to the original injury.
desc_CS_jh_llt05_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target by 5 m. <br>When the number rolled is in multiples of 2, twice as much injury will be caused to the target in addition to the original injury.
desc_CS_jh_llt06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the player is in dice-throwing status, each attack will have <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font> effect regardless of the target's parry. Each attack will also have 100% spraying effect. <br>The range of spraying will be determined by the number rolled.
desc_CS_jh_llt06_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the player is in dice-throwing status, each attack will have <font color="#f9fc00">Common Lockout</font> effect regardless of the target's parry. Each attack will also have 100% spraying effect. <br>The range of spraying will be determined by the number rolled.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you have <font color="#FF3030">Angry Cockroach</font> status, your attack will have <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> effect and <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. <br>The attack has a chance to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font>.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When you have <font color="#FF3030">Wrathful Xiao Qiang</font> status, your move will have <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> effect and <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. <br>(The move has chances to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font>.)
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj01_sky_11=Normal Attack. When you have Angry Cockroach status, your attack will have Yellow Armor status.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj01_sky_12=Normal Attack. When you have Wrathful Xiao Qiang status, your move will have Yellow Armor status.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj02_11=Believe me, I can smash your head with only one kick! Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly. <br>The attack has a chance to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">What a Tragedy</font>.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj02_12=Believe me, I can smash your head with only one kick! Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.) <br>(The move has chances to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">Ugly Ugly Ugly</font>.)
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj02_sky_11=This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj02_sky_12=Lock, pruning shears Foot <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>If you break target's parry, you will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> the target. <br>The attack has a chance to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font>.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj03_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>If you break target's parry, you will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> the target. <br>(The move has chances to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font>.)
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj03_sky_11=Breaks parry, knocks down.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj03_sky_12=Break Defense, Knock down
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj05_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>When attacking enemies lying on the ground, you can <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> continuously and inflict <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font> to them: disfigures them, and increases damage by 5% for 30 seconds. <br>You cannot move and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using attacks.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj05_12=Ouch! Who beat me? Treads nearby enemies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When attacking enemies lying on the ground, you can <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> continuously and grant <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font> to them: disfigure them, and increase damage by 5% for 30 seconds. <br>(You cannot move and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using moves.)
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj05_sky_11=Area of effect, Yellow Armor. Tread the ground: get eye bags and red footprint on face.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj05_sky_12=AOE, Yellow Armor. Tread the ground: get eye bags and red footprint on face.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Play Dead</font> status: hits face, reduces vision, and loses target for 4 seconds <br>The attack has a chance to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">What a Tragedy</font>.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, grant <font color="#FFAE00">Seek Death</font> status: hit on face, reduce vision and lose target for 4 seconds. <br>(The move has chances to disfigure target and turn target into <font color="#FF3030">Ugly Ugly Ugly</font>.)
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj06_sky_11=Ranged and inflict Play Dead effect: Go blind and lose target.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj06_sky_12=Ranged and grant Seek Death effect: Blind and lose target.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Hits target and grants <font color="#FF3030">What a Tragedy</font> status: disfigured and gets 10% more damage for 30 seconds. <br>Hits target and grants <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font> status for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj07_12=Good! It's vicious Disfiguring Kick! Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Hits target and grants <font color="#FF3030">Ugly Ugly Ugly</font> status: disfigured and get 10% more damage for 30 seconds. <br>Hit target and grant <font color="#f9fc00">Key Confusion</font> status for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj07_sky_11=Ult, Lock interact, inflict What a Tragedy effect: Keyboard settings randomized, face turns into pig face.
desc_CS_jh_mmqfj07_sky_12=Ult, Lock interact, grant Ugly Ugly Ugly effect: Key Confusion, face turns into pig face.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf01_11=Sword Chi causes {@0:伤害包} damage to your target; <br>You will receive 4 extra Rage points during the attack (enemy does not parry).
desc_CS_jh_mzjf01_12=Ink Sword Like Steel, Whirling Horizontal Chop, Sword Chi will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to your target; <br>You will receive 4 extra Rage points during the attack (enemy does not parry).
desc_CS_jh_mzjf02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf02_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf03_11=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf03_12=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your Parry Endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Defense. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf04_11=Convert your Rage up to 6800 points of Parry Endurance, while cancelling your <font color="#f9fc00">inability to block</font>. <br>Gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font>effect for 12 seconds. During this time, when you attack a target with Mozi's Sword, your attack inflicts extra danage equal to 3% of your Parry Endurance, up to 320. You also recover 2 points of Rage. <br>If your Parry Endurance is reduced to 30%, you receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>. <br>The higher you cultivate this skill, the faster you can recover your Parry Endurance.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf04_12=Convert your Rage up to 7400 points of Parry Endurance, while cancelling your <font color="#f9fc00">inability to block</font>. <br>Gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font>effect for 12 seconds. During this time, when you attack a target with Mozi's Sword, your attack inflicts extra danage equal to 3% of your Parry Endurance, up to 320. You also recover 2 points of Rage. <br>If your Parry Endurance is reduced to 30%, you receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>. <br>The higher you cultivate this skill, the faster you can recover your Parry Endurance.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf05_11=Receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> effect. Next time you attack a target with Mozi's Sword, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> effect. <br>Targets under the <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> effect have a 20% chance to have their attacks interrupted, and their skills disabled for 3 seconds. This 15-second effect can be stacked 12 times. Each time target uses a skill, a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> is removed.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf05_12=Receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> effect. Next time you attack a target with Mozi's Sword, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> effect. <br>Targets under the <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> effect have a 20% chance to have their attacks interrupted, and their skills disabled for 3 seconds. This 15-second effect can be stacked 13 times. Each time target uses a skill, a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> is removed.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害} to enemy in front. <br>If you overcome your target's parry, you will recover 1280 Parry Endurance points, and reduce your target's Internal and External attack damage by 128 points.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf06_12=Inflict {@0:伤害} to enemy in front. <br>If you overcome your target's parry, you will recover 1280 Parry Endurance points, and reduce your target's Internal and External attack damage by 128 points.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf07_11=When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Decides Destiny</font> effect. Each stack of this effect reduces the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> by 1 second, while increasing the rate by which Rage is converted to Parry Endurance by 4%. This effect can be stacked up to 20 times.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf07_12=When hiding the sword rack, air transport universe, parry success: to add their own <font color="#FFAE00"> "moves of the sword" </font> status of each layer can be reduced moves <font color="#f9fc00"> [ Jianqi rivers and lakes] </font> 1 seconds back air time, 4% increase in conversions (conversion anger parry stamina), the state can stack 20 layers.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_11=This stabbing attack does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend: </font>When your parry endurance exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's external attack damage reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reinforced attack: </font>If your current parry endurance is less than 30%, you can recover 20 points Rage after using this skill. <br>When your parry endurance exceeds 65%, this skill will keep you from being sent flying, thrown, or knocked down.
desc_CS_jh_mzjf08_12=Ride the wind and wield the sword, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defense</font>: If parry endurance is over 65%, your attack ignores 15% of target's external damage reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack for attack</font>: If parry endurance is below 305, recover 20 rage after the skill is launched completely. <br>If parry endurance is above 65%, you will not be thrown, knocked down or back)
desc_CS_jh_plbz01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If you are affected by <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Light and Heavy</font> to enemies: reduces attack by 20%, lasts 6 seconds, can stack up to 5 times, only applies to players. <br>Removes a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>.
desc_CS_jh_plbz01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If you are affected by <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Light/Heavy</font> to enemies: reduces attack by 20%, lasts 6 seconds, can stack up to 5 times, only applies to players. <br>after the use of it, removes a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qxj01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Each attack grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bloodthirsty</font> to yourself: Converts 1% of the damage you do into HP, can stack up to 10 times, lasts 14 seconds.<br>If the target attacked is not a player, increases your <font color="#FF3030">Hatred</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qxj01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front. <br>Each attack grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bloodthirsty</font> to yourself: converts 1% of the damage you do into HP, can stack up to 10 times, lasts 14 seconds.<br>If the target attacked is not a player, increases your <font color="#FF3030">Hatred</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qxj02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>On breaking an enemy's parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Merak, Second of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: increases the damage done by skills of this skill set by 30%, lasts 7 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_qxj02_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>On breaking an enemy's parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Merak, Second of the Seven Stars</font> to yourself: increases the damage done by skills of this skill set by 30%, lasts 7 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_qxj03_11=Your good fortune is written in the stars! <br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Phecda, Third of the Seven Stars</font> effect. Your attacks become <font color="#f9fc00">vampiric</font>, absorbing 10% damage as HP. Attack power of all skills in this set increases by 10% for 17 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_qxj03_12=Your good fortune is written in the stars! <br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Phecda, Third of the Seven Stars</font> effect. Your attacks become <font color="#f9fc00">vampiric</font>, absorbing 10% damage as HP. Attack power of all skills in this set increases by 10% for 18 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_qxj04_11=Deals {@0:伤害包}. <br>If the target successfully parries your attack for the first 5 seconds, increases the damage of your attack by 50%. <br>If the target is not a player, then it'll be forced to attack itself. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_qxj04_12=Deals {@0:伤害包}. <br>If the target successfully parries your attack for the first 5 seconds, increases the damage of your attack by 50%. <br>If the target is not a player, then it'll be forced to attack itself. <br> This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach.
desc_CS_jh_qxj06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies. <br>Deals extra damage when the victim's HP is lower than 30%. <br>While skill is being used, each attack the enemy chooses not to parry, or each time you are attacked, grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Mizar, Sixth of the Seven Stars</font>: Increases external defense by 100 and internal defense by 10, can stack up to 49 times, lasts 14 seconds. <br>You cannot move and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using attacks.
desc_CS_jh_qxj06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies. <br>Deals extra damage when the victim's HP is lower than 30%. <br>While skill is being used, each attack the enemy chooses not to parry, or each time you are attacked, grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Mizar, Sixth of the Seven Stars</font>: increases external defense by 100 and internal defense by 10, can stack up to 49 times, lasts 14 seconds. <br>While skill is being used, you cannot move and you will be affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qxj07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Grants a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Mizar, Sixth of the Seven Stars</font> every time this skill hits a target who chooses not to parry: Increases external defense by 100 and internal defense by 10, can stack up to 49 times, lasts 14 seconds.
