desc_CS_jh_qzjf07_11=Gains <font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font>: Increases Evasion by 50% for three seconds and makes you unable to use Charging Skills or be locked by Charging Skills. If moving, using skills or getting attacked, the effect will be removed. <br>Before the effect is removed, skills will be performed automatically, dealing damage (affected by skill level) to enemies within five meters and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking them down</font>.  <br>(This skill cannot be used in the air.)
desc_CS_jh_qzjf07_12=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Graceful Sword</font>: Increases Evasion by 50% within three seconds and makes you unable to use Charging Skills nor be locked by Charging Skills. If moving, using skills or getting attacked, the effect will be removed. <br>Before the effect is removed, skills will be performed automatically, dealing damage (Affected by skill level) to enemies within five meters and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking them down</font>. <br>(This skill cannot be used in the air.)
