desc_CS_jh_sfj01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Once the attack hits the target, it can be used again for a maximum of 2 times for 2 seconds. <br>The second attack will <font color="#f9fc00">stun and throw</font> your target.
desc_CS_jh_sfj01_12=Feint attack with dagger while frowning: This causes the enemy in front to{@0:伤害包};<br> once the strike hits the target it can be used again for a maximum of 2 times within 2 seconds. <br>(The second strike will be accompanied with <font color="#f9fc00">stunning and knocking away</font> effect)
desc_CS_jh_sfj01_1_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Once the attack hits the target, it can be used again within 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfj01_1_12=Wielding Heavenly Chisel without any anger or pleasure: This will render the enemy in front unconscious, as well as{@0:伤害包};<br> once the strike hits the target it can be used again within 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfj01_2_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_sfj01_2_12=Heavenly fury breaks bones and flesh: This will knock away the enemy in front and cause{@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_sfj02_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as inflicted with <font color="#FF3030">Mystical Beast (negative)</font> status, which reduces its moving speed by 40% and Flying Skill distance by 4 meters for 5 seconds. <br>At the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">Mystical Beast (positive)</font> status, which increases moving speed by 40%, Flying Skills by a distance of 4 meters, and charging distance of 10 meters for 5 seconds. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_sfj02_12=Heavenly Beast creates wind and shoots dagger from the sky: This will cause the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Once it hits its undefended target: <br>The target will be paralyzed for 2 seconds, as well as added with <font color="#FF3030">"Heavenly Beast (negative)"</font> status which reduces its moving speed by 40% and Flying Skill for a distance of about 4m for 5 seconds; <br>at the same time the player obtains <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Beat (positive)"</font> status which increases its moving speed by 40%, and Flying Skill for a distance of 4m and charging distance of 10m for 5 seconds. <br>(The strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)
desc_CS_jh_sfj03_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>After breaking enemies' parry, they will be knocked down for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfj03_12=Prancing steps that ride the wind in total focus: Rapid charge to selected region and causes enemies in range to{@0:伤害包};<br> after breaking enemies' defense, they will be knocked down for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfj04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Howler</font> state for 5 seconds. When executing the attack <font color="#f9fc00">Howling Storm</font>, ranged attack distance doubles. This effect is cleared after the attack is executed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_sfj04_12=Soaring Dragon on still and moon-less night: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> at the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"All Powerful"</font> state for 5 seconds. When launching the strike <font color="#f9fc00">[Power Over Wind and Clouds]</font>, the shooting distance will increase twofold, it will be cleared after it is launched. <br>(this strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_sfj04_hide_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Serenade the Moon</font> state for 5 seconds. When executing the attack <font color="#f9fc00">Howling Storm</font>, ranged attack distance doubles. This effect is cleared after the attack is executed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_sfj04_hide_12=Soaring through the air on still and moon-less night: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> at the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Tease the Moon"</font> state for 5 seconds. When launching the strike <font color="#f9fc00">[Power Over Wind and Clouds]</font>, the shooting distance will increase twofold, it will be cleared after it is launched. <br>(this strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_sfj05_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Singing Wind"</font> state for 5 seconds. When executing the attack <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Serenading the Moon</font>, the charging speed will increase. This effect is cleared after the attack is executed.  <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_sfj05_12=Wind Song Dies Abruptly and the Clouds Embrace the Wind: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Lauding Wind"</font> state for 5 seconds. When launching the strike <font color="#f9fc00">[Playing with Moon and Lauding the Wind]</font>, the charging speed will increase, it will be cleared after it is launched. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_sfj05_hide_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Singing Wind"</font> state for 5 seconds. When executing the attack <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Serenading the Moon</font>, the charging speed will increase. This effect is cleared after the attack is executed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_sfj05_hide_12=Wind Song Dies Abruptly and the Clouds Embrace the Wind: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> At the same time it enables the player to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">"Lauding Wind"</font> state for 5 seconds. When launching the strike <font color="#f9fc00">[Playing with Moon and Lauding the Wind]</font>, the charging speed will increase, it will be cleared after it is launched. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_sfj06_11=This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> state: When in a defensive state and under attack by enemy, it can render the enemy's attack ineffective, in order to execute the charging strike. This state can persist for 5 seconds.  <br>Counterattack has an effective range of 6 meters. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attack.  Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_sfj06_12=Lying in Wait in Leisure: This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> state: When in a defensive state and under attack by enemy, it can render the enemy's strike ineffective in order to launch the charging strike used in the last time. This state can be maintained for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_sfj07_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can throw undefended targets, and prohibits Flying Skills for 3 seconds.  <br>If the player is in a <font color="#FFAE00">Mystical Beast (positive)</font> state, he/she will be able to throw the target 3 times.
desc_CS_jh_sfj07_12=Showing Unbridled Enthusiasm when the clouds are gone and the rain has ceased: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> The strike can knock away undefended targets, and prohibit Flying Skill for 3 seconds. <br>If the player is in a <font color="#FFAE00">"Heavenly Beast (positive)"</font> state, it will be able to knock away the target 3 times.
desc_CS_jh_sfj08_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking, any enemy who dared to attack would be stunned. The same target will be stunned if hit within 6 seconds, with the stunning effect decreasing each time.  <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_sfj08_12=The rich inner spirit is suppressed and there is overwhelming sadness; the wind obscures all traces: This causes the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> During the strike, any enemy who dared to attack would be stunned (the same target will be stunned unconscious once if hit within 6 seconds, with the stunning effect decreasing each time). <br>(The strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state)
desc_CS_jh_whjf01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Surging Wave</font> to targets: can be knocked down by <font color="#f9fc00">Ocean Connecting the Sky</font> for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_whjf01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Surging Wave</font> to targets: can be knocked down by <font color="#f9fc00">Ocean Connecting the Sky</font> for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_whjf02_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>The last attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets' with <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status.  <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_whjf02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The last attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets' with <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_jh_whjf03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>It can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Surging Wave</font> status.  <br>You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. You can use Flying Skills when using the attack.
desc_CS_jh_whjf03_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>It can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Surging Wave</font> status. <br>(You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the move. You can use Flying Skills when using the move)
desc_CS_jh_whjf04_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>Upon breaking enemies' parry, grant <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status to them: the last attack of <font color="#f9fc00">Clear and Bright Moon Shines, A Song of Lamentable Elegy</font> will <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_whjf04_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When breaking enemies' defense successfully, grant <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status to them: the last attack of <font color="#f9fc00">Clear and Bright Moon Shines, A Song of Lamentable Elegy</font> will <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_whjf06_11=Sword Chi flies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets.
desc_CS_jh_whjf06_12=Sword Chi flies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets.
desc_CS_jh_whjf07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The last attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_whjf07_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The last attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_whjf08_11=Be a party animal. Enter the <font color="#FF3030">Pleasure Seeking</font> state to absorb damage. If this effect remains uninterrupted for 15 seconds, you recover up to 9% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_jh_whjf08_12=Be a party animal. Enter the <font color="#FF3030">Pleasure Seeking</font> state to absorb damage. If this effect remains uninterrupted for 15 seconds, you recover up to 10% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Also adds to targets the <font color="#FFAE00">Ruler of the Heavens</font> status: Temporary paralysis with moving speed gradually recovering after 2.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg01_12=Measuring the sky and sweeping all before it: This causes the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> Also adds to them the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ruler of the Heavens"</font> status: Temporary paralysis with moving speed gradually recovering within 2.5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>After breaking down the enemy's parry, will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kirin Step</font> status: disables skills and disables flying skills for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg02_12=Kirin takes a step and locks the spear in reverse hand: This causes the enemy in front to{@0:伤害包};<br> After breaking down the enemy's defense, will add to it <font color="#FFAE00">"Kirin Step"</font> status: Seal skill and prohibits Flying Skills for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg03_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skills to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg03_12=Ground-shattering hit of the spear in preparation for stealth rebound: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包}. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg05_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The first attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who fail to parry, and the second attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who fail to parry.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg05_12=Coiling spear extracts the soul and the Golden Dragon swings its tail: This cause the surrounding enemies to{@0:伤害包};<br> The spear strikes with Dragon's form and Tiger's Awe: The first strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> enemies who do not defend themselves, and the second strike can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who do not defend themselves.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>This will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target to the position selected by the mouse, and stun all enemies within range for 3 seconds, as well as cause damage.  <br>This attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state. The maximum range of throw is 20 meters.<br>This attack allows use of Flying Skills to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_12=Lifting with the spear and locking the throat with kick: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包};<br> Capturing the Dragon and taming the Tiger with uplifting spear: This will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target to the position selected by the mouse, and render unconscious all enemies within the range for 3 seconds, as way as cause hurt. <br>(This strike is launched in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; the maximum range of throw is 20m)<br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_hide_11=Target is thrown to designated area.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg06_hide_12=Lock and throw to designated position after striking
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>When using this skill, you acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Driving the Wind</font> state: lasts 15 seconds, when you use <font color="#f9fc00">Whirlwind Kick </font>, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state. <br>You also acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Rely on Cloud</font: lasts 15 seconds, increases damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Storm Clouds </font>, max 10 stacks.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>When using this skill, you acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Windriding</font> state: lasts 15 seconds, when you use <font color="#f9fc00">【Wind Blowing Leaves】</font>, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; <br>You also acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Leaning Cloud</font>: lasts 15 seconds, increase damage of <font color="#f9fc00">【Cloud With Wind】</font>, max 10 stacks.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_sky_11=Attaches Whirlwind, max 10 stacks. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt01_sky_12=Prepare to attach NPC buff, upon hitting target, attach buff1 Whirlwind, max 10 stacks, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>If you break target's parry, enemy gets thrown.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>If you break target's parry, apply <font color="#f9fc00">Blow-away</font> effect.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_sky_11=Upon breaking parry, if target is in the air, knocks it to the ground; if target is on the ground, knocks it down, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt02_sky_12=Upon successful Break Defense, if target is in the air, knock it to the ground; if target is on the ground, knock it down, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_11=Enhance your Whirlwind Kick attack! <br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font> effect, increasing the power of your <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> for 18 seconds. <br>While under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font>, your <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> not only gets faster, but also lengthens the paralysis effect of <font color="#f9fc00">Whirlwind Blow</font> by 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_12=Enhance your Whirlwind Kick attack! <br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font> effect, increasing the power of your <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> for 19 seconds. <br>While under the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Dominate</font>, your <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> not only gets faster, but also lengthens the paralysis effect of <font color="#f9fc00">Whirlwind Blow</font> by 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_sky_11=Parry buffs with Power Kick. You receive Yellow Armor effect during your skill preparation until the skill hits target.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt03_sky_12=Parry attaches buff2 named Power Kick, you receive Yellow Armor effect during your skill preparation until the skill hits target
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>Generates <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>: Enemies affected will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 1 second, taking damage. Parry is ignored during paralysis. If you are have the "Dominate" buff, effect lasts 5 seconds.<br>Paralysis gradually decreases.<br>If you have Driving the Wind effect, you launch the skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Generate <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>: Enemies affected will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 1 second, taking damage. (Attach Paralyze effect ignoring Parry, if you have Power Ascension, effect lasts 5 seconds)<br>(Paralyze effect decreases progressively)<br>(If you have Windriding effect, you launch the skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_sky_11=When target is marked, strike him continuously. Target will be affected by a third buff, Sweeping Leaves, and will be paralyzed for 3 seconds, suffering {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt04_sky_12=If you have NPC mark, strike target continuously, affected target will be attached with buff3 Sweeping Leaves and will be paralyzed for 3 seconds, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> by the last hit.  <br>(Removes Paralysis after knocking target down; knock down does not ignore Parry.)<br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skills.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked-down</font> by the last hit. <br>(Remove Paralyze after knocking target down, knock-down does not ignore Parry)<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_sky_11=2 hit Charge, if combo reaches 6 hits, ignores parry and blows away ground unit or knocks down airborne unit, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt05_sky_12=2 hit Charge, if combo achieves 6, ignore Parry and blow away ground unit or knock down airborne unit, refer to roundhouse kick, dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> by the last hit.  <br>(Removes Paralysis after knocking target down; knock down does not ignore Parry.)<br>For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skills. Max charge distance is 20 meters.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, it takes extra damage, and will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked-down</font> by the last hit. <br>(Remove Paralyze after knocking target down, knock-down does not ignore Parry)<br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill, max charge distance is 20 meters)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_sky_11=1 hit, leaps and charges. If you are airborne, you kick downwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt06_sky_12=1 hit, leap and charge, if you are airborne, kick downwards, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Based on how many stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Rely on Cloud</font> there are, deals extra damage.<br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, attaches <font color="#FFAE00">Listening to Wind</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> target for 2 seconds after 5 seconds.  Parrying does not trigger stun effect.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Based on the stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Leaning Cloud</font>, deal extra damage;<br>If target is affected by <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font>, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Listening to Wind</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target for 2 second after 5 seconds. (Parry does not trigger Stun effect)
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_sky_11=Deals extra damage based on Whirlwind, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfsyt07_sky_12=Deal extra damage based on Whirlwind, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_xfz01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast.
desc_CS_jh_xfz01_12=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast
desc_CS_jh_xfz02_11=<br>If target is an enemy: Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and stuns the victim for 3 seconds; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast. <br>If target is an ally, nullifies most control debuffs and Hit Recovery effects, and applies to yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> that lasts 3 seconds. Yellow Armor: grants immunity from all negative effects except stuns (cannot be cast on yourself).
desc_CS_jh_xfz02_12=<br>if it's an enemy target: Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and stuns the victim for 3 seconds; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast <br>If it's a friendly target, nullifies most controlling effects and Hit Recovery effects, and applies to yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> that lasts 3 seconds. Yellow Super Armor: grants immunity from all hindering effects except stuns (cannot be casted on yourself)
desc_CS_jh_xfz02_hide_11=<br>If target is an enemy: Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and stuns the victim for 3 seconds; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast. <br>If target is an ally, nullifies most control debuffs and Hit Recovery effects, and applies to yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> that lasts 3 seconds. Yellow Armor: grants immunity from all negative effects except stuns (cannot be cast on yourself).
desc_CS_jh_xfz02_hide_12=<br>if it's an enemy target: Deals damage and stuns the victim for 3 seconds; nullifies the effect of one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast <br>If it's a friendly target, nullifies most controlling effects and Hit Recovery effects, and applies to yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> that lasts 3 seconds. Yellow Super Armor: grants immunity from all hindering effects except stuns (cannot be casted on yourself)
desc_CS_jh_xfz05_11=Makes a <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Mark</font>, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a specified area, paralyzing victims for 5 seconds; nullifies the effect of a stack of your <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast.  <br>Grants 5 Rage to your teammates within a 20-metre radius around you every second. Last 5 seconds. Cannot be cast on self.
desc_CS_jh_xfz05_12=<br>Makes a <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Mark</font>, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a specified area, paralyzing victims for 5 seconds; nullifies the effect of a stack of your <font color="#FFAE00">Vajra Bonus</font> when the skill is cast. <br>Grants 5 Rage to your teammates within a 20-metre radius around you every one second. Last 5 seconds. (cannot be casted on yourself)
desc_CS_jh_xfz06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a 5-meter radius.  <br>If victim's parry is broken, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Perishable</font> to it. Lasts 6 seconds.  Increases the attacker's damage done by 1% each time an enemy unit affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Perishable</font> is attacked. Stacks up to 10 times. Lasts one minute.
desc_CS_jh_xfz06_12=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a 5-metre radius. <br>If a Break Defense occurs on the victim, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Perishable</font> to it. Lasts 6 seconds. Increases the attacker's damage done by 1& each time an enemy unit affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Perishable</font> is attacked. Stacks up to 10 times. Lasts one minute.
desc_CS_jh_xld01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it adds to the target an <font color="#FFAE00">Understated Beauty</font> status: Continuous bleeding for 8 seconds. The higher the level of <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>, the greater the damage.  <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skills to approach target quickly.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_xld01_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it adds to the target an <font color="#FFAE00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status: Continuous bleeding for 8 seconds. The higher the level of <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>, the greater the damage. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_xld03_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the enemy is in an <font color="#f9fc00">Understated Beauty</font> status, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>.  <br>After the enemy is thrown, it will enter <font color="#FFAE00">Mythical Void</font> status, and within 3 seconds it will cannot be thrown with this attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld03_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the enemy is in an <font color="#f9fc00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>. <br>After the enemy is thrown, it will enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Mythical Void"</font> status, and within 3 seconds it will cannot be thrown with this attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking, <font color="#f9fc00">the player</font> falls into <font color="#FF3030">Asura</font>: Press key repeatedly. If successful, the attack will be executed in rapid succession, otherwise the attack will be interrupted.  <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">Sigh of Passion</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xld04_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking, <font color="#f9fc00">the player</font> falls into <font color="#FF3030">Asura</font>: Press the key repeatedly. If successful the attack will be executed in rapid succession, otherwise the attack will be interrupted. <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Sigh of Passion"</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xld05_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking parry: 30 points of the enemy's flying skill points will be eliminated, while also adding to it <font color="#FFAE00">Rain on Pear Blossom</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Limbo</font>, the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> continuously. Lasts 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xld05_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When successfully breaking defense: 30 points of the enemy's Flying skill points will be eliminated, while also adding to it <font color="#FFAE00">"Rain on Pear Blossom"</font> status: Using <font color="#f9fc00">Limbo</font> the enemy can be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> continuously. The status will continue for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xld06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Each attack will add to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">Tears of Blood</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds.  <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_xld06_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> Each attack will add to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Tears of Blood"</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds. <br>The attack is executed in a <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_CS_jh_xld08_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who are in <font color="#FFAE00">Rain on Peach Blossom</font> status.  <br>This attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. Flying skills may be used when executing the attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld08_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who are in <font color="#FFAE00">"Rain on Peach Blossom"</font> status. <br>This attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. Flying Skill may be used when executing the attack.
desc_CS_jh_xld09_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking the <font color="#f9fc00">enemy</font> will be knocked into <font color="#FF3030">Asura (enemy)</font>: Press key rapidly; if successful, the enemy will be released from the attack, otherwise target will continue to receive blows.   <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">Momentous Night</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xld09_12=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While attacking the <font color="#f9fc00">enemy</font> will be knocked into <font color="#FF3030">Asura (enemy)</font>: Rapid-fire pressing of the button. If successful the enemy will be released from the attack, otherwise Target will continue to receive blows.  <br>This skill shares the same cooldown period with <font color="#f9fc00">"Momentous Night"</font>.
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Every 10 seconds, the attack is executed in Yellow Armor status. There is also a chance to randomly obtain one of the effects of Manic Pounding and Frantic Beating: <br>Manic Pounding: the attack throws the target. <br>Frantic Beating: Remove the time for catching breath in Wild Shot Fist - 2, Wild Shot Fist - 3 and Wild Shot Fist - 6. In addition, there will not be need to catch breath for the next attack.  <br>Damage ignores target's external defense reduction.
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_13=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front. <br>Every 10 seconds, receive Yellow Armor and randomly acquire Raging Attack or Hasty Strike: <br>Raging Attack: This attack applies thrown effect. <br>Hasty Strike: Remove Chi charging period of Wild Shot Fist 2, 3 and 4, and next time you use a move, skill will not enter Chi charging state. <br>Damage ignores target's external defense reduction)
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_14=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front. <br>Every 10 seconds, receive Yellow Armor and randomly acquire Raging Attack or Hasty Strike: <br>Raging Attack: This attack applies thrown effect. <br>Hasty Strike: Remove Chi charging period of Wild Shot Fist 2, 3 and 4, and next time you use a move, skill will not enter Chi charging state. <br>Damage ignores target's external defense reduction)
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_15=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front. <br>Every 10 seconds, receive Yellow Armor and randomly acquire Raging Attack or Hasty Strike: <br>Raging Attack: This attack applies thrown effect. <br>Hasty Strike: Remove Chi charging period of Wild Shot Fist 2, 3 and 4, and next time you use a move, skill will not enter Chi charging state. <br>Damage ignores target's external defense reduction)
desc_CS_jh_yqq01_16=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the front. <br>Every 10 seconds, receive Yellow Armor and randomly acquire Raging Attack or Hasty Strike: <br>Raging Attack: This attack applies thrown effect. <br>Hasty Strike: Remove Chi charging period of Wild Shot Fist 2, 3 and 4, and next time you use a move, skill will not enter Chi charging state. <br>Damage ignores target's external defense reduction)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage, stuns the target and reduces the likelihood of internal Attack Critical Hits, while also causing concussion against nearby enemies (max: 10).  <br>While attacking, the player cannot be thrown, knocked back or knocked down.  <br>Instant recovery when the attack is interrupted or evaded.  <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skills to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_13=Charging Skill, Flipping Fracture Strike, Elegantly Unpretentious: targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_14=Charging Skill, Flipping Fracture Strike, Elegantly Unpretentious: targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_15=Charging Skill, Flipping Fracture Strike, Elegantly Unpretentious: targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq02_16=Charging Skill, Flipping Fracture Strike, Elegantly Unpretentious: targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage, and reduces the likelihood of internal Attack Critical Hits, while also causing concussion to nearby enemies (max: 10).  <br>While attacking, the player cannot be thrown, knocked back or knocked down. <br>Instant recovery when the attack is interrupted or evaded. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skills to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_13=Charging Skill, Scratching Base Strike, Wrapped Fist Strike: Targets receive {@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding target. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_14=Charging Skill, Scratching Base Strike, Wrapped Fist Strike: Targets receive {@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding target. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_15=Charging Skill, Scratching Base Strike, Wrapped Fist Strike: Targets receive {@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding target. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq03_16=Charging Skill, Scratching Base Strike, Wrapped Fist Strike: Targets receive {@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding target. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down. <br>(Combine with Flying Skills to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>Breaks your target's parry to inflict a debuff: receives additional massive damage from all skills of this set.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_13=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_14=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_15=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq04_16=Feint force and step back, hook and spit. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemy. <br>After breaking target's Endurance, add state: Add heavy damage to this Move attack.
desc_CS_jh_yqq06_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage, and reduce likelihood of internal Attack Critical Hits, while also causing concussion to the nearby enemies (maximum 10 persons).  <br>While attacking, the player will obtain the Red Armor status.  <br>Instant recovery when the attack is interrupted or evaded. 80% of lost Rage will be returned.
desc_CS_jh_yqq06_13=Wild Nature Explosion, Disordered Wilderness, Confidently Advance with Fists: Squeezed targets receive{@0:damage packet} and their internal attack critical hit multiplier is decreased. Also shocks away up to 10 surrounding targets. <br>While using this skill, you cannot be launched, knocked back, or knocked down.
