desc_CS_jh_yydf04_11=Twirl with the knife rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>(You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state when using this Skill, and you may use the Flying Skill.) <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Skill Damage increases, You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state when using this Skill"
