desc_CS_jh_yydf07_11=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you; when defeating an enemy Parry: <br>Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.  <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Damage is increased, and the range of your Skill increases to 20 meters in front."
desc_CS_jh_yydf07_12=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you; when defeating an enemy Parry: <br>Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.  <br>"<font color="#FF3030">'Benevolent and Invincible'</font>: Damage is increased, and the range of your Skill increases to 20 meters in front."
desc_CS_jh_yydf07_hide_11=All Actions Go Wrong, Crazy Yuanyang, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to any enemies within 20 meters in front of you; <br>When defeating an enemy Parry: Flying Skill is prohibited for 5 seconds.
