desc_CS_jh_yydld01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> effect, each time you break the target's block, target receives <font color="#FFAE00">Scorching Day</font>, which lowers his or her external defense by 10% for 5 seconds. <br>If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> effect, each time you break the target's block, target receives <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Feather</font>, which lowers his or her attack power by 10% for 5 seconds.
