desc_CS_jh_yydld02_hide_1=Enter a <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> stance for 5 seconds, When blocking an attack, you immediately launch a counterattack. <br>Your counterattack is an overt move that is effective within a 6-meter radius, but it is ineffective against Super Armor, and is vulnerable to feint attacks. This effect can be stacked to increase the damage dealt by the counterattack.
