desc_CS_jh_yydld04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases external damage received by 3%, and can be stacked just once. <br>If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases your defense against external damage by 3%, and can be stacked just once.
desc_CS_jh_yydld04_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases external damage received by 3%, and can be stacked up to 7 times. <br>If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases your defense against external damage by 3%, and can be stacked up to 7 times.
desc_CS_jh_yydld04_11=Moon between pine photos, rock springs high. Left flick the right cut, jump Hengqiao on the front inflict {@0:伤害包}; when the self is "<font color="#FFAE00"> Yao day </font>" state, no hit to parry enemy to add itself "<font color="#FFAE00"> shadow </font>" status: each 3% increase in the external work damage for 8 seconds, stacking 7 layers; <br> when the self is "<font color="#FFAE00"> </font> dark month" state, no hit to parry enemy to add itself "<font color="#FFAE00"> stream shuttle </font>" status: each 3% increase in internal and external defense power for 8 seconds, can stack 7 layers.
desc_CS_jh_yydld04_12=Moon between pine photos, rock springs high. Left flick the right cut, jump Hengqiao on the front inflict {@0:伤害包}; when the self is "<font color="#FFAE00"> Yao day </font>" state, no hit to parry enemy to add itself "<font color="#FFAE00"> shadow </font>" status: each 3% increase in the external work damage for 8 seconds, stacking 7 layers; <br> when the self is "<font color="#FFAE00"> </font> dark month" state, no hit to parry enemy to add itself "<font color="#FFAE00"> stream shuttle </font>" status: each 3% increase in internal and external defense power for 8 seconds, can stack 7 layers.
desc_CS_jh_yydld04_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases external damage received by 3%, and can be stacked up to 2 times. <br>If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases your defense against external damage by 3%, and can be stacked up to 2 times.
desc_CS_jh_yydld04_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases external damage received by 3%, and can be stacked up to 3 times. <br>If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases your defense against external damage by 3%, and can be stacked up to 3 times.
desc_CS_jh_yydld04_4=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, target receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases external damage received by 3%, and can be stacked up to 4 times. <br>If you are under the <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> effect, each time you hit a target who is not blocking, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>. This 8-second effect increases your defense against external damage by 3%, and can be stacked up to 4 times.
