desc_CS_jh_yydld05_1=Leap, then dive and cleave to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets. The initial attack <font color="#f9fc00">throws</font> a target who is not blocking. Attacker then gains <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_yydld05_10=Trinidad Huang day twilight, knife geese fly north wind. Step on board the air, turning cut down, causing nearby enemies {@ 0: package harm}; moves the first strike can <font color="#f9fc00"> knock </font> not parry enemy, the process moves to display < font color = "# f9fc00"> yellow tyrants </font> status.
