desc_CS_jh_yydld05_hide_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets. Targets who fail to block receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Move Clouds</font> effect. When he or she is attacked again with this skill, the attacker recovers 50% damage received as HP. <font color="#FFAE00">Move Clouds</font> lasts for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_yydld05_hide_10=Moon out of the Tianshan Mountains, the vast sea of ​​clouds. Bottoms attack, lower right upper left, causing nearby enemies {@0:伤害包}; to parry enemy not add "<font color="#FFAE00"> the Clouds </font>" STATUS: This routine moves to attack, An attacker could restore blood (50% damage). "<font color="#FFAE00"> the Clouds </font>" state for 10 seconds.
