desc_CS_jh_yydld06_1=Switch freely between Yin and Yang stances, as embodied by the Moon and the Sun. <br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font>, when you break a target's block with Flying Goose Greets the Sun, you debuff your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Scorching Day</font>. When you hit a target who is not blocking with Moon Shadow Sways, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font> effect. <br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font>, when you break a target's block with Flying Goose Greets the Sun, you debuff your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Feather</font>. When you hit a target who is not blocking with Moon Shadow Sways, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>effect. When this happens, two skills switch from Yang to Yin. Sun Infuriates the Sky becomes Peerless Moon, while Black Blade Venerates the Sun becomes Move Cloud and See the Moon.
desc_CS_jh_yydld07_1=A flurry of blade attacks deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_CS_jh_yydld07_10=Wu Chudong south split, heaven and earth sun and the moon float. Slashing frenzy, flying cut plan, swords sky, bombarding the enemy. Inflicts {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_yydld07_11=Wu Chudong south split, heaven and earth sun and the moon float. Slashing frenzy, flying cut plan, swords sky, bombarding the enemy. Inflicts {@0:伤害包}.
