desc_CS_jh_yydld07_9=Wu Chudong south split, heaven and earth sun and the moon float. Slashing frenzy, flying cut plan, swords sky, bombarding the enemy. Inflicts {@0:伤害包}.
desc_CS_jh_zq01_11=Trips targets in front to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Dong Bin Raises a Jug"</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these skills. This effect lasts for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>status.  <br>The level of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>effect is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike.
desc_CS_jh_zq01_12=Turn and Lift a Jug, Force of a Thousand Tons, causes Enemies in front to Stumble and deals {@0:伤害包} damage, <br>and adds <font color="#FFAE00">“Dong Bin Raises a Jug”</font>: You will greatly increase your chance of a Critical Hit next time you use these Skills, and the state will continue for 5 seconds. <br>When you start to use this Skill, you will automatically be raised one level, unless you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Caihe Waist Strike" </font>status.  <br>(The grade of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>state is linked with the effectiveness of the parry to Caihe Waist Strike)
desc_CS_jh_zq02_11=The <font color="#FFAE00">False Sleep </font>effect lets you recover your Blood Stasis to mitigate loss of health. When attacked, you can counter-attack against nearby enemies, and knock them down. The effect lasts for 5 seconds.  <br>The counter-attack has a range of 5 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint.  You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>effect during your counter-attack.  With increased skill level, you can increase damage of counter-attack.
desc_CS_jh_zq02_12=Turn Elbow Bend Knee, Drunken Crouch Intoxicated Sleep, will cause you to enter the <font color="#FFAE00">“False Sleep” </font>state: When attacked by enemies, you can counterattack against nearby enemies, and knock them down. The state continues for 5 seconds. <br>(The counterattack has a range of 5 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint Move. You will be in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>state during your counterattack. Increases Skill level, can intensify counterattack Damage)
desc_CS_jh_zq02_hide_11=Fall to the ground, and recover your health. Gain Yellow Armor and execute a counter-attack against your attacker within 5 meters, knocking him to the ground.
desc_CS_jh_zq02_hide_12=You have collapsed, continuing to heal your bruises; you will gain Yellow Armor and counterattack your target when you are attacked within 5 meters, and knock your opponent to the ground
desc_CS_jh_zq03_11=Your seemingly faltering steps deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target is debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Zhong Li Carries the Jug</font>. For 5 seconds, target is slowed by 40%, and falls when he or she attempts to use Flying Skills. The fall will clear the effect, however. <br>This skill can throw a target and knock him or her down. <br>When using this skill, if you do not have the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect, you will receive 1 stack of that effect. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is also a blocking move. You must block an attack in order to receive 3 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect.
desc_CS_jh_zq03_12=Your seemingly faltering steps deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target is debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Zhong Li Carries the Jug</font>. For 5 seconds, target is slowed by 43%, and falls when he or she attempts to use Flying Skills. The fall will clear the effect, however. <br>This skill can throw a target and knock him or her down. <br>When using this skill, if you do not have the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect, you will receive 1 stack of that effect. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is also a blocking move. You must block an attack in order to receive 3 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect.
desc_CS_jh_zq04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front. <br>If your counter-attack is successful, you can knock your target back, and inflict an <font color="#FFAE00">Elder Guo Throws the Cup </font>effect: He will have difficulty hitting the target with his next attack. The effect will last 5 seconds.  If you are on the first level of <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike, </font>the effect will last an additional second.
desc_CS_jh_zq04_12=Drunkenly Throwing the Cup, Give a Roundhouse Kick while on Your Back, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>If your counterattack is successful, you can knock your target back, and put him in an <font color="#FFAE00">“Elder Guo Throws the Cup” </font>state: He will have difficulty hitting the target next attack; the state will last 5 seconds. (If you are on the first level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike," </font>the state will last an additional 1 second)
desc_CS_jh_zq05_11=Toast your target as you block. If you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect. For 18 seconds, you have a chance to increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Xiangzi Plays the Flute, Elder Guo Throws the Cup, and Imperial Uncle's Neck Lock</font> . If you currently have the <font color="#FFAE00">Fairy Offers Wine</font> effect, you will not benefit from <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font>, but as you block, you can recover energy while lying on the ground.
desc_CS_jh_zq05_12=Toast your target as you block. If you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect. For 19 seconds, you have a chance to increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Xiangzi Plays the Flute, Elder Guo Throws the Cup, and Imperial Uncle's Neck Lock</font> . If you currently have the <font color="#FFAE00">Fairy Offers Wine</font> effect, you will not benefit from <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font>, but as you block, you can recover energy while lying on the ground.
desc_CS_jh_zq06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If you are at level 3 of <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike, </font>the last blow of this skill will knock down your target (no parry).  <br>You can use Flying Skills with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_zq06_12=Hit Chest Drag Feet Bout of Madness, Swinging Step Drunken Leisure, brawling with your target deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If you are at 3rd level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike,” </font>the last blow of this Skill will knock down your target (no parry). <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_zq07_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>The last strike of this skill has a 10% chance of knocking down your target, if he does not parry.  <br>Each level of <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike </font>increases chance of knock down by 10%.  <br>You can use Flying Skills with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_zq07_12=Staggered Horn Cup Tally, Hold Wrist Throat Lock deals {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>The last strike of this Skill has a 10% chance of knocking down your target (has not parried). <br>Each level of <font color="#FFAE00">“Caihe Waist Strike” </font>increases chance of knock down by 10%. <br>(For this skill, approach your foe with Flying Skill)
desc_CS_jh_zq08_11=Toast your target and receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Fairy Offers Wine</font> effect. For 18 seconds, you are slowed but your evasion rate is increased. <br>This effect improves with greater Alcohol Tolerance. <br>With low Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 20% and your evasion rate increases by 5%. <br>With modest Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 15% and your evasion rate increases by 10%. <br>With high Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 10% and your evasion rate increases by 15%. <br>With exceptional Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 5% and your evasion rate increases by 20%. <br>This effect vanishes as soon as you dodge attack, while giving you the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is also a blocking move. You must block an attack in order to receive 3 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect.
desc_CS_jh_zq08_12=Toast your target and receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Fairy Offers Wine</font> effect. For 19 seconds, you are slowed but your evasion rate is increased. <br>This effect improves with greater Alcohol Tolerance. <br>With low Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 20% and your evasion rate increases by 5%. <br>With modest Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 15% and your evasion rate increases by 10%. <br>With high Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 10% and your evasion rate increases by 15%. <br>With exceptional Alcohol Tolerance, you are slowed by 5% and your evasion rate increases by 20%. <br>This effect vanishes as soon as you dodge attack, while giving you the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> is also a blocking move. You must block an attack in order to receive 3 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Caihe Waist Strike</font> effect.
desc_CS_nj_tq01_1=A kicking attack that deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>After you hit a target 5 times, you gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_nj_tq01_10=Sweep elbow side kick, fist staggered, hit the front of the enemy, causing {@0:伤害包}; <br> moves hit five times, and then itself into the <font color="#f9fc00"> yellow tyrants </font> status, 2 seconds.
