desc_CS_nj_tq03_1=A ferocious uppercut deals {@0:伤害包} damage and adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Monkey Flips</font> effect. <br>For 4 seconds, when you attack a target with the <font color="#FFAE00">Monkey Flips</font> effect in the air, target loses 10% HP (but no greater than 10% of your maximum HP), and is <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>.
