desc_CS_nj_tq05_1=Enter a <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> stance for 5 seconds. When blocking an attack, you immediately launch a counterattack. <br>Your counterattack is an overt move that is effective within a 6-meter radius, but it is ineffective against Super Armor, and is vulnerable to feint attacks. This effect can be stacked to increase the damage dealt by the counterattack.
desc_CS_nj_tq05_10=Step mention chest, neck cuff hit the knee, make themselves into the <font color="#FFAE00"> "anti-defensive to the offensive" </font> status: in a state parry enemy attacks, strokes can be disassembled enemy and counterattack the enemy, the state of sustainable 5 seconds. <br> (anti-anti moves, the effective range of 6 meters, the body of Pa invalid, may be unreal restraint. moves to enhance the number of layers can be increased back injury)
