desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_11=Dance with a legion of demons to gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Three Faced Demon</font> effect. When you block an attack, you give your attacker a <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, and have a 55% chance of receiving a <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can get up to 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>When your target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, you can trigger its effect via <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, with their respective <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font> by 3%.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_12=Dance with a legion of demons to gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Three Faced Demon</font> effect. When you block an attack, you give your attacker a <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, and have a 60% chance of receiving a <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can get up to 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>When your target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, you can trigger its effect via <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, with their respective <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font> by 3%.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_13=Dance with a legion of demons to gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Three Faced Demon</font> effect. When you block an attack, you give your attacker a <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, and have a 65% chance of receiving a <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can get up to 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>When your target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, you can trigger its effect via <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, with their respective <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font> by 3%.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_14=Dance with a legion of demons to gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Three Faced Demon</font> effect. When you block an attack, you give your attacker a <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, and have a 70% chance of receiving a <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can get up to 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>When your target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, you can trigger its effect via <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, with their respective <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font> by 3%.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw01_15=Dance with a legion of demons to gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Three Faced Demon</font> effect. When you block an attack, you give your attacker a <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, and have a 75% chance of receiving a <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font>. You can get up to 10 <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br>When your target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>, you can trigger its effect via <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font>, with their respective <font color="#f9fc00">special effects</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase the damage of <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font> by 3%.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When you break enemy's parry, you get ten Rage Points and add Heavenly Music Guide to enemy.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you 10 Rage.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw02_13=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you 10 Rage.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw02_14=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you 10 Rage.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw02_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs target with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you 10 Rage.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw03_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy. If they don't parry, debuff them with Heavenly Music Guide and buff yourself with Joy. Joy effect: Increase damage by 10% and movement speed by 30%. The effect lasts seven seconds. <br>You can use Flying Skills with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw03_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Joy</font> (Damage increased by 10% and movement speed increased by 30%). Lasts seven seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw03_13=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Joy</font> (Damage increased by 10% and movement speed increased by 30%). Lasts seven seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw03_14=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Joy</font> (Damage increased by 10% and movement speed increased by 30%). Lasts seven seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw03_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> and gives you <font color="#FFAE00">Joy</font> (Damage increased by 10% and movement speed increased by 30%). Lasts seven seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a 5-meter radius and add Heavenly Music Guide to the targets who don't parry.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw04_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw04_13=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>.
