desc_CS_nlb_tmw04_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters and debuffs target that does not parry with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw05_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If the target is debuffed with Heavenly Music Guide and is not in defense state, this skill ignores their external defense. <br>You can use 3 Three Faces Seals to get Yellow Armor when using this skill.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw05_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. If target debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> is not in defense status, you can ignore its <font color="#f9fc00">external defense</font>. <br>It takes three<font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
