desc_CS_nlb_tmw06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies within 5 meters in front and stun the enemies with Heavenly Music Guide effect for three seconds. <br>You can use 3 Three Faces Seals to get Yellow Armor when using this skill.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters. Targets debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Seal</font> will be <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for three seconds. <br>It takes three<font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> to gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
