desc_CS_nlb_tmw08_11=Get 3 Three Faces Seals immediately. Three Faces Seal can increase the damage of Heavenly Music Guide, Three Saints Guide, Bodhisattva Guide and Dance with the Demon by 3%.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw08_12=Gain three <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw08_13=Gain three <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw08_14=Gain three <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw08_15=Gain three <font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seals</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Three Faces Seal</font> can increase 3% of the damage caused by <font color="#f9fc00">Heavenly Music Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Saints Guide</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Bodhisattva Guide</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dance with the Demon</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw09_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies within 6-meter radius. <br>When releasing this skill, you get Yellow Armor state.
desc_CS_nlb_tmw09_12=Force enemies within 6 meters to dance with you andDeals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw09_13=Force enemies within 6 meters to dance with you andDeals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw09_14=Force enemies within 6 meters to dance with you andDeals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill.)
desc_CS_nlb_tmw09_15=Force enemies within 6 meters to dance with you andDeals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(You will enter <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using the skill.)
desc_CS_nlb_yzx01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies within 5 meters in front. Upon hit, one of your dubuffs can be cleared.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within five meters. <br>A successful hit removes one <font color="#f9fc00">debuff</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx02_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy. <br>You can use Flying Skills with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an enemy. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_nlb_yzx03_11=Get Story of Painful Past state: Every successful parry grants you with 1 stack of Painful Past, max 9 stacks. The effect lasts 30 seconds. <br>You can cost 3 stacks of Painful Past to use Story of Painful Past (hidden): Sets a Vine Barrier on the ground, dealing external attack damage to the enemies within 5-meter radius and paralyzing them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx03_12=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Sorrow of Departure Expression</font>: A successful parry leads to one <font color="#FFAE00">Sorrow of Departure</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">It</font> can be stacked up to nine times. Lasts 30 seconds. <br>It takes three stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Sorrow of Departure</font> to use <font color="#f9fc00">Sorrow of Departure Expression (Hidden)</font>: Inject internal energy into the seeds and spread them to get <font color="#FFAE00">Vine Barrier</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Vine Barrier</font> deals external attack damage to enemies within five meters and twines around their legs, making them <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for two seconds.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx03_hide_11=Sets a Vine Barrier on the ground, dealing external attack damage to the enemies within 5-meter radius and paralyzing them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx03_hide_12=Inject internal energy into the seeds and spread them to get <font color="#FFAE00">Vine Barrier</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Vine Barrier</font> deals external attack damage to enemies within five meters and twines around their legs, making them <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for two seconds.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies. <br>Upon breaking target's parry, it will add to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">Aching Heart</font> state: When using flying skills, the enemies will be paralyzed for two seconds. The Paralyze effect can be triggered three times.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx04_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets. <br>When breaking target's block, target receives <font color="#FFAE00">Aching Heart</font>effect. For the next 16 seconds, if target attempts to use Flying Skills, he or she will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds. This <font color="#f9fc00">paralysis</font> effect can be triggered 3 times.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx05_11=Sets a Vine Barrier on the ground, throwing enemies within a 5-meter radius and dealing external attack damage to them.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx05_12=Inject internal energy into the seeds and spread them to get <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Barrier</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Barrier</font> deals external attack damage to enemies within five meters and <font color="#f9fc00">knock them away</font>.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. When the attack is interrupted, the attacker knocks back surrounding enemies within a 5-meter radius and paralyzes them for 2 seconds. <br>You can use Flying Skills with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an enemy. If the attack is interrupted, caster's internal energy will <font color="#f9fc00">Repel</font> enemies within five meters and make them <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for two seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_CS_nlb_yzx07_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.  If they don't parry, you teleport to them immediately and paralyze them for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx07_12=Attack the enemy with a Hidden Weapon, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If the attack is dodged, caster will be <font color="#FFAE00">Teleporting</font> next to the enemy and make him <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for two seconds.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx08_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy. <br>If the enemy is affected by Paralyze effect of this skill set, this skill will be replaced by Tears of a Confidant (hidden), which pulls the target to you and deals damage.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx08_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an enemy. <br>If the enemy gets <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font>, this move will be switched to <font color="#f9fc00">Confidante's Tears (Hidden)</font>: Pulls back one of enemies within 20 meters and attack target.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx08_hide_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy.
desc_CS_nlb_yzx08_hide_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an enemy.
desc_CS_single_gxx_1=Create an area of effect that deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Affected enemies are debuffed with 3 seconds of <font color="#FFAE00">Bottomless Sea Abyss</font>, and are bound to you. They <font color="#f9fc00">fall</font> when you move, and vice versa. <font color="#f9fc00">Knock down</font> yourself and your nearby targets in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bottomless Sea Abyss</font> state and are not blocking. <br>This skill can only be used on <font color="#f9fc00">your character</font>.
desc_CS_single_gxx_2=Create an area of effect that deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Affected enemies are debuffed with 4 seconds of <font color="#FFAE00">Bottomless Sea Abyss</font>, and are bound to you. They <font color="#f9fc00">fall</font> when you move, and vice versa. <font color="#f9fc00">Knock down</font> yourself and your nearby targets in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bottomless Sea Abyss</font> state and are not blocking. <br>This skill can only be used on <font color="#f9fc00">your character</font>.
desc_CS_single_gxx_3=Create an area of effect that deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Affected enemies are debuffed with 5 seconds of <font color="#FFAE00">Bottomless Sea Abyss</font>, and are bound to you. They <font color="#f9fc00">fall</font> when you move, and vice versa. <font color="#f9fc00">Knock down</font> yourself and your nearby targets in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bottomless Sea Abyss</font> state and are not blocking. <br>This skill can only be used on <font color="#f9fc00">your character</font>.
desc_CS_single_hsp_fyj_1=This Flying Skill is exclusive to the Mount Hua Sect. <br>Approach your target quickly.<br>This skill gives you <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor.</font>. If your skill is blocked or interrupted, you will be unable to move next to your target.
desc_CS_single_hsp_jwsx_1=<br>When your rage exceeds 50, <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> a target who is not blocking. Impale the ground with your Flying Cloud Sword. Allies who click on it will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Submit to the Sword</font> effect, which gives them a chance to inflict extra 10% damage on their targets for 30 seconds.
desc_CS_single_hsp_jwsx_2=<br>When your rage exceeds 50, <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> a target who is not blocking. Impale the ground with your Flying Cloud Sword. Allies who click on it will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Submit to the Sword</font> effect, which gives them a chance to inflict extra 20% damage on their targets for 30 seconds.
desc_CS_single_hsp_jwsx_3=<br>When your rage exceeds 50, <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> a target who is not blocking. Impale the ground with your Flying Cloud Sword. Allies who click on it will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Submit to the Sword</font> effect, which gives them a chance to inflict extra 30% damage on their targets for 30 seconds.
desc_CS_single_hsp_yjtf_1=<br>Create a sword array with a 10-meter area of effect. When targets' rage is at 50 or below, they are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> if they are not blocking. <br>Allies in the area of effect receive <font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> effect. 6 enemies in the area of effect receive <font color="#FFAE00">Listen to Wind</font> effect. Both effects last for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> increases attack power by 2%. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Listen to Wind</font> reduces enemy's attack power by 2%.
desc_CS_single_hsp_yjtf_2=<br>Create a sword array with a 10-meter area of effect. When targets' rage is at 50 or below, they are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> if they are not blocking. <br>Allies in the area of effect receive <font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> effect. 6 enemies in the area of effect receive <font color="#FFAE00">Listen to Wind</font> effect. Both effects last for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> increases attack power by 5%. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Listen to Wind</font> reduces enemy's attack power by 5%.
desc_CS_single_hsp_yjtf_3=<br>Create a sword array with a 10-meter area of effect. When targets' rage is at 50 or below, they are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font> if they are not blocking. <br>Allies in the area of effect receive <font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> effect. 6 enemies in the area of effect receive <font color="#FFAE00">Listen to Wind</font> effect. Both effects last for 10 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> increases attack power by 8%. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Listen to Wind</font> reduces enemy's attack power by 8%.
desc_CS_single_jjg_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Fencing Music</font>, which reduces the attack power of nearby enemies by 10%. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Fencing Music</font> lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_single_jjg_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Fencing Music</font>, which reduces the attack power of nearby enemies by 15%. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Fencing Music</font> lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_single_jjg_3=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Fencing Music</font>, which reduces the attack power of nearby enemies by 20%. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Fencing Music</font> lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_single_js_1=<br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in a 10-meter area of effect. Targets who leave the array's AoE will have their <font color="#f9fc00">Flying Skills disabled</font> and also be greatly <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_single_js_2=<br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in a 10-meter area of effect. Targets who leave the array's AoE will have their <font color="#f9fc00">Flying Skills disabled</font> and also be greatly <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_single_js_3=<br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in a 10-meter area of effect. Targets who leave the array's AoE will have their <font color="#f9fc00">Flying Skills disabled</font> and also be greatly <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_single_mzy_1=Your agile movements give you 10 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Stainless Garb</font> effect. The next time you're attacked, one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Stainless Garb</font> is removed, while your attack receives a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Water Poison</font>. When <font color="#FFAE00">Water Poison</font> is stacked 10 times, target is <font color="#f9fc00">fainted</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_single_mzy_2=Your agile movements give you 16 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Stainless Garb</font> effect. The next time you're attacked, one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Stainless Garb</font> is removed, while your attack receives a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Water Poison</font>. When <font color="#FFAE00">Water Poison</font> is stacked 8 times, target is <font color="#f9fc00">fainted</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_single_mzy_3=Your agile movements give you 18 stacks of the <font color="#FFAE00">Stainless Garb</font> effect. The next time you're attacked, one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Stainless Garb</font> is removed, while your attack receives a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Water Poison</font>. When <font color="#FFAE00">Water Poison</font> is stacked 6 times, target is <font color="#f9fc00">fainted</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_single_rssq_1=With just One Ladle of Water, you <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> nearby targets who fail to block, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Targets who fail to block are debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Three Thousand Ladles of Water</font>, which greatly reduces their <font color="#f9fc00">evasion</font> rate for 8 seconds. <br>You gain the <font color="#FFAE00">One Ladle of Water</font> effect, which prevents your skills from being <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_single_rssq_2=With just One Ladle of Water, you <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> nearby targets who fail to block, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Targets who fail to block are debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Three Thousand Ladles of Water</font>, which greatly reduces their <font color="#f9fc00">evasion</font> rate for 10 seconds. <br>You gain the <font color="#FFAE00">One Ladle of Water</font> effect, which prevents your skills from being <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_single_rssq_3=With just One Ladle of Water, you <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> nearby targets who fail to block, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Targets who fail to block are debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Three Thousand Ladles of Water</font>, which greatly reduces their <font color="#f9fc00">evasion</font> rate for 12 seconds. <br>You gain the <font color="#FFAE00">One Ladle of Water</font> effect, which prevents your skills from being <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_single_txsj_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage in a 5-meter area of effect. This attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> a target who is not blocking.
desc_CS_single_txsj_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage in a 8-meter area of effect. This attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> a target who is not blocking.
desc_CS_single_txsj_3=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage in a 10-meter area of effect. This attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> a target who is not blocking.
desc_CS_sj_syxz01_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Needle</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage cost of <font color="#f9fc00">Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 26 times. Lasts 15 seconds. <br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz01_13=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Each successful attack to a target who has not parried adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Golden Needle"</font> status to player, which decreases the amount of rage consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> by 1 point. Status may be stacked 26 times. Lasts 15 seconds.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz02_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When breaking a target's block, you inflict him with <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Breaker</font> for 14 seconds, causing him to miss his next attack.<br>The more Medical Value you have, the greater damage you inflict.
desc_CS_sj_syxz02_13=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When breaking a target's block, you inflict him with <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Breaker</font> for 15 seconds, causing him to miss his next attack.<br>The more Medical Value you have, the greater damage you inflict.
desc_CS_sj_syxz03_12=With a successful block, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> effect, which lowers the energy needed to use the skills in this set for 29 seconds. This effect can be stacked 30 times. <br>Every time you use a skill in this set, a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> effect is cleared.
desc_CS_sj_syxz03_13=With a successful block, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> effect, which lowers the energy needed to use the skills in this set for 30 seconds. This effect can be stacked 30 times. <br>Every time you use a skill in this set, a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Web</font> effect is cleared.
desc_CS_sj_syxz04_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the target loses HP by more than 50%, it will trigger secondary damage.  <br>Damage from this attack is determined by the time it takes to charge the skill, which cannot exceed 3 seconds.  If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also knock back the target.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz04_13=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the target loses HP by more than 50%, it will trigger secondary damage. <br>Damage from this attack is determined by the time it takes to charge the skill, which cannot exceed 3 seconds. If the charging time exceeds 50%, the attack will also knock back the target.<br>Damage increases with higher medical value.
desc_CS_sj_syxz05_12=Add <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> effect to target. <br>Enemy targets receive <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>. <br>Friendly targets receive <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> causes extra damage received from attacks for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> absorbs up to 64% of damage received as HP for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sj_syxz05_13=Add <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> effect to target. <br>Enemy targets receive <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>. <br>Friendly targets receive <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> causes extra damage received from attacks for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> absorbs up to 61% of damage received as HP for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sj_syxz06_12=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Will add to the target (self or an ally) <font color="#FFAE00">Clearing Meridians</font> status: HP will be restored every second for 5 seconds.  <br>Charge time is 4 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz06_13=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Will add to the target (self or an ally)<font color="#FFAE00">"Clearing Meridians"</font> status: HP will be restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds. Only 1 person may recover HP at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>Attack power and HP recovery are increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_12=When fully charged, this healing skill <br>restores 70% of a fallen ally's maximum HP. However, you lose 30% HP. <br>Charging takes 3 seconds. This skill can only be used on a teammate who is gravely injured and lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz07_13=When fully charged, this healing skill <br>restores 75% of a fallen ally's maximum HP. However, you lose 25% HP. <br>Charging takes 3 seconds. This skill can only be used on a teammate who is gravely injured and lying on the ground.
desc_CS_sj_syxz08_12=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Allies within 15 meters receive <font color="#FFAE00">Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers</font> status: Great amounts of HP and Energy are restored every second for 5 seconds.  <br>Charge time is 4 seconds, with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> in effect while charging.<br>Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_sj_syxz08_13=Successful charge of this skill has the following effects.<br>Allies within 15m receive <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers"</font> status: great amounts of HP and Energy are restored every second for 5 seconds. <br>Charge time is 4 seconds, with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> in effect while charging.<br>Only 1 person may recover HP continuously at a time. Recovery is not restricted by bruising. <br>HP recovery is increased with higher medical points.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz01_1=Unleash a six-attack combo that deals {@0:伤害包} damage in a 5-meter area of effect in front of you. <br>The fifth attack can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> a target who is not blocking for a short distance. The sixth attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> the target.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz01_10=Palm shadow waves have pushed wild, impulsive layers monstrous potential. Step on the bow legs, six palm pushing and, within the range of 5 meters in front of the enemy causing {@0:伤害包}. <br> if the enemy no time to parry, the fifth hit <font color="#f9fc00"> knock </font> enemy a short distance, the sixth hit <font color="#f9fc00"> down </ font > enemy.
