desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This skill can be used with Flying Skills to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz03_10=Yi waved Wu Xian, watched Guihong difficult. Infuriating to the whole body of the proposed power vortex flow Cang, who touch lax Qi Jin, sudden loss of stature, and inflicting {@0:伤害包}. <br> (This can be used to dodge moves fast approaching opponents)
