desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz06_1=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#FFAE00">Matriarch's Curtain</font>. When you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 6 seconds with a 30-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you block an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font> by 1 second.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz06_2=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#FFAE00">Matriarch's Curtain</font>. When you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 6 seconds with a 25-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you block an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font> by 1 second.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz06_3=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#FFAE00">Matriarch's Curtain</font>. When you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 7 seconds with a 25-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you block an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font> by 1 second.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz06_4=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#FFAE00">Matriarch's Curtain</font>. When you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 7 seconds with a 20-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you block an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font> by 1 second.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz06_5=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#FFAE00">Matriarch's Curtain</font>. When you block an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 8 seconds with a 20-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you block an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font> by 1 second.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz07_1=With a spinning kick, you are <font color="#FFAE00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font>. For 3 seconds, you gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>, and with each 0.6 second you are protected by a <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Cloud</font>. Your  color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> is increased by 10%. Meanwhile, enemies witin 6 meters are debuffed by <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Mist</font>, with their <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> lowered by 10%. <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Cloud</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Mist</font> last for 6 seconds, and can be stacked 5 times. <br>This skill can be interrupted with <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font>. It shares the same recovery time with <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font>.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz08_1=With a sweep of your feet, you enter the <font color="#FFAE00">Inverted River of Stars</font> state. In the next 3 seconds, when you are subject to an unstoppable <font color="#FFAE00">charging attack</font>, the attacker receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Star</font>effect. Attacker's <font color="#f9fc00">skills are disabled</font> for 1 second. Every 0.6 second, enemies within 6 meters of attacker are <font color="#FFAE00">Hung Upside Down</font>, receiving extra 30% soft damage when they are attacked. Each effect <font color="#FFAE00">Hung Upside Down</font> lasts 2 seconds, and this duration can be stacked up to 5 times. The actual damage from the effect is not stacked. <br>This skill can be interrupted with <font color="#f9fc00">Wield Five Strings</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Empty Sea</font>. It shares the same recovery time with <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font>.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz09_1=A graceful move that creates a 15-meter area of effect in front of you, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Break a target's block to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Crisp Bone Softener</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzing</font> the target for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_ssg_bhjtz09_10=Drunken Beauty Park before the dance, smile step flower. Xuanshen step around the lower body fingertips, within 15 meters in front of the enemy, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br> If successful break enemy defenses, it can add <font color="#FFAE00"> "rib cartilage crisp" </font>: <font color="#f9fc00"> set the body </font> 2 seconds.
