desc_CS_ssg_jxc02_1=A swift kick creates a five-meter area of effect, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Targets are <font color="#FFAE00">Constraind by Snow</font>, slowing down by 30% for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc02_10=Ming Sheng from the autumn, winter snows fly Zhijiu. Skills and sideways, within the range of 5 meters in front of the target causing {@0:伤害包}; <br> not parry the target while giving added <font color="#FFAE00"> "Snow War" </font>: reduction 30 % movement speed for 5 seconds.
