desc_CS_ssg_jxc03_1=Create a 5-meter area of effect in front of you, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage and breaking the targets' block. With their feet frozen in place, targets will be <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc03_10=South Jiangbei snow long, Afar Yishui Han. Step on Xuanshen cut, within the range of 5 meters in front of the target causing {@0:伤害包}. Parry break goal, to make the destination frozen feet, 3 seconds <font color="#f9fc00"> Can not move </font>.
