desc_CS_ssg_jxc04_1=Dance in a flurry of snowflakes, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This skill can be used with Flying Skills to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc04_10=Chaos low cloud dusk, anxious Xue Wu back to the wind. Step on the sectional center, dance wrapped fall on the target causing {@0:伤害包}. <br> (This can be used to dodge moves fast approaching opponents)
