desc_CS_ssg_jxc05_1=A spinning move creates an area of effect that deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This skill can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets who fail to block.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc05_10=Twilight snow to help eliminate steep, loose Lin Yu Chen Tong. Tease thorn sideways, hit the spin progress, within a range of 5 meters around the target, causing {@0:伤害包}; <br> moves can be <font color="#f9fc00"> down </font> not parry goal.
