desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_1=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 10% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 6 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_10=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 20% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 10 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_2=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 10% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 7 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_3=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 10% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 8 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_4=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 10% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 9 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_5=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 10% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 10 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_6=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 12% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 10 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_7=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 14% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 10 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_8=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 16% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 10 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc06_9=Defend yourself and <font color="#f9fc00">Stand on Snow</font>. When you block an attack, you receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hard Ice</font>, which reduces the damage your receive by 18% if you do not block the next attack within 10 seconds. Hard Ice is stackable 10 times. One stack is spent when it goes into effect. <br>This effect is cancelled when you use a skill from another set, or your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc07_1=Throw a frozen dagger to create an area of effect that freezes targets and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Targets will <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 3 seconds. <br>Enter this area of effect to add 10% attack power to the twin dagger skills in this set for 10 seconds. <br>If you do not enter the area of effect in 10 seconds, the effect will vanish.
desc_CS_ssg_jxc07_10=Chapman heard barking,   Stride whipping, click Regional Ice thorn throwing surprisingly, within the range of the target causing {@ 0: package} hurt, and it froze, caught in <font color="#f9fc00"> unconscious </font> 3 Miao ; <br> itself into the ice barbed range allows cold ice barbed spines attached to the double increase of the routine moves 10% damage for 10 seconds. <br> (if the ice itself does not enter the range of barbed, barbed ice will disappear after 10 seconds.)
