desc_CS_th_bhcs02_11=Plays the musical note <font color="#9932CD">Fa</font>. Music of the flute inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets and causes target to become paralyzed for 3 seconds.  <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs02_12=Peach blossoms fly and willows sway in the wind; adds <font color="#9932CD">Zhi</font> melody. Music of the flute causes in surrounding enemies {@0:伤害包} and causes target to become Paralyzed for 3 seconds.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If target already has <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's parry has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds.  <br>Can use flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs04_12=The white waves reach the skies and the song subdues the sun and moon. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Shang</font> melody. Stabs the target and then the heart, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>If target already has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's defense has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds.  <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs06_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs06_12=The tide rises, surprising the heavens. The tides fall and demons cry. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Jue</font> melody. Music of the flute is awe inspiring and causes enemies within 8-meter radius to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs07_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Every blow adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.   <br>Internal Injury applies only to players. Damage is based on player attributes. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs07_12=Not yet proficient with the flute. The music of the tides is magnificent. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font> melody. Playing notes Impacts the target, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every blow adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>(Internal Injury is only effective on other players; damage done is based on player's own attributes) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped. Single swords only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_11=Inflicts {@0 : 伤害包} damage to the enemies in front. <br>When attacking, it also inflicts Vampiric effect equal to 25% of the damage.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_13=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_14=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_16=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_17=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_18=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd01_19=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Your hit has <font color="#f9fc00">Leech</font> effect (Converts 25% of damage dealt into HP).
desc_CS_xd_dyshd02_11=Inflicts {@0 : 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When attacking, it also inflicts Vampiric effect equal to 25% of the damage.<br>The first hit on the targets grants you a stack of Soul state. Each stack of Soul can reduce the damage taken from one strike by 50%. <br>You can use Flying Skills with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Converts 25% of the damage you deal into HP.<br>Grants you a stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> each time you hit a target using the first hit of a skill. Each stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> can absorb 50% incoming damage.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd02_13=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Converts 25% of the damage you deal into HP.<br>Grants you a stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> each time you hit a target using the first hit of a skill. Each stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> can absorb 50% incoming damage.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd02_14=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Converts 25% of the damage you deal into HP.<br>Grants you a stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> each time you hit a target using the first hit of a skill. Each stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> can absorb 50% incoming damage.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
desc_CS_xd_dyshd02_15=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Converts 25% of the damage you deal into HP.<br>Grants you a stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> each time you hit a target using the first hit of a skill. Each stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> can absorb 50% incoming damage.<br>(This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill to get close to your opponent faster)
