desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_11=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 11 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_12=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 12 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_13=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 13 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_14=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 14 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_15=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 15 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_16=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 16 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
