desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_18=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 18 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd03_19=<br>When you block an attack, you gain <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font>, which increases the attack power of skills in this set by 5%. This effect can be stacked 20 times.<br>The <font color="#FFAE00">Power</font> effect ends when you stop using skills in this skill set, or when your skill is interrupted.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters. <br>Upon breaking target's parry, <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzes</font> them for 4 seconds.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd04_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in 15 meters.<br>Nullifying an enemy parry will cause the enemy to be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 4 seconds.
