desc_CS_xd_dyshd06_11=Inflicts {@0 : 伤害包} damage to the enemies within five meters in front. <br>When attacking, it also inflicts Vampiric effect equal to 50% of the damage, max 7 times.<br>Hit on the targets grants you two stacks of Soul state. Each stack of Soul can reduce the damage taken from one strike by 50%.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Coverts 50% of the damage you deal into HP. (Conversion times maxes out at 7.)<br>Grants you two stacks of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> the moment this skill causes blood. Each stack of<font color="#FFAE00"> Soul</font> absorbs 50% incoming damage for you.
