desc_CS_xd_xdj01_11=Inflicts {@0 : 伤害包} damage to the enemies. <br>When your HP is below 75%, the attack also inflicts Vampiric effect. The lower your HP is, the more HP you will absorb.
desc_CS_xd_xdj01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Converts part of the damage you deal into HP when your HP is lower than 75%. The less HP you have, the greater the Leech effect.
desc_CS_xd_xdj02_11=Inflicts {@0 : 伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If they don't parry, they are thrown.
desc_CS_xd_xdj02_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Sends the target flying if the hit of the skill is not parried by the target.
desc_CS_xd_xdj03_11=Deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>When you break target's block, you receive 9 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Drinking</font>, which adds the <font color="#f9fc00">Vampiric</font> effect to skills in this set. Each time you damage your target, you consume 1 stack of this effect.
desc_CS_xd_xdj03_12=Drink their blood, Ru their hair, cut in front of the enemy, causing blood {@0:伤害包}; <br> break the enemy parry, their access layer 9 <font color="#FFAE00"> "blood drinking" </font> status: this routine moves attack with <font color="#f9fc00"> Twilight </font> effect, hurt the target layer 1 status is cleared.
desc_CS_xd_xdj04_11=After successful parry, you enter Weeping Blood state: Blood Chant is used instead of Blood Weep.  <br>If you parry more times, Blood Chant will deal higher damage. <br>When parrying five times with Weeping Blood effect, Blood Chant also inflicts Stunned effect.
desc_CS_xd_xdj04_12=<br>Parrying an attack enters you into a state of <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Weep</font> changes into <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>the more parries are made, the greater damage will be done by <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font>.<br>while in the state of <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font>, making 5 or more parries grants <font color="#f9fc00">Blood Song</font> so that each attack applies the effect of Stun.
desc_CS_xd_xdj04_hide_11=Deals {@0 : 伤害包} damage. <br>When parrying five times with Weeping Blood effect, the attack also inflicts stun.
desc_CS_xd_xdj04_hide_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>While <font color="#FF3030">Weeping Blood</font> is active, parrying 5 or more attacks grants Stun effect to the hit of this skill
desc_CS_xd_xdj07_11=Deals {@0 : 伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When your HP is below 50%, the attack also inflicts stun. <br>This attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. Flying skills may be used when executing the attack.
desc_CS_xd_xdj07_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>The lower your HP is, the greater damage the skill damage will be; <br>while your HP is less than 50%, applies <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> to every attack.<br>(During the cast time, you will be protected by <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>. You can use Flying Skills when casting this skill.)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf01_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Adds to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">Out of Ink</font> status: It will be attacked by Flood of Black Ink and will briefly faint.  <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf01_13=Every physical thing is considered transient: This causes the enemy ahead to {@0:伤害包};<br> It also adds to the enemy <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Ink"</font> status: It will be attacked by the strike "Black Ink Ruler" and will become temporarily fainted. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf02_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf02_13=Taking advantage and pressing ahead closely: Rapid whipping of the target to cause it {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_12=Enables player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while parrying, the attack is negated. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font>: damage over time; enemies who enter the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds.  <br>Counterattack can persist for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attacks.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_13=Hidden heaven and earth lying in wait for right opportunity This enables the player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Turning Defense into Attack"</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while in defense status, it is possible to render such attack ineffective. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Qiankun Energy Field</font>: Continuous damage, enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field will exist for 8 seconds. <br>(Counterattack prevention can be maintained for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint moves)<br>(Increase in the strike's level can increase counterattack injury)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_hide_12=When <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font> is triggered, target suffers damage over time and its flying skills are disabled. Enemies who enter the energy field or stand within its range will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds.  <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf03_hide_13=At the time <font color="#f9fc00">Qiankun Energy Field</font> will be created: Continuous damage and prohibits Flying Skill; enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> energy field and <font color="#FF3030">within it range</font> will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field will exist for 8 seconds. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf04_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Upon breaking enemy's parry, player steals the target's HP and Energy, while inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Vacuum</font>: Target is slowed and cannot use flying skills for 5 seconds.  <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf04_13=The wind is down and the clouds are dark; a ruler ends all: Striking the enemy in front from below causes it {@0:伤害包};<br> When breaking down the enemy's defense: Absorbs its life to restore the player's own energy and blood, while also adding to the player <font color="#FFAE00">"Ultimate Emptiness"</font> status: Slowed and Prohibit Flying Skill, will be maintained for 5 seconds. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf05_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Creates a <font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Path Aura</font> to deal damage over time. Enemies who attempt to escape the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The energy field can persist for 8 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf05_13=The ethereal clouds leave no trace: This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包};<br> At the same time there will be created <font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Energy Field</font>: Continuous damage, enemies who blindly attempt to <font color="#FF3030">escape</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds; the energy field can be maintained for 8 seconds. <br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf06_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>Pulls a random target within 20 meters.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf06_13=There are no boundaries to worry, and what is close may be far away: Pull target in front and knock it away to cause {@0:伤害包}.  <br>(Randomly pull all targets within a range of 20m)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf07_12=Faint autumn hill in the reflection of evening mist; black ink ruler with a range of energy force: This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>Powerful energy force: If the enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Ink"</font> status each strike will cause it to be temporarily fainted. <br>(The strike is launched in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status, it is possible to move freely when launching the strike)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xjz_wmcf07_13=Faint autumn hill in the reflection of evening mist; black ink ruler with a range of energy force: This causes the surrounding enemies to {@0:伤害包}.  <br>Powerful energy force: If the enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Broken Ink"</font> status each strike will cause it to be temporarily fainted. <br>(The strike is launched in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status, it is possible to move freely when launching the strike)<br>(If ruler is armed it will exert 100% of the strike's power; if dagger is armed it can only exert 70% of he strike's power)
desc_CS_xy_jlsd01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets, you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Thunderbolt</font> status: the skill damage in the same set increases by 10% and gets 3 stacks at most. The status lasts for 7 seconds.
