desc_CS_xy_ktdj04_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Upon breaking enemy's parry, inflicts target with <font color="#FFAE00">Trapped (Feint)</font> status: Reduces defense of Internal and External skills by 48% for 7 seconds.
