desc_CS_xy_ktdj05_11=Blade Chi echoes constantly between enemies. <br>Targets hit by Blade Chi will get damage, <font color="#f9fc00">paralysis</font> for 2 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds.  <br>Echoes 8 times max.
desc_CS_xy_ktdj05_12=Blade Chi <font color="#f9fc00">echoes</font> constantly between enemies. <br>Targets hit by Blade Chi will get damage, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> for 2 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds. <br>(Blade Chi echoes 8 times at most.)
desc_CS_xy_ktdj06_11=Blade Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> enemies within 8 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds.  <br>The knock back effect ignores enemy's parry. Cannot knock back the same target for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_xy_ktdj06_12=Blade Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> enemies within 8 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds. <br>(The Knock Back effect ignores enemy's Endurance. Cannot knock back the same target in 10 seconds.)
desc_CS_xy_ktdj07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 8 meters. <br>Upon hitting the targets, inflicts them with <font color="#FFAE00">Exchange Sun</font> status: Reduces attack speed by 50% and disables flying skills for 2 seconds. <br>During the attack, you get <font color="#FFAE00">Premium</font> status: Reduces damage taken by 75%. <br>You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. You can use Flying Skills when using the attack.
desc_CS_xy_ktdj07_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 8 meters. <br>When hitting the targets, grant them <font color="#FFAE00">Exchange Sun</font> status: reduce movement speed by 50% and disable flying skills for 2 seconds. <br>During the move, you get <font color="#FFAE00">Supreme</font> status: reduce damage taken by 75%. <br>(You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the move. You can use Flying Skills when using the move)
