desc_CS_yh_hsqs03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If target's parry is broken, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> to it, causing it to have a great chance to miss its coming attack. It also applies <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font>, causing target to be unable to parry for a long time, as well as draining its Energy when hit by Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess. Actual amount of Energy to drain is decided by the level of the skill.
desc_CS_yh_hsqs03_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>Upon successful break of defense, attach target with <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> (target's next attack is very likely to miss) and <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font> (will not be able to use parry for a long time. When hit by Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess, energy will be drained, amount depends on level of skill.
