desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to an initial target and splash damage to adjacent ones within a 8-meter radius around the initial target;<br>Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Flowers</font> to enemy, paralyzing them for 3 seconds.  <br>If the enemy is already affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>, stuns it for 3 seconds (this effect ignores the target's parry).
desc_CS_yhwq_hsqs06_12=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target, also affects targets within 8 meters;<br>attach enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Flowers</font>: Paralyze for 3 seconds. <br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font>, target will be stunned for 3 seconds (ignores Parry).
