desc_Npc_jh_jgjf01_1=Three Marvels Six Rites, Far from the Nine Palaces, wielding your sword causes {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy in front of you; <br>After using this Skill, you will receive a beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>and you can keep up to 9 beams.
