desc_Npc_jh_jgjf03_1=Roaming Three Evading Five, Imperial Sword Attack for Punishment, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy in front; <br>When you overcome the enemy's parry, if you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain the <font color="#FFAE00">“Harmony with Others” </font>state: This Skill will not be sealed the first five times it is used.
