desc_Npc_jh_jgjf04_1=Wear Nine Tread One, Spreading Rebellion, when your parry is successful: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Xun Jia” </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Secret Chant” </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase)
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf04_2=Wear Nine Tread One, Spreading Rebellion, when your parry is successful: <br>You will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, and will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Xun Jia” </font>status: Reflects 50% Damage, can accumulate to 5 levels, and 1 level is removed when you are struck. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will attain <font color="#FFAE00">“Secret Chant” </font>status: Additional Damage during an Attack can accumulate to 5 levels; 1 level is removed when attacked. <br>When you are not in Heaven's Time Favorable Terrain, your parry will receive 1 beam of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light," </font>which can accumulate to 9 levels. <br>(As the effectiveness of the Skill increases, Additional Damage in <font color="#FFAE00">Secret Chant </font>status will increase)
