desc_Npc_jh_jgjf05_1=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzing enemies in a 15-meter range and dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>With <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> (increases movement speed by 5%), while enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> (increases Flying Skill Points consumption by 1 when using Flying Skills and increase Energy consumption by 5% when using skills). The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf05_2=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 5%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 1 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 5% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
