desc_Npc_jh_jgjf05_7=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 20%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 20% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf05_8=Activates <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>, paralyzes enemies in 15-meter range and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven Sword Array</font>: You and your team members will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font> It can increase movement speed by 20%, enemies will gain <font color="#FF3030">Heaven's Gap</font> It can increase Flying Skill points consumption by 2 when using Flying Skill and increase Energy consumption by 20% when using a skill. The array lasts 10 seconds. <br>Only one array can exist.)
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf06_1=Unleashes <font color="#f9fc00">Earth Sword Array</font> to knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, causing {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Earth Sword Array</font>, you and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>, which increases Critical Hit value by 5%, and increases Accuracy by 5%. Your enemy will receive <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting</font>, which reduces External Defense by 5%. This array lasts for 10 seconds.  <br>Only one array can exist at a time.
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf06_2=Inside are Nine Heavens, the Spirit is Nine Earths, unleash <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>, knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, and cause them {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>: You and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>(increases Critical Hit value by 5%, increases Accuracy by 5%), and your enemy will encounter <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting </font>(reduces External Defense by 5%); the Sword Array will last 10 seconds. <br>(Only one Sword Array can exist)
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf06_3=Unleashes <font color="#f9fc00">Earth Sword Array</font> to knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, causing {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Earth Sword Array</font>, you and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>, which increases Critical Hit value by 10%, and increases Accuracy by 5%. Your enemy will receive <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting</font>, which reduces External Defense by 10%. This array lasts for 10 seconds.  <br>Only one array can exist at a time.
