desc_Npc_jh_jgjf06_8=Inside are Nine Heavens, the Spirit is Nine Earths, unleash <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>, knock down enemies within a range of 15 meters, and cause them {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>In the <font color="#f9fc00">Territory Sword Array</font>: You and your teammates will attain <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain </font>(increases Critical Hit value by 20%, increases Accuracy by 20%), and your enemy will encounter <font color="#FF3030">Earth Splitting </font>(reduces External Defense by 20%); the Sword Array will last 10 seconds. <br>(Only one Sword Array can exist)
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf07_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the selected area. <br>If you are in an effect of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target to be <font color="#FFAE00">Infatuated</font>: Keyboard settings are randomized, which will last for 3 seconds. It can be used twice, with an interval of 2 seconds.  <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, this skill will change to <font color="#f9fc00">Nine Palaces Eight Winds.</font>
desc_Npc_jh_jgjf07_2=Six Jia Return to the Origin, Three Marvels Exhaust Principle, causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the selected range; <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target to be <font color="#FFAE00">“Infatuated"</font>: Confused Key Positions, which will continue for 3 seconds; can be used twice, with an interval of 2 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, this Skill will change to the Skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Nine Palaces Eight Winds." </font>
