desc_Npc_jh_jgjf08_1=Three Beginnings Six Eras, Nine Swords Return to One, Gleaming White Sword Light Converges, pursuing your target causes {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>You will also cause Additional Damage depending on the amount of <font color="#FFAE00">“Sword Light,” </font>the <font color="#FFAE00">"Sword Light" </font>will then be cleared. <br>If you are in a state of <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time</font>, you will cause your target <font color="#FFAE00">“Ruptured Liver and Gall”</font>: The enemy will continuously lose HP, which will continue for 5 seconds. <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, you will cause your target to be Stunned 3 seconds.
