desc_Npc_jh_jgjf09_1=Yin Yang Right and Wrong, Visiting the Nine Palaces, Measured Pace, Death Life Sword Slash, will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within the range of your stride and slash; <br>If you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Heaven's Time </font>or <font color="#f9fc00">Favorable Terrain</font>, Damage will be even greater. <br>(The Attack is accompanied by rigidity, and you will be in a <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor </font>state, so you can be attacked.)
