desc_Npc_jh_xld01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>At the same time it adds to the target an <font color="#FFAE00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status: Continuous bleeding for 8 seconds. The higher the level of <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>, the greater the damage. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.<br>Damage is increased with greater skill proficiency.
