desc_Npc_jh_xld02_1=When parry is successful: <br>Adds to the attacker <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font>: Raises <font color="#FFAE00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status and damage for 15 seconds. Effect can be stacked 4 times.
