desc_Npc_jh_xld03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> If the enemy is in an <font color="#f9fc00">"Understated Beauty"</font> status, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>. <br>After the enemy is thrown, it will enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Mythical Void"</font> status, and within 3 seconds it will cannot be thrown with this attack.
