desc_Npc_jh_yxfj03_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Draw the Sword</font>state: When parrying an enemy's attacks, you can disassemble his skill and counterattack, lasts 5 seconds.  <br>In <font color="#FFAE00">Draw the Sword</font>state: Receive special effect when using Upward Move and Sword Chi Flute Heart. <br>Counterattack, effective radius is 20 meters, not effective against Super Armor effect, vulnerable against feint moves.<br>In Draw the Sword state, cannot move when you are parrying.
desc_Npc_jh_yxfj03_10=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> effect: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts 5 seconds. In <font color="#FF3030">Draw the Sword</font>state: Receive special effect when using Upward attack and Sword Chi Flute Heart. <br>Counterattack, effective radius is 20 meters, not effective against Uper Armor effect, vulnerable against feints)<br>In Draw the Sword state, cannot attack when you are parrying)
