desc_skill_6nei_bshw_01_1=Skill is charged for 5 seconds. Within a 10m x 3m area of effect ahead, targets receive modest damage and the Pointing the Way effect. For 10 seconds, their skills are disabled, and they are knocked down every time they use Flying Skills.
desc_skill_6nei_bshw_02_1=Targets within 5 meters receive minor damage. For 20 seconds, their blocks are broken, and they receive the Follow Up a Victory effect, losing 1% HP every second for 10 seconds, and are thrown at the final second.
desc_skill_6nei_bshw_03_1=Inflict minor damage. With each attack, target who is not blocking is thrown, and loses 5% HP.
desc_skill_6nei_bshw_04_1=Charge the skill for 3 seconds, and gain the Suction effect for 20 seconds. When attacked during this period, 80% of damage will be reflected to the player. If the boss is in the Moving Stars state, two randomly chosen targets will have the Movement effect, which throws them to a specified location. These two players must be rescued by their teammates within 10 seconds. Otherwise, the two trapped players will lose 30% HP, and their teammates within 8 meters will lose 10% HP and energy.
desc_skill_6nei_bshw_05_1=Qin Hui sits and breathes for 10 seconds, during which there is 5% chance that attacks against him will be interrupted. When Soothing Chi is complete, Qin Hui gains the Condensed Qi effect, rendering him immune to 20% of damage received. If Soothing Chi is interrupted, the 10-second period is reset.
desc_skill_6nei_bshw_06_1=Disrupt Qin Hui's recovery, removing his Condensed Chi effect.<br>This can be used only on Qin Hui!
desc_skill_6nei_dlxw_01_1=Charge this skillfor 3 seconds to deal massive damage. Target who fails to block will be thrown, and within the next 10 seconds, every skill target uses will result in 1% loss of HP.
desc_skill_6nei_dlxw_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds to  unleash a twin hammer attack that deals massive damage and knocks down targets within 8 meters.
desc_skill_6nei_dlxw_03_1=Twin hammers stun all targets in an area of effect for 20 seconds. If boss is attacked, the effect is canceled.
desc_skill_6nei_dlxw_05_1=A charged projectile that can interrupt the Yue's Might attack from Qing Pi.
desc_skill_6nei_dz_01_1=Targets who fail to block the attack will be stunned and disarmed for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_6nei_dz_02_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to knock back nearby targets and give them the Noose effect, which stuns them for 5 seconds and deals massive damage witihin 2 meters for 10 seconds. If the Expel effect persists, targets receive the Loss effect, losing 5% energy every 2 seconds for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_6nei_dz_03_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to deal moderate damage to nearby players. Targets lose 5% HP each second for 10 seconds. Clear the effect by having another player click on you.
desc_skill_6nei_myfr_01_1=Nearby targets in a 8-meter area of effect receive minor damage. Selected target receives the Cold Thorn effect for 20 seconds and is thrown. Under this effect, target loses Flying Skill points and 2% HP. 20 seconds later, target loses 20% HP and is frozen for 30 seconds, during which his or her external defense is lowered by 100%. Target must move constantly to avoid this effect, which freezes the target when stacked 30 times.
desc_skill_6nei_myfr_03_1=Boss charges skill for 15 seconds, during which her evasion increases by 50%. There is 5% chance of interrupting this kill when boss receives damage. If the skill is uninterrupted, it repels nearby players in a 5-meter radius, and activates the Muddling Smoke effect, which increases the boss's attack power by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_6nei_myfr_04_1=Charge skill for 3 seconds. This attack deals minor damage and can be blocked. If boss has the Deep Cold Armor effect and target is not blocking, it purges target's rage and deplets 50% of his or her energy. When this happens, Deep Cold Armor is removed.
desc_skill_6nei_myfr_05_1=Lady Moon starts dancing for 3 seconds, during which she buries a bomb trap, while attacting any target who is not blocking in a 10-meter area to approach her within 5 meters. Once players enter this 5-meter zone, Lady Moon stuns them. 5 seconds later, the trap is sprung, throwing the targets to inflict massive damage. Thrown players now suffer from Fatal Attraction. For the next 10 seconds, each time they attack, they have a chance of causing a teammate within 5 meters to lose 2% HP.
desc_skill_6nei_pz01_1=Spirit Snake Emerges: Deal damage in an area of effect.
desc_skill_6nei_pz02_1=Snake Charmer: Damage nearby targets.
desc_skill_6nei_pz03_1=Serpent Heart: Gain Serpent Heart effect.
desc_skill_6nei_pz04_1=Tiger Head and Snake Tail: Chance to stun target for 3 seconds.
desc_skill_6nei_pz05_1=Sword of Honor: Disarm weapon of targets and turn them against their wielders.
desc_skill_6nei_pz06_1=Dark Sky Sword: Damage nearby targets and slow them down.
desc_skill_6nei_pz07_1=Boundless Falling Leaves
desc_skill_6nei_shlw_01_1=Deal minor damage to targets in a 10m x 3m area of effect. Targets receive the Phage effect. When stacked 2 times, targets lose 50% HP. If boss carries over 5 stacks of the Opportunistic Strike effect, target loses 50 points of rage.
desc_skill_6nei_shlw_02_1=Boss charges skill for 5 seconds and gains the Bloody Eye effect, which has two versions. In its Yang form, the attack absorbs 30% HP from target. In its Yin form, it throws the target. When Opportunistic Strike is stacked 10 times, releasing this skill will cause targets within a 5-meter radius to lose 10% of their energy.
desc_skill_6nei_shlw_03_1=Deal minor damage to targets in an area of effect. If boss has the Opportunistic Strike effect, target receives the Netherworld effect. For 15 seconds, target has a 20% to be frozen for 1 second every 3 sceconds.
desc_skill_duanwu_xhj_fc_1=<s>
desc_skill_hs_cmls01_1=Break the cultist's defense. Remove Black Demon Armor effect.
desc_skill_hs_cmls02_1=Defeat the cultist's attack. Greatly reduce the damage of Shadow Wing.
desc_skill_hs_cmls03_1=Crush the Demon: Resist the Palpitations debuff from Ou Yang's Tiger's Head attack.
desc_skill_hs_cmls04_1=Quickly remove the blade thrown by Xiang Tianwen's Cirrus Cloud attack, and deal damage to the boss.
desc_skill_hs_cmls05_1=Reduce the effect of Xiao Yao's Sword Wall.
desc_skill_hs_cmls06_1=Unleash Sword Chi to resist Zun Chengzong's Pulverize Jade attack.
desc_skill_hs_dy_01_1=Use metal to control wood.
desc_skill_hs_dy_02_1=Use wood to control earth.
desc_skill_hs_dy_03_1=Use water to control fire.
desc_skill_hs_dy_04_1=Use fire to control metal.
desc_skill_hs_dy_05_1=Use earth to control water.
desc_skill_hs_dy_06_1=Sword Chi Strike
desc_skill_hs_dy_07_1=Sword Chi forms an armor, resisting a great amount of damage.
desc_skill_hs_dy_08_1=Only with this sword will you be able to defeat a target protected by Indestructible Body.
desc_skill_hs_dy_09_1=Only this skill can defeat the effect of Crossing the Demon's Breath.
desc_skill_hs_dy_10_1=With this sword, you can defeat experts who may be more skilled than you.
desc_skill_hs_dy_11_1=Wield a heavy sword. A crude but effective attack.
desc_skill_hs_ffh01_1=Pull nearby targets who are not blocking towards you, and then knock them down.
desc_skill_hs_ffh02_1=Targets within a 5 meter area of effect cannot block.
desc_skill_hs_fy01_1=Armor buff grants immunity against all damage. 100% damage is reflected to attacker.
desc_skill_hs_gj01_1=Deplete 50% of targets' maximum HP within a 30-meter area of effect.
desc_skill_hs_jq_1=Sword qi.
desc_skill_hs_jq_1_1=Sword qi.
desc_skill_hs_oy01_1=Target's attack is disabled while sustaining massive damage and bleeding, losing 1% of maximum HP every second for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_hs_oy02_1=Break target's block and inflict target with Resurgeance, which causes target to lose control.
desc_skill_hs_oy03_1=Nearby targets who are not blocking are inflicted with Resurgeance, losing control over their skills.
desc_skill_hs_qcy01_1=Chi Forces Entry: Every time you attack, you sustain damage.
desc_skill_hs_qcy02_1=When you break target's block, your next block will weaken the target for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_hs_scz01_1=When attacked, player is weakened for 3 seconds.
desc_skill_hs_scz02_1=When target's block is broken, target suffers from Impractical Pace, which disables his or her Flying Skills.
desc_skill_hs_scz03_1=A wall of solid earth repels nearby players for 20 meters.
desc_skill_hs_stw01_1=Cleaving attack. Within 2 seconds, targets in a fan-shaped area of effect are stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_skill_hs_stw02_1=Break target's block and knock them back.
desc_skill_hs_wjgz_1=Return to Form: Defeat your opponent with countless sword attacks.
desc_skill_hs_xb01_1=Snake Bite: A normal cultist attack.
desc_skill_hs_xb02_1=Shadow Strike
desc_skill_hs_xtl01_1=Execute a 3-attack combo with your spear, dealing massive damage.
desc_skill_hs_xtl02_1=An attack to break target's block.
desc_skill_hs_xtw01_1=Target receives massive damage, and cannot attack or block.
desc_skill_hs_xtw02_1=Break a target's block to inflict damage and knock him back.
desc_skill_hs_xtw03_1=Xiang Tianwen throws a blade, creating a 20-meter area of effect that damages targets every second for 3 minutes. Destroy this blade to defeat the attack.
desc_skill_hs_xtw04_1=Xiang Tianwen names a player, and throws a blade at him or her. The target receives the Floating Effect for 15 seconds, during which he or she must be saved by other players. If not, target receives massive damage.
desc_skill_hs_xy01_1=3-attack combo
desc_skill_hs_xy02_1=Break target's block and throws him.
desc_skill_hs_xy03_1=You are affected by Sword Chi. Reflect 100% damage to attacker.
