desc_skill_hsp_cc_lyq_1=Venerated Sword
desc_skill_hsp_cc_shl_1=Hidden sword sheath
desc_skill_hsp_cc_tyx_1=Return to Origin, First Form - Enter the Sword
desc_skill_hsp_cc_wcm_1=Snow on Cherry Blossoms
desc_skill_hsp_cc_xyc_1=Chaotic Sword Chi
desc_skill_hsp_cc_zyy_1=Sword of Wrath
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_cf_01_1=Deal damage to target in three stages. If target has the Sword of Worship status, he or she receives additional damage equal to 20% of his or her HP.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_cf_02_1=Target receives massive damage and loses 1% HP every time he or she uses Flying Skills. Effect lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_cf_03_1=Throw targets within a 5-meter area of effect. Gain Modest Sword effect, which lets you absort 30,000 damage as HP.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_cf_04_1=While exhausted, use a skill to remove the Sword of Worship and exhausted states on yourself.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_lyq_01_1=Targets within a 120° fan-shaped area of effect receives minor damage and the Venerated Man effect, which slows them down by 50%.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_lyq_02_1=Build up a charge of energy over 5 seconds. Being critically hit will have a 30% chance of releasing this charge. At that time, target will receive massive damage and be thrown.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_shl_01_1=Inflict moderate damage. If target is not blocking, he or she loses 20% energy.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_shl_02_1=Damage targets within an area of effect in three stages. The final stage adds the Lock Meridians effect, which reduces brawn by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_shl_03_1=Inflict moderate damage to target and adds Falling Spirit effect: for the next 5 seconds, target loses 10% energy when he or she uses Flying Skills.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_shl_04_1=Deal moderate damage to a random nearby target, throwing him or her. Two targets receive the Yin and Yang states of Spirit Sword, respectively.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_sjt_1=<font color="#f9fc00"> Taihua mysterious Pill </font> <br> immediately be full of all the blood and internal forces.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_tyx_01_1=Damage the target in 6 stages. Although this attack can be blocked, the final attack of this skill can break the target's block.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_tyx_02_1=Target receives massive damage, which can be shared among target's teammates if they are nearby.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_tyx_04_1=Immunity against all attacks for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_wcm_01_1=Damage targets within a 3-meter area of effect in 3 stages. Targets are also slowed by 50% for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_wcm_02_1=Deal moderate damage. If target is not blocking, he or she loses extra 50% HP, and receives the Shivering effect for 20 seconds, during which he or she is paralyzed for 1 second every 5 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_wcm_03_1=Boss builds up a charge of energy to create a sword array over 10 seconds, during which the damage he receive is increased by 50%. If this skill is interrupted, the energy is released, knocking back nearby targets and depleting them 10% of their HP and energy.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_xyc_01_1=Deal Yang damage to target, and gives target the Sword Chi Violation effect, resulting in additional 5% loss of HP.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_xyc_02_1=Deal minor damage to target, and gives target the Sword Chi Violation effect, pulling the player towards the boss. Sword Chi creates an area of effect around the player, in which all targets are paralyzed for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_xyc_03_1=Deal massive damage to target and disables his or her skills for 5 seconds. If target still has the Sword Chi Violation effect, target will be thrown into the air.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_xyc_04_1=Targets more than 15 meter away receive spike damage.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_zyy_01_1=Deal minor damage. If target is blocking, he or she loses extra 20% HP, and and is knocked down.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_zyy_02_1=Attack 3 targets and deal damage in 3 stages. Gain the Tian Shu Reversed effect, which purges the target's rage.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_zyy_03_1=Zheng Yunying charges this skill for 10 seconds, during which targets are paraylzed for 5 seconds and can struggle to escape paralysis. If player fails to escape, he or she is stunned for 10 seconds. When the skill is fully charged in 10 seconds, all targets within a 10-meter area of effect lose 80% HP. If Zheng Yunying is in the Tian Shu Reversed effect, he will inflict spike damage onto all targets within the area.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_zyy_04_1=Deal minor damage to target, who is stunned for 5 seconds. If Zheng Yunying does not have the Meridian Reversal effect, target loses an additional 30% HP and energy.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_zyy_05_1=Deal minor damage to targets, and invoke their inner demons, which explode in 10 seconds, resulting in target's loss of 30% HP.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_zyy_06_1=Cancel the reversed state of your medidian effect on Zheng Yunying. <br><font color="#FF0000">This skill can be used only on Zheng Yunying.</font>
desc_skill_hsp_jm_01_1=Deal minor damage to target in 3 stages. While Demon Sword is in effect, target loses 5% energy.
desc_skill_hsp_jm_02_1=Deal massive damage. While Demon Sword is in effect, target's Flying Skills are disabled for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_hsp_jm_03_1=Deal minor damage to nearby targets. While Demon Sword is in effect, target can be thrown.
desc_skill_hsp_tjt_jn_1=Use an overt attack against the conjured greatsword.
desc_skill_hsp_yjwm_01_1=Charge towards the location where the enemy is knocked down.
desc_skill_hsp_yjwm_03_1=<s>
desc_skill_hsp_yjwm_04_1=Throw nearby targets.
desc_skill_hsp_yzx_04_1=Whistling wind, clouds Dragon. Dunshen spin sword, jump to plug the enemies within the range of 8 meters to pull themselves and <font color="#f9fc00"> down </font>, resulting in {@0:伤害包}.
desc_skill_item_yjp_1_1=The Crystal Jade Bottle gives you a buff.
desc_skill_mrlx_item_1=Neutralizes and provides resistance against insect poison.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_01_1=An overt unarmed attack that paralyzes and disables the skills of targets within a 180° fan shaped area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_02_1=An overt unarmed attack that throws targets and disables their Flying Skills within a 10m x 3m area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_03_1=Summon Miasma Bee
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_04_1=An overt blade attack that disables the skills of targets within a 180° fan shaped area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_05_1=An overt blade attack that throws, stuns and bleeds targets within an 10m x 3m area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_06_1=A feint blade attack that disables the skills of targets within a 120° fan shaped area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_07_1=An overt blade attack that throws targets and depletes his energy within a 5 meter area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_08_1=An overt blade attack that stuns and bleeds targets within a 10 meter area of effect.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_09_1=Block with your blade. If successful, target is thrown and cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_skill_npc_ssgmr_10_1=A major blade overt attack, dealing damage in a 15-meter radius.
desc_skill_qyby_lf01_1=Throw target straight up.
desc_skill_qyby_lf02_1=Knock target down.
desc_skill_qyby_lf03_1=Knock target back.
desc_skill_qyby_lf04_1=Cloak of Chaos
desc_skill_qyby_qp01_1=Smite
desc_skill_qyby_qp02_1=Shruiken: Projectile weapon used by Mo Wuqing to slow Qing Pi down. Since she has a limited quantity of shruikens, it's best to use these only against Qing Pi.
desc_skill_qyby_xws01_1=Enemies are debuffed by "Tired of Picking Flowers": Slowed by 20% for 8 seconds. If this effect is stacked 3 times, target is paralyzed for 2 seconds.
desc_skill_qyby_xws02_1=Target suffers from Fatal Attraction for 4 seconds, and will approach you involuntarily.
desc_skill_qyby_xws03_1=Targets within a 5-meter area of effect take damage and cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_skill_qyby_xws04_1=Damage nearby targets. First strike can knock them down.
desc_skill_qyby_xws05_1=Debuff target with Soft Voice when breaking his or her block. Next time you attack the target, you inflict 15% extra damage for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_ssbd_001_1=Take any clue of the Divine Water heist from a fallen enemy.
desc_skill_ssbd_001a_1=Steal each other and all Shenshui stolen clues.
desc_skill_ssbd_002_1=Stun target.
desc_skill_ssbd_002a_1=Stun each other.
desc_skill_ssbd_003_1=Increase your movement speed.
desc_skill_ssbd_003a_1=Accelerate their movement speed.
desc_skill_ssbd_004_1=Immobilize target.
desc_skill_ssbd_004a_1=Tied to each other, making it impossible to move.
desc_skill_ssbd_005_1=Collect information regarding the Divine Water heist.
desc_skill_ssbd_005a_1=Shenshui pickup stolen information.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_1=When you are in mortal danger, douse yourself with Divine Water to gain a miraculous buff.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_1_1=When your HP is below 25%, Sacred Dew cancels disarmed and paralysis status, and grants immunity against being disarmed and paralyzed for 4 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_1_2=When your HP is below 25%, Sacred Dew cancels disarmed and paralysis status, and grants immunity against being disarmed and paralyzed for 6 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_1_3=When your HP is below 25%, Sacred Dew cancels disarmed and paralysis status, and grants immunity against being disarmed and paralyzed for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_2=Shenshui Gong Qi surgery one of Shenshui concise way after a special catalytic, has been the effect Shenshui door need.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_2_1=When your HP is below 25%, Holy Tear restores the use of your attack and flying skills, and grants immunity against having your attacking and flying skills disabled for 4 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_2_2=When your HP is below 25%, Holy Tear restores the use of your attack and flying skills, and grants immunity against having your attacking and flying skills disabled for 6 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_2_3=When your HP is below 25%, Holy Tear restores the use of your attack and flying skills, and grants immunity against having your attacking and flying skills disabled for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_3=Shenshui Gong Qi surgery one of Shenshui concise way after a special catalytic, has been the effect Shenshui door need.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_3_1=When your HP is below 25%, Hallowed Ice grants immunity against being thrown or knocked down for 4 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_3_2=When your HP is below 25%, Hallowed Ice grants immunity against being thrown or knocked down for 6 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_3_3=When your HP is below 25%, Hallowed Ice grants immunity against being thrown or knocked down for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_4=Shenshui Gong Qi surgery one of Shenshui concise way after a special catalytic, has been the effect Shenshui door need.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_4_1=When your HP is below 25%, Blessed Snow grants immunity against being knocked back or stunned for 4 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_4_2=When your HP is below 25%, Blessed Snow grants immunity against being knocked back or stunned for 6 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_effect_4_3=When your HP is below 25%, Blessed Snow grants immunity against being knocked back or stunned for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_001_1=Deals massive damage to target and inflicts him or her with Grievous Wound, increasing the damage he or she receives by 100% for 25 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_002_1=Deals damage to players within a 5-meter radius. Players are thrown and slowed.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_003_1=Stuns players within a 5 meter radius. They will also consume twice as much energy to use skills.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_004_1=Deals massive damage to target. If target has allies nearby, the damage is shared among them.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_006_1=Damages targets within a fan-shaped area of effect.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_007_1=Gain the Burning Rage buff, stackable 20 times.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_008_1=Defeat your target's block to purge hiis/her rage and reduce his/her energy.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_009_1=Damages target within 5 meters, and causes him or her to bleed.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_010_1=When you defeat an enemy's block, you gain the buff to reflect his or her attacks.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_011_1=Damage targets within an area of effect, and throw them.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_012_1=Burn target, who must enter a Realm of Water to remove debuff.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_013_1=Defeat your target's block to add the "Push with Overwhelming Momentum" effect.
