desc_zf_hsp_01_01_1=If the target has entered the <font color="#FFAE00">"Frost and Thunder"</font> state without parrying, his or her internal defense is reduced by 20% for 10 seconds. You gain Yellow Armow while this skill is in effect.
desc_zf_hsp_02_01_1=If the target has entered the <font color="#FFAE00">"Collapse"</font> state without parrying, he or she is <font color="#f9fc00">disarmed</font> for 10 seconds. This skill can be used only once every minute. You gain Yellow Armow while this skill is in effect.
desc_zyb_Npc_jh_ncd01_1=Inflict moderate damage against a mounted target. <br> This skill can be used with Flying Skills to approach a target quickly.
desc_zyb_Npc_jh_ncd02_1=Inflict moderate damage.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Cold as Ice</font>: The lower the target's HP becomes, the more damage he or she receives. <br> This skill can be used with Flying Skills to approach a target quickly. Maximum range is 20 meters.
desc_zyb_Npc_jh_ncd03_1=Inflict moderate damage against nearby targets. <br>You can move freely while using this skill, and gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> buff.
desc_zyb_Npc_jh_ncd04_1=Inflict moderate damage against nearby targets. <br>When you break down the target's block, your damage against him or her is doubled, and you recover 10 points of rage.
desc_zyb_Npc_jh_ncd05_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>state: When parrying an enemy's attacks, you can dismantle his skill and counterattack, lasts 5 seconds. <br>(Counter skill, effective radius is 6m, it does not work upon Super Armor and may be restrained by Feint Moves. Increase skill stacks to boost counter damage)
desc_zyb_Npc_jh_ncd06_1=Attach self with <font color="#FFAE00">Dagger Cloaked in Red</font>: Absorb minor damage, lasts 10 seconds; <br>When the effect ends, you receive <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">【Dagger Cloaked in Yellow】</font>.
