desc_CS_jh_cyjf03_1=Focus on <font color="#FFAE00">Setting Sun Sword Chi</font> to protect yourself. When you block an attack, you can cause three waves of <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Chi</font> to fill the enemy's body while restoring some of your own energy. <br>This attack originates from <font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font>'s defensive skills.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf03_10=A movement that concentrates <font color="#FFAE00">Setting Sun Sword Chi</font> to protect oneself. After you parry you can cause <font color="#FFAE00">Lihuo Chi</font> to fill the enemy's body while restoring some of your own inner energy.<br>This movement comes from <font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font>'s defense movements.
