desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_6=While moving, freely wield your dagger to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies in front of you.<br>Every critical strike reduces the recovery time of <font color="#FFAE00">Demons Plunder the Soul</font> by 2 seconds. <br>When your own Rage points exceed 60, every critical hit you land will stun your target for 0.5 second. <br>The higher your Rage, the greater the chance of you landing a critical hit.
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_7=desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_7
desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_8=desc_CS_jh_dpgx01_8
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_11=Switch freely between 2 stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font>: When you block an attack, receive <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect. Your <font color="#FFAE00">False Retreat</font> gains 3 meters in range. <font color="#FFAE00">Arrows of Lies</font> gains extra 8 meters. Other skills in this set gain 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font>: When you block an attack, receive <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect, increasing skill damage by 30 per hit, with an extra 61 for <font color="#FFAE00">God of Lies</font>. Increase the charging distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">Feigned Defeat and Feigned Surrender</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf04_12=Switch freely between 2 stances. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Assertive Stance</font>: When you block an attack, receive <font color="#FFAE00">Ask for Defeat</font> effect. Your <font color="#FFAE00">False Retreat</font> gains 3 meters in range. <font color="#FFAE00">Arrows of Lies</font> gains extra 8 meters. Other skills in this set gain 2 meters. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Restrained Stance</font>: When you block an attack, receive <font color="#FFAE00">Undefeated</font> effect, increasing skill damage by 34 per hit, with an extra 66 for <font color="#FFAE00">God of Lies</font>. Increase the charging distance and speed of <font color="#FFAE00">Feigned Defeat and Feigned Surrender</font>.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_11=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Devil's Mirror</font>. Next time you are attacked, you reflect 99% damage. Attacker's acupoints are struck for 3 seconds, hindering his attack and movement.
desc_CS_jh_qbgf06_12=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Devil's Mirror</font> effect: Next time you are hit, 99% of the damage you received will be reflected, and the attacker's accupoint will be hit for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_11=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage. If target has at least 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Force</font>, this attack will cause him or her to <font color="#FFAE00">faint</font>. <br>This is the signature skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> from Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_qyzf01_12=Military science doesn't have aptotic rules, just like water doesn't have settled shape. Deal {@0:伤害包} to target, and if <font color="#FFAE00">Entangled by Iron Force</font> on target stacks to 5 floors, this skill will certainly make target <font color="#FFAE00">stunned</font>.<br>This skill is adept skill of <font color="#FFAE00">Wu Zhen</font> in Green Cloud Castle.
desc_CS_jh_slbwj04_11=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage a target in front of you. <br>if you break target's block, your attack is enhanced with <font color="#FFAE00">Mystic Dragon Assault</font>. For 4 seconds, you inflict 200-650 damage, and stun your target for 3 second. If your target blocks this attack, he or she will not be stunned.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_12=A successful block will add 59 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_13=A successful block will add 65 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_14=A successful block will add 72 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_15=A successful block will add 79 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_16=A successful block will add 86 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_17=A successful block will add 94 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_18=A successful block will add 102 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_19=A successful block will add 110 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_jl_zfd05_20=A successful block will add 118 hard damage to your attacks. Damage is determined by your internal skill.
desc_CS_sl_lzs03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within a 15-meter area of effect in front of you. <br>If skill breaks through enemy's block, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> to the enemy.
desc_CS_sl_lzs03_12=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy.
