desc_CS_xy_shl01_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When targets are hit, they receive 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font>, reducing their attack power by 10% for 20 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font> is only effective against other players.
desc_CS_xy_shl01_10=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>After hitting enemies, you can use this move again. <br>(When casting move again, you will throw <font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font> out, enemies touched by the Blaze will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 2 seconds.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
