desc_CS_xy_shl04_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When breaking enemies' block, they receive 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font>effect, reducing their attack power by 10% for 20 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font> is only effective against other players.
desc_CS_xy_shl04_10=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When breaking enemies' block, they receive 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font>effect, reducing their attack power by 10% for 20 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font> is only effective against other players.
desc_CS_xy_shl04_2=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When breaking enemy's parry, grant him/her <font color="#FFAE00">Fire Watch</font> status: reduce move damage by 10% for 20 seconds. Can have 2 stacks. Gradually recover with the use of moves. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
desc_CS_xy_shl04_3=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When breaking enemies' block, they receive 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font>effect, reducing their attack power by 10% for 20 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font> is only effective against other players.
desc_CS_xy_shl04_4=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When breaking enemy's parry, grant him/her <font color="#FFAE00">Fire Watch</font> status: reduce move damage by 10% for 20 seconds. Can have 3 stacks. Gradually recover with the use of moves. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
desc_CS_xy_shl04_5=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>When breaking enemies' block, they receive 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font>effect,reducing their attack power by 10% for 20 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Watch Fire</font> is only effective against other players.
