desc_CS_xy_shl06_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Burn all enemies within 15 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Unleash <font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font>, damaging every target it touches and <font color="#f9fc00">stunning</font> them for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_xy_shl06_10=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> enemies in the <font color="#FF3030">Sea of Flame</font> into air. <br>(You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the move. Knock into Air effect ignores enemy's Endurance.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
