desc_CS_xy_shl07_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Burn all enemies within 15 meters, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When using this skill, you will be covered in <font color="#FF3030">Sea of Flame</font>, scalding and <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzing</font> targets in the area of effect for 2 seconds. <br>The more time targets are scalded this way, the more damage they receive each time.<br>Your next attack unleashes <font color="#FF3030">Blaze</font>, damaging every target it touches and <font color="#f9fc00">throwing</font> them.
desc_CS_xy_shl07_10=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters. <br>When using the move, you will have <font color="#FF3030">Sea of Flame</font> around you, which scalds enemies nearby constantly and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
desc_CS_xy_shl07_2=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters. <br>When using the move, you will have <font color="#FF3030">Sea of Flame</font> around you, which scalds enemies nearby constantly and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
