desc_CS_xy_shl08_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Targets in a 6-meter area of effect receive {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>After the initial attack <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the targets, it will <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font>them. <br>This skill activates <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>. Flying Skills are possible during the use of this skill.
desc_CS_xy_shl08_10=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 10 meters. <br>The move will constantly <font color="#f9fc00">knock enemies nearby into air</font>. If the target parries, the first attack will <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> him/her to you. <br>(Drag effect ignores enemy's Endurance. The range of drag and knock into air is 10 meters.) <br>(You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> status when using the move. And you can use Flying Skills when using this move.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
desc_CS_xy_shl08_2=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 10 meters. <br>The move will constantly <font color="#f9fc00">knock enemies nearby into air</font>. If the target parries, the first attack will <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> him/her to you. <br>(Drag effect ignores enemy's Endurance. The range of drag and knock into air is 10 meters.) <br>(You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Red Super Armor</font> status when using the move. And you can use Flying Skills when using this move.) <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a Token is equipped. Equipping Dagger and Ruler inflict only 70% damage.)
