desc_CS_dh_trlx03_1=Dash to a selected area and inflict {@0:伤害包} within a 5 meter radius. Skills used during this time will increase Evasion.
desc_CS_dh_trlx03_10=Third Slash. Spin the sword and crosscut. Take the sword back to defend. Sprint to the selected area, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies in a ratious of 5 meters. Substantially increase Evasion Rate when casting.
