desc_CS_dh_trlx05_1=Activates <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: Parrying an enemies attack will enable a counter-attack state for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_dh_trlx05_10=Counterattack Slash. Kick heavily and push the sword to prick downward. Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> state: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(counter-attack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint.  Increasing skill level can intensify counter-attack damage)
