desc_CS_em_qcc01_1=Striking the enemy within 10 meters will inflict the target with{@0:伤害包}. The first strike upon the target will grant a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">“Allure”</font>. Can be stacked up to 4 times and is active for 15 seconds.<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_em_qcc01_10=Dressing colourful garb. Dancing elegantly. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 10 meters in front of you. Get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> for 15 seconds if hit any enemy. Up to 4 stacks. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_em_qcc01_2=Dressing colourful garb. Dancing elegantly. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 10 meters in front of you. Get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> for 15 seconds if hit any enemy. Up to 4 stacks. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
