desc_CS_em_qcc02_1=Parrying grants a 25% chance to inflict the attack with <font color="#FFAE00">Shang Dynasty in Ruin</font>: Health is continuously drained for 10 seconds for a total loss of 168 (Stregthened by the power of your internal skill). After the health drain has ended, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds.<br/> (The attacker cannot be affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Shang Dynasty in Ruin</font> again until 20 seconds have passed)
