desc_CS_em_qcc03_1=A spinning horizontal slash that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters directly in front{@0:伤害包}. Breaking the target's parry will cause them to be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
desc_CS_em_qcc03_10=The Zhou Dynasty fell for a beauty's laughter. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. If breaking enemies' parries successfully you will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> them.
