desc_CS_em_qcc04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters and causes them to be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. The first strike on the target also grants a chance to receive a stack of<font color="#FFAE00">Allure</font>. Can be stacked up to 4 times and is active for 15 seconds.<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_em_qcc04_10=Glancing back and smiling makes all other concubines unbeautiful. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters nearby. Continuously <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Back</font> them. Get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> for 15 seconds if hit any enemy. Up to 4 stacks. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
