desc_CS_em_qcc05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target, while the first strike willg rant a chance to receive a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Allure</font>. Can be stacked up to 4 times and active for 15 seconds.<br/>(This skill can be used to quickly apporoach the target)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_em_qcc05_10=Unparalleled Beauty makes birds surprised, shames the moon and flowers. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> for 15 seconds if hit any enemy. Up to 4 stacks. <br/>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.)<br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
