desc_CS_em_qcc05_9=Unparalleled Beauty makes birds surprised, shames the moon and flowers. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> for 15 seconds if hit any enemy. Up to 4 stacks. <br/>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.)<br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_em_qcc06_1=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Shame and the Flower</font> status:  Continuously restores health, though will be unable to use skills while active. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Allure</font> will increase health recovery by 0.5%. Using skills interrupt and clear all stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Alure</font>. (Allure is active for 3 seconds)<br/>(Stacking <font color="#FFAE00">Allure</font> 4 times will grant <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_em_qcc06_10=Looks like a fairy comes to human world. Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shaming Flowers</font> status: Continuously recover HP. Unable to use other skills while casting. Casting can be stopped by moving. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> can increase 50% recovery. After this skill is ended or stopped remove all <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> stacks. Shaming Flowers status lasts for 3 seconds. <br/>(If you have 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font>, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state when casting.)<br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_em_qcc06_2=Looks like a fairy comes to human world. Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shaming Flowers</font> status: Continuously recover HP. Unable to use other skills while casting. Casting can be stopped by moving. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> can increase 50% recovery. After this skill is ended or stopped remove all <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> stacks. Shaming Flowers status lasts for 3 seconds. <br/>(If you have 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font>, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state when casting.)<br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_em_qcc06_3=Looks like a fairy comes to human world. Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Shaming Flowers</font> status: Continuously recover HP. Unable to use other skills while casting. Casting can be stopped by moving. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> can increase 50% recovery. After this skill is ended or stopped remove all <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font> stacks. Shaming Flowers status lasts for 3 seconds. <br/>(If you have 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font>, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state when casting.)<br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
