desc_CS_em_qcc07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front within 5 meters. Targets that fail to parry may <font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for 2 seconds.<br/> (When <font color="#FFAE00">Allure</font> has been stacked 4 times,<font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> will be granted. Once <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> clears, <font color="#FFAE00">Allure</font> will be cleared as well)
desc_CS_em_qcc07_10=A dresser with a design that tends to make one nostalgic. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. Hit enemies without parrying can <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> them for 2 seconds. <br/>(If you have 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font>, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state when casting. After <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> is ended remove all stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Enamoring City</font>)
