desc_CS_gb_xlsbzc04_1=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: Parrying an opponents attack negates their ability to use skills for 5 seconds and counter attacks.<br> (Counter-attack moves have a 6 meter range. Stacking will increase coun ter-attack damage)
desc_CS_gb_xlsbzc04_10=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> state: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(counter-attack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increasing skill level can intensify counter-attack damage)
