desc_CS_gb_xlsbzc06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters of the affected area.<br>Targets within 5 meters will also receive <font color="#f9fc00">192</font> sustained damage for 3 seconds (Effected by melee strength). Targets within the area of effect will also be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
