desc_CS_jl_bmjs07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to up to 5 targets within 8 meters. Targets that fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. If <font color="#FFAE00">Withered Flesh and Bones</font> is active, you will receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>。<br>Must wait 5 seconds upon hitting the target before the skill can be used again.<br> (Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_jl_bmjs07_10=When the universe created, gas flow up to be sky, solid precipitated to be earth. Brandish blade while spinning. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters (Up to 5 targets) and <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> them if they are not parrying. If you are at <font color="#FFAE00">Back To Life</font> state, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting. <br>Once the attack hits the target, it can be used again within 5 seconds. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
