desc_CS_jl_bmjs07_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to up to 5 targets within 8 meters. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Overcast Cloud</font> status - <font color="#f9fc00">Skills Disabled</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry</font> for 3 seconds. If <font color="#FFAE00">Withered Flesh and Bones</font> is active, <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> is added and the target  will receive 10%^ Blood Stasis.<br> (Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_jl_bmjs07_hide_10=When the universe created, gas flow up to be sky, solid precipitated to be earth. Insert blades to the ground. Howl to the sky. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters (Up to 5 targets) and add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Turbidity</font> state: <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to Parry</font> for 3 seconds. If you are at <font color="#FFAE00">Back To Life</font> state, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting. Restore 10% of your Extravasated Blood. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
