desc_CS_jy_tdshs01_1=Snares the target which causes {@0:伤害包} while adding <font color="#f9fc00">Soul Grasp</font><br>Slows targets by 10% and decreases the distance of Wild Goose Flying Skill and Jump Across the Cloud by 1% for 7 seconds. Can be stacked up to 5 times.
