desc_CS_jy_tdshs03_1=Use a grappling hook to move to targeted destination and inflict damage on targets within 5 meters, as well as <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 3 seconds.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Law of the Universe</font> has been stacked 5 times, <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status will be granted. <font color="#FFAE00">Law of the Universe</font> will be cleared after using.<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_jy_tdshs03_10=Nether swap. Throw out flying claw to selected area. <br>Teleport to selected area. Deals damage to enemies within 5 meters where you launched off and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 3 second. <br>If you got 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Longitude and Latitude</font>, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting. Remove all stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Longitude and Latitude</font> after casting. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_jy_tdshs03_2=Nether swap. Throw out flying claw to selected area. <br>Teleport to selected area. Deals damage to enemies within 5 meters where you launched off and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 3 second. <br>If you got 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Longitude and Latitude</font>, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting. Remove all stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Longitude and Latitude</font> after casting. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
