desc_CS_jy_tdshs04_1=A spinning maneuver dealing {@0:伤害包}<br>Breaking a target's parry will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Days of Darkness</font> status: vasion will activate <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> every 2 seconds for 6 seconds<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_jy_tdshs04_10=A spinning maneuver dealing {@0:伤害包}<br>Breaking a target's parry will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Days of Darkness</font> status: vasion will activate <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> every 2 seconds for 10 seconds<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_jy_tdshs04_2=Pitch and completely darkness. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If breaking target's parrying successfully will add the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Completely Darkness</font> state: Use Flying Skill will change this state into a 2 second <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font>. This status lasts for 6 seconds. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
