desc_CS_jy_tdshs05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the selected target.<br>If the target fails to parry they will be <font color="#f9fc00">Constrained</font> with a lasso. When <font color="#f9fc00">Constrained</font>, the following can be used - <font color="#f9fc00">Be Loose, Don't Lose</font>: The target is entangled and pulled in and <font color="#f9fc00">tossed</font> toward the selected area.
desc_CS_jy_tdshs05_10=Justice Has Long Arms. Although loose but never miss. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected target. <br>Flying Claw will <font color="#f9fc00">Tangle</font> enemy that not parrying. After <font color="#f9fc00">Tangling</font> you can use the skill <font color="#f9fc00">Loose But Never Miss</font>: Push the tangled enemy towards you then <font color="#f9fc00">Throw</font> the target to selected area.
