desc_CS_jy_tdshs06_1=Activates <font color="#FFAE00">Law of the Universe</font> status: Parrying an opponents attack grants<font color="#f9fc00">[Stun Spirit and Grasp the Soul]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Ecstatic Soul]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Days of Darkness]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Long Arm of Justice]</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">[Be Loose, Don't Lose]</font>and<font color="#f9fc00">[World Shaking]</font> with a 1 meter range. Can be stacked up to 5 times while each use consimes a stack. Active for 8 seconds. Upon stacking 5 times <font color="#f9fc00">[Transpose Shadow and Soul]</font> is activated and grants <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. All states will be cleared upon use.
