desc_CS_jz_yydbf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets directly ahead within 15 meters, while also inflicting them with a <font color="#FFAE00">confusion</font> effect and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 30% for 2 seconds.<br> When you have <font color="#FFAE00">“Do”</font> the target can be <font color="#f9fc00">struck down</font> while airborne.<br> (Skill is increased by 100% when a flute is equipped. Equipping a single sword will increase the skill by 70%)
desc_CS_jz_yydbf01_10=Confusing for ten years. Bent forward to perform a cofusing music. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 15 meters in front of you. Add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Confusing</font> state: Be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 30% for 2 seconds. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Do</font> state, this skill will <font color="#f9fc00">Shoot Down</font> enemies in the air. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
