desc_CS_jz_yydbf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters of the surrounding area. <br>Breaking a target's parry will <font color="#f9fc00">internal defense</font> by 12% for 5 seconds. <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">“Re”</font> is active, the target's <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion </font> will be decreased by 10% for 5 seconds.<br> (Skill is increased by 100% when a flute is equipped. Equipping a single sword will increase the skill by 70%)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
