desc_CS_jz_yydbf03_1=Using the skill adds<font color="#FFAE00">Flute Note</font> status for 12 seconds; wherein, a random note of <font color="#FFAE00">“Do”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“Re”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“Mi”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“Fa”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“So”</font> will be played. At the same time, movement restriction will be removed a single time.
