desc_CS_jz_yydbf05_1=Playing the <font color="#FFAE00">Ebrious Flute Note</font>” will deal {@0:伤害包} to targets within an 8 meter range.  Also inflicts the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Ebrious Flute Note</font> status, which will <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">“Mi”</font> has been played, <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> will be extended by 2 seconds.<br> (Skill is increased by 100% when a flute is equipped. Equipping a single sword will increase the skill by 70%)
desc_CS_jz_yydbf05_10=Hard for a soul to arrive. Bitter comes from sorrow. Perform a sorrow music. Playing the flute to cast a <font color="#FFAE00">Music Array</font>. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters and add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Intoxicating Flute Sound</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skill</font> for 3 seconds. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Mi</font> state, this skill give an extra 2 seconds to <font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skill</font>. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
