desc_CS_jz_yydbf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}  to targets within 6 meters and the first strike from the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">Throw</font> the target. <br>If<font color="#FFAE00">“Fa”</font> has been played, each attack will cause the target to be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>.(You can move while executing this skill)<br> (Skill is increased by 100% when a flute is equipped. Equipping a single sword will increase the skill by 70%)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_jz_yydbf06_10=Bright moon won't know farewell. Perform another farewell music. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 6 meters. The first hit of this skill can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> enemies. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Sol</font> state, each hit of this skill can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> enemies. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword) <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
