desc_CS_jz_yydbf09_1=A flurry of dancing flutes inflict {@0:伤害包} to targets within a 5 meter radius. The last strike can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> enemies who are not blocking. If target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Ebrious Flute Note </font>effect, he becomes <font color="#f9fc00">rigid</font>. <br>When you are under the effect of the musical note <font color="#FFAE00">"so" </font>, your attack will have a 20% greater chance of landing a critical hit. <br>A Yellow Armor is in effect while you charge up the skill.<br> Equipping a flute results in 100% effectiveness of this skill. If you have a single sword instead of a flute, this skill can only be 70% effective.
desc_CS_jz_yydbf09_10=Nobody wants to see gray hair in mirror. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. The last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> surrounding enemies that not parrying. If enemies were at <font color="#FFAE00">Intoxicating Flute Sound</font> state, they will get <font color="#f9fc00">Stiffness</font> while being attacked by this skill. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">La</font> state, increase Accuracy Rate by 20%. <br>(Be in Yellow Armor while casting) <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
desc_CS_jz_yydbf09_2=Nobody wants to see gray hair in mirror. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. The last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> surrounding enemies that not parrying. If enemies were at <font color="#FFAE00">Intoxicating Flute Sound</font> state, they will get <font color="#f9fc00">Stiffness</font> while being attacked by this skill. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">La</font> state, increase Accuracy Rate by 20%. <br>(Be in Yellow Armor while casting) <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
