desc_CS_single_cfdh=Old Miracle Worker brought this skill to the people in Hero Island, so that they might have more chances to survive in the Eastern Seas.
desc_CS_single_cfdh_1=Increase flying skill effectiness and recovering rate over water for 25 seconds.
desc_CS_single_cfdh_2=Increase flying skill effectiness and recovering rate over water for 35 seconds.
desc_CS_single_cfdh_3=Increase flying skill effectiness and recovering rate over water for 45 seconds.
desc_CS_single_rfyss=The unique skill of Japanese Yihe Ninja Faction.
desc_CS_single_wdq=A common skill of Japanese Kendo.
desc_CS_single_wdq_1=Absorb a certain amount of damage received as HP for 10 seconds. This skill is cancelled when you're attacked for another time, or when the damage you absorb exceeds 30% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_single_wdq_2=Absorb a certain amount of damage received as HP for 10 seconds. This skill is cancelled when you're attacked 2 times, or when the damage you absorb exceeds 60% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_single_wdq_3=Absorb a certain amount of damage received as HP for 10 seconds. This skill is cancelled when you're attacked 3 times, or when the damage you absorb exceeds 90% of your maximum HP.
desc_CS_single_wnwx=The unique skill of Liu Family.
desc_CS_single_wnwx_1=Enter a rarefied state for a <font color="#FFAE00">Contemplation of Nothingness</font>. Your skills are immune to becoming disabled or randomized for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_single_wnwx_2=Enter a rarefied state for a <font color="#FFAE00">Contemplation of Nothingness</font>. Your skills are immune to becoming disabled or randomized for 9 seconds.
desc_CS_single_wnwx_3=Enter a rarefied state for a <font color="#FFAE00">Contemplation of Nothingness</font>. Your skills are immune to becoming disabled or randomized for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_single_wshj=A defensive skill developed by Old Miracle Worker, this skill has been refined by the Mo family of the Justices of Fate, who now share it with the four factions of Penglai.
desc_CS_single_wshj_1=With roaring thunder, enemies within a 10 meter area of effect become disoriented.
desc_CS_single_xkx=A mysterious skill recently rediscovered in the depths of Hero Cavern, its origin long forgotten.
desc_CS_single_xkx_1=After you have comprehended 24 lines of verse in Hero Cavern, use this item to practice your skills. You will cultivate at an accelerated rate.
desc_CS_single_xsmq=Another skill developed by Old Miracle Worker of Clarion Cliff, and shared among the three other factions of Penglai.
desc_CS_single_xsmq_1=With a clarion sound of a flute, you and your allies within a 10 meter radius recover energy over time.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} to targets within a 5 meter radius. <br>If you maintain the <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandas of Emptiness</font> effect, this atack has a greater chance of inflicting a critical hit. <br> Different body sizes (81-100) will result in different degrees of effectivness.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg01_10=In Buddha's thought. All the world is just dust. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. <br>If you were in <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas Are All Empty</font> state, the Critical Hit Rate will be increased significantly. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_sl_chpdg01_2=In Buddha's thought. All the world is just dust. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. <br>If you were in <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas Are All Empty</font> state, the Critical Hit Rate will be increased significantly. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
