desc_CS_sl_chpdg03_1=Parrying reduces the cooldown of Five Skandhas of Emptiness by 1 second.<br>Also adds <font color="#FFAE00">Release from Suffering</font>: Activates Guanyin Lowers Her Gaze and Save the World, dealing 34 points of Yang damage (Damage affected by the power of your melee) for 8 seconds.
