desc_CS_sl_chpdg04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters. <br>If the target fails to parry, they will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas of Emptiness</font> status.The final attack of this still will cause the target to bK <font color="#f9fc00">knocked Down</font>.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg04_10=Own nothing. Gather no dust. Never settle in one place. Swing the staff and thump on the ground. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>If the enemies are in the Unable to Parry state or you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas Are All Empty</font> state, the last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies.
