desc_CS_sl_chpdg05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br> (This move can be used to quickly approach the target)
desc_CS_sl_chpdg05_10=Look down on the world to find people who need help then help them.  Deals {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
