desc_CS_sl_chpdg06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters. <br>Breaking the targets parry inflicts them with<font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 2 seconds and are unable to parry for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg06_10=Turn back. Nothing but misery awaits you. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>breaking enemies' parrying successfully will make them <font color="#f9fc00">Stiff</font> for 2 seconds and unable to parry in 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg06_2=Turn back. Nothing but misery awaits you. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>breaking enemies' parrying successfully will make them <font color="#f9fc00">Stiff</font> for 2 seconds and unable to parry in 5 seconds.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg06_3=Turn back. Nothing but misery awaits you. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>breaking enemies' parrying successfully will make them <font color="#f9fc00">Stiff</font> for 2 seconds and unable to parry in 5 seconds.
