desc_CS_sl_chpdg08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters, causing them to fall to the floor.<br>If <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas of Emptiness</font> is active, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font> and unable to get up.<br>(Using the skill grants <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and can be sued with flying skills)
desc_CS_sl_chpdg08_10=Abandon yourself and enter reincarnation, deliver all the world. Brandishing staff madly likes swirling wind clears the leaves. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Make knocked down enemies unable to get up. <br>If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas Are All Empty</font> state, every hit of this skill will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies. <br>(Get yourself <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> and able to use Flying Skills while casting)
desc_CS_sl_chpdg08_2=Abandon yourself and enter reincarnation, deliver all the world. Brandishing staff madly likes swirling wind clears the leaves. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Make knocked down enemies unable to get up. <br>If you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">Five Skandhas Are All Empty</font> state, every hit of this skill will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies. <br>(Get yourself <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> and able to use Flying Skills while casting)
