desc_CS_tm_ykr01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front within 5 meters. <br>If the target fails to parry and is hit, <font color="#FFAE00">swipe</font> will reduce their evasion by 10% for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_tm_ykr01_10=Brandish dagger in a instant. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>Hit enemies not parrying will <font color="#FFAE00">Steal</font> them 10% of Evasion Rate for 12 seconds.
