desc_CS_tm_ykr02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets directly in front. Breaking the target's defense will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Mythical Void</font> status for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#f9fc00">[Spirit Wails to the Gods]</font> will cause the target to be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> and inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Mythical Void</font> upon the target.
desc_CS_tm_ykr02_10=Squat and spin the dagger. Deals {@0:伤害包} to front enemies. If breaking enemies' parrying successfully will add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> state which lasts for 5 seconds. <br>Skill <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Cry God Howl</font> can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> state.
