desc_CS_tm_ykr04_1=Throw a hiddien weapon to the selected area, activated <font color="#FFAE00">Shock Both Spirits and Gods</font>. The hidden weapon will detonate, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters. After the detonation, a toxic gas will be left over, activating <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails to the Gods</font>.<br>While hidden in the gas, the catser will receive<font color="#FFAE00">A Fish in Water</font>:  Grants immunity from <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font>,<font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font>.<br>The poisonous gas will continue to effect targets and inflict them with <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wail</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wail</font>: Continuous damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 25% each second.
desc_CS_tm_ykr04_10=Clouds gather, mists roll, ghost cry and god howl. Throw a hidden weapon <font color="#FFAE00">Shock Ghost and God</font> to selected area. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Creates a smoke area <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Cry God Howl</font>. <br>Hide yourself in the smoke. <font color="#FFAE00">As a Fish In Water</font>: Immunity to <font color="#f9fc00">Forbid Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard Settings Randomize</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disable</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Slow</font>. <br>The smoke will also affect enemies inside: Make them <font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skill</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard Setting Randomized</font>, take continuously damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed/font> by 25% per second.
desc_CS_tm_ykr04_2=Clouds gather, mists roll, ghost cry and god howl. Throw a hidden weapon <font color="#FFAE00">Shock Ghost and God</font> to selected area. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Creates a smoke area <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Cry God Howl</font>. <br>Hide yourself in the smoke. <font color="#FFAE00">As a Fish In Water</font>: Immunity to <font color="#f9fc00">Forbid Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard Settings Randomize</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disable</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Slow</font>. <br>The smoke will also affect enemies inside: Make them <font color="#f9fc00">Forbidding Flying Skill</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard Setting Randomized</font>, take continuously damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed/font> by 25% per second.
