desc_CS_tm_ykr06_1=<font color="#FFAE00">The Sound of Wind and the Cry of the Stork</font> status: Parrying the target's attack will activate an enveloping toxic gas and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails to the Gods</font> for 48 seconds.<br>Hide yourself in the cloud of toxic gas to gain <font color="#FFAE00">A Fish in Water</font>: Immunity from <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font>.<br>Meanwhile, the toxic gas will inflict surrounding targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#FFAE00">God's Cry</font>: Continuous damage for 25% each seond and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> status.
