desc_CS_tm_ykr06_7=<font color="#FFAE00">The Sound of Wind and the Cry of the Stork</font> status: Parrying the target's attack will activate an enveloping toxic gas and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails to the Gods</font> for 36 seconds.<br>Hide yourself in the cloud of toxic gas to gain <font color="#FFAE00">A Fish in Water</font>: Immunity from <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font>.<br>Meanwhile, the toxic gas will inflict surrounding targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#FFAE00">God's Cry</font>: Continuous damage for 25% each seond and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> status.
desc_CS_tm_ykr06_8=<font color="#FFAE00">The Sound of Wind and the Cry of the Stork</font> status: Parrying the target's attack will activate an enveloping toxic gas and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails to the Gods</font> for 34 seconds.<br>Hide yourself in the cloud of toxic gas to gain <font color="#FFAE00">A Fish in Water</font>: Immunity from <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font>.<br>Meanwhile, the toxic gas will inflict surrounding targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#FFAE00">God's Cry</font>: Continuous damage for 25% each seond and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> status.
desc_CS_tm_ykr06_9=<font color="#FFAE00">The Sound of Wind and the Cry of the Stork</font> status: Parrying the target's attack will activate an enveloping toxic gas and activate <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails to the Gods</font> for 32 seconds.<br>Hide yourself in the cloud of toxic gas to gain <font color="#FFAE00">A Fish in Water</font>: Immunity from <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font>.<br>Meanwhile, the toxic gas will inflict surrounding targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wails</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>, <font color="#FFAE00">God's Cry</font>: Continuous damage for 25% each seond and <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> status.
desc_CS_tm_ykr07_1=Appear behind the target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to them and inflicts them with <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second. <br> (Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_tm_ykr07_10=The wild has no boundary. A sudden thunder will frighten souls. Blink to target's back and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Also <font color="#f9fc00">Stiff</font> the target for 1 second. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
