desc_CS_tm_ykr08_1=A skill unique to the Tangmen, the <font color="#FFAE00">Reincarnated Blade</font>.<font color="#FFAE00">Reincarnated Blade</font> will knock the target 15 meters away.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Reincarnated Blade</font>can lead to <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font> - Throws the target and deals 168 damage (A melee bonus is added if close)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
