desc_CS_wd_rzrj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly ahead and within 5 meters.<br>If the target fails to parry the caster will receive <font color="#FFAE00">Dreaming Spirit</font>: Accuracy increased by 10% for 10 seconds.<br>If one strikes the target without parrying, the target will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Enter Dream</font>, causing them to be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>; after which, <font color="#FFAE00">Enter Dream</font> will clear.
desc_CS_wd_rzrj01_10=Grass shows green, soul shows dull blue. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>Hit enemies not parrying will get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Dream Soul</font> state: Increase 10% Accuracy Rate for 10 seconds. <br>Hit enemies who are not parrying and have <font color="#FFAE00">In Dream</font> with them will <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> them and remove their <font color="#FFAE00">In Dream</font> state.
