desc_CS_wd_rzrj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Life Water</font> is active, each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Like Water</font> will grant additional damage for each attack.<br> (This move can be used to quickly approach the target)
desc_CS_wd_rzrj02_10=Failed to detain. Just remains heart broken. Deals {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>Gain additional damage which is depending on the stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font> on you. Remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font> after each hit. <br>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
