desc_CS_wd_rzrj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front and within 5 meters. Defending a from an enemy attack will cause the target to be unable to parry for 3 seconds and will inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Enter Dream</font>. (Active for 5 seconds). While active, striking targets with <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Soul</font> will cause them to be knocked away.
desc_CS_wd_rzrj03_10=Westerly is chilly. Hard to fall in sleep. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. If breaking enemies' parrying successfully will add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Dreaming</font> state for 5 seconds. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">Soul Shows Dull Blue In Dream</font> can launch up enemies in Dreaming.
desc_CS_wd_rzrj03_2=Westerly is chilly. Hard to fall in sleep. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. If breaking enemies' parrying successfully will add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Dreaming</font> state for 5 seconds. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">Soul Shows Dull Blue In Dream</font> can launch up enemies in Dreaming.
