desc_CS_wd_rzrj04_1=Inflicts the target with <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> and deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Life Water</font> active, each stack will cause attacks to deal additional damage, though each attack landed will remove a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Life Water</font>. <br> (Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
