desc_CS_wd_rzrj04_9=Gazing in a trance after drunken. Blink to target and deals {@0:伤害包} and <font color="#f9fc00">Stiff</font> the target temporarily. <br>Gain additional damage which is depending on the stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font> on you. Remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font> after each hit. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_CS_wd_rzrj06_1=Parrying an attack grants a stack(Up to 10) of <font color="#FFAE00">Like Water</font>: Grants additional damage for <font color="#f9fc00">Grief-Stricken</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Inane Gaze</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Three Lives at Your Whim</font> (Damage dealt is affected by <font color="#f9fc00">Flow Like Water</font>, internal strength and the amount of stacks of<font color="#FFAE00">Life Water</font>). Active for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_wd_rzrj06_10=Time runs like a river. After parrying successfully get yourself a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font>: Adds damage while casting <font color="#f9fc00">Heart Broken</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Gazing In a Trance</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Pliant Three Lives</font> (Additional damage is affected by the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Running Likes Water</font>, Internal Attack Damage and stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font>). The status lasts for 15 seconds and up to 10 stacks.
desc_CS_wd_rzrj06_2=Time runs like a river. After parrying successfully get yourself a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font>: Adds damage while casting <font color="#f9fc00">Heart Broken</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Gazing In a Trance</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Pliant Three Lives</font> (Additional damage is affected by the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Running Likes Water</font>, Internal Attack Damage and stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Watery</font>). The status lasts for 15 seconds and up to 10 stacks.
