desc_CS_wd_rzrj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the selected target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Life Water</font> will icnrease damage dealt based on the amount of times it has been stacked. Each attack landed will remove a stack from <font color="#FFAE00">Life Water</font>.
