desc_CS_wd_rzrj08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters of the surrounding area. Striking a atrget that fails to parry will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Endless Sorrow</font> for 3 seconds; during which, targets who attempt to use a skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked Down</font>. <br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_CS_wd_rzrj08_10=What a sadness. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. Hit not parrying enemies will add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Sadnee</font> state for 3 seconds: <font color="#f9fc00">Fall down</font> if attempt to attack. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
