desc_Npc_88PVP_yyd01_1=Activates<font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font> status: Enhances all skills within this set. Effect has 6 stackes. Each skill used will remove a stack. Status will end if you switch to another weapon or use a skill from a different set. n(Active for 60 seconds)<br>(You will also receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> upon using this skill)
