desc_Npc_hs_hsjf07_1=Activates <font color="#FFAE00">Indistinct Green Mountain</font> status: Grants a 100% chance to Evade enemy attacks. For 2 seconds. Each Evade will damage the enemy. <br> (Using a dashing skill will cancel the effect)<br> (Effect can be stacked. Each stack will increase the damage)
desc_Npc_hs_hsjf07_10=The hidden streams of the Green Mountain have kept the Southern Plains verdant, even at the onset of autumn. Observing enemies' action and hiding counterattack. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">Indistinct Green Mountain</font> state for 2 seconds. You have a very good chance of evading enemy attacks, and launching a counterattack afterwards. <br>Using a skill that lets you charge towards your target will cancel this effect. <br>The more this effect is stacked, the more damage you can avoid.
desc_Npc_hs_hsjf07_11=The hidden streams of the Green Mountain have kept the Southern Plains verdant, even at the onset of autumn. Observing enemies' action and hiding counterattack. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">Indistinct Green Mountain</font> state for 2 seconds. You have a very good chance of evading enemy attacks, and launching a counterattack afterwards. <br>Using a skill that lets you charge towards your target will cancel this effect. <br>The more this effect is stacked, the more damage you can avoid.
