desc_Npc_jh_mzjf04_1=Converts your Rage into 2000 Parry Endurance points and clears <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> status. <br> Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> status: Striking a target with Mozi's Sword will deal additional damage that is equal to 3% of your current Parry Endurance points (Maximum of 80 additional damage). You will also recover 2 Rage points for each hit. (Active for 12 seconds) <br>If your Parry Endurance drops below 30%, you will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.<br>(The higher this skill is cultivated, the more Parry Endurance points you can recover)
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf04_10=Converts your Rage into 5000 Parry Endurance points and clears <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> status. <br> Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> status: Striking a target with Mozi's Sword will deal additional damage that is equal to 3% of your current Parry Endurance points (Maximum of 320 additional damage). You will also recover 2 Rage points for each hit. (Active for 12 seconds) <br>If your Parry Endurance drops below 30%, you will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.<br>(The higher this skill is cultivated, the more Parry Endurance points you can recover)
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf04_2=Converts your Rage into 2400 Parry Endurance points and clears <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> status. <br> Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> status: Striking a target with Mozi's Sword will deal additional damage that is equal to 3% of your current Parry Endurance points (Maximum of 110 additional damage). You will also recover 2 Rage points for each hit. (Active for 12 seconds) <br>If your Parry Endurance drops below 30%, you will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.<br>(The higher this skill is cultivated, the more Parry Endurance points you can recover)
