desc_Npc_jh_mzjf04_7=Converts your Rage into 4400 Parry Endurance points and clears <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> status. <br> Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> status: Striking a target with Mozi's Sword will deal additional damage that is equal to 3% of your current Parry Endurance points (Maximum of 278 additional damage). You will also recover 2 Rage points for each hit. (Active for 12 seconds) <br>If your Parry Endurance drops below 30%, you will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.<br>(The higher this skill is cultivated, the more Parry Endurance points you can recover)
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf04_8=Convert your Rage into 5000 Parry Endurance Points, also clear <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to Parry</font> state. <br>Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> state for 12 seconds: Hitting a target with Mozi's Sword will deal extra damage which equals to 3% of your Current Parry Endurance Points (extra damage is up to 320). You also recover 2 points of Rage for each hit. <br>If your Parry Endurance is below 30%, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Weak Super Armor</font> while casting. <br>The higher you cultivate this skill, the more you can recover your Parry Endurance Points.
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf04_9=Convert your Rage into 5000 Parry Endurance Points, also clear <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to Parry</font> state. <br>Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Chi of Jianghu</font> state for 12 seconds: Hitting a target with Mozi's Sword will deal extra damage which equals to 3% of your Current Parry Endurance Points (extra damage is up to 320). You also recover 2 points of Rage for each hit. <br>If your Parry Endurance is below 30%, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Weak Super Armor</font> while casting. <br>The higher you cultivate this skill, the more you can recover your Parry Endurance Points.
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_1=Receive <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> status:  When attacking a target with Mozi's Sword, the target will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>. <br>Target's inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> have a 20% chance for their skills to be cancelled or Disabled for 3 seconds. (Active for 15 seconds and can be stacked up to 2 times.) Each time the target uses a skill, 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_10=Receive <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> status:  When attacking a target with Mozi's Sword, the target will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>. <br>Target's inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> have a 20% chance for their skills to be cancelled or Disabled for 3 seconds. (Active for 15 seconds and can be stacked up to 9 times.) Each time the target uses a skill, 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> will be removed.
