desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_4=Receive <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> status:  When attacking a target with Mozi's Sword, the target will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>. <br>Target's inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> have a 20% chance for their skills to be cancelled or Disabled for 3 seconds. (Active for 15 seconds and can be stacked up to 5 times.) Each time the target uses a skill, 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_5=Receive <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> status:  When attacking a target with Mozi's Sword, the target will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>. <br>Target's inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> have a 20% chance for their skills to be cancelled or Disabled for 3 seconds. (Active for 15 seconds and can be stacked up to 6 times.) Each time the target uses a skill, 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> will be removed.
