desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_7=Receive <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> status:  When attacking a target with Mozi's Sword, the target will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>. <br>Target's inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> have a 20% chance for their skills to be cancelled or Disabled for 3 seconds. (Active for 15 seconds and can be stacked up to 8 times.) Each time the target uses a skill, 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> will be removed.
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_8=Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> state: When you attack a target with Mozi's Sword add the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> state. <br>Targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> state have a 20% chance to be interrupted when use a skill and they will be Skill Disabled for 3 seconds. This status lasts for 15 seconds and stack up to 9. (Each time target uses a skill remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>.)
desc_Npc_jh_mzjf05_9=Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Universal Love</font> state: When you attack a target with Mozi's Sword add the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> state. <br>Targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font> state have a 20% chance to be interrupted when use a skill and they will be Skill Disabled for 3 seconds. This status lasts for 15 seconds and stack up to 9. (Each time target uses a skill remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Non-Aggression</font>.)
