desc_Npc_jh_mzjf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Attack and Defend</font>: Once your Parry Endurance has exceeded 75%, your attacks will bypass 5% of the target's External Damage reduction. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Reinforced Attack</font>: If your Parry Endurance points are below 30%, you can recover 20 Rage points after using this skill.<br>(While your Parry Endurance is above 75%, you cannot be thrown, knocked back or down)
