desc_Npc_jh_mzjf08_8=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br><font color="#f9fc00">Both Attack and Defend</font>: When your Parry Endurance Points exceeds 65%, your attack will ignore 15% of your target's External Damage Reduction. </font>If your Current Parry Endurance Points is less than 30%, you can recover 20 points Rage after using this skill. <br>(If parry endurance is above 65%, you will not be thrown, knocked down or back)
