desc_Npc_jh_qzjf07_1=Gain<font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> status: Increases Evasion for 3 seconds and unable to be locked on by charging skills, while unable to use charging skills yourself. Moving or using skills while under this status will end it. <br>If the status ends naturally, the skill will automatically activate and deal damage(Based on skill level) to targets within 5 meters, then<font color="#f9fc00">Knocking them down</font>。<br>(This skill cannot be used with airborne)
desc_Npc_jh_qzjf07_10=Snow is whiter than plum however plum is more fragrant than snow. Gains <font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> state: Increases Evasion by 50% for 3 seconds and makes you unable to use Charging Skills or be locked by Charging Skills. If move, use skills or be attacked, the state will be removed.  <br>If the state ended naturally, this skill will be performed automatically, dealing damage (affected by skill level) to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Them Down</font>.   <br>(This skill cannot be used in the air.)
