desc_Npc_jh_qzjf07_4=Snow is whiter than plum however plum is more fragrant than snow. Gains <font color="#FFAE00">Sword of Transformation</font> state: Increases Evasion by 50% for 3 seconds and makes you unable to use Charging Skills or be locked by Charging Skills. If move, use skills or be attacked, the state will be removed.  <br>If the state ended naturally, this skill will be performed automatically, dealing damage (affected by skill level) to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Them Down</font>.   <br>(This skill cannot be used in the air.)
