desc_Npc_jh_tlw02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Target will also be inflicted with <font color="#FF3030">Fatal Attraction</font>: Target cannot control themseves and will automatically walk toward you for 4 seconds.<br>(Fatal Attraction does not work on airborne targets but will bring them down to the ground)<br>(Skill only uses on other players)
