desc_Npc_jh_tlw07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets in the selected area. <br>Additionally, casts <font color="#f9fc00">Dance Shadow</font>: Targets within 5 meters will be unable to use Flying Skills. <br>You will also gain 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Veil of Silk</font>: Swap positions with nearby targets and damage them with <font color="#f9fc00">Dance Shadow</font>. Each swap consumes 1 stack. (Active for 10 seconds and can be stacked up to 2 times)<br>(Only one Dance Shadow may be active at a time. Activating another will cancel the previous one.<br>(When activating the skill under Veil of Silk status, you will receive <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_Npc_jh_tlw07_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in your selected area.<br>Also creates a <font color="#f9fc00">Dancing Shadow</font>: Enemies within 5 meters will be unable to use their Flying Skills. <br>At the same time you will get 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Veil of Silk</font> state: You can switch position with the <font color="#f9fc00">Dancing Shadow</font> and damage nearby enemies.  This status lasts for 10 seconds and stacks up to 2 times. Each switch costs 1 stack.  <br>Only one Dance Shadow may exist. The new Dance Shadow you made will replace the previous one.<br>When executing this skill in Veil of Silk state, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_Npc_jh_tlw07_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in your selected area.<br>Also creates a <font color="#f9fc00">Dancing Shadow</font>: Enemies within 5 meters will be unable to use their Flying Skills. <br>At the same time you will get 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Veil of Silk</font> state: You can switch position with the <font color="#f9fc00">Dancing Shadow</font> and damage nearby enemies.  This status lasts for 10 seconds and stacks up to 2 times. Each switch costs 1 stack.  <br>Only one Dance Shadow may exist. The new Dance Shadow you made will replace the previous one.<br>When executing this skill in Veil of Silk state, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
