desc_Npc_jh_yydf05_1=Enter the <font color="#FF3030">"A Kind Person Has No Enemies" </font> state, enhance all of your other skills in this set. This effect has 6 stacks and lasts for 60 seconds. Remove 1 stack for each skill you used, and A Kind Person Has No Enemies state is completely lost if you switch to another weapon or use a skill in another set.<br> You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor </font>when using this skill.
desc_Npc_jh_yydf06_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: If you are struck while attempting to parry, you can negate their attack and counter-attack. Status active for 5 seconds.<br>(Counter-attack has a 6 meter range, is ineffective against Super Armor and can be restrained by a feint. Cultivating the skill will increase the counter-attack damage)<br><font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: Damage is increased and counter-attack distance is increased to 25 meters.
desc_Npc_jh_yydf06_10=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> state: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Cultivate this skill to increase the damage of its counter-attack) <br><font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: Damage increases. Counterattack Distance increases to 25 meters.
