desc_Npc_jh_yydf07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front of you. <br>Breaking the target's parry will disable their Flying Skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">A Kind Person Has No Enemies</font>: Damage is increased while the skill's effective range is increased by 20 meters in front of you.
