desc_Npc_jh_yydld01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. If you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font> status and break a target's parry, you will inflict them with<font color="#FFAE00">Scorching Day</font> status: Decreases external defense by 10% for 5 seconds.<br>If you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> status and break a target's parry, you will inflict them with<font color="#FFAE00">Flying Feather</font>: Decreases skill-based damage by 10% for 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_yydld02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets. Target's that fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_yydld02_hide_01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.
desc_Npc_jh_yydld02_hide_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: If you are hit while attempting a parry, you will negate their attack and they will be hit instead. Active for 5 seconds.<br>(Counter's has a range of 6 meters, if inefftive against Super Armor and can be overcome by a feint. Increasing the skill level will increase the Counter's damage dealt)
desc_Npc_jh_yydld03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>(Can be used with a Flying Skill to quickly approach the target)
desc_Npc_jh_yydld04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target directly in front of you. If you are under <font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font>” status, each time you hit a target that fails to parry you will receive a single stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Shadow</font>: Each stack will increase your attack damage by 3%. (Active for 8 seconds and can be stacked up to 7 times.)<br>When under <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font> status, each time you hit a target that fails to parry you will receive a single stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Swaying Shadow</font>: Each stack will increase your external and internal defense by 3%. (Active for 8 seconds and can eb stacked up to 7 times)
desc_Npc_jh_yydld05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding targets and will launch targets that fail to parry. When activating this skill you will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_yydld05_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. Targets that fail to parry will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Move Clouds</font> status: Being struck by another attack from this skillset will convert the damage dealt into HP. (<font color="#FFAE00">Move Clouds</font> is active for 5 seconds)
desc_Npc_jh_yydld06_1=Switch your status.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Shining Sun</font>: Sun Infuriates the Sky becomes Peerless Moon.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Dark Moon</font>: Black Blade Venerates the Sun becomes Move Cloud and See the Moon.
desc_Npc_jh_yydld07_1=Attack with a flurry of blades. Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets.
