desc_Npc_ssg_jxc07a_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets; additionally, they will <font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for 3 seconds.<br>Entering the area of effect can increase damage for skills within this set by 10% for 10 seconds.<br>(If you do not enter the area of effect then it will disappear after 10 seconds)
desc_Npc_ssg_jxc07a_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets; additionally, they will <font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for 3 seconds.<br>Entering the area of effect can increase damage for skills within this set by 20% for 10 seconds.<br>(If you do not enter the area of effect then it will disappear after 10 seconds)
desc_Npc_ssg_jxc07a_11=Back to home in a snowy night. Throw a frozen dagger to create an area that freezes enemies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage, also <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> them for 3 seconds. <br>Entering this area yourself can make your damage of this set increased by 20% for 10 seconds. <br>(If you do not enter the area in 10 seconds, the area will disappear.)
