desc_jiebai_NPChuixue_1=Recover HP
desc_jiebai_jinlan_1=Receive 300 Jinlan Points
desc_jiebai_ls_001_1=A powerful Mental Skill, activates a Super Armor which abosrbs incoming damage and returns 50% of it to one's own HP. Active for 2 minutes. Can only be used in <font color="#f9fc00">Oath of Friendship</font>
desc_jiebai_ls_002_1=Incites targets into an angered state, causing all enemies within 50 meters to become aggressive toward you. Once they enter a 20 meter radius they will receive 10 damage every second. Active for 2 minutes. Can only be used in <font color="#f9fc00">Oath of Friendship</font>
desc_jiebai_ls_003_1=Stuns all targets within a 15 meter radius and inflicts Vulnerable status and clears any healing effects in place.<br/>Vulnerable: 100% additional damage from attacks. Can only be used in <font color="#f9fc00">Oath of Friendship</font>
desc_jiebai_ls_004_1=Instantly recovers 30% of your health and continuously increases your health by 30% for 2 minutes. Also induces a body protecting chi effect, which will persist for 2 minutes before it is broken.  (Cannot be stacked). Can only be used in <font color="#f9fc00">Oath of Friendship</font>
desc_jiebai_ls_005_1=Full restores Energy every 30 seconds for 2 minutes. Can only be used in <font color="#f9fc00">Oath of Friendship</font>
desc_jiebai_zhaohuan001_1=Summon teammates
