desc_jn_wjd_behavior05_01_1=Disguise as a villager
desc_jn_wjd_behavior13_1_1=<s>
desc_jn_wjd_behavior35_01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}. Target will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font> if they fail to parry the final attack.<br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a spear, or 70% if equipped with a staff)
desc_jn_wjd_behavior35_02_1=Deals{@0:伤害包}. Breaking a target's parry will inflict them with<font color="#FFAE00">Stampede</font>: Target will be<font color="#f9fc00">Knocked Down</font> when attacked. Active for 3 seconds<br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a spear, or 70% if equipped with a staff)
desc_jn_wjd_behavior35_04_1=Damages targets directly in front of you.<br>Breaking the target's parry will inflict Paralysis: Target is frozen and unable to parry.
desc_jn_wjd_behavior35_05_1=A three-pronged attack dealing {@0:伤害包}.
desc_jn_wjd_behavior35_06_1=A light attack which deals {@0:伤害包}<br>This skill can break a target's parry and reduce their movement speed.
desc_jn_wjd_behavior39_01_1=This skill has a range of 15 meters directly in front of you. Aim carefully as you only have one chance to use this skill. If you fail in using this skill, speak with the Chinese army scout to leave the area and try again. (Skill cannot be used in combat)
