desc_pld_cike01_1=While in stealth mode, you have a chance of stealing Elder's Tokens from elders of the four factions. Once you have one from each faction, exchange with Gu Xin the mysterious assassin for an important item.
desc_pld_cike03_1=Use this only on the elder guardian. Strike him on the back of his head, and he'll be out for 5 minutes.
