desc_skill_SJclone01_b06_1=Can make you peace down. <br>Only can be used in the last 5 seconds of this state <br>Can clear the Seckill state
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_01_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals damage to target in 3 stages. This damage can be shared by teammates.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_02_1=Charge this skill for 5 seconds. Deals damage to enemies who are parrying on the ground and paralyze them for 3 seconds. Kill the enemies who are not parrying on the ground immediately. Deals a littel damage to enemies in the air.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_03_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds and deals a large amount of damage to current target. This damage can be parried. But if parried this damage the target will be disarmed for 5 seconds. If in the Rage state, the effect of Wuyou's skills will change: If hit the target will stun the target and deal 10 damage to enemies near the target. Also add Vulnerable state to Secret Devices in this area.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_04_1=Deals damage to all enemies in the front area and clear all their Rage Points if they are not parrying. Also have a chance to add them with All Empty state: Lost 2% of Energy every 5 seconds. This status lasts for 1 minute.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_05_1=I am the master of all the weapons. Charge this skill for 5 seconds. Launch up all enemies within 5 meters. Randomly get 1 Mastery state from a total of 9. Such as Mastery-Single Sword, Mastery-Double Swords and Mastery-Single Blade. Each state of Mastery will let the enemies unable to use corresponding weapon for a period of time.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_sj01_1=Charge this skill for 2 seconds and deal a small amount of damage to nearby targets. Cause enemies in the air fall down.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_sj02_1=Charge this skill for 2 seconds and deal massive damage to enemies in the area. If breaking enemies' parrying successfully will add them with Kongyou state: Have a chance to stun for 0.5 seconds every 2 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_sj03_1=Deals a amount of damage to current target. If the target is not parrying then add the target with Vulnerable state: Take 50% additional damage in 10 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_sj04_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Then launch up all the targets within 2 meters after casting and deal 5% HP damage. If launch up any target will get 10-second-shield to absorb 10% damage.
desc_skill_SJclone01_boss_sj05_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds and add Quiet state to all the targets in this area. If players try to move within 3 seconds after debuffed with Quiet, they will lost 80% HP and make other players within 3 meters lost 50% HP.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_01_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds and deal a medium amount of damage to all the targets and add them with Unique Heaven state: Using Sword Skills causes 5% HP loss. Using other kinds of skills causes 2% HP loss. This state lasts for 10 second.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_02_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals damage to targets in the front in 3 stages. The last hit will launch up enemies not parrying. If this attack hit more than 3 target will get a 10-second-state which reflect 100% damage.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_04_1=Deals a small amount of damage to enemies in a cone area in the front and launches them up.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_05_1=Applies a 50% slowing effect to all the targets within 8 meters then deals damage to them in 3 stages. Each stage of damage equals to their 10% HP but unable to damage enemies in the air.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_06_1=Throw out crossed hidden weapons which wandering in the area. These hidden weapons exist for 20 seconds. If be touched 3 times will explore, freeze up all the targets and reduce their External Defense by 50%. Lose 1% HP per second and in the Hidden Weapon Area.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_07_1=Throw out hidden weapons in a straight line which launch up all the enemies in the path and decrease their Movement Speed and Accuracy Rate by 50%.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_08_1=Charge this skill for 5 seconds. Then get a state that can reduce 30% damage taken.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_09_1=Deals a small amount of damage to all the enemies in a annual area and add them with Buring state: Decrease External Defense by 50%. Have a chance to receive an extra 2% HP damage when be damaged.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_10_1=Deal minor damage to all the targets in the behind and add them with Shadow state. Stun the target for 2 seconds if the Shadow state stacks to 20 times.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_11_1=Deals minor damage to current target. The target reduces 100% Evasion Rate and makes nearby allies lose 5% HP every 2 seconds in the next 10 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_12_1=Deals minor damage to target and adds a hidden poison on the target. The poison explores after 10 seconds: If the target's Energy is less than 50% then lose 10% HP, otherwise lose all Rage Points and stun for 1 second.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_13_1=Throw out an orb. This orb continuously absorbs 3% Energy of all the targets in this area per second in 30 seconds. Deals damage of 100% HP to all the targets after 30 seconds. If this orb is broken in 30 seconds, all the targets will recover energy and 10 Rage Points.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_14_1=Shock the ground and deal a medium amount of damage to targets within 10 meters and slow them by 80%. The Deceleration lasts for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_15_1=Deals a medium amount of damage to all the targets and decreases their External Defense by 60% for 30 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_16_1=Push a Chi Wave off which knocks back all the enemies and deals a medium amount of damage to them.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_17_1=Deals minor damage to target and increases External damage by 20% for 30 second.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_18_1=Deals minor damage to and paralyzes the target for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_19_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals a medium amount of damage to all the targets nearby and adds them with Towing Soul state: If failed to QTE will be launched up and damage decrease by 20% for 1 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_20_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals minor damage to all the targets nearby and adds them with Chopping state: Launches up the targets in the air and deals 80% HP damage to targets on the ground.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_01_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals damage to target in 3 stages. This damage can be shared by teammates.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_02_1=Charge this skill for 5 seconds. Deals damage to enemies who are parrying on the ground and paralyze them for 3 seconds. Kill the enemies who are not parrying on the ground immediately. Deals a littel damage to enemies in the air.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_03_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds and deals a large amount of damage to current target. This damage can be parried. But if parried this damage the target will be disarmed for 5 seconds. If in the Rage state, the effect of Wuyou's skills will change: If hit the target will stun the target and deal 10 damage to enemies near the target. Also add Vulnerable state to Secret Devices in this area.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_04_1=Deals damage to all enemies in the front area and clear all their Rage Points if they are not parrying. Also have a chance to add them with All Empty state: Lost 2% of Energy every 5 seconds. This status lasts for 1 minute.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_05_1=I am the master of all the weapons. Charge this skill for 5 seconds. Launch up all enemies within 5 meters. Get a Mastery state. Remove all the present Red Armor, Yellow Armor and Pluck The Peacock's Plume states. And make these states unable to affect in 20 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_sj01_1=Charge this skill for 2 seconds and deal a small amount of damage to nearby targets. Cause enemies in the air fall down.
desc_skill_SJclone02_boss_sj02_1=Charge this skill for 2 seconds and deal massive damage to enemies in the area. If breaking enemies' parrying successfully will add them with Kongyou state: Have a chance to stun for 0.5 seconds every 2 seconds.
