desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_09_1=Deals a small amount of damage to all the enemies in a annual area and add them with Buring state: Decrease External Defense by 50%. Have a chance to receive an extra 2% HP damage when be damaged.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_10_1=Deal minor damage to all the targets in the behind and add them with Shadow state. Stun the target for 2 seconds if the Shadow state stacks to 20 times.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_11_1=Deals minor damage to current target. The target reduces 100% Evasion Rate and makes nearby allies lose 5% HP every 2 seconds in the next 10 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_12_1=Deals minor damage to target and adds a hidden poison on the target. The poison explores after 10 seconds: If the target's Energy is less than 50% then lose 10% HP, otherwise lose all Rage Points and stun for 1 second.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_13_1=Throw out an orb. This orb continuously absorbs 3% Energy of all the targets in this area per second in 30 seconds. Deals damage of 100% HP to all the targets after 30 seconds. If this orb is broken in 30 seconds, all the targets will recover energy and 10 Rage Points.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_14_1=Shock the ground and deal a medium amount of damage to targets within 10 meters and slow them by 80%. The Deceleration lasts for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_15_1=Deals a medium amount of damage to all the targets and decreases their External Defense by 60% for 30 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_16_1=Push a Chi Wave off which knocks back all the enemies and deals a medium amount of damage to them.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_17_1=Deals minor damage to target and increases External damage by 20% for 30 second.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_18_1=Deals minor damage to and paralyzes the target for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_19_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals a medium amount of damage to all the targets nearby and adds them with Towing Soul state: If failed to QTE will be launched up and damage decrease by 20% for 1 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclone02_mon_20_1=Charge this skill for 3 seconds. Deals minor damage to all the targets nearby and adds them with Chopping state: Launches up the targets in the air and deals 80% HP damage to targets on the ground.
