desc_skill_npc_sjclone02_001_1=Throw out hidden weapons, deals 1% HP loss to the target who touches the hidden weapon. And launches the target up and clears his Rage Points up
desc_skill_npc_sjclone02_002_1=Throw out hidden weapons, deals 1% HP loss to the target who touches the hidden weapon. And paralyzes the target for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_npc_sjclone02_003_1=Fires the hidden weapon. The affected target will lose 1% HP and you will increase the damage by 10%. However, when the effect ends, you will lose 10% HP.
desc_skill_npc_sjclone02_004_1=Throw out hidden weapons, deals 1% HP loss to the target who touches the hidden weapon. And decreases the target Internal Defense by 100% for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_npc_sjclone02_005_1=Throw out hidden weapons, deals 1% HP loss to the target who touches the hidden weapon. And makes the target lose 5% HP and Energy per second. Lasts for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_npc_sjclone02_009_1=Throw out hidden weapons, deals minor damage and launches up the targets.
