desc_skill_wjd_003_1=Charge ahead and smash the target, inflicting {@0:伤害包}.<br>Target is also inflicted with<font color="#FFAE00">“Cracking Head”</font> status: Stacking this skill will increase damage dealt. Each stack will increase damage by 5% and can be stacked up to 3 times. Active for 15 seconds. <br>(This move can be used to quickly approach the target)
desc_skill_wjd_004_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>If the target fails to parry, they will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Losing Blade Wound</font>, causing them to receive continuous damage for a short period.
