desc_skill_wjd_014_1=Target will be pulled and dealt {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(Targets who parrying will not be pulled)
desc_skill_wjd_015_1=Damages the target and inflicts them with Thunder Force - if the target is in Fire Force based on two kinds of buffs, the amount of layers will deal additional damage to the target, resulting in {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_skill_wjd_016_1=Initiate a swinging attack that damages surrounding targets.<br> Airbonre targets will be grounded while Chi Force will resist all debuff effects.<br> (If the target is under<font color="#FFAE00">Fire</font> status and has been stacked 3 times, additional damage will be dealt while parries will be disabled)<br> (This skill cannot be interrupted)
desc_skill_wjd_017_1=Slash the target directly ahead, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When the target is critically hit they will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Thunderbolt</font> status: Skills in this set's damage is increased by 10%. Can be stacked up to 3 times. Active for 7 seconds.
desc_skill_wjd_018_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Surrounding targets are dealt {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Striking the target has a chance to inflict<font color="#f9fc00">Closer</font>, wherein every attack will finlioct the target with <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font>.<br> (Cannot move while using, though will be granted <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_skill_wjd_019_1=Attacks the target directly in front with {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets that fail to parry will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Trapped (Feint)</font> status: Internal and external defense reduced by 6% for 7 seconds.
