desc_zf_jb_01_01_1=The array user can use this skill to turn the array eye to target him (her). This skill can only be used on an ally.
desc_zf_jiebai_01_01_1=Shocks targets within 8 meters, deals {@0:伤害包} damage to them and activates <font color="#FFAE00">Annihilation</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> by 50% for 5 seconds.
desc_zf_jiebai_01_01_10=Heroes are not afraid of going forward and dying. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters. Add the enemies who are not parrying with <font color="#FFAE00">Destroy</font> state: Be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 50% for 5 seconds.
