desc_zf_jiebai_02_01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to a single target. If the target fails to parry, a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Falling Star</font> will be added. <font color="#FFAE00">Falling Star</font>: Accuracy increased by 5%.
