zf_jiebai_04_01=Endless Net
desc_jn_wjd_behavior38_01_1=This skill has a range of 15 meters directly in front of you. Aim carefully as you only have one chance to use this skill. If you fail in using this skill, speak with the navy captain to leave the area and try again. (Skill cannot be used in combat)
desc_wjd_txxhjp01_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包}<br>Parrying a target's attack activates<font color="#FFAE00">“Tai Xuan”</font> status for 30 seconds. Can be stacked up to 3 times.
desc_wjd_txxhjp02_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包}<br>Target's that faIl to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>.
desc_wjd_txxhjp03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>The first strike will leave the target <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 3 seconds, while the final strike will affect the target with <font color="#f9fc00">Closer</font>.<br>（When the target has 3 stacjks of <font color="#FFAE00">Tai Xuan</font the Closer effect will be negated)
desc_wjd_txxhjp04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly ahead.<br>Breaking the target's parry will have their<font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_wjd_txxhjp06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>Additional damage will be dealt when the target is under<font color="#FFAE00">Tai Xuan</font> status.<br>(This move can be used to quickly approach the target)
desc_wjd_txxhjp07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>Additional damage will be dealt when the target is under<font color="#FFAE00">Tai Xuan</font> status.
desc_wjd_xld01_1=Slash the target for {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Also inflicts the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Understated Beauty</font> status: Continuous bleeding daamage for 8 seconds. The more <font color="#FF3030">Frown</font> is stacked, the more damage the bleeding will do.<br>(This skill can be used to quickly approach the target)<br>(Enahcned skills can icnrease the damage state)
desc_wjd_xld03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets in front and within 15 meters.<br>If the target is under <font color="#f9fc00">Understated Beauty</font> status, they cannot be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>.<br>(Airborne targets that are hit will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Mythical Void</font> for 3 seconds and will be unable to use flying skills)
desc_wjd_xld05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front.<br>Breaking the target's defense:  Evasion is decreased by 12 and is inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Rain on Pear Blossom</font> status: sustained<font color="#f9fc00">Limbo</font> status and will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font>. Active for 10 seconds.
desc_wjd_xld06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding targets.<br>Each strike adds <font color="#FFAE00">Tears of Blood</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds.<br>(Grants <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font> status)
desc_wjd_xld08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding targets. <br>Target will be <font color="#f9fc00">thrown</font> and inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Rain on Pear Blossom</font> status.<br> (Adds <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font> status. Can be used to approach the target)
desc_wjd_xld09_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>The <font color="#f9fc00">enemy</font> becomes <font color="#FF3030">Asura (Enemy)</font>: Press keys quickly to escape the skill. Failing will cause you to be inflicted by multiple chained skills. <br>(Skillss under <font color="#f9fc00">Momentous Night</font> have a shared cooldown)
desc_wjd_xzjf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front. <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Sudden Snow</font> status: Lowers the speed of Flying Swallow and Perforated Clouds. Can be stacked up to 3 times. (After 3 uses, use 2 more times to sun the target for 1 second)
desc_wjd_xzjf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Intrusion</font>: Limits target's evasion and substantially decreaes their speed (Speed will slowly recover over time)
desc_wjd_xzjf05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front. <br>Breaking a atrget's defense causes the following:  Evasion will cause the target to be dazed for 1 second. Active for 6 seconds.
desc_wjd_xzjf07_1=Dashes to the target and knows them down, dealing {@0:伤害包} to targets within the area of effect.
desc_wjd_xzjf08_1=Jumping Slash with no Trace: Jump attack the target (Hits causes 1 second of Ridigty) with an attack that strikes up to 3 times.<br>The more <font color="#FFAE00">Sudden Snow</font> is stacked, the higher the damage will be.<br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage)
desc_wjd_yxfj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>(This can be used to evade moves from quickly approaching opponents)
desc_wjd_yxfj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}；<br>Damaging the target with sword chi activates <font color="#FFAE00">Rarified state</font>: Internal and external attack power reduced by 10% for 10 seconds.
desc_wjd_yxfj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>During <font color="#FF3030">Draw the Sword</font> status: Target's that fail to parry the sword chi will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>.
desc_wjd_yxfj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}.<br>(<font color="#FFAE00">Block the Sun</font> must first be activated)<br> (This skill can be used to evade quickly approaching opponents)
desc_wjd_yxfj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}<br>Breaking the target's parry will result in a <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> effect for 3 seconds and shift them to the side.<br>When <font color="#FF3030">Draw the Sword</font> is active, you gain a different way to attack. Click on your target to break their defense with an aoe.<br> (Max distance of 20 meters)
desc_wjd_yxfj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">Six Exits</font>is active, the chance of evading an enemy attack is greatly increased and adds <font color="#FFAE00">Block the Sun</font> status.<br> (Skill also adds<font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status)<br> (<font color="#f9fc00">Cloud Covers the Sun</font> can be activated after using Block the Sun. Active for 20 seconds)
desc_wjd_yxfj08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}.
