desc_CS_single_bsbc_1=Successfully execute this skill to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and greatly increase your Hatred Value for 6 seconds. After this period your Hatred Value will become normal.<br>(Invalid to players)
desc_CS_single_bsbc_2=Successfully execute this skill to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and greatly increase your Hatred Value for 8 seconds. After this period your Hatred Value will become normal.<br>(Invalid to players)
desc_CS_single_bsbc_3=Successfully execute this skill to deal {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and greatly increase your Hatred Value for 10 seconds. After this period your Hatred Value will become normal.<br>(Invalid to players)
desc_CS_single_jlj_1=Use this on an ally within 15 meters or yourself to relieve the Five Immortals Sect Insect Poison. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_msg_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target. Plant a <font color="#FFAE00">Insect of Hallucinations</font> on target without parrying. Make the target <font color="#FF3030">Lose Mind</font> and walk to you. The insect exists for 3 seconds. (Invalid to airborne targets. Lose Mind only affect on players)
desc_CS_single_msg_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target. Plant a <font color="#FFAE00">Insect of Hallucinations</font> on target without parrying. Make the target <font color="#FF3030">Lose Mind</font> and walk to you. The insect exists for 4 seconds. (Invalid to airborne targets. Lose Mind only affect on players)
desc_CS_single_msg_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target. Plant a <font color="#FFAE00">Insect of Hallucinations</font> on target without parrying. Make the target <font color="#FF3030">Lose Mind</font> and walk to you. The insect exists for 5 seconds. (Invalid to airborne targets. Lose Mind only affect on players)
desc_CS_single_tgd_1=Successfully execute this skill to deal {@0:伤害包} to your target and hook your target to you.<br>(You need a Life Fishing Rod or Wuji Island Fishing Rod in your Backpack)
desc_CS_single_tgd_2=Successfully execute this skill to deal {@0:伤害包} to your target and hook your target to you.<br>(You need a Life Fishing Rod or Wuji Island Fishing Rod in your Backpack)
desc_CS_single_tgd_3=Successfully execute this skill to deal {@0:伤害包} to your target and hook your target to you.<br>(You need a Life Fishing Rod or Wuji Island Fishing Rod in your Backpack)
desc_CS_single_txg_1=Plant a Heart-connecting Insect on your target without parrying and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Heart-connecting Insect</font> state. On enemies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Steal HP</font>. On allies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Transfuse HP</font>. The amount of Lifesteal and Transfusion are both 1% of your Max HP. This state exists for 5 seconds. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_txg_2=Plant a Heart-connecting Insect on your target without parrying and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Heart-connecting Insect</font> state. On enemies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Steal HP</font>. On allies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Transfuse HP</font>. The amount of Lifesteal and Transfusion are both 1% of your Max HP. This state exists for 7 seconds. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_txg_3=Plant a Heart-connecting Insect on your target without parrying and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Heart-connecting Insect</font> state. On enemies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Steal HP</font>. On allies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Transfuse HP</font>. The amount of Lifesteal and Transfusion are both 1% of your Max HP. This state exists for 10 seconds. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_txg_hide_1=Plant a Heart-connecting Insect on your target without parrying and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Heart-connecting Insect</font> state. On enemies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Steal HP</font>. On allies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Transfuse HP</font>. The amount of Lifesteal and Transfusion are both 1% of your Max HP. This state exists for 5 seconds. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_txg_hide_2=Plant a Heart-connecting Insect on your target without parrying and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Heart-connecting Insect</font> state. On enemies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Steal HP</font>. On allies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Transfuse HP</font>. The amount of Lifesteal and Transfusion are both 1% of your Max HP. This state exists for 7 seconds. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_txg_hide_3=Plant a Heart-connecting Insect on your target without parrying and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Heart-connecting Insect</font> state. On enemies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Steal HP</font>. On allies you can continuously <font color="#FF3030">Transfuse HP</font>. The amount of Lifesteal and Transfusion are both 1% of your Max HP. This state exists for 10 seconds. (Can be only used on players)
desc_CS_single_wjxc_1=Successfully execute this skill to recover 20% of your Max Energy.
desc_CS_single_wjxc_2=Successfully execute this skill to recover 25% of your Max Energy.
desc_CS_single_wjxc_3=Successfully execute this skill to recover 30% of your Max Energy.
desc_CS_single_wsdy_1=Successfully execute this skill to enter <font color="#FFAE00">Spymaster</font> state for 6 seconds. During this period, the enemies within 10 meters will have their <font color="#f9fc00">Ninja Stealth Technique</font>'s <font color="#FFAE00">Stealth</font> state lose efficacy.
desc_CS_single_wsdy_2=Successfully execute this skill to enter <font color="#FFAE00">Spymaster</font> state for 8 seconds. During this period, the enemies within 10 meters will have their <font color="#f9fc00">Ninja Stealth Technique</font>'s <font color="#FFAE00">Stealth</font> state lose efficacy.
desc_CS_single_wsdy_3=Successfully execute this skill to enter <font color="#FFAE00">Spymaster</font> state for 10 seconds. During this period, the enemies within 10 meters will have their <font color="#f9fc00">Ninja Stealth Technique</font>'s <font color="#FFAE00">Stealth</font> state lose efficacy.
desc_CS_single_wxd_1=Throw a poison cauldron to selected area. Continuously release five poisons to deal bleeding damage. Targets within 8 meters and not parrying will <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to use Flying Skills</font>. This cauldron exists for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_single_wxd_2=Throw a poison cauldron to selected area. Continuously release five poisons to deal bleeding damage. Targets within 8 meters and not parrying will <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to use Flying Skills</font> and become <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>. This cauldron exists for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_single_wxd_3=Throw a poison cauldron to selected area. Continuously release five poisons to deal bleeding damage. Targets within 8 meters and not parrying will <font color="#f9fc00">Be Slowed</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to use Flying Skills</font> and become <font color="#f9fc00">Keyboard settings randomized</font>. This cauldron exists for 7 seconds.
