desc_CS_wxj_gyxhj04_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Creature Chases the Moon</font> state: after parrying enemies' attacks, you can put <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Insect</font> into enemies' bodies, which turns enemies' Chi to <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Chi</font> for 12 seconds. After 3 stacks you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Chi Overflow</font> state for 5 seconds: make enemies within 5 meters unable to use Flying Skills. You can also shoot the Chi into enemy's body, <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target who are not parrying for a short distance, let the target <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_wxj_gyxhj04_10=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Creature Chases the Moon</font> state: after parrying enemies' attacks, you can put <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Insect</font> into enemies' bodies, which turns enemies' Chi to <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Chi</font> for 12 seconds. After 3 stacks you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Chi Overflow</font> state for 5 seconds: make enemies within 5 meters unable to use Flying Skills. You can also shoot the Chi into enemy's body, <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target who are not parrying for a short distance, let the target <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_wxj_gyxhj04_11=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Creature Chases the Moon</font> state: after parrying enemies' attacks, you can put <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Insect</font> into enemies' bodies, which turns enemies' Chi to <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Chi</font> for 12 seconds. After 3 stacks you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Chi Overflow</font> state for 5 seconds: make enemies within 5 meters unable to use Flying Skills. You can also shoot the Chi into enemy's body, <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target who are not parrying for a short distance, let the target <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 3 seconds.
