desc_CS_wxj_gyxhj05_1=Dashes and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters in front of you. Inflicts the enemies who are not parrying with <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second. <br>This skill can be used continuously for 3 times. The second usage will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies who're not parrying. The third usage will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock</font> enemies who're not parrying into air.<br>(Unable to use this skill in air)<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
