desc_CS_wxj_qzwds07_1=Add yourself with <font color="#FFAE00">Bring Poison into Body</font> state for 10 seconds. With this state, your Accuracy Rate increases by 5%. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">Spider Spins</font> will add target who is not parrying with <font color="#FFAE00">Cocoon</font> state, makes your target be <font color="#f9fc00">Interrupted</font> when trying to use skills within 3 seconds, then clear the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Cocoon</font> state.
