desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 10 meters in front of you. If hit any target who is not parrying then the cooldown time of <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font> will decrease by 1 second.
