desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz06_1=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#f9fc00">Matriarch's Curtain</font> state. When you parrying an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 6 seconds with a 30-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you parry an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Swarming Insects</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font> by 1 second.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz06_2=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#f9fc00">Matriarch's Curtain</font> state. When you parrying an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 6 seconds with a 25-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you parry an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Swarming Insects</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font> by 1 second.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz06_3=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#f9fc00">Matriarch's Curtain</font> state. When you parrying an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 7 seconds with a 25-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you parry an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Swarming Insects</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font> by 1 second.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz06_4=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#f9fc00">Matriarch's Curtain</font> state. When you parrying an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 7 seconds with a 20-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you parry an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Swarming Insects</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font> by 1 second.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz06_5=Your dazzling hand movements create a <font color="#f9fc00">Matriarch's Curtain</font> state. When you parrying an attack, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Pierce the Sky</font> effect for 8 seconds with a 20-second recovery period. While it is active, your skills <font color="#f9fc00">cannot be disabled</font>. The next time you parry an attack, you reduce the recovery time of <font color="#f9fc00">Swarming Insects</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font> by 1 second.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz07_1=With a spinning kick, you can enter <font color="#FFAE00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> state. For 3 seconds, you gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>, and with each 0.6 second you can get a <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Cloud</font> (Increase your  color="#f9fc00">evasion</font> by 10%). Meanwhile, enemies witin 6 meters are debuffed by <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Mist</font> every 0.6 second (Decrease their <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 10%). <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Cloud</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Thick Mist</font> last for 6 seconds, and can be stacked 5 times. This skill can be interrupted with <font color="#f9fc00">Inverted River of Stars</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font>.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz08_1=With a sweep of your feet, you enter the <font color="#FFAE00">Inverted River of Stars</font> state. In the next 3 seconds, when you are attacked, the attacker receives the <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Star</font>effect (Disable attacker's <font color="#f9fc00">skills</font> for 1 second). Every 0.6 second, enemies within 6 meters of attacker will get <font color="#FFAE00">Hung Upside Down</font> state (Makes them receive extra 25% Soft Damage when they are attacked). Each effect <font color="#FFAE00">Hung Upside Down</font> lasts 1.5 seconds, and this duration can be stacked up to 5 times (The duration can be stacked). This skill can be interrupted with <font color="#f9fc00">Lost in a Misty Fog</font> or <font color="#f9fc00">Dreaming Goddess</font>.
desc_Npc_ssg_bhjtz09_1=A graceful move that creates a 15-meter area of effect in front of you, dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Break a target's block to inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Crisp Bone Softener</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzing</font> the target for 2 seconds.
