desc_Npc_tm_ywt04_1=Passion inside the body burns. Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a five-meter area of effect:<br>When it is triggered, it can cause enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage;<br>Enemies in the trap suffer continuous damage. (If they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> state, they suffer even greater damage. More stacks, more damage.)<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterwards will add the <font color="#FFAE00">"Scald"</font> effect to them (add damage).<br>(The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered. Updating hidden weapon skill can increase the damage.)
