desc_Npc_tm_ywt05_1=The Move of Ecstasy. Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. Break parrying successfully and then Poison Gas invaded, which made the target <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font>(The effect is like Dizziness) for 3 seconds.<br>Being attacked will interrupt the state of <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font>.
