desc_Npc_tm_ywt08_1=It's very risky. Blow up all the <font color="#FFAE00">Explosive Traps</font> set by Wild Ghost Startles the Spirit quickly.
desc_Npc_tm_ywt09_1=Frightening Move. Set an <font color="#FFAE00">Explosive Trap</font>. Trigger it manually and cause an explosive damage to the nearby enemies.<br>(If it is not triggered manually within 30 seconds, it will explode automatically. Max: 3)
