desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>(This skill can be used with Flying Skills to quickly approach the target)<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters in front of you. If break enemies' parrying successfully, add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Insect</font> state: cannot parry for 5 seconds. <font color="#f9fc00">Fall down</font> after being hit for 5 times.<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters in front of you. Add <font color="#FFAE00">Thousand Poison Worm</font> state to enemies without parrying: continuously lose HP for 8 seconds.<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj04_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Creature Chases the Moon</font> state: after parrying enemies' attacks, you can put <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Insect</font> into enemies' bodies, which turns enemies' Chi to <font color="#FFAE00">Heart Connecting Chi</font> for 12 seconds. After 3 stacks you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Chi Overflow</font> state for 5 seconds: make enemies within 5 meters unable to use Flying Skills. You can also shoot the Chi into enemy's body, <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target who are not parrying for a short distance, let the target <font color="#f9fc00">cannot parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj05_1=Dashes and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters in front of you. Inflicts the enemies who are not parrying with <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second. <br>This skill can be used continuously for 3 times. The second usage will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies who're not parrying. The third usage will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock</font> enemies who're not parrying into air.<br>(Unable to use this skill in air)<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj05_hide_01_1=Dashes and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters in front of you. <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies who're not parrying. <br>(Unable to use this skill in air)<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj05_hide_02_1=Dashes and deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters in front of you. <font color="#f9fc00">Knock</font> enemies who're not parrying into air. <br>(Unable to use this skill in air)<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. Add the enemies who're parrying with <font color="#FFAE00">Spiritual Insect Damages Body</font> state: Decrease Movement Speed and Evasion by 10% for 5 seconds. Can be stacked 5 times.<br>You can move freely while using this skill, and gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> buff.<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_gyxhj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>(Equipping Twin Rings inflicts 100% damage while Twin Daggers only inflicts 70%))
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Spider Spins</font> state for 6 seconds. Your target will be <font color="#f9fc00">interrupted</font> when trying to use a skill within 3 seconds after the <font color="#FFAE00">Spider Spins</font> stacking for 3 times.
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters in front of you. <br>Breaking targets' parrying successfully will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock then Down</font>.
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds04_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Strucks Down</font> airborne target and deals {@0:伤害包} and make this target unable to use skills for 3 seconds. If the target got Poison and Spirit then this attack will deal additional 11 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage).
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target.
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds06_1=Add the attackers with <font color="#FFAE00">Poison and Spirit</font> state after parrying their attacks successfully. Make them continuously bleeding (Blood Loss Damage increases while the level of <font color="#FFAE00">Poison and Spirit</font> increasing). This state lasts for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds07_1=Add yourself with <font color="#FFAE00">Bring Poison into Body</font> state for 10 seconds. With this state, your Accuracy Rate increases by 5%. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">Spider Spins</font> will add target who is not parrying with <font color="#FFAE00">Cocoon</font> state, makes your target be <font color="#f9fc00">Interrupted</font> when trying to use skills within 3 seconds, then clear the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Cocoon</font> state.
desc_Npc_wxj_qzwds08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target and inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Blind</font>. Also make your target <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed by 80%</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to use Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_fwz_b11_001a_1=I'm waiting you here.<br>Ask "Do you need the umbrella?" Maybe you can meet your lover.
desc_fwz_b11_001b_1=I'm waiting you here.<br>Ask "Do you need the umbrella?" Maybe you can meet your lover.
desc_fwz_b11_001c_1=I'm waiting you here.<br>Ask "Do you need the umbrella?" Maybe you can meet your lover.
desc_fwz_cloth_331b_1=The sky is high and the weather is fine. It's so carefree to overlook from some high place.
desc_fwz_cloth_331g_1=Leaves start to turn red and fall. That's so attractive.
desc_fwz_cloth_341a_1=Hide your face, hide in the Jianghu.
desc_fwz_cloth_341b_1=Reveal your face, shock the Jianghu.
desc_fwz_cloth_358_1=Dhyana contains martial arts. Martial arts contains Dhyana.
desc_fwz_cloth_358_npc_1=<s>
desc_fwz_g11_001a_1=Look at that idiot
desc_fwz_g11_001b_1=Look at that idiot
desc_fwz_g11_001c_1=Look at that idiot
desc_fwz_weapon_356_1=It is said that this is one of the killing skill in the Qins' Mace Skills.
desc_lxcnvpu_01_1=<s>
desc_lxsn_01_test_1=Yuan Wei and Bai Ji, come here!<br>Summon the Immortal Lord's servants.
desc_skill_clone035_bshw_01_1=Skill is charged for 5 seconds. Within a 10m x 3m area of effect ahead, targets receive modest damage and the Pointing the Way effect. For 10 seconds, their skills are disabled, and they are knocked down every time they use Flying Skills.
desc_skill_clone035_bshw_02_1=Targets within 5 meters receive minor damage. For 20 seconds, their blocks are broken, and they receive the Follow Up a Victory effect, losing 1% HP every second for 10 seconds, and are thrown at the final second.
desc_skill_clone035_bshw_03_1=Inflict minor damage. With each attack, target who is not blocking is thrown, and loses 5% HP.
desc_skill_clone035_dlxw_01_1=Charge this skillfor 3 seconds to deal massive damage. Target who fails to block will be thrown, and within the next 10 seconds, every skill target uses will result in 1% loss of HP.
desc_skill_clone035_dlxw_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds to  unleash a twin hammer attack that deals massive damage and knocks down targets within 8 meters.
desc_skill_clone035_dlxw_03_1=Twin hammers stun all targets in an area of effect for 20 seconds. If boss is attacked, the effect is canceled.
desc_skill_clone035_myfr_01_1=Nearby targets in a 8-meter area of effect receive minor damage. Selected target receives the Cold Thorn effect for 20 seconds and is thrown. Under this effect, target loses Flying Skill points and 2% HP. 20 seconds later, target loses 20% HP and is frozen for 30 seconds, during which his or her external defense is lowered by 100%. Target must move constantly to avoid this effect, which freezes the target when stacked 30 times.
desc_skill_clone035_myfr_02_1=Charge skill for 15 seconds, during which her evasion increases by 50%. There is 30% chance of interrupting this kill when boss receives damage. If the skill is uninterrupted, it repels nearby players in a 5-meter radius, and activates the Muddling Smoke effect, which increases the boss's attack power by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone035_myfr_03_1=Charge skill for 3 seconds. This attack deals minor damage and can be blocked. If boss has the Deep Cold Armor effect and target is not blocking, it purges target's rage and deplets 50% of his or her energy. When this happens, Deep Cold Armor is removed.
desc_skill_lxc_mxm_1=Lotus in the Depths
desc_skill_ssf_01_1=Random effect (Slowed by 20%, Paralyzed for 2 seconds every 2 minutes, Lose HP every 2 seconds, Accuracy decreases by 10%, Evasion decreases by 10%, Flying Skills cost 5 more Flying Skill Points, Crit Rate decreases by 10%, External and Internal Defense decrease by 15%)
