desc_zf_jiebai_07_01_1=Add yourself with <font color="#FFAE00">Converting Ying and Yang</font> state: turn the <font color="#FFAE00">Chilly Water Force</font> which you want to shoot to enemies into <font color="#FFAE00">Warm Energy</font> and inject into yourself. This energy will also bounce between allies. If an ally is in Mysterious Water Array, then this ally will recover a set amount of HP (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage. Increasing skill level can increase the amount of recovery).
