desc_Boss_wulin_ds_001_1=A target in a 3m x 6m rectangular area in front of you will suffer damage, and be knocked back.
desc_Boss_wulin_ds_003_1=You will deal damage to a target within a radius of 5 meters, and cause his keystrokes to be randomized.
desc_Boss_wulin_ds_004_1=You will deal damage to a target within a radius of 5 meters, and cause him to steadily lose HP and start a new Flying Skill count.
desc_Boss_wulin_ds_005_1=After breaking the defense, your target's skills will be disabled.
desc_Boss_wulin_kj_001_1=Inflict continuous damage within 10 meters around the target.
desc_Boss_wulin_kj_002_1=Deals damage to the enemies in front and inflicts Demonic Sound to the unparried targets. Demonic Sound effect: The target will consume HP when using a skill. Last for 5 seconds.
desc_Boss_wulin_kj_003_1=Deals damage to a target. If the target parries, it will receive Ears Ringing, which reduces its movement speed by 30% for 5 seconds.
desc_Boss_wulin_kj_004_1=Deals damage to the enemies 5 meters in front of you and inflicts Cloud Heart to the unparried targets, which reduces their movement speed by 30% for 5 seconds.
desc_Boss_wulin_qls_001_1=A target in a 3m x 10m rectangular area in front of you will suffer damage, and will be knocked down.
desc_Boss_wulin_qls_002_1=Attack a collapsed target
desc_Boss_wulin_qls_003_1=Charge towards the target to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This skill can be charged. When fully charged for 1.5 seconds, enemies are knocked back.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Breaking a target's parry will send them flying.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj01_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Breaking a target's parry will send them flying.
