desc_CS_df_dfwfj05_1=Creates a Five Elements Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Five Elements: Increases your external attack damage by 7% and inflicts Reversed Five Elements onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Five Elements reduces the targets' External Defense by 7%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
desc_CS_df_dfwfj05_10=Creates a Five Elements Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Five Elements: Increases your external attack damage by 15% and inflicts Reversed Five Elements onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Five Elements will reduce the targets' External Defense by 15%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
desc_CS_df_dfwfj05_11=Creates a Five Elements Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Five Elements: Increases your external attack damage by 15% and inflicts Reversed Five Elements onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Five Elements will reduce the targets' External Defense by 15%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
