desc_CS_df_dfwfj05_9=Creates a Five Elements Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Five Elements: Increases your external attack damage by 15% and inflicts Reversed Five Elements onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Five Elements will reduce the targets' External Defense by 15%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
desc_CS_df_dfwfj06_1=When you block 8 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj06_2=When you block 7 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj06_3=When you block 6 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj06_4=When you block 5 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj06_5=When you block 4 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj06_6=When you block 3 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_CS_df_dfwfj07_1=Creates a Seven Stars Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Seven Stars: Reduces all the damage taken by 7% and inflicts Reversed Seven Stars onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Seven Stars will reduces the targets' all Attack by 7%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
