desc_CS_dm_fmgf01_1=Atlas Lifts the Heavens Trailing the wrestling type, the selected target caused by {@0:damage package}, their own in the air when the move can be cast <font color="#f9fc00">down the</font> air target. <br> (This move can be used to quickly close to the opponent)
