desc_CS_dm_fmgf08_1=Zhong Mingzhen universal, dragon swallowing Kyushu. Dance horn whirlpool style, on the surrounding 5 meters within the scope of the enemy caused by {@0:damage package}, to display the move itself as the <font color="#f9fc00">blue body</font> . <br> Moves each hit can not <font color="#f9fc00">repel</font> the ground enemy, and to add <font color="#FFAE00">Longtong</font> state: Superimposed 5 layers after a <font color="#f9fc00">coma for</font> 2 seconds; <br> Moves each hit can also <font color="#f9fc00">hit</font> the aircraft or air in the air of the enemy.
