desc_CS_jh_hq02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. When you break the enemies' defense, you will knock them back. <br>When you break the enemies' parry with Life-Saving Monkey Hair effect, it knocks them back and inflicts Damaged Meridian on them for 3 seconds. (When you use this skill, you will fall down. This effect can be triggered once.)
