desc_CS_jh_hq06_1=You get Transformation Monkey. When you block an attack, you get 1 Life-Saving Monkey Hair, lasting for 10 seconds. A Life-Saving Monkey Hair appears every 10 seconds. <br>Life-Saving Monkey Hair: Enhances the effects of Monkey Jumps across the Ravine, Stone Monkey Emerges, and Monkeys Run Wild in the Forest in this skill set.
