desc_CS_jh_qxz07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. Breaking the enemies' defense will cause them to be unable to parry for 3 seconds and will inflict Whale Swallows which reduces their speed by 80% for 3 seconds. While active, striking targets with Sturgeon Dives into Deep Pool will cause them to be knocked down.
