desc_CS_jh_sxjj05_1=Contort body and swing sword. If parry is successful, targets without <font color="#FFAE00">"Seamless"</font>state get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Seamless"</font> state for 12s. <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">"Seamless"</font> reaches 4 stacks, target is <font color="#f9fc00">Dizzy </font> for 2s and <font color="#FFAE00">"Seamless"</font> state is cleared. 15s of <font color="#FFAE00">"Immunity to Departed State Influence"</font>. <br>When target is in <font color="#FFAE00">"Immunity to Departed State Influence"</font> 25 additional Hard Damage will be dealt by all skills of this set (takes melee and internal power damage bonus)
