desc_CS_jh_yybtbf06_1=You will receive <font color="#FFAE00">Amazing Xixia</font>. When you block an attack, you receive 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Calligraphic Charm</font>. Can be stacked up to 10 times. <br>When you have over 6 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Calligraphic Charm</font>, this skill will be casted automatically and consume 6 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Calligraphic Charm</font>: Deals damage to the enemies 15 meters in front of you and each attack <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> the unparried enemies.
