desc_CS_jh_yybtbf07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> the enemies who dare to attack (Only valid for 3 times). If you have 6 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Calligraphic Charm</font>, you will be buffed with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while using the skill. <br>When using this skill, you can use <font color="#f9fc00">Stomachache Copybook</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Ode to Xixia</font> to interrupt it.
