desc_CS_jh_yybtbf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies 5 meters in front of you and grants you 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Calligraphic Charm</font> upon hitting the unparried enemies. You will also leave an Ink Shadow and fly away. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Ink Shadow</font>: Deals Yang Damage to the nearby enemies. When the Ink Shadow appears, the enemies will be <font color="#f9fc00">pulled</font> towards the center and each attack <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the unparried enemies for 2 seconds. (<font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> effect weakens gradually.)
