desc_CS_mr_wxqyr02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. Breaking the enemies' defense will debuff them with Force of Thunder Trigram: Increases the chance of getting Critical Hit by 15%, lasting for 5 seconds. When the enemies get Critical Hit 5 times, the debuff will be removed.
