desc_CS_ng_gsd05_1=Folds the fan and throws the hidden weapons in it, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. Each strike of the skill will stun the unparried enemies. This skill cannot be used in the air. <br>When you use this skill again, all the hidden weapons will be thrown, dealing soft damage to the nearby enemies. You will get Yellow Armor when using the skill.
desc_CS_ng_gsd05_10=Folds the fan and throws the hidden weapons in it, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. Each strike of the skill will stun the unparried enemies. This skill cannot be used in the air. <br>When you use this skill again, all the hidden weapons will be thrown, dealing soft damage to the nearby enemies and debuffing the unparried enemies with Skill Disabled for 3 seconds. You will get Yellow Armor when using the skill.
