desc_CS_ng_gsd06_1=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 2 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_gsd06_2=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 4 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_gsd06_3=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 6 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_gsd06_4=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 8 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_gsd06_5=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 10 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_gsd06_6=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 12 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_ng_gsd07_1=Unfold the fan and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the selected target.
