desc_CS_single_cwqxz_1=The noise of Zen and clear singing of buddhism abide. Gives user <font color="#FF3030">Awakening Purity</font>: 2% every 2 seconds <font color="#f9fc00">return</font> 2% blood and internal force, move the removed state, the state lasts for 10 seconds, while meditating<font color="#f9fc00">the yellow Pa body</font>.
desc_CS_single_cwqxz_2=The noise of Zen and clear singing of buddhism abide. Gives user <font color="#FF3030">Awakening Purity</font>: every 2 seconds <font color="#f9fc00">return </font>5% blood internal force, move the removed state, the state lasts for 10 seconds, while meditating <font color="#f9fc00">the yellow Pa body</font>.
desc_CS_single_cwqxz_3=The noise of Zen and clear singing of buddhism abide. Gives user <font color="#FF3030">Awakening Purity</font>:every 2 seconds<font color="#f9fc00">return</font> 5% blood and internal forces, move the removed state, the state lasts for 10 seconds, while meditating <font color="#f9fc00">the yellow Pa body</font>.
desc_CS_single_fmjgz_1=Golem Subdues Evil Gives teammate <font color="#FF3030">Demon Slaying Warrior</font>: If the target has been around itself within 10 meters, then their own and target <font color="#f9fc00">damage</font> 10%, for 10 seconds. <br>Target is unable to gain immunity within 10m.
desc_CS_single_fmjgz_2=Golem Subdues Evil Gives teammate <font color="#FF3030">Demon Slaying Warrior</font>: If the target has been around itself within 10 meters, then the target and the target <font color="#f9fc00">damage</font> 10%, for 15 seconds. <br>Target is unable to gain immunity within 10m.
desc_CS_single_fmjgz_3=Golem Subdues Evil Gives teammate <font color="#FF3030">Demon Slaying Warrior</font>: If the target has been around itself within 10 meters, then the target and the target <font color="#f9fc00">damage</font> 10%, for 20 seconds. <br>Target is unable to gain immunity within 10m.
desc_CS_single_mwnpz_1=I protect the people for the Wisdom King. Give target<font color="#FF3030">Wisdom King Nirvana</font>: 1 minute, can withstand a <font color="#f9fc00">lethal attack</font> , and reply 10% qi and blood. <font color="#f9fc00">After </font> reviving, there is a 10m cooldown. <br>(<font color="#FF3030"> only effective for user or friends</font>)
desc_CS_single_mwnpz_2=I protect the people for the Wisdom King. Give target<font color="#FF3030">Wisdom King Nirvana</font>: 1 minute, can withstand a <font color="#f9fc00">lethal attack</font> , and reply 15% qi and blood. <font color="#f9fc00">After </font> reviving, there is a 10m cooldown. <br>(<font color="#FF3030"> only effective for user or friends</font>)
desc_CS_single_mwnpz_3=I protect the people for the Wisdom King. Give target<font color="#FF3030">Wisdom King Nirvana</font>: 1 minute, can withstand a <font color="#f9fc00">lethal attack</font> , and reply 20% qi and blood. <font color="#f9fc00">After </font> reviving, there is a 10m cooldown. <br>(<font color="#FF3030"> only effective for user or friends</font>)
desc_CS_single_wjdbz_1=The Buddha is Merciful. Deals {@0伤害包} damage to all targets within 5m and <font color="#f9fc00"> knocks back </font> targets that don’t block. If it strikes any target, there is a chance to add <font color="#FF3030">Great Mercy</font>: Every 2s, <font color="#f9fc00"> Recover </font> 1% HP for teammates within 5m. Lasts 10s.
desc_CS_single_wjdbz_2=The Buddha is Merciful. Deals {@0伤害包} damage to all targets within 5m and <font color="#f9fc00"> knocks back </font> targets that don’t block. If it strikes any target, there is a high chance of giving self <font color="#FF3030">Great Mercy</font>: Every 2s, <font color="#f9fc00"> Recover </font> 1% HP for teammates within 5m. Lasts 10s.
desc_CS_single_wjdbz_3=The Buddha is Merciful. Deals {@0伤害包} damage to all targets within 5m and <font color="#f9fc00"> knocks back </font> targets that don’t block. If it strikes any target, gives user <font color="#FF3030">Great Mercy</font>: Every 2s, <font color="#f9fc00"> Recover </font> 1% HP for teammates within 5m. Lasts 10s.
desc_CS_single_ywdj_1=Crossing River with a Reed The Dharma Sect special Flying Skill. Break a reed and throw it in the water. User the skill to cross the river on the reeds. Cross the vast expanses with a reed. Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Crossing the River with a Reed</font> state for 60s.
desc_CS_single_ywdj_2=Crossing River with a Reed The Dharma Sect special Flying Skill. Break a reed and throw it in the water. User the skill to cross the river on the reeds. Cross the vast expanses with a reed. Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Crossing the River with a Reed</font> state for 120s.
desc_CS_single_ywdj_3=Crossing River with a Reed The Dharma Sect special Flying Skill. Break a reed and throw it in the water. User the skill to cross the river on the reeds. Cross the vast expanses with a reed. Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Crossing the River with a Reed</font> state for 180s.
