desc_CS_ym_mwcq05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. Reduces the unparried enemies' Accuracy Rate by 15% and makes them continuously lose HP for 6 seconds upon hit. <br>When used on the allies, it increases their Accuracy Rate by 15% and continuously recovers their HP for 6 seconds.
