desc_CS_ym_mwcq07_1=Pulls back the enemies within 8 meters and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to them. Creates a 8-meter radius Energy Field for 10 seconds, in which enemies will take continuous damage per second and have a chance to fall down when using flying skills (the chance depends on the remaining Energy Field time). <br>(Get yourself Yellow Armor.) <br>(Skill upgrade slightly increases the Fall-Down chance.)
