desc_CS_ym_mwcq08_1=Creates a 6-meter radius Energy Field for 10 seconds, in which allies will recover HP for 3 seconds when they are attacked with effect of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, or Stunned. When you get Wood Painting, you will recover HP continuously in the Energy Field. Each HP recovery removes one stack of Wood Painting.
