desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 15 meters in front of you. <br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly. <br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks them down</font>.
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc04_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> state: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increasing skill level can intensify counter-attack damage.)
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc04_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target.
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front within 5 meters.<br>Breaking the target's parry will add <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Diverts the River</font> status: When being attacked by skills from this set, the enemy will be debuffed with <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters of the affected area.<br>Targets within 5 meters will also receive <font color="#f9fc00">192</font> sustained damage for 3 seconds (Effected by melee strength). Targets within the area of effect will also be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc07_1=Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Soaring Dragon</font> state: In a period of 8 seconds, each hit of this skill set will add your target a stack of <font color="#f9fc00">Disabling Flying Skills</font> for 1 second. Up to 5 stacks.
desc_Npc_gb_xlsbzc08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf01_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target gains <font color="#FFAE00">"Sudden Snow" </font>status: Reduces "Wild Goose" and "Jump across the Cloud" flying skills speed, can stack 3 times. You will stun your target for 1 second when using it for the third time.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf01_2=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target gains <font color="#FFAE00">"Sudden Snow" </font>status: Reduces "Wild Goose" and "Jump across the Cloud" flying skills speed, can stack 3 times. You will stun your target for 1 second when using it for the third time.
