desc_Npc_jh_hyjf01_4=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target gains <font color="#FFAE00">"Sudden Snow" </font>status: Reduces "Wild Goose" and "Jump across the Cloud" flying skills speed, can stack 3 times. You will stun your target for 1 second when using it for the third time.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf01_5=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target gains <font color="#FFAE00">"Sudden Snow" </font>status: Reduces "Wild Goose" and "Jump across the Cloud" flying skills speed, can stack 3 times. You will stun your target for 1 second when using it for the third time.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf01_6=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Target gains <font color="#FFAE00">"Sudden Snow" </font>status: Reduces "Wild Goose" and "Jump across the Cloud" flying skills speed, can stack 3 times. You will stun your target for 1 second when using it for the third time.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf02_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf02_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf02_4=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf02_5=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf02_6=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Intrusion</font>: Restricts nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decreases Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf03_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Intrusion</font>: Restricts nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decreases Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf03_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Intrusion</font>: Restricts nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decreases Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time).
