desc_Npc_jh_hyjf04_5=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period.
