desc_Npc_jh_hyjf05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target in front of you. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 1 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf05_2=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target in front of you. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 1 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf05_3=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target in front of you. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 1 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 8 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf05_4=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target in front of you. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 1 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 9 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf05_5=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target in front of you. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 1 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf05_6=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target in front of you. <br>When breaking defense, add state to target: Stunned for 2 second if using Flying Skill; state will last for 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf06_1=When parrying successfully, you will get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Proud Snow"</font>, up to 3 stacks: <br>When casting "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Snow Storm" and "Traceless Snow," you get Super Armor. Each time you cast the skill, a stack of Proud Snow will be removed. <br>Reduces Rage cost for casting Bitter Cold. 1 stack of Proud Snow reduces Rage Cost by 1, while gets removed upon an attack.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf06_2=When parrying successfully, you will get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Proud Snow"</font>, up to 4 stacks: <br>When casting "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Snow Storm" and "Traceless Snow," you get Super Armor. Each time you cast the skill, a stack of Proud Snow will be removed. <br>Reduces Rage cost for casting Bitter Cold. 1 stack of Proud Snow reduces Rage Cost by 1, while gets removed upon an attack.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf06_3=When parrying successfully, you will get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Proud Snow"</font>, up to 5 stacks: <br>When casting "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Snow Storm" and "Traceless Snow," you get Super Armor. Each time you cast the skill, a stack of Proud Snow will be removed. <br>Reduces Rage cost for casting Bitter Cold. 1 stack of Proud Snow reduces Rage Cost by 1, while gets removed upon an attack.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf06_4=When parrying successfully, you will get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Proud Snow"</font>, up to 6 stacks: <br>When casting "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Snow Storm" and "Traceless Snow," you get Super Armor. Each time you cast the skill, a stack of Proud Snow will be removed. <br>Reduces Rage cost for casting Bitter Cold. 1 stack of Proud Snow reduces Rage Cost by 1, while gets removed upon an attack.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf06_5=When parrying successfully, you will get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Proud Snow"</font>, up to 7 stacks: <br>When casting "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Snow Storm" and "Traceless Snow," you get Super Armor. Each time you cast the skill, a stack of Proud Snow will be removed. <br>Reduces Rage cost for casting Bitter Cold. 1 stack of Proud Snow reduces Rage Cost by 1, while gets removed upon an attack.
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf06_6=When parrying successfully, you will get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Proud Snow"</font>, up to 8 stacks: <br>When casting "Sudden Snow is Changeable", "Snow Storm" and "Traceless Snow," you get Super Armor. Each time you cast the skill, a stack of Proud Snow will be removed. <br>Reduces Rage cost for casting Bitter Cold. 1 stack of Proud Snow reduces Rage Cost by 1, while gets removed upon an attack.
