desc_Npc_jh_hyjf08_1=Initiate a leaping attack (Attack also causes 1 second of Rigidity) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of 3 slashes.<br>The more stacks of Sudden Snow the targets get, the higher the damage they will take. <br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage.)
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf08_2=Initiate a leaping attack (Attack also causes 1 second of Rigidity) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of 4 slashes.<br>The more stacks of Sudden Snow the targets get, the higher the damage they will take. <br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage.)
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf08_3=Initiate a leaping attack (Attack also causes 1 second of Rigidity) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of 5 slashes.<br>The more stacks of Sudden Snow the targets get, the higher the damage they will take. <br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage.)
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf08_4=Initiate a leaping attack (Attack also causes 1 second of Rigidity) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of 6 slashes.<br>The more stacks of Sudden Snow the targets get, the higher the damage they will take. <br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage.)
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf08_5=Initiate a leaping attack (Attack also causes 1 second of Rigidity) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of 7 slashes.<br>The more stacks of Sudden Snow the targets get, the higher the damage they will take. <br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage.)
desc_Npc_jh_hyjf08_6=Initiate a leaping attack (Attack also causes 1 second of Rigidity) toward surrounding targets for a maximum of 8 slashes.<br>The more stacks of Sudden Snow the targets get, the higher the damage they will take. <br>(Skill requires 10 rage points. Each attack will consume 10 rage.)
