desc_Npc_jh_jsjf07_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Siege of the Snakes"</font>: Can absorb 40% of damage taken. It can be broken if under 5 continuous attacks. <br>If the state remains unbroken, the skill will be used again within 3 seconds (or when the state is over), returning all damage previously absorbed to the nearby enemies and daze them for 3 seconds.
