desc_Npc_jh_mmqfj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>When attacking enemies lying on the ground, you can <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> continuously and inflict <font color="#FF3030">Peerless Beauty</font> to them: disfigures them, and increases damage by 5% for 30 seconds. <br>You cannot move and will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using attacks.
