desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz03_1=Parrying grants a 50% chance to remove 6 of the target's buffs and make them immune to most buffs for 5 seconds. 30 second cooldown.
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 20 meters. <br>If you break target's parry, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz07_1=Dashes towards the target and causes them to faint for 3 seconds. The last attack will knock them back and deal {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz10_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to a target directly in front within 20 meters, while causing <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz13_1=Generates Cook Dragon and Phoenix in a 7-meter radius (Effect active for 10 seconds). Damage you receive from the target affected by Cook Dragon and Phoenix will be reduced by 30%. <br>(Only effective in PvP)
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz15_1=Stuns the enemies within 8 meters and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to them. <br>(Get yourself Yellow Armor.)
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz18_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">throws them</font>. <br>(When using this skill, your Stiffness, Knocked Back, Knocked Down or Thrown effect can be cleared. This skill activates Yellow Armor.)
desc_Npc_jh_xlsbz18_sky_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">throws them</font>. <br>(When using this skill, your Stiffness, Knocked Back, Knocked Down or Thrown effect can be cleared. This skill activates Yellow Armor.)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 15 meters in front of you. Add them with <font color="#FFAE00">Confusing</font> state: Be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed</font> by 30% for 2 seconds. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Do</font> state, this skill will <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Down</font> enemies in the air. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. <br>Breaking a target's parry will reduce that target's <font color="#f9fc00">internal defense</font> by 12% for 5 seconds. <br>When <font color="#FFAE00">“Re”</font> is active, the target's <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion</font> will be decreased by 10% for 5 seconds. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword) <br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf03_1=Using the skill adds <font color="#FFAE00">Flute Note</font> status for 12 seconds; wherein, a random note of <font color="#FFAE00">“Do”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“Re”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“Mi”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“Fa”</font><font color="#FFAE00">“So”</font> will be played. At the same time, movement restriction will be removed a single time.
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf04_1=Parrying grants a 22% chance to inflict the target with <font color="#FFAE00">“Flute Note”</font> status. (Can be stacked). Stacking <font color="#FFAE00">Flute Note</font> 9 times will activate <font color="#FFAE00">Intoxicating Flute Sound</font> status.
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf05_1=Play the flute to cast a <font color="#FFAE00">Music Array</font>. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters and adds them with <font color="#FFAE00">Intoxicating Flute Sound</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Mi</font> state, this skill gives an extra 2 seconds to <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font>. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 6 meters and the first strike from the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">Throw</font> the target. <br>If <font color="#FFAE00">“Fa”</font> has been played, each attack will cause the target to be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. (You can move while executing this skill) <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword) <br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
desc_Npc_jz_yydbf09_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. The last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">Throw</font> surrounding unparried enemies. If enemies were at <font color="#FFAE00">Intoxicating Flute Sound</font> state, they will get <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> while being attacked by this skill. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">La</font> state, increase Accuracy Rate by 20%. <br>(Be in Yellow Armor while casting) <br>(Inflicts 100% damage when equipped with a Flute but only 70% damage with a Single Sword)
desc_Npc_mmzw_xyjj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters.
desc_Npc_mmzw_xyjj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>If you break target's parry, you will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> the target.
desc_Npc_sneakon_ss_01_1=Stuns up to 5 enemies within 20 meters for 3 seconds and pulls them to your side. (Stun Effect decreases steadily). Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Npc_sneakon_ss_02_1=Deals increasingly {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>(Get yourself <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> and able to use Flying Skills while casting)
desc_boss_ss4_1_1=desc_Poison_1
desc_boss_ss5_1_1=desc_Shield_1
desc_boss_ss6_1_1=desc_Strength_1
desc_chunjie_qifu_002_1=Spring Festival blessing activities
desc_clone034_monster_attack01_1=Simple attack, sharp Jian Qi cross the front of the enemy caused by {@0:damage package}, and make every use of dodge are subject to additional damage.
desc_clone034_monster_attack03_1=Warheads, Sword Impacts, {@ 0: Damage to the Target}; will be subject to additional damage when the target can not be parry. <br> (This move can be used to quickly close to the opponent)
desc_clone034_monster_attack04_1=Warheads, Sword Impacts, {@ 0: Damage to the Target}; will be subject to additional damage when the target can not be parry. <br> (This move can be used to quickly close to the opponent)
desc_clone034_ywx_pg_1=Normal Attack
desc_clonetower001_NEW_1=<s>
desc_clonetower001_cyy_01_1=Creates Earth Spikes at the target's feet in 5 seconds, dealing a medium amount of damage and inflicting Bleeding upon hit. Bleeding effect: The target loses 1% HP per second, lasting for 10 seconds. When user's Damage Reduction stacks to below 3 times, this skill will deal Instant Kill damage and increase Bleeding effect (the target loses 10% HP per second, lasting for 10 seconds).
desc_clonetower001_cyy_02_1=Charge skill for 3 seconds to increase movement speed and damage by 20% and pull players within 20 meters towards the user. When user's Damage Reduction stacks to below 3 times, it also deals massive damage.
desc_clonetower001_cyy_03_1=Charge skill for 2 seconds to inflict earth spirit to the target, reducing their HP by 30% and stun them for 2 seconds upon using traps. When user's Damage Reduction stacks to over 3 times, the skill will change. Inflicts Dark Sky to the unparried targets, dealing massive damage and causes Keyboard settings randomized. Deals little damage to the parried target.
desc_clonetower001_cyy_04_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to deal massive damage to surrounding targets and knock them down. If players jump, it deals little damage.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_00_1=Blade Chi
desc_clonetower001_jdc_01_1=Throws all the targets and deals a medium amount of damage.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_02_1=Deals a medium amount of damage and inflicts Surf which reduces the target's movement speed by 50%.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_03_1=Releases three waves of Blade Chi, dealing little damage and inflicting Overlapping Waves upon hit. With 3 stacks of Overlapping Waves, the target will be paralyzed for 5 seconds.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_04_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to create a 5 meter radius of hidden weapon circle at the target, reducing the affected players' HP by 5% and removing a stack of Yinyang Mechanism per second. The circle lasts 8 seconds.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_05_1=Charge skill for 20 seconds to deal Instant Kill damage to the targets.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_06_1=Inflict Ignite to the selected target. After igniting, click the mouse to throw the target and deal damage to Jian Duancang in Demented state. <br>Can only be used on the bomb.
desc_clonetower001_jdc_07_1=Kick away the bomb.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_01_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to deal a medium amount of damage to the enemies within the range and debuff them with Moon Elapse, reducing their Accuracy by 20% for 20 seconds.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_02_1=Charge skill for 3 seconds. If not parring, the target will be debuffed with Meteorite Light: Reduces Brawn by 20% and each Critical Hit has a 10% chance to stun them for 1 second. Effect lasts for 20 seconds. If parring, the target will lose 5% HP.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_03_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to create a Blade Chi area, reducing the affected enemies' HP by 1% per second and movement speed by 80%. When taking a Critical Hit during recharging period, the effect stacks, creating 1 more Blade Chi area, up to 5 areas.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_04_1=Charge for 6 seconds, causing a lot of damage to the targets. When charging, any critical hit received will add a BUFF that immune 60% of damage to the player.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_05_1=Charge skill for 20 seconds to remove all the recovery items in the area and reduce the targets' HP by 95%. When user takes 20 hits while charging, the skill is interrupted and user is debuffed with Exposure: Get stunned for 20 seconds and have a chance to spawn the recovery item in the area upon taking Critical Hit.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_06_1=Charge skill for 20 seconds to reduce the targets' HP by 95% and debuff them with Bleeding: reduces their HP by 1% per second. Effect lasts for 20 seconds. The skill has a 30% chance to be interrupted while charging. Upon interruption, user will be controlled by players' skill for 10 seconds.
desc_clonetower001_lzq_07_1=Moon Chasing Fist
desc_clonetower001_xyl_01_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to shoot 3 bullets, dealing massive damage to the targets and reducing their recovery effect by 100% for 10 seconds upon hit. Has a 10% chance to deal Instance Kill damage.
desc_clonetower001_xyl_02_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to throw an explosive plate. After explosion, it deals massive damage to the target and creates a fog area, debuffing the affected enemies with Dark Clouds: reducing their movement speed by 30% and disable their flying skills for 20 seconds.
desc_clonetower001_xyl_03_1=Charge skill for 2 seconds to debuff the target with a 5-second Life-Taking Lock. During the effect period, the target will receive a medium amount of damage and lose all Flying Skill Points while using a flying skill.
desc_clonetower001_xyl_04_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to throw out the hidden weapons, dealing massive damage and having a 50% chance to deal Instant Kill damage.
desc_clonetower001_xyl_05_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to fire a dart. Deals massive damage upon hit, and leaves a bomb every 2 seconds. The bombs will explode after 8 seconds, dealing Instance Skill damage to all nearby players. The bombs will be destroyed after taking an attack.
desc_clonetower001_xyl_06_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds to throw a sickle, removing all the recovery items in the route. When hitting a player, it deals massive damage and has a 20% chance to deal Instance Kill damage to them.
desc_clonetower001_xyl_07_1=<s>
desc_dfsh_yxwf_bs02_1=Use the skill to light a lamp.
