desc_dfsj_cjg_hjboss_05_1=Deals damage to target and knocks down the nearby enemies.
desc_dfsj_cjg_kz_01_1=Use it on the Elemental Demon Leader to remove its HP recovery state.
desc_dfsj_cjg_kz_02_1=Use it on the Elemental Demon Leader to remove its External Skill Damage Immunity state.
