desc_dfsj_dzt_05_1=Start fire at the coals to draw Dongfang Yan away.<br><font color="#f9fc00">You can get close to it to dispel the coldness.</font>
desc_dfsj_dzt_06_1=Extinguish the given sky fire
desc_dfsj_lrhn_02_1=Strengthened Weapon Competition Points.
desc_dfsj_lrjfd_01_1=Use to increase the movement speed.
desc_dfsj_lrjn_01_1=Use the skill to maintain the weapons.
desc_dfsj_ytds01_1=Use it on the Cold Iron Heavy Sword (361,1534) in the Dongfang Family Sword Furnace to complete Smelt and get irons. (It cannot be used if your backpack is full.)
desc_dfsj_ytfxmc01_1=Use it on the wood (390,1533) around Dongfang Family Sword Furnace to start fire and get a torch. (It cannot be used if your backpack is full.)
desc_dfsj_ytsqmc01_1=Use it to tie up the wood on the ground.
desc_dfsj_ywt_01_1=10-meter circular area attack
desc_dfsj_ywt_02_1=10-meter fan-shaped area attack
desc_dfsj_ywt_03_1=5-meter circular area attack, Weaken+Stun, Damage Reduction
desc_dfsj_ywt_04_1=10-meter square area attack, knock down
desc_dfsj_ywt_05_1=10-meter fan-shaped area attack, break defense
desc_dfsj_ywt_06_1=10-meter fan-shaped area attack
desc_dfsj_ywt_07_1=10-meter circular area attack
desc_dfsj_ywt_08_1=5-meter Fan-Shaped area, Stun
desc_dfsj_ywt_09_1=Wields a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will causes him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block, he will suffer damage if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often uses this attack to break enemy's parry.
desc_dfsj_ywt_10_1=Raise the sand around you and imbue it with your inner energy, jolting surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. This causes them to be paralyzed for 3.5 seconds, unable to move but able to parry. <br/>This move evolved from the blade skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Cui Yang</font> of Longmen Inn.
desc_dfsj_ywt_11_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}. <br>In <font color="#FF3030">Draw the Sword</font>state: Sword Chi may <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> target who does not parry.
desc_dfsj_ywt_12_1=A graceful sword dance technique that deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_dfsj_ywt_13_1=<s> Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front of you. If you hit a target (Must be a player), the cooldown time for <font color="#f9fc00">Dance of Three Blossoms</font> will be reduced by 2 seconds.
desc_dfsj_ywt_14_1=<s> <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks down</font> targets within 15 meters and deals {@0:伤害包}.
desc_dfsj_ywt_15_1=Request a Weapon Competition with players
desc_dfsj_yxwf_yxd01_1=Use to increase Crit Damage and Damage Reduction.
desc_dfsj_zjcj_jncj01_1=Collect the sword to the top of the stone sword at Sword Pavilion.
desc_dfsj_zjcj_zsjn01_1=The wind is chilly and the water is cold.
desc_dfsj_zjcjjn01_1=Use on the red curtain to write some words on it. (The curtain must be blank.)
desc_dfsj_zjcjjn02_1=Use on the green curtain to write some words on it. (The curtain must be blank.)
desc_dfsj_zjcjjn03_1=Use on the white curtain to write some words on it. (The curtain must be blank.)
