desc_fwz_test_ts1_1=Yu Xiao stunt, shake the blade, to release a sound wave to the target, can be continuous ejection<font color="#FFAE00">between the enemy</font>; <br> On the target of the siren: Attack damage, dizziness 1 second, limit dodge 2 seconds. <br> The sonic boom is limited to 5 times.
desc_fwz_test_ts2_1=Yu Xiao stunt, shake the blade, to release a sound wave to the target, can be continuous ejection<font color="#FFAE00">between the enemy</font>; <br> On the target of the siren: Attack damage, dizziness 1 second, limit dodge 2 seconds. <br> The sonic boom is limited to 5 times.
