desc_jn_clone034_boss2_01_1=Circular area of effect damage. Spin in two circles and then use sword. The first two strikes block enemy skills, and the final strike knocks down enemies in range with no defense.
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_02_1=Jump in the air and then descend to the ground attacking. Deals massive damage to enemies in range.
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_04_1=Raise sword while it gathers energy. Knocks down enemies in range and deals some damage.
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_05_1=Deal multi-step attack after knocking down. Deals massive damage to enemies in range.
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_06_1=Rush which Stiffens enemies struck.
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_07_1=Knocks enemies ahead airborne and then begins multi-step attack. Very high damage.
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_tmjt02_1=Knocks target toward self and deals damage.
