desc_jn_guild_01_01_1=If players don't parry, they will be debuffed with Constriction.
desc_jn_guild_01_02_1=If players don't parry, they will be knocked down and debuffed with Break Bone.
desc_jn_guild_01_03_1=Deals damage equal to 10% of Max HP every meter.
desc_jn_guild_01_04_1=Buffs self with Burning Rage.
desc_jn_guild_01_05_1=Summons a Rage Ball
desc_jn_guild_01_06_1=Debuffs the player with Irritation.
desc_jn_guild_01_07_1=Die of explosion
desc_jn_guild_02_01_1=Normal Attack
desc_jn_guild_02_02_1=If players don't parry, they will be debuffed with Nearly Immobilized.
desc_jn_guild_02_03_1=Invincible Chop
desc_jn_guild_02_05_1=Knocks back all targets within 8 meters.
desc_jn_guild_02_06_1=Buffs self with a stack of Evil Chi Rushing into the Sky.
desc_jn_guild_03_01_1=Summons a trap.
desc_jn_guild_03_03_1=If players don't parry, the boss will knock them down and get Path of Vengeance.
desc_jn_guild_03_04_1=If players don't parry, they will be thrown upward and debuffed with Wither.
