desc_jn_ngsj_shuilao_chouhenzhuanyi_1=Grants energy to increase your damage for 30 seconds.
desc_jn_sneakon_001_1=Stun your current target for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Use on Information Disciple or Traitor to get 1 piece of Information.</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unable to use in combat.</font>
desc_jn_sneakon_002_1=Summons a Perdue to attract the attention of the nearby enemies. <br><font color="#f9fc00">The Perdue can only exist for 10 seconds.</font>
desc_jn_sneakon_003_1=Shoot an hidden arrow on the line of 30 meters in front of you which can kill all the targets on the path.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Kill a Traitor to get 2 pieces of Information.</font><br><font color="#FF3030">Unable to use in combat.</font>
desc_jn_sneakon_005_1=Try to assassinate the target in a close distance.<br><font color="#FF3030">Unable to use in combat.</font>
desc_jn_sneakon_006_1=Strike the target's acupoint. Knock back your target and disable the target's movement for 10 seconds.
desc_jn_sneakon_008_1=Rescue
desc_jn_wywl_qf_01_1=Deals damage to the enemies ahead
desc_jn_wywl_qf_02_1=Throws the nearby enemies and deals damage to them
desc_jn_wywl_qf_03_1=Knocks back the nearby enemies and deals damage to them
desc_jn_wywl_qf_04_1=Deals damage to the enemies ahead
desc_jn_wywl_qf_05_1=Releases a Sword Chi within 10 meters ahead, and Paralyzes the unparried targets.
desc_jn_wywl_qf_06_1=Charges towards the target and inflicts Slowed to the unparried one.
