desc_skill_clone034_dw_01_1=Releases quickly. Deals 15% max HP soft damage to the two enemies with the most HP within 5m. Disables flying skills for 5s.
desc_skill_clone034_dw_02_1=Cast for 3s. While casting, knocks all targets within 5m airborne. Deals 30% max HP external attack damage to enemy with the most HP within 5-15m after casting is over.
desc_skill_clone034_dw_03_1=Releases quickly. Current Hatred takes 7% max HP damage each second. HP recover decreases 90%. Canceled by iron sword.
desc_skill_clone034_dw_04_1=Two seconds to cast. Lasts 8s. Reflects damage from players using internal skills.
desc_skill_clone034_dw_05_1=Cast for 1s. Get the "Hellflame Protection" buff to increase damage 20% every 2s. Can be stacked 10 times. Deals damage equal to 6% max HP each second to enemies within 5m. Canceled with Congealed Frost Sword.
desc_skill_clone034_dw_08_1=Cast for 4s. Deals massive external attack damage to current target. Can be divided.
desc_skill_clone034_hjdzA_1=Deals massive damage to current target.
desc_skill_clone034_hjdzB_1=Deals average damage.
desc_skill_clone034_hjdzC_1=Attacks current target with long range Hidden Weapon. Deals mid-level damage.
desc_skill_clone034_hjdzD_1=Deals average damage.
desc_skill_clone034_hx_01_1=Gather power for 3s. All targets on the battlefield are confused 5s. While using flying skills, they have a chance of consuming 2% Energy. (Two three stages)
desc_skill_clone034_hx_02_1=Use the Yin Yang power to give yourself 15s of Yin Yang Four Phase state. This state increase damage 30%.
desc_skill_clone034_hx_03_1=Deals minor damage to all targets in range ahead. Knocks airborne non-blocking targets. If the target has any Five Forms Buff, Yin Yang Buff, or Yin Yang Fusion Buff, deals massive damage.
desc_skill_clone034_hx_05_1=Gather power 5s, then deal massive damage to all enemies in range. Triggers differing effects depending on user’s Yin Yang Fusion Array stack. Deals 10% HP loss with 1 stack; throws all targets with 2 stacks; clears all Pluck The Peacock's Plume effects with 3 stacks and deals 90% HP loss
desc_skill_clone034_hx_06_1=Charge energy 2s. Clears user’s Yin Yang Fusion Array state, Yin Yang Sword state. When clearing 2 stacks(including 2 stacks), deals instant kill. If not at 2 stacks(not including 2 stacks), deals medium damage and throws all targets.
desc_skill_clone034_hx_07_1=And T more than 3 meters, will charge 5 seconds on all targets caused a lot of damage. (One stage of exclusive skills)
desc_skill_clone034_jghx_01_1=Detonates all puppets on the field. Deals 75% max HP damage to all targets.
desc_skill_clone034_jghx_02_1=Four randomly selected players are paralyzed, and other players must tap to rescue. A 5m radius flame circle is produced under their feet. The flames deals 30% HP loss to players in range. This damage bypasses all bonus effects. Area exists permanently.
desc_skill_clone034_jghx_03_1=Knocks back all targets ahead and gives Flame Status. External Defense decreases 100% and 5% HP loss every second, lasting 10s. If the target is parrying, then they cannot parry for 20s.
desc_skill_clone034_jghx_04_1=Each time used, this skill will be used 3 times. After gathering power 3s, releases canon shot towards targets ahead. Targets struck will take 5% HP loss. If the shot crosses any Blaze areas of effect, it will immediately detonate, and all targets within 5m will take kill damage.
desc_skill_clone034_jghx_05_1=Throw all targets in range and gives Fatigue State, lowering damage 30%. Lasts 5s. This skill will be released within 10s after use of Xuanmen Cannon.
desc_skill_clone034_jghx_06_1=Gathers energy 2s and spins in place, throwing knives. If player is in the air, deals small amount of damage. If target is on the ground, deals 80 HP damage and decreases HP recovery by 80%.
desc_skill_clone034_jgs_01_1=Deals heavy damage to all targets in range ahead.
desc_skill_clone034_jgs_02_1=Throw targets in range ahead, dealing average damage.
desc_skill_clone034_jgs_03_1=Deals massive damage to targets nearby, decreasing movement speed 70%.
desc_skill_clone034_jx_01_1=Throws targets ahead. Attack and Defense both decrease 20%.
desc_skill_clone034_jx_02_1=Gather power 2s. Creates a giant ring flame under users’ feet. Players in range take 10% HP damage and have skills disabled.
desc_skill_clone034_jx_03_1=Gather power 5s and strike the ground. Deals massive Yang Damage to enemies within 10m. Struck enemies are Burned and take continuous damage. They also take 50% more damage.
desc_skill_clone034_jx_04_1=Selected players must leave the group. After 8s, deals 30% HP damage to players within 10m.
desc_skill_clone034_jx_05_1=Normal Attack - Giant Trap Beast
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_01_1=Selects two random players and gives Qianqingsi State. When this state ends, it deals 10% Yin Damage and then skips to another player without Qianqingsi State. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_02_1=Gather power 3s. While gathering, you are unable to use flying skills. After power is gathered, deal great damage to all targets within 8m. Causes 20s Dazed effect if target is not parrying (similar to Intoxication). (If in Yin Yang State, deals damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_03_1=Gather power 1s. Loose Sword Chi in the area ahead, throwing all targets in the area and dealing some damage. Struck targets get Shicong effect. During Shicong effect, each skill use has a chance to cause 0.5s dizziness. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_04_1=Gather power 2s. Damage done to targets nearby increases 50% and gives user Singing Sword Song effect. Each time struck by an attack or internal skill, there is a chance to recover 1% HP. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_05_1=Causes Skill Disability to all targets nearby. If Xu Miaozhen is in range, recover 5% HP. During the next 10s, recover 0.5% HP every 2s. Continuous healing effect canceled after leaving area. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect) (If in Madness, deals 30% HP loss to NPCs)
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_07_1=Able to dispel Ling Yunyu’s "Love at First Sight" and Xu Miaozhen’s "Lian Xipo" damage to ally leader.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_01_1=Releases quickly, dealing 20% max HP external attack damage. Skills are disabled and target is paralyzed 2s.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_02_1=Cast 2s, deals 4000 external attack damage to players within 10m radius. Targets lose 7% max HP every second for 3s.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_03_1=Cast 2s. Triple strike. Affects players within 15m area of 120 degree fan shape. Struck targets are knocked back and faint for 2s. Deals 25% max HP external attack damage.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_04_1=Cast 2s. Range is 10m radius around current target. After throwing, targets faint for 3s and take 60% max HP external attack damage.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_05_1=Cast 3s. Area of effect is 10m radium. Deals 90% max HP external attack damage and faint 2s.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_06_1_1=Releases allies from blocked meridian state.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_07_1=Casts immediately. Effective against players within 20m radius. After 3s, deals 30% max HP Yang Damage to players in range (including user) If user is not within range of any ally explosion, only take 30% damage. If in range of ally explosion, take 60% damage; take 120% with three stacks; take 240% with four stacks. Damage increases with amount of stacks.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_08_1=Cast 4s. Deals kill damage to all members. Players in range of "Conserve the Scarce" are immune to damage.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_01_1=Store energy for 3s and deal hard damage to all players in range, knocking back all non-blocking players.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_02_1=Store energy for 3s and deal yin damage to all players in range, knocking back all non-blocking players.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_03_1=Store energy for 3s and deal soft damage to all players in range, knocking back all non-blocking players.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_04_1=Store energy for 3s and deal yang damage to all players in range, knocking back all non-blocking players.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_05_1=Store energy for 3s and deal trauma damage to all players in range, knocking back all non-blocking players.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_06_1=Deals hard damage to all targets within 5m.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_07_1=Deals yin damage to all targets within 5m.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_08_1=Deals soft damage to all targets within 5m.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_09_1=Deals yang damage to all targets within 5m.
desc_skill_clone034_qfy_monster_10_1=Deals trauma damage to all targets within 5m.
desc_skill_clone034_qybgs_01_1=Mid level damage. If there are other players within 3m of target, this attack deals great damage. Damage is increased with "Sword's Will" effect.
desc_skill_clone034_qybgs_02_1=Mid level damage. Clears "Sword's Will" effect. Does not clear if target is parrying.
desc_skill_clone034_qybgs_03_1=High damage. Six players share. If target and sharers have "Sword's Will" effect, deals extra damage. Damage increased with "Sword's Will" effect.
desc_skill_clone034_qybgs_04_1=Deals minor damage. Struck players get Buddha's Golden Aura cleared. In the next 30s, player is unable to take effect of Buddha's Golden Aura. Damage increased with "Sword's Will" effect.
desc_skill_clone034_ssd_01_1=Gather power 15s. Swap External skill immunity status of user. Damage taken while gathering power is doubled.
desc_skill_clone034_ssd_02_1=Gather power 2s. Deals great damage to all targets in range. Disarms targets not parrying for 10s.
desc_skill_clone034_ssd_03_1=Deals massive damage to all targets in area ahead. Movement speed decreases 80%. Cancels all Flying Skill Points.
desc_skill_clone034_ssd_04_1=Gather power 10s. Deals great damage to all targets in 10x10 area ahead. If controlled while gathering strength, deals kill damage to all players and lose 20% HP each second over the next 5s. (ignores all immunity and Pluck The Peacock's Plume status)
desc_skill_clone034_ssd_05_1=Throws disc ahead which returns to user. The disc throws struck targets and deals great damage, causing Bleeding. Also decreases HP recovery 90%.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz1_01_1=Randomly creates a spinning blade, which deals multi-step damage to players in range and decreases their movement speed.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz1_02_1=Deals mid level damage to current target and deals damage to multiple targets.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz1_03_1=Prevent the sword from causing moderate damage
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_01_1=Pulls players towards user and stuns for 5s. Deals mid level damage after 5s. Does not stun if target is parrying.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_02_1=Gather power 5s. Disables skills of players within 5m and continuously decreases Energy while dealing minor HP damage.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_03_1=Multi-step heavy damage. Parry to decrease damage.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_04_1=Deals continuous area of effect damage. Players with Taiyin Array Eye temporary skills must use shield to decrease damage. Shield appears while using temporary skill.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_05_1=Selects a player and deals kill damage after 5s. Requires players with Taiyang Array Eye temporary skills to use.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_06_1=Use Energy Shield for immunity to some damage.
desc_skill_clone034_sxjz2_07_1=Gives selected target Suppress Earth effect, allowing immunity to some Laceration damage.
desc_skill_clone034_syany_01_1=In three random places, players within 5m have speed reduced 50%. Deals 1% HP damage every second.
desc_skill_clone034_syany_02_1=Binds current target, dealing 10% damage every second. Effect lasts 10s. Requires other players to tap before being dispelled.
desc_skill_clone034_syany_03_1=Throws random players to the same spot, dealing mid level damage. In the next 30s, if those players get too close, they will deal massive damage to each other.
desc_skill_clone034_syany_04_1=Gathers power 20s, and then deals kill damage to nearby enemies. Chance of getting cut off if damaged while gathering strength.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_01_1=Deals damage to targets within a rectangular area 3m long and 10m wide. If the first struck target is not parrying, they get the "Deep Water" or "Fiery Heat" status.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_02_1=Deals damage and throws three random targets within 30m. Grants "Bone Chilling" status.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_03_1=Deals damage to targets ahead in a 120 degree field within 10m. If the first struck target is not parrying, they get the "Deep Water" or "Fiery Heat" status.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_04_1=Deals damage to all targets within 20m. Draws target near user if not parrying and gives "Wrapped Up" status.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_05_1=Deals damage to current target and fires three shots (8m radius). If the struck target has more than 50% HP, they take the "Soaring Acupoint Strike" effect. If their HP is less than 50%, they are "Seriously Wounded."
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_06_1=Gives user the No Means of Retreat effect. Deals damage and throws all enemies within 10m behind user in a 120 degree fan shape.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_07_1=Deals damage to all targets on the field. If the target has more than 50% Energy, gives three levels of "Water Cover" effect.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_08_1=Grants user the "Galaxy Overturn" effect.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_08_1_1=Grants user the "Nine Heavens Darkshield" effect.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_09_1=Changes user's state to "With the Current".
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_09_1_1=When battle begins, grants the "With the Current" effect and random mark of Nine Heavens Galaxy.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_10_1=Changes user’s state to "Against the Current".
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_11_1=Deals damage to all targets within 15m. Each strike causes 10% HP loss, with a total of 5 strikes. If target is not parrying, each target grants the Irregular Breathing effect.
desc_skill_clone034_sygjy_normal_1=Deals {@0:伤害包}
desc_skill_clone034_syin_02_1=Deals small amount of damage. Rage of players in rage is decrease and players are unable to get Thunder Mark effect for some time.
desc_skill_clone034_syin_04_1=Gathers power 20s, and then deals kill damage to nearby enemies. Chance of getting cut off if damaged while gathering strength.
desc_skill_clone034_tyany_01_1=Random players use skills to deal damage for 10s. User is stunned 5s after effect disappears.
desc_skill_clone034_tyany_02_1=Creates random traps. Players that enter are thrown and take mid level damage. Targets are Burned for 20s and take continuous HP damage. Burn effect will transfer to other players if they get too close.
desc_skill_clone034_tyany_03_1=Continuous HP damage is dealt after striking the target. Burned players much approach to cancel. When canceled, average damage is dealt to both parties one time.
desc_skill_clone034_tyany_04_1=Gathers power 20s, and then deals kill damage to nearby enemies. Chance of getting cut off if damaged while gathering strength.
desc_skill_clone034_tyin_01_1=Skills of players in range are disabled, and they are confused and slowed. Deals minor damage and continuously decreases player energy. Decreases player’s Accuracy for 20s.
desc_skill_clone034_tyin_02_1=Gives user a Shield to absorb some damage. If the shield has not been broken, decreases energy of nearby players greatly.
desc_skill_clone034_tyin_03_1=Gives effect to random player in range. The player cannot move, use flying skills, or martial skills; otherwise they will take great damage. The player cannot take effect of "Pierce the Sky in Rage".
desc_skill_clone034_tyin_04_1=Gathers power 20s, and then deals kill damage to nearby enemies. Chance of getting cut off if damaged while gathering strength.
desc_skill_clone034_wx_01_1=Knocks back target, deals damage, and grants Confusion.
desc_skill_clone034_wx_02_1=Throws target, deals damage, and reduces speed.
desc_skill_clone034_wx_03_1=Looses a Fire trap under the feet of the current target. Players in the trap lose 10% HP every second, and their movement speed decreases 30%.
desc_skill_clone034_xmz_01_1=Gather power 2s and then deal minor damage five times to three random players on the field. Each hit has a 30% chance to decrease target’s speed 50% (damage can be Parried).
desc_skill_clone034_xmz_02_1=Deals average damage to four random players. If the players’ HP is over 50%, it clears all Rage. If lower than 50%, damage decreases 30% (in Yin Yang state, only deals minor damage and has no additional effects)
desc_skill_clone034_xmz_03_1=Strikes current target 7 times. If the target doesn’t parry the first hit, the target is unable to parry for 30s. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_xmz_04_1=Deals minor damage to three random players. These players must approach a non-selected player. If there is more than 1 non-selected player, deals 10% damage every 2s. If there are no non-selected players, deals 5% damage every 2s. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_xmz_05_1=Deals minor damage to all targets in range ahead and causes 10s fainting (only deals minor damage if in Yin Yang state and has no additional effect)
desc_skill_clone034_xmz_06_1=Deals great damage to targets nearby and gives Ling Yunyu the Lian Xi effect. Each attack has a chance of disabling skills 1s. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect) (If in Madness, deals 30% HP loss to NPCs)
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds01a_1=Uses Moon Shadow power to summon an illusion of similar size and strength. Illusion lasts 3 minutes. If Illusion is not destroyed, it deals great damage to all players within 50m.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds01b_1=Uses Moon Shadow power to summon two illusions of similar size and strength. Illusion lasts 3 minutes. If Illusion is not destroyed, it deals great damage to all players within 50m.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds01c_1=Uses Moon Shadow power to summon three illusions of similar size and strength. Illusion lasts 3 minutes. If Illusion is not destroyed, it deals great damage to all players within 50m.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds02_1=Deals damage to six random players according to HP percentage. The lower their HP, the greater the damage.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds04_1=Control the enemy’s shadow to take damage for user. It absorbs all damage for the next 8s. After 5s, all damage taken is given to opponent.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds05_1=Deals damage five times to players within 40m. Players standing on the ground are Knocked Down and take 100% damage.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds06_1=Fires a crescent moon sword 40m ahead. Struck enemies not parrying are thrown.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx01_1=In an instant, releases Cold Ice into the current target’s body. Deals continuous damage for 5s and prevents movement. (Can be used during all phases; damage added in 3rd and 4th phase) Player cannot move for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx02_1=Cast 2s. Use the power of the Moon to deal great damage. Deals 9 consecutive Yin Damage blows. Each strike picks a random target within 2m. (Can be used during all phases; damage added in 3rd and 4th phase) Damage increased with Full Moon.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx04_1=Releases quickly. Fires countless moon shaped hidden weapons across the entire field. Players influenced take damage every 5s and short stun effect. Lasts 30s and has 40m of range (can be used in all stages; damage increase in 3rd and 4th stages); with Waning Moon, increases mid level continuous damage.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx06_1=Cast for 2s. Curses a random player within 20m and gives them Lone Star effect. Players who come within 10m take HP and blue damage. (only used in phase 2 and 3) During Waning Moon, affects players within 15m of cursed player.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx07_1=Releases quickly. Uses the way of the changing moon to summon Yin Yang power, granting a Yin Yang Buff. Players who receive Yin after 5s are frozen for 5s. Players who take Yang receive burning damage every second for 20s. Has a 40m range. (Players who take Yang can jump in the water to dispel) (only used in phase 2, 3, and 4) Used in Full Moon. Yin Yang Buff cannot be parried. Each time this skill is used, the Moon Phase Array changes.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx10_1=Cast quickly. Imbues player with the power of the Cold Moon to give Freezing effect for 10s. If the player is not in the Moon Phase Array when the effect ends, they cannot move for 10s and take great damage. This effect ignores Pluck The Peacock's Plume effect. Range in 100m (only used in phase 4) During Last quarter of the Moon, Freeze effect lasts 7s.
desc_skill_clone034_ys_01_1=Gather power 1s and then deal great damage to current target. If the target is no parrying, causes the charge effect. Within 10s, if more than 3 players are within range, causes explosion. (disregards Buff effects)
desc_skill_clone034_ys_02_1=Spin in place and knock back all targets in range while dealing mid level damage. If the target is parrying, it cannot parry for 1m.
desc_skill_clone034_ys_03_1=Gather power 10s. If not attacked more than 20 times, deals damage to all targets again and recovers HP of all robots. Casting is interrupted if struck more than 20 times. Damage decreases 80% while gathering power. HP recovery within 5m decreases 100%.
desc_skill_clone034_ys_04_1=Knocks back all targets ahead and causes massive damage. If target isn’t parrying, they are dissolved and Breath decreases 100%. Lasts 10s.
desc_skill_clone034_ys_05_1=Creates a 3m area every 2s under user’s feet. Damage left and right of the area increases 300%. Players lose 5% HP every second. Lasts 10s. Area exists 15s.
desc_skill_clone034_zs_01_1=Gather power 1s and then deal great damage to current target. If the target is no parrying, causes the charge effect. Within 10s, if more than 3 players are within range, causes explosion. (disregards Buff effects)
desc_skill_clone034_zs_02_1=Spin in place and knock back all targets in range while dealing mid level damage. If the target is parrying, it cannot parry for 1m.
desc_skill_clone034_zs_03_1=Gather power 10s. If not attacked more than 20 times, deals damage to all targets again and recovers HP of all robots. Casting is interrupted if struck more than 20 times. Damage decreases 80% while gathering power. HP recovery within 5m decreases 100%.
desc_skill_clone034_zs_04_1=Knocks back all targets ahead and causes massive damage. If target isn’t parrying, they are dissolved and Brawn decreases 100%. Lasts 10s.
desc_skill_clone034_zs_05_1=Deals mid level damage to all targets in range and causes High Poison effect. Deals 1% Breath loss each time this skill is used and has a chance to stack High Poison effect. After stacking 5 times, it deals 50% HP loss and 100% Energy loss.
desc_skill_clone036_mtx_01_1=Summon the Whirlwind at a radius of 5 meters around a target. The Whirlwind exists for 5 seconds. The players in it lose 500 HP every 2 seconds and receive a stack of Offended.
desc_skill_clone036_qrr_02_1=Charge skill for 5 seconds. 3 seconds later, a 10-second Smoke Area will appear at a radius of 5 meters around the target. In this smoke area, players will receive Slowed by 30% and Skill Disabled, and lose HP and Energy by 5% per second.
desc_skill_clonetower001_gsy00_1=Long stick Normal Attack
desc_skill_clonetower001_gsy01_1=Charge skill for 2 seconds. Gongsun You deals little damage to players.
desc_skill_clonetower001_gsy02_1=Charge skill for 2 seconds to throw nearby players and deal a medium amount of damage. Parried players will receive little damage but not be thrown.
desc_skill_clonetower001_gsy03_1=Gongsun You attacks the players, dealing little damage and disabling their skills.
desc_skill_clonetower001_gsy04_1=Gongsun You creates a circular area in a 6-meter radius for 10 seconds, reducing the affected players' movement speed and inflicting Bleeding to them.
desc_skill_clonetower001_gsy_ex_1=Uses HP to remove Explosion effect.
desc_skill_clonetower001_lh_001_1=Defeat the enemy with only one strike. Can only be used on Wicked Foreign Women and Central Plains Traitors.
desc_skill_clonetower001_lh_002_1=Defeat the enemy with only one strike. Can only be used on Wicked Foreign Women and Central Plains Traitors. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
