desc_skill_clonetower001_xp_02_1=Buff self with a stack of Evade: Evades the target's Push once within 5 seconds. <br>Buff self with Accumulate: 5 stacks of Accumulate allow the using of Wild.
desc_skill_clonetower001_xp_03_1=Charge skill for 1 second to knock back the targets in the 3X3 area ahead. <br>If the target has Protect state, it removes a stack of Protect. <br>Cannot knock back the targets in Evade or Protect state.
desc_skill_clonetower001_xp_04_1=NPC's exclusive skills. Charge skill for 1 second to knock back targets within 20 meters.
desc_skill_clonetower001_xp_05_1=When stacked up to 5 times, it ignores Evade and Protect and knocks back the targets.
desc_skill_clonetower001_xp_06_1=NPC's exclusive skills. Buffs self with 5 stacks of the effect. When having Protect state, it is immune to Push.
desc_skill_clonetower001_xwgsz_001_1=Deals little damage. Non-parry recovers 40% HP of all members of Snake Array.
desc_skill_clonetower001_xwgsz_002_1=Deals little damage and inflicts players with Tangle: When stacked up to 4 times, Tangle effect is removed and players' flying skills are disabled.
