desc_wuji_CS_em_jdmz02_1=Increases target's HP recovery, removes blood clots and jolts and deal damage to nearby enemies. When used on yourself, the move can throw nearby enemies. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Buddha's Aura</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Send-Flying range increases to 5 meters. When used on the target, it will clear 1 non-control debuff of that target and its allies within 5 meters and inflicts 2 buffs (Auspiciousness and Beginning) on them. Auspiciousness: Withstand Send-Flying, Knock-Back, and Knock-Down once in 6 seconds. Beginning: Skill Damage increases by 20% for 6 seconds. <br>(The skill caster can also get the buff.)
desc_wuji_CS_em_jdmz02_10=Increases target's HP recovery, removes blood clots and jolts and deal damage to nearby enemies. When used on yourself, the move can throw nearby enemies. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Buddha's Aura</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Send-Flying range increases to 5 meters. When used on the target, it will clear 1 non-control debuff of that target and its allies within 5 meters and inflicts 2 buffs (Auspiciousness and Beginning) on them. Auspiciousness: Withstand Send-Flying, Knock-Back, and Knock-Down once in 6 seconds. Beginning: Skill Damage increases by 20% for 6 seconds. <br>(The skill caster can also get the buff.)
desc_wuji_CS_em_jdmz02_11=Increases target's HP recovery, removes blood clots and jolts and deal damage to nearby enemies. When used on yourself, the move can throw nearby enemies. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Buddha's Aura</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Send-Flying range increases to 5 meters. When used on the target, it will clear 1 non-control debuff of that target and its allies within 5 meters and inflicts 2 buffs (Auspiciousness and Beginning) on them. Auspiciousness: Withstand Send-Flying, Knock-Back, and Knock-Down once in 6 seconds. Beginning: Skill Damage increases by 20% for 6 seconds. <br>(The skill caster can also get the buff.)
