desc_wuji_CS_em_jdmz03_1=A palm strike deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. Breaks targets' Parry and reduces their Rage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Buddha's Aura</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Skill range increases to 15 meters, only for 1 player. Recovery Time increases to 6 seconds.
