desc_wuji_CS_gb_lhz03_1=Detonate <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; skill may blow away targets and injure them: affected targets lose HP continuously and suffer loss of Brawn. <br>(May only be used when you have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ultimate Domination</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. It may be used even when you don't have Lotus Chi. 3 stacks of Lotus Chi may increase skill range by 2 meters.
