desc_wuji_CS_gb_lhz07_1=This move knocks airborne targets out of the sky to suffer {@0: 伤害包} damage, and it imparts an explosion effect that shocks enemies around the target. <br>(You must have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font> to use this move. This move can only be used against airborne targets.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ultimate Domination</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. It may be used even when you don't have Lotus Chi.
