desc_wuji_CS_jh_cyjf02_1=Wields a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage. <br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will causes him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block, he will suffer damage and cannot use flying skills for 3 seconds if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Dusk</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. When triggering Blazing Sword, you may cause four waves of Blazing Chi to fill the enemy's body. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often uses this attack to break enemy's parry.
