desc_wuji_CS_jh_cyjf05_1=Deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to nearby enemies, and makes enemies unable to use attacks. <br>This attack causes enemies' bodies to be filled with <font color="#FFAE00">Blazing Sword</font>. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Dusk</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. When triggering Blazing Sword, you may cause four waves of Blazing Chi to fill the enemy's body. <br>This attack is one of the wild attacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhao Ziji</font>.
