desc_wuji_CS_jh_cyjf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>If the enemy does not parry, a pyre will be created around the enemy, preventing him from using flying skills and also causing him to take damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Dusk</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. If the enemy doesn't parry, he will suffer two waves of Blazing Sword; If he parries, a flaming pyre appears. <br>It's said that this attack is associated with <font color="#FFAE00">Wei Buji</font>.
