desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Intrusion</font>: Restricts nearby enemy from using Flying Skill and decreases Movement Speed sharply (speed will recover with time). <br><font color="#FF00FF">Trace of Snow</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. If you are in the Proud Snow state, you will send the target flying.
