desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_1=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_2=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_3=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_4=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
