desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_6=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_7=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. If you are in the "Proud Snow" effect, using this skill will cause you to lose a stack of Proud Snow and obtain the Yellow Armor effect. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf04_8=Ice-cold heart, Huanhua Sword: Clear movement-restricted negative effects (decrease speed, Paralysis, no Flying Skill), increase Movement Speed sharply (Speed will recover to normal level with time), restrict movement immune in a short period. If you are in the "Proud Snow" effect, using this skill will cause you to lose a stack of Proud Snow and obtain the Yellow Armor effect. Trace of Snow</font>: Casting skill becomes faster. Use the skill to get three stacks of Proud Snow. (Facing Wind and Snow must be used first.)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_hyjf07_1=Sprint to the selected area, knock down enemies within range and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to them. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Trace of Snow</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Charging and drawing back skill become faster. The target is knocked down for 1 more second.
