desc_wuji_CS_jh_liusha08_1=Slam target onto the ground for 5 seconds, and deal damage equivalent to 5% current HP per second (138 damage at most, can be affected by damage bonus).<br/>This skill is a stunt of <font color="#FFAE00">Cao Zhengqing</font>, known as the Hellhound of Longmen Inn. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Barren</font>: Reduces the internal defense of the target trapped in the earth by 20%.
