desc_wuji_CS_jh_liusha09_1=A small tornado sweeps the earth, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies directly in front of you and lifting them into the air. <br/>A wild gust swirls the sands as the setting sun bleeds into the sky. The fires of Longmen Inn never go out, such is power of that place, cunning and shifting like the sands. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Barren</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Upon hitting the unparried target, they will be lifted to the air.
