desc_wuji_CS_jl_zfd01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemy; <br>If target is under <font color="#FFAE00">Shock</font>, it takes additional Hard Damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ruthless</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Inflicts 1 stack of Ruthless to the unparried target upon hit. 3 stacks of Ruthless will disable the target's Flying Skills for 3 seconds.
