desc_wuji_CS_jy_dqd02_1=Your blade chops in line with your emotions, and its chi slashes to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Wind Rider</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Upon hitting the unparried target, it reduces their External Defense by 15% for 7 seconds.
