desc_wuji_CS_jy_dqd04_1=A ten-ton sweeping chop that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>If you break the enemy's parry, your enduring might will paralyze him. This means he will be unable to use any movements and will effectively be stunned. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Wind Rider</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Upon hit, Heartless Chi will not be removed from the target to increase damage. When you break the target's parry, Heartless Chi increases to full stacks.
