desc_wuji_CS_jy_yzq07_1=Stretch out arm and tear around enemies, deal {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When in air, can select area on the ground to use skill, knock down enemies in area and attach a same effect with <font color="#FFAE00">"Peck Eye and Scramble for Pearl"</font>. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Haunted</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. When using this skill on the ground, you paralyze the enemies nearby for 3 seconds.
