desc_wuji_CS_jz_lyfh04_1=Combine the sword and body, successful parry has a 25% chance to counter-stun: make enemy paralyzed for 5 seconds, can not move. <br>(counter-stun cooldown is 22 seconds) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Falling Dust</font>：Parrying grants a 25% chance to destabilize the target's lower body.
