desc_wuji_CS_jz_lyfh05_1=Charge skill, the colorful sword chi will lash target and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>This skill can bring down target in air, and paralyse target's legs, reduce movement speed and forbid use of flying skills. <br> (You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Falling Dust</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Charging distance of the skill increases to 20 meters.
