desc_wuji_CS_sl_djgq04_1=Feint body movement, tumble the enemy and inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to him;<br>If the enemy wants to parry, he will be tumbled even more fiercely. (Get extra hard damage.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Open Door</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Breaking Defense inflicts the target with Open Door: The target will be knocked down if they use a skill in 5 seconds. <br>This skill can be used in air.
