desc_wuji_CS_tm_jsc03_1=Increase movement speed by 30% for 15 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Illusory Escape</font>: Use the skill to get Burning Rage effect: Get 15 Rage, and then lose 15 Rage in 7 seconds. It has 15-second recovery time. When you use it again during this period, Burning Rage will grant you 5 Rage and then deduct 5 Rage. However, recovery time will not reset.
desc_wuji_CS_tm_jsc03_10=Increase movement speed by 50%. Attacks from the <font color="#FFAE00">Backfire</font> set will have added soft damage for 15 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Illusory Escape</font>: Use the skill to get Burning Rage effect: Get 15 Rage, and then lose 15 Rage in 7 seconds. It has 15-second recovery time. When you use it again during this period, Burning Rage will grant you 5 Rage and then deduct 5 Rage. However, recovery time will not reset.
