desc_wuji_CS_tm_jsc04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Attempts to block the skill will cause the target to be blown away and paralyzed (slowed by 30% for 8 seconds). <br><font color="#FF00FF">Illusory Escape</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Casting skill becomes faster. When paralyzed, the target's all Defenses reduce by 30%.
