desc_wuji_CS_wd_qfjf02_1=Gather chi move. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and grants <font color="#FFAE00">Muddle</font> to make them fall down. <br>Skill does not require channeling when used in the air, and has chances to knock target down. The stronger your <font color="#FFAE00">Breeze</font> is, the higher chances to knock target down. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flight</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. AOE move distance increases to 5 meters. When using it in air, you may interrupt it by using any skill in this set.
