desc_CS_gm_ynsxj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and grants you a 10-second<font color="#FFAE00"> Convey One’s Love </font>. Convey One’s Love: Grants you Yellow Super Armor when you cast <font color="#f9fc00">Bamboo Curtain By The Tarn</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Chess Under The Pines</font>. Convey One's Love will be removed the moment you get Yellow Super Armor.
