desc_CS_hs_hsjf01_1=A sweeping attack that deals {@0:伤害包} damage, and can <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> a target who has already fallen down. This skill can be quickly used again when it is evaded by your target. <br>For 10 seconds, targets cannot be thrown again by <font color="#f9fc00">Emerging Cloud</font>.
desc_CS_hs_hsjf01_10=Beach under running water unintentional, Baiyun Chuxiu this mood. Dunshen seated step, sword Hengqiao on front inflict {@0:伤害包} can be in the ground state of the enemy <font color="#f9fc00"> knock </font>. Moves can be used again after a dodge. <br> (hit the target after flying in 10 seconds and can not be <font color="#f9fc00"> [Baiyun Chuxiu] </font> knock again)
