desc_CS_hs_hsjf03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. <br>When you break a target's attack, you can clear the recovery time for <font color="#f9fc00">Soaring Aurora</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Soaring Sparrow</font>.
desc_CS_hs_hsjf03_10=When the rain First Clearing, hanging waterfall down days gentry. Twist the body break step, fencing down the road, in front of the enemy, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br> break the enemy parry, you can clear this routine moves <font color="#f9fc00"> [Bai consistent day] </font>, <font color="#f9fc00"> [Jinyan turned] </font> the return air time.
