desc_CS_hs_kfkj03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} to a target in front of you. If you hit a target who is not blocking 5 times, target will suffer from <font color="#FFAE00">High Wind</font>. In 3 seconds, he or she will <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 2 seconds.
