desc_CS_jh_ahlj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters; <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs it with <font color="#FFAE00">Chill </font> (Lasts five seconds) and makes it <font color="#FFAE00">Mystified</font>. <font color="#f9fc00">Chill Glimpse</font> will become an <font color="#FFAE00">Overt Move</font> if it hits enemy debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Chill </font>: Deals external attack damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Away</font> enemies who do not parry.
