desc_CS_jh_ahlj05_1=<br>Buffs with <font color="#FFAE00">Calm As A Summer Sea</font> (Lasts five seconds): When parrying enemy's attack, you can undo enemy's skill and strike it back. <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Improvement of skill level increases counter damage.)
