desc_CS_jh_ahlj07_1=Depletes 20% of current HP and activates <font color="#FFAE00">Frenzied Blood</font> (Lasts seven seconds): <br><font color="#f9fc00">Exterior Red Plum</font>: Resets Chi recovery; <br><font color="#f9fc00">Escaping Peach Branch</font>: Causes enemy to <font color="#f9fc00">Faint for one second</font>; <br>All skills give a 50% vampiric effect; <br>Player will get an extra two Rage when attacking or getting attacked.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf05_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you.<br>When player breaks enemy's parry, player receives 10 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>. <br>As movement speed increases, target receives more damage. <br>This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf05_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} to targets in thr front. <br>Upon parry break, gain 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>. <br>Skill damage increases with speed)<br>This set can only be used by castrated characters.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf05_11=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to a target in front of you. Successful break of target's defenses causes target unable to parry or use skills.
desc_CS_jh_bxjf05_12=Stab the wrist and break the arm, pressing forward towards the enemy, causing the following to enemies in front of player{@0:伤害包}: successful breakthrough of target's defenses causes target unable to parry or use skills.
