desc_CS_jh_chz05_1=Applies Shifting Stars to a target. within 12 seconds, whenever the target affected by Shifting Stars casts a skill, imitate the skill for 60 seconds. Able to imitate most skills. The imitated skill shares the same Cooldown with the original skill you've already learned. The imitated skill has no cross-skillset Cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_chz05_2=Applies Shifting Stars to a target. within 12 seconds, whenever the target affected by Shifting Stars casts a skill, imitate the skill for 70 seconds. Able to imitate most skills. The imitated skill shares the same Cooldown with the original skill you've already learned. The imitated skill has no cross-skillset Cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_chz05_3=Applies Shifting Stars to a target. within 12 seconds, whenever the target affected by Shifting Stars casts a skill, imitate the skill for 80 seconds. Able to imitate most skills. The imitated skill shares the same Cooldown with the original skill you've already learned. The imitated skill has no cross-skillset Cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_chz05_4=Applies Shifting Stars to a target. within 12 seconds, whenever the target affected by Shifting Stars casts a skill, imitate the skill for 90 seconds. Able to imitate most skills. The imitated skill shares the same Cooldown with the original skill you've already learned. The imitated skill has no cross-skillset Cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_chz05_5=Applies Shifting Stars to a target. within 12 seconds, whenever the target affected by Shifting Stars casts a skill, imitate the skill for 100 seconds. Able to imitate most skills. The imitated skill shares the same Cooldown with the original skill you've already learned. The imitated skill has no cross-skillset Cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_chz05_6=Applies Shifting Stars to a target. within 12 seconds, whenever the target affected by Shifting Stars casts a skill, imitate the skill for 120 seconds. Able to imitate most skills. The imitated skill shares the same Cooldown with the original skill you've already learned. The imitated skill has no cross-skillset Cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_cyjf02_1=Wield a sword to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy attempts to parry, the unity of your sword and will cause him to be hit with <font color="#FFAE00">Flame Sword Chi</font>. If you successfully break the enemy's block he will suffer damage if he attempts to use flying skills for a short period.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Han Sijin</font> often used this move to break enemy's parries.
