desc_CS_jh_cyjf04_1=The setting sun bleeds as the sword swings. Your sword's chi sweeps the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>If the enemy does not parry, he will be <font color="#FFAE00">Restrained</font>: If he uses flying skills he will suffer damage.<br>This move is one of the master skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhou Lifeng</font>.
