desc_CS_jh_dl01_1=A quick strike against enemies before you in a fan-shaped area of effect, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage. Enemies that attempt to parry will lose a set amount of inner energy, and your own extravasated blood will be restored according to the number of enemies who parry.<br>This move was often used by <font color="#FFAE00">Gu Song</font> at Phantoms' Mountain Manor.
desc_CS_jh_dl01_10=A quick strike against enemies before you in a fan-shaped area of effect, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage. Enemies that attempt to parry will lose a set amount of inner energy, and your own extravasated blood will be restored according to the number of enemies who parry.<br>This move was often used by <font color="#FFAE00">Gu Song</font> at Phantoms' Mountain Manor.
