desc_CS_jh_dl01_2=A swift hit. Deal {@0: damage bag} to targets ahead in a fan shaped area, Targets will lose their Energys when tring to block. You will recover your own HP depending on the number of targets trying to block. It is specially used by <br/>Phantoms' Mountain Manor's<font color="#FFAE00">Gu Song</font>.
