desc_CS_jh_dl03_1=Defense Posture. Curdle Spirit and Hold Chi.<br/>Every successful Parry adds 1 level of "<font color="#FFAE00">Chaotic Yuan</font>" Chi. (Superposing to Level 6 at the most, and last 20 seconds.) When "<font color="#FFAE00">Chaotic Yuan</font>" Chi ends or superposes to Level 6, the Unit that is affected will lose a certain amount of HP immediately. The higher the level of "<font color="#FFAE00">Chaotic Yuan</font>" Chi is, the more Damage there will be.<br/>Every successful Parry adds 1 level of "<font color="#FFAE00">Spirit-curdling</font>" State to itself. (Can superpose 4 times, and last 20 seconds.) Each level of State has 25 percent odds to blow away the Target while using Soul Dispelling Phantom Palm.<br/>A Unique Technique derived by <font color="#FFAE00">Gu Song</font> in Phantoms' Mountain Manor.
desc_CS_jh_dl03_10=A defensive move.<br>Every time you parry you add one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Earth Energy</font>, which is stackable up to six times. When <font color="#FFAE00">Earth Energy</font> wears off or is stacked six times, the target will lose a set amount of HP for 20 seconds.<br>Every time you parry you can add one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Focus</font>, which can be stacked a total of four times. Each stack has a 25% chance of sending the enemy flying if you use Soul Dispelling Phantom Palm. The effect lasts 20 seconds.<br>This master stroke was invented by <font color="#FFAE00">Gu Song</font> at Phantom's Mountain Manor.
desc_CS_jh_dl03_11=A defensive move.<br>Every time you parry you add one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Earth Energy</font>, which is stackable up to six times. When <font color="#FFAE00">Earth Energy</font> wears off or is stacked six times, the target will lose a set amount of HP for 20 seconds.<br>Every time you parry you can add one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Focus</font>, which can be stacked a total of four times. Each stack has a 25% chance of sending the enemy flying if you use Soul Dispelling Phantom Palm. The effect lasts 20 seconds.<br>This master stroke was invented by <font color="#FFAE00">Gu Song</font> at Phantom's Mountain Manor.
