desc_CS_jh_dl04_1=A strike as fearsome as a lion's roar, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage and having a 15% chance to frighten the enemy, rendering him unable to perform any movements.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)<br>This is one of the many skills of martial arts legend <font color="#FFAE00">Gao Tao</font>.
