desc_CS_jh_dl05_1=Push a powerful palm to enemies in front of you, and deal {@0: 伤害包}. If you are in <font color="#FFAE00">Focus Spirit</font>, then you may punch target away. <br/>It was the best skill of Thousand-Face Ghost Servant <font color="#FFAE00">Ximen Yu</font>.
