desc_CS_jh_dl07_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a single target in front of you. A gust sweeps up your opponent by the feet, and as long as he remains in the gust area, every two seconds the enemy will have one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Difficult Breathing</font> added to him for a maximum of 10 stacks. The enemy will ultimately suffer continuous damage as a result of this state for up to 20 seconds.<br/>Peacock Hall Leader <font color="#FFAE00">Ma Bian</font> was particularly skilled at this move and filled people with fear when he unleashed it.
