desc_CS_jh_hjdf01_hide_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>A successful break of target's parry causes <br>target unable to parry for 5 seconds and adds 3 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> and 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Hidden Blade"</font>, which lowers rage point consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Hidden Blades Everywhere"</font> by 5 points. Status lasts for 10 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf01_hide_10=The strong blade flexes gently to break through the falsehoods. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>a successful break through of target's parry causes <br>target unable to parry for 5 seconds and adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> and 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Hidden Blade"</font>, which lowers rage point consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Hidden Swords Everywhere"</font> by 5 points; status lasts for 10 seconds and can be stacked for 5 layers.
