desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_1=A successful parry leads player into the <font color="#FF3030">"A Finely Crafted Blade"</font>state, which adds <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to player for 1 second when player uses a skill. Energy use is halved for 2.5 seconds. <br>Effects of player state applies only to normal attacks of the same set.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Closed Doors Iron Fan"</font> cannot be used without first using this skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_10=On a successful parry, applies <font color="#FF3030">A Finely Crafted Blade</font> to yourself. A Finely Crafted Blade: grants 1 second of Yellow Armor to yourself when your next skill is cast. reduces the energy cost of your next skill by 50%. lasts 7 seconds. <br>The above-mentioned next skill can only be normal skills of this skill set)<br>Closed Door Iron Fan must be preceded with this parry skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_11=When you block an attack, you enter the <font color="#FF3030">A Finely Crafted Blade</font> state for 7.5 seconds. During this time, your next attack gives you <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> for 1 second, and you spend only half the energy you need for your skills. <br>This effect applies only towards skills from this skill set. <br>Before you block, you cannot use <font color="#f9fc00">Closed Door Iron Fan</font>.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_12=When you block an attack, you enter the <font color="#FF3030">A Finely Crafted Blade</font> state for 8 seconds. During this time, your next attack gives you <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> for 1 second, and you spend only half the energy you need for your skills. <br>This effect applies only towards skills from this skill set. <br>Before you block, you cannot use <font color="#f9fc00">Closed Door Iron Fan</font>.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_2=A successful parry leads player into the <font color="#FF3030">"A Finely Crafted Blade"</font>state, which adds <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to player for 1 second when player uses a skill. Energy use is halved for 3 seconds. <br>Effects of player state applies only to normal attacks of the same set.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Closed Doors Iron Fan"</font> cannot be used without first using this skill.
