desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_5=A successful parry leads player into the <font color="#FF3030">"A Finely Crafted Blade"</font>state, which adds <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to player for 1 second when player uses a skill. Energy use is halved for 4.5 seconds. <br>Effects of player state applies only to normal attacks of the same set.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Closed Doors Iron Fan"</font> cannot be used without first using this skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_6=A successful parry leads player into the <font color="#FF3030">"A Finely Crafted Blade"</font>state, which adds <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to player for 1 second when player uses a skill. Energy use is halved for 5 seconds. <br>Effects of player state applies only to normal attacks of the same set.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Closed Doors Iron Fan"</font> cannot be used without first using this skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_7=A successful parry leads player into the <font color="#FF3030">"A Finely Crafted Blade"</font>state, which adds <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to player for 1 second when player uses a skill. Energy use is halved for 5.5 seconds. <br>Effects of player state applies only to normal attacks of the same set.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Closed Doors Iron Fan"</font> cannot be used without first using this skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_8=A successful parry leads player into the <font color="#FF3030">"A Finely Crafted Blade"</font>state, which adds <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> to player for 1 second when player uses a skill. Energy use is halved for 6 seconds. <br>Effects of player state applies only to normal attacks of the same set.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Closed Doors Iron Fan"</font> cannot be used without first using this skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf03_9=On a successful parry, applies <font color="#FF3030">A Finely Crafted Blade</font> to yourself. A Finely Crafted Blade: grants 1 second of Yellow Armor to yourself when your next skill is cast. reduces the energy cost of your next skill by 50%. lasts 6.5 seconds. <br>The above-mentioned next skill can only be normal skills of this skill set)<br>Closed Door Iron Fan must be preceded with this parry skill.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf05_1=Feint attack.<br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Cloud Dragon"</font> changes to a ranged feint attack. <br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Yuanyang Chains"</font> changes to a charging feint attack. <br>The skill <font color="#f9fc00">"Entangle the Body and Soul"</font> changes to a charged overt attack. <br>Using any one of the transformed skills will remove the switch effect for the next skill; transformed skills has the same cooldown time as the original skills.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_hide_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>A successful break of target's parry <br>forbids target from parrying for 5 seconds and adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Hidden Blade"</font>, which lowers rage point consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Hidden Blades Everywhere"</font> by 5 points; status lasts for 10 seconds and can be stacked 5 times and deals additional damage based on the number of stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 stacked effect. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_hide_10=The chain steps are forceful and aggressive. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>a successful breakthrough of target's parry <br>forbids target from parrying for 5 seconds and adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Hidden Blade"</font>, which lowers rage point consumption of <font color="#f9fc00">"Hidden Swords Everywhere"</font> by 5 points; status lasts for 10 seconds and can be layered 5 times and deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
desc_CS_jh_hjdf06_hide_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>A successful break of target's parry forbids target from parrying for 5 seconds and adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Blade</font>, which lowers rage point cost of <font color="#f9fc00">Hidden Blades Everywhere</font> by 5 points; status lasts for 10 seconds and can be stacked 5 times and deals additional damage based on the number of stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Slow Force</font> on player. Every successful hit removes 1 stacked effect. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
