desc_CS_jh_jhdf07_10=Create a barrier to absorb some damage received. If the barrier is not broken after certain amount of damage absorbed, the user will enter Furious State.<br>Furious State: Increases the damage of all skills in this set by 50% and decreases Defense by 100% for 10 seconds.
