desc_CS_jh_jhdf08_1=Blades spin around you, causing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets.
desc_CS_jh_jhdf08_10=Ever-shifting blade, circling around rapidly. Cause {@0:伤害包} damage to target within range. <br>Blade spins around you, causing continuous damage to nearby targets. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Ma Jier</font> always uses this Move to torture prisoners.
