desc_CS_jh_jsjf07_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Siege of the Snakes"</font>: Can absorb 40% of jury. It can be broken if under 5 continuous attacks. <br>If the status remains unbroken, it will return all injuries previously absorbed to the nearby enemies. Attack with this skill again within 3 seconds (or immediately after the status ends without interference), and cause the enemies to be <font color="#f9fc00">dazed</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jsjf07_2=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">"Siege of the Snakes"</font>: Can absorb 45% of jury. It can be broken if under 5 continuous attacks. <br>If the status remains unbroken, it will return all injuries previously absorbed to the nearby enemies. Attack with this skill again within 3 seconds (or immediately after the status ends without interference), and cause the enemies to be <font color="#f9fc00">dazed</font> for 3 seconds.
