desc_CS_jh_jzbf01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>At the same time adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"No Attack"</font> to target, whose the next attack is reduced by 99%. Each attack removes 1 stacked effect for 5 seconds.<br>Damage reduction only works with players.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf01_10=Those who have strong backing are secure and unafraid, those who have nothing to rely cannot attack. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>at the same time adds 4 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Cannot Attack"</font> (damage for the next attack is reduced by 99%, every blow reduces 1 layer, lasts for 5 seconds) to target.  <br>(Reduces damage, only effective on players)
desc_CS_jh_jzbf01_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>At the same time adds 4 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">No Attack</font> to target: the next attack is reduced by 99%. Each attack removes 1 stacked effect for 5 seconds. <br>Damage reduction only works on players.
