desc_CS_jh_jzbf02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Can cause a large amount of damage (great chance of critical hit) to targets with<font color="#FFAE00">"No Attack"</font>, and then removes the <font color="#FFAE00">No Attack</font> status. <br>Raising skill level can increase critical hit damage.<br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf02_10=The one who excels at surprise leaves the camp and strikes. Causes in tread target{@0:伤害包}; <br>can cause a large amount of damage (great chance of critical hit) to targets with<font color="#FFAE00">"Cannot Attack"</font>, and then removes the <font color="#FFAE00">Cannot Attack</font> status.  <br>(Raising skill level can increase critical hit damage) <br>(Can use flying skills with this skill to quickly approach your opponent)
