desc_CS_jh_jzbf03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>if target has <font color="#FFAE00">"No Attack"</font>, parrying this move will cause concussion and additional damage to target. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf03_10=One who suggests and presides over all can decide all with one battle. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>if target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Cannot Attack"</font>, parrying this move will cause concussion and additional damage in target.  <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
