desc_CS_jh_jzbf04_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Strategy"</font> to player. If attacked, attacker will have skills disabled for 2 seconds at end of attack. Lasts 7 seconds. <br>1 second reduction in skill cooldown for every increase in skill level.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf04_2=To seek to defeat the enemy, one must strengthen oneself. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Strategy"</font> to player. If attacked, attacker will have Skills Sealed for 2 seconds at end of attack. Lasts 7 seconds.  <br>(1 second reduction in skill cooldown for every increase in skill level)
