desc_CS_jh_jzbf05_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Speed Fight"</font> to player: <br>increases the charge speed and charge distance for <font color="#f9fc00">"Surprise Attack" and </font><font color="#f9fc00">"Decisive Battle"</font>. <br>Increases movement speed by 50%. Increases damage done by skills by 50%. Lasts 10 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Speed Fight</font> After Speed Fight status ends, player enters <font color="#FF3030">"Exhausted"</font> status. Movement speed is decreased, takes additional damage from attacks (parries can negate extra damage), debuff lasts for 10 seconds. <br>Increasing skill level can reduce the negative effects of Exhausted.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf05_2=The fast will survive and those who are not will perish. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Quick Battle"</font> to player: <br>increases the charge speed and charge distance for <font color="#f9fc00">"Surprise Attack" and </font><font color="#f9fc00">"Decisive Battle"</font>. <br>Increases movement speed by 50%. Increases damage done by set moves by 50%. Lasts 10 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Battle</font> After Quick Battle status ends, player enters <font color="#FF3030">"Exhausted"</font> status. Movement speed is decreased, takes additional damage from attacks (parries can negate extra damage), debuff lasts for 10 seconds.  <br>(increasing skill level can reduce the negative effects of Exhausted)
desc_CS_jh_jzbf05_3=The fast will survive and those who are not will perish. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Quick Battle"</font> to player: <br>increases the charge speed and charge distance for <font color="#f9fc00">"Surprise Attack" and </font><font color="#f9fc00">"Decisive Battle"</font>. <br>Increases movement speed by 50%. Increases damage done by set moves by 50%. Lasts 10 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Battle</font> After Quick Battle status ends, player enters <font color="#FF3030">"Exhausted"</font> status. Movement speed is decreased, takes additional damage from attacks (parries can negate extra damage), debuff lasts for 10 seconds.  <br>(increasing skill level can reduce the negative effects of Exhausted)
