desc_CS_jh_jzbf05_8=The fast will survive and those who are not will perish. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Quick Battle"</font> to player: <br>increases the charge speed and charge distance for <font color="#f9fc00">"Surprise Attack" and </font><font color="#f9fc00">"Decisive Battle"</font>. <br>Increases movement speed by 50%. Increases damage done by set moves by 50%. Lasts 10 seconds.  <br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Battle</font> After Quick Battle status ends, player enters <font color="#FF3030">"Exhausted"</font> status. Movement speed is decreased, takes additional damage from attacks (parries can negate extra damage), debuff lasts for 10 seconds.  <br>(increasing skill level can reduce the negative effects of Exhausted)
desc_CS_jh_jzbf07_1=Use <font color="#FFAE00">"Counter"</font> and player may dismantle enemy skills and perform a counterattack when attacked by enemies for 5 seconds. <br>A successful counterattack when under <font color="#FFAE00">"Strategy"</font> makes target paralyzed for 4 seconds. <br>Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by a feint attack. Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf07_10=What seems real is fake and what seems fake is real, will cause player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Shift from Defense to Attack"</font> and player may dismantle enemy skills and perform a counterattack when attacked by enemies, lasts for 5 seconds.  <br>A successful counterattack when under <font color="#FFAE00">"Strategy"</font> makes target paralyzed for 4 seconds.  <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move.  increased effectiveness of skill increases damage done by counterattack)
desc_CS_jh_jzbf07_11=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font>: If you get hit when parrying, you can undo attacker's current skill and strike back. The effect lasts five seconds.   <br>A successful counterattack under <font color="#FFAE00">Strategy</font> makes target paralyzed for 4 seconds.   <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Improvement of skill level increases counter damage.)
