desc_CS_jh_jzbf08_1=Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: <br>knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field executes, causing enemies to become stunned for 0.5 seconds. <br>Causes damage over time to enemies within the aura field (the closer the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). <br>If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become stunned for 3 seconds. <br>The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds. <br>Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_CS_jh_jzbf08_10=The square is Yang, and the circle is Yin. Yin and Yang echo nature, the harmony of heaven and earth. Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: <br>knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field launches, causing enemies to become Stunned for 2 seconds; <br>causes continuous damage to enemies within the aura field (the close the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). <br>If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become Stunned for 3 seconds.  <br>The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds.  <br>(Increased skill effectiveness increases damage done by the Radius Aura Field)
desc_CS_jh_jzbf08_11=Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field launches, causing enemies to become stunned for 2 seconds; causes continuous damage to enemies within the aura field (the closer the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become stunned for 3 seconds. The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds. <br>(Increased skill effectiveness increases damage done by the Radius Aura Field.)
