desc_CS_jh_kfdf05_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Unstoppable Wind"</font> to player for 10 seconds, during which player may attack the same target with <br><font color="#f9fc00">"Shadow Leaves No Trace"</font>. Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">"Onset of Storm"</font>.<br>Removes common cooldown for skills within the set. <br>Greatly increases player movement speed, immune to being slowed and paralysis debuffs. <br>Duration of status is refreshed when player seriously wounds target. Only effective with players.
desc_CS_jh_kfdf05_10=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Unstoppable Wind"</font> to player for 19 seconds, during which player may attack the same target with <br><font color="#f9fc00">"Shadow Leaves No Trace"</font>. Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using <font color="#f9fc00">"Onset of Storm"</font>.<br>Removes common cooldown for skills within the set. <br>Greatly increases player speed, immune to being slowed and paralysis debuffs. <br>Duration of status is refreshed when player seriously wounds target. Only effective in PvP.
