desc_CS_jh_liusha07_1=Strike at the enemy's parry from an unexpected angle to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, causing the enemy to lose focus and hallucinate. This attack also causes the enemy to injure himself.<br/>This movement is one of the vicious methods of <font color="#FFAE00">Lu Xiaojiang</font>.
