desc_CS_jh_llt03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> when the number rolled is "small", the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">disable Flying skills</font> for 3 seconds.<br>When the number rolled is "big", the attack will cause <font color="#f9fc00">50% deceleration</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_llt03_10=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the number rolled is small, the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">disable skills</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> for 5 seconds.<br>When the number rolled is big, the attack will cause <font color="#f9fc00">50% deceleration</font> and <font color="#f9fc00"> significant reduction of accuracy</font> for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_llt03_11=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the number rolled is small, the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">disable skills</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> regardless of the target's parry for 5 seconds.<br>When the number rolled is big, the attack will cause <font color="#f9fc00">50% deceleration</font> and <font color="#f9fc00"> significant reduction of accuracy</font> regardless of the target's parry for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_llt03_12=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> When the number rolled is small, the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">disable skills</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> regardless of the target's parry for 5 seconds.<br>When the number rolled is big, the attack will cause <font color="#f9fc00">50% deceleration</font> and <font color="#f9fc00"> significant reduction of accuracy</font> regardless of the target's parry for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_llt03_2=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage.<br> when the number rolled is "small", the attack will <font color="#f9fc00">disable Flying skills</font> for 3 seconds.<br>When the number rolled is "big", the attack will cause <font color="#f9fc00">50% deceleration</font> for 3 seconds.
