desc_CS_jh_llt05_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target by 5 m.
desc_CS_jh_llt05_10=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the target by 5 m. <br>When the number rolled is in multiples of 3, twice as much injury will be caused to the target in addition to the original injury.
