desc_CS_jh_mlyqj03_f_1=Flying Petals Sword, Disordered Greeting: Targets in front receive {@0:damage packet}; <br>Countering a target's parry inflicts them with<font color="#FFAE00">Sudden Meeting After the Rain</font>: Energy drained for 6 seconds when target uses a skill.
