desc_CS_jh_plbz03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>on hitting an enemy (ignore parry), applies <font color="#FFAE00">Cold and Hot Hit</font> to it: <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzes it and disables its use of skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br>If you are affected by <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>, within 2 seconds, you can use a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to cast this skill once again.
