desc_CS_jh_plbz04_1=Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Active and Passive</font> to yourself: lasts 6 seconds. while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies a second of <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> to enemies around you.
desc_CS_jh_plbz04_2=Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Active and Passive</font> to yourself: lasts 8 seconds. while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies a second of <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> to enemies around you.
desc_CS_jh_plbz04_3=Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Active and Passive</font> to yourself: lasts 10 seconds. while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies a second of <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> to enemies around you.
desc_CS_jh_plbz04_4=Applies <font color="#FFAE00">Active and Passive</font> to yourself: lasts 12 seconds. while either <font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active for this skill set, applies a second of <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> to enemies around you.
desc_CS_jh_plbz06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>On breaking an enemy's parry, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Light and Dark</font> to it: lowers Accuracy by 70%, lasts for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font>: anytime while activating this skill, this skill can be immediately replaced by the use of <font color="#f9fc00">Overt and Feint or Big and Small</font> , and grants a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to yourself.
desc_CS_jh_plbz06_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>On breaking an enemy's Parry, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Bright/Shadowy</font> to it: lowers Accuracy by 70%, lasts for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Up Where Feint Ends</font>: anytime in the middle of the skillcasting of this skill, this skill can be immediately replaced by the use of <font color="#f9fc00">Feint/Overt Hit or Big/Small Hit</font> , and grants a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to yourself.
desc_CS_jh_plbz06_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>On breaking an enemy's parry, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Light and Dark</font> to it: lowers Accuracy by 70%, lasts for 6 seconds. <br><font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font>: Anytime while activating this skill, this skill can be immediately replaced by the use of <font color="#f9fc00">Overt and Feint or Big and Small</font> , and grants a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to yourself.
