desc_CS_jh_plbz07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Where Overt Ends</font>: anytime while activating this skill, this skill can be immediately replaced by the use of <font color="#f9fc00">Light and Dark</font>, and grants a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to yourself. <br> This skill can be preceded with a Flying skill for quick approach.
desc_CS_jh_plbz07_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage; <br><font color="#FF3030">Feint Follows Up Where Overt Ends</font>: anytime in the middle of the skillcasting of this skill, this skill can be immediately replaced by the use of <font color="#f9fc00">Bright/Shadowy Hit</font>, and grants a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to yourself. <br> (This skill can be preceded with a Flying Skill for quick approach)
desc_CS_jh_plbz07_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br><font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font>: Anytime while activating this skill, this skill can be immediately replaced by the use of <font color="#f9fc00">Light and Dark</font>, and grants a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> to yourself.  <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
