desc_CS_jh_qyzf04_1=The five elements converge at the enemy's head, and his defenses vanish, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage. This movement increases you movement speed;<br>If the enemy does not parry in time, his meridians will be affected. Movement speed will be increased, but he will suffer continued damage.<br>This movement is one of the master skills of <font color="#FFAE00">Tian Feng</font> of Green Cloud Fortress.
