desc_CS_jh_tslyz01_5=Focuses Chi in the palm of the hand. Shoots Life and Death Rune into the enemy. The Life and Death Rune causes the target to lose their Energy continuously. If the Life and Death Rune is not resolved within a limited time, it will erupt in the body, causing the target to take more serious damage.
desc_CS_jh_tslyz02_1=Focuses Chi in both hands. The energy hits the main acupoints of the body, which can eliminate the target's debuffs. If the target is hit by Life and Death Rune, it will dissolve the internal power of Life and Death Rune to heal the target.
