desc_CS_jh_wlbgg07_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
desc_CS_jh_wlbgg07_10=Dragon is launched like an arrow, rapid-fire lurking spear with advancing steps: This causes the target to{@0:伤害包}. <br>(This strike allows use of Flying Skill to close in on opponent rapidly)
