desc_CS_jh_xlsbz03_1=Parrying grants 20% chance to remove Three of the target's buffs. 30 second cooldown.
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz03_10=<font color="#9932CD">Citing the I Ching Book of Changes: When a dragon is at rest, power rests in its full potential.</font><br>Parrying grants a chance to clear the target of 6 buffs, while gaining immunity from certain buffs for 3 seconds. Active for 30 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz03_11=<font color="#9932CD">Citing the I Ching Book of Changes: When a dragon is at rest, power rests in its full potential.</font><br>Parrying grants a chance to clear the target of 6 buffs, while gaining immunity from certain buffs for 4 seconds. Active for 30 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz03_12=<font color="#9932CD">Citing the I Ching Book of Changes: When a dragon is at rest, power rests in its full potential.</font><br>Parrying grants a chance to clear the target of 6 buffs, while gaining immunity from certain buffs for 5 seconds. Active for 30 seconds.
