desc_CS_jh_xlsbz15_1=Stuns the enemies within 8 meters and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to them. <br>This skill activates <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>.
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz15_10=<font color="#9932CD"></font><br>Tagrtes within 8 meters will be inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Fainted</font> and dealt {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>The first and last hits of this skill can bypass the target's parry and if in range they will be<font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font><br>Landing the attack grants <font color="#FFAE00">Power of the Descending Dragon</font> status: External damage received is reduced by 15%, internal strength damage reduced by 15%, chance to ignore a parry increased by 15%. Active for 6 seconds.<br> (Skill grants <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> status.)
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz15_11=<font color="#9932CD">The Classic of Changes. Earth Hexagrams. </font><br>Shocks enemies 8 meters nearby to make them <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>The first and last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">Launch</font> enemies whether they are parrying or not. <br>Get yourself <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Subduing Power</font> state: Increases Internal and External Attack Damage Reduction Ignore by 15%. Increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 15%. <br>(Get yourself <font color="#FF3030">Strong SuperArmor</font> while casting)
