desc_CS_jh_xlsbz18_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">throws</font> them. When using this skill, your Stiffness, Knocked Back, Knocked Down or Thrown effect can be cleared. This skill activates Yellow Armor.
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz18_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">throws</font> them.<br> (When using this skill Slowed, Disable Flying Skills, Paralyze, Disarm, Skill Disabled, Fainted, Knock Back, Knocked down will be cleared, though executing this skill while airborne will end it. Skill also grants <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status)
desc_CS_jh_xlsbz18_11=<font color="#9932CD">The Classic of Changes. Moving Hexagrams. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> them whether they are parrying or not. <br>(Can be cast under Slowed, Forbidden Flying Skills, Paralyzed, Disarmed, Stunned, Stiffness, Knocked Back, Knocked Down, Launched up. Remove corresponding debuff. Get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting)
