desc_CS_jy_dqd01_1=Brutal and heartless, your chi sweeps enemies in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>If you have studied <font color="#FFAE00">Merciless World</font>, it will enhance this move by adding <font color="#FFAE00">Emotion Breaking Blade</font> blade Energy to it. Every time you use other Emotion Breaking Blade movements, they will trigger the effect for added damage.
