desc_CS_single_rfyss_1=A mainstay of ninjas in the Eastern Seas, this skill allows you to clear Hatred and fade from sight and clear for 4 seconds, or until you are either attacking or under attack.
desc_CS_single_rfyss_2=A mainstay of ninjas in the Eastern Seas, this skill allows you to clear Hatred and fade from sight and clear for 7 seconds, or until you are either attacking or under attack.
desc_CS_single_rfyss_3=A mainstay of ninjas in the Eastern Seas, this skill allows you to clear Hatred and fade from sight and clear for 10 seconds, or until you are either attacking or under attack.
desc_CS_sl_lhq05_1=Use <font color="#FFAE00">"Pick Flower"</font> to enhance your "Arhat Fist" skills.<br> When you execute <font color="#FFAE00">"Wild Horse Chases the Wind"</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">"Three Hook Combo Punch"</font>, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Divert"</font> effect, increasing External Attack Damage. This effect can be stacked.<br>Parrying will grant you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked.
desc_CS_sl_lhq05_2=Use <font color="#FFAE00">"Pick Flower"</font> to enhance your "Arhat Fist" skills.<br> When you execute <font color="#FFAE00">"Wild Horse Chases the Wind"</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">"Three Hook Combo Punch"</font>, you gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Divert"</font> effect, increasing the External Attack Damage. This effect can be stacked.<br>Successful parry will grant you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing the Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked.
