desc_CS_th_bhcs05_1=Adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Roaring Wind</font> status to player. <br>Successful parry adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Winds"</font> status: movement speed increases by 5%. Can be stacked 10 times. Lasts 15 seconds.
desc_CS_th_bhcs05_10=Adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Roaring Wind</font> status to player. <br>Successful parry adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Winds"</font> status: speed increases by 5%. Can be stacked 10 times. Lasts 33 seconds.
desc_CS_th_bhcs05_11=Play a musical note to gain <font color="#FFAE00">Roaring Wind</font>. <br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Winds</font>effect, which increases your speed by 5% for 35 seconds. This effect can be stacked 10 times.
desc_CS_th_bhcs05_12=Play a musical note to gain <font color="#FFAE00">Roaring Wind</font>. <br>When you block an attack, you receive the <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Winds</font>effect, which increases your speed by 5% for 37 seconds. This effect can be stacked 10 times.
