desc_CS_th_bhcs08_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Still Waters"</font> to self: recovers Energy over time for player and nearby allies. Lasts 5 seconds. <br>If the melody is <font color="#9932CD">Do Do Do</font>, charging the skill causes additional damage. <br>If the melody is <font color="#9932CD">Fa So Do</font>, the skill inflicts damage to nearby targets, and player gains <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use. <br>If the melody is <font color="#9932CD">Mi Re So</font>, the skill inflicts extra damage and can  approach target quickly using Flying skills.
desc_CS_th_bhcs08_10=The song plays and the eagle flies, and the demons lose heart. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Water Mirror"</font> to self: continuous recovery of energy for player and surrounding teammates. Lasts 5 seconds.  <br>If the melody is <font color="#9932CD">Gong, Gong, Gon</font>, the move gains the additional effects: charge causes damage in target. <br>If the harmony is <font color="#9932CD">Zhi, Yu, Shang</font>, the move gains the additional effects: causes damage in surrounding targets, and gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using skill. <br>If the harmony is <font color="#9932CD">Jie, Shang, Yu</font>, the move gains the additional effects: causes damage in target and can approach target quickly using flying skills.
