desc_Newworld_xiyu_xixia_4_004_1=Wields blade to strike the ground and knocks down around enemies. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Costs 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> and grants Super Armor status to this move.
desc_Npc_gm_ynsxj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and grants you a 10-second<font color="#FFAE00"> Convey One’s Love </font>. Convey One’s Love: Grants you Yellow Super Armor when you cast <font color="#f9fc00">Bamboo Curtain By The Tarn</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Chess Under The Pines</font>. Convey One's Love will be removed the moment you get Yellow Super Armor.
