desc_Npc_jh_ahlj02_1=<font color="#FFAE00">Charge</font> forward (Skill cannot be used in the air) and knock away the enemies in your path, causing them to <font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for 2 seconds, and then dealing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Using <font color="#f9fc00">Kirin's Fury</font> will reset the cooldown time.
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj02_10=The spring cannot be locked in a yard because a red plum branch leaning over the wall. <font color="#FFAE00">Charge</font> forward (this move cannot be used in mid-air) and knock back enemies on the way, making them <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for two seconds and dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.  <br><font color="#f9fc00">Kirin's Fury</font> resets cooldown time.
