desc_Npc_jh_ahlj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters.<br>When <font color="#FFAE00">“Blood Crazed</font> is activated, your attacks will cause the target to <font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj03_10=Escaping. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters; <br>When buffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Frenzied Blood</font>, your hit causes enemy to <font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for one second.
