desc_Npc_jh_ahlj04_1=This skill varies between being overt and feint. Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 5 meters. <br>If the target's parry is broken, they will be debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font> for 5 seconds and <font color="#FFAE00">stupified</font>. <font color="#f9fc00">Shock of Winter</font> will convert to an<font color="#FFAE00">Overt Move</font> if the target is currently debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Shocked</font>: Deals damage and targets that fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj04_10=The skill sometimes overt, sometimes feint. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters; <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs it with <font color="#FFAE00">Chill </font> (lasts five seconds) and makes it <font color="#FFAE00">Mystified</font>. <font color="#f9fc00">Shock of Winter</font> will become an <font color="#FFAE00">Overt Move</font> if it hits enemy debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Chill </font>: Deals external attack damage and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks away</font> enemies who do not parry.
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj04_2=The skill sometimes overt, sometimes feint. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within five meters; <br>If enemy's parry is broken, debuffs it with <font color="#FFAE00">Chill </font> (lasts five seconds) and makes it <font color="#FFAE00">Mystified</font>. <font color="#f9fc00">Shock of Winter</font> will become an <font color="#FFAE00">Overt Move</font> if it hits enemy debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Chill </font>: Deals external attack damage and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks away</font> enemies who do not parry.
