desc_Npc_jh_ahlj05_1=Three feet of ice is not formed in a day.<br>Buffs with <font color="#FFAE00">Clear as Ice and No Fear for Falling Sky</font>: Parrying a target's attack can negate their skill and then counterattackk. (Active for 5 seconds) <br>(6 meter range. Does not effect those with Super Armor and can be overcome witha feint. Stacking will increase the counterattack damage)
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj05_10=The three feet thick ice is not formed in one day. <br>Buffs with <font color="#FFAE00">Calm As A Summer Sea</font> (Lasts five seconds): When parrying enemy's attack, you can undo enemy's skill and strike it back.  <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Improvement of skill level increases counter damage.)
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj05_2=The three feet thick ice is not formed in one day. <br>Buffs with <font color="#FFAE00">Calm As A Summer Sea</font> (Lasts five seconds): When parrying enemy's attack, you can undo enemy's skill and strike it back.  <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Improvement of skill level increases counter damage.)
desc_Npc_jh_ahlj05_3=The three feet thick ice is not formed in one day. <br>Buffs with <font color="#FFAE00">Calm As A Summer Sea</font> (Lasts five seconds): When parrying enemy's attack, you can undo enemy's skill and strike it back.  <br>(Counterattack: With a 6-meter range, ineffective to Super Armor and subdued to a Feint. Improvement of skill level increases counter damage.)
