desc_Npc_jh_ahlj07_1=Removes 20% of your existing HP and activates <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Crazed</font> (Active for 7 seconds)：<br><font color="#f9fc00">Apricots from the Walled Orchard</font>：Resets Chi recovery<br><font color="#f9fc00">Tender Cherry Branches</font>: Causes the target to<font color="#f9fc00">Faint</font> for 1 second. <br>All skills will receive a 50% vampiric effect.<br>You will also receive two additional Rage points when attacking or being attacked.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>When you break enemy's parry, you receive 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>. <br>As attack speed increases, target receives more damage. <br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf05_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. When you break enemy's parry, you receive maximum amount of Evil Influence stacks.
desc_Npc_jh_bxjf05_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. When you break enemy's parry, enemy is unable to parry or use skills.
