desc_Npc_jh_bxjf05_2=Stab the wrist and break the arm, pressing forward towards the enemy, causing the following to enemies in front of player{@0:伤害包}: <br>when player breaks through enemy's parry, player receives 10 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Evil Influence"</font>.  <br>(Damage done increases with increase in player's movement speed) <br>(This set can only be used by players who have been castrated)
