desc_Npc_jh_jzbf01_4=Those who have strong backing are secure and unafraid, those who have nothing to rely cannot attack. Causes in target{@0:伤害包}; <br>at the same time adds 2 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Cannot Attack"</font> (damage for the next attack is reduced by 99%, every blow reduces 1 layer, lasts for 5 seconds) to target.  <br>(Reduces damage, only effective on players)
