desc_Npc_jh_jzbf03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>if target has <font color="#FFAE00">"No Attack"</font>, parrying this move will cause concussion and additional damage to target. <br>This attack allows use of Flying Skill to approach target quickly.
