desc_Npc_jh_jzbf07_5=What seems real is fake and what seems fake is real, will cause player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Shift from Defense to Attack"</font> and player may dismantle enemy skills and perform a counterattack when attacked by enemies, lasts for 5 seconds.  <br>A successful counterattack when under <font color="#FFAE00">"Strategy"</font> makes target paralyzed for 4 seconds.  <br>(Counterattack with an effective range of 6m. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by Feint Move.  increased effectiveness of skill increases damage done by counterattack)
