desc_Npc_jh_jzbf08_1=Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: <br>knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field executes, causing enemies to become stunned for 0.5 seconds. <br>Causes damage over time to enemies within the aura field (the closer the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). <br>If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become stunned for 3 seconds. <br>The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds. <br>Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_Npc_jh_jzbf08_2=The square is Yang, and the circle is Yin. Yin and Yang echo nature, the harmony of heaven and earth. Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: <br>knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field launches, causing enemies to become Stunned for 0.5 seconds; <br>causes continuous damage to enemies within the aura field (the closer the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). <br>If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become Stunned for 3 seconds.  <br>The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds.  <br>(Increased skill effectiveness increases damage done by the Radius Aura Field)
desc_Npc_jh_jzbf08_3=Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: <br>knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field executes, causing enemies to become stunned for 1 seconds. <br>Causes damage over time to enemies within the aura field (the close the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). <br>If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become stunned for 3 seconds. <br>The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds. <br>Damage increases with greater skill proficiency.
desc_Npc_jh_jzbf08_4=The square is Yang, and the circle is Yin. Yin and Yang echo nature, the harmony of heaven and earth. Concentrate Chi to form the <font color="#FF3030">Radius Aura Field</font>: <br>knocks back all enemies within an 8-meter radius when aura field launches, causing enemies to become Stunned for 1 seconds; <br>causes continuous damage to enemies within the aura field (the close the enemy is to the center of the aura field, the higher the damage inflicted). <br>If enemy tries to leave the aura field, enemy will suffer a large amount of damage and become Stunned for 3 seconds.  <br>The Radius Aura Field can last for 5 seconds.  <br>(Increased skill effectiveness increases damage done by the Radius Aura Field)
