desc_Npc_jh_plbz02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the  target. <br><font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font>: Atctivation of the skill can be cancelled  with <font color="#f9fc00">Light and Dark</font>, granting 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>.<br> (This skill can be sued to Evade quickly approaching enemies)
desc_Npc_jh_plbz02_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br><font color="#FF3030">Interrupt Overt and Start Feint</font>: When activating this skill you can interrupt is by using <font color="#f9fc00">Light and Dark</font>, and gain a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> state.  <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
