desc_Npc_jh_plbz03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>Landing hits on the target while bypassing their parry will inflict them with <font color="#FFAE00">Cold and Hot</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed and Skills Disabled</font> for 3 seconds.<br>If you are under <font color="#FF3030">Break</font> status, you can cast this skill again within 2 seconds by spending a stack of <font color="#FF3030">Break</font>.
