desc_Npc_jh_plbz04_4=Activates <font color="#FFAE00">Active and Passive</font> status for 12 seconds. While either <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Overt Follows Where Feint Ends</font> is active with this skill set, surrounding targets are inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Strike Acupoint</font> for 1 second.
