desc_Npc_jh_qzjf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets directly in front of you. If you hit a target(Must be a player), the cooldown time for <font color="#f9fc00">Dance of Three Blossoms</font> will be reduced by 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_qzjf01_10=The opening plum blossoms look like snow in winter. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front of you. If hit any enemy (must be player) will reduce 2 second cooldown time of <font color="#f9fc00">Plum Blossom In Three Movements</font>.
