desc_Npc_jh_qzjf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to up to 5 targets within the selected are and will <font color="#f9fc00">Throw</font> them. Using the skill will also grant <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> and return you to your original position.
desc_Npc_jh_qzjf03_10=In the deep of fog and mist is a watery river. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to up to five enemies in a selected area and <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> them. Become <font color="#f9fc00">Red Armor</font> when using the skill and return to the original position after the attack.
