desc_Npc_jz_yxjf05_1=When you successfully parry, you will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Voiceless</font> state: This state can be stacked up to 15 times, at which point you can cancel the <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Spear and Jade Vibration</font> cooldown period. It can be cleared every 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf05_2=When you successfully parry, you will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Voiceless</font> state: This state can be stacked up to 12 times, at which point you can cancel the <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Spear and Jade Vibration</font> cooldown period. It can be cleared every 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf05_3=When you successfully parry, you will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Voiceless</font> state: This state can be stacked up to 10 times, at which point you can cancel the <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Spear and Jade Vibration</font> cooldown period. It can be cleared every 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf05_4=When you successfully parry, you will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Voiceless</font> state: This state can be stacked up to 8 times, at which point you can cancel the <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Spear and Jade Vibration</font> cooldown period. It can be cleared every 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf05_5=When you successfully parry, you will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Voiceless</font> state: This state can be stacked up to 8 times, at which point you can cancel the <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Spear and Jade Vibration</font> cooldown period. It can be cleared every 13 seconds.
desc_Npc_jz_yxjf05_6=When you successfully parry, you will gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Voiceless</font> state: This state can be stacked up to 8 times, at which point you can cancel the <font color="#FFAE00">Golden Spear and Jade Vibration</font> cooldown period. It can be cleared every 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_th_bhcs05_1=Adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Roaring Wind</font> status to player. <br>Successful parry adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Winds"</font> status: movement speed increases by 5%. Can be stacked 10 times. Lasts 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_th_bhcs05_2=Adds the <font color="#FFAE00">Roaring Wind</font> status to player. <br>Successful parry adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Winds"</font> status: movement speed increases by 5%. Can be stacked 10 times. Lasts 17 seconds.
