desc_Npc_th_bhcs08_hide01_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Still Waters"</font> to self. Recovers Energy over time for player and nearby allies. Lasts 5 seconds. <br>Gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when skill is in use.<br> Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
