desc_Npc_th_bhcs08_hide03_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Longest charge time is 5 seconds. The longer the charge time, the higher the damage. <br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Still Waters"</font> to self: recovers Energy over time for player and nearby allies. Lasts 5 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
