desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and grants you a 10-second<font color="#FFAE00"> Convey One’s Love </font>. Convey One’s Love: Grants you Yellow Super Armor when you cast <font color="#f9fc00">Bamboo Curtain By The Tarn</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Chess Under The Pines</font>. Convey One's Love will be removed the moment you get Yellow Super Armor.
desc_gmp_hd_ynsxj06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If enemy parry is destroyed, applies<font color="#FFAE00"> Chatter By The Window</font> to the enemy: Causes the enemy to be unable to parry for 5 seconds.
