desc_skill_hsp_yzx_01_1=The great ambition there, sail sea. Stitch cut left and right, in front of the enemy, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br> break the enemy parry, it can not ward off within 5 seconds, was present during the attack routine moves every 1 second hit reduces the attack moves back air time.
desc_skill_hsp_yzx_02_1=Stormy, dark deep fog. Lunge rapier, Douwan mad stab of front inflict {@0:伤害包}. No parry enemy hit five times, will make it seriously <font color="#FFAE00"> "blast" </font> internal injuries, internal injuries after the attack three seconds into the <font color="#f9fc00"> unconscious </font> 2 seconds.
desc_skill_ssg_charge=Divine Water Palace disciples can transfer and store their life force in liquid form, as Divine Water.
desc_skill_ssg_charge_1=Divine Water Palace disciples keep their Divine Water in Crystal Jade Bottles, which are imbued with different properties to bring out different effects of the Divine Water.
desc_wjd_xzjf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Quick Non-Attack</font>: Each skill enhances it's own charge speed and distance.<br><font color="#FFAE00">No Attack Due to Collapse</font>: Striking the target reduces their charge speed and attack distance.<br> (Cant be used to quickly approach the target)
desc_zf_gb_01_01_1=This skill is used by the player setting up the array. All allies in area of effect will reflect 30 damage to attacker when hit. Lasts 2 minutes.
