desc_skill_npc_sjclThree02_001_1=Launch a hidden weapon, dealing 1% damage to the target, knocking them away and removing all their rage points.
desc_skill_npc_sjclThree02_002_1=Launch a hidden weapon dealing 1% damage to the target for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_npc_sjclThree02_004_1=Launch a hidden weapon, dealing 1% damage to the target and reducing their internal defense by 100% for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_npc_sjclThree02_005_1=Launch a hidden weapon, dealing 1% damage to the target and an aidditional 5% damage each second for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_npc_sjclThree02_009_1=Launch a hidden weapon, knocking the target away and dealing a small amount of damage.
skill_SJclThree01_b06=Equilibrium
desc_skill_SJclThree01_b06_1=Restores equilibrium in circulation. <br> Must wait 5 seconds before the status can be used.<br>Can lift the instant death status.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_01=Limitless Woe
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_01_1=Charges for 3 seconds, striking the target 3 times. The damage is shared with teammates.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_02_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Grounded targets that parry the attack will be paralyzed for 3 seconds. Those that fail to parry will be instantly killed. If the target is airborne they will receive a small amount of damage.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_03=Worry Free
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_03_1=Charges for 3 seconds then deals major damage to the target, which cannot be parried. If they attempt to parry they will be paralyzed for 5 seconds and unable to use weapons. If this skill is cast during Rage status, it will be altered to place the target into a faint state and all targets surroudnign the affected target will receive 10 damage and inflicted with Vulnerable status.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_04=Clear Impurity from Nothingness
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_04_1=If a target fails to parry they will have all their Rage removed and a chance for the caster to receive 2% energy every 5 seconds for 1 minute.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_05=Laws of Heaven
skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj01=Empty Phase Fist
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj01_1=Charges for 2 seconds and deals a small amount of damage to surrounding targets. If the target is airborne they will be grounded.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj02=Worriless Fist
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj02_1=Charges for 2 seconds and damages targets within range. If the target has their parry broken, worry free status will activate. Target will become dazed for 0.5 seconds every 2 seconds.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj03=Fist of the Phantom Pain
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj03_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the target. If the target fails to parry they will be inflicted with Vulnerable status, receiving an additional 50% damage for 10 seconds.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj04=Empty Fear
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj04_1=Charges for 3 seconds, and knocks away all targets within 2 meters and deals 5% damage. Striking airborne targets will grant a sheild absorbing 10% damage.
skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj05=Vacuous Calm
desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_sj05_1=Charges for 3 seconds and adds a static effect. If the target moves within 3 seconds they will receive 80% damage, while other targets within 3 meters of the original target will receive 50% damage.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_01_1=Charges for 3 seconds dealing moderate damage to surrounding targets and adds No Equal in Heaven. If the target is using a sword skill, they will receive 5% damage while standard skills will cause 2% damage. Active for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds and deals 3 damaging strikes to all targets directly in front. If the target fails to parry the final blow, then 100% of damage dealt in the next 10 seconds will be rebounded back to the attacker.
skill_SJclThree01_mon_03=Sky Mirror
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_03_1=Charge for 5 seconds to use a water-resistant technique to control a clone. The clone has abrosb up to 50% of damage and will remain active for 1 minute. If the clone is not killed while active, after the minute is up it will explode, dealing 90% damage to nearby targets - during which the target(s) will be unable to activate Pluck The Peacock's Plume, Red Super Armor, Yellow Armor and Buddha Heart Palm for 20 seconds.
skill_SJclThree01_mon_04=Sky Maul Attack
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_04_1=Deals a small amount of damage to targets within a wide area directly in front and knocks them away.
skill_SJclThree01_mon_05=Splitting Earth Chop
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_05_1=Half the targets in the asurrounding area will be slowed. Grounded targets will receive 10% damage while airbonre targets will remain undamaged.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_06_1=Launch a hidden weapon which will remain active for 20 seconds. If triggered 3 times while active, it will freeze targets and reduce their defense by 50%. Those within the aoe of the hidden weapon will have their health drained by 1%.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_07_1=Launch a hidden weapon at the target. Targets will have their movement speed and accuracy reduced by 50% for 30 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_08_1=Charges for 5 seconds and then grants immunity to 30% of damage for 10 seconds.
skill_SJclThree01_mon_09=Inferno Flame
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_09_1=Damages all targets in the area of effect and adds a burning effect. External defense is reduced by 50% and there is a chance to inflict a blood loss wound, resulting in an additional 2% damage.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_10_1=Deals a small amount of damage to nearby targets and inflicts Shadow status, causing them to faint for 2 seconds. Can be stacked up to 20 times.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_11_1=Deals a small amount of damage and reduces the target's Evasion by 100%. Also inflicts 5% damage to the surrounding friendly units every 2 seconds for the next 10 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_12_1=Damages the target and inflicts them with stalking poison - 10 seconds after being inflicted,if the target's energy is below 50%, their HP and energy will be drained by 10%, 50% of Rage removed and in a fainted state for 1 second.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_13_1=Fires a projectile that abosrbs 3% energy each second. After 30 seconds it will deal100% damage to the target. If the projectile is stopped before the 30 seconds are up, all energy will be restored along with 10 Rage points.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_14_1=Strike the ground, causing an 80% slowed effect and a smallamount of damage to targets within 10 meters. Active for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_15_1=Deals moderate damage to to all targets and reduces their defence by 60%. Active for 30 seconds.
skill_SJclThree01_mon_16=Splintered River
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_16_1=Launches a chi wave that deals moderate damage to targets and repels attacks.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_17_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the target while enhancing the internal attack damager of the caster by 20% for 30 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_18_1=Deals a small amount of damage and targets the opponent for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_19_1=Charges for 3 seconds and deals a moderate amount of damage while infloicting the target with Soul Bound. Failing to execute the QTE will result In being Thrown and damage reduced by 20% for 1 minute.
skill_SJclThree01_mon_20=Hurricane Slash
desc_skill_SJclThree01_mon_20_1=Charges for 3 seconds and dealls a small amount of damage to nearby targets.  Adds a Slash effect - if the trget is airborne they will be thrown and receive 80% damage.
