desc_skill_SJclThree02_boss_05_1=Charges for 5 seconds and damages targets within 5 meters. Damaged targets will have certain buffs removed, in particular Red Super Armor, Yellow Armor and  Pluck The Peacock's Plume effects. These skills will not be able to be activated again for 20 seconds.
