desc_skill_SJclThree01_boss_05_1=Ha! I know all skills. Is there any I do not know!? Charge this skill for 5 seconds, then rush toward the target within 5 meters. Gain Laws of Heaven status, which randomly prohibits the use of one of 9 weapons: Single sword, twin swords, single blade, etc.
"desc_dfsj_cjg_bj_01_1=Use on the corresponding sword chest to collect the sword in your hand.
After use, the sword on the back can be put down."=
