desc_CS_jh_csqns06_1=Gain "Counter" state: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. (Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increasing skill level can intensify counter-attack damage.)
