desc_CS_jh_klsjj07_1=Adds yourself with <font color="#FFAE00">"Silent Flame"</font>: Continuously affect enemies within 5 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">"Silent Flame Chi"</font>, lasts 8 seconds. Affected enemies <font color="#f9fc00">cannot use Flying Skills</font>, and your <font color="#f9fc00">Internal/External Attack Accuracy</font> will increase greatly.
desc_CS_jh_klsjj08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 6 meters, and <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> non-parrying enemies. When casting the skill, you will grant <font color="#FFAE00">"Return Sun"</font> state by costing extra Rage: Increases skill damage of this set for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Human Return Sun</font>: Increases damage by 5% and costs 5 points of Rage additionally.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Earth Return Sun</font>: Increases damage by 10% and costs 10 points of Rage additionally.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Sky Return Sun</font>: Increases damage by 15% and costs 15 points of Rage additionally.<br>(Unable to move and grant Yellow Armor while casting the skill.
