desc_CS_jh_kspzj04_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Feats On the Sacrifices"</font> state: Gather strength continuously and make the next attack with Heavy Sword more powerful (This skill can be only released on ground. When releasing you're in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state).<br>When releasing this skill, you can use these skills: <font color="#f9fc00">Isolated City Sunset, Raising Lantern With Sword, and Endless War</font> to interrupt, and trigger the <font color="#FF00FF">Charging for Attack</font> effect of these 3 skills (Increasing skill level can reduce skill cooldown time).
desc_CS_jh_kspzj04_2=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Feats On the Sacrifices"</font> state: Gather strength continuously and make the next attack with Heavy Sword more powerful (This skill can be only released on ground. When releasing you're in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state).<br>When releasing this skill, you can use these skills: <font color="#f9fc00">Isolated City Sunset, Raising Lantern With Sword, and Endless War</font> to interrupt, and trigger the <font color="#FF00FF">Charging for Attack</font> effect of these 3 skills (Increasing skill level can reduce skill cooldown time).
