desc_CS_jh_kspzj05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 8 meters in the front, and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Back</font> non-parrying enemies, also <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds (This skill can be only released on ground).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Charging for Attack</font>: Releasing this skill under <font color="#FFAE00">"Feats On the Sacrifices"</font> state, can <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> non-parrying enemies in the front.
