desc_CS_jh_pjjt04_1=Adds yourself with <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon and Tiger Body"</font> state. Parry an attack will add yourself with 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Dragon's Prowess"</font> state, lasts 10 seconds. After 9 stacks the state will be removed and trigger <font color="#FFAE00">"Tiger's Majesty"</font> effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Back</font> your opponent and decrease your opponent's all defense by 12% within 7 seconds.
