desc_CS_jh_pjjt05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> the target. Within 5 seconds you can release this skill again to <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> the target, can release at most 2 times.
