desc_CS_jh_tmby01_1=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Obscene</font><br> Deals {@0:伤害包} to the selected target. Costing 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> can reduce the non-parrying enemy's skill damage by 5% for 6 seconds.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
