desc_CS_jh_tmby03_1=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Fougere</font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 20 meters in the front. Breaking enemies' parry will also make them <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds.<br>Costing 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> can shoot out a "Lingering Sound Wave" to the front: Recover ally targets' HP (Recovery amount is affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage) on the path.
