desc_CS_jh_tmby04_1=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Grief</font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 20 meters in the front. <font color="#f9fc00">Slow Down</font> non-parrying enemies by 30% for 2 seconds.<br>Costing 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> can shoot out a "Lingering Sound Wave" to the front: Deals Soft Damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage) to enemies on the path, and <font color="#f9fc00">Slow Down</font> non-parrying enemies by 60% for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tmby04_10=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Grief</font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 20 meters in the front. <font color="#f9fc00">Slow Down</font> non-parrying enemies by 50% for 2 seconds.<br>Costing 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> can shoot out a "Lingering Sound Wave" to the front: Deals Soft Damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage) to enemies on the path, and <font color="#f9fc00">Slow Down</font> non-parrying enemies by 80% for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tmby04_11=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Grief</font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 20 meters in the front. <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> non-parrying enemies for 2 seconds.<br>Costing 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> can shoot out a "Lingering Sound Wave" to the front: Deals Soft Damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage) to enemies on the path, and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> non-parrying enemies for 3 seconds.
