desc_CS_jh_tmby05_1=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Love</font><br>Enter <font color="#FFAE00">"Zither's Heart"</font> state: Parrying enemies' attack can get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound Encircles"</font> state. This state can last for 12 seconds and will transfer into 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> state after 5 stacks. "Lingering Sound" can stack up to 3 times and lasts 8 seconds.
