desc_CS_jh_tmby06_1=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Seizing Souls</font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 10 meters in the front. <font color="#f9fc00">Pull</font> non-parrying enemies to you and the last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> non-parrying enemies.<br>Casting the skill again can straightly launch the last hit, at this time , you can cost 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Lingering Sound"</font> to shoot out a "Lingering Sound Wave" to the front: Deals Soft Damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage) to enemies on the path, and <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> them.<br>(When casting the skill you are in <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> state).
