desc_CS_jh_tmby07_1=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Reverse</font><br>Damage received by you is reduced by 10%, and debuffs received by you are unable to stack up (Can take effect for 2 times). Lasts 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_tmby07_10=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Reverse</font><br>Create a, 8-second Music Area around you: Within 12 meters, damage received by ally players is reduced by 10%, most of splash damage received is reduced by 25%, and debuffs received are unable to stack up (Can take effect for 10 times).
desc_CS_jh_tmby07_11=<font color="#a3ca44">Sound of Reverse</font><br>Create a, 10-second Music Area around you: Within 14 meters, damage received by ally players is reduced by 10%, most of splash damage received is reduced by 40%, and debuffs received are unable to stack up (Can take effect for 10 times).
