desc_CS_jh_xxsyp06_1=Upon parrying successfully, adds the attacker with one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Cold River"</font> state, up to 8 stacks, lasts 8 seconds.<br>Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Cold River"</font> will decrease the speed and distance of <font color="#f9fc00">[Wild Goose Flying Skill]</font>, and <font color="#f9fc00">[Jump Across the Cloud]</font> by 2%. Using Flying Skill once will remove one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Cold River"</font>.
