desc_CS_jh_yfjb02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets 5 meters in the front. Breaking parrying successfully will add the target with 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Pouring</font> state. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Pouring</font> inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Slowing Down</font> by 5%. Using Flying Skill once can remove one stack of this state. If the state still exists after 5 seconds then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 2 second.
