desc_CS_jh_ymcxs04_1=Upon parrying successfully, add yourself with one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Continuing</font> state, up to 5 second, lasts 15 seconds.<br>You can release the skill again when you already have 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Continuing</font> to increase your Ignore External Parry by 5% for 7 seconds, at the same time remove most of debuffs on you.
