desc_Npc_jy_dqd01_guild_1=Damage your target. <br>Add <font color="#FFAE00">"Merciless World"</font> to player, which instills <font color="#FFAE00">"Heartless"</font> Chi in enemy with every attack. Every time the enemy is attacked by a Heartless Skill, the Heartless Chi triggers extra damage. The Chi disappears after damage is triggered.
