desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx07_1_1=Releases quickly. Uses the way of the changing moon to summon Yin Yang power, granting a Yin Yang Buff. Players who receive Yin after 5s are frozen for 5s. Players who take Yang receive burning damage every second for 20s. Has a 40m range. (Players who take Yang can jump in the water to dispel) (only used in phase 2, 3, and 4) Used in Full Moon. Yin Yang Buff cannot be parried. Each time this skill is used, the Moon Phase Array changes.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx07_2_1=Releases quickly. Uses the way of the changing moon to summon Yin Yang power, granting a Yin Yang Buff. Players who receive Yin after 5s are frozen for 5s. Players who take Yang receive burning damage every second for 20s. Has a 40m range. (Players who take Yang can jump in the water to dispel) (only used in phase 2, 3, and 4) Used in Full Moon. Yin Yang Buff cannot be parried. Each time this skill is used, the Moon Phase Array changes.
