desc_skill_clone038_hme_04_1=Skill 4
desc_skill_clone038_lg_01_1=Hit the front area with the huge hammer and create an earth spike area with a radius of 8 meters. Deal large damage to targets within the range and disables their Flying Skills for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_clone038_lg_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds and sweeps with the axe. Deal large damage to the front and blow away parrying targets.
desc_skill_clone038_lg_03_1=Jump and trample on the ground, deal huge damage to all targets within 10 meters and cause bleeding. Targets with bleeding will lose 5% of HP every 2 seconds and be slowed down by 50%.
desc_skill_clone038_lg_04_1=Charge for 3 seconds and roll the head. Within 5 seconds, deal intermediate damage to all targets within 10 meters per second.
desc_skill_clone038_lg_05_1=Charge for 3 seconds to release a hammer rotation attack that deals huge damage to all targets within 10 meters and knock them back, also decrease their External Defense by 95%.
desc_skill_clone038_lg_06_1=Charge for 3 seconds and deal large damage to all targets in the front fan area. Targets whose Rage is below than 50% will have their HP Recovery reduced by 100%.
desc_skill_clone038_lg_07_1=Charge for 1 second and deal small HP loss to all targets in the front fan area.
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_00_1=Lei Xingkong Normal Attack
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_01_1=Attack three times with axe to the front. Deal additional damage and inflict Skill Disabled effect with Fierce state.
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_02_1=Slash twice to the front and deal small damage. Add the hit player with a debuff.
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_03_1=Smash the ground and break nearby targets' parry, also deal large damage to them and knock them down.
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_04_1=Attack the current target. If the target is parrying then deal additional damage to nearby units.
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_05_1=Charge for 10 seconds. Once released successfully grant Addicted to Killing state.
desc_skill_clone038_lxk_06_1=Deal small damage to nearby units and inflict stunning. Absorb Fierce Soul NPC.
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_00_1=Iron Ruler Monk Normal Attack
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_01_1=Charge for 2 seconds, then drag nearby players and deal damage.
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_02_1=Charge for 2 seconds, then dash to player ,kick the player up and deal intermediate damage, at the same time spread Chi force to other players randomly, also deal damage and cause blowing away.
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_03_1=Charge for 2 seconds, then grab a player and throw the player to the front area. Blow away other players on the path and deal damage to them.
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_04_1=Charge for 2 seconds, then launch players within 8 meters into air and jump up to kick away the airborne players.
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_05_1=Bewitch some of players and make their mind confused. If they failed to become conscious in time then immediately kill them after a period of time.
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_05_ex_1=Hey, wake up! (Approach an ally target to use)
desc_skill_clone038_tcdr_06_1=Charge for 2 seconds, then the players need to move continuously within the set time, or they will be captured by the traps underground and receive continuous damage.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_01_1=When start to charging, knock away the current target. After charging for 3 seconds, spit a venom orb to the target's ground. The venom orb will deal large damage when landing, and knock away the target, make the target Skill Disabled for 10 seconds, also lose 1% of HP per second. The venom will create a 5-meter-radius venom pool which lasts 20 seconds. Players cannot use their skills in the pool and lose 5% of HP per second, and the players staying in the pool for more than 10 seconds will have their external defense reduced by 90% for 1 minute.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds, then hit the ground, deal large damage to an 8*20 area in the front, and launch up all targets in the area.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_03_1=Charge for 3 seconds, deal large damage to a fan area in the front and knock back all targets, also add the targets with Bleeding state which deduct their HP and Energy by 1% per second. If a bleeding target is blown away by the Whirlwind, the target will receive huge damage.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_04_1=Charge for 2 seconds, then create a 3-meter-radius circle under the target's feet. The ghost claw will appear in 2 seconds, deal intermediate damage to hit targets, stun them for 5 seconds, and clear all their Rage Points.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_05_1=Charge for 5 seconds, then release all the poison. Deal large damage to all targets within 8 meters, and slow them down by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_06_1=Charge for 1 second, then randomly select two players and summon an insect under each of the players' feet. The insect will explode in 20 seconds and deduct all the players' 50% of HP, while ignore any defense effect.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_07_1=Plant an insect to the players that not being planted. If the target is damaged by a teammate's poison in 30 seconds, the insect will explode and cause a loss of 50% of HP.
desc_skill_clone038_wdgr_08_1=Charge for 10 seconds, then recover 2% of HP. Will be interrupted if the Interrupt state stacked for 5 times.
