desc_st_zcboss_001_1=Unbearable coldness causes paralysis.
desc_st_zcboss_002_1=Move like a shadow. Grants Reflect effect.
desc_st_zcboss_003_1=As good as water. Increase Damage Reduction by 80%.
desc_st_zcboss_004_1=Tai Chi creates Yin and Yang. Create a Tai Chi circle which inflicts stunning.
desc_st_zcboss_005_1=Sun and moon swallowing.
desc_st_zcboss_006_1=Deal large damage to the target.
desc_st_zcboss_007_1=Sword falling like rain.
desc_st_zcboss_008_1=Fire dragon devours the world.
desc_st_zclsjn_001_1=Guide your disciple to tide over the difficulty. (Use to remove the Paralysis state on your disciple) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_002_1=Guide your disciple to tide over the difficulty. (After using you may receive damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_003_1=Guide your disciple to tide over the difficulty. (After using your disciple may receive damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_004_1=Break the expert's Immunity state and help your disciple to tide over the difficulty. (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_005_1=Sacrifice yourself. (After using you will receive damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_006_1=Taoism creates a sword. (After using your disciple will be disturbed) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_007_1=Occupy the advantage. (After using your disciple's Critical Damage is increased by 30%) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_008_1=There must be some loss. (After using you will receive damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_009_1=The green soul fades. (After using your disciple's Critical Damage is decreased by 30%) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_010_1=A soul breaking song. (Use to clear the Sword Rain state which is disturbing your disciple) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_011_1=Possessed by the devil. (You will receive some damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_012_1=Lonely smoke in the desert. (After using your disciple will receive some damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_013_1=Glamorous sunset. (Use to drive away the rolling fireball) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_014_1=Chi of green sun. (You will receive some damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
desc_st_zclsjn_015_1=Disappearance of loneliness. (Your disciple will receive some damage) (You may only choose one from the three skills to help your disciple, please make your choice carefully)
