desc_CS_hs_kfkj04_1=Charge a short distance towards your enemy to inflict {@0:伤害包} damage, while briefly <font color="#f9fc00">stunning</font> your target. Within 4 seconds, this skill can be used again, up to 3 times. <br>Every time this skill is repeated within 4 seconds, <font color="#f9fc00">Speeding Twister</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Furious Storm</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Roaring Tiger</font> will give you <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font>. <br>This skill cannot be used in midair.
desc_CS_hs_kfkj04_10=Thunder blast to, there will be carnage disaster. People rushing Sword, sword stab introduced, resulting in the enemy front sprint a distance, on the right path and strength {@ 0: package} damage and briefly <font color="#f9fc00"> unconscious </font>, 4 Miao You can play inside again, you can display up to three times. <br> each display display <font color="#f9fc00">] [Feng Chi cloud volume </font> <font color="#f9fc00"> 4 seconds after the moves [stormy] </font> <font color="#f9fc00"> 【Tigers wind] </font> is included with <font color="#f9fc00"> yellow tyrants </font> effect. <br> (the moves can not be cast in the air)
