desc_CS_th_bhcs01_1=Plays the musical note <font color="#9932CD">"So"</font>. Music of the flute inflicts {@0:伤害包} to nearby targets. <br>Every attack adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">"Vastness"</font>. Lasts 15 seconds. <br>If target has 6 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury. <br>Player can move freely with <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. Internal Injury applies only towards players and is based on their attributes.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs01_10=A song of the green tides, the tide rises and falls. Adds <font color="#9932CD">Yu</font> melody. Music of the flute causes in surrounding enemies {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every strike adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font>. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>(Player can move freely when using skill, player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using skill. Internal Injury is only effective towards other players based on player's attributes) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped, a single sword can only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs01_11=Plays the musical note <font color="#9932CD">So</font>. Music of the flute inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets. <br>Every attack adds 1 stackable effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font>. Lasts 15 seconds.  <br>If target has 6 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Vastness</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury.  <br>Can move about freely when <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> is used with the skill. Internal Injury only applies to players, and is based on player attributes. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
