desc_CS_th_bhcs03_1=Music of the flute damages enemies within 8 meters, and forces them to dance.<br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when this skill is in use.<br>Targets will not stop dancing even when attacked.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
desc_CS_th_bhcs03_10=Peach blossoms remind one of past sorrows. The song ends yet I am still wandering on this green sea. Music of the flute causes damage in surrounding enemies and cause enemies within a 8-meters radius to become Ecstatic and begin to dance.  <br>(Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using skill)<br>(Cannot stop dancing during Ecstasy even if external forces try to stop them) <br>(Skills cause 100% damage if flute is equipped, a single sword can only do 70% damage)
desc_CS_th_bhcs03_11=Music of the flute damages enemies within 8 meters, and forces them to dance. <br>Player has <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when this skill is in use.<br>Targets will not stop dancing even when attacked.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.
