desc_Skill_force_thd01_1=Continually hitting the fish can increase the skill level of Air Cutter. With higher level, the hit rate will be increased.
desc_Skill_force_thd01_2=Continually hitting the fish can increase the skill level of Air Cutter. With higher level, the hit rate will be increased.
desc_Skill_force_thd01_3=Taught by the fourth disciple of Peach Blossom Island Leader Qin Xuanlei. It looks like a dragon leaving ocean toward sky. By hitting shoal repeatedly to upgrade the skill Air Cutter. With higher level, the hit rate will be increased.
