desc_event_korea_sl01_1=Age of Wushu Record - Shaolin Defensive Skill — Dragon Claw
desc_event_korea_sl02_1=The defensive skill off Shaolin in Age of Wushu Record — Dragon Claw
desc_event_korea_sl03_1=The defensive skill off Shaolin in Age of Wushu Record — Dragon Claw
desc_jn_boss_dhes02_1=Rush to the front of the target
desc_jn_boss_dhes03_1=<s>
desc_jn_guild_02_04_1=Creates an Illusion.
desc_skill_clone034_dw_07_1=Casts quickly. Uses 5 swords to deal 8% of max damage (external attack damage) with each sword. Struck players get the "Bone Saw" debuff for 10s. Damage amplification 80%.
desc_skill_clone034_qd_06_1=Casts immediately. Three random players within 20m faint and take 25% max HP Yin Damage every second. Limai or Death cancel.
desc_skill_clone034_syin_01_1=For 10s, reflects 30% damage taken to player.
desc_skill_clone034_syin_03_1=Heavy strike to target. If target has Rage, more damage is given.
desc_skill_hpzz_bc_001_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Deals 500 points of damage to all targets within five meters.
desc_skill_hpzz_fs_001_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Deals 1,000 points of damage to target.
desc_skill_hpzz_jg_001_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Deals 3,000 points of damage to all targets in the front 90 degree arc within five meters.
desc_skill_hpzz_jg_002_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Deals 20% HP damage to a single target, debuffing him with Drifting Soul effect. Lasts five seconds. Also infects up to five targets within three meters, dealing 20% HP damage.
desc_skill_hpzz_jg_003_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Sprinkles in a selected area with poison pollen, dealing 2% HP damage per second to all NPCs within three meters. Lasts eight seconds.
desc_skill_hpzz_kz_001_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Deals 1,000 points of damage to target.
desc_skill_hpzz_kz_003_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Sprinkles in a selected area with poison pollen, debuffing all NPCs within three meters with Heavenly Thunder effect. Loses 8% HP every five seconds in Heavenly Thunder. The effect lasts 30 seconds. The zone lasts five seconds.
desc_skill_hpzz_kz_004_1=Costs one packet of pollen. Sprinkles in a selected area with poison pollen, debuffing all NPCs within three meters with Soaring Fire effect. Slows target down by 30% and reduces his HP by 2% every second. Lasts five seconds.
desc_test_sl_lzs03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target, and adds Cherish the Lost to the target: Damage taken increases by 3% for 15 seconds. Can stack 3 times.
desc_test_sl_lzs04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. If target has Cherish the Lost debuff, paralyze the target for 5 seconds.
desc_wx_sl_lzs03_1=Deals 251 damage to the target. Every stack of Cherish the Lost debuff will add 30 extra Hard Damage. Add Cherish the Lost to target for 15 seconds. Can stack 3 times. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
desc_wx_sl_lzs03_2=Deals 339 damage to the target. Every stack of Cherish the Lost debuff will add 30 extra Hard Damage. Add Cherish the Lost to target for 15 seconds. Can stack 4 times. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
desc_wx_sl_lzs03_3=Deals 426 damage to the target. Every stack of Cherish the Lost debuff will add 30 extra Hard Damage. Add Cherish the Lost to target for 15 seconds. Can stack 5 times. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
desc_wx_sl_lzs03_4=Deals 534 damage to the target. Every stack of Cherish the Lost debuff will add 30 extra Hard Damage. Add Cherish the Lost to target for 15 seconds. Can stack 6 times. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
desc_wx_sl_lzs04_1=Deals 227 damage to the target. If target has Cherish the Lost debuff, stun the target for 3 seconds. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
desc_wx_sl_lzs04_2=Deals 342 damage to the target. If target has Cherish the Lost debuff, stun the target for 3 seconds. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
desc_wx_sl_lzs04_3=Deals 484 damage to the target. If target has Cherish the Lost debuff, stun the target for 3.5 seconds. <br>Use it to enter Speed Up status and the cost of Flying Skill points will decrease by 50%.
