desc_Boss_jh_kxtd01_1=Cultivate your moral character and right your steps, tighten your foot and kick. Causes in enemies in front{@0:伤害包}.
desc_Boss_jh_kxtd03_1=The heaven and earth become upside down, swing-around kick, causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}. <br>Causes additional damage to enemies already on the ground.  <br>(player will have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when using skills after player finishes three continuous kicks)
desc_Boss_jh_liusha01_1=Throw a fan from your sleeve, your chi powering its flight as it deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to targets in front of you. There is a chance that the fan will land a blow to an accupoint, procluding the enemy from performing a movement.<br/>This movement is a favorite of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhu Jianzhi</font> at the Longmen Inn.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sc_001_1=Second Stage Switch
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_01_1=Unite your fists and strike with both of them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy;<br>The gust from your mighty fists brings with it a poisonous essence that causes the enemy to fall into the <font color="#FFAE00">Poison Lure</font>: This increases the effect of being poisoned.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_02_1=Your fists strike with a bitter coldness that penetrates the bones of enemies who stand before them, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage;<br>After breaking an enemy's defense, this movement puts them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Smash Marrow</font> state. This causes the target to continuously lose Energy. When you execute this movement, the amount of Energy you use determines how much damage you inflict. This movement can also reset the duration of poison effects.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_03_1=Bone Corrosion attacks the heart, give out 3 waves of bloody poison fog, the enemy contact it will be poisoned.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_04_1=Concentrate a poisonous energy, then let it spiral outwards to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>This movement will ground airborne targets, putting them into the <font color="#FFAE00">Fracture Bone</font> state: This slows movement speed, and when the enemy uses flying skills he will suffer intense damage. Adding even more <font color="#FFAE00">Bone Fracture</font> to the enemy will slow his speed even more. The intense damage effect will only occur once.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target and inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Blind</font>. Also make your target <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed by 80%</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Unable to use Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_06_1=<font color="#f9fc00">Strucks Down</font> airborne target and deals {@0:伤害包} and make this target unable to use skills for 3 seconds. If the target got Poison and Spirit then this attack will deal additional 11 points of Yin Damage (Affected by Melee Damage and Internal Attack Damage).
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to your target and add your target with <font color="#FFAE00">Spider Spins</font> state for 6 seconds. Your target will be <font color="#f9fc00">interrupted</font> when trying to use a skill within 3 seconds after the <font color="#FFAE00">Spider Spins</font> stacking for 3 times.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters in front of you. <br>Breaking targets' parrying successfully will <font color="#f9fc00">Knock then Down</font>.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_04_10_1=Deals damages to enemies within 15 meters with an AoE attack. Targets who fail to parry will be knocked away and forbidden to use flying skills with continuous energy loss for 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_07_01_1=Restores target's HP by 20%<br><font color="#f9fc00">Only available to brothers and sisters of the Liu Family</font>
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_07_02_1=A demon of the unholy ways, you hurl a vicious poison that envelops both you and surrounding enemies. The effect lowers enemies' movement speed and prevents them from using flying skills.<br>If you use this move again or use other moves from this set after using this move once, the poison effect will be cancelled.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_08_01_1=Deal damage to nearby enemies
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_08_02_1=Deal damage to enemies nearby
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_09_01_1=Clears most debuffs<br><font color="#f9fc00">Effective distance: 5 meters</font>
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_09_02_1=Creates a trap for 1 minute.
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_10_01_1=Try to mine the target <br><font color="#f9fc00">Give me a hand. Maybe we will be rich in the future</font>
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_10_02_1=Last Stand
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_10_03_1=Outburst of Anger
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_10_04_1=Rage
desc_Boss_wbwf_sx_10_05_1=Death Match
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_01_1=Group attack, forcing the enemy to repel in its own direction
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_02_1=Single attack, reducing the damage of non-parrying enemies by 25%, reducing movement speed by 20%. Can stack 3 times. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_03_1=Instantly recovers 10% of HP while reducing damage taken by 50% for 10 seconds.
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_04_1=Charge, stun if not blocked
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_05_1=Single attack, repel if not blocked
