desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_09_1=Take your own Peacock Plum and treat multiple people
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_10_1=Single attack
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_11_1=Group attack. Keyboard settings randomized if not block within 10 seconds
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_12_1=Throw away enemies
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_13_1=Normal Attack
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_14_1=Jump back
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_15_1=Heal
desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_05_16_1=Flying flowers look beautiful, throw 3 darts continuously, deal {@0:伤害包} to target.
