desc_Boss_wbwf_xx_07_05_1=Volley Preparation
desc_CS_jh_dtd01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>Hit the target and inject Blade Chi <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font> into its body for 10 seconds. After 8 stacks, <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> effect will be triggered. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font> effect, you receive Yellow Armor when casting skills.
desc_CS_jh_dtd01_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>Hit the target and inject Blade Chi <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font> into its body for 10 seconds. After 8 stacks, <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> effect will be triggered. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font> effect, you receive Yellow Armor when casting skills.
desc_CS_jh_dtd01_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>Hit the target and inject Blade Chi <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font> into its body for 10 seconds. After 8 stacks, <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> effect will be triggered. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font> effect, you receive Yellow Armor when casting skills.
desc_CS_jh_dtd01_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>Hit the target and inject Blade Chi <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font> into its body for 10 seconds. After 8 stacks, <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> effect will be triggered. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font> effect, you receive Yellow Armor when casting skills.
