desc_CS_jh_dtd02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies. <br>When breaking parry, add <font color="#FFAE00">"Off Talus"</font> status to the target for 5 seconds: target will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> if he tries to use flying skill and will trigger Blade Chi<font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font>. <br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font> buff to yourself. When casting [Blood Drinking Disabusing], [Spin Blade with Dance], you receive Yellow Armor. <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon" </font> lasts 10 seconds and will be cleared after triggering Yellow Armor.
