desc_CS_jh_dtd03_1=Wields the blade to parry enemy's attack.<br>When parrying successfully, send one <font color="#FFAE00">"Injure Soul"</font>Blade Chi to the attacker: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Defense decreases</font> by 5%, <font color="#f9fc00">HP recovery speed decreases</font> by 5%. Lasts 10 seconds. Can stack 3 times. <br>Changing skill set will clear the status.
desc_CS_jh_dtd03_2=Wields the blade to parry enemy's attack.<br>When parrying successfully, send one <font color="#FFAE00">"Injure Soul"</font>Blade Chi to the attacker: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Defense decreases</font> by 5%, <font color="#f9fc00">HP recovery speed decreases</font> by 5%. Lasts 10 seconds. Can stack 4 times. <br>Changing skill set will clear the status.
desc_CS_jh_dtd03_3=Wields the blade to parry enemy's attack.<br>When parrying successfully, send one <font color="#FFAE00">"Injure Soul"</font>Blade Chi to the attacker: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Defense decreases</font> by 5%, <font color="#f9fc00">HP recovery speed decreases</font> by 5%. Lasts 10 seconds. Can stack 5 times. <br>Changing skill set will clear the status.
