desc_CS_jh_dtd03_6=Wields the blade to parry enemy's attack.<br>When parrying successfully, send one <font color="#FFAE00">"Injure Soul"</font>Blade Chi to the attacker: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Defense decreases</font> by 5%, <font color="#f9fc00">HP recovery speed decreases</font> by 5%. Lasts 10 seconds. Can stack 8 times. <br>Changing skill set will clear the status.
desc_CS_jh_dtd04_1=Dashes forward with a knife and deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. You can <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> non-parrying targets and get <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font>status. Add a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font> to the target if the target doesn't have Blade Chi <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font>. <br>(This skill cannot be used in the air.)
