desc_CS_jh_jysg01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters ahead. Each time you use this skill, you will get one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Sun's Departure</font>. When you get three stacks and use this skill again, you will <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the enemy.
