desc_CS_jh_jysg05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>Enemies hit by this skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">pulled</font> close to you. Afterward, Wushu Qi Blast will be used. Use <font color="#FF3030">Trigram Origin</font> to send targets within 8 meters <font color="#f9fc00">flying</font>.<br>(Cannot move while using this skill, during which time you also get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
