desc_CS_jh_jysg08_1=Bestows 15% <font color="#f9fc00">damage resistance</font> and increases <font color="#f9fc00">External Parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Skill Conversion</font> by 10 for 5 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jysg08_2=Bestows 20% <font color="#f9fc00">damage resistance</font> and increases <font color="#f9fc00">External Parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Skill Conversion</font> by 15 for 6 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jysg08_3=Bestows 20% <font color="#f9fc00">damage resistance</font> and increases <font color="#f9fc00">External Parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Skill Conversion</font> by 20 for 7 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jysg08_4=Bestows 25% <font color="#f9fc00">damage resistance</font> and increases <font color="#f9fc00">External Parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Skill Conversion</font> by 30 for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jysg08_5=Bestows 30% <font color="#f9fc00">damage resistance</font> and increases <font color="#f9fc00">External Parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Skill Conversion</font> by 30 for 9 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jysg08_6=Bestows 30% <font color="#f9fc00">damage resistance</font> and increases <font color="#f9fc00">External Parry</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Skill Conversion</font> by 100 for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_jysg09_1=Jumps backward into the air and levitates for 10 seconds. While in the air, sends out a <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Qi Blast</font> that <font color="#f9fc00">sends target flying</font>. Skill can be chained together multiple times. After the skill is finished or upon using another skill, you will return to the ground.<br>When using the skill, you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Power</font>, increasing External and Internal Skill Damage Reduction Avoidance by 15%, as well as External and Internal Skill Parry Avoidance by 15%.<br>(Also grants <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using skill)
desc_CS_jh_jysg09_10=Jumps backward into the air and levitates for 10 seconds. While in the air, sends out a <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Qi Blast</font> that ignores parries and <font color="#f9fc00">sends target flying</font>. Skill can be chained together multiple times. After the skill is finished or upon using another skill, you will return to the ground.<br>When using the skill, you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Power</font>, increasing External and Internal Skill Damage Reduction Avoidance by 15%, as well as External and Internal Skill Parry Avoidance by 15%.<br>(Also grants <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using skill)
desc_CS_jh_jysg09_11=Jumps backward into the air and levitates for 10 seconds. While in the air, sends out a <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Qi Blast</font> that ignores parries and <font color="#f9fc00">sends target flying</font>. Skill can be chained together multiple times. After the skill is finished or upon using another skill, you will return to the ground.<br>When using the skill, you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Power</font>, increasing External and Internal Skill Damage Reduction Avoidance by 15%, as well as External and Internal Skill Parry Avoidance by 15%.<br>(Also grants <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using skill)
