desc_CS_jh_jysg09_3=Jumps backward into the air and levitates for 10 seconds. While in the air, sends out a <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Qi Blast</font> that <font color="#f9fc00">sends target flying</font>. Skill can be chained together multiple times. After the skill is finished or upon using another skill, you will return to the ground.<br>When using the skill, you will get <font color="#FFAE00">Wushu Power</font>, increasing External and Internal Skill Damage Reduction Avoidance by 15%, as well as External and Internal Skill Parry Avoidance by 15%.<br>(Also grants <font color="#FF3030">Red Armor</font> when using skill)
