desc_CS_jh_ldg01_1=Fires 5 rounds of arrow rain 15 meters ahead, dealing {@0:伤害包}. Break Defense inflicts 5% <font color="#f9fc00">Slow</font> on enemy for 5 seconds. If target is using a <font color="#f9fc00">Flying Skill</font>, their flying skills will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 3 seconds.
