desc_CS_jh_ldg02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Each time a non-parrying enemy is hit, this skill adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bow's Cry</font>. Upon reaching 5 stacks, using this skill will fire three rapid shots and <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> non-parrying targets a short distance.
