desc_CS_jh_ldg03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> non-parrying targets.<br>When charge time exceeds 10%, damage is increased by 10% and range is increased by 2 meters.<br>When charge time exceeds 50%, damage is increased by 20% and range is increased by 4 meters.<br>When charge time reaches 100%, damage is increased by 30%, range is increased by 6 meters, and target is <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font> regardless of parry.
