desc_CS_jh_ldg04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> target for 2 seconds. Once stun is finished, target gets <font color="#FFAE00">Through the Moon</font> state. If target tries to use <font color="#f9fc00">flying skill</font> within 5 seconds, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font> for 1 second. If they try to <font color="#f9fc00">use a skill</font>, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 1 second. Once one of these effects is triggered, <font color="#FFAE00">Through the Moon</font> is removed.
