desc_CS_jh_ldg06_1=After a successful parry, gives self <font color="#FFAE00">Startling Bow</font> state, which <font color="#f9fc00">increases movement speed</font> by 10% for 15 seconds. At the same time, there is a 30% chance to add <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Goose</font> state, which grants <font color="#f9fc00">immunity to movement debuffs</font> for 10 seconds. <font color="#f9fc00">Immunity to movement debuffs</font> has a 25-second cooldown.
