desc_CS_jh_lybj06_1=Fires an arrow with launching mechanisms. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected enemy. If it hits an enemy that isn't parrying, it will inflict <font color="#f9fc00">fainting</font> on them for 2 seconds and give them a mark effect: for 10 seconds, <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion Rate</font> falls by 5% and <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion</font> falls by 50.<br>Launching mechanism will trigger on enemy's body, inflicting 61 External Skill Damage on enemy (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs).
desc_CS_jh_lybj06_10=Fires an arrow with launching mechanisms. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected enemy. If it hits an enemy that isn't parrying, it will inflict <font color="#f9fc00">fainting</font> on them for 2 seconds and give them a mark effect: for 10 seconds, <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion Rate</font> falls by 35% and <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion</font> falls by 300.<br>Launching mechanism will trigger on enemy's body, inflicting 227 External Skill Damage on enemy (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs).
