desc_CS_jh_lybj07_1=Fires an arrow toward selected area. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the area and triggers <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Danger</font>: Pulls enemies within 5 meters toward the center of the mechanism and <font color="#f9fc00">gathers them together</font> before detonating, rendering non-parrying enemies <font color="#f9fc00">unable to parry</font> for 3 seconds.
