desc_CS_jh_lydgd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When successfully breaking enemy's defense, <font color="#f9fc00">disable Flying Skill</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lydgd03_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When successfully breaking enemy's defense, <font color="#f9fc00">paralyze</font> the target (will slowly disappear) and make him unable to parry for 5 seconds.
