desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_1=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level).
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_10=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 20 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level). If the enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> at the same time, his skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_11=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 20 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level). If the enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> at the same time, his skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_12=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 20 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level). If the enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> at the same time, his skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_13=Initiates <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font> state: Upon parrying an enemy attack, you get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font> for 20 seconds. Max 6 stacks.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: Upon suffering an attack while not parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font> will be transferred to the attacker. Upon reaching six stacks, the enemy will suffer External Skill Damage (affected by melee damage and internal skill damage bonuses as well as skill's level). If enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font>, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_2=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level).
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_3=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 12 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level).
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_4=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 14 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level). If the enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> at the same time, his skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 1 second.
desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_5=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 14 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level). If the enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> at the same time, his skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 1 second.
