desc_CS_jh_lydgd05_9=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font>Status: When successfully parry enemy's attack, you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> status for 16 seconds. Can stack 6 times.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: When being attacked without parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font> will transfer to the attacker. After 6 stacks, it will cause external damage to the enemy (Affected by Melee Damage, Internal Attack Damage and skill level). If the enemy is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> at the same time, his skill will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 1 second.
