desc_CS_jh_mjh07_1=Triggers <font color="#FFAE00">Devouring Qi</font> state: Upon successfully parrying an enemy attack, you get <font color="#FFAE00">Shadow Devouring</font> Chi Force for 15 seconds. Max 3 stacks. When <font color="#f9fc00">Pursuit of Shadow</font> is supported by enough <font color="#FFAE00">Shadow Devouring</font> Chi Force, it will condense shadow energy and increase the amount of damage inflicted by stacks of <font color="#f9fc00">Devouring Qi</font>.
