desc_CS_jh_sjjc03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected enemy. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Cut Pulse</font> upon breaking an enemy's parry: enemy is <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skills</font> for 3 seconds.<br>Consuming an extra 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Flaming Meteor</font> will <font color="#f9fc00">send enemy flying</font> upon breaking their parry.
