desc_CS_jh_sjjc07_1=After successfully parrying an enemy, you get "<font color="#FFAE00">Flaming Meteor</font>" state: Lasts 12 seconds. Max 3 stacks. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to arrow attacks for this set. Using an arrow attack from this set consumes 1 stack of Flaming Meteor.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>：Deals 17 Yang Damage every second for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks. Damage increases with number of stacks.
desc_CS_jh_sjjc07_10=After successfully parrying an enemy, you get "<font color="#FFAE00">Flaming Meteor</font>" state: Lasts 24 seconds. Max 7 stacks. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to arrow attacks for this set. Using an arrow attack from this set consumes 1 stack of Flaming Meteor.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>：Deals 60 Yang Damage every second for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks. Damage increases with number of stacks.
