desc_CS_jh_sjjc09_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 8 meters. Each hit will cause non-parrying target to <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 3 seconds. You get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while using this skill and will teleport away when skill finishes.<br>Using this skill while airborne reduces damage and teleport distance.
