desc_CS_mj_rylhq01_1=Uses spear to stab targets 15 meters ahead and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Non-parrying enemies that are hit will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skills</font>.<br><font color="#FF3030">Dual spears</font>: Skill range is reduced to 5 meters and will no longer render target <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skills</font>, however <font color="#f9fc00">damage</font> will be increased by 30%.<br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
