desc_CS_mj_rylhq02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 15 meters.<br>Upon breaking a target's parry, it will reduce their <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Internal and External Skill Defenses</font> by 30%.<br><font color="#FF3030">Dual Spears</font>: Range is reduced to 5 meters and skill <font color="#f9fc00">immobilizes</font> target for 1 second. Casting speed is also increased.<br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
