desc_CS_mj_rylhq05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. Each strike <font color="#f9fc00">slows</font> target by 10% and reduces their <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion Rate</font> by 10%. Max 5 stacks. Final strike <font color="#f9fc00">sends target flying</font>.<br>(You get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while using this skill and can also use Flying Skills while casting it.)<br><font color="#FF3030">Dual spears</font>: Each strike will send non-parrying enemies flying (you get Yellow Armor while using this skill but are unable to move)<br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
