desc_CS_mj_rylhq06_1=Using this skill costs <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Spear</font> to initiate <font color="#FF3030">dual spears</font> state. Max 7 stacks. Use the skill once to consume 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">dual spears</font>. If you don't have <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Spear</font> you will get 1 stack of <font color="#FF3030">dual spears</font>.
desc_CS_mj_rylhq07_1=Upon a successful parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Spear</font>. Max 2 stacks.<br>Use the skill again to combine two spears into one. This clears <font color="#FF3030">Double Spear stance</font>.
desc_CS_mj_rylhq07_2=Upon a successful parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Spear</font>. Max 3 stacks.<br>Use the skill again to combine two spears into one. This clears <font color="#FF3030">Double Spear stance</font>.
desc_CS_mj_rylhq07_3=Upon a successful parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Spear</font>. Max 4 stacks.<br>Use the skill again to combine two spears into one. This clears <font color="#FF3030">Double Spear stance</font>.
desc_CS_mj_rylhq07_4=Upon a successful parry, grants <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Spear</font>. Max 5 stacks.<br>Use the skill again to combine two spears into one. This clears <font color="#FF3030">Double Spear stance</font>.
