desc_CS_mj_rylhq08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <font color="#f9fc00">Pulls non-parrying target toward you in the air</font> and then <font color="#f9fc00">slams</font> them. You will get Yellow Armor while using this skill but cannot move.<br><font color="#FF3030">Dual spears</font>: Skill inflicts ranged <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> and sends target <font color="#f9fc00">flying</font>.<br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)<br>(Different Body Size values [81-100] will result in different effects)
