desc_CS_mj_typzd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Renders target <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skills</font> for 3 seconds when its defense is broken and adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals continuous Yang damage for 12 seconds. Max 5 stacks. Also dissipates Chi Force, adding 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> to non-parrying enemies within 5 meters.<br>(<font color="#f9fc00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> skill must be learned for <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> to take effect)
