desc_CS_mj_typzd06_1=Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> state: Upon successful parry, gives attacker 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals 10 Yang Damage every 2 seconds (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs). Max 5 stacks. Deals more damage with each stack. Lasts 12 seconds.<br>(Scald damage is increased with level)
desc_CS_mj_typzd06_10=Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> state: Upon successful parry, gives attacker 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals 54 Yang Damage every 2 seconds (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs). Max 5 stacks. Deals more damage with each stack. Lasts 12 seconds.<br>(Scald damage is increased with level)
desc_CS_mj_typzd06_11=Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> state: Upon successful parry, gives attacker 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals 60 Yang Damage every 2 seconds (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs). Max 5 stacks. Deals more damage with each stack. Lasts 12 seconds.<br>(Scald damage is increased with level)
desc_CS_mj_typzd06_12=Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> state: Upon successful parry, gives attacker 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals 66 Yang Damage every 2 seconds (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs). Max 5 stacks. Deals more damage with each stack. Lasts 12 seconds.<br>(Scald damage is increased with level)
desc_CS_mj_typzd06_2=Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> state: Upon successful parry, gives attacker 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals 14 Yang Damage every 2 seconds (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs). Max 5 stacks. Deals more damage with each stack. Lasts 12 seconds.<br>(Scald damage is increased with level)
