desc_CS_mj_typzd06_9=Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> state: Upon successful parry, gives attacker 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Deals 48 Yang Damage every 2 seconds (this amount is affected by melee and internal skill buffs). Max 5 stacks. Deals more damage with each stack. Lasts 12 seconds.<br>(Scald damage is increased with level)
desc_CS_mj_typzd07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Each strike <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> non-parrying enemies and enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>.<br>You get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while using and can move freely.
desc_CS_mj_typzd07_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Each strike <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> non-parrying enemies and enemies with <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>.<br>You get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while using and can move freely.
