desc_CS_single_qfww01_1=Restores HP.
desc_CS_single_qfww02_1=Restores some Energy.
desc_CS_single_ts01_1=You <font color="#FFAE00">teleport</font> to the enemy's side and <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> them for 2 seconds. Their <font color="#f9fc00">damage taken</font> is increased by 30% for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Cannot be used in battle.</font>
desc_CS_single_ts02_1=Enemy is unable to use <font color="#FFAE00">Jump Across the Cloud</font> and is <font color="#f9fc00">slowed</font> by 30% for 30 seconds. Target's <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion Rate</font> is reduced to its lowest level.<br><font color="#FF3030">Can only be used against enemies with less than 30% HP.</font>
desc_Npc_act_cxjl01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies.<br><font color="#f9fc00">"Wind and Thunder Stance"</font>: largely slows targets, deals damage to enemies around you. <br>If the target is affected by the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Storm</font>, deals additional damage and removes the effect. <br><font color="#4169E1">This skill won't deal critical hit other than on rainy days.</font>
desc_Npc_act_cxjl02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby. <br>You can move freely while using this skill, as well as gaining <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>. <br>This move can be used within five seconds. After being used three times or more, it will be accompanied with <font color="#f9fc00">Knocking Away</font>. <br>(Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.)
desc_Npc_act_cxjl03_1=Attacks the target directly in front with {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Targets that fail to parry will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Trapped (Feint)</font> status: Internal and external defense reduced by 6% for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_act_cxjl04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage and paralyze target for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_act_cxjl05_1=The blade has become me, and I am the blade. The blade is in the dance and the dance has become the blade. Causes in surrounding enemies{@0:伤害包}; <br>if the enemy is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry</font> state, each <br>blow from a skill causes <font color="#f9fc00">Unconsciousness</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Cannot Parry </font>for 1.5 seconds in enemy. Deals additional damage based on the number of stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">"Slow Force"</font>on player. Every successful hit removes 1 layer.  <br>(Player may move freely when using skill, status becomes <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> during skill use)
desc_Npc_act_cxjl06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies around you. <br>Throws enemies affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>. Each throwing removes a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Anger of Thunder</font>. <br>Can move your character while casting this skill)<br/><font color="#4169E1">when it's a rainy day, at the time of the last hit of this skill, throws targets affected by Anger of Thunder high into the air to inflict thunder and lightning damage on them. </font>
desc_Npc_act_cxjl08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When breaking enemies' defense successfully, <font color="#f9fc00">disable their skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_act_cxjl09_1=A poisonous ailment explodes in the enemy's body, jolting nearby enemies as well. This maneuver fills you with bloodlust, increasing the power of your Perish Blade by 100%, each stroke drawing rivers of blood. Thereafter, when you execute The Spirit Leaves the Body double sting movement you will obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Enhanced Endurance</font> state.
desc_Npc_act_cxlj07_1=Slash the target directly ahead, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When the target is critically hit they will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Thunderbolt</font> status: Skills in this set's damage is increased by 10%. Can be stacked up to 3 times. Active for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Breaking a target's parry will send them flying.
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Reduces the unparried target's movement speed by 15% for 5 seconds upon hit.
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. When you get Five Elements, each attack reduces the unparried target's Rage by 1. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Disable the target's Flying Skills for 3 seconds. When you use the skill, Edgeless Sword Will will appear at the target's feet, which deals damage and throws the target after 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj04_npc_1=Throws the target several times
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj05_1=Creates a Five Elements Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Five Elements: Increases your external attack damage by 7% and inflicts Reversed Five Elements onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Five Elements reduces the targets' External Defense by 7%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj06_1=When you block 8 attacks, you get Six Ways for 15 seconds. <br>Using Five Elements Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies. <br>Using Seven Stars Sword Array will reduce 1 stack of this effect and apply 2 seconds of Strike Acupoint to enemies who are trying to attack you within 5 seconds. <br>When you get <font color="#FFAE00">Six Ways</font>, your blocks will not be counted.
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj07_1=Creates a Seven Stars Sword Array, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets within 8 meters. You also get Seven Stars: Reduces all the damage taken by 7% and inflicts Reversed Seven Stars onto the targets for 7 seconds. Reversed Seven Stars will reduces the targets' all Attack by 7%. <br>(Five Elements and Seven Stars cannot exist at a time.)
desc_Npc_df_dfwfj08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. When you get Seven Stars, the last hit inflicts Disarmed on the target for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_erg_xhmdl01_1=<font color="#a3ca44">We can forgive the heavens for doing bad, but if we do bad ourselves, it is unforgivable!</font> <br>Slashes and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters. <br>When hitting enemies without Endurance, grant <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font> to them for 10 seconds. Explode upon 3 stacks and <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font>  them for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_erg_xhmdl02_1=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_erg_xhmdl03_1=<br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_erg_xhmdl04_1=<font color="#a3ca44"></font><br>Surrounding targets are dealt {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Striking the target has a chance to inflict<font color="#f9fc00">Closer</font>, wherein every attack will finlioct the target with <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font>.<br> (Cannot move while using, though will be granted <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_Npc_erg_xhmdl08_1=<br>Massacres enemies nearby and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Grant <font color="#FF3030">Monster</font> to enemies upon every attack (Ignore Endurance). <br>(You will be in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> status when using this move, and you may use Flying Skills.)
desc_Npc_jh_chz01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Adds buffs to yourself: increases both Internal and External Attack Damage Reduction Ignore by 15%, increases External Parry Ignore by 15%, increases Internal Conversion Ignore by 15%. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_chz01_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Adds buffs to yourself: increases both Internal and External Attack Damage Reduction Ignore by 15%, increases External Parry Ignore by 15%, increases Internal Conversion Ignore by 15%. Lasts 5 seconds.
