desc_Npc_jh_chz03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to target. Upon hitting the target, the target is paralyzed for 6 seconds. Can hit at most 10 targets. One target can only be hit once.
desc_Npc_jh_chz03_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to target. Upon hitting the target, the target is paralyzed for 6 seconds. Can hit at most 10 targets. One target can only be hit once.
desc_Npc_jh_chz03_11=Deals {@0:伤害包} to target. Upon hitting the target, the target is paralyzed for 6 seconds. Can hit at most 10 targets. One target can only be hit once.
