desc_Npc_jh_csqns01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_csqns02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front, and adds <font color="#FFAE00">"Earth Break"</font> state to collapsed targets: Additionally receive 5% of external attack damage, lasts 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_csqns04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets and continuously <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> collapsed targets. Within 2 seconds you can interrupt this skill and release <font color="#f9fc00">[Soul Grasping Break]</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> the front targets.
desc_Npc_jh_csqns04_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> them. <br>When you are using the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_Npc_jh_csqns05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to front enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> them. <br>When you are using the skill, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state.
desc_Npc_jh_csqns07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the selected target. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. <br>When hitting non-parrying enemy, you can get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font>status.
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When successfully breaking enemy's defense, <font color="#f9fc00">disable Flying Skill</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the selected enemies. The first hit <font color="#f9fc00">disables skill</font> of non-parrying enemies for 2 seconds. The second hit <font color="#f9fc00">pulls</font> them closer to you.
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc05_1=Initiates <font color="#FFAE00">Astringe Light and Shadow</font> state: Upon parrying an enemy attack, you get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font> for 12 seconds. Max 6 stacks.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font>: Upon suffering an attack while not parrying, <font color="#FFAE00">Gather Shadow</font> will be transferred to the attacker. Upon reaching six stacks, the enemy will suffer External Skill Damage (affected by melee damage and internal skill damage bonuses as well as skill's level).
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and forms a 5-meter <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> area which lasts for 10 seconds under the feet: Deals external damage to enemies within range every second and causes them <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skill</font>. (This skill cannot be used in the air.)
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. The first three hits of the move can cause <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font> to non-parrying enemies. And the next two hits can <font color="#f9fc00">knockdown</font>non-parrying enemies. <br>Casting this skill in <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> area can get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status.
desc_Npc_jh_gymmc08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the selected target.
desc_Npc_jh_jlsd01_1=Slash the target directly ahead, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When the target is critically hit they will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Thunderbolt</font> status: Skills in this set's damage is increased by 10%. Can be stacked up to 3 times. Active for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_jlsd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_jlsd04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can be cast again in 4 seconds for 2 more times. The third cast will <font color="#f9fc00">knock </font> enemies into air.
desc_Npc_jh_jlsd04_1_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can be cast again in 4 seconds. The next cast will <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> enemies into air .
desc_Npc_jh_jlsd04_2_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets and <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> them into air .
desc_Npc_jh_jsc06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target; <br>Increase critical hit rate when used together with <font color="#FFAE00">Following Madness</font>.
