desc_Npc_jh_kfdf05_6=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Unstoppable Wind</font> to yourself for 10 seconds, during which <br>player may attack the same target with Shadow Leaves No Trace. <br>Player gets Super Armor when using Onset of Storm.<br>Removes common cooldown for skills within the set. <br>Increases movement speed, immune to slow down and paralysis debuffs. <br>Duration of status is refreshed when player seriously wounds target. (Only effective to players.)
