desc_Npc_jh_kfdf05_9=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Unstoppable Wind</font> to yourself for 10 seconds, during which <br>player may attack the same target with Shadow Leaves No Trace. <br>Player gets Super Armor when using Onset of Storm.<br>Removes common cooldown for skills within the set. <br>Increases movement speed, immune to slow down and paralysis debuffs. <br>Duration of status is refreshed when player seriously wounds target. (Only effective to players.)
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_10=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_11=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_2=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_3=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
