desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_7=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_8=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf06_9=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Dance</font> to yourself. Upon successful parry, there's a chance to reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_1=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_10=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_11=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_2=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_3=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_4=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_5=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_6=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_7=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_8=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_kfdf07_9=Deals{@0:伤害包} to enemies.<br>When breaking parry, reduce the cooldown of Shadow Leaves No Trace for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies that 5 meters in the front. Upon breaking parrying, decreases the target's <font color="#f9fc00">Evade Rate</font> by 5% for 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the selected target.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj03_1=Shoots a sword Chi to the selected target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters, and <font color="#f9fc00">Blow Away</font> non-parrying targets.
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj05_1=Enters <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning Cloud"</font> state: Upon parrying successfully, adds the attacker with a <font color="#FFAE00">"Burning Cloud"</font> Chi: <br><font color="#FFAE00">"Burning Cloud"</font> Chi can lurk for 30 seconds. After 7 stacks, it will explode when the carrier is releasing a skill: Deals damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> for 3 seconds.<br>Upgrade to increase the explosion damage.
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj06_1=Fly over and charge at your target, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This attack can only be used against airborne targets)
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj07_1=Adds yourself with <font color="#FFAE00">"Silent Flame"</font>: Continuously affect enemies within 5 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">"Silent Flame Chi"</font>, lasts 8 seconds. Affected enemies <font color="#f9fc00">cannot use Flying Skills</font>, and your <font color="#f9fc00">Internal/External Attack Accuracy</font> will increase greatly.
desc_Npc_jh_klsjj08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 6 meters, and <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> non-parrying enemies. When casting the skill, you will grant <font color="#FFAE00">"Return Sun"</font> state by costing extra Rage: Increases skill damage of this set for 10 seconds.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Human Return Sun</font>: Increases damage by 5% and costs 5 points of Rage additionally.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Earth Return Sun</font>: Increases damage by 10% and costs 10 points of Rage additionally.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Sky Return Sun</font>: Increases damage by 15% and costs 15 points of Rage additionally.<br>(Unable to move and grant Yellow Armor while casting the skill.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg01_1=Fires 5 rounds of arrow rain 15 meters ahead, dealing {@0:伤害包}. Break Defense inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Slow</font> on enemy for 5 seconds. If target is using a <font color="#f9fc00">Flying Skill</font>, their flying skills will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Each time a non-parrying enemy is hit, this skill adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bow's Cry</font>. Upon reaching 5 stacks, using this skill will fire three rapid shots and <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> targets a short distance.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg02_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> non-parrying enemies.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> non-parrying targets. The longer the skill is charged, the more damage it deals and the farther the skill's range. When charge time reaches 100%, target is <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font> regardless of parry.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> target for 2 seconds. Once stun is finished, target gets <font color="#FFAE00">Through the Moon</font> state. If target tries to use <font color="#f9fc00">flying skill</font> within 5 seconds, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font> for 1 second. If they try to <font color="#f9fc00">use a skill</font>, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 1 second.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg05_1=Fires rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. If target is not parrying when hit, they will suffer <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg06_1=After a successful parry, gives self <font color="#FFAE00">Startling Bow</font> state, which <font color="#f9fc00">increases movement speed</font> by 10% for 15 seconds. At the same time, there is a 30% chance to add <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen Goose</font> state, which grants <font color="#f9fc00">immunity to movement debuffs</font> for 10 seconds. <font color="#f9fc00">Immunity to movement debuffs</font> has a 25-second cooldown.
desc_Npc_jh_lyg07_1=Jumps back and fires, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_mjh01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected target.<br>(This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_mjh02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters ahead. Upon successfully breaking an enemy's parry, inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Stance Break</font>: Unable to parry for 3 seconds. Upon suffering <font color="#f9fc00">Through the Wind</font>, target is <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_mjh03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Upon hitting an enemy that is not parrying or has <font color="#FFAE00">Stance Break</font> status, <font color="#f9fc00">immobilizes</font> them for 1 second.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Through the Wind</font>: Deals 1.1x damage upon hitting target that cannot parry.
desc_Npc_jh_mjh04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in selected area. Inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 2 seconds.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Instep Bone</font>: After skill is finished, you teleport to the selected area.
desc_Npc_jh_mjh05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters.<br>If you have 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Shadow Devouring</font>, skill will consume 3 stacks to emit 3 blade shadows. Blade shadows whirl around and deal Yang Damage to enemies encountered and <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> non-parrying enemies.<br>(Using this skill gives you <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_Npc_jh_mjh06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected target.
desc_Npc_jh_mjh07_1=Triggers <font color="#FFAE00">Devouring Qi</font> state: Upon successfully parrying an enemy attack, you get <font color="#FFAE00">Shadow Devouring</font> Chi Force for 15 seconds. Max 3 stacks. When <font color="#f9fc00">Pursuit of Shadow</font> is supported by enough <font color="#FFAE00">Shadow Devouring</font> Chi Force, it will condense shadow energy and increase the amount of damage inflicted by stacks of <font color="#f9fc00">Devouring Qi</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_nrjbd01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets.
desc_Npc_jh_nrjbd02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target; <br>If the target is male, the last strike will bring him into<font color="#FF3030">Eggache</font>State: Reduce all damage taken by 30% and last 6 sec.
desc_Npc_jh_nrjbd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 15 meters. <br>Grants them <font color="#FFAE00">Hard to Find</font> status: their next attack will be evaded and cleared. The status lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_nrjbd04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby; <br>Successfully dodging the attack will make the attacker<font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font>for 3 sec；<br>The last move will<font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font>all enemies who do not parry. <br>(Using this skill increases evasion, and you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Super Armor</font> effect, also you may use Flying Skills.)
desc_Npc_jh_nrjbd07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When the target is male, the last attack will grant him <font color="#FF3030">Ball Broken</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">reduce speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font> for 4 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected target.<br>(This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters ahead. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> on non-parrying enemies: Reduces movement speed by 10% for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected enemy. When breaking an enemy's parry: enemy is <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skills</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc04_1=Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Startle</font>: Evasion Rate is reduced by 10% and reduces Resilience by 50 for 20 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc05_1=Launches a large number of arrows to the selected area, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and inflicting <font color="#f9fc00">immobilization</font> for 1 second if they are not parrying. At the same time, enemies knocked to the ground will be unable to get up.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc05_sky_1=Launches a large number of arrows to the selected area, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and inflicting <font color="#f9fc00">immobilization</font> for 1 second if they are not parrying. At the same time, enemies knocked to the ground will be unable to get up.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to selected enemy. This effect has a high hit rate.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc07_1=After successfully parrying an enemy, you get "<font color="#FFAE00">Flaming Meteor</font>" state: Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to arrow attacks for this set for 24 seconds. Max 7 stacks. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>：Deals () Yang Damage every second for 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc08_1=Charges for a while and then fires an arrow forward, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies along the way. Non-parrying enemies will be <font color="#f9fc00">sent flying</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc08_sky_1=Charges for a while and then fires an arrow forward, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies along the way. Non-parrying enemies will be <font color="#f9fc00">sent flying</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc09_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 8 meters. Each hit will cause non-parrying target to <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_sjjc09_sky_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 8 meters. Each hit will cause non-parrying target to <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jl_bmjs02_1=Stop the corruptions, clean the headstream Arrest enemy, howl to the sky. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jl_bmjs03_1=Use knack to defeat enemy. Slash heavily to launch out a Blade Chi. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in a selected 5-meter-area and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> them. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_Npc_jl_bmjs04_1=Hide capacities and bide time, dealing with trouble by counterattack. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 5 meters in front of you.  If hit any enemy (must be player) will reduce 1 second cooldown time of <font color="#f9fc00">Birds Frightened By Bow</font>.
desc_Npc_jl_bmjs07_1=When the universe created, gas flow up to be sky, solid precipitated to be earth. Brandish blade while spinning. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters (Up to 5 targets) and <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> them if they are not parrying. If you are at <font color="#FFAE00">Back To Life</font> state, you will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting. <br>Once the attack hits the target, it can be used again within 5 seconds. <br>(The Skill Effect will change by different Physique Points [81-100])
desc_Npc_jl_bmjs08_1=Live without standing place, die without burial ground. Continuously split target. Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target.
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. Breaking the enemies' defense will debuff them with Force of Thunder Trigram: Increases the chance of getting Critical Hit by 15%, lasting for 5 seconds. When the enemies get Critical Hit 5 times, the debuff will be removed.
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies ahead. In Collapsed state, enemies will suffer 12% more damage.
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the targets. The first strike also knocks down the unparried targets. <br>(Get yourself Yellow Armor.)
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr05_1=You get Howling Sky: increases External Attack Accuracy Rate by 12% and deals external attack damage, lasting for 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr06_1=Gain <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> state: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increasing skill level can intensify counter-attack damage.)
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_Npc_mr_wxqyr08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd01_1=Folds the fan and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the selected target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd02_1=Folds the fan and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. When you break enemies' defense, they will be knocked back and debuffed with Lower Body Instability for 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd03_1=Unfolds the fan and wields a whirlwind towards the enemies in front, dealing Soft Damage to them and knocking down the unparried enemies with Lower Body Instability. <br>Charge this skill for 1.5 seconds. Whirlwind damage and flight distance increase with time.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd04_1=Unfolds the fan and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 15 meters in front of you. Each strike of the skill will knock down the unparried enemies.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd05_1=Folds the fan and throws the hidden weapons in it, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. Each strike of the skill will stun the unparried enemies. This skill cannot be used in the air. <br>When you use this skill again, all the hidden weapons will be thrown, dealing soft damage to the nearby enemies. You will get Yellow Armor when using the skill.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd05_hide_1=Folds the fan and throws all the hidden weapons in it,dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>You will get Yellow Armor when using the skill.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd06_1=You get Self-controlled: each parry gives you a stack of Fan Force, up to 2 stacks, lastings for 30 seconds. Each time you fold/unfold the fan, 2 stacks of Fan Force will be removed to grant you a buff: <br>Unfolding fan switches to folding fan: increases External Parry Ignore and Internal Conversion Ignore by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds. <br>Folding fan switches to unfolding fan: increases skill damage by 8%, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_ng_gsd07_1=Unfold the fan and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the selected target.
desc_Npc_wbwf_xfsyt01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>When using this skill, you acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Windriding</font> state: lasts 15 seconds, when you use <font color="#f9fc00">【Wind Blowing Leaves】</font>, you are in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state; <br>You also acquire <font color="#FFAE00">Leaning Cloud</font>: lasts 15 seconds, increase damage of <font color="#f9fc00">【Cloud With Wind】</font>, max 10 stacks.
desc_Npc_wbwf_xfsyt02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>If you break target's parry, apply <font color="#f9fc00">Blow-away</font> effect.
desc_Npc_wbwf_xfsyt04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Generate <font color="#FF3030">Whirlwind</font>: Enemies affected will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 1 second, taking damage. (Attach Paralyze effect ignoring Parry, if you have Power Ascension, effect lasts 5 seconds)<br>(Paralyze effect decreases progressively)<br>(If you have Windriding effect, you launch the skill under <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets 5 meters in front of you. Reduces the unparried enemies' Congestion by 25% upon hit.
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq04_1=Each successful parry buffs yourself with a stack of Wood Painting, up to 8 stacks, lasting 15 seconds. Effect: When you get Swans Fly Over Sea, your HP recovers continuously. Each HP recovery removes one stack of Wood Painting. <br>When you use the skill again with 8 stacks of Wood Painting, it will remove all the stacks of Wood Painting to remove most of your debuffs and recover your Congestion. (Recovery value depends on internal skill damage.)
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq04_hide_1=Each successful parry buffs yourself with a stack of Wood Painting, up to 8 stacks, lasting 15 seconds. Effect: When you get Swans Fly Over Sea, your HP recovers continuously. Each HP recovery removes one stack of Wood Painting. <br>When you use the skill again with 8 stacks of Wood Painting, it will remove all the stacks of Wood Painting to remove most of your debuffs and recover your Congestion. (Recovery value depends on internal skill damage.)
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. Reduces the unparried enemies' Accuracy Rate by 15% and makes them continuously lose HP for 6 seconds upon hit. <br>When used on the allies, it increases their Accuracy Rate by 15% and continuously recovers their HP for 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq05_hide_1=Deals damage to enemies. Reduces the unparried enemies' Accuracy Rate by 15% and makes them continuously lose HP for 6 seconds upon hit. <br>When used on the allies, it increases their Accuracy Rate by 15% and continuously recovers their HP for 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front of you. When you break enemies' defense, you will throw them.
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq07_1=Pulls back the enemies within 8 meters and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to them. Creates a 8-meter radius Energy Field for 10 seconds, in which enemies will take continuous damage per second and have a chance to fall down when using flying skills (the chance depends on the remaining Energy Field time). <br>(Get yourself Yellow Armor.) <br>(Skill upgrade slightly increases the Fall-Down chance.)
desc_Npc_ym_mwcq08_1=Creates a 6-meter radius Energy Field for 10 seconds, in which allies will recover HP for 3 seconds when they are attacked with effect of Disable Flying Skills, Paralyzed, or Stunned. When you get Wood Painting, you will recover HP continuously in the Energy Field. Each HP recovery removes one stack of Wood Painting.
desc_boss_erg_cg_01_1=Within 5 meters, Knock away + Weaken
desc_boss_erg_cg_02_1=Within 5 meters, paralyzed if not parry
desc_boss_erg_cg_04_1=Within 10 meters, fall down after 5 seconds if not parry
desc_boss_erg_cg_05_1=Charges towards a specified target, causing knockout effects on non-parrying targets
desc_boss_erg_cg_06_1=Within 10 meters, generate a fire ring under the target's feet
desc_boss_erg_cg_07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.
desc_boss_erg_cg_08_1=<font color="#9932CD">The Classic of Changes. Waiting Hexagrams. Dragon Soaring Over Great Rivers. </font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} to target. <br>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_boss_erg_cg_09_1=<font color="#9932CD">The Classic of Changes. Well Hexagrams.  </font><br>Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters in front of you and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds.
desc_boss_erg_cg_10_1=<font color="#9932CD">The Classic of Changes. Earth Hexagrams. </font><br>Shocks enemies 8 meters nearby to make them <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(Get yourself <font color="#FF3030">Strong SuperArmor</font> while casting)
desc_boss_erg_cg_11_1=<font color="#9932CD">The Classic of Changes. Moving Hexagrams. Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> them if they are not parrying. <br>(Can be cast under Stiffness, Knocked Back, Knocked Down, Launched up. Remove corresponding debuff. Get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting)
desc_boss_erg_cg_12_1=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies;<br>The terminal strike can send enemies within a six-meter area flying.
desc_boss_erg_cg_13_1=A charging movement. Wield a club and chop to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_boss_erg_cg_14_1=A charging movement. Fly over and circle the enemy before striking to deal {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>This consumes one layer of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state, limiting its parry abilities.<br>(This movement can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
desc_boss_erg_cg_15_1=Wielding a club, strike the enemy to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage, adding the <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state to him. Stackable up to three times.
desc_boss_erg_cg_16_1=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and send nearby enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping.
desc_boss_erg_cg_17_1=Within 10 meters, loses HP continuously and unable to recover Energy
desc_boss_erg_cg_18_1=Within 10 meters, knock away with high damage
desc_boss_erg_cg_19_1=Within 10 meters, knock away with high damage
desc_boss_erg_cg_20_1=Within 10 meters, pull
desc_boss_wbwf_sx_06_01_1=Use herbal medicine to restore 10% HP for the NPC and clear Old Wound Returns debuff.
desc_boss_wbwf_sx_06_02_1=Draw A Snake Out of Its Hole
desc_boss_wbwf_sx_06_03_1=Waving Fists to Disturb, Flashing Kick with Leg Force: causes damage to enemies in front.
desc_cbt_drwf_lzy_tsbd001_1=There must be precious treasure here. If you search the cave carefully, you may find something.
