desc_jn_gujdrtg_001_1=Receive a gold armor which heals the player with 50% of the damage absorbed. Active for 2 minutes.
desc_jn_gujdrtg_002_1=Taunt all enemies within 50 meters, and deal 10 damage to all enemies within 20 meters every second, lasts 2 minutes.
desc_jn_gujdrtg_003_1=Cause damage to targets and give them injection of ordinary inner power, causing them to explode when dying which damages all friendly forces within a 10 meter radius. Damage is equivalent to their max HP.
desc_jn_gujdrtg_004_1=Stun all enemies within 15 meters and attach Vulnerable to them, also remove their Super Armor effect. <br/>【Vulnerable】: Suffer 100% additional damage
desc_jn_gujdrtg_005_1=Recover 305 HP, and max HP is increased by 30% for 2 minutes. Produce a protection effect and absorb damage equivalent to max HP. Lasts 2 minutes before shield is broken. While you have the shield, your Super Armor is weakened (cannot be stacked).
desc_jn_gujdrtg_006_1=Increase movement speed by 100% and blow away nearby enemies, lasts 30 seconds.
desc_jn_gujdrtg_007_1=Reduce damage taken by 90% for 15 seconds, after the effect ends, deal damage equal to your max HP to all nearby enemies. Each attack has a chance to trigger Body Protecting Chi to deal damage worth 10% of your max HP to nearby enemies.
desc_jn_gujdrtg_008_1=Gain 50 Rage immediately, gain further 10 Rage in every 10 seconds.
desc_jn_gujdrtg_009_1=Instantly recovers 100% of Energy. Energy will continuously be restored by 100% every 30 seconds for 2 minutes.
