desc_skill_4yuejuqing001_1=<s>
desc_skill_9yang_heal_1=Consumes your own HP to heal Chi Yangzi.
desc_skill_clone009_wux004_2_1=Front rectangular area is slammed and targets hit will get "Yin Perish".
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_01_1=Locks onto current target and fires a massive snowball at them after 5 seconds. Reduces HP of all targets hit by 50% and reduces their movement speed by 60% for 10 seconds. 2% HP is cost each time a flying skill is used. Snowball will knock down ice pillars.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_02_1=Charges up for 8 seconds, focusing momentum on the target. During this time, skills will be locked and you will be unable to move. Other players will need to get close to remove this state. Once fully charged, will deal a massive amount of damage to all targets ahead. If target blocks, they will be defense broken for 10 seconds. If target has not shaken lock, they will be immediately killed.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_04_1=Deals a moderate amount of damage over a rectangular area ahead and knocks back all targets. Targets will get Dark Chill for 20 seconds. This effect has a 75% chance to inflict 1-second faint every 4 seconds. This skill deals damage worth 80% ice pillar's lost HP.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_05_1=After charging for 5 seconds, deals a large amount of damage to players ahead and adds Scarlet Frost effect. Reduces damage by 90%, External Skill Defense by 90%, and movement speed by 90% for 10 seconds. This damage will not affect ice pillars.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_06_1=Jumps backward and slams hammer 3 times, dealing a massive amount of damage and given targets Shaken effect for 10 seconds. Every time this skill is used there is a certain chance of locking skills for 2 seconds. Clears all player's Ice Break effects.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_07_1=Two stage AOE that summons monsters.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_08_1=Throws ice at target. If target is a Demonic Snow Ape, target will be enraged. Rage can stack up to 5 times. Each stack will increase its damage by 5% and its damage taken by 10%.
desc_skill_clone039_pz001_1=Round area damage. Targets hit will faint and lose 5% HP.
desc_skill_clone039_pz002_1=Single target skill. Paralyzes for 5 seconds and deals 5% soft damage.
desc_skill_clone039_pz003_1=Summons Trained Braves to help fight off disciples.
desc_skill_clone039_pz004_1=Summons Cultivated Swordsmen to help fight off disciples.
desc_skill_clone039_pz005_1=Summons Hidden Hermits to help fight off disciples.
desc_skill_clone039_wux001_1=10-meter half circle damage area. Those who take damage get Crow's Flight state.
desc_skill_clone039_wux002_1=10-meter half circle damage area. Deals extra damage to targets with Crow's Flight.
desc_skill_clone039_wux003_1=Round 8-meter area damage. Sends flying and inflicts paralysis.
desc_skill_clone039_wux004_1=Solo chop. Adds Yang Live on effect.
desc_skill_clone039_wux005_1=Rectangular chop.
desc_skill_clone039_wux005_2_1=Picks solo target.
desc_skill_clone039_wux006_1=Disorders all opponent's directions.
desc_skill_clone039_wux007_1=Round area damage. Enemies hit get "Cold Enters the Body"
desc_skill_clone039_wux_attack_1=Hero Normal Skill
desc_skill_clone039_xq_01_1=Attacks 3 random targets. Whirlwind appears beneath targets' feet after 5 seconds, reducing their movement speed by 80% and locking their flying skills. After leaving the whirlwind area or once whirlwind dissipates, they lose 20% HP.
desc_skill_clone039_xq_02_1=Charges up for 2 seconds then launches ice needles ahead. Targets hit by ice needles are frozen. After a player is frozen, they can repeatedly use move keys to break frozen state. If they haven't removed frozen state after 15 seconds, they will take a massive amount of damage. Damage taken while frozen is doubled.
desc_skill_clone039_xq_03_1=Pulls nearby non-blocking players close and slashes them in the air, locking their throats. Other players must help them remove this state, or they will suffer 90% HP loss after 10 seconds. 1% HP and Energy are lost every 2 seconds while this state is active.
desc_skill_clone039_xq_04_1=Throws a ball of ice forward. Targets hit will lose 1% HP every time they use a skill and will have a chance of having skills locked for 5 seconds. This effect lasts 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone039_xq_05_1=Creates a ball of ice beneath all targets within 50 meters. Balls of ice will explode after 5 seconds and deal a massive amount of damage over a nearby area and reduce movement speed by 80% and lock flying skills. After balls of ice detonate, they will leave behind an area of cold air for 20 seconds. Skills will be locked in these areas and 2% HP will be lost every second.
desc_skill_guildagree_shp_001_1=Chi Pill
desc_skill_hd_201751_001_1=desc_skill_hd_201751_001_1
desc_skill_hd_201751_002_1=desc_skill_hd_201751_001_1
