desc_skill_hd_201751_004_1=desc_skill_hd_201751_001_1
desc_skill_item_title_4098_1=desc_skill_item_title_4096_1
desc_skill_jiuyang_01_001_1=Increases nearby allies' Internal Damage by 50% for 30 seconds.
desc_skill_jiuyang_01_002_1=Gives nearby allies 30% immunity to all damage for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_jiuyang_01_003_1=Nearby allies recover 5% HP and Energy every second for the next 5 seconds.
desc_skill_jiuyang_01_004_1=Grants 10 seconds of Red Armor to nearby allies. <br>This skill can only be used 3 times.
desc_skill_jiuyang_01_005_1=Knocks down all nearby enemies and makes them unable to use Flying Skills for 5 seconds.<br>This skill can only be used 3 times.
desc_skill_jiuyang_02_01_1=Feed Chi Yangzi some Sun Grass.
desc_skill_jiuyang_rq_01_1=Gives all allies within 50 meters 20 seconds of Red Armor.
desc_skill_jiuyang_rq_02_1=Gives all allies within 50 meters 20 seconds of Red Armor.
desc_skill_jiuyang_rq_03_1=All non-blocking enemies within 50 meters will be knocked down.
desc_skill_jiuyang_rq_04_1=Causes enemies within 50 meters to faint for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_jqwf_hdlz_001_1=Venom Swallow the World
desc_skill_jqwf_jg_001_1=desc_skill_jqwf_jg_001_1
desc_skill_jqwf_jr_001_1=Use on the injured people to cure them.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn01_1=Unbearable coldness causes paralysis.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn02_1=Move like a shadow. Grants Reflect effect.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn03_1=As good as water. Increase Damage Reduction by 80%.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn04_1=Tai Chi creates Yin and Yang. Create a Tai Chi circle which inflicts stunning.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn06_1=Deal large damage to the target.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn07_1=Sword falling like rain.
desc_skill_jqwf_ltn08_1=Fire dragon devours the world.
desc_skill_jqwf_wy_001_1=Tear the sky like a demon shadow.
desc_skill_jqwf_wy_002_1=Hell Soul.
desc_skill_jsjy_shp_001_1=Nine-colored Antidote
desc_skill_ksxz_shp_001_1=Spirit Raise
desc_skill_ngyaopin_001_1=desc_skill_ngyaopin_001_1
desc_skill_ssf_010_1=Random effect (Slowed by 20%, Paralyzed for 2 seconds every 2 minutes, Lose HP every 2 seconds, Accuracy decreases by 10%, Evasion decreases by 10%, Flying Skills cost 5 more Flying Skill Points, Crit Rate decreases by 10%, External and Internal Defense decrease by 15%)
desc_skill_ssf_tasknpc_01_1=Get 5 Unmarked Runes
desc_skill_weibing_kill_1=Guard Skill
desc_skill_wgyaopin_001_1=desc_skill_wgyaopin_001_1
desc_skill_wywl_xuruo_1=123
desc_sw_mj_01_1=Skill is charged for 5 seconds. Within a 10m x 3m area of effect ahead, targets receive modest damage and the Pointing the Way effect. For 10 seconds, their skills are disabled, and they are knocked down every time they use Flying Skills.
desc_sw_mj_02_1=Targets within 5 meters receive minor damage. For 20 seconds, their blocks are broken, and they receive the Follow Up a Victory effect, losing 1% HP every second for 10 seconds, and are thrown at the final second.
desc_sw_mj_03_1=Inflict minor damage. With each attack, target who is not blocking is thrown, and loses 5% HP.
desc_sw_mj_04_1=Charge this skillfor 3 seconds to deal massive damage. Target who fails to block will be thrown, and within the next 10 seconds, every skill target uses will result in 1% loss of HP.
desc_sw_mj_05_1=Charge for 3 seconds to unleash a twin hammer attack that deals massive damage and knocks down targets within 8 meters.
desc_sw_mj_06_1=Twin hammers stun all targets in an area of effect for 20 seconds. If boss is attacked, the effect is canceled.
desc_sw_mj_07_1=Nearby targets in a 8-meter area of effect receive minor damage. Selected target receives the Cold Thorn effect for 20 seconds and is thrown. Under this effect, target loses Flying Skill points and 2% HP. 20 seconds later, target loses 20% HP and is frozen for 30 seconds, during which his or her external defense is lowered by 100%. Target must move constantly to avoid this effect, which freezes the target when stacked 30 times.
desc_sw_mj_08_1=Charge skill for 15 seconds, during which her evasion increases by 50%. There is 30% chance of interrupting this kill when boss receives damage. If the skill is uninterrupted, it repels nearby players in a 5-meter radius, and activates the Muddling Smoke effect, which increases the boss's attack power by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_sw_mj_09_1=Charge skill for 3 seconds. This attack deals minor damage and can be blocked. If boss has the Deep Cold Armor effect and target is not blocking, it purges target's rage and deplets 50% of his or her energy. When this happens, Deep Cold Armor is removed.
desc_sw_mj_10_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters ahead. Upon successfully breaking an enemy's parry, inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Stance Break</font>: Unable to parry for 3 seconds. Upon suffering <font color="#f9fc00">Through the Wind</font>, target is <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font>.
desc_sw_mj_11_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Upon hitting an enemy that is not parrying or has <font color="#FFAE00">Stance Break</font> status, <font color="#f9fc00">immobilizes</font> them for 1 second.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Through the Wind</font>: Deals 1.1x damage upon hitting target that cannot parry.
desc_sw_mj_12_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in selected area. Inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">faint</font> for 2 seconds.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Instep Bone</font>: After skill is finished, you teleport to the selected area.
desc_sw_mj_13_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters.<br>If you have 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Shadow Devouring</font>, skill will consume 3 stacks to emit 3 blade shadows. Blade shadows whirl around and deal Yang Damage to enemies encountered and <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> non-parrying enemies.<br>(Using this skill gives you <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font>)
desc_sw_mj_14_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. <br>When hitting non-parrying enemy, you can get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Gather Shadow"</font>status.
desc_sw_mj_15_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When successfully breaking enemy's defense, <font color="#f9fc00">disable Flying Skill</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_sw_mj_16_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters and forms a 5-meter <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> area which lasts for 10 seconds under the feet: Deals external damage to enemies within range every second and causes them <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use flying skill</font>. (This skill cannot be used in the air.)
desc_sw_mj_17_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. The first three hits of the move can cause <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font> to non-parrying enemies. And the next two hits can <font color="#f9fc00">knockdown</font>non-parrying enemies. <br>Casting this skill in <font color="#FFAE00">Remain Shadow</font> area can get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status.
desc_sw_mj_18_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Each time a non-parrying enemy is hit, this skill adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bow's Cry</font>. Upon reaching 5 stacks, using this skill will fire three rapid shots and <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> targets a short distance.
desc_sw_mj_19_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 15 meters. Skill <font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> non-parrying enemies.<br>Exceeding charge time by 10% increases damage by 10% and range by 1 meter.<br>Exceeding charge time by 50% increases damage by 20% and range by 2 meters.<br>Exceeding charge time by 100% increases damage by 30%, range by 3 meters, and .<font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> targets regardless of parry.
desc_sw_mj_20_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> target for 2 seconds. Once stun is finished, target gets <font color="#FFAE00">Through the Moon</font> state. If target tries to use <font color="#f9fc00">flying skill</font> within 5 seconds, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font> for 1 second. If they try to <font color="#f9fc00">use a skill</font>, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use skills</font> for 1 second.
desc_sw_mj_21_1=Fires rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. If target is not parrying when hit, they will suffer <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font>.
desc_sw_mj_22_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters ahead. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> on non-parrying enemies: Reduces movement speed by 10% for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks.
desc_sw_mj_23_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected enemy and <font color="#f9fc00">drops</font> airborne non-parrying enemies. Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Startle</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">keys are disordered</font> for 5 seconds and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> states on the enemy. (While enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font>, effects will be intensified)
desc_sw_mj_24_1=Launches a large number of arrows over an 8x25 meter rectangle, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies and inflicting <font color="#f9fc00">immobilization</font> for 1 second if they are not parrying. At the same time, enemies knocked to the ground will be unable to get up.<br>When skill is used in the air, fewer arrows are fired and less damage is dealt.
desc_sw_mj_25_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to selected enemy. This effect has a high hit rate.
desc_sw_mj_26_1=Charges for 1.5 seconds and then fires an arrow forward, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies along the way. Non-parrying enemies will be <font color="#f9fc00">sent flying</font>. This skill cannot be charged up while in the air and damage will be weakened. Additionally, you will only be able to <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> non-parrying enemies.
desc_sw_mj_27_1=Deal minor damage to targets in a 10m x 3m area of effect. Targets receive the Phage effect. When stacked 2 times, targets lose 50% HP. If boss carries over 5 stacks of the Opportunistic Strike effect, target loses 50 points of rage.
desc_sw_mj_28_1=Boss charges skill for 5 seconds and gains the Bloody Eye effect, which has two versions. In its Yang form, the attack absorbs 30% HP from target. In its Yin form, it throws the target. When Opportunistic Strike is stacked 10 times, releasing this skill will cause targets within a 5-meter radius to lose 10% of their energy.
desc_sw_mj_30_1=Deal minor damage to targets in an area of effect. If boss has the Opportunistic Strike effect, target receives the Netherworld effect. For 15 seconds, target has a 20% to be frozen for 1 second every 3 sceconds.
desc_sw_mj_31_1=Lady Moon starts dancing for 3 seconds, during which she buries a bomb trap, while attacting any target who is not blocking in a 10-meter area to approach her within 5 meters. Once players enter this 5-meter zone, Lady Moon stuns them. 5 seconds later, the trap is sprung, throwing the targets to inflict massive damage. Thrown players now suffer from Fatal Attraction. For the next 10 seconds, each time they attack, they have a chance of causing a teammate within 5 meters to lose 2% HP.
desc_sw_mj_npc_01_1=Launch Ballista
desc_sw_mj_npc_02_1=Explode
desc_sw_mj_npc_03_1=Weakens body.
desc_sw_mj_npc_04_1=Slows HP recovery.
desc_sw_mj_npc_05_1=Slows body.
desc_sw_mj_npc_06_1=Deals continuous burning damage.
desc_sw_mj_npc_07_1=All keys are disordered.
desc_sw_mj_npc_08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters ahead. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> on non-parrying enemies: Reduces movement speed by 10% for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks.
desc_sw_mj_npc_09_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters ahead. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> on non-parrying enemies: Reduces movement speed by 10% for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks.
desc_sw_mj_npc_10_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 20 meters ahead. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> on non-parrying enemies: Reduces movement speed by 10% for 5 seconds. Max 5 stacks.
