desc_wuji_CS_gb_dgbf02_1=A sudden, angular stab that deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. This also consumes one stack of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> state and prevents him from using feint moves. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Demented</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. When hitting non-parrying enemies, remove 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disable their skill</font> for 3 seconds.
