desc_wuji_CS_gb_dgbf07_1=Rise from the ground and use the staff to launch the enemy into the air, dealing {@0:伤害包}.<br>Attaches <font color="#FFAE00">Fallen</font> state to the enemies: Unable to jump. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Demented</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. This skill can be released in air, and if it's interrupted, the attacker will be <font color="#f9fc00">disarmed</font> for 3 seconds.
