desc_wuji_CS_gb_dgbf08_9=Deals {@0: 伤害包} to enemies.<br>The final hit can send enemies within 6 meters into air. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Demented</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. When hitting non-parrying enemies every time, <font color="#f9fc00">disable their flying skills</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_cljf05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies. <br>Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font> state: stands still and deals continuous damage to nearby enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 1 second. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font> stacks, you get <font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each stack increases the power of the skill set by 15% and recovers Chi and Energy. Lasts 10 seconds. <br>(This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font> stacks increase based on your <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font> stacks. One stack of Sword Dance state is removed each time you are attacked.) <br>If married couple use this skill within 8 meters, they will get <font color="#FFAE00">Link (Female)</font>, <font color="#FFAE00">Link (Male)</font> status. Female is protected by the male and <font color="#f9fc00">reduces damage taken by</font> 50%. Male is encouraged by female and <font color="#f9fc00">damage is increased by</font> 30% (Couple need to be in a team)
desc_wuji_CS_jh_cljf05_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies. <br>Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font> state: stands still and deals continuous damage to nearby enemies. <br>If the <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font>state is not cut off in 4 seconds, then it stuns surrounding enemies for 3 second. Also, according to your <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font> stacks, you get <font color="#f9fc00">Potential Stimulation</font>: Each stack increases the power of the skill set by 15% and recovers Chi and Energy. Lasts 10 seconds. <br>(This skill is used in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Dance</font> stacks increase based on your <font color="#FFAE00">Water-Milk Fusion</font> stacks. One stack of Sword Dance state is removed each time you are attacked.) <br>If married couple use this skill within 8 meters, they will get <font color="#FFAE00">Link (Female)</font>, <font color="#FFAE00">Link (Male)</font> status. Female is protected by the male and <font color="#f9fc00">reduces damage taken by</font> 50%. Male is encouraged by female and <font color="#f9fc00">damage is increased by</font> 30% (Couple need to be in a team)
