desc_wuji_CS_jh_ldg01_9=Fires 5 rounds of arrow rain 15 meters ahead, dealing {@0:伤害包}. Break Defense inflicts 45% <font color="#f9fc00">Slow</font> on enemy for 5 seconds. If target is using a <font color="#f9fc00">Flying Skill</font>, their flying skills will be <font color="#f9fc00">disabled</font> for 3 seconds.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Arrow Wind</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Skill changes to a 25-meter single target skill. Break Defense adds <font color="#f9fc00">Arrow Rain</font> and greatly increases Accuracy.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_ldg02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Adds a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Bow's Cry"</font> for every non-parrying enemy hit. With 5 stacks, you fire rapidly 3 times, each hit <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> non-parrying enemies a short distance.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Arrow Wind</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. When using skill, you get 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Bow's Cry</font>, and you fire three times in a row. Hitting a non-parrying enemy will remove a majority of its <font color="#f9fc00">Damage Absorption</font> effects.
