desc_wuji_CS_jh_ldg05_1=Fires rapidly, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to target. If target is not parrying when hit, they will suffer <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font>.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Arrow Wind</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Extends duration of <font color="#f9fc00">stiffness</font> by 1 second. If this skill is interrupted, the enemy that interrupted it will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>.
