desc_wuji_CS_jh_slbwj03_1=When being attacked, deal 36 damage to the attacker. (The damage is affected by internal and external strength.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Divine Punishment</font>: During <font color="#FFAE00">New Moon</font> period, when being attacked, there is a chance to inflict the attacker with <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 2 seconds (This effect can only be triggered every 10 seconds)
