desc_wuji_CS_jh_slbwj04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front. <br>If you break target's Parry, attach <font color="#FFAE00">Mystical Dragon Deterrence</font> to target: In 4 seconds, deal 1 to 150 random damage, and cause Stun effect for 1 second. (Parry does not trigger Stun effect)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Divine Punishment</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. After successfully breaking enemy's parry, he will receive an additional 25% damage when being attacked by this skill set within 4 seconds.
