desc_wuji_CS_sl_lhq03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets.<br>Break the enemy's parry to get the <font color="#FFAE00">Divert</font> effect: increasing the External Attack Damage. This effect can be stacked. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Buddha's Rage</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Each stack of skill can knock the enemy off when the enemy's parry is broken, and the knock off height increases as the number of stacks increases.
