desc_wuji_CS_sl_lhq06_1=Enhances Chi effect: <br>When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Divert</font> effect, your attack power increase and inflicts additional damage when attacking. <br>When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Drop the Eyebrow</font> effect, your defense increases. <br>Remove debuffs when casting the skill. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Buddha's Rage</font>: Skill becomes overt move. Deals {@0:伤害包} to nearby enemies and knocks off non-parrying enemies.
