desc_wuji_CS_sl_lzs04_1=A defensive stance. A successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked 3 times. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Telepathy</font>: Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state can reduce target's Internal Skill Conversion by 10 points.
desc_wuji_CS_sl_lzs04_2=A defensive stance. A successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked 4 times. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Telepathy</font>: Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state can reduce target's Internal Skill Conversion by 10 points.
desc_wuji_CS_sl_lzs04_3=A defensive stance. A successful parry will attach <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state: causing Flying Skill to cost extra Flying Skill points, this effect can be stacked 5 times. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Telepathy</font>: Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state can reduce target's Internal Skill Conversion by 10 points.
desc_wuji_CS_sl_lzs06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and attach one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> to it. <br>if target is in the air, he falls to the ground and receives extra damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Telepathy</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. The skill can knock down airborne target regardless of parrying, and deals additional damage.
