desc_wuji_CS_wd_tjq03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. When you break enemies' defense, they will be temporarily unable to use feint moves. <br>If you use this move within 5 seconds of blocking, the period during which the enemy cannot use parries is lengthened. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Inaction</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. If break enemies' parrying successfully, inflict them with <font color="#f9fc00">Skill Disabled</font> for 3 seconds.
