desc_wuji_CS_wd_tjq06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you. <br>If you strike within 5 seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skills. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Inaction</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Skill now can be used in the air. If you use the skill within 5 seconds of a successful block, you can also <font color="#f9fc00">Knock Down</font> enemies without parrying.
