desc_wuji_CS_wd_tjq08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies. <br>This move also steals their self-control abilities. You can drag them to you and knock them into air. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Inaction</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Increases skill effective range by 1 meter.
