desc_wuji_CS_xy_jlsd06_1=When parry successfully, <br>you get <font color="#FFAE00">Raging Flame</font> status: get 3 stacks at most for 60 seconds. And you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using <font color="#f9fc00">Landslide</font>. (Deplete 3 stacks of Raging Flame) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the Deer</font>: If you have less than 3 stacks of Raging Flame state, using the skill will straightly get 3 stacks of Raging Flame state.
