desc_wuji_CS_xy_jlsd06_8=When parry successfully, <br>you get <font color="#FFAE00">Raging Flame</font> status: get 10 stacks at most for 60 seconds. And you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using <font color="#f9fc00">Landslide</font>. (Deplete 3 stacks of Raging Flame) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the Deer</font>: If you have less than 3 stacks of Raging Flame state, using the skill will straightly get 3 stacks of Raging Flame state.
desc_wuji_CS_xy_jlsd06_9=When parry successfully, <br>you get <font color="#FFAE00">Raging Flame</font> status: get 11 stacks at most for 60 seconds. And you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using <font color="#f9fc00">Landslide</font>. (Deplete 3 stacks of Raging Flame) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the Deer</font>: If you have less than 3 stacks of Raging Flame state, using the skill will straightly get 3 stacks of Raging Flame state.
desc_wuji_CS_xy_jlsd07_1=You get <font color="#FFAE00">Skyfall</font> status: reduces damage taken by 10%, the range of attacks in the same set increases 3 meters. Lasts for 10 seconds. <br>You can cast the attack again after 10 seconds, dealing damage to enemies. The lower the enemy's HP, the more damage they will get. You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. After the attack, <font color="#FFAE00">Skyfall</font> status disappears. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the Deer</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. If you have 3 or more stacks of Raging Flame state, using the skill will consume 3 stacks of Raging Flame state to knock down the target.
