desc_CS_jh_lsbm05_1=Power is corrupting, and a blade is hidden behind a smile. After parrying successfully get yourself a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Blade</font> (10 stacks max): Adds damage while casting <font color="#f9fc00">Drastic Measures</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Trick the Heaven</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Start with the Leader</font> (Additional damage is affected by the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Lethal Smile</font>, Melee Damage and stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Blade</font>). The status lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_lsbm05_10=Power is corrupting, and a blade is hidden behind a smile. After parrying successfully get yourself a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Blade</font> (10 stacks max): Adds damage while casting <font color="#f9fc00">Drastic Measures</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Trick the Heaven</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Start with the Leader</font> (Additional damage is affected by the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Lethal Smile</font>, Melee Damage and stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Blade</font>). The status lasts for 15 seconds.
