desc_CS_jh_lsbm07_1=Advance along one path while secretly going along another. The Skills Set’s damage is increased by 10%. <font color="#f9fc00">Trick the Heaven</font> Skill change: There are more flying daggers. Critical Hit Rate is increased by 5%, but the skill range is decreased by 3. Lasts 10 seconds.
