desc_CS_jh_wxjj05_1=Ancient vicissitudes and endless sadness. Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Wood Shield</font> that Absorbs Damage and lasts 8 seconds. Being attacked by targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Flowing Water</font> will activate Wooden Shield and add counter-shock effect, <font color="#f9fc00">stunning</font> the target for 2 seconds.
