desc_CS_jh_wxjj06_1=Rejuvenation and fire in the night. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding targets and grants <font color="#FFAE00">Fireworks</font>, increasing damage. Hit targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Flowing Water</font> draws targets to you.<br>(Your attack will have Yellow Armor status. This skill cannot be used in midair or on the move.)
