desc_CS_jh_yylcd02_1=Do your best to get through the siege. <font color="#FF3030">Right Hand Blade Strike</font> deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies in front.<br>Broken parry targets <font color="#f9fc00">can’t use Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds. Switching to left hand and suffering from Break Defense disperses 2% of Energy.
