desc_CS_jh_yylcd03_1=Heartbroken woman, empty-handed traveler. <font color="#FF3030">Two Hhanded Blade Strike</font> deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. Switching to the left hand when drawing blades <font color="#f9fc00">Silences</font> the non-parry target. Switching to the right hand <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> the non-parry target.<br>Use a Flying Skill in combination with this skill to approach target quickly.
