desc_CS_jh_yylcd04_1=Side chambers floating go to be promoted that can be degrees, absolute domain boundless let alone! <font color="#FF3030">Left Hand Blade Strike</font> deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. Target's that fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. If the last skill was Right Handed, if you Dodge, you will Return Chi.
