desc_CS_jh_yylcd05_1=Cold wind turns the cauldron. <font color="#FF3030">Right Hand Blade Strike</font> deals {@0:伤害包} to surrounding targets.<br>When switching to left hand, non-parry target will be <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 2 seconds. <br>During the skill you are in Light Rage and can’t move.
