desc_CS_jh_yylcd07_1=Attack with a flurry of blades. <font color="#FF3030">Two Hhanded Blade Strike</font> deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. Switching to the left hand for Rage Skill increases <font color="#f9fc00">Damage by 30%</font>, to the right hand - increases <font color="#f9fc00">Critical Hit by 20% and Accuracy by 30%</font>.
