desc_CS_single_cfh_1=Charge into battle! Blow the horn and buffs self and up to 10 teammates within 10 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Array Strike</font> effect: increase <font color="#f9fc00">50% movement speed</font> for 10 seconds. Ignore movement debuffs during effect period. <br>(Players effected by Thunder Array Strike will be unable to receive this effect again for the next 10 minutes) <br>Attacking enemy will cost <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Array Strike</font> and cause the next attack to <font color="#FFAE00">increase damage</font> by 25%.
desc_CS_single_cfh_2=Charge into battle! Blow the horn and buffs self and up to 10 teammates within 10 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Array Strike</font> effect: increase <font color="#f9fc00">50% movement speed</font> for 12 seconds. Ignore movement debuffs during effect period. <br>(Players effected by Thunder Array Strike will be unable to receive this effect again for the next 10 minutes) <br>Attacking enemy will cost <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Array Strike</font> and cause the next attack to <font color="#FFAE00">increase damage</font> by 25%.
desc_CS_single_cfh_3=Charge into battle! Blow the horn and buffs self and up to 10 teammates within 10 meters with <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Array Strike</font> effect: increase <font color="#f9fc00">50% movement speed</font> for 15 seconds. Ignore movement debuffs during effect period. <br>(Players effected by Thunder Array Strike will be unable to receive this effect again for the next 10 minutes) <br>Attacking enemy will cost <font color="#FFAE00">Thunder Array Strike</font> and cause the next attack to <font color="#FFAE00">increase damage</font> by 25%.
desc_CS_single_cyj_1=Pierce the clouds. Shoots up an arrow to the sky and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 6 meters. Skill can <font color="#f9fc00">Shoot Down</font> aerial targets within range. Launched arrow leaves 5 meter <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wind</font> area for 5 seconds: Enemies who will try to leave the area will be unable to use Flying Skills for 3 seconds.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_single_cyj_2=Pierce the clouds. Shoots up an arrow to the sky and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 6 meters. Skill can <font color="#f9fc00">Shoot Down</font> aerial targets within range. Launched arrow leaves 5 meter <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wind</font> area for 6 seconds: Enemies who will try to leave the area will be unable to use Flying Skills for 3 seconds.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_single_cyj_3=Pierce the clouds. Shoots up an arrow to the sky and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 6 meters. Skill can <font color="#f9fc00">Shoot Down</font> aerial targets within range. Launched arrow leaves 5 meter <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Wind</font> area for 7 seconds: Enemies who will try to leave the area will be unable to use Flying Skills for 3 seconds.<br>This skill cannot be used in the air.
desc_CS_single_hyxj_1=Hide the intention of killing Throws a trap within 8 meters. When it is activated, non-parry targets in the range are <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds. The traps continues to damage enemies within the range every second and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> to enemies on the ground: Slows down by 10% and <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for 5 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times. After there are 5 <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> stacks, <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> is cleared and the enemy is <font color="#f9fc00">Silenced</font> for 3 seconds. (<font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> cannot be applied during that time). Actively leaving the trap area will clear all <font color="#FFAE00">sticky oil</font><br>The trap hiding period is 20 seconds, and the trap will exist for 10 seconds after triggering.
desc_CS_single_hyxj_2=Hide the intention of killing Throws a trap within 8 meters. When it is activated, non-parry targets in the range are <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds. The traps continues to damage enemies within the range every second and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> to enemies on the ground: Slows down by 10% and <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for 5 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times. After there are 5 <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> stacks, <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> is cleared and the enemy is <font color="#f9fc00">Silenced</font> for 3 seconds. (<font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> cannot be applied during that time). Actively leaving the trap area will clear all <font color="#FFAE00">sticky oil</font><br>The trap hiding period is 20 seconds, and the trap will exist for 12 seconds after triggering.
desc_CS_single_hyxj_3=Hide the intention of killing Throws a trap within 8 meters. When it is activated, non-parry targets in the range are <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds. The traps continues to damage enemies within the range every second and inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> to enemies on the ground: Slows down by 10% and <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for 5 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times. After there are 5 <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> stacks, <font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> is cleared and the enemy is <font color="#f9fc00">Silenced</font> for 3 seconds. (<font color="#FFAE00">Sticky Oil</font> cannot be applied during that time). Actively leaving the trap area will clear all <font color="#FFAE00">sticky oil</font><br>The trap hiding period is 20 seconds, and the trap will exist for 15 seconds after triggering.
desc_CS_single_sjjz_1=Battle formation, soldiers! Activate Shenji Array. Clear most non-controlling debuffs for up to 10 Shenji Camp teammates within 10 meters (effected players will be unable to trigger this effect again for 10 minutes). Also all nearby Shenji Camp teammates will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Shenji Defense</font>: Increase 2% external defense, can be stacked 10 times, lasts 15 seconds.
desc_CS_single_sjjz_2=Battle formation, soldiers! Activate Shenji Array. Clear most non-controlling debuffs for up to 10 Shenji Camp teammates within 10 meters (effected players will be unable to trigger this effect again for 10 minutes). Also all nearby Shenji Camp teammates will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Shenji Defense</font>: Increase 3% external defense, can be stacked 10 times, lasts 15 seconds.
desc_CS_single_sjjz_3=Battle formation, soldiers! Activate Shenji Array. Clear most non-controlling debuffs for up to 10 Shenji Camp teammates within 10 meters (effected players will be unable to trigger this effect again for 10 minutes). Also all nearby Shenji Camp teammates will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Shenji Defense</font>: Increase 5% external defense, can be stacked 10 times, lasts 15 seconds.
