desc_CS_sjy_dkd04_1=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Calculated Advance</font>: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font> for 6 seconds. Up to 3 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd04_2=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Calculated Advance</font>: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font> for 7 seconds. Up to 4 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd04_3=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Calculated Advance</font>: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font> for 8 seconds. Up to 4 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd04_4=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Calculated Advance</font>: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font> for 9 seconds. Up to 5 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd04_5=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Calculated Advance</font>: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font> for 10 seconds. Up to 5 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd04_6=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Calculated Advance</font>: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font> for 12 seconds. Up to 6 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
