desc_CS_sjy_klbx01_1=Dragon force. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When you have only 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>, can <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font> targets with a final blow. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
