desc_CS_sjy_klbx02_1=Body like feather. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies withing 6 meters in front of you.<br>Hitting non-parry targets will grant you <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>. When you have only 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Fierce Dragon Moonlock</font> can Airborne non-parry target. (If you continuously hit the same non-parry enemy within 10 seconds, only 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font> can be triggered). <br>Cast on the ground only.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
