desc_CS_sjy_klbx03_1=Dragon and pearl. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. When you break enemies' parry, they get inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Disarmed</font> for 3 seconds. After that using other skills Reduce Damage by 60% (gradually recovers in 3 seconds.) <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
