desc_CS_sjy_klbx04_1=Stir clouds. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. The 1st skill attack <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks back</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font> the non-parry target. After that spear will <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font> the non-parry targets. You're in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state when casting. <br>Your movement speed is greatly increased and you can move freely, but you cannot use Flying Skills.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
