desc_CS_sjy_klbx05_1=Turn the river. You enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> for 5 seconds: When being attacked by the enemy while in parry, can trigger <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>, but no <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font>. <br>Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increase the number of skills to increase counterattack damage.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
