desc_CS_sjy_klbx08_9=Mad dragon dances. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
desc_Clone004_xinzhongtian_02_01_1=<s>
desc_Clone004_xinzhongtian_03_01_1=Earthworm's Tremor
desc_NPC_sjy_dkd01_1=Ravaging wars and chaos Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_NPC_sjy_dkd02_1=Every Bush and Tree looks like an Enemy. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters . When you break enemies' parry, they get inflicted with Terrified: Cannot use skill within 3 seconds.
desc_NPC_sjy_dkd03_1=Beat the grass to scare snakes. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 5 meters and slow down non-parry targets and inflicts them with 1 stack of Battle Will.
desc_NPC_sjy_dkd04_1=Killing Breath Everywhere Grants Calculated Advance: When successfully parrying an enemy attack, you can accumulate Battle Will for 6 seconds. Up to 3 stacks. Additional effects will be obtained when you release Golden Blade Iron Horse and Win with Surprise.
desc_NPC_sjy_dkd06_1=Wait While Your Opponent Exhausts Themselves. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. Hit non-parry targets will be inflicted with 1 stack of Battle Will and get Paralyzed for 3 seconds.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx01_1=Dragon force. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>When you have only 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>, can <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font> targets with a final blow. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx01_hide_1=Angry dragon. Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If they don't parry, they are <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font>. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a spear is equipped. Wielding a staff inflicts 70% damage.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx02_1=Body like feather. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies withing 6 meters in front of you.<br>Hitting non-parry targets will grant you <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>. When you have only 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Fierce Dragon Moonlock</font> can Airborne non-parry target. (If you continuously hit the same non-parry enemy within 10 seconds, only 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Surprise Return</font> can be triggered).
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx03_1=Dragon and pearl. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. When you break enemies' parry, they get inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Disarmed</font> for 3 seconds. After that using other skills Reduce Damage by 60% (gradually recovers in 3 seconds.)
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx04_1=Stir clouds. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. The 1st skill attack <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks back</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font> the non-parry target. After that spear will <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font> the non-parry targets. You're in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> state when casting. <br>Your movement speed is greatly increased and you can move freely, but you cannot use Flying Skills.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx05_1=Turn the river. You enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> for 5 seconds: When being attacked by the enemy while in parry, can trigger <font color="#f9fc00">Surprise Return</font>, and <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font> non-parry enemy. <br>Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increase the number of skills to increase counterattack damage.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx05_hide_1=Turn the river. You enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> for 5 seconds: When being attacked by the enemy while in parry, can trigger <font color="#f9fc00">Surprise Return</font>, and <font color="#f9fc00">Airborne</font> non-parry enemy. <br>Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increase the number of skills to increase counterattack damage.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx06_1=Squeeze my lizard. Slap enemy with <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Mace</font> and deal {@0:伤害包} damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for non-parry target for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Shoot Down</font> aerial non-parry targets.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx07_1=Wounded dragon screamed. You accumulate energy and scream: When your HP is higher than or equal to 50%, 30% of the current HP will be consumed after the scream to obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Howl</font> status: Get 50 points of Rage and increase the damage of your skills by 25% for 10 seconds; <br>When the percentage of your own HP is lower than 50%, 50% of the current Energy will be consumed after the scream to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> status: Recover 80% of lost of HP and Energy, but the damage received during the period is increased by 100%. When a lethal attack is received, you will die directly. After 8 seconds, HP and Energy will recover to <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> state before the start.
desc_NPC_sjy_klbx08_1=Mad dragon dances. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg01_1=The sound of the spring breeze wake up. Rotate the jabs and kick the kicks, causing the {@0:damage package} to the selected target. <br> (This move can be used to quickly close to the opponent)
desc_Npc_jh_fbg02_1=Micro-cold, the hills are greeted but greeted. Launch a surprise attack with the stick focusing on the enemy's weakness, dealing {@0:damage package} to the enemy within 15m and the hit chance of it is extremely high(correct hit probability substantially). <br> Itself in the <font color="#FFAE00">"storm"</font> state, the move into the palm of the law, to combat a wider range.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg02_hide_1=Micro-cold, the hills are greeted but greeted. Condensate pincer, palm wind on the front of the enemy within 15 meters caused by {@0:damage package}, and to the parry of the enemy to add <font color="#FFAE00">"storm"</font> state: <font color="#f9fc00">Decrease by</font> 50% for 5 sec.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg03_1=Bamboo Cane and Straw Shoes. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. When you break enemies' parry, they get inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Poetic</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Seal Skills</font> when attacked for 1 second.<br>Itself in the <font color="#FFAE00">Chaotic Storm</font> state, the move into the palm of the law, to combat a wider range.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg03_hide_1=Bamboo sticks mans shoes light victory horse. Jumped to the body, the legs split Huashan, leg strength on the front of the enemy caused by {@0:damage package}, if the successful removal of the enemy parry, then make it a short <font color="#f9fc00">set</font> , 5 seconds to gradually restore the speed of movement.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg03_hide_sky_1=Bamboo sticks mans shoes light victory horse. Virtual strokes, broken defense caused double damage, palm, add BUFF
desc_Npc_jh_fbg04_1=Mo listen to the forest to play the sound of leaves, why Yin Xiao and Xu line. Rotary dance stick, stand ape stand, so that their own into the <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin Xiao Xu line"</font> state: Successfully attack the enemy attack, their own <font color="#FFAE00">"Yin Xiao"</font> : 5 seconds once again successfully attack the enemy attack, can break its offensive, to fight back, <font color="#f9fc00">repel the</font> range of 5 meters within the enemy did not ward off a short distance and make it <font color="#f9fc00">unconscious</font> 1.5 seconds, return time 30 seconds. <br> (Counter to the effective range of 5 meters, the tyrants are invalid, can be shuffled restraint. Process for the counter state <font color="#f9fc00">thereof yellow Pa.</font> Increase the number of moves, can increase counterattack damage)
desc_Npc_jh_fbg04_hide_1=Mo listen to the forest to play the sound of leaves, why Yin Xiao and Xu line. Counterattack around the enemy, repuls and short dizziness
desc_Npc_jh_fbg05_1=The turmoil is uncertain, Qiankun. You enter the state of <font color="#FFAE00">Chaotic Storm</font>, and the long stick causes External Damage to the enemy hit in the process of <font color="#FFAE00">flying out</font> Damage.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Chaotic Storm</font>: Unable to use weapons, but can use following Skills: <font color="#f9fc00">Mountain Sunset, Bamboo Cane and Straw Shoes, Misty Rain</font> range becomes longer and the effect becomes stronger, lasts 10 seconds; <br>The long stick spins to selected area to form <font color="#FFAE00">Wave Column</font>: The creation of the stick will instantly <font color="#f9fc00">Draw</font> the non-parry enemies within 8 meters to the center of the stick, and <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills<font color="#f9fc00"> /font>, and make Continuous Damage. The stick can continue to use the moves during the <font color="#f9fc00">Misty Rain, Chaotic Storm</font> to retract the long stick. <br>You have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when casting the skill.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg05_hide_1=The storm will be determined to set, unwilling to stir up trouble with the wind. Standing to stare, take the stick of the momentum, the internal force cited, to recover the <font color="#FFAE00">"storm gang Gang"</font> , to reduce the moves <font color="#f9fc00">[storm]</font> 5 seconds back to the time, while clearing their own <font color="#FFAE00">"storm"</font> state; <br> Long stick in the process of <font color="#FFAE00">flying back</font> , hit the enemy without parry to <font color="#f9fc00">set the body for</font> 2 seconds; <br><font color="#f9fc00">(Yellow Pa body</font> itself in a state of the display moves)
desc_Npc_jh_fbg06_1=Who’s scared? A Mino misty rain Ren Pingsheng. Vacated pointers, force shovel, on the selected target caused by {@0:damage package}, and <font color="#f9fc00">set</font> the enemy did not parry the enemy 3 seconds. <br> Their own in the <font color="#FFAE00">"storm"</font> state, the move can also be displayed on hand, combat distance farther.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg06_hide_1=Who’s scared? A Mino misty rain Ren Pingsheng. Vacated pointers, draw days instantaneous palm, on the selected target caused by {@0:damage package}, and to the parry of the enemy to add <font color="#FFAE00">"misty rain"</font> state: <font color="#f9fc00">Steady</font> 1 second after the <font color="#f9fc00">fly</font> . <br> Cast the move can also be picked up the stick, while clearing their own <font color="#FFAE00">"storm"</font> state.
desc_Npc_jh_fbg07_1=Looking back at the bleak place, go back, no rain nor sunny. Beat up, pick up the enemy, the selected target caused by {@0:damage package}.
desc_Npc_jh_fbgf04_hide_1=Mo listen to the forest to play the sound of leaves, why Yin Xiao and Xu line. Counterattack around the enemy, repuls and short dizziness
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies 5 meters in front of you. <br>When you break the targets' defense, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds and receive 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Skeleton</font>. <br>(Reign of the World must be used to inflict Skeleton.)
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>Reduces the unparried target's movement speed by 5% for 3 seconds. When using the skill, you will summon <font color="#FFAE00">Water and Moon Dreamland</font>, which <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> the enemies within 5 meters after 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets 5 meters in front of you. Inflicts 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Skeleton</font> to upparried targets upon hit. <br>(Reign of the World must be used to inflict Skeleton.)
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc05_1=Parrying will inflict 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Skeleton</font> to the target. <br>Each stack reduces the target's movement speed by 4% for 7 seconds. Can stack up to 3 times.
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemies within 6 meters. <br>Each attack of this skill consumes 1 stack of the target's <font color="#FFAE00">Skeleton</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> it for 2 seconds. <br>(Get yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and able to use Flying Skills while casting)
desc_Npc_jh_mzmyc07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets 5 meters in front of you. Consumes 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Skeleton</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> the upparried targets. <br>(Get yourself Yellow Armor)
desc_Npc_jh_qxz01_1=Evil Dragon Tangle. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
desc_Npc_jh_qxz02_1=Flying Fish Whirl. Moves to the selected area, <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> targets within 5 meters and deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Npc_jh_qxz03_1=Storm Sharkbite. Continuously <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks back</font> targets within 15 meters and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>You have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> when casting the skill.
desc_Npc_jh_qxz04_1=Sudden News. Deals {@0:damage package} to enemies within 5 meters in front.<br>Hit <font color="#f9fc00">Collapse</font> enemies to make them<font color="#f9fc00">Silence</font>3 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_qxz05_1=The electric eel kills. You enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> for 5 seconds: When attacked during parry, can interrupt enemy skill and launch a counterattack. <br>Counterattack has a range of 20 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint.
desc_Npc_jh_qxz06_1=The demon fish hidden. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 2 seconds. <br>.<font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> targets debuffed with <font color="#FFAE00">Whale Swallowing</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_qxz07_1=Whale Swallowing Power. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. Breaking the enemies' defense will cause them to be unable to parry for 3 seconds and will inflict <font color="#FFAE00">Whale Swallowing</font> which reduces their speed by 80% for 3 seconds. While active, striking targets with <font color="#f9fc00">Hiding Demon Fish</font> will cause them to be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font>. <br>When the enemy's defense is successfully broken, the Return Chi time of this Skill will be reduced by 2 seconds.
