desc_fwz_cloth_507b_1=After my teacher was drunk, he slept in hammock. What a bum. The wind and showers are frightening, and the falling flowers and snow are so vast.
desc_fwz_cloth_507g_1=The cloud revolved with the singing of green jade, and the snow circled red jade sleeves.
