desc_fwz_weapon_416_1=Thousands of drums are thundering, and thousands of flags are on fire. The sun wheel stays in the frost and the moon soul hangs like carved bow.
desc_fwz_weapon_510_1=The south wind swept away dust, and went west to Chang'an to the side of the sun.
