desc_skill_clone036_mtx_02_1=Charge on the ground for 3 seconds, causing moderate damage to all players within 20 meters in front, and Stun players with Offended state for 2 seconds, and a hit to clear 1 layer of Offended.
desc_skill_clone036_mtx_03_1=After charging for 3 seconds, it will knock the player within 4 meters Airborne and cause a moderate amount of damage. If the player has Offended state, 50% of the Energy and all Rage values will be cleared. Clear All Offended stacks
desc_skill_clone036_yw_01_1=Add the Invitation to the current target, and the player's damage in this status will be increased by 50%, and the Pay Homage skill will be obtained. If the effect of Pay Homage remains on you for 20 seconds, inflicts spiked damage on you.
desc_skill_clone036_yw_02_1=Causes a lot of damage to all players within 20 meters ahead. If you have 2 levels of Arrogance state, you will add a Bleeding state to the target. The Bleeding state enemies will lose 5% HP per second for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_clone036_yw_03_1=Inflict a small amount of damage to the target, and generate two circular Chi areas with a radius of 5 meters on the field. Players in the area add a Dazed state. Area lasts for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone040_cj_01_1=Inflicts Silent state to all targets. The Silent state starts countdown in 3 seconds. Within 5 seconds, if the player uses skill, moves, or uses Flying Skills, Cui Ji releases his Sword Qi to directly kill the target in seconds. In this state, the player cannot add any moves to avoid death and HP recovery buffs. At the same time, after Cui Ji casts the skill, within 8 seconds, he will Concentration and not move. And after the end of this state will enter a short Exhausted state, and when takes damage within 10 seconds, will receive an additional 50% damage. This skill does not trigger the Concentration state.
desc_skill_clone040_cj_02_1=Charge up for 3 seconds to add a Fire of Sorrow state to all targets in the range. In the Fire of Sorrow state, Sword Chi will form on the target's head every two seconds. The sword energy will drop after 1 second after it is formed, and it will be around the drop. All targets within 2 meters lose 15% HP. This skill triggers the Concentration effect when it hits the target.
desc_skill_clone040_cj_03_1=Instantly add 8 seconds of Sword Chant to self, and all targets within 50 meters of surrounding area will add 7-second chanting state. In this state, the target will be forcibly stunned for 2 seconds, Reduce Damage by 90% during the state, and movement speed will be reduced by 50%. If you force a move during this period, the effect will be extended for 20 seconds, and at the end of Cui Ji's Sword Chant, you will suffer a 50% loss of HP. At the same time, when the Cui Ji Sword Chant ends, he will fall into a state of Exhausted, and when he is damaged within 10 seconds, the damage will double. This skill will trigger the concentration effect at the end of the Sword Chant.
desc_skill_clone040_cj_04_1=Accumulate power for 5 seconds, throw Sword Chi to the front 120° fan-shaped area, and cause a lot of damage, and add 10 seconds of Broken Tendons state. In this state, the movement speed is reduced by 50%. This skill triggers the Concentration effect when it hits the target.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_02_1=Charge for 2 seconds to Bite the current target. If the target have not blocked, a Strong Poison state is added. In this state, items cannot be used, and the HP recovery effect is reduced by 80%. If there is a Mist Concealment-Shield state, it will be added to all targets within 5 meters of the target at the same time.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_02_a_1=Charge for 2 seconds, Bite the current target and add a Strong Poison state. In this state, items cannot be used, and the blood recovery effect is reduced by 80%. Each attack will cause 60% loss of HP to players within 10 meters, and will induce Spread state. If there is a Mist Concealment-Shield state, it will be added to all targets within 5 meters of the target at the same time.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_03_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, causing a lot of damage to all targets in front of you, and after knocking back, if you have Mist Concealment-Shield state, you will be Stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_03_a_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, causing a lot of damage to all targets in front of you, and after knocking back, if you have Mist Concealment-Shield state, you will be Stunned for 3 seconds.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_04_1=Directly spit poison to 5 random nearby targets. After the venom is spit out, a Venomous Pond with a radius of 5 meters will be formed on the bottom of the target's feet. The damage of all hostile targets in the poison pool is reduced by 50%, and most of the move buff effects are cleared. If you have a Mist Concealment-Shield state, the Venomous Pond will cause 10% HP loss to the target every second. This loss ignores all Defense effects.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_04_a_1=Directly spit poison to 9 random nearby targets. After the Venom is spit out, a Venomous Pond with a radius of 5 meters will be formed on the bottom of the target's feet. In the Venomous Pond, a Cold Poison state will be added to all targets for 10 seconds, the Damage will be reduced by 50%, and the probability of Critical Hits will be reduced. 90% of the Critical Hit damage is reduced by 100%, Flying Skills are forbidden, and most of the move buff effects are cleared. If you have a Mist Concealment-Shield state, the Venomous Pond will cause 10% HP loss to the target every second. This loss ignores all Defense effects.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_05_1=Charge up for 5 seconds, stand up, pat forward heavily, cause 90% loss of HP to all targets in the area (including the snakes summoned), and add 10 seconds of Paralysis to the target. In this state, target is Silenced. If Flying Skills is used forcibly in this state, it will cause 5% loss of HP. If there is a Mist Concealment-Shield state, it will cause an additional 50% loss of HP that ignores the defense on the original base.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_05_a_1=Charge up for 1 second, stand up and slap forward heavily. If the target in the area is on the ground, it will cause 90% loss of HP. If it has a Frost Shadow shield state, it will be directly killed.
desc_skill_clone040_gsx_01_1=Charge up for 5 seconds. If you are attacked more than 10 times during the period, you will get a post-action state and will be Immune to 80% of Damage within 10 seconds. When the state is over, it will inflict moderate damage to all surrounding targets. If it you not attacked more than 10 times during the charging period, it will cause a small amount of Damage to all surrounding targets.
desc_skill_clone040_gsx_02_1=Charge up for 2 seconds to cause a lot of Damage to all surrounding targets. The damage can be blocked. If it is not blocked, Starlight state is added. Damage is reduced by 90%, and 2% of HP and Energy are lost per second.
desc_skill_clone040_gsx_03_1=After accumulating power for 5 seconds, 4 players will be randomly picked, causing 30% HP loss to the picked player. If there are other players within 5 meters of the picked target, the picked player will be killed directly, and Toxic Fog will be released on the soles of other players’ feet. Within 20 seconds, within the range of the Toxic Fog, the hit is reduced by 90%, and 5% HP loss is caused every second.
desc_skill_clone040_gsx_05_1=Instantly releases Coldness within 10 meters of the surrounding area. The area exists for 10 seconds. In the Coldness area, the hostile target loses 1% HP per second, and has a certain chance of breaking Meridians and Fall Down.
desc_skill_clone040_gsx_06_1=desc_skill_clone040_gsx_06_1
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_01_1=Add a detection buff to the target for 5 seconds. Buff disappears if the target is moving or using skills. If the target does not meet the conditions, the target is Stunned.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_02_1=Add a buff to the target for 6 seconds. After the buff disappears, a damage circle (echelon distance) of 3 meters is created at the feet of the target.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_03_1=Multi-stage Instant Kill damage, requires more than 6 people to gather and share.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_06_1=Causes one time Damage, can block to reduce the Damage received.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_07_1=Damage weakens with distance and decreases when approaching.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_08_1=Freezes the current target, deducts HP and Energy continuously. Need other players to deal damage to break the Ice Cube.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_09_1=Continuous casting. Various small balls refreshed on the site, and the small balls move towards Lord Qin. After each ball is absorbed, the damage of Lord Qin's reading skill increases. About 8 balls begin to damage (see the actual the value).
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_10_1=Knock the target player into the air and release the skill in a straight line to the target player. At the same time, a buff appears on the player. When the buff disappears, multiple people need to share the damage. Players need to enter the skill range, otherwise they will be Instant Killed in seconds. At the same time, an NPC appeared on the edge of the field to release straight-line range skills to the player. Players who hit will be buffed, and they may be Stunned by using skills or Flying Skills.
desc_skill_clone040_lqk_001_1=desc_skill_clone040_lqk_001_1
desc_skill_clone040_lqk_002_1=desc_skill_clone040_lqk_002_1
desc_skill_clone040_lqk_003_1=desc_skill_clone040_lqk_003_1
desc_skill_clone040_lqk_004_1=desc_skill_clone040_lqk_004_1
desc_skill_clone040_lqk_005_1=desc_skill_clone040_lqk_005_1
desc_skill_clone040_lqk_006_1=desc_skill_clone040_lqk_006_1
desc_skill_clone040_sw_01_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, knock back all targets within 20 meters, and cause a lot of damage. If the target is too close, it will cause 50% HP loss.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_01_a_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, knock back all targets within 20 meters, and cause a lot of damage. If the target is too close, it will cause 50% HP loss.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_02_1=Charge up for 5 seconds to cause a lot of damage to the current target. If it hits less than 3 people around (not including 3 people), the current Star Blast state will be cleared and the HP will return to 1.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_02_a_1=Accumulate power for 5 seconds to cause a lot of damage to the current target, and add a Starlight state to the target. After 3 seconds, every time you attack the target, it will randomly connect with 2 nearby targets. The player will continue to connect while using the skill. After connecting for 5 seconds, all targets will suffer 20% HP loss, and the connections will be stacked. Each time they are stacked, they will be counted separately. This state will clear most Skills Buffs.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_03_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, cause a small amount of damage to all surrounding targets, and add a Starfall state. Every time you use a skill in the Starfall state, you will lose HP.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_03_a_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, cause a small amount of damage to all surrounding targets, and add a Starfall state. Every time you use a skill in the Starfall state, you will lose HP.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_04_1=Inflicts 20%+ of HP loss to all surrounding targets. If the target is in Starfall state, it will be stunned for 5 seconds and suffer 5% HP loss every 0.5 seconds (this damage ignores defense but is not Deadly).
desc_skill_clone040_sw_04_a_1=Inflicts 20%+ of HP loss to all surrounding targets. If the target is in Starfall state, it will be stunned for 5 seconds and suffer 5% HP loss every 0.5 seconds (this damage ignores defense but is not Deadly).
desc_skill_clone040_sw_05_1=Guide for 10 seconds. In this state, damage taken decreased by 80%. If attacked after 3 seconds, you will enter Counterattack mode and cause Damage to the surrounding area. Locks two targets every second, chases the target with a chain, causing a lot of damage to the target and all targets within 5 meters of the target, and clear the Star Blast state.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_05_a_1=Guide for 10 seconds. In this state, damage taken decreased by 80%. If attacked after 3 seconds, you will enter Counterattack mode and cause Damage to the surrounding area. Locks two targets every second, chases the target with a chain, causing a lot of damage to the target and all targets within 5 meters of the target, and clear the Star Blast state. This state will clear most Buffs.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_06_1=After getting close to the Star Chain - Main player, you can use this skill to cancel the connection between the two.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_07_1=Hit causes 0.5% HP loss.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_08_1=Lock the target to deal damage.
desc_skill_clone040_wuy_001_1=Damage dealt in front sector.
desc_skill_clone040_wuy_002_1=Damage dealt in front.
desc_skill_clone040_wuy_003_1=Damage dealt to surrounding area.
desc_skill_clone040_wuy_004_1=Damage dealt to enemies around.
desc_skill_clone040_wuy_005_1=Damage dealt in a ring.
desc_skill_clone040_wuy_006_1=Adds debuff.
desc_skill_hfdw_001_1=Players within 5 meters deal damage, and their Damage Reflection effect will be increased for 10 seconds (Reflect 100% damage).
desc_skill_hfdw_003_1=Hit causes a lot of HP damage. Player jumping can be evaded.
desc_skill_hfdw_004_1=Hit the player to cause damage, Knocked Back and stun the player for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_hfdw_005_1=Causes HP damage to the player. When the final strike hits the ground, a target within 3 meters with the player as the center of the circle deals one round of Damage.
desc_skill_hfdw_006_1=Damage Skill
desc_skill_item_jianghu_gh_1=Increases the conversion rate of Internal Cultivation by 100%, increase the conversion rate of Chi by 150%, and increase the conversion rate of Experience by 100%.
desc_skill_item_jianghu_zh_1=In the Forbidden Instance, adds 30 points for all attributes to you and the allies within 20 meters (valid for Forbidden Instances only).
desc_skill_jmh_001_1=Continuous casting. After hitting the player, the player will be Knocked down if he uses Flying Skills.
desc_skill_jmh_002_1=After hitting the player, adds Ignite effect to the player (1% HP loss per second for 20 seconds).
desc_skill_jmh_003_1=Stuns after hitting the player if the player has Ignite effect. Causes an explosion effect and removes Ignite.
desc_skill_jmh_004_1=Ignores the block, drags the player to your side to cause Damage and inflicts Slow.
