desc_skill_lzy_scf_jxlr001_1=Spin from standing until the body spins downwards, and then slowly stand up with the spin.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_jxlr002_1=Knocked Back blocking enemies within the skill range in front, Airborne non-blocking enemies.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_jxlr003_1=Throws targets ahead. Attack and Defense both decrease 20%.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_jxlr004_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, slam the ground and cause a lot of Physical Damage to enemies within 10 meters of the target. The enemy that is hit will be Slowed and unable to use Flying Skills, and all damage will be increased by 50%.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_lsnkb001_1=Casting for 2 seconds. Players within a radius of ten meters get 70% of Max HP damage and Knocked down.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_lsnkb002_1=Causes continuous damage in the area. Your damage in the area increases, and a small amount of HP is restored.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_yz001_1=<s>
desc_skill_lzy_scf_yz002_1=Inflicts damage to all targets within 20 meters around, if the target does not block, it will be Paralyzed and Silenced.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_yz003_1=Inflicts damage to all targets within 20 meters. If the target does not block, it will be pulled to the side, and the Shadow Break state will be added.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_zfkb001_1=Charge for 2 seconds, causing massive damage to all surrounding targets.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_zfkb002_1=Shoots Down targets in the air.
desc_skill_lzy_scf_zfkb003_1=Non-blocking enemies are pulled to the side.
