desc_skill_scf_cf_04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target.<br>The first strike will leave the target <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 3 seconds, while the final strike will affect the target with <font color="#f9fc00">Closer</font>.<br>（When the target has 3 stacjks of <font color="#FFAE00">Tai Xuan</font the Closer effect will be negated)
