desc_tiandifeng01_guj001_1=Within 10 meters, generate a fire ring under the target's feet
desc_tiandifeng01_guj002_1=<s>
desc_tiandifeng02_guj001_1=Sword Chi flies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets.
desc_tiandifeng02_guj002_1=20 meters ring pull
desc_tiandifeng02_guj003_1=<s>
desc_tiandifeng02_guj004_1=<s>
desc_tiandifeng03_guj001_1=Twin hammers stun all targets in an area of effect for 20 seconds. If boss is attacked, the effect is canceled.
desc_tiandifeng03_guj002_1=Charge this skillfor 3 seconds to deal massive damage. Target who fails to block will be thrown, and within the next 10 seconds, every skill target uses will result in 1% loss of HP.
desc_tiandifeng03_guj003_1=Charge for 3 seconds to unleash a twin hammer attack that deals massive damage and knocks down targets within 8 meters.
desc_tiandifeng04_guj001_1=Targets within 5 meters receive minor damage. For 20 seconds, their blocks are broken, and they receive the Follow Up a Victory effect. They lose 5% HP every second for 10 seconds. Knocked Back the player with the last 1 hit.
desc_tiandifeng04_guj002_1=Causes average damage to nearby players. Lose 5% HP each second for 10 seconds. Clear the effect by having another player click on you.
desc_tiandifeng04_guj003_1=Gather power 2s. Damage done to targets nearby increases 50% and gives user Singing Sword Song effect. Each time struck by an attack or internal skill, there is a chance to recover 1% HP.
desc_tiandifeng04_guj004_1=Gather power 3s. While gathering, you are unable to use flying skills. After power is gathered, deal great damage to all targets within 8m. Causes 20s Dazed effect if target is not parrying (similar to Intoxication). (If in Yin Yang State, deals damage; no extra effect)
