desc_wuji_CS_em_ynjf04_1=Stabs target and knocks him/her into air. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Can stab twice continuously, and each attack will grant 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> to yourself. <br>(This move can only attack target in air.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Fantasy Moon</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage and their range by 5 meters.
