desc_wuji_CS_em_ynjf07_1=When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> status, for a period of time you will be immune to damage of being struck down, thrown into the air and knocked down.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Fantasy Moon</font>: When you have Hidden Energy, you can parry successfully and you can get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Light as Swallow - Fantasy Moon</font> effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Attack Accuracy</font> increased by 6%. Lasts 10 seconds. Up to 5 stacks.
desc_wuji_CS_em_ynjf07_2=When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> status, for a period of time you will be immune to damage of being struck down, thrown into the air and knocked down.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Fantasy Moon</font>: When you have Hidden Energy, you can parry successfully and you can get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Light as Swallow - Fantasy Moon</font> effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Attack Accuracy</font> increased by 6%. Lasts 10 seconds. Up to 5 stacks.
desc_wuji_CS_em_ynjf07_3=When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> status, for a period of time you will be immune to damage of being struck down, thrown into the air and knocked down.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Fantasy Moon</font>: When you have Hidden Energy, you can parry successfully and you can get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Light as Swallow - Fantasy Moon</font> effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Attack Accuracy</font> increased by 6%. Lasts 10 seconds. Up to 5 stacks.
desc_wuji_CS_em_ynjf07_4=When you have <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Energy</font> status, for a period of time you will be immune to damage of being struck down, thrown into the air and knocked down.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Fantasy Moon</font>: When you have Hidden Energy, you can parry successfully and you can get a stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Light as Swallow - Fantasy Moon</font> effect: <font color="#f9fc00">Internal Attack Accuracy</font> increased by 6%. Lasts 10 seconds. Up to 5 stacks.
desc_wuji_CS_gbzp_dgbf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets, consumes 1 stack of the targets' <font color="#FFAE00">Taunt</font> status and prevent them from using feint attack. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the dog</font>: Slightly increases the Skills damage. If the target has <font color="#FFAE00">Instigate</font>, hitting the unparried target reduces its <font color="#f9fc00">Internal and External Defense</font> by 30% for 5 seconds.
