desc_wuji_CS_gbzp_dgbf07_1=Rising from the ground, wield a staff and sends nearby non-parry enemies flying to deal {@0:伤害包} damage; <br>This move puts enemies in the <font color="#FFAE00">Falling</font> state, preventing the targets from jumping. When your HP is less than 50%, ignores the parry and Blows away the target. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the dog</font>: Slightly increase the Skill damage. When the strike is interrupted, you will get <font color="#f9fc00">Decrease damage received</font> by 50% for 6 seconds.
