desc_wuji_CS_gbzp_dgbf08_1=Strike in a crazed frenzy, each swing of the club like that of a madman. This movement deals {@0: 伤害包} damage to enemies within 6 meters;<br>The terminal strike can send non-parry enemies within a six-meter area flying. When your HP is less than 50%, ignores the parry and Blows away the target. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Chase the dog</font>: Slightly increases the Skills damage. Hitting an non-parry enemy will <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying skills</font> for 1 second.
