desc_wuji_CS_jh_myjf03_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Player transforms into a Ghost Shadow: player does not take external skill damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Pierce Shadow</font>: Slightly increases the Skills damage. You get <font color="#FFAE00">Sword Shadow</font> when casting the skill: increase External Damage Reduction Bypass by 15%, Ignore Internal Damage Reduction by 15%, Ignore External Parry by 15%, Ignore Internal Conversion by 15% for 5 seconds. After the move is used, the state of <font color="#FFAE00">Inseparable Shadow</font> is obtained: Internal Attack Accuracy Rate is greatly improved within 5 seconds.
