desc_wuji_CS_jh_myjf06_1=Executing 6 parries successfully grants you the ability to <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font>, which adds the Ghost Shadow effect that reduces damage taken by 75% for 4 seconds. <br>(If you stop parrying, the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> state immediately ends)<br>(Using skills from other sets will clear the Invisible Shadows state.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Pierce Shadow</font>: If the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> status disappears, it will change to <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Shadow</font>: Decrease Damage Received by 25% for 5 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_myjf06_2=Executing 6 parries successfully grants you the ability to <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font>, which adds the Ghost Shadow effect that reduces damage taken by 80% for 4 seconds. <br>(If you stop parrying, the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> state immediately ends)<br>(Using skills from other sets will clear the Invisible Shadows state.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Pierce Shadow</font>: If the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> status disappears, it will change to <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Shadow</font>: Decrease Damage Received by 30% for 5 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_myjf06_3=Executing 6 parries successfully grants you the ability to <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font>, which adds the Ghost Shadow effect that reduces damage taken by 80% for 5 seconds. <br>(If you stop parrying, the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> state immediately ends)<br>(Using skills from other sets will clear the Invisible Shadows state.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Pierce Shadow</font>: If the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> status disappears, it will change to <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Shadow</font>: Decrease Damage Received by 35% for 5 seconds.
