desc_wuji_CS_jh_myjf06_8=Executing 6 parries successfully grants you the ability to <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font>, which adds the Ghost Shadow effect that reduces damage taken by 99% for 7 seconds. <br>(If you stop parrying, the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> state immediately ends)<br>(Using skills from other sets will clear the Invisible Shadows state.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Pierce Shadow</font>: If the <font color="#FFAE00">Vanish</font> status disappears, it will change to <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Shadow</font>: Decrease Damage Received by 60% for 5 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_myjf08_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. Summon <font color="#f9fc00">"Ghost Shadow"</font> around target.<br> <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> will jump and attack target and around enemies with 1-second Rigidity inflicted per attack, up to 5 attacks. <br>The damage done by <font color="#f9fc00">Ghost Shadow</font> increases as the level of this skill increases.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Pierce Shadow</font>: Slightly increases the Skills damage. The range of Skills is increased by 2 meters. You are in Red Super Armor while casting the skill.
