desc_wuji_CS_jh_sjjc05_1=Strong as bear, arrow like meteorite, Xiong Qu hunts a tiger at night technique. Shoot a large number of arrows continuously into the selected area from 8 to 25 meters away, causing {@0: damage packs} to enemies within the range and inflict on the non-parry enemies <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second. At the same time suppress the Collapse enemy, making it impossible to get up. <br>The effect is weaker if the skill is cast in the air. Arrow Rain decreases, Damage Decrease. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Mind and Vision</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Reduce the Return Chi time by 3 seconds, which can also damage the enemy close by.
