desc_wuji_CS_jl_dmssj01_1=A sharp hit. Sword Energy will cause {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in the same row.<br>Targets will be inflicted the effect of <font color="#FFAE00">Choke</font>: they will unable to eat for a certain time period. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Myriad</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The skill becomes single. When the enemy has Choke, the HP and Energy recovery rate is reduced by 40%.
