desc_wuji_CS_jl_dmssj07_1=Sword Energy will deal {@0:伤害包} damage to a target.<br>It will cause constant damage to targets in a radius of 8 m lasting 4 seconds and then targets will be stunned over 3 sec. <br>If targets block or Evades the hit, its cooldown time will be reduced by half.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Myriad</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The range of Injured and Stunned increases to 10 meters.
