desc_wuji_CS_jl_dmssj09_1=Deal {@0: 伤害包} to target.<br>When the target's HP is lower than 24%, the skill will deal double damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Myriad</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. If the target's HP is more than 70% and is non-parry when the move is cast, the Last Hit of Defy the Heaven will knock the target down.
