desc_wuji_CS_jy_xsd02_1=Fierce move, throw a flying claw to catch target, and drag target to your side, and then you chop once against target, deal {@0: 伤害包}. If your attack is parried, you will not be able to use Flying Claw to approach the target. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Execution</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage and the range by 2 meters.
