desc_wuji_CS_jy_xsd03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>At the same time, the skill burns target and makes target take continuous damage. Lasts 6 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Execution</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.
