desc_wuji_CS_jy_xsd07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies. <br>The lower your current HP is, the higher the move damage will be. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Execution</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Hit non-parry targets will be inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Slow down</font> for 5 seconds. The lower your HP is, the stronger the slowing effect will be.
