desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf03_1=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font> between your targets.<br>Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br>At most, this echo continues for 5 rounds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Reduces the Recover time of the move by 5 seconds. This Skill gets quicker. Hit non-parry targets will be inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> duration is increased by 1 second.
desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf03_10=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font> between your targets.<br>Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br>At most, this echo continues for 10 rounds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Reduces the Recover time of the move by 5 seconds. This Skill gets quicker. Hit non-parry targets will be inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> duration is increased by 1 second.
desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf03_11=To execute the ultimate Jade Flute skill, shake your weapon until it emits a sound wave, which <font color="#FFAE00">echoes</font> between your targets.<br>Targets are stunned for 1 second and cannot use Flying Skills for 2 seconds. <br>At most, this echo continues for 10 rounds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Reduces the Recover time of the move by 5 seconds. This Skill gets quicker. Hit non-parry targets will be inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Disable Flying Skills</font> duration is increased by 1 second.
desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf03_12=A master skill of Sir Jade Flute, for this movement you flutter the blade to unleash a sonic wave that <font color="#FFAE00">bounces between</font> enemies;<br>The effective of this is attack damage, 1 second of dizziness, and the inability to use flying skills for 2 seconds.<br>The sound wave can bounce 10 times at most.
