desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf04_1=Your sword and your will are one, and you carry a frigid bearing to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage to the enemy.<br>When you use this move to break the enemy's defense, the target will be paralyzed.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Breaking the enemy's defense Paralyzes and Knocks the target down.
