desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf07_1=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to one enemy.<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a attack direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The skill becomes single. The group moves can be restored after using Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound, and non-parry targets in it will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf07_10=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to one enemy.<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a attack direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The skill becomes single. The group moves can be restored after using Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound, and non-parry targets in it will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
desc_wuji_CS_jz_yxjf07_2=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to one enemy.<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a attack direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The skill becomes single. The group moves can be restored after using Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound, and non-parry targets in it will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
