desc_wuji_CS_slzp_lzs03_1=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Zen Heart</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage and their range to 8 meters.
desc_wuji_CS_slzp_lzs03_10=Use feint to attract overt, attack weakness, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in front.<br>If skill breaks through enemy's parry, it inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">"Incomplete"</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> onto the enemy. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Zen Heart</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage and their range to 10 meters.
