desc_wuji_CS_slzp_lzs05_1=Charging attack, bend your arm like a bow, and then strike like a spring, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, he will be paralyzed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Zen Heart</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. If the target is in <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">Silenced</font>.
desc_wuji_CS_slzp_lzs05_10=Charging attack, bend your arm like a bow, and then strike like a spring, deal {@0:伤害包} to target. If target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Void"</font> state, he will be paralyzed. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Zen Heart</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. If the target is in <font color="#FFAE00">Incomplete</font> state, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">Silenced</font>.
