desc_wuji_CS_slzp_lzs06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target and attach one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Void</font> to it. <br>if target is in the air, he falls to the ground and receives extra damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Zen Heart</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. When your HP is below 50%, the Skill ignores the block and Shoots Down the air targets, and additional damage will be added.
