desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage by consecutively hurling three darts; <br>The attack deals extra damage with each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font>. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Each hit on non-parry target reduces cooldown of Souls haunting foot, Wicked Spirit Blocks the Way by 3 seconds, Soup of Oblivion by 1 second, and <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Back</font> non-parry targets.
