desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt04_1=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a 5 meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage.<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterward will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. <br>The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered. Upgrade hidden weapons skills to increase Burn damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Increases the radius of the trap by 1 meter, and when the trap explodes, it will blow up to 5 non-parry targets within the trigger range.
desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt04_10=Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Gunpowder Trap</font>, which has a 5 meter area of effect and causes enemies who fall into it to suffer explosion damage.<br>Enemies within the trap suffer continuous damage, and if they are debuffed with the <font color="#FFAE00">Wronged Ghost</font> state, they suffer even greater damage per stack of it.<br>Using hidden weapons of this set afterward will add the <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> effect to them for added damage. <br>The trap lasts for 20 seconds and has a 20-second effect once triggered. Upgrade hidden weapons skills to increase Burn damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Increases the radius of the trap by 1 meter, and when the trap explodes, it will blow up to 5 non-parry targets within the trigger range.
