desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt05_1=The Move of Ecstasy. Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. Break parrying successfully and then Poison Gas invaded, which made the target <font color="#FFAE00">"Unconscious"</font>(The effect is like Dizziness) for 3 seconds. <br>Being attacked will interrupt the state of <font color="#FFAE00">Unconscious</font>. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The damage attribute is changed to External Skill, and the time of the Skill Recovery is reduced by 2 seconds.
