desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt06_1=A secret move of the king of the underworld. Hurl the <font color="#FFAE00">Fire and Oil Trap</font>, which has a 5 meter area of effect: <br>The first enemy caught in the trap will be paralyzed for 2 seconds and take attached damage;<br>Affected enemies also have their movement speed reduced by 20% and their Flying Skills are limited. (This debuff cannot be stacked);<br>Affected enemies will also have the <font color="#FFAE00">"Wronged Ghost"</font> debuff added to them, with one stack added each second for a maximum of 20 stacks. <br>(The trap lasts 30 seconds and its effects last 30 seconds when triggered.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Increases the radius of the trap by 1 meter, and Paralyze when up to 5 targets that enter the trap are Silenced for 3 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt07_1=Rains air projectiles on within 15 meters of the target, resulting in {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This skill can be used while moving)<font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Increases the Skill speed, the damage attribute is changed to External Skill. Hitting the non-parry target inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Slow and Disable Flying Skills</font> for 2 seconds. If the target has Wronged Ghost and non-parry, inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1.5 seconds.
