desc_wuji_CS_wdzp_tjq02_1=A charging attack that envelops the enemy and deals {@0:伤害包} damage;<br>If you strike within 5 seconds of successfully parrying, you can send enemies flying. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Incontestable</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. If you have less than 50% of HP, you can cast Skill within 5 seconds after successfully parrying. When you don’t have <font color="#FFAE00">Grappling Force</font>, you will get it.
