desc_wuji_CS_wdzp_tjq06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies.<br>The sheer force of this move grounds any airborne enemies that are close to you. <br>If you strike within 5 seconds of a successful block, your attack will disable the enemy's jump and Flying Skills. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Incontestable</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. The Skill can also be cast in the air. When you cast the Skill 5 in seconds after successfully parrying, non-parry enemy will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds.
