desc_wuji_CS_wdzp_tjq08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies.<br>This move also steals their self-control abilities. You can drag them to you and knock them into air. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Incontestable</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage and their range to 6 meters.
