desc_CS_jh_jyjf04_1=Upon successful parry, you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">Loss of Dragon</font> state. When you use skills of this set, you will deal 20 points of extra external damage (scaling with respect to melee power). The state lasts for 10 seconds.
