desc_CS_jh_lzxss02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 15 meters in front. Successful parry breaking will add to the enemies 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font>: Continuous HP loss within 5 seconds. (The more the stacks, the higher the damage.) <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font> internal injury will be gone over time.
