desc_CS_jh_lzxss04_1=Throw 1 <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Drop</font> to front. It will deal yin damage to the first enemy. If the enemy does not parry, then the enemy will be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 2 seconds and be dragged towards you.
