desc_CS_jh_lzxss05_1=Yourself enter <font color="#f9fc00">Primitive Savage</font> state. Every successful parry will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Boiling Blood</font>. It lasts 8 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times. <br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Boiling Blood</font> state, you can actively use this skill and deal yin damage, with 10% bonus yin damage per hit. (Bonus damage ignores defense.) The more <font color="#FFAE00">Boiling Blood</font> stacks you have, the more bonus damage is. <br>(The changed skill can approach the target quickly with flying skills.)
