desc_CS_jh_wlp03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters in front. When you successfully parry break, you can <font color="#f9fc00">disable their flying skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font> state, you can poison parrying targets: slow down over time in 5 seconds.
