desc_CS_jh_wlp04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters in front. Continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unparried targets. Last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> unparried targets. Use 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font> to execute the skill, you will obtain <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font>。<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Forms</font> state, enemies can not parry within the affected area.
