desc_CS_jh_wlp05_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font> state. At the same time, the skill will become <font color="#f9fc00">Chanting Crane</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font>: Reinforce the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Short Wings</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Super Suspicion</font>. <br>After you use the skill or parry, yourself will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font>: When the chi power appears and disappears, enemies within 5 meters range will suffer 17 points of yang damage. The chi power lasts for 12 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times.
desc_CS_jh_wlp05_10=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font> state. At the same time, the skill will become <font color="#f9fc00">Chanting Crane</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font>: Reinforce the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Short Wings</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Super Suspicion</font>. <br>After you use the skill or parry, yourself will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font>: When the chi power appears and disappears, enemies within 5 meters range will suffer 116 points of yang damage. The chi power lasts for 18 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times.
