desc_CS_ts_tsjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <font color="#f9fc00">Freeze</font> unparried targets for 5 seconds. If the target is attacked, then that will release the target from <font color="#f9fc00">frozen</font> state and add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font> to the target. If the target is in air, then it will <font color="#f9fc00">fall down</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
