desc_CS_ts_tsjf05_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <font color="#f9fc00">Freeze</font> unparried targets for 5 seconds. If the target is attacked, then that will release the target from <font color="#f9fc00">frozen</font> state and add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font> to the target. If the target is in air, then it will <font color="#f9fc00">fall down</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_CS_ts_tsjf06_1=Build an ice wall and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Affected targets in the ice area will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">will not be able to use hidden weapons</font>. The ice wall will exist for 10 seconds, and continuously give <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font>. When the ice wall disappears, targets within the affected area will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked up</font>. Teammates who enter the ice wall area will gain 20% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">movement speed</font> and 20% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy rate</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
