desc_CS_ts_tsjf07_1=Parry to gain one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font>. It can be stacked 10 times. When it reaches 10 stacks, it will release automatically. It will use <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> to freeze yourself, let you be immune against most damages (from players) and controls, and let you be unable to cast skills or move, for 2 seconds. Use the skill to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> stacks, and put it into a cool down of 20 seconds. <br>Use skills from other sets will remove this state.
desc_CS_ts_tsjf07_2=Parry to gain one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font>. It can be stacked 10 times. When it reaches 10 stacks, it will release automatically. It will use <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> to freeze yourself, let you be immune against most damages (from players) and controls, and let you be unable to cast skills or move, for 2 seconds. Use the skill to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> stacks, and put it into a cool down of 18 seconds. <br>Use skills from other sets will remove this state.
