desc_CS_ts_tsjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Instantly <font color="#f9fc00">freeze</font> the target within 6 meters. Last hit will break the ice and <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> the target. <br>(While using the skill, you can't move and have yellow armor.)
desc_CS_ts_tsjf08_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Instantly <font color="#f9fc00">freeze</font> the target within 6 meters. Last hit will break the ice and <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> the target. <br>(While using the skill, you can't move and have yellow armor.) <br>(If yourself is within the area of ice, then your evasion rate will be significantly increased, and you will also deal 30% more <font color="#f9fc00">damage</font> and have 10% more <font color="#f9fc00">critical hit rate</font>. The effect only works with Tianshan's internals.)
