desc_CS_ts_tyjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters in front. Add <font color="#FFAE00">Cold Night</font> buff on enemies who didn't parry. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Night</font>: Continuously cause damage and cause a 20% slow down, for 7 seconds.
