desc_CS_ts_tyjf04_1=Drop falling snow sword at selected area. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> unparried enemies for 2 seconds and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters of the falling snow sword. Within the sword area, continuously deal damage on enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font>. The falling snow sword exists for 7 seconds. <br>If you are within 20 meters of the falling snow sword, then the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Rushing Snow Dance</font>: You instantly teleport to the location of <font color="#FF3030">falling snow sword</font>, deal damage to enemies nearby, and <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> unparried enemies.
