desc_CS_ts_tyjf06_1=Successful parry will let the enemies gain <font color="#FFAE00">Clear Glitter</font> state: Reduce movement speed by 5%. Reduce internal defense by 3%. Clear Glitter lasts for 5 seconds and can stack for 5 times. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Frozen Lotus with Clear Glitter</font> effect will be removed.
