desc_CS_ts_wcjf06_1=Use the skill to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> state. Use the skill again to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> state. You can switch between the two parry states. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Qian</font> to the target. Once it reaches 12 stacks, it will explode, deduct HP and energy from the target, and disable flying skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kun</font> to the target. Once it reaches 12 stacks, it will explode, make the target lose 30 flying points, and reduce the target's damage by 30%. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then this parry will be removed.
desc_CS_ts_wcjf06_2=Use the skill to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> state. Use the skill again to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> state. You can switch between the two parry states. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Qian</font> to the target. Once it reaches 11 stacks, it will explode, deduct HP and energy from the target, and disable flying skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kun</font> to the target. Once it reaches 11 stacks, it will explode, make the target lose 30 flying points, and reduce the target's damage by 30%. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then this parry will be removed.
desc_CS_ts_wcjf06_3=Use the skill to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> state. Use the skill again to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> state. You can switch between the two parry states. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Qian</font> to the target. Once it reaches 10 stacks, it will explode, deduct HP and energy from the target, and disable flying skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kun</font> to the target. Once it reaches 10 stacks, it will explode, make the target lose 30 flying points, and reduce the target's damage by 30%. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then this parry will be removed.
desc_CS_ts_wcjf06_4=Use the skill to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> state. Use the skill again to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> state. You can switch between the two parry states. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Qian</font> to the target. Once it reaches 9 stacks, it will explode, deduct HP and energy from the target, and disable flying skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kun</font> to the target. Once it reaches 9 stacks, it will explode, make the target lose 30 flying points, and reduce the target's damage by 30%. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then this parry will be removed.
desc_CS_ts_wcjf06_5=Use the skill to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> state. Use the skill again to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> state. You can switch between the two parry states. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Qian</font> to the target. Each stack will reduce the chance of doing critical hit by 3%. Once it reaches 8 stacks, it will explode, deduct HP and energy from the target, and disable flying skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kun</font> to the target. Each stack will reduce the chance of evasion by 5%. Once it reaches 8 stacks, it will explode, make the target lose 30 flying points, and reduce the target's damage by 30%. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then this parry will be removed.
desc_CS_ts_wcjf07_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy (Only effective to players). Each hit costs one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> unparried targets. <br>When you use this skill, you can move freely and have yellow armor.
