desc_Npc_jh_jyjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters in front. If you hit unparried enemies, then you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">Faraway</font> state, which increases your movement speed by 30% for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target in front. <br>If you break parry successfully, then you will knock up the target.
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>(The skill can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf04_1=Upon successful parry, you will gain <font color="#FFAE00">Loss of Dragon</font> state. When you use skills of this set, you will deal 195 points of extra external damage (scaling with respect to melee power). The state lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf05_1=Add <font color="#FFAE00">The Wailers</font> state to yourself: Reflect damage received to the enemies. It lasts for 8 seconds. <br>(Only works towards players.)
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 10 meters in front. Can knock up unparried targets.
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf07_1=Chop the target in the air and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(It only works towards the target in air.)
desc_Npc_jh_jyjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_Npc_jh_wlp01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font> state, last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> unparried enemies. <br>(Can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_wlp02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Forms</font> state, the speed, range, and accuracy rate of the skill are increased. <br>(Can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_wlp02_hide_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Forms</font> state, the speed, range, and accuracy rate of the skill are increased. <br>(Can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_wlp03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters in front. When you successfully parry break, you can <font color="#f9fc00">disable their flying skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font> state, you can poison parrying targets: slow down over time in 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_wlp04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters in front. Continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unparried targets. Last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> unparried targets. Use 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font> to execute the skill, you will obtain <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font>。<br>Under <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Forms</font> state, enemies can not parry within the affected area.
desc_Npc_jh_wlp05_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font> state. At the same time, the skill will become <font color="#f9fc00">Chanting Crane</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Snake and Crane Double Ways</font>: Reinforce the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Short Wings</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Super Suspicion</font>. <br>After you use the skill or parry, yourself will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font>: When the chi power appears and disappears, enemies within 5 meters range will suffer 487 points of yang damage. The chi power lasts for 12 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times.
desc_Npc_jh_wlp05_hide_1=Enter <font color="#FFAE00">Tiger and Crane Double Forms</font> state. At the same time, the skill will become <font color="#f9fc00">Crawling Crane</font>. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Tiger and Crane Double Forms</font>: Reinforce the skills <font color="#f9fc00">Tigers Howl</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Leopard Change</font>. <br>After you use the skill or parry, yourself will gain 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font>: When the chi power appears and disappears, enemies within 5 meters range will suffer 487 points of yang damage. The chi power lasts for 12 seconds and can be stacked for 5 times.
desc_Npc_jh_wlp06_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Every time you hit enemies, it will reduce one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Three Turns Monster Power</font> on yourself.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang True Chi</font> to unparried targets for 10 seconds. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 6 meters. If you parry break a target successfully, then you can <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> the target.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Last hit will add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang True Chi</font> to unparried targets. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <font color="#f9fc00">Freeze</font> unparried targets for 5 seconds. If the target is attacked, then that will release the target from <font color="#f9fc00">frozen</font> state and add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font> to the target. If the target is in air, then it will <font color="#f9fc00">fall down</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf06_1=Build an ice wall and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Affected targets in the ice area will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">will not be able to use hidden weapons</font>. The ice wall will exist for 10 seconds, and continuously give <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font>. When the ice wall disappears, targets within the affected area will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked up</font>. Teammates who enter the ice wall area will gain 50% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">movement speed</font> and 50% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy rate</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf07_1=Parry to gain one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font>. It can be stacked 10 times. When it reaches 10 stacks, it will release automatically. It will use <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> to freeze yourself, let you be immune against most damages (from players) and controls, and let you be unable to cast skills or move, for 2 seconds. Use the skill to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> stacks, and put it into a cool down of 10 seconds.
desc_Npc_ts_tsjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Instantly <font color="#f9fc00">freeze</font> the target within 6 meters. Last hit will break the ice and <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> the target. <br>(While using the skill, you can't move and have yellow armor.) <br>(If yourself is within the area of ice, then your evasion rate will be significantly increased, and you will also deal 30% more <font color="#f9fc00">damage</font> and have 20% more <font color="#f9fc00">critical hit rate</font>. The effect only works with Tianshan's internals.)
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters in front. Add <font color="#FFAE00">Cold Night</font> buff on enemies. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Night</font>: Continuously cause damage and cause a 10% slow down. If the enemy is attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">Dusk Snow in Forgotten Years</font>, then the enemy will <font color="#f9fc00">fall down</font>.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Successful parry break will add <font color="#f9fc00">Snow Fall</font> state: <font color="#FFAE00">Movement speed</font> is reduced to the minimum, and will slowly get back to normal after 5 seconds. <br>In the mean time, self will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Clear Autumn</font> state: Within 10 seconds, if you use <font color="#FFAE00">Dusk Snow in Forgotten Years</font>, you will obtain <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font>.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf03_1=Sword dance to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>(Can use flying skills to quickly approach the target.)
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf04_1=Drop falling snow sword at selected area. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> for 2 seconds and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters of the falling snow sword. Within the sword area, continuously deal damage on enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font>. The falling snow sword exists for 7 seconds. <br>When the falling snow sword exists, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Rushing Snow Dance</font>: You instantly teleport to the location of <font color="#FF3030">falling snow sword</font>, deal damage to enemies nearby, and <font color="#f9fc00">knock them up</font>.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf04_hide_1=Instantly teleport to the location of <font color="#FF3030">falling snow sword</font>, deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies nearby, and <font color="#f9fc00">knock them up</font>.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the area, and suppress enemies who fell down. <br>When you use the skill, you will obtain <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font> state.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf06_1=Successful parry will let the enemies gain <font color="#FFAE00">Clear Glitter</font> state: Reduce movement speed by 10%. Reduce yin defense by 100 points. Clear Glitter lasts for 10 seconds and can stack for 3 times.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf07_1=Continuously hit the target to deal {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_Npc_ts_tyjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>Landing hits on enemies under <font color="#FFAE00">slow down debuff of this skill set</font> can <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> and will knock down enemies in air. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Clear Autumn</font> state, then the skill will have <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font> state.
desc_event_detective10_1=Cult disciples seeing through hidden identity
desc_fwz_cloth_839_1=desc_fwz_cloth_839_1
desc_fwz_cloth_840_1=desc_fwz_cloth_840_1
desc_fwz_cloth_843_1=I have story to tell. Do you have wine?
