desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tsjf03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Last hit will add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang True Chi</font> to unparried targets. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tsjf04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tsjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <font color="#f9fc00">Freeze</font> unparried targets for 5 seconds. If the target is attacked, then that will release the target from <font color="#f9fc00">frozen</font> state and add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font> to the target. If the target is in air, then it will <font color="#f9fc00">fall down</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tsjf06_1=Build an ice wall and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Affected targets in the ice area will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">will not be able to use hidden weapons</font>. The ice wall will exist for 10 seconds, and continuously give <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font>. When the ice wall disappears, targets within the affected area will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked up</font>. Teammates who enter the ice wall area will gain 20% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">movement speed</font> and 20% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy rate</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tsjf07_1=Parry to gain one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font>. It can be stacked 10 times. When it reaches 10 stacks, it will release automatically. It will use <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> to freeze yourself, let you be immune against most damages (from players) and controls, and let you be unable to cast skills or move, for 2 seconds. Use the skill to clear <font color="#FFAE00">Chi of Ice Cold</font> stacks, and put it into a cool down of 20 seconds. <br>Use skills from other sets will remove this state. <br>Can't use it in instance.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tsjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Instantly <font color="#f9fc00">freeze</font> the target within 6 meters. Last hit will break the ice and <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> the target. <br>(While using the skill, you can't move and have yellow armor.)
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 20 meters in front. Add <font color="#FFAE00">Cold Night</font> buff on enemies. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Cold Night</font>: Continuously cause damage and cause a 20% slow down, for 7 seconds.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Successful parry break will add <font color="#f9fc00">Snow Fall</font> state: <font color="#FFAE00">Movement speed</font> is reduced to the minimum, and will slowly get back to normal after 5 seconds.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf03_1=Sword dance to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>(Can use flying skills to quickly approach the target.)
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf04_1=Drop falling snow sword at selected area. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> for 2 seconds and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters of the falling snow sword. Within the sword area, continuously deal damage on enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">disable flying skills</font>. The falling snow sword exists for 7 seconds. <br>If you are within 20 meters of the falling snow sword, then the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Rushing Snow Dance</font>: You instantly teleport to the location of <font color="#FF3030">falling snow sword</font>, deal damage to enemies nearby, and <font color="#f9fc00">knock them up</font>.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the area, and suppress enemies who fell down. You can't use the skill in air. <br>When you use the skill, you will obtain <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font> state.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf06_1=Your successful parry will give the enemy one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Clear Glitter</font> debuff: Slow down by 5% and reduce 1% yin defense. Last 5 seconds. Can be stacked for 5 times. <br>If you use skills of other sets, then this effect will be removed.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf07_1=Continuously hit enemies to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>Landing hits on enemies under <font color="#FFAE00">slow down debuff of this skill set</font> can deal some extra damage.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_tyjf08_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <br>Landing hits on enemies under <font color="#FFAE00">slow down debuff of this skill set</font> can <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font> and will knock down enemies in air.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 5 meters. Hitting on unparried targets will make them <font color="#f9fc00">lose energy</font> whenever they cast skills, for 7 seconds.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf02_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 5 meters. When you parry break successfully, <font color="#f9fc00">reduce 2% of the target's energy</font>.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Hitting on an unparried target will <font color="#f9fc00">absorb</font> its energy per hit. <br>(Can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.)
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 15 meters. Unparried enemies will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked up</font>.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If your energy is more than the target's energy, then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stiff</font>. Every time you hit unparried targets, you add <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> state to them. Each stack increases <font color="#f9fc00">the chance of being critical hit</font> by 5%. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy. Last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">instantly jumps</font>to the back of unparried target.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf06_1=Use the skill to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> state. Use the skill again to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> state. You can switch between the two parry states. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Qian</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Qian</font> to the target. Each stack will reduce the chance of doing critical hit by 3%. Once it reaches 8 stacks, it will explode, deduct HP and energy from the target, and disable flying skills for 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Turn Kun</font> will add <font color="#FFAE00">Kun</font> to the target. Each stack will reduce the chance of evasion by 5%. Once it reaches 8 stacks, it will explode, make the target lose 30 flying points, and reduce the target's damage by 30%. <br>If you use skills from other sets, then this parry will be removed.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf07_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy. Each hit costs one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> unparried targets. <br>When you use this skill, you can move freely and have yellow armor.
desc_schoolwar_CS_ts_wcjf08_1=Continuously hit the target and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy.
desc_skill_adv034_fyc_01_1=Deal some damage to all targets in front. Add Qiankun state to unparried targets, which causes key bind to mess up and disable skills.
desc_skill_adv034_fyc_02_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Deal damage to all targets within 10 meters and continuously knock them up. Every knock will add to yourself Leisure Cloud state. When the state hits 6 stacks, you will gain 30 seconds of Wild Crane state. It will add 30% extra soft damage to your attacks.
desc_skill_adv034_fyc_03_1=Skill loading time is 5 seconds. Deal huge damage to all targets within 10 meters and delete 30% of their energy. If someone's energy is below 30%, then instantly delete 50% of its HP. This effect will ignore any defense or reduction.
desc_skill_adv034_fyc_04_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Deal some damage to the target. If the target does not parry, then add Ethereal state to the target and reduce its accuracy rate by 90%. And every time the target tries to cast a skill, there is a chance to fall down.
desc_skill_adv034_hbz_01_1=Deal some damage to the target. Add to self 1 stack of Black Piece state. Add to the target 10 seconds of Heaven Essence state. Within 10 meters, 10% HP loss every second. Every time one casts a skill, the timer will be reset and 1 more stack of Black Piece state will be added.
desc_skill_adv034_hbz_02_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Create a black piece within 20 meters of self. When the black piece is attacked by white piece players, it will suffer a lot of damage. The black piece will explode and instantly kill white piece players in 30 seconds.
desc_skill_adv034_hbz_03_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Deal some damage to front area. If the target is not in white piece state, then will add to the target Black Piece - Break state. Under this state, if white piece players come close, then there will be a 20% HP loss every 3 seconds. Under this state, if the target is in white piece state, then the target will be killed instantly.
desc_skill_adv034_hbz_04_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Deal some damage to all targets within 5 meters.
desc_skill_adv034_hbz_05_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Throw 4 black pieces randomly within 20 meters nearby. Within the area of a black piece, every 2 seconds targets within 10 meters will be pulled towards the black piece. When the state disappears, all targets within the area will suffer a lot of damage. If any targets are in white piece state, then those targets will receive a debuff that reduces all attributes by 90%.
desc_skill_clone041_dypz_01_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Form a frozen ground with a radius of 10 meters. Movement speed within the area will be increased by 80%. But when attacked within the area, one will receive a lot of damage.
desc_skill_clone041_dypz_02_1=Instantly executed. Knock back all targets in the area and deal a lot of damage. Form a area with radius of 2 meters under the feet of the targets. Within this area, there will be a loss of 5% HP every second, for 1 minute.
desc_skill_clone041_dypz_03_1=Deal some damage to all surrounding targets. Randomly select 3 players and add Cold Winter debuff. It slows players down by 500%. One has to keep moving to remove this debuff. Otherwise, one will be instantly killed when the debuff disappears.
desc_skill_clone041_dypz_04_1=Cast a sword chi to the frontal area and deal a lot of damage. If a target is on frozen ground, then it will be instantly killed.
desc_skill_clone041_dypz_05_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Add to self Coldness Through Bone state for 30 seconds. Under this state, every 10 seconds, one deals some damage to surrounding targets and 1 stack of Through Bone debuff to them, which slows them down 20% and can be stacked.
desc_skill_clone041_qhqdz_01_1=Deal some damage to all surrounding targets. Randomly select 4 targets and add Cherry Blossom Fall state. Under the state, the targets will have their accuracy reduced by 90%. If they use flying skills, the state timer will be reset. Under the state, if a target attacks a Cherry Blossom Clone, then the clone will have 100% evasion rate and heal 20% HP every time it is attacked.
desc_skill_clone041_qhqdz_02_1=Skill loading time is 5 seconds. Summon clones and hide itself among the clones. Only when clones are defeated will the real one be revealed. If a clone is attacked, then other clones within 100 meters will heal 50% each time. Clones will explode and cause all players to drop to 1 HP after 15 seconds.
desc_skill_clone041_qhqdz_03_1=Skill loading time is 4 seconds. Deal some damage to all surrounding targets within 20 meters. A chance to add Narrow Eye Lids state to targets for 15 seconds. The state will reduce vision, and cause a loss of 5% energy and 10% rage every second.
desc_skill_clone041_qhqdz_04_1=Skill loading time is 2 seconds. Add to self White Snow state. Within 20 seconds, reflect 100% external damage and receive extra 50% yang damage.
desc_skill_clone041_qhqdz_05_1=Throw bombs at the feet of randomly selected 3 players. Within the bomb area, players will have damage reduced by 100%. Within the bomb area, there is a chance to add a 20 seconds state Make Good Use of Beautiful Time, which has a chance to stun, disable skills, and mess up key binds.
desc_skill_clone041_xb_01_1=Reduce damage taken by 50%, and reflect 100% damage.
desc_skill_clone041_xb_02_1=Increase damage received by 20%. Set a sword array within 20 meters around spirit ice. All players within the area will lose 5% HP every second, for 30 seconds.
desc_skill_clone041_zlwf_01_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Cast a sword chi to frontal area. Knock back all the targets in the area, and deal a lot of damage. It also adds Shark Spin state, which slows down movement speed by 30%.
desc_skill_clone041_zlwf_02_1=Skill loading time is 1 second. Knock up all surrounding targets. Add Dragon Scale Protecting the Body state to self. All targets within 5 meters are slowed down by 80%. They will also lose 20% HP and energy every second. It lasts for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone041_zlwf_03_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Cast three sword chis to frontal area. Deal a lot of damage. If a target has less than 30% HP, then there is a chance to kill it instantly.
desc_skill_clone041_zlwf_04_1=Skill loading time is 5 seconds. Deal a lot of damage to all surrounding targets. If 3 or more targets got hit, then heal your own HP by 30% and increase your own damage by 100%.
desc_skill_clone041_zlwf_05_1=Deal a lot of damage to all surrounding targets within 8 meters. Add to self Ride the Wave state. Targets beyond 8 meters will lose 10% HP every second, have their flying skills disabled, and have their key binds messed up. When the state ends, all targets in the area will have a 50% chance of being killed instantly.
desc_skill_clone041_zsjx_01_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Deal some damage to all surrounding targets. If a target does not parry, then it will gain Dragon Evasion state. Create shadows around the target and deal a lot of damage, and the target can not heal HP or energy within the next 20 seconds.
desc_skill_clone041_zsjx_02_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Cast three sword strokes to frontal area. Add Break state to the targets, which reduces their external defense by 90%.
desc_skill_clone041_zsjx_03_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Pull surrounding targets to self. In the mean time, jump high in the air and cast a few sword chis to the area below within 10 meters. Every time a hit lands on a target, it will remove a beneficial buff from the target.
desc_skill_clone041_zsjx_04_1=Cast a sword chi to frontal area. The sword chi forms a huge dragon and flies forward. It deals a lot of damage along the way, and add Dragon Prestige state to the targets for 10 seconds. Under the state, the targets will have their damage reduced by 80%, receive 50% extra damage, have their flying skills disabled, and every time they use skills there is a chance to get stunned.
desc_skill_clone041_zsjx_05_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Deal multiple times of damage to all surrounding targets. Continuously knock up the targets.
desc_skill_clone041_zzmsl_01_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Deal multiple times of damage to all frontal targets. A chance to add Shock state to them for 15 seconds. Under the state, the target will lose 20% HP when using skills.
desc_skill_clone041_zzmsl_02_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Deal some damage to all surrounding targets within 20 meters. If a target is on ground, then it will be paralyzed and stunned for 5 seconds. And in the next 10 seconds, whenever a target uses skills, it will possibly get paralyzed for 1 second.
desc_skill_clone041_zzmsl_03_1=Randomly select 4 targets. After 2 seconds, cast sword chi storm in the area within 2 meters range of the targets. They will lose 2% HP every second for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone041_zzmsl_04_1=Instantly executed. Deal a lot of damage to all targets in the area. Add Break Water state, which reduced HP healing effect by 100%.
desc_skill_clone041_zzmsl_05_1=Skill loading time is 5 seconds. There is a very low chance to interrupt a skill when being critical hit. Add Glittering Flame state to self for 20 seconds. Every attack will gain bonus damage.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_tlq02_1=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down. <br>(Can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Windsplitter</font>: Slightly increase damage. Range is increased by 2 meters. When you equip this rework <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Breaks Cart - Windsplitter</font>, the Break Cart state obtained with the skill will exist for an extra 2 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_tlq02_10=A series of clever strikes that deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the enemy; <br>When the enemy is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Cart</font> state, you can knock him down. <br>(Can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Windsplitter</font>: Slightly increase damage. Range is increased by 2 meters. When you equip this rework <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Breaks Cart - Windsplitter</font>, the Break Cart state obtained with the skill will exist for an extra 2 seconds.
