desc_wuji_CS_jh_tlq03_1=Give your attacks the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Chi</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be thrown or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Burning Rage</font> state added to you</font>. <br/>The <font color="#FFFFA5">Concentration</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be thrown or sent flying. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Windsplitter</font>: Use the skill to obtain two states. When you have the two states, <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Stalks a Cicada</font>'s animation is faster, and executing <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Breaks Cart</font> will consume this state.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_tlq03_10=Give your attacks the effects of Mantis Breaks Cart, and two states can be freely switched: <br><font color="#FFAE00">Gather Chi</font>: While you charge up for Mantis Breaks Cart you won't be thrown or sent flying. If attacked while charging up, you will have the <font color="#FFAE00">Burning Rage</font> state added to you</font>. <br/>The <font color="#FFFFA5">Concentration</font> state: While executing Mantis Breaks Cart you will not be thrown or sent flying. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Windsplitter</font>: Use the skill to obtain two states. When you have the two states, <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Stalks a Cicada</font>'s animation is faster, and executing <font color="#FFAE00">Mantis Breaks Cart</font> will consume this state.
