desc_wuji_CS_jh_tlq04_1=This charging attack inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>When you are in a <font color="#f9fc00">Concentration </font>or in <font color="#FFAE00"">"Burning Rage"</font>, you can knock your target back, and give your target the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Broken Cart" </font>effect, denying him the use of Flying Skill or defensive action for 3 seconds. You will gain the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Amplify damage" </font>effect for a period of time, inflicting additional Hard damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Windsplitter</font>: Slightly increase damage. Charging time is reduced. When you have two states of <font color="#FFAE00">Inquisitive Mantis</font>, the dash animation is faster.
desc_wuji_CS_jh_tlq04_10=This charging attack inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>When you are in a <font color="#f9fc00">Concentration </font>or in <font color="#FFAE00"">"Burning Rage"</font>, you can knock your target back, and give your target the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Broken Cart" </font>effect, denying him the use of Flying Skill or defensive action for 3 seconds. You will gain the <font color="#FFAE00"">"Amplify damage" </font>effect for a period of time, inflicting additional Hard damage. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Windsplitter</font>: Slightly increase damage. Charging time is reduced. When you have two states of <font color="#FFAE00">Inquisitive Mantis</font>, the dash animation is faster.
