desc_wuji_CS_ts_tsjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang True Chi</font> to unparried targets for 10 seconds. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Boundless Ice</font>: Slightly increase damage. If you hit unparried targets, then <font color="#f9fc00">slow down</font> by 25%.
