desc_wuji_CS_ts_tsjf03_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Last hit will add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang True Chi</font> to unparried targets. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Boundless Ice</font>: Slightly increase damage. Skill speed is faster.
