desc_wuji_CS_ts_tsjf03_9=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Last hit will add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang True Chi</font> to unparried targets. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds. <br>(This skill can use flying skills to approach the target quickly.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Boundless Ice</font>: Slightly increase damage. Skill speed is faster.
desc_wuji_CS_ts_tsjf06_1=Build an ice wall and deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Affected targets in the ice area will be <font color="#f9fc00">paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds, and <font color="#f9fc00">will not be able to use hidden weapons</font>. The ice wall will exist for 10 seconds, and continuously give <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font>. When the ice wall disappears, targets within the affected area will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked up</font>. Teammates who enter the ice wall area will gain 20% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">movement speed</font> and 20% bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy rate</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Boundless Ice</font>: Slightly increase damage. Teammates who enter the ice area will have bonus in <font color="#f9fc00">movement speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy rate</font> for 7 seconds.
