desc_wuji_CS_ts_wcjf01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 5 meters. Hitting on unparried targets will make them <font color="#f9fc00">lose energy</font> whenever they cast skills, for 7 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Autumn Water</font>: Slightly increase damage. Skill range is increased by 1 meter.
