desc_wuji_CS_ts_wcjf05_10=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If your energy is more than the target's energy, then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stiff</font>. Every time you hit unparried targets, you add <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> state to them. Each stack increases <font color="#f9fc00">the chance of being critical hit</font> by 5%. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy. Last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">instantly jumps</font>to the back of unparried target. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Autumn Water</font>: Slightly increase damage. <font color="#f9fc00">Accuracy rate</font> is significantly increased. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.15 of the target's lost energy, but its cool down is extended by 2 seconds.
