desc_wuji_CS_ts_wcjf07_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy (Only effective to players). Each hit costs one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock up</font> unparried targets. <br>When you use this skill, you can move freely and have yellow armor. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Autumn Water</font>: Slightly increase damage. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.12 of the target's lost energy.
