desc_wuji_CS_xy_ktdj06_1=Blade Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>The move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> enemies within 8 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyze</font> them for 2 seconds. <br>(The knock back effect ignores enemy's parry. Cannot knock back the same target in 10 seconds.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Kuntian</font>: Slightly increase damage. When the target has 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">parry buffs</font>, disable skills for 2 seconds. <br>(Cannot skill disable the same target in 10 seconds.)
