desc_wuji_CS_xy_ktdj07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 8 meters. <br>When hitting the targets, grant them <font color="#FFAE00">Exchange Sun</font> status: reduce movement speed by 50% and disable flying skills for 2 seconds. <br>During the move, you get <font color="#FFAE00">Supreme</font> status: reduce damage taken by 75%. <br>(You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the move. You can use Flying Skills when using the move) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Kuntian</font>: Slightly increase damage. When the target has 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">parry buffs</font>, you can pull it towards you. <br>(The pulling effect ignores enemy's parry. Cannot pull the same target in 10 seconds.)
