desc_CS_jh_cljf01_1=Charging Skill, Heart to Heart, Identical Hearts: Cause targets {@0:damage packet}; <br>Also, according to your gender, give targets added corresponding <font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Horn (males only)</font> or<font color="#FFAE00">Spirit Horn (females only)</font>state: When attacked by your spouse, if you simultaneously have these two states, then 5% skill damage is added, lasting 5 seconds. <br>(This move can be used with flying skills to quickly approach the enemy.)
