desc_CS_jh_cljf03_1=Couple's Combination, Apprentice Strike, Flying Wing to Wing: Pull surrounding targets to you and cause {@0:damage packet}; <br>after successfully using skill, adds additional damage based on the spousal properties. <br>(This skill requires the married couple to use the skill within a range of 8 meters. Using the [Double Wing Flight] will cut off the skill that the spouse is currently using and make the spouse's [Double Wing Flight] enter cool-down.)
