desc_CS_jh_gclhz04_1=Consume 10% of energy and HP to boost <font color="#FF3030">spouse</font><br>There will be some energy and HP loss.<br>Both player and spouse receive a state of <font color="#FFAE00">"Mental Bond"</font>: When under attack, capable of <font color="#f9fc00">slowing</font> the attacker for 1 seconds.
