desc_CS_jh_mlyqj01_f_1=Lithely Sublimity, Bitter Green Potion: Inflict surrounding targets with {@0:damage packet}; <br><font color="#f9fc00">Green Plum Like a Pea (Females only)</font>: When your spouse uses this skill within 2 seconds after you use the skill, the skill's damage is increased by 10% and surrounding targets are knocked back.
