desc_CS_jh_mlyqj07_f_1=Married Couple Combination, Burning Red Shadows, Rushing Twisted Sword: Cause surrounding enemies {@0:damage packet}; <br>The skill can continuously knock enemies flying into the air when using the skill in the <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font>state. <br> (This skill requires the married couple to use the skill within a range of 8 meters; Additional damage is added based on the spousal properties; using the [Return of the Prodigal Son] will cut off the skill that the partner is currently using and make the partner's [Return of the Prodigal Son] enter cool-down.
