desc_wuji_CS_jh_cljf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 8 meters. Continuously <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> non-parrying targets to you. The last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">knock</font> non-parrying targets into air. <br>After successfully using skill, add additional damage based on spouse's attributes. <br>(This skill requires the married couple to use the skill within a range of 8 meters. Using the [Double Wing Flight] will cut off the skill that the spouse is currently using and make the spouse's [Double Wing Flight] enter cool-down.)
