desc_wuji_CS_jh_cljf07_1=Oaths of the Mountains and Seas, Loyal to the Death: Surrounding targets receive {@0:伤害包}. <br>Also receive <font color="#FFAE00">Dependent</font> status: When being attacked, seal the skills of the attacker for 1 second. One stack of the status is expended each time you are attacked. <br>If your spouse is within 8 meters, <font color="#FFAE00">Dependent</font> status will extend to 5 seconds when casting the skill.
