desc_wuji_CS_tm_ywt06_10=Demon King's secret skill. Throw <font color="#FFAE00">trap</font>. Effect radius is 5 meters. It has the following special effect: <br>For the first enemy that enters the trap, he will be paralyzed for 2 seconds and receive extra damage; <br>For enemies inside the trap, they will be slowed down by 35%, and they can't use flying skills (which do not stack); <br>For enemies inside the trap, they will gain <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost</font> debuff, which will gain one more stack every second to a maximum of 20 stacks. <br>(The trap will exist for 30 seconds. The effects of trap will exist for 30 seconds after being applied.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Prison</font>: Increase radius of trap by 1 meter. Can paralyze at most 5 targets inside the trap, and disable them for 3 seconds.
