desc_CS_jh_csdwg01_1=Condensing murderous aura, what is the dark intention? Deals {@0:伤害包} Damage to the target in front and inflicts not-parry targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Windrunner</font> for 5 seconds: <font color="#FFAE00">Evasion Rate</font> decreases by 10%.
