desc_CS_jh_csdwg04_1=When will the wind come to sweep the world clear? Fly forward with a stick and hit the target in your path, dealing {@0:伤害包} Damage. If the target is already affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Windrunner</font>, it will be <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds.<br>This skill cannot be performed in the air.
