desc_CS_jh_csdwg05_1=Burst embedded spirits and demons weeping roots are all ancient. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Inflicts the unparried target with <font color="#FFAE00">Pull In</font> into itself. When the target is <font color="#FFAE00">Paralyzed</font> with this skill, it will be additionally <font color="#f9fc00">Stunned</font> for 1 second.
