desc_CS_jh_csdwg06_1=The battle stick from the gods of war, armor and horses compete for glory. Spins on a pole, causing {@0:伤害包} Damage to nearby enemies. This skill may continuously <font color="#f9fc00">Knock down</font> targets that do not parry and were <font color="#FFAE00">Paralyzed</font> by the skill. Hitting an enemy grants one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font>. (Must have learned <font color="#f9fc00">Crimson Water</font> to be able to inflict )<br>Cannot get <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> while being in <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status.
