desc_CS_jh_csdwg07_1=West mountain leads to tiger cave, the Red Cliff hides the dragon palace. Grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Water</font> status: Successful parry grants one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> for 8 seconds. After collecting 10 levels the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>: Burst consumes all the <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> non-parry enemies nearby for 3 seconds and deals Damage, while huge momentum <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them for 1 second. You will also get <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status for 5 seconds after casting the skill: Technique Damage increased by 30%. Each use of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Martial Staff</font> extends the Martial duration by 1 second (but not exceeding the maximum duration).<br>Cannot obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> while being in <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_csdwg07_10=West mountain leads to tiger cave, the Red Cliff hides the dragon palace. Grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Water</font> status: Successful parry grants one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> for 12 seconds. After collecting 10 levels the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>: Burst consumes all the <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> non-parry enemies nearby for 3 seconds and deals Damage, while huge momentum <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them for 1 second. You will also get <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status for 6 seconds after casting the skill: Technique Damage increased by 45%. Each use of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Martial Staff</font> extends the Martial duration by 1 second (but not exceeding the maximum duration).<br>Cannot obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> while being in <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_csdwg07_11=West mountain leads to tiger cave, the Red Cliff hides the dragon palace. Grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Water</font> status: Successful parry grants one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> for 12 seconds. After collecting 10 levels the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>: Burst consumes all the <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> non-parry enemies nearby for 3 seconds and deals Damage, while huge momentum <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them for 1 second. You will also get <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status for 6 seconds after casting the skill: Technique Damage increased by 45%. Each use of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Martial Staff</font> extends the Martial duration by 1 second (but not exceeding the maximum duration).<br>Cannot obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> while being in <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status.
desc_CS_jh_csdwg07_12=West mountain leads to tiger cave, the Red Cliff hides the dragon palace. Grants you <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Water</font> status: Successful parry grants one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> for 15 seconds. After collecting 10 levels the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Frozen Burst</font>: Burst consumes all the <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> non-parry enemies nearby for 3 seconds and deals Damage, while huge momentum <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them for 1 second. You will also get <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status for 6 seconds after casting the skill: Technique Damage increased by 50%. Each use of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Martial Staff</font> extends the Martial duration by 1 second (but not exceeding the maximum duration).<br>Cannot obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font> while being in <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status.
