desc_CS_jh_csdwg07_hide_1=Night cold condensed bursting into flames, spring air enters a plant. Burst consumes all the <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> non-parry enemies nearby for 3 seconds and deals {@0:伤害包} Damage, while huge momentum <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them for 1 second. You will also get <font color="#FFAE00">Martial</font> status for 5 seconds after casting the skill: Technique Damage increased by 30%. Each use of <font color="#FFAE00">Crimson Martial Staff</font> extends the Martial duration by 1 second (but not exceeding the maximum duration).
