desc_CS_jh_gwzbd01_1=The fluttering stern wings, the lone beast walks the herd. Slashes the target, dealing {@0:伤害包} Damage to the chosen target. The second hit may <font color="#f9fc00">knock the target down</font> if the target doesn't parry.
