desc_CS_jh_gwzbd02_1=Try to be involved in the overlord strategy, will be the period of conqueror's glory. Spins and slashes, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters . When you break enemies' parry, they get inflicted with 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font>: Decreases internal defense by 3% for 10 seconds.
