desc_CS_jh_gwzbd03_1=Memories of lunar night and talking to the hegemon. Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within a 5-meter radius and adds <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> to the targets who don't parry: Decreases internal defense by 3% for 10 seconds.
