desc_CS_jh_gwzbd06_1=Ice sparkles and knife cuts jade. You enter <font color="#FFAE00">Sparkling Ice</font> state: Each successful parry will give you 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cold Blood</font> status: 10% Drain HP upon attacking with the skill. Each attack consumes 1 stack of Cold Blood. Maximum 3 stacks.
