desc_CS_jh_gwzbd07_1=Red ice shocked fallen hands, the glory of passing the knife. Slashes the target in front and deals {@0:伤害包} Damage to enemies within 5 meters. Hitting non-parry target inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second. <br>(Cannot move freely while using this skill, and gain the Yellow Super Armor buff.)
