desc_CS_jh_gwzbd08_1=The beacon embers and stars fall, and the sword ring accompanies the moon to open. Rage slashes and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected target. The last attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets with 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Severed Tendon</font> status.
