desc_CS_jh_jgmnc01_1=The unevenness overlaps, and the universe is engulfed. Stabs and causes {@0:伤害包} Damage. If there is a <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow</font> around you, activates <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow Chant</font>: Also hit the target once with <font color="#f9fc00">Devastating Chop - Demon Chant</font>.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Devastating Chop - Demon Chant</font>: Stabs the target and causes Damage. The Damage increases with the level of <font color="#FFAE00">Devastating Chop</font>.
