desc_CS_jh_jgmnc02_1=Horrified by the inverted view of the body, with Ling Gang wind. Spins and stabs, inflicting {@0:伤害包} Damage to enemies within 5 meters in front. Unparried enemies get <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked Back</font>.
