desc_CS_jh_jgmnc03_1=There is no work that cannot be accomplished with a single iron pestle. Stabs the target and deals {@0:伤害包} Damage. The last hit on a non-parry target leaves one <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow</font>.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Demon Shadow</font> exists for 10 seconds. Only one can exist at a time. <br>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly).
