desc_CS_jh_jgmnc04_1=The way of heaven is dark and far away, and the ghosts and gods are at a loss. Flying twin daggers deal {@0:伤害包} to targets nearby and inflict 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font>. Target with more than 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font> hit by <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Dance</font> will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font> for a period of time. The skill <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Back</font> targets with 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font>. <br>If there is a <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow</font> around you, activates <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow Chant</font>, calling to your side and casting <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Dance - Demon Chant</font>. <br>The effect might be limited by terrain.<br>You have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and can move freely when casting. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font> status: Slow down by 10%, lasts 5 seconds, up to 5 stacks. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Demon Dance - Demon Chant</font>: Effect similar to <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Dance</font>, Damage increases with the level of <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Dance</font>.
desc_CS_jh_jgmnc04_10=The way of heaven is dark and far away, and the ghosts and gods are at a loss. Flying twin daggers deal {@0:伤害包} to targets nearby and inflict 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font>. Target with more than 4 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font> hit by <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Dance</font> will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font> for a period of time. The skill <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks Back</font> targets with 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font>. <br>If there is a <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow</font> around you, activates <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow Chant</font>, calling to your side and casting <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Dance - Demon Chant</font>. <br>The effect might be limited by terrain.<br>You have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and can move freely when casting. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Dark Demon</font> status: Slow down by 10%, lasts 5 seconds, up to 5 stacks. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Demon Dance - Demon Chant</font>: Effect similar to <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Dance</font>, Damage increases with the level of <font color="#FFAE00">Demon Dance</font>.
