desc_CS_jh_jgmnc05_1=This body is unattached and subdues the Vajra firmness. Strikes in front and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies on the way, for a short time inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font>.<br>Leaves one <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow</font> before striking.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Demon Shadow</font> exists for 10 seconds. Only one can exist at a time. <br>(This ability can't be used while in the air).
