desc_CS_jh_jgmnc06_1=Consume and return to the Demon Shadow position. <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> the surrounding non-parry targets and deals {@0:伤害包} Damage after reaching the position.<br>Requires a <font color="#f9fc00">Dark Demon</font> within 20 meters to cast.
