desc_CS_jh_jgmnc07_1=Long floating clouds, clear and dust-free. Enters <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: If you get hit while parrying, you can undo attacker's current attack and counterattack. The status lasts for 5 seconds. <br>(Counterattack has a range of 6 meters, is ineffective against Super Armor, and can be countered by a Feint. Increasing the skill stack number increases the counterattack Damage.)
