desc_CS_jh_jgmnc08_1=If you climb the peaks and mountains, all realms are silent outside your body. Flying slash that deals {@0:伤害包} Damage. The last hit on a non-parry target leaves one <font color="#f9fc00">Demon Shadow</font>.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Demon Shadow</font> exists for 10 seconds. Only one can exist at a time.
