desc_CS_jh_wshtz01_1=I will look back and see the four wildernesses. Rolls and inflicts {@0:伤害包} external damage to enemies in front, inflicting the non-parry targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Barren</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Slowing</font> down by 10%.
