desc_CS_jh_wshtz03_1=The four poles have been approached, and the beast is harnessed to the eight wildernesses. Dance around the pole, use defense instead of attack and obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Eight Wildernesses</font> status for 5 seconds after a successful parry. Can stack 3 times. You get immunity to control when casting <font color="#f9fc00">Wild Whirlwind</font>, <font color="#f9fc00">Soaring Dance</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Splash-ink Cloud</font>.
