desc_CS_jh_wshtz06_1=Rising by the giant river, rushing to the sky. Deals {@0:伤害包} external damage to surrounding enemies. The hit targets in <font color="#FFAE00">Barren</font> status will be inflicted with <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second.
