desc_CS_jh_wshtz07_1=Deep in the mountains, the dragon and tiger are flying and changing, and the sea is moving instantly. Deals {@0:伤害包} external damage to enemies nearby and <font color="#f9fc00">drags</font> non-parry enemies to you.
