desc_CS_jh_wshtz08_1=The giant broke the earth's axis and seas and rivers raged with waves. Slash like thunder and cause {@0:伤害包} external damage to the enemies around you and slowly <font color="#f9fc00">drag</font> the enemies around you. The final hit <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks</font> the enemies into air.
