desc_CS_lzy_xmgrc_gxtlj01_1=The vine is born in the morning. Sword strikes enemies within 10 meters in front dealing {@0:伤害包}. The hit non-parrying enemies will be slowed down by <font color="#FFAE00">20%</font>.
desc_CS_lzy_xmgrc_gxtlj02_1=A thousand grudges and grievances, weeping with love and blood sleeve shirt red. Deals {@0:伤害包} Damage to enemies within 5 meters in front. Unparried enemies get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font>.
desc_CS_lzy_xmgrc_gxtlj03_1=Weeping eyes do not ever get tired of looking at each other, but in vain. Absorbs the surrounding Sword Qi, causing {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When the first strike hits, the whistling Sword Qi will <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> the unparried enemy for 0.5 seconds. Sword Qi pours out when casting the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Shocking the non-parrying enemies around you</font>.<br>Can be cast only on the ground. Cannot move when casting.
desc_CS_newdataosha_dingzw_001_1=Use to immediately restore 10% HP.
desc_CS_newdataosha_dingzw_002_1=Use to immediately restore 50% HP.
desc_CS_newdataosha_dingzw_003_1=Use to immediately recover 10% Energy.
desc_CS_newdataosha_dingzw_004_1=Use to immediately recover 50% Energy.
desc_CS_single_xm1_1=Sophora petals dancing in the wind fall into channel, autumn enters the city. Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 7 meters. Targets who fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>. Gains 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock Energy</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">Galaxy Heron</font> based on existing stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock Blade - Rustling Sands</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">Small Celestial Star Sword - Galaxy Heron</font> on the player.
desc_CS_single_xm1_2=Sophora petals dancing in the wind fall into channel, autumn enters the city. Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 7 meters. Targets who fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>. Gains 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock Energy</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">Galaxy Heron</font> based on existing stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock Blade - Rustling Sands</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">Small Celestial Star Sword - Galaxy Heron</font> on the player.
desc_CS_single_xm1_3=Sophora petals dancing in the wind fall into channel, autumn enters the city. Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 7 meters. Targets who fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>. Gains 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock Energy</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">Galaxy Heron</font> based on existing stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock Blade - Rustling Sands</font> or <font color="#FFAE00">Small Celestial Star Sword - Galaxy Heron</font> on the player.
desc_CS_single_xm2_1=The incense in the sky penetrates Chang'an, and the whole city is full of golden flowers. Creates Fragrant Array, which instantly <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> unparried enemies around and causes {@0:伤害包} damage. In a while the flowers scatter and the fallen enemies within the Fragrant Array are <font color="#f9fc00">thrown up</font> high.
desc_CS_single_xm2_2=The incense in the sky penetrates Chang'an, and the whole city is full of golden flowers. Creates Fragrant Array, which instantly <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> unparried enemies around and causes {@0:伤害包} damage. In a while the flowers scatter and the fallen enemies within the Fragrant Array are <font color="#f9fc00">thrown up</font> high.
desc_CS_single_xm2_3=The incense in the sky penetrates Chang'an, and the whole city is full of golden flowers. Creates Fragrant Array, which instantly <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> unparried enemies around and causes {@0:伤害包} damage. In a while the flowers scatter and the fallen enemies within the Fragrant Array are <font color="#f9fc00">thrown up</font> high.
desc_CS_single_xm3_1=Hoarfrost shimmers in the dawn of spring morning. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> for 1 second if the target fails to parry, then swipes ink over the target's face, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Ink Stain</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Ink Stain</font>: The target's face is covered with ink for 1 minute.
desc_CS_single_xm3_2=Hoarfrost shimmers in the dawn of spring morning. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> for 2 seconds if the target fails to parry, then swipes ink over the target's face, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Ink Stain</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Ink Stain</font>: The target's face is covered with ink for 1 minute.
desc_CS_single_xm3_3=Hoarfrost shimmers in the dawn of spring morning. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target, <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> for 3 seconds if the target fails to parry, then swipes ink over the target's face, inflicting <font color="#FFAE00">Ink Stain</font>. <font color="#FFAE00">Ink Stain</font>: The target's face is covered with ink for 1 minute.
