desc_CS_xmg_pyj02_1=The sun rises and the dry sand falls. Injects a ray of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy will be injected into the enemy's body to hide for 10 seconds upon a successful parry. Up to 7 stacks. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy: Targets hit by <font color="#f9fc00">Across the Sea</font> will get <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font> for a short period of time.
