desc_CS_xmg_pyj07_1=Weeping eyes do not ever get tired of looking at each other, but in vain. Absorbs the surrounding Sword Qi, causing {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When the first strike hits, the whistling Sword Qi will <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> the unparried enemy for 0.5 seconds. Sword Qi pours out when casting the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Shocking the non-parrying enemies around you</font>. <br>Can be cast only on the ground. Cannot move when casting.
