desc_CS_xmg_pyj08_1=The sea turns wild waves, the Milky Way lies Across the Sea tide. Sword dance deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters around. Each hit on an unparried enemy affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy will consume 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy and get inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font>. <br>You have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and can move freely when casting.
