desc_CS_xmg_xtxjf01_1=The bells and drums are late for the long night, and the stars are longing for the dawn. Inflict {@0:伤害包} Damage to the enemy in front. If the target is affected by 5 stacks of <font color="#f9fc00">Galaxy Heron</font>, it will detonate, causing damage and <font color="#f9fc00">Keystrokes are randomized</font> for 3 seconds.
