desc_CS_xmg_xtxjf05_1=Causes {@0:伤害包} Damage to the enemy in front and casts <font color="#fa0000">Small Celestial Star Sword Array</font> that <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzes</font> the enemy within the range for 3 seconds, and inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Falling Morning Star</font> that reduces the External Defense by 10%. The sword array lasts for 10 seconds.
