desc_CS_xmg_xtxjf06_1=The long song sings the pine wind, and the river stars are scarce at the end of the song. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the selected enemy. At the same time, it can ignite the star power on the unparried target, inflicting them with <font color="#FFAE00">Wind Hangover</font> status to it and causing continuous damage. The more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Galaxy Heron</font>, the higher the burning damage.
