desc_CS_xmg_xtxjf07_1=The colorful boats and clouds are light, and the star river heron rises. Makes the opponent Dazed upon a successful parry and inflicts <font color="#f9fc00">Galaxy Heron</font> state which slows down by 5% for 5 seconds. It can stack 5 times.
