desc_Npc_riding_xjq_001_1=Increase movement speed. <br/><font color="#ff0000">Upon entering combat, state will be removed</font>
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj01_1=The vine is born in the morning. Sword strikes enemies within 10 meters in front dealing {@0:伤害包}. The hit non-parrying enemies will be slowed down by <font color="#FFAE00">20%</font>.
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj02_1=The sun rises and the dry sand falls. Injects a ray of <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy will be injected into the enemy's body to hide for 15 seconds upon a successful parry. Up to 7 stacks. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy: Targets hit by Across the Sea will get <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font> for a short period of time.
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj03_1=A brightness and an extinction between one foot, how can I be lonely? Inflict {@0:伤害包} Damage on target.<br>Use a Flying Skill in combination with this skill to approach target quickly.
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj04_1=The stinging clouds and rain, and the wind and gods are thundering. Spike the target to deal {@0:伤害包}. <br>(This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly. The max distance for charge is 15 meters).
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj05_1=The stars are cold, and the moon is full of empty mountains. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to selected target. A powerful blow will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> unparried targets.
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj06_1=A thousand grudges and grievances, weeping with love and blood sleeve shirt red. Deals {@0:伤害包} Damage to enemies within 5 meters in front. Unparried enemies get <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font>.
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj07_1=Weeping eyes do not ever get tired of looking at each other, but in vain. Absorbs the surrounding Sword Qi, causing {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters. When the first strike hits, the whistling Sword Qi will <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> the unparried enemy for 0.5 seconds. Sword Qi pours out when casting the skill, <font color="#FFAE00">Shocking the non-parrying enemies around you</font>.<br>Can be cast only on the ground. Cannot move when casting.
desc_Npc_xmg_pyj08_1=The sea turns wild waves, the Milky Way lies Across the Sea tide. Sword dance deals {@0:伤害包} to enemies within 5 meters around. Each hit on an unparried enemy affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Hidden Rock</font> Hidden Energy will consume 1 stack of Hidden Energy and get inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font>. <br>You have <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> and can move freely when casting.
desc_fwz_cloth_849_1=Happiness, longevity, longevity, good luck, and prosperity.
desc_fwz_cloth_874_1=Eating a watermelon, dropping a melon, picking up a little fool, ha-ha-ha.
desc_fwz_weapon_630_1=Pipe Strike
desc_fwz_weapon_857_1=The cold wind whipped the sword to make waves.
desc_item_skill_xigua_1=desc_item_skill_xigua_1
desc_item_skill_xigua_ice_1=desc_item_skill_xigua_1
desc_npc_skill_lzy_2019jq001_1=The enemy within 20 meters is dragged to the side.
desc_pet_bao_act01_1=Put me down! I am going for a gallop!
desc_pet_bao_act02_1=Fondle me, please!
desc_pet_bao_act03_1=Two-legged beast, from now on you will belong to me!
desc_pet_dissmiss_bao_1=I am going to patrol the territory!
desc_pet_dissmiss_pig_1=Raise Golden Den
desc_pet_pig_act01_1=Hum-hum-hum!
desc_pet_pig_act02_1=It is necessary to raise Golden Enmity fat, and life will be prosperous!
desc_pet_pig_act03_1=Make way, make way you all!
desc_schoolwar_skill_emei_1=A merciful move that gives your allies and you Body Protecting Chi which reduces damage taken for a short period.
desc_schoolwar_skill_gaibang_1=Strike in a frenzy, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>The final strike knocks back all enemies within a 6-meter radius who fail to parry.
desc_schoolwar_skill_jilegu_1=Attack enemies while moving, deal {@0:伤害包}, and make them suffer <font color="#FFAE00">"Shock"</font>.
desc_schoolwar_skill_jinyiwei_1=The move opens the world, the bloody war can assuage eight directions, wield blade to strike the ground to knock down around enemies, and deal {@0: 伤害包}.<br>Cost 3 floors of <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Thirsty Will</font> to attach Endure state for this skill.
desc_schoolwar_skill_junzitang_1=The sword of Sir Jade Flute rises, cutting the air and whistling as it goes to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies.<br>The sound wave vexes the enemies' ears, putting them in the <font color="#FFAE00">Bewildered</font> state: Under this state, their attack power is reduced, and if they press a attack direction button (up, down, left or right) their commands will become confused. If airborne while struck, enemies will be grounded. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Flute Sound</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Non-parry targets in Oar in Midstream - Flute Sound will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked down</font>.
desc_schoolwar_skill_mingjiao_1=Strong as bear, arrow like meteorite, Xiong Qu hunts a tiger at night technique. Shoot a large number of arrows continuously into the selected area from 8 to 25 meters away, causing {@0: damage packs} to enemies within the range and inflict on the non-parry enemies <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 1 second. At the same time suppress the Collapse enemy, making it impossible to get up. <br>The effect is weaker if the skill is cast in the air. Arrow Rain decreases, Damage Decrease. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Mind and Vision</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage. Reduce the Return Chi time by 3 seconds, which can also damage the enemy close by.
desc_schoolwar_skill_shaolin_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; when target is airborne, you may knock it away.
desc_schoolwar_skill_tangmen_1=The rains turn to shooting stars. Shoot at the enemy in the range of 15 meters to deal {@0: 伤害包} damage.<br>(This movement can be executed while moving.)
desc_schoolwar_skill_tianshan_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. <font color="#f9fc00">Freeze</font> unparried targets for 5 seconds. If the target is attacked, then that will release the target from <font color="#f9fc00">frozen</font> state and add <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yin True Chi</font> to the target. If the target is in air, then it will <font color="#f9fc00">fall down</font>. <br>If a target has both of <font color="#FFAE00">Extreme Yang and Yin True Chi</font>, then the <font color="#f9fc00">evasion rate</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">skill damage</font> will be reduced by 50%, for 7 seconds.
desc_schoolwar_skill_wudang_1=Open the tai chi, moving yin and yang, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby enemies; <br>This movement also steals their self-control abilities, and you can send them flying.
desc_skill_clone043_jll_03_1=Instantly names 5 players around nearby and inflicts the Scorpion Miasma Sting status for 15 seconds: targets hit by it will have Movement Speed reduced by 50%, Evasion Rate reduced by 90%, Hit Rate reduced by 90%, and you cannot block. Each time using the skill, it will infect 2 players around you at random with a certain probability. At the end of the effect, the status will deal Instant Kill damage to all targets within 50 meters. Players who are in the Scorpion Miasma Sting status will not be affected by the Golden Toad Poison - Toxic effect after being inflicted with Golden Toad Poison - Toxic, while removing the Scorpion Miasma Sting effect.
desc_skill_clone043_jll_04_1=When the Poison God Cauldron is thrown into the air, a 20 meter radius Toxic Fog will be created in the air above the player's head. The player in the air will be inflicted with Burning Poison: in this state each time you use a skill, you will lose 20% of your energy, and when the state disappears, if your internal energy falls below 30%, it will cause 90% loss of HP to all targets within 10 meters. If the player dies from this effect, Bone Corrosion will be inflicted. This status decreases all attributes by 80% for 8 minutes and is not cleared by death.
desc_skill_clone043_jll_05_1=After charging for 3 seconds, throws the Poison God Cauldron into the center of the field and release it to add 1 minute of Breath Protection to self. HP recovery is forbidden within 8 meters of the surrounding area. At the same time, players within 60 meters of the Poison God Cauldron will have the Breath Devouring effect inflicted on them, losing 5% HP every 3 seconds. Players will take an additional 50% Yin Damage every time they take damage. If there is a Cobweb, Golden Toad Poison, Scorpion Miasma Sting effect on the player, they will be blind, and their Brawn internal breath will be reduced by 90%.
desc_skill_clone043_jll_06_1=Ordinary Hidden Weapon Attack within 10 meters, dealing a certain amount of damage to the target.
desc_skill_clone043_jzx_01_1=Drags all nearby non-parry targets within 30 meters and inflicts Chant Procession state. In this state, you will be stunned for 10 seconds. And deals massive damage to all targets within range.
desc_skill_clone043_jzx_02_1=Cast directly. Knocks down all non-parry targets within 20 meters. It deals a lot of damage and additional damage to players with Chant Procession status.
desc_skill_clone043_jzx_03_1=All targets in the field take a lot of damage. At the same time, 5 random targets will be inflicted with Divine Temper state for 10 seconds. In this state, every time they move or deal damage, 0.5% of Crimson Pearl Fairy HP will be recovered. It will stack 1 layer of Divine Temper and infect other players within 20 meters around it. Divine Refinement can be stacked 3 times. After 3 stacks of the target will be killed directly. Once the Divine Temper state ends, you solidify and your damage increases by 50%.
desc_skill_clone043_jzx_04_1=After charging for 1 second, causes massive damage to all targets within a 120° 30 meters fan-shaped area in front and inflicts Chi Entanglement status, reducing movement speed by 80% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_jzx_05_1=After charging for 1 second, adds the state of Pure Temper Shadow to self for 1 minute. Every 10 seconds, an Avatar will be summoned at the Crimson Pearl Fairy. Within 10 meters around the Avatar, the damage received by Crimson Pearl Fairy will be reduced by 100%, and the damage caused will be increased by 100%. The player who enters the area loses 60% of HP per second (ignoring most immunities). At the same time, the Shadow Possessed status is inflicted for 20 seconds. Every time a skill is used, Crimson Pearl Fairy will get 0,2% HP restored. The Avatar will disappear in 20 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_01_1=Cast directly. Reduces the HP of all targets within 50 meters to 85%, and adds Mind Restraint state to self. In this state, when any player's HP within 20 meters exceeds 90%, 10% HP will be deducted and Heart Broken status will be inflicted. When using skills, an additional 10% of internal energy will be consumed. Lasts 20 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_02_1=Cast directly. Forcibly reduces HP of players with more than 50% HP within 50 meters to 50%, and inflicts Chi Contemplation state to all players. If the player's HP exceeds 50%, and in 5 seconds it is still greater than 50%, inflicts Ineffective Remedy state: target loses 20% of the HP per second for 20 seconds, and gets inflicted with Soul Breaker state after death: all attributes will be reduced by 99%, and cannot get most of the buffs. Lasts 10 minutes The effect won't get deleted after leaving the scene.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_03_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Inflicts a small amount of damage to the surrounding targets, and inflicts the Marrow Piercer state to all blocking targets. In this state, the accuracy is reduced by 90%, and every time the target uses Flying Skills, there is a certain probability of getting Stunned for 1 second. Effect lasts for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_04_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Deals a lot of damage to all surrounding targets, and causes different effects based on your own HP and the target's HP. When your own HP is higher than 50%, inflicts the target with Blood Devourer status to the target. Each time a skill is used, it will cause 30% HP loss, and when the effect ends, it may will inflict Overdose of Excessive Remedy status to self: HP Recovery will be reduced by 100%, and become immune to most of buffs. When your HP falls below 50%, inflicts the target with Cure Blood status: In this state, if the target's HP is greater than 50%, Evil Blood status will be inflicted: Invincible and Faint for 20 seconds, and 100% HP will be restored every second. And at the end the status turns into Evil Blood Remnant status: seals skills and makes immune to all skill damage, immune to most buffs, and inflicts 40% HP loss per second to all targets within 10 meters, which ignores most damage immunity effects. If the target's HP falls below 50%, the medicine is transformed into Poison Blood: 5% HP loss per second, and a 90% reduction in Brawn and internal breath. Effect lasts for 15 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_05_1=Stuns the current target before charging for 5 seconds. Afterwards causes a lot of damage to the current target and inflicts a Spicule Injection state: inserts a bone needle into body key spots, rendering the player Paralyzed and Stunned for 10 seconds. Other players can click on the target to pull out the needle. Bone needles can be used to pull out the needle twice and there is a certain probability to fail. After two failures, after the Needle In The Marrow time expires, it will turn into permanent HP loss, the target will be immune to most of buffs, and HP recovery will be reduced by 100%. When you fail to remove the needle or when the Spicule Injection is over, the bone needle will fly into 2 other players within 30 meters.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_07_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Randomly calls 2 targets when charging, inflicts 5 meters of Shennong Realm status. Players in this status will lose 2% HP per second for 20 seconds. Shennong Realm will inflict instant kill on all targets within the area after the time expires.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_08_1=Charges for 1 second. Deals a small amount of damage to the current target.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_09_1=Clear the needle and get Outer Explosion status to self. If the HP of all targets within 20 meters is lower than 50%, it will cause 20% of HP loss, and if the HP is higher than 50%, directly restores 60% of HP.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_01_1=Charges for 2 seconds, cause a small amount of damage to all targets within 30 meters, and leave a stack of Seal of Vajra. In this state, the damage received is increased by 20%. It can be stacked 3 times.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_02_1=Randomly selects 2 enemies and throws twin daggers. After hitting the target, it will drag other non-parrying players within 20 meters or are in the air, and inflicts the Demonic Entanglement status: the movement speed is reduced by 90%, and an Empty Phantom appears at the feet of the target hit.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_03_1=Deals a lot of damage to the current target. Can be blocked. If you have your own Phantom when casting the skill, it will trigger Phantom Howls, clearing most of the buffs within 20 meters of Empty Phantom and reducing the target's internal and external defense by 100%. If the target has Test Medicine status, it will be removed and the target rendered unconscious for 10 seconds. After howling, the Empty Phantom dissipates.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_04_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Deals 5 strikes of damage to the surrounding area, each hit inflicting Soul Splitter status to the targets. In this state, the damage received is increased by 100%. It can be stacked 5 times. More than 3 stacks cause Rigidity and the Rip and Tear effect will be cleared after casting. Target with 5 stacks will be instantly killed. When activated, if there is any Phantom around you, it will trigger Phantom Howls, inflicting 3 layers of Soul Splitter status to the enemies around the Phantom.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_05_1=Charges for 3 seconds and deals tremendous amount of damage to targets within 30 meters. If there is any Phantom around you, it will trigger Phantom Howls, which will deal massive damage to all targets around the Phantom and inflict Dharma Void status on all blocking targets within 50 meters, sealing skills and disarming them for 8 seconds. When it hits an enemy with 3 stacks of Seal of Vajra, it consumes the stacks, causes 95% HP loss and reduces the HP Recovery effect by 80% for 20 seconds after inflicting Evil Thoughts, and summons an Empty Phantom under the target's feet.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_06_1=If the player has the "Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers" effect of the "Three Yang Dark Needle" technique, the herb will take effect and restore Mu Shuzi's HP by 10%. If there is no "Celestial Maiden Scatters Flowers" effect, there is a high probability of causing 5% HP loss to the target, and 2% of HP will be restored upon successful use.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_07_1=Clears most buffs within 20 meters of Empty Phantom, and reduces the target's internal and external defense by 100%. If the target has Test Medicine status, it will be removed and the target rendered unconscious for 10 seconds. After howling, the Empty Phantom dissipates.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_08_1=Inflicts 3 stacks of Soul Splitter state to the enemies around Phantom. If the target's HP is below 50%, it will be instantly killed.
desc_skill_clone043_wss_09_1=Deals massive damage to all targets around the Phantom and inflicts Dharma Void status on all blocking targets within 10 meters, sealing skills and disarming them for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_01_1=Charges for 3 seconds. When the skill is ready, the current target will be Stunned and knocked back. When the target is knocked back, throws a scythe to the target, which will leave Scythe Shade on the spot if it hits the target. The Scythe Shade will exist for 30 minutes and inflict Wandering Moon state to the target within 10 meters: causes 30% HP loss and energy per second, ignoring all defense and buffs. If the scythe does not hit the target, you will get inflicted with Four Wildernesses status for 1 minute. Every time Yun Guzhi deals damage, it will cause an additional 20% loss of HP and energy to all targets within 30 meters.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_02_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Randomly names 5 players in the field, deals a small amount of damage to them and throw the Phantom Scythe under them. The Phantom Scythe will spin, and in 3 seconds it will drag in all players within 15 meters. All targets within 10 meters of Phantom Scythe will be inflicted with Wilderness Flow state: lose 2% HP per second, reduce movement speed by 50%. When receiving damage, there is a chance to clear 2 buffs on self, and receive an additional 30% external damage which ignores External Defense.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_03_1=Leaps into the air, ignores any damage and cannot be locked, then smashes down the scythe, knocking all targets on the ground back. If the target is on the ground, it will be felled by a blow directly, causing 80% HP loss and inflicting Beast Crusher state: every time you use a skill, there is a certain probability of getting Severed Tendon, resulting in Constriction, suffering 20% loss HP, collapsing on ground and Faint for 2 seconds. After landing, picks up the scythe and swirls, causing 8 stages of damage to all targets within 50 meters. The Beast Crusher status will also be inflicted each time the damage is dealt.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_04_1=Charges for three seconds. Recovers all Scythe Shade on the field when charging, and adds a stack of Crazy Tide status to self for each recovered Scythe. Max 10 stacks. After charging, it will cause a lot of damage to all targets within 25 meters, and according to own Crazy Tide state, will cause an additional percentage of HP loss to all targets on the field, and there is a certain probability to Stun the target for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_05_1=Inflicts external damage to the enemies within 20 meters, and drags the enemies within 10 meters in. At the end of the skill, the players who are pulled close will be Knocked into air, and the Cloudraker status will be inflicted: after the player hits the ground, it will cause a lot of damage to all players within 10 meters around him. The damage is cleared and immune to the buffs. At the same time, it clears 1-3 buffs off the damaged target.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_06_1=After charging for 5 seconds, swings the scythe forward, and the shadow of the blade will carry Eternal Collapse to the front, dealing massive damage to all targets in the front sector. If the target has any Blade Wound state (Wandering Moon, Wilderness Flow, Beast Crusher, Cloudraker, Beast of the Barrens), there is a high probability of dealing instant kill damage.
desc_skill_clone043_ygz_07_1=Jumps up slightly and throws a spinning scythe, dealing 28000 external damage to all targets regardless of defense (15000 if Tier 5 internal skill) and adds Bestial Deathzone to self.
desc_skill_hdlb_dy_01_1=<s>
desc_skill_shp_190702_1_1=Throw Watermelon
desc_skill_shp_190702_2_1=Clear Water
desc_skill_xmg_dy_01_1=Shark hunt
desc_wuji_CS_by_xlxf01_1=Axe Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: The range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> the target. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Bloody Axe</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Hitting a non-parry target refreshes the <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status duration.
