desc_wuji_CS_by_xlxf01_9=Axe Force deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: The range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> the target. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Bloody Axe</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Hitting a non-parry target refreshes the <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status duration.
desc_wuji_CS_by_xlxf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: <br>The range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, reduces cooldown of all your attacks by 10%. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Bloody Axe</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
