desc_wuji_CS_by_xlxf07_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>With <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status: <br>The range of the attack is doubled and you have a chance to <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> target. <br>When hitting targets who are not blocking, reduces cooldown of all your attacks by 10%. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if Twin Axes are equipped. Equipping Twin Blades inflicts only 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Bloody Axe</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. The final hit knocks down the non-parry target if there is an active <font color="#FFAE00">Firmament Destroyed</font> status.
