desc_wuji_CS_jh_bxjf01_1=Stuns and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>When hitting targets, grant yourself 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: Increase movement speed and charge distance for moves in the same set for 15 seconds. It can be stacked 10 times. <br>The level of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> is related to <font color="#f9fc00">Cosmic Bloom</font> level. <br>(Damage increases with the increase of your movement speed.) <br>(This set can only be used by players who have been castrated.)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Exorcise Evil</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Slightly increases Stun duration.
