desc_wuji_CS_jh_bxjf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target.<br>Consumes 1 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>: Paralyze targets for 2 seconds and Remove any attack restrictions on you. <br>No extra effects when you don't have enough stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font>.<br>As attack speed increases, target receives more damage.<br>This skill set can only be used by castrated players.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Exorcise Evil</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> will not be consumed if the player is in the <font color="#FFAE00">Evil Influence</font> status.
