desc_wuji_CS_jh_lhbwq02_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If player has 10 stacked effects <font color="#FFAE00">Pounces for Prey</font>, player will gain the <font color="#FF3030">Become a Dragon</font> effect: Changes <font color="#f9fc00">Dragon Swims Everywhere</font> into <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Tiger and Cloud Dragon</font>. Lasts for 15 seconds. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Dragontiger Rupture</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Grants <font color="#FF3030">Become a Dragon</font> status if the player has 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pounce</font> status.
