desc_wuji_CS_jh_lhbwq07_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>A successful break of enemy's parry adds <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Heart</font> to enemy: Causes them to take damage when using attack skills. Lasts 8 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Dragontiger Rupture</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Grants 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pounce</font> status upon successfully breaking enemy's defense. <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Heart</font> status bonus effect: Using Flying Skills may cause Falling Down.
