desc_wuji_CS_jh_lhbwq08_1=Inflicts {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>Adds <font color="#FFAE00">Rip and Tear</font> to enemies: It causes them to take on additional damage when attacked by <font color="#f9fc00">Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and can be stacked 40 times. <br>Execute a chain of attacks without consuming energy.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Dragontiger Rupture</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Grants Yellow Armor if the player has <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Flight</font> status.
