desc_wuji_CS_jh_whjf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>The last attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets' with <font color="#FFAE00">Sunset in the West Wind</font> status. <br>This attack can be used with flying skills to approach the target quickly.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Unyielding</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
