desc_wuji_CS_jh_whjf06_1=Sword Chi flies and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to target. <br>The attack can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Unyielding</font>: Slightly increases damage. You obtain "Rally the Legions" status after hitting a non-parry target and use this technique to increase Damage by 10%.
