desc_wuji_CS_sj_syxz02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>When breaking a target's parry, you inflict them with <font color="#FFAE00">Soul Breaker</font>: It will be difficult to hit the target in the next attack. The effect lasts 3 seconds. <br>(The more Medical points you have, the higher the Damage will be).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Unchoke Meridian</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Target in the <font color="#f9fc00">[Soul Breaker]</font> status will be <font color="#f9fc00">Slowed down</font> by 30%.
