desc_wuji_CS_sj_syxz05_1=Inflicts the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> state: <br>If the target is an enemy, they will get <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> status. <br>If the target is an ally, they will get <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> status. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>: When hit, the target receives additional damage for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>. Absorbs damage received. Reflects 97% of damage received after the buff is over. Lasts 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Unchoke Meridian</font>: Once the <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle" </font>status ends, the target's HP recovery effect will be increased by 50% for 5 seconds, and the effect will weaken by 10% per second. <br>Taking damage when the <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> status is active will Slow down by an additional 10% for 5 seconds. Effect can be stacked 3 times. Clears the Slow down effect when the <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> status is over.
desc_wuji_CS_sj_syxz05_10=Inflicts the target with <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> or <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> state: <br>If the target is an enemy, they will get <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> status. <br>If the target is an ally, they will get <font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font> status. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font>: When hit, the target receives additional damage for 5 seconds.<br><font color="#FF3030">Guided Needle</font>. Absorbs damage received. Reflects 70% of damage received after the buff is over. Lasts 5 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Unchoke Meridian</font>: Once the <font color="#FF3030">"Guided Needle" </font>status ends, the target's HP recovery effect will be increased by 50% for 5 seconds, and the effect will weaken by 10% per second. <br>Taking damage when the <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> status is active will Slow down by an additional 10% for 5 seconds. Effect can be stacked 3 times. Clears the Slow down effect when the <font color="#FFAE00">Flying Needle</font> status is over.
