desc_wuji_CS_th_bhcs04_1=Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Shang</font> melody. Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>If target already has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Vastness"</font> status, attacks deal additional damage. <br>If target's defense has been broken, attacks will paralyze target for 3 seconds. <br>Can use Flying skills with this skill to approach target quickly. <br>You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly. Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Sound of Tides</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. You can use Flying Skill with this skill to approach your target quickly.
