desc_wuji_CS_th_bhcs06_1=The tide rises, surprising the heavens. The tides fall and demons cry. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Jue</font> melody. Music of the flute is awe inspiring and causes {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 8-meter radius. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Sound of Tides</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Decreases the target's Evasion Rate by 100% after Break Defense.
