desc_wuji_CS_th_bhcs07_1=Not yet proficient with the flute. The music of the tides is magnificent. Adds the <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font> melody. Playing notes Impacts the target, causing {@0:伤害包}. <br>Every blow adds 1 stack of <font color="#FFAE00">"Boundless"</font> to the enemy. Lasts 15 seconds. <br>If target has 6 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Boundless</font>, target will sustain Internal Injury. <br>Internal Injury applies only to players. Damage is based on player attributes.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a flute is equipped. Wielding only a single sword inflicts 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Sound of Tides</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Activating this technique grants 1 additional musical note <font color="#9932CD">Gong</font>.
