desc_wuji_CS_xjz_wmcf03_1=Enables player to enter <font color="#FFAE00">Counter</font> status: When being attacked by enemy while parrying, the attack is negated. The player will also create <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font>: Damage over time; enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds. <br>Counterattack can persist for 5 seconds. It is ineffective against Super Armor and can be overcome by feint attacks.<br>Damage is increased with higher skill stacks.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Close</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Inflicts the enemy <font color="#FF3030">entering</font> the aura with <font color="#FFAE00">Out of Ink</font> status.
