desc_wuji_CS_xjz_wmcf03_hide_1=At the same time, creates <font color="#f9fc00">Universal Aura</font>: Target suffers damage over time and its flying skills are disabled. Enemies who <font color="#FF3030">enter</font> the energy field or <font color="#FF3030">stand within its range</font> will be paralyzed for 2 seconds. The area of effect lasts for 8 seconds. <br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Close</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Inflicts the enemy <font color="#FF3030">entering</font> the aura with <font color="#FFAE00">Out of Ink</font> status.
