desc_wuji_CS_xjz_wmcf07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. <br>If the enemy is in <font color="#FFAE00">Out of Ink</font> status, each hit can cause a short Faint. <br>The attack is executed in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status. It is possible to attack freely when attacking.<br>Skill inflicts 100% damage if a ruler is equipped. Wielding only a single dagger inflicts 70% damage.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Close</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Slightly increases Faint duration, making attacks smoother.
