desc_wuji_CS_xy_nrjbd04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When evading attacker's move successfully, you can <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> him/her for 3 seconds. <br>The last attack will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies without Endurance. <br>You will get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> status when using the attack. You can use Flying Skills when using the attack.<br><font color="#FF00FF">Overcoming Affection</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Cool down time reduced by 3 seconds. If the target hit is already inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00"">[Hard to Find]</font>, <font color="#FFAE00"">[Hard to Find]</font> will be consumed and it will be regarded as successful <font color="#f9fc00">Evasion</font> from the enemy's Technique.
