desc_wuji_CS_xy_nrjbd07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When the target is male, the last attack will grant him <font color="#FF3030">Ball Broken</font> status: <font color="#f9fc00">Reduces speed</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">disables flying skills</font> for 4 seconds. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Overcoming Affection</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. If the target is male, enters <font color="#FFAE00"">[Fragile Beauty]</font> status when casting: Increases <font color="#FFAE00"">[Females Only]</font> set Damage by 40%. <font color="#FFAE00"">[Fragile Beauty]</font> status will weaken every 2 seconds by 10%.
