desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If target's parry is broken, applies <font color="#FFAE00">Bright Butterflies</font> to it, causing it to have a great chance to miss its coming attack. It also applies <font color="#FFAE00">Twinkling Flowers</font>, causing target to be unable to parry for a long time, as well as draining its Energy when hit by Seven Techniques of the Flower Goddess. Actual amount of Energy to drain is decided by the stack of the skill. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Cool down time reduced by 2 seconds. After using this technique, you can directly cast <font color="#f9fc00">[Fallen Petals]</font>. There is no need to recover between two techniques.
