desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs05_1=Grants self <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> state: When players take damage, 60% damage will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters. The state lasts 5 seconds. (If there is no enemy nearby or the attack is not dealt by players, the effect will not be triggered). <br>You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting this skill. <br>(This ability can't be used while in the air).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: When casting the technique, you can actively cast <font color="#f9fc00">[Necrid Blossom]</font> <font color="#f9fc00">[Nightstalker]</font> to break through the move.
desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs05_2=Grants self <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> state: When players take damage, 70% damage will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters. The state lasts 5 seconds. (If there is no enemy nearby or the attack is not dealt by players, the effect will not be triggered). <br>You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting this skill. <br>(This ability can't be used while in the air).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: When casting the technique, you can actively cast <font color="#f9fc00">[Necrid Blossom]</font> <font color="#f9fc00">[Nightstalker]</font> to break through the move.
desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs05_3=Grants self <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> state: When players take damage, 80% damage will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters. The state lasts 5 seconds. (If there is no enemy nearby or the attack is not dealt by players, the effect will not be triggered). <br>You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting this skill. <br>(This ability can't be used while in the air).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: When casting the technique, you can actively cast <font color="#f9fc00">[Necrid Blossom]</font> <font color="#f9fc00">[Nightstalker]</font> to break through the move.
desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs05_4=Grants self <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> state: When players take damage, 90% damage will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters. The state lasts 5 seconds. (If there is no enemy nearby or the attack is not dealt by players, the effect will not be triggered). <br>You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting this skill. <br>(This ability can't be used while in the air).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: When casting the technique, you can actively cast <font color="#f9fc00">[Necrid Blossom]</font> <font color="#f9fc00">[Nightstalker]</font> to break through the move.
desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs05_5=Grants self <font color="#FFAE00">Shifting Flowers</font> state: When players take damage, 100% damage will be transferred to a random enemy within 10 meters. The state lasts 5 seconds. (If there is no enemy nearby or the attack is not dealt by players, the effect will not be triggered). <br>You will gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while casting this skill. <br>(This ability can't be used while in the air).<br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: When casting the technique, you can actively cast <font color="#f9fc00">[Necrid Blossom]</font> <font color="#f9fc00">[Nightstalker]</font> to break through the move.
desc_wuji_CS_yh_hsqs07_1=The flower god, full of grace and beauty, descends to earth; the slow Chi force causes in target {@0:伤害包}: <br>ignores target's internal and external defense when attacking if target has <font color="#FFAE00">"Butterfly Dance"</font> status. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Swiftness</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Obtain <font color="#FFAE00">No Match</font> status when casting: <font color="#f9fc00">Hit Rate</font> is greatly increased and <font color="#f9fc00">Immune to Seal Skill</font>.
