desc_CS_sl_lhq04_1=As you parry, this defensive stance grants you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked 5 times.<br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Maitreya Drops an Eyebrow</font> effect will be removed.
desc_CS_sl_lhq04_2=As you parry, this defensive stance grants you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked 6 times.<br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Maitreya Drops an Eyebrow</font> effect will be removed.
desc_CS_sl_lhq04_3=As you parry, this defensive stance grants you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked 7 times.<br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Maitreya Drops an Eyebrow</font> effect will be removed.
desc_CS_sl_lhq04_4=As you parry, this defensive stance grants you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked 8 times.<br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Maitreya Drops an Eyebrow</font> effect will be removed.
desc_CS_sl_lhq04_5=As you parry, this defensive stance grants you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked 9 times.<br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Maitreya Drops an Eyebrow</font> effect will be removed.
desc_CS_sl_lhq04_6=As you parry, this defensive stance grants you the <font color="#FFAE00">"Lower Eyebrows"</font> effect, increasing Internal and External Defense. This effect can be stacked 10 times.<br>If you use skills from other sets, then <font color="#FFAE00">Maitreya Drops an Eyebrow</font> effect will be removed.
