desc_CS_dy_sdyjl04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <font color="#FFAE00">Paralyzes</font> non-parrying targets for 2 seconds. If there is <font color="#FFAE00">Howling Blade</font> effect active, spends one stack and casts <font color="#f9fc00">Howling Blade: Double Flow Break</font>: Deals damage to targets 5 meters in front and <font color="#f9fc00">Silences</font> non-parry targets for 3 seconds.
