desc_CS_dy_sdyjl05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Inflicts <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font> on non-parry targets and the last blow <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks</font> them down. If <font color="#FFAE00">Howling Blade</font> is active, changes the skill to <font color="#f9fc00">Howling Blade: Return of a Swallow</font>: Target's that fail to parry will be <font color="#f9fc00">Knocked into air</font>.
