desc_CS_jh_fxjf04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Target's that fail to parry will be inflicted for a short period with <font color="#FFAE00">Rigidity</font>. The last hit will <font color="#f9fc00">knock the non-parry targets into air</font>. When casting is over, if the target still fails to parry, you will get one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Towering Peak</font>. <br>(<font color="#f9fc00">Distant Towering Peak</font> skill should be learned to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Towering Peak</font>)
