desc_CS_jh_fxjf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">strikes down</font> non-parrying targets that are in the air. If <font color="#FFAE00">Towering Peak</font> is active, spends one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Towering Peak</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">Silences</font> non-parry targets on the ground for 2 seconds.
