desc_CS_jh_mhz05_1=Flies behind the target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Targets on the ground get <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 2 seconds. Targets in the air that fail to parry are<font color="#f9fc00">struck down</font>.
