desc_CS_jh_mhz06_1=Stares at the enemy and enters <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity Soulsplit</font> status: Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity</font> status. Each stack increases Damage by 3%. Up to 3 stacks. Dealing damage removes 1 stack. Lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_mhz06_2=Stares at the enemy and enters <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity Soulsplit</font> status: Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity</font> status. Each stack increases Damage by 3%. Up to 4 stacks. Dealing damage removes 1 stack. Lasts 20 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_mhz06_3=Stares at the enemy and enters <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity Soulsplit</font> status: Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity</font> status. Each stack increases Damage by 3%. Up to 5 stacks. Dealing damage removes 1 stack. Lasts 20 seconds.
