desc_CS_jh_mqc01_1=Sweeps target in front to deal {@0:伤害包} damage. Grants <font color="#FFAE00">Charming Flower</font> when casting this skill: Increases <font color="#FFAE00">Movement Speed</font> by 5% for 10 seconds. Up to 3 stacks. <br>After 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Charming Flower</font>, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">Grasp Passion Tangles</font>.
