desc_CS_jh_mqc01_hide_1=Throws dagger to deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If the target fails to parry, <font color="#FFAE00">Passion Tangles</font> effect will be granted: Continuously drains target's HP for 7 seconds. <br>Casting it while <font color="#f9fc00">Pomegranate Demon</font> state is active will spend a stack of <font color="#f9fc00">Charming Flower</font>. Casting the skill and activating <font color="#FFAE00">Passion Tangles</font> will <font color="#FFAE00">Silence</font> the target for 1 second.<br>Once casting is over, <font color="#FFAE00">Charming Flower</font> status is removed.
