desc_CS_jh_mqc05_1=Slashes and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Breaking defense grants <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrated Confusion</font>: Absorbs 5% of Max HP. When <font color="#FFAE00">Concentrated Confusion</font> is active, you can't be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked into air</font>. Lasts 10 seconds and stacks 1 time.
