desc_CS_jh_mqc06_1=<font color="#FFAE00">You get stealthy</font> and dance, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies around, attract targets on the ground nearby to <font color="#FFAE00">get close to</font> you. Enemies who touch you get <font color="#f9fc00">knocked into air</font>. <br>Casting it while <font color="#f9fc00">Pomegranate Demon</font> state is active will spend a stack of <font color="#f9fc00">Pomegranate Demon</font>. Every time casting the skill and hitting a non-parry target will shortly <font color="#FFAE00">take away their vision</font>.
