desc_CS_jh_mqc07_1=Successfully blocking 3 times grants one stack of <font color="#f9fc00">Pomegranate Demon</font> status: Consumes one stack to enhance the effects of <font color="#FFAE00">Grasp Passion Tangles, Sideburns Rubbing, Demon Backstab</font> in this skill set. Lasts for 5 seconds. Up to 1 stack. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Grasp Passion Tangles</font>: Activating <font color="#FFAE00">Passion Tangles</font> <font color="#FFAE00">Silences</font> the target for 1 second.<br><font color="#FFAE00">Sideburns Rubbing</font>: x0.3 bonus damage. <br><font color="#FFAE00">Demon Backstab</font>: Every time casting the skill and hitting a non-parry target will shortly <font color="#FFAE00">take away their vision</font>.
