desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 5 meters.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. Breaking defense knocks them into air.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl04_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and Paralyzes for 2 seconds. If there is Howling Blade effect active, spends one stack and casts Howling Blade: Double Flow Break: Silences targets 5 meters in front for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl04_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and Silences targets for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. Inflicts Rigidity on non-parry targets and the last blow knocks them down. If Howling Blade changes to a flying slash that knocks targets into air.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl05_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage and knocks non-parry targets into air. Clears one stack of Howling Blade once cast.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl06_1=Rushes to the target and enters Howling Blade state (No Damage. You get Yellow Armor when casting)
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl07_1=Enters Howling Blade state and deals {@0:伤害包} Damage to targets around. Non-parry targets hit will be unable to parry for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl08_1=A successful block grants a stack of Ethereal status: Increases Howling Blade Damage by 5%. Lasts 15 seconds, maximum 4 stacks. Casting Howling Blade increases Critical Hit by 20% if there is a Ethereal status.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl09_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If the state is active, perform Blade Drawing Skill.
desc_Npc_dy_sdyjl09_hide_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target and clears one stack of Howling Blade once cast.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets in front within 5 meters. Enter Lone Walker's Frontier when hitting a downed target: Grants one stack of Towering Peak status every 2 seconds within 6 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. When you break the target's block, you will knock the target into air.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If your HP is higher than the target's, you will spend a stack of Towering Peak and the skill will deal x0.3 bonus damage.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf04_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage and each time shortly inflicts Rigidity. The last hit knocks the target into air. Knocking targets into air grants a stack of Towering Peak.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf05_1=Blocking an enemy skill grants a stack of Towering Peak status.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters and strikes down targets that are in the air. If Towering Peak is active, spends one stack of Towering Peak and Silences targets on the ground for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. The last hit knocks down nearby non-parry targets. Spend one stack of Towering Peak to obtain Yellow Armor when casting.
desc_Npc_jh_fxjf08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. If your HP is higher than the target's, you will spend a stack of Towering Peak and the skill will have Siphon effect.
desc_Npc_jh_mhz01_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters in front and continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knocks</font> the targets in the air that fail to parry.
desc_Npc_jh_mhz02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies 5 meters in front, <font color="#f9fc00">knocks them into air</font> when breaking defense.
desc_Npc_jh_mhz03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage. <br>(This skill can be used with a Flying Skill to approach a target quickly.)
desc_Npc_jh_mhz05_1=Flies behind the target and deals {@0:伤害包} damage. Targets on the ground get <font color="#f9fc00">Rigidity</font> for 2 seconds. Targets in the air that fail to parry are<font color="#f9fc00">struck down</font>.
desc_Npc_jh_mhz06_1=Stares at the enemy and enters <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity Soulsplit</font> status: Successful parry grants <font color="#FFAE00">Enmity</font> status. Each stack increases Damage by 3%. Up to 5 stacks. Dealing damage removes 1 stack. Lasts 5 seconds.
desc_Npc_jh_mhz07_1=Pounces 8 meters in front and deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <font color="#f9fc00">Knocks</font> non-parry targets into air.
desc_Npc_jh_mhz08_1=Hard hit deals {@0:伤害包} damage.
desc_fwz_cloth_870b_1=Wind and Moon Affection
desc_fwz_cloth_870g_1=Wind and Moon Affection
desc_fwz_cloth_873_1=Lute strings entangled hearts. May that last forever.
desc_fwz_cloth_891_1=May the new year be happy and wonderful! Let this life be "mice" to you!
desc_fwz_weapon_879_1=Time cannot be turned back. Memories are getting farther and farther away.
desc_fwz_weapon_880a_1=<s>
desc_fwz_weapon_880b_1=<s>
desc_fwz_weapon_881_1=Northern winds blow, geese fly in clouds far away.
desc_fwz_weapon_882_1=Sword agitates everywhere!
desc_fwz_weapon_890_1=Proudly walking with sword!
desc_pet_dissmiss_mouse_1=I will now digest food.
desc_pet_mouse_act01_1=Don't get close to me!
desc_pet_mouse_act02_1=Stop bothering me, peasants!
desc_pet_mouse_act03_1=There are always rascals who want to harm me! Let go!
desc_ski_shuxing_allguj_01_1=<s>
desc_skill_1908_dy_002_1=Stun the target (Spend one Night City Treasure Chest)
desc_skill_1908_dy_002a_1=Stun the target (Spend one Treasure Chest)
desc_skill_1908_dy_01_1=Stun targets within a certain range (Spend one Night City Treasure Chest)
desc_skill_1908_dy_03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to the target.<br>If the target fails to parry, they will be inflicted with <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Confusion</font>.<br>(May be difficult to see if activated to close)
desc_skill_1908_dy_04_1=Discarding will attract the attention of guards (Spend three Night City Treasure Chests)
desc_skill_1908_dy_05_1=Briefly increases own movement speed
desc_skill_1908_dy_06_1=Cause damage to targets straight ahead in a 120° arc 5 meters ahead, knocking targets back and reducing their speed by 50% for 8 seconds.
desc_skill_1908_dy_07_1=Suddenly move to the side of a player. Causes damage to player and shock other team members within a 1 meter radius. Clear hatred of target. You gain worry-forgetting buff and temporarily increase arm power by 20 points and movement speed by 50%.
desc_skill_1908_dy_08_1=Fire hidden poison dagger at any random player. Causes damage and add shadow raid debuff for 5 seconds, with movement speed decreased by 50%, causing 100 points of damage every second.
desc_skill_1908_dy_09_1=Cause continuous AOE damage to surrounding players.
desc_skill_1908_dy_10_1=Continuously fire 4 hidden weapon nets in a 20 meter radius. Causes continuous damage to targets within a 2 meter radius and 50% reduced speed.
desc_skill_1908_dy_11_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies in the front; <br>Attempts to block the skill will cause the target to be blown away and paralyzed (30% reduced movement speed for 8 seconds).
desc_skill_1908_dy_12_1=<s>
desc_skill_1908_dy_13_1=<s>
desc_skill_1908_dy_14_1=Give yourself a laughing effect and become immune to damage coming from targets in front of you.
desc_skill_1908_dy_15_1=Randomly select one player to release it on. Causes AOE damage to surrounding targets in 5 meter radius. Stack up three-pest and three-herb debuff, and movement causes capture.
desc_skill_1908_dy_16_1=Stealth technique: Throws a smoke bomb to create a special mist that makes enemies in mist lose HP continuously and disable their flying skills.<br>Allies in mist can use the smoke to increase their Evasion and Melee Damage.
desc_skill_1908_dy_17_1=The boss stays on site without moving. Guides healing skills. Causes mass recovery within 10 meters for 10 seconds. Recovers 2% HP top limit every second. Basic: Cuts off at 3,000; Hard: 20,000; Hell: 30,000
desc_skill_1908_dy_18_1=Continuously knock surrounding targets flying into the air. This skill can be used in a combo attack.
desc_skill_1908_dy_19_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If the target blocks, then they faint for 4 seconds.
desc_skill_1908_dy_20_1=<s>
desc_skill_1908_dy_21_1=Burning something good? (Spend three Night City Treasure Chests)
desc_skill_1908_dy_22_1=Key Synthesize Stage 15
desc_skill_1908_dy_23_1=Synthesize Silver Key
desc_skill_1908_dy_24_1=Synthesize Gold Key
desc_skill_1908_dy_25_1=Sneak up behind the guards and deliver a fatal blow (Cannot be used in battle)
desc_skill_1908_dy_26_1=Medicine
desc_skill_1908_dy_27_1=change outfit
desc_skill_1908_dy_28_1=Stun targets nearby and deal massive damage (Spend five Night City Treasure Chests)
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_01_1=Summoned Ghost Mask drives everyone into a Dreamscape. Your Damage is increased by 300%.
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_02_1=Creates a Ghost Mask phantom at each player's feet. When taking damage, restores HP of all the Ghost Masks around by 100%. The Ghost Mask will self-destruct after 1 minute. Self-destruction does not cause effects. Killing within 1 minute, Ghost Mask grants the player temporary skill "Calmness".
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_03_1=Grants a 3 minute shield that Reduces Damage by 90%.
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_04_1=Deals several stages of damage to targets within 30 meters. Each hit on a target not in Calmness state increases your Evasion by 5%.
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_05_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Stuns all targets within a 120° 20 meters fan-shaped area in front and causes massive damage. If you are in Ghost Mask Phantom state, and target does not have Calmness, it will get knocked into air.
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_06_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Grants a stack of shield that absorbs 2% of Max HP. If you are in Ghost Mask Dreamland state, the shield will rise and all the enemies nearby without "Calmness" status will lose 30% HP.
desc_skill_clone044_gmsz_07_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Deals multiple damage to targets nearby. If you are in Ghost Mask Dreamland and the target is not in Calmness state, they will Faint for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_hysj_01_01_1=Unleashes flying fire godlike lighting on the targets nearby. Deals a lot of Damage to all targets within 5 meters. Adds Combustion state for 15 seconds, which deducts 5% HP every 2 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_hysj_01_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Summons 5 musketeers that fire away. Deals a lot of Damage to all targets within 5 meter. Adds Combustion state for 15 seconds, which deducts 5% HP every 2 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_hysj_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Throws fire thunder bombs within 10 meters blowing up all players and causing a lot of damage. If the target has Combustion state, it will cause an additional 20% HP loss.
desc_skill_clone044_hysj_03_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Inflicts Spirit Lamp status to all targets in the field, and kills them instantly in 10 seconds. Can be removed by interacting with another player.
desc_skill_clone044_hysj_04_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Deals large damage to all targets within 5 meters, then damage to targets within 8 meters, and then to targets within 10 meters. Each hit inflicts Daylight status to the target, decreasing Accuracy by 50%.
desc_skill_clone044_hysj_05_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the current target but deals massive damage to targets within 5 meters.
desc_skill_clone044_jcz_01_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Deals a small amount of damage to the current target and inflicts Myriad Weave that deals a small amount of Damage to all targets within 8 meters every 2 seconds and inflicts other players with Thousand Threads. Up to 10 stacks. Each stack decreases Movement Speed by 20% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_jcz_02_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the current target and inflicts Intricately Woven. Inflicts 20% HP loss after 5 seconds of being active. Contaminates two other players nearby who are not hit by the effect.
desc_skill_clone044_jcz_03_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Causes massive damage to all targets within 10 meters and inflicts Golden Cage that Paralyzes for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_jcz_04_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Deals minor damage to all targets within 10 meters. If targets are in Golden Cage status, then all the Flying Skill Points, Rage and Energy get cancelled.
desc_skill_clone044_jcz_05_1=Cause minor damage to all surrounding targets within 5 meter range.
desc_skill_clone044_ltgz_01_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Deals an average amount of damage to enemies in a cone 120° area within 10 meters in the front and knocks them into air if they fail to block.
desc_skill_clone044_ltgz_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Knocks all surrounding targets within 8 meters into air and creates True Chi Shield that reduces 80% damage for 20 seconds when drawing the skill back. If you get attacked when casting the skill, there is a chance to get Damage increased by 30% for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_ltgz_03_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Causes minor damage to all the targets and adds Plants effect. Slowly restores own HP, 5% of HP per 2 seconds, lasts 10 seconds. Lose 30% HP and clear the status if you activate a skill while it is active.
desc_skill_clone044_ltgz_04_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Drags targets within 10 meters and deals 30% HP loss and inflicts Faint for 5 seconds. If more than 5 targets are hit, restores 10% HP.
desc_skill_clone044_ltgz_05_1=Charges for 1 second and grants Anatman Boundary status for 20 seconds. Each attack in this state has a chance to Siphon, and reduces External defense of all the targets within 10 meters by 50%.
desc_skill_clone044_srj_01_1=Deals massive damage to targets that fail to block within 20 meters and Silences for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_srj_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds and summons Water Shade below. Each Water Shade's attack restores 5% Energy for Shui Ruji. Water Shade can use Three Thousand Ladles of Water and Purple Burst Silver Needle skills.
desc_skill_clone044_srj_03_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Randomly points 3 players. Silk Ribbon traps players to paralyze them and instantly lose 80% HP. Other players who are within 5 meters range of trapped players will be trapped.
desc_skill_clone044_srj_04_1=Charges for 1 second. Knocks all targets within 8 meters into air and inflicts all of them with Circulating Water that decreases movement speed by 50%. When entering within 5 meters, get Knocked Back and Stunned for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_srj_05_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Deals a small amount of damage to the current target. Each hit has a certain chance to inflict Purple Burst Silver Needle status that stacks up to 10 times and makes them lose 20% of HP.
desc_skill_clone044_tlw_01_1=Grabs the current target and falls to the ground, causing massive damage to all targets within 10 meters, inflicting Knock back and Faint for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_tlw_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Causes massive damage to all targets within a 180° 10 meters fan-shaped area in front and inflicts Paralysis for 10 seconds. Each movement , skill use or Flying Skill will Paralyze for 1 second.
desc_skill_clone044_tlw_03_1=Jumps and smashes into ground. Causes massive damage to all targets within 10 meters and inflicts Regretful Earth that stuns everyone in sight for 10 seconds. If the target is blocking, their defense will be broken.
desc_skill_clone044_tlw_04_1=Grants self Tenacious Defense that reduces all Damage except for Soft Damage for 60 seconds.
desc_skill_clone044_tlw_05_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Deals a small amount of damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area and launches them up.
desc_skill_clone045_gss_01_1=Randomly picks a player and inflicts Demonic Poison that disables Flying Skill and continuously reduces Movement Speed until they can't move. When Demonic Poison is over, target's Movement Speed will be restored, and it creates a poison pool in front of target. After entering the poison pool, inflicts 1% HP damage per second. Players who enter the poison pool gain a stack of Fatal Attraction every second.
desc_skill_clone045_gss_02_1=Spreads smoke around and continuously inflicts Fatal Attraction to players within 5 meters and causes multiple damage.
desc_skill_clone045_gss_03_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Inflicts an AOE damage to the whole field and absorbs the poison pools on the field, granting self a Gas Mask that absorbs 2% Max HP.
desc_skill_clone045_gss_04_1=Throws three darts at the target in a row, knocking it back with each attack.
desc_skill_clone045_gss_05_1=Charges for 1 second. Deals one round of damage to the range. Targets that fail to block get inflicted with a stack of Fatal Attraction. Players hit get Confusion: keyboard settings are randomized, and every time they use a skill, they will get damage.
desc_skill_clone045_gwd_01_1=Pulls all the players within the range to you. Knocks down players around and adds a chance to Fall Down when using Flying Skill.
desc_skill_clone045_gwd_02_1=The boss bar deals minor AOE damage to all the players. Once the bar is full, creates a few Broken Rocks on the field (in the middle and around the area, so that the AOE range covers the entire field) and Broken Rocks bar starts. Once the bar is full, everyone within range gets massive damage. Broken Rocks can be attacked.
desc_skill_clone045_gwd_03_1=Hits players in the rectangle in front inflicting stun for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_clone045_gwd_04_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Deals AOE damage to the entire field. While in Joy, the boss's damage increases with the distance. While in Rage, boss's damage decreases with the distance.
desc_skill_clone045_gwd_05_1=Makes a series of three hits, causing damage to the current target.
desc_skill_clone045_gwd_06_1=Charges for 1 second. Deals one round of damage to non-blocking targets in the area. When hitting three targets that don't block: If you are in Joy state, certain amount of stacks of Anger will be removed. If you are in Rage state, a certain amount of Lacking Will will be removed, and 5% of HP will be restored.
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_01_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Smashes the ground, causing massive damage to all targets in the rectangular area in front and knocking all the targets in the area into air.
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_02_1=Grabs the current target and smashes it left and right. Each time it hits the ground, it deals AOE damage to the surrounding area. If you get attacked during that skill, your Damage will increase.
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_03_1=Throws random items in front, knocking targets on the path into air and inflicting Bleeding.
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_04_1=Charges for 1 second. Forms an air wave that pushes the hit targets back. Targets within 3 meters will get knocked into air. (On Hard difficulty allies within area of effect will get 200% Damage increase)
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_04a_1=Charges for 1 second. Forms an air wave that pushes the hit targets back. Targets within 3 meters will get knocked into air. (On Hard difficulty allies within area of effect will get 200% Damage increase)
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_05_1=Locks the target after breaking defense, rendering the target quartered. Casting the skill takes 5 seconds. If the target won't get free, it gets instantly killed, and your damage will increase by 200%.
desc_skill_clone045_gyw_06_1=Spears hit the area around the target and stuff comes crushing down, causing massive damage to enemies within 10 meters and Paralyzing for 10 seconds.
desc_skill_clone045_ptgj_1=buf_mmzw_damage_1
desc_skill_clone045_srj_01_1=Charges for 1 second and inflicts a small amount of damage to the area, granting an Astral Soul: Internal and external attack power Hit Rate reduced by 50%, Damage increased by 30%. There is a chance to accidentally damage an ally and do minor damage to surrounding allies when casting a skill.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_01h_1=Charges for 1 second and inflicts a small amount of damage to the area, granting an Astral Soul: Internal and external attack power Hit Rate reduced by 30%, Damage increased by 30%. There is a chance to accidentally damage an ally and do minor damage to surrounding allies when casting a skill.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Summons a large coffin in front that rises from the ground and knocks the targets within 10 meters into air and deals a lot of Damage. It also adds Official Seal state, which slows down movement speed by 80% and keyboard settings are randomized.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_03_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Interrupted when attacked 30 times. Restores 30% of Demons and Monsters HP. Grants self a stack of shield that absorbs 2% HP.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_03h_1=Charges for 3 seconds. All allies in range get a stack of shield that absorbs 2% of their HP.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_04_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Releases Poison Fog to all Corpse Puppets. Deals massive damage to all targets within 5 meters, inflict Break Defense and Faint for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_04h_1=Charges for 5 seconds. When getting a critical hit, there is a small chance of being interrupted. Spreads for around. All allies around get Evasion increased by 80% for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_05_1=Charges for 1 second. Releases Poison Fog, increasing own Evasion by 80%. Targets within 5 meters continuously lose hp.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_05h_1=Charges for 5 seconds. When getting a critical hit, there is a small chance of being interrupted. Grants Demons and Monsters to allies within range: Damage increased by 100%, Siphons when attacking.
desc_skill_clone045_srj_06_1=Charges for 5 seconds. If there are 3 and more stacks of Demons and Monsters, all the Demons and Monsters Damage increases by 50%, and attacks restore a certain amount of HP. If there are 2 and fewer stacks of Demons and Monsters, you get a shield that absorbs up to 5% of Max HP. You restore HP while the shield is active. Once the shield is broken, you get Weakened status that increases incoming Damage by 100%.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_01_1=Makes 3 random players spit venom and created Poison Circles under the target.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_02_1=Deals a small amount of damage to enemies in a fan area in front and knocks them back, inflicting Bleeding.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_03_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Makes all the targets within the area Faint and sucks them in, ignoring blocks, buffs and kills them instantly.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_04_1=Causes massive damage to all surrounding targets. Blocking can reduce the damage.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_05_1=Deals massive damage to the current target and targets around. Restores 10% of HP when hitting more than 3 targets.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_06_1=Twisting like crazy, causing damage to the whole field. If the target moves during that time, they will fall, and get Stun status similar to Drunk. Reduces damage by 90% and Movement Speed by 80%.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_07_1=Casts right after respawn. Any attack will interrupt it. Deals 20% HP loss per second to all the targets on the field and deals External Skill damage equal to 10% of Max HP.
desc_skill_clone046_cysw_08_1=desc_skill_clone046_cysw_08_1
desc_skill_fivesky_001_1=<s>
desc_skill_jtg_chxr_01_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Deals minor damage to all the targets nearby and inflicts them with debuffs: target loses 1% Max HP per second for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_jtg_chxr_02_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Causes massive damage to all targets within 40 meters and inflicts Falling Feather. If players move at that time, Green Crane restores 1% HP. Lasts 8 seconds.
desc_skill_jtg_chxr_03_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Pulls all the nearby non-blocking targets and Sword Chi fills the heavens, dealing fatal damage to targets within 20 meters. If the target blocks, breaks defense for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_jtg_chxr_04_1=Charges for 2 seconds. knocks back and enters a state. Each attack will randomly knock the enemies within 10 meters into air. If more than 10 targets are knocked into air during the attack, all targets within 10 meters will suffer lethal damage at the end of the attack.
desc_skill_jtg_chxr_05_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Deals massive damage to all targets in the front fan-shaped area and inflicts a state, during which the targets will have their HP Recovery reduced.
desc_skill_jtg_llxk_01_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Deals massive damage to 180° area in front. Targets within 5 meters get knocked down and get a lot of damage when the target uses Flying Skill.
desc_skill_jtg_llxk_02_1=Throws a flying sword, knocking targets in a rectangular area into air and enters a special state to the target. In this state, each skill interrupts the current skill casting and makes it lose 2% of Energy.
desc_skill_jtg_llxk_03_1=Inflicts a special status to 6 random targets within 30 meters. They need to press buttons to get free from the status, and if they fail to do so, they enter Infatuation state: keys get messed up. Deals average Damage to all targets within 10 meters when casting the skill.
desc_skill_jtg_llxk_04_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Inflicts lethal damage to all targets on the ground within 10 meters.
desc_skill_jtg_llxk_05_1=Charges for 2 seconds and puts the blade into ground. The blade grants the Deer Fairy Guest a special status which increases it's Damage by 200% and Damage Reduction by 100%. If the blade is not removed within 2 minutes, Deer Fairy Guest takes it and instantly kills 1 target nearby every time when dealing damage.
desc_skill_jtg_llxk_06_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the current target.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_01_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Deals average damage to all the targets within 20 meters and inflicts Elegant Writing status: movement Speed decreased by 60%, lose 5% HP every second for 15 seconds.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_02_1=Casts multiple waves in front, knocking targets that are moving into air.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_03_1=Charges for 5 seconds. Picks a random target and inflicts a Roll Call status that lasts 20 seconds. During that status, all the targets within 10 meters will get 20% HP loss when you take any kind of damage.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_04_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Hits the ground with the brush. Wave of air forms a 20 meter damage area spreading outwards. Targets touched by the wave freeze for 5 seconds, and damage taken is doubled. Use Flying Skill to evade the wave.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_05_1=Charges for 2 seconds. Throws an Ink Carp on the current target. Once it hits, it causes a massive splash damage to all the targets within 5 meters and inflicts a debuff that makes them receive 50% extra damage.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_06_1=Charges for 1 second. Roll Calls everyone and in 2 seconds water rushes under their feet, causing massive damage and forms a circular area with a 5 meter radius at the original spot. Damage in that area is decreased by 90%, and targets lose 5% Energy per second.
desc_skill_jtg_lmxz_07_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the current target and inflicts a stack of a status. During that status, 15 stacks of the status remove most skill buffs, damage taken is doubled for 60 seconds.
desc_skill_shp_20191111_1=Mud Ball
