desc_wuji_CS_mj_typzd02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets 15 meters ahead.<br>If enemy has <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>, it will add more fire (adds 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>). <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>: Continuously deals Yang Damage for 12 seconds. Max 5 stacks. <br>(<font color="#f9fc00">Iron Horse Crosses the River</font> must be learned for <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> to take effect)<br><font color="#FF00FF">Array Breaking</font>: Slightly increases skill damage. Enemy with <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font> will have fire on them increased (adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Scald</font>).
