desc_CS_jh_dl06_1=Toss an invisible powder within a five meter radius of your position, dealing {@0: 伤害包} damage to players in the vicinity and making them dizzy for three seconds.<br/><font color="#FFAE00">Ximen Yu</font>, the famous assassin, used this together with some of his advanced moves.
