desc_CS_jh_dtd06_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to the target. <br>Hitting the target will add <font color="#FFAE00">"Fold Elbow"</font>status for 5 seconds: trying to attack will get <font color="#f9fc00">skill disabled</font>. If the target forcibly uses flying skill during the period, Blade Chi <font color="#FFAE00">"Ignition"</font> will be triggered. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">"Seal Dragon"</font> effect, you receive Yellow Armor when casting skills.
