desc_CS_jh_lzxss03_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 15 meters in front. Adds 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font> to unparried enemies: Continuous HP loss within 5 seconds. (The higher the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Mass Annihilation</font>, the higher the damage.) <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font> internal injury will be gone over time.
