desc_CS_jh_lzxss06_12=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 6 meters in front. Adds 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font> to unparried enemies: Continuous HP loss within 5 seconds. (The higher the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Mass Annihilation</font>, the higher the damage.) <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font> internal injury will be gone over time. <br>At the same time, 5 <font color="#FFAE00">Blood Drops</font> will deal yin damage to affected enemies and <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> unparried enemies for 2 seconds. (Effect can take place once. You can't use the skill in air.)
