desc_CS_jh_lzxss07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to nearby targets. Adds 5 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Pouring Blood</font> to unparried enemies: Continuous HP loss within 5 seconds. (The higher the level of <font color="#f9fc00">Mass Annihilation</font>, the higher the damage.) <br>When you use the skill, you can freely move in <font color="#f9fc00">yellow armor</font> state.
