desc_CS_jh_tmjt07_1=50% damage will be dealt and the rest damage will be inflicted to you and your enemies in 10 secs. <br>If serious injured when being demonized, you will deal 25% of remaining damage to your enemies.<br>(Your seriously injury caused by remaining damage won't increase enemy's Infamy)
