desc_CS_sjy_dkd05_1=Golden Blade Iron Horse Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. If you have 3 and more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font>, 3 stacks will be spent and non-parry target will be <font color="#FFAE00">Knocked down</font>. <br>Your attack will have Yellow Armor status. Can move freely when casting.
