desc_CS_sjy_dkd07_1=All warriors win by surprise. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage the target within 8 meters and inflicts non-parry targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Defeat</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Slows down</font> by 15%. After 4 stacks <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds. If you have 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font>, non-parry targets will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. <br>Unable to use in the air.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd07_10=All warriors win by surprise. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage the target within 8 meters and inflicts non-parry targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Defeat</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Slows down</font> by 15%. After 4 stacks <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds. If you have 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font>, non-parry targets will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. <br>Unable to use in the air.
desc_CS_sjy_dkd07_11=All warriors win by surprise. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage the target within 8 meters and inflicts non-parry targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Defeat</font>: <font color="#f9fc00">Disables Flying Skills</font> for 3 seconds and <font color="#f9fc00">Slows down</font> by 15%. After 4 stacks <font color="#f9fc00">Paralyzed</font> for 3 seconds. If you have 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Battle Will</font>, non-parry targets will be <font color="#f9fc00">Thrown</font>. <br>Unable to use in the air.
