desc_CS_xd_dyshd05_1=Enters a state of <font color="#FF3030">Suppress Feelings</font>:<br>Maxes out the <font color="#f9fc00">Leech effect of each skill under this skillset</font> at its extreme (Converts 55% of the damage you deal into HP) for 12 seconds.<br>While this effect is active, taking out a player heals you for 50% of your lost HP and 50% of your lost Energy, and gets you 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul</font>. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul</font> neutralizes 50% of the damage of an incoming hit.
desc_CS_xd_dyshd05_10=Enters a state of <font color="#FF3030">Suppress Feelings</font>:<br>Maxes out the <font color="#f9fc00">Leech effect of each skill under this skillset</font> at its extreme (Converts 70% of the damage you deal into HP) for 15 seconds.<br>While this effect is active, taking out a player heals you for 50% of your lost HP and 50% of your lost Energy, and gets you 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul</font>. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul</font> neutralizes 50% of the damage of an incoming hit.
