desc_Clone004_helaershu_03_1=Four swords appear. If the player cannot break the swords in 10 seconds, the boss will gain an ability to attack the entire team at once.
desc_NPC_sjy_dkd05_1=Golden Blade Iron Horse Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets within 5 meters. If you have 3 and more stacks of Battle Will, 3 stacks will be spend and non-parry target will be Knocked down. Your attack will have Yellow Armor status. Can move freely when casting.
