desc_Npc_jh_yywd07_1=Sweeps surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Each attack can <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> enemy for 2 seconds, and attach <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect: keeps losing HP, lasts 8 seconds, can stack up to 5 times. <br>Need to learn skill <font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Wind and Moon</font> to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect.
