desc_Npc_ssg_jxc08_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 10 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them.<br>Get yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> but unable to move while casting.
desc_Npc_ssg_jxc08_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 10 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them.<br>Get yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> but unable to move while casting.
