desc_Npc_ssg_jxc08_9=Deals {@0:伤害包} to targets within 10 meters and <font color="#f9fc00">Stuns</font> them.<br>Get yourself <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> but unable to move while casting.
desc_Npc_xd_dyshd05_1=Enters <font color="#FF3030">Suppress Feelings</font> state: <br>The <font color="#f9fc00">Vampiric</font> effect of this skill set increases to the cap (70% of the damage) in 15 seconds.<br>When killing a player within 15 seconds, you will gain full HP and Energy and 3 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul</font> state. Each stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Soul</font> can reduce the damage taken from one strike by 50%.
desc_QYBGboss005_lx_1=Reduce boss's HP and increase players' rage
desc_QYBGboss005_tgyj_1=Boss monster's HP reduced to 5%. Boss committed suicide and bring death to targets in a Y radius.
desc_clone003_zhoulifeng_ywsf_01_1=Radius of 10 meters within the scope of the traps with the trap to remove the BOSS current target of all other players, plus fishing net buffer: Equivalent to vertigo, for 5s, CD20S
desc_clone005_stzx_yyxh_1=Randomly create one illusion nearby with fixed amount of blood. Add illusion to boss blood addition effect (special effect uses black mist).
desc_clone007_ssy_ctwy_1=You want revenge, but are not brave enough. Take all of your rage and release it to cause sec-kill damage. Damage is decreased when parried.
desc_clone007_ssy_ctwy_2=You want revenge, but are not brave enough. Take all of your rage and release it to cause sec-kill damage. Damage is decreased when parried.
desc_clone007_ts_scdx_1=Boss steps on ground to make targets in a 5 meter radius immobilized and continuously bleeding.
desc_clone007_wwdz_typt_1=Yang Chi bursts from the body and falls from heaven. Causes damage to surrounding players in a circular range and stuns them. After using it, boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone007_wwdz_typt_2=Yang Chi bursts from the body and falls from heaven. Causes damage to surrounding players in a circular range and stuns them. After using it, boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone007_wwdz_tyst_1=Charge the player in front in a straight line and cause random damage and stun. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone007_wwdz_tyst_2=Charge the player in front in a straight line and cause random damage and stun. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone009_myst_dlz_1=Cause major damage to a single target and add bleeding and immobilization effect for 5 seconds. Bleeding effect can be overcome by Rosy Clouds Slowly Rise effect. If the target enters Fatal Injury State during time of bleeding effect, then the boss recovers 10% of Chi and blood.
desc_clone009_myst_dlz_2=Cause major damage to a single target and add bleeding and immobilization effect for 5 seconds. Bleeding effect can be overcome by Rosy Clouds Slowly Rise effect. If the target enters Fatal Injury State during time of bleeding effect, then the boss recovers 10% of Chi and blood.
desc_clone011_xg_mdhx_1=50% damage will be dealt and the rest damage will be inflicted to you and your enemies in 10 secs. <br>If serious injured when being demonized, you will deal 25% of remaining damage to your enemies.<br>(Your seriously injury caused by remaining damage won't increase enemy's Infamy)
desc_clone011_xkg_xuzhao_1=Cause minor damage to surrounding targets. If target parries, then the Guardian effect is added. When attacking boss, you will be knocked flying into the air and friendly forces will receive 10% damage in aftershock.
desc_clone013_tmj_ygsn_1=The boss stays in one place without moving. Guide healing skills. Causes mass recovery within 10 meters regardless of affiliation for 10 seconds. Recover 2% of HP top limit every second. Basic: Cuts off at 3,000; Hard: 20,000; Hell: 30,000
desc_clone015_gebufan_03_1=All targets within 20 meters fall into Deterred status. Status length determined by target's proximity to boss. Active for 10 seconds within 3 meters. Active for 8 seconds within 3 to 6 meters. Active for 6 seconds within 6 to 9 meters. Active for 4 seconds at more than 9 meters.
desc_clone019_foshi_wjj_1=It will be charging over 3 sec. Targets in the distance will receive more damage. After releasing, BOSS will be exhausted and unable to attack. Additional damage will be dealt when attacking the giant sword.
desc_clone019_foshi_yuancheng_1=Boss monster's physical attack cause sword Energy damage in a 60m radius
desc_clone019_hwt_typt_1=Yang Chi bursts from the body and falls from heaven. Causes damage to surrounding players in a circular range and launch. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone019_hwt_typt_2=Yang Chi bursts from the body and falls from heaven. Causes damage to surrounding players in a circular range and launch. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone019_hwt_tyst_1=Charge the player in front in a straight line and cause random damage and stun. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone019_hwt_tyst_2=Charge the player in front in a straight line and cause random damage and stun. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone019_hwt_yjys_1=Select a target and use a buff to cause damage to surrounding targets. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone019_hwt_yjys_2=Select a target and use a buff to cause damage to surrounding targets. After using it, the boss enters the Internal Skill Core state.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_sxg_d_1=Make targets nearby affected by the Bloodthirsty Insect Poison, increasing targets' attack power and reducing their defense power. Will cause bleeding effect when attacked by boss.
desc_clone019_mazhalan_sxg_k_1=Make targets nearby affected by the Bloodthirsty Insect Poison, increasing targets' attack power and reducing their defense power. Will cause bleeding effect when attacked by boss.
desc_clone021_yuancheng07_1=The Peacock Plume left behind by Taoist Mu, can cause significant injury to him during boss fight in the "King of Hidden Weapons" event
desc_clone021_yuancheng08_1=The Peacock Plume left behind by Taoist Mu, can cause significant injury to him during boss fight in the "King of Hidden Weapons" event
desc_clone021_yuancheng09_1=The Peacock Plume left behind by Taoist Mu, can cause significant injury to him during boss fight in the "King of Hidden Weapons" event
desc_dfsh_yxwf_bs01_1=Use the skill to kill a mouse.
desc_event_boss02_1_1=Second Internal Skill Event boss's AOE skill
desc_event_boss02_2_1=Second Internal Skill Event boss's skill, fixed damage 550 (Dagger)
desc_event_boss02_3_1=Second Internal Skill Event boss's skill, increase 40% damage.
desc_event_boss02_4_1=Second Internal Skill Event boss's skill, fixed damage 350 (Dagger)
desc_event_boss03_11_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a 90 degree fan shaped 500 aoe damage to 20 targets (a Japanese captain's aoe skill)
desc_event_boss03_12_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 450*3 damage (a Japanese captain's skill)
desc_event_boss03_13_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 450 damage (a Japanese captain's skill)
desc_event_boss03_1_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 1800 damage (a Japanese commander's skill)
desc_event_boss03_2_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a 90 degree fan shaped 1800 aoe damage to 20 targets (a Japanese commander's aoe skill)
desc_event_boss03_3_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 850*3 damage (a Japanese captain's skill)
desc_event_boss03_4_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a 90 degree fan shaped 850 aoe damage to 20 targets (a Japanese commander's aoe skill)
desc_event_boss03_5_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 550 damage (Dagger)
desc_event_boss03_6_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 350*3 damage (Dagger)
desc_event_boss03_7_1=Internal Skills Tier 3 Boss skills. Grant a single target 850*3 damage (a Japanese captain's skill)
desc_fb_Npc_jh_tmjt07_1=50% damage will be dealt and the rest damage will be inflicted to you and your enemies in 10 secs. <br>If serious injured when being demonized, you will deal 25% of remaining damage to your enemies.<br>(Your seriously injury caused by remaining damage won't increase enemy's Infamy)
desc_jn_boss_srz0104_1=50% damage will be dealt and the rest damage will be inflicted to you and your enemies in 10 secs. <br>If serious injured when being demonized, you will deal 25% of remaining damage to your enemies.<br>(Your seriously injury caused by remaining damage won't increase enemy's Infamy)
desc_jn_clone034_boss2_03_1=Stabs sword into the ground and creates sword array in a 10m radius. Deals continuous damage to players within the array. Damage of Spellbound BOSSES decreases 90%.
desc_jn_gmphd_01_001_1=In the event of Attack Killers' Manor, removing the traps at the gate will help a lot.
desc_jn_gmphd_01_002_1=In the event of Attack Killers' Manor, you can cure the injured Disciples.
desc_jn_gmphd_01_003_1=In the event of Attack Killers' Manor, you can cure the injured Disciples.
desc_jn_gmphd_01_018_1=Killers' Manor - Normal Attack
desc_jn_gmphd_01_019_1=Killers' Manor - Slow nearby enemies
desc_jn_gmphd_01_019_1_1=Killers' Manor - Slow nearby enemies - for junior monsters
desc_jn_gmphd_01_020_1=Killers' Manor - Knock into air with buff
desc_jn_gmphd_01_020_1_1=Killers' Manor - Knock into air with buff - for junior monsters
desc_jn_gmphd_01_021_1=Killers' Manor - Kill and HP Recovery
desc_jn_gmphd_01_022_1=Killers' Manor - Defense break, remove rage and reduce mana
desc_jn_gmphd_01_023_1=Killers' Manor - Vajra's Protection
desc_jn_gmphd_01_024_1=Killers' Manor - Great HP loss damage
desc_jn_gmphd_01_025_1=Killers' Manor - Effect with buff added
desc_jn_guild_03_02_1=Throws backward, ignores Evasion, and removes the targets' Pluck The Peacock's Plume, Buddha's Golden Aura, and Ravaging Venom.
desc_jn_jhhj_001_1=Striking a target with a hidden weapon deals 30% of max damage and marks the target. If you kill the marked target within 2 minutes, your HP will be fully restored.
desc_jn_jyjx_dwz_001_1=Every time you kill an intruder, you can get this skill, which can be used on Chi Yangzi to restore a certain amount of HP to help him break through the last level of the Nine Yang Peerless Scripts. (It will disappear after the skill is used. You need to kill the intruder to get this skill.)
desc_jn_new_hql06_1=You are far away from the Boss. Jump right to the player and knock him down.
desc_jn_tg29_064_1=2 seconds to cast. The skill removes all debuffs and adds a shield to the player, increasing Defense by 50% and absorbing 1000 points of damage taken for 12 seconds. If the damage exceeds over 1000 points, the shield shatters and stuns nearby Boss NPC for 5 seconds. 45 seconds cooldown.
desc_jn_tqwf_001_1=Striking a target with a hidden weapon deals 30% of max damage and marks the target. If you kill the marked target within 2 minutes, your HP will be fully restored.
desc_jn_xiake_shp_hole_1_1=Striking a target with a hidden weapon deals 30% of max damage and marks the target. If you kill the marked target within 2 minutes, your HP will be fully restored.
desc_jn_yyzc_boss050_1=Attack nearby targets. This skill is unlocked after scoring many kills.
desc_jxxl_jh_mxlhs07_1=50% damage will be dealt and the rest damage will be inflicted to you and your enemies in 10 secs. <br>If serious injured when being demonized, it will deal 25% damage to your enemies. <br>(Badly Hurt by the remaining damage will not increase the Infamy of target.)
desc_jy_fswf_01_1=Deal damage to surrounding targets and knock them flying.
desc_jy_fswf_02_1=Deal damage to the target and add yourself with Yellow Armor effect.
desc_jy_fswf_03_1=Deal damage to the target and knock it down.
desc_jy_fswf_04_1=Deal damage to the target and stun it.
desc_jy_fswf_05_1=Deal damage to the target and stun it. At the same time recover 2% of your HP and Energy per second, lasts 10 second.
desc_newworld_mijing_yywd07_1=Sweeps surrounding enemies to deal {@0:伤害包}.<br>Each attack can <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> enemy for 2 seconds, and attach <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect: keeps losing HP, lasts 8 seconds, can stack up to 5 times. <br>Need to learn skill <font color="#f9fc00">Boundless Wind and Moon</font> to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Wind and Moon</font> effect.
desc_newworld_miku_hql_07_1=You are far away from the Boss. Jump right to the player and knock him down.
desc_rn_fbboss_001_1=Jail Delivery boss's harming skill, it has 70% chance to disarm the target for 5 seconds (Palm)
desc_rn_fbboss_002_1=Prison break boss skill. Attack increased by 40% (Fist)
desc_rn_fbboss_003_1=Prison break boss limited skill. Stiffness and Damage equal to 5% of Max HP (Fist)
desc_rn_fbboss_004_1=Jail Delivery boss's harming skill, fixed damage 350 (Palm)
desc_rn_fbboss_005_1=Prison break boss damage skill. Deals a Trauma buff (Fist)
desc_rn_fbboss_006_1=Prison break boss damage skill. Deals additional Damage to an enemy with Trauma (Fist)
desc_rn_fbboss_007_1=Jail Delivery boss's harming skill, fixed damage 550 (Knife)
desc_rn_fbboss_008_1=Prison break boss skill. 50% splash damage (Blade)
desc_rn_fbboss_009_1=Prison break boss skill. Seal Acupoint (Blade)
desc_rn_fbboss_010_1=Prison break boss skill. Recovers 30%/50%/70%/90%/120% of current HP (Blade)
desc_rn_fbboss_011_1=Prison break boss skill. Attack increased by 40% for 15 seconds (Blade)
desc_skill_6nei_dlxw_04_1=Charge this skill for 10 seconds. If successful, targeted NPC will lose 5% HP. Allies receive the Yue effect, which grants 50% immunity against damage and reduces damage received by 50% for 20 seconds. When boss is attacked, there is a 5% chance of interrupting this skill. Using a special item will immediately interrupt this skill.
desc_skill_6nei_myfr_02_1=Lady Moon charges this skill for 5 seconds to deal massive damage. This damage can be shared among the target's nearby teammates. However, if the damage is not shared by exactly 4 teammates, Lady Moon gains the Chaos and Confusion effect for 30 seconds. During this effect, every time Lady Moon attacks a player, she recovers 5% HP. This can be done at most 3 times.
desc_skill_6nei_shlw_04_1=Boss throws nearby targets to inflict minor damage, and gain the Fangs effect for 20 seconds. This effect causes target to lose 1% HP for 10 seconds. If boss has the Opportunistic Strike effect, he tosses 20 bombs to the ground. The bombs detonate in 10 seconds, causing all targets in the 5-meter blast radius to lose 50% HP. The bombs cannot be attacked by players; each time a player attempts to do so, he or she is knocked back.
desc_skill_SJclone01_mon_03_1=Charge this skill for 5 seconds and create a illusion. This illusion lasts for 1 minute and helps shoulder 50% damage. If this illusion is not killed in 1 minute it will explore and cause all the targets lose their 90% HP. The targets will also immunity to some buffs such as Pluck The Peacock's Plume, Yellow Armor, Red Armor and Buddha Heart Palm in 20 seconds.
desc_skill_adv034_fyc_05_1=Skill loading time is 3 seconds. Cast fans nearby and play moon watching music. When the fans exist, the boss is invincible and heals 1% HP every 2 seconds. When the playing ends, the boss heals 20% HP. In the next 30 seconds, all targets within 30 meters will not heal any HP. If the fans are destroyed, then the music playing will be interrupted.
desc_skill_clone034_hx_04_1=Throws disc ahead, knocking airborne all targets in its path and dealing continuous damage. The disc returns to the BOSS' hands.
desc_skill_clone034_lyy_06_1=Gather power 2s. Deals kill damage if target isn't Parrying, or massive damage if target is Parrying. If player is killed, damage increases 50% for 1 minute. Each attack causes Vampiric effect. (If in Yin Yang State, only deals small amount of damage; no extra effect)
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ds03_1=Uses the power of Moonlight to blend user into the surroundings, becoming hidden for 3s. BOSS evasion increases greatly while hiding. After coming out of hiding, Lunar Eclipse power is released to deal great damage to the current target.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx03_1=10s of casting time. Twelve Lotus Flowers appear on the field. If not all killed, the Boss deals kill damage to all when finished casting. Boss takes 50% more damage while casting. All damage taken after 10s is given to players and bosses within 5m (during skill time, boss takes 3 actual damage)
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx05_1=Cast for 3s. Stun players ahead for 3s and ignore endurance knock back. Range includes area 40m in front of the BOSS in a 120 degree fan shape (only used in phase 1 and 2). During new moon, stun time is 5s.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx08_1=Cast 3s. Triggers the potential of green vines to grow rapidly. Causes paralyze effect. Players on the ground take continuous great damage. Knocks flying players to the ground and does mid level damage. Also summons a Lotus Flower NPC that can be attacked in the water nearby. The NPC recovers 1% of the BOSS' HP every 10 second. The Lotus Flower is immune to External skill attacks and can last up to 100s. (only used in stage 4) Summon two Lotus Flowers during the first quarter of the moon.
desc_skill_clone034_yhc_ywx09_1=Casts 2s. Uses the power of the moon to stun non-parrying players nearby and bring closer to the BOSS to damage. Uses spinning kick within 20m to knock flying all non Hatred targets back 30m (kicks off Lotus Pad) and deal damage. Deals damage in a large area. Area of effect is 20m. (Only used in phases 3 and 4) During New Moon Array, drags in players within 40m.
desc_skill_clone039_fxmy_03_1=Charges up for 5 seconds, dealing 5 rounds of continuous damage to enemies nearby. This damage can be blocked. When final round is blocked, Boss's damage will be increased by 200% for next 20 seconds and the next attack has a 50% chance to inflict Break Defense.
desc_skill_clone040_cj_05_1=Charge the current target for 8 seconds. If there are no more than 5 teammates within 3 meters of the target, the target will be killed directly, and the BOSS will increase its damage by 300% for 30 seconds. If there are more than 5 teammates, a small amount of damage is caused, and a 20-second Pardon state is added to all player targets in the range. In this state, when the player uses Flying Skills, the Sword Wound mark state will not be added. This skill triggers the Concentration effect when it hits the target.
desc_skill_clone040_cj_05_a_1=Charge the current target for 8 seconds. If there are no more than 5 teammates within 3 meters of the target, the target will be killed directly, and the BOSS will increase its damage by 300% for 30 seconds. If there are more than 5 teammates, a small amount of damage is caused, and a 20-second Pardon state is added to all player targets in the range. In this state, when the player uses Flying Skills, the Sword Wound mark state will not be added. This skill triggers the Concentration effect when it hits the target.
desc_skill_clone040_dmym_01_1=Charge up for 5 seconds. During the period, if you receive a Critical Hit, you will be interrupted by 15%. If the Frost Shadow is successful, it will add 10 seconds of Frost Shadow state, and Evasion rate will increase by 95%, slowly getting a stack of damage reduction every 2 seconds. When the Frost Shadow is over, you will get the Mist Concealment-Shield state. This state is based on the number of stacks to avoid damage, and the state exists for 45 seconds. If you take damage while in Frost Shadow state, the Frost Shadow state will be cancelled immediately. When decrease damage shield exists, all Boss skills are changed.
desc_skill_clone040_gsx_04_1=Charge up for 3 seconds, cause a lot of damage to all targets in a sector area of 120° in front of you and a radius of 10 meters, and Burn the target, reducing the target's Movement Speed by 50%. Each time damage received, the damage is doubled. When hitting the target, it will Feedback to the Boss for 10 seconds of Sunset status. In the Sunset state, within 5 meters of the BOSS, the Critical Hit Rate of all targets is reduced by 95%, and the Crit Damage is reduced by 100%.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_04_1=In two situations, it needs to be shared or stay away from the crowd; as the HP of the Boss decreases, the number of people who are randomized increases.
desc_skill_clone040_jqw_05_1=Create an Icy Flame Ball with fixed coordinates and start to cast the skill of destroying the group. Need to kill within the specified time. As the Boss HP drops, the Icy Flame Ball gets a certain amount of Damage Reduction.
desc_skill_clone040_sw_06_a_1=After a burst, 2 Starlight NPCs are randomly created within 10 meters. 4 people are required to stand around the Starlight NPC. If within less than 5 seconds, or there are more than 4 people or less than 4 people, the BOSS will get the Starlight. All targets within 80 meters around suffer 60% HP loss every second for 20 seconds. This damage ignores most Skill Buffs.
desc_skill_clone043_jll_01_1=The skill charges for 5 seconds and stuns all targets upon hit. When the skill hits a target, random targets in the field will get inflicted with Cobweb status for 20 seconds, and when the skill hits ends, the Stun status is removed from all players. The player not in Stun state will be inflicted with Spider Insect state. Spider Insect state summons a small spider that cannot be killed every 5 seconds, and in 1 second all targets within 20 meters around it will suffer loss of 50% HP. Flying Skills will be forbidden, and movement speed reduced by 90%. After the player is caught in the Cobweb status, every time the player moves and uses Flying Skills, the spider web state will be stacked. When there are 20 stacks of Cobweb, the player will be Paralyzed, Faint and wrapped by the spider web, losing 20% HP per second, which ignores most immunity, and will return 0.1% of HP per second to Jin Linglong, and will return 30% HP to Jin Linglong once the target is killed. Permanently boosts Jin Linglong movement speed by 5%. This status is permanent. Teammates can break through the spider web to free their teammates.
desc_skill_clone043_jll_02_1=Charges for 3 seconds and slaps the ground, dealing massive damage to everyone, dropping multiple Golden Toads around, adding 1 minute of Golden Toad Poison - Live effect when entering within 8 meters of a Golden Toad. Player movement speed is increased by 100%, all buffs are cleared, and cannot gain them again for the duration of the effect. The Golden Toad will generate a 10-meter range of Golden Toad Poison - Toxic on the bottom of its feet after each move. You will lose 30% HP every 2 seconds when you enter the poison circle. This damage ignores defense and adds the Golden Toad Poison - Fatal effect, ignoring and being immune to most buffs. If you take any damage under this effect, you will take double damage. The Golden Toad can be killed.
desc_skill_clone043_whg_06_1=Charges for 3 seconds. Inflicts moderate damage to the entire field and break the defense of all blocking targets. Also unable to use Flying Skills for the next 20 seconds. At the same time, Blood-Drinking Needle state will be inflicted on 5 random targets on the field. When you are hit by the Blood-Drinking Needle, you will temporarily gain the Energy Needle status. When you use the Energy Needle status, you will get the Outer Explosion status, causing 20% HP loss to all targets within 20 meters of you if their HP is below 50%, and 60% HP loss to all targets if their HP level is above 50%. If the Blood-Drinking Needle status ends automatically, the BOSS will get Blood Shield, making them immune to 90% of all damage for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_hs_oy04_1=Boss leaps towards a random target, trampling him or her. Target loses HP over time and suffers from Bone Fracture, unable to use Flying Skills and slowed by 80%.
desc_skill_hs_scz04_1=Zun Chengzong charges this skill for 5 seconds, during which nearby targets take damage. This damage only be reduced by the use of Remove the Demon, one of the Six Demonslaying Techniques. With such use, players can dodge behind boulders to avoid damage. The boulders themselves will be destroyed.
desc_skill_hs_xy04_1=Boss traps the player in a sword array, disabling the player's attack and flying skills.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_cf_05_1=Remove the Modest Sword buff from boss.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_lyq_03_1=Target receives Venerated Sword effect, losing 2000 and an additional 5% of his or her current HP. If the Venerated Sword state expires while the player is within 2 meters of the boss, Venerated Sword will again be in effect.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_lyq_04_1=When boss's HP is below 20%, a sword array will appear every 5 seconds. Within the sword array's area of effect, targets will be unable to use Flying Skills. For 10 seconds, targets within the area of effect will lost 10% HP. While the array is active, players must attack the animated greatsword within the array; doing so depletes 5% of the boss's HP. However, players will also lose 40% of their HP during this attack.
desc_skill_hsp_gdj_tyx_03_1=Inflict minor damage to target, and gain the Transformation effect, whose level increases as it stacks up. When Transformation is at level 5, boss's attack power increases by 5%. At level 10, attack power increases 10%. At level 15, attack power increases 30%. At level 25, attack power increases 50%. At level 50, attack power increases 80%.
desc_skill_jyz_sinei_menshen01_1=Door God kills collapsed player
desc_skill_nlb_llz_003_1=10 seconds for preparing the skill. Gain Tender Flower. Stacks Broken Heart every time you get attacked until it teaches 50 stacks, dealing 10,000 points of HP damage to the Boss and interrupting its skills. Debuffs attacker with Evil Desire every time you get attacked. When Evil Desire is stacked up to four times, attacker will get fainted for five seconds. After skill is prepared, deals huge damage to targets within five meters.
desc_skill_nlb_llz_005_1=One second for preparing the skill. Gain Bloom and create a poisonous flower every two seconds, dealing 500 HP damage per second to all target players. Debuffs Boss with Narcissism. It takes 100 points of internal energy for each attack.
desc_skill_nlb_yxc_001_1=Deals damage to all targets 5 times within 3 meters. <br>Boss says: Only righteousness matters to me. It'd be better if Nianluo Flowers are destroyed.
desc_skill_ssg_mphz_005_1=Create a double of yourself at a random nearby location. Become Indignant, increasing your damage by 25%.
desc_skill_xiake_fishing_sanfen_1_1=Use this skill to defeat the Four Scourges. Defeat them to complete the The Four Scourges event.
desc_skill_xiake_fishing_shayu_1=Use this skill to kill the sharks in the waters near the "Treasure of the Eastern Seas". Kill 3 sharks to complete the Eastern Seas Newcomer event.
desc_sw_mj_29_1=Boss throws nearby targets to inflict minor damage, and gain the Fangs effect for 20 seconds. This effect causes target to lose 1% HP for 10 seconds. If boss has the Opportunistic Strike effect, he tosses 20 bombs to the ground. The bombs detonate in 10 seconds, causing all targets in the 5-meter blast radius to lose 50% HP. The bombs cannot be attacked by players; each time a player attempts to do so, he or she is knocked back.
desc_tiandifeng03_guj004_1=Charge this skill for 10 seconds. Allies receive the Yue effect, which grants 50% immunity against damage and reduces damage received by 50% for 20 seconds. When the boss is attacked, there is a 5% chance to be interrupted.
desc_wuji_CS_ts_wcjf05_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If your energy is more than the target's energy, then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stiff</font>. Every time you hit unparried targets, you add <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> state to them. Each stack increases <font color="#f9fc00">the chance of being critical hit</font> by 5%. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy. Last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">instantly jumps</font>to the back of unparried target. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Autumn Water</font>: Slightly increase damage. <font color="#f9fc00">Accuracy rate</font> is significantly increased. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.15 of the target's lost energy.
desc_wuji_CS_ts_wcjf05_2=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to the target. If your energy is more than the target's energy, then the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">stiff</font>. Every time you hit unparried targets, you add <font color="#FFAE00">Dim Spirit</font> state to them. Each stack increases <font color="#f9fc00">the chance of being critical hit</font> by 5%. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.1 of the target's lost energy. Last hit can <font color="#f9fc00">instantly jumps</font>to the back of unparried target. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Autumn Water</font>: Slightly increase damage. <font color="#f9fc00">Accuracy rate</font> is significantly increased. Each hit has extra damage that is equivalent to 0.15 of the target's lost energy.
