desc_wx_jy_dqd05_1=Makes you possessed. Increases Attack by 35% for 12 seconds. The status disappears once you kill the target. If the status has ended and you have not killed the target, Energy will be halved.
desc_wx_jy_shd05_1=Killing the unit within 6 seconds recovers 12% HP and 8% Energy
desc_wx_jy_shd05_2=Killing the unit within 9 seconds recovers 12% HP and 8% Energy
desc_wx_jy_shd05_3=Killing the unit within 12 seconds recovers 15% HP and 10% Energy
desc_zf_jhts_02_003_1=Interrupts Qiu Hentian and guides the assassins back into the array. (Top secret skill. Do not use unless you are trapped in the Forbidden Area.)
desc_zf_slts_01_002_1=Golden shield protects body, reduce massive taken damage from Boss for team members. (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
desc_zf_tmts_01_003_1=Make all team members taken less damage from Boss, last 10s. (Top stunt, if you are not trapped in forbidden area, do not use it, remember! )
