desc_CS_jh_sf02_1=If you don't believe me, look at the chess player, who must hold the end of the game. Shooting the pieces will cause {@0: damage} to the target. If the target has <font color="#FFAE00">move mountains and fill the sea</font>, then the splashing damage will be given to the surrounding targets.
