desc_CS_jh_sf03_1=Only by adapting to change can one remain safe, and only a brave warrior can defend all sides. Throwing chess pieces at the target will cause {@0: damage}, and when the target's defense is broken, they can be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>.
desc_CS_jh_sf03_10=Only by adapting to change can one remain safe, and only a brave warrior can defend all sides. Throwing chess pieces at the target will cause {@0: damage}, and when the target's defense is broken, they can be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>.
