desc_CS_jh_sf04_1=In the world of endless competition, relying solely on the old Qing Mountain chess game. When targeting, it causes {@0: damage package}. If the target does not defend, an additional layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Move Mountains and Fill Seas</font> will be added: when attacked by this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army]</font>, it will splash 10% of the damage to surrounding targets, up to 4 layers, lasting for 15 seconds.
