desc_CS_jh_sf05_1=Qin, sword, wine, chess, dragon, crane, and tiger, carefree and worry-free. When successfully defending, there is a 30% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Self-Improvement Status</font> to oneself: the damage of the moves in this set <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army], [Move Mountains and Fill Seas], [Dragon Swimming in the Sea]</font> will increase by 10%, lasting for 8 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sf05_10=The basics of geometry are like a game of chess, where one must be skilled in order to succeed. When successfully defending, there is a 50% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-righteousness</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army][Moving Mountains][Dragon's Sea Voyage]</font> increases damage by 25% for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sf05_11=The basics of geometry are like a game of chess, where one must be skilled in order to succeed. When successfully defending, there is a 55% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-righteousness</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army][Moving Mountains][Dragon's Sea Voyage]</font> increases damage by 25% for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sf05_12=The basics of geometry are like a game of chess, where one must be skilled in order to succeed. When successfully defending, there is a 60% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-righteousness</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army][Moving Mountains][Dragon's Sea Voyage]</font> increases damage by 25% for 15 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sf05_2=Like a game of chess, the basics of geometry require skill and strategy to master. When successfully defending, there is a 35% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-righteousness</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army][Moving Mountains][Dragon's Sea Voyage]</font> increases damage by 10% for 10 seconds.
