desc_CS_jh_sf05_5=When successfully blocking, there is a 40% chance to add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-sufficiency status</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army][Moving Mountains and Filling Seas][Dragon Swimming in the Sea]</font> increases damage by 15% for 11 seconds.
