desc_CS_jh_sf05_9=When successfully blocking, there is a 50% chance to add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-sufficiency status</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army][Moving Mountains and Filling Seas][Dragon Swimming in the Sea]</font> increases damage by 20% for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sf06_1=When the song ends and the stars disappear, the mind is at peace and the machine is forgotten. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> enemies within the selected range for 2 seconds, causing {@0: damage} and placing <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chessboard</font>: When the Holy Plum Chessboard is present, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">[Rain as Cover]</font>: Use to destroy the Holy Plum Chessboard, causing damage to enemies within the chessboard and pulling in and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> enemies who have not defended.
