desc_CS_jh_sf06_hide_1=Looking into the distant blue cave, the bright moon rises. Even if fame and fortune are fleeting, the game of destroying the holy plum chess game can cause harm to enemies within the game, and bring them closer and <font color="#f9fc00">knock them away</font>.
