desc_CS_jh_sf07_1=Who can use black and white to enter the mysterious realm, experiencing life and death a thousand times. When releasing this move, the user and surrounding teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> state: the next time they are attacked, they will receive an additional 5% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting 10 seconds). <br>When in the <font color="#FFAE00">self-sufficient</font> state, this move can remove the <font color="#FFAE00">self-sufficient</font> state and put the user in a <font color="#f9fc00">dominant</font> state during the execution of this move. <br>During the execution, the <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Army]</font> skill can be used to interrupt. <br>(This move cannot be executed in mid-air).
desc_CS_jh_sf07_10=Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, and the concept of square and circle? When this move is used, the user and their teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">"Benefit the World"</font> state: the next time they are attacked, they will receive an additional 5% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 10 seconds). If the user is in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Self-Reliant"</font> state, they can remove it and enter the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Emperor"</font> state during the execution of this move. During the execution, the user can use the <font color="#f9fc00">"Rise of the Rebels"</font> skill to interrupt. (This move cannot be used in mid-air).
desc_CS_jh_sf07_11=Who can use black and white to enter the mysterious, the cycle of life and death is square. When releasing moves, you and your surrounding teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Benefit the World"</font> state: the next attack will reduce an additional 9% damage (up to 5 layers, lasting 20 seconds). <br> When in <font color="#FFAE00">"Self-Reliance"</font> state, you can remove <font color="#FFAE00">"Self-Reliance"</font> and make the process of this move become <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Emperor's Body"</font> state. <br> During the release, you can use the <font color="#f9fc00">"Rise of the Rebels"</font> skill to interrupt. <br> (This move cannot be performed in the air).
desc_CS_jh_sf07_12=Who can use black and white to enter the mysterious, the cycle of life and death embodies the concept of square and circle. When releasing this move, you and your surrounding teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">"Benefit the World"</font> state: the next attack will have an additional 9% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting 25 seconds). <br> While in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Self-Reliance"</font> state, you can remove the <font color="#FFAE00">"Self-Reliance"</font> state and change the execution of this move to the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Emperor's Body"</font> state. <br> During the execution, you can use the <font color="#f9fc00">"Rise of the Rebels"</font> skill to interrupt. <br> (This move cannot be executed in mid-air).
