desc_CS_jh_sf08_1=Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, and the concept of square and circle? When this move is used, the user and their surrounding teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of the <font color="#FFAE00">"Benefit the World"</font> state: the next time they are attacked, they will receive an additional 8% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 20 seconds). If the user is in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Self-Reliant"</font> state, they can remove it and enter the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Emperor's Body"</font> state during the execution of this move. During the execution, the user can use the <font color="#f9fc00">"Rising Up Against the Odds"</font> skill to interrupt. (This move cannot be used in mid-air).
