desc_CS_jh_sfgp01_1=How can one withstand the challenges of the business world? Together, we call upon the wind and rain to soar like dragons. This move inflicts {@0: damage} on enemies within range, causing a brief <font color="#FFAE00">"Stun"</font> if the target is not able to defend, and finally <font color="#f9fc00">"Stuns"</font> surrounding enemies who were not able to defend for 1 second. The execution of this move is in the <font color="#f9fc00">"Yellow Emperor's Body"</font> state. (This move cannot be used in mid-air).
desc_CS_jh_sfgp01_10=<font color="#a3ca44">-Everyone cleans their clothes of dust, and I also spend my time playing chess-</font><br>Strategizing and planning, witnessing the rise and fall of dynasties. A series of strikes that cause {@0: damage}. <br> (This move can be used with light footwork to quickly approach the opponent)
