desc_CS_jh_sfgp04_1=<font color="#a3ca44">-In the midst of the hustle and bustle of the world, relying solely on the old Qing Mountain chess game-</font><br>My heart travels thousands of miles, and I meet immortals again. Hitting the target causes {@0: damage}, and if the target does not defend, an additional layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Move Mountains and Fill Seas</font> is added: When attacked by this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rise of the New Army (ancient manual)]</font>, an additional effect will be triggered, up to a maximum of 4 layers, lasting for 15 seconds. If there is a Saint Plum chess piece within 20 meters of the target, the Saint Plum chess piece will also attempt to attack the target and cause damage. If the target still does not defend, they will be given an additional layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Vertical and Horizontal</font> state: Reducing 5% <font color="#FFAE00">external defense</font>, lasting for 10 seconds, and can be stacked up to 5 layers.
