desc_CS_jh_sfgp05_1=<font color="#a3ca44">-The qin, sword, wine, chess, dragon, crane, and tiger, carefree and worry-free-</font><br>When I am alone, I do not encounter any opponents. When successfully defending, there is a 35% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-improvement status</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Up Against the Odds (ancient manual)][Moving Mountains and Filling Seas (ancient manual)][Dragon Swimming in the Sea (ancient manual)]</font> increases damage by 15% for 10 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp05_10=<font color="#a3ca44">-The qin, sword, wine, chess, dragon, crane, and tiger, carefree and worry-free-</font><br>When I am alone, I do not encounter any opponents. When successfully defending, there is a 60% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-improvement status</font> to oneself: this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising Up Against the Odds (ancient manual)][Moving Mountains and Filling Seas (ancient manual)][Dragon Swimming in the Sea (ancient manual)]</font> increases damage by 25% for 60 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp05_11=<font color="#a3ca44">-Sword, Chess, Dragon, Crane, and Tiger, carefree and worry-free-</font><br>When I am alone, I do not encounter any other masters. When successfully defending, add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-righteousness</font> to oneself: this set of techniques <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising from the Ashes (ancient manual)][Moving Mountains and Filling Seas (ancient manual)][Dragon Swimming in the Sea (ancient manual)]</font> increases damage by 27% for 60 seconds.
