desc_CS_jh_sfgp05_9=<font color="#a3ca44">-Sword, Chess, Dragon, Crane, Tiger, Carefree and Worry-free-</font><br>When I am alone, I do not encounter any opponents. When successfully defending, there is a 55% chance of adding a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Self-Improvement State</font> to oneself: This set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Rising from the Ashes (ancient manual)][Moving Mountains and Filling Seas (ancient manual)][Dragon Swimming in the Sea (ancient manual)]</font> increases damage by 25% for 12 seconds.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp06_1=<font color="#a3ca44">-The long song ends, the river and stars are hopeful, and the mind is forgotten-</font><br>In front of the window, the cold sun sets in the west. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> and select enemies within range for 3 seconds to cause {@0: damage} and place <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chessboard</font> and two <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Pieces</font>: While the Holy Plum Chessboard is active, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">[Rain as Cover (Ancient Score)]</font>: Use to destroy the Holy Plum Chessboard, causing damage to enemies within the board and pulling in and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> enemies who have not defended. <br><font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Piece</font>: The Holy Plum Chess Piece will continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> airborne targets within a 3-meter radius.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp06_10=<font color="#a3ca44">-The long song ends, the river and stars are hopeful, and the mind is forgotten-</font><br>In front of the window, the cold sun sets in the west. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> and select enemies within range for 3 seconds to cause {@0: damage} and place <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chessboard</font> and two <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Pieces</font>: While the Holy Plum Chessboard is active, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">[Rain as Cover (Ancient Score)]</font>: Use to destroy the Holy Plum Chessboard, causing damage to enemies within the board and pulling in and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> enemies who have not defended. <br><font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Piece</font>: The Holy Plum Chess Piece will continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> airborne targets within a 3-meter radius.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp06_11=<font color="#a3ca44">-As the long song ends, the river and stars are hopeful, and the mind is carefree and forgetful-</font><br>At the window, in a game, the cold sun sets in the west. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> and select enemies within range for 3 seconds (if the target is already stunned, stun for 0.5 seconds) and cause {@0: damage} and place <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chessboard</font> and two <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Pieces</font>: While the Holy Plum Chessboard exists, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">[Rain as Cover (Ancient Score)]</font>: Use to destroy the Holy Plum Chessboard, cause damage to enemies within the chessboard, and pull in and <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> unstunned enemies.<br><font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Piece</font>: The Holy Plum Chess Piece will continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> unstunned airborne targets within a 3-meter radius.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp06_12=<font color="#a3ca44">-As the long song ends, the river and stars are hopeful, and the mind is carefree and forgetful-</font><br>At the window, in a game, the cold sun sets in the west. <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> and select enemies within range for 3 seconds (if the target is already stunned, stun for 0.5 seconds) and cause {@0: damage} and place <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chessboard</font> and two <font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Pieces</font>: While the Holy Plum Chessboard exists, the skill changes to <font color="#f9fc00">[Rain as Cover (Ancient Score)]</font>: Use to destroy the Holy Plum Chessboard, cause damage to enemies within the chessboard, and pull in and <font color="#f9fc00">knock away</font> unstunned enemies.<br><font color="#FF3030">Holy Plum Chess Piece</font>: The Holy Plum Chess Piece will continuously <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> unstunned airborne targets within a 3-meter radius.
