desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_1=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When using this technique, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 6% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 12 seconds).<br>(The process of using this technique is in <font color="#FF3030">red domination</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the process by using other skills from this set.<br>(This technique cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_10=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your schemes. When releasing a move, you and your teammates in the surrounding area will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Benefit the World</font> state: the next attack will have an additional 10% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting 30 seconds).<br>At the same time, add a 20-second Sun-eating Flag state to yourself and your teammates in the surrounding area: when attacked by the Great Qianyuan, it will add the Sun-eating Flag · Forbidden: prohibiting the use of the Great Qianyuan.<br>(The process of releasing the move is in <font color="#FF3030">Red Overlord</font> state).<br>You can interrupt the release process with this set of skills.<br>(This move cannot be used in mid-air).
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_11=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, one must be cautious and cunning. Add the <font color="#FFAE00">benefit the world</font> state to oneself: within 30 seconds, reduce 35% of damage taken and reflect the damage taken, with a cooldown of 45 seconds. (The process of using this move is in <font color="#FF3030">red tyrant</font> state.)<br>During the release, this move can be interrupted by using other skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Can be used in states of slowing, disabling light work, immobilization, disarming, sealing moves, dizziness, being hit, being pushed back, being knocked down, and being knocked away, and can remove corresponding states</font>.<br>While releasing the move, it will also add a continuous <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state to teammates within a 20-meter radius for 20 seconds. The more teammates added, the weaker the effect of the benefit the world state, the longer the cooldown time, and the effect of the benefit the world state on teammates will also clear most abnormal states, allowing them to recover from being hit, pushed back, knocked down, and knocked away, and adding a 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state (ineffective for teammates who are currently locked onto attacking enemies or in a tyrant state).<br>While in the benefit the world state, if one is damaged by the Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill, they will be added with a 2-minute Sun Devouring Flag · Forbidden: unable to use the Great Qian Yuan and a 1-minute Sun Devouring state: [Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill] move's knock away, knock down, and push back effects will be ineffective.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_12=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, one must be cautious and cunning. Add the <font color="#FFAE00">benefit the world</font> state to oneself: within 30 seconds, reduce 35% of damage taken and reflect the damage taken, with a cooldown of 45 seconds. (The process of using this move is in <font color="#FF3030">red tyrant</font> state.)<br>During the release, this move can be interrupted by using other skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Can be used in states of slowing, disabling light work, immobilization, disarming, sealing moves, dizziness, being hit, being pushed back, being knocked down, and being knocked away, and can remove corresponding states</font>.<br>While releasing the move, it will also add a continuous <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state to teammates within a 20-meter radius for 20 seconds. The more teammates added, the weaker the effect of the benefit the world state, the longer the cooldown time, and the effect of the benefit the world state on teammates will also clear most abnormal states, allowing them to recover from being hit, pushed back, knocked down, and knocked away, and adding a 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state (ineffective for teammates who are currently locked onto attacking enemies or in a tyrant state).<br>While in the benefit the world state, if one is damaged by the Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill, they will be added with a 2-minute Sun Devouring Flag · Forbidden: unable to use the Great Qian Yuan and a 1-minute Sun Devouring state: [Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill] move's knock away, knock down, and push back effects will be ineffective.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_2=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When using this technique, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 7% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 14 seconds).<br>(The process of using this technique is in <font color="#FF3030">red domination</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the process by using other skills from this set.<br>(This technique cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_3=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When using this technique, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 7% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 15 seconds).<br>(The process of using this technique is in <font color="#FF3030">red domination</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the process by using other skills from this set.<br>(This technique cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_4=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When using this technique, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 7% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 16 seconds).<br>(The process of using this technique is in <font color="#FF3030">red domination</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the process by using other skills from this set.<br>(This technique cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_5=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When using this technique, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 7% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting 18 seconds).<br>(The process of using this technique is in <font color="#FF3030">red domination</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the process by using other skills.<br>(This technique cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_6=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your tricks. When releasing a move, you and your teammates within range will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Benefit the World</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 8% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 18 seconds).<br>At the same time, add a 20-second Sun-eating Flag status to yourself and your teammates within range: when attacked by the Great Qianyuan, it will add the Sun-eating Flag · Forbidden: prohibiting the use of the Great Qianyuan.<br>(The process of releasing this move is in <font color="#FF3030">Red Overlord</font> state.)<br>During the release process, this set of skills can be interrupted.<br>(This move cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_7=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When releasing a move, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Benefit the World</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 8% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 20 seconds).<br>At the same time, add the Sun-Eating Flag status to yourself and your teammates for 20 seconds: when attacked by the Great Qianyuan, it will add the Sun-Eating Flag·Forbidden: prohibiting the use of the Great Qianyuan.<br>(The process of releasing the move is in <font color="#FF3030">Red Overlord</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the release process with this set of skills.<br>(This move cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_8=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When releasing a move, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Benefit the World</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 9% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 20 seconds).<br>At the same time, add a 20-second Sun-eating Flag status to yourself and your teammates: when attacked by the Great Qianyuan, add a Sun-eating Flag·Forbidden: prohibit the use of the Great Qianyuan.<br>(The process of releasing this move is in <font color="#FF3030">Red Overlord</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the release process by using this set of skills.<br>(This move cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_9=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your schemes. When releasing a move, you and your teammates in the surrounding area will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Benefit the World</font> state: the next attack will have an additional 9% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting 25 seconds).<br>At the same time, add a 20-second Sun-eating Flag state to yourself and your teammates in the surrounding area: when attacked by the Great Qianyuan, it will add the Sun-eating Flag · Forbidden: prohibiting the use of the Great Qianyuan.<br>(The process of releasing the move is in <font color="#FF3030">Red Overlord</font> state).<br>You can interrupt the release process with this set of skills.<br>(This move cannot be performed in mid-air).
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_hide_1=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your dangerous moves. When using this technique, you and your teammates will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">benefiting the world</font> status: the next attack will have an additional 6% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting for 12 seconds).<br>(The process of using this technique is in <font color="#FF3030">red domination</font> state.)<br>You can interrupt the process by using other skills from this set.<br>(This technique cannot be used in mid-air.)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_hide_10=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, keep your hands in your sleeves and hide your schemes. When releasing a move, you and your teammates in the surrounding area will continuously gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Benefit the World</font> state: the next attack will have an additional 10% damage reduction (up to 5 layers, lasting 30 seconds).<br>At the same time, add a 20-second Sun-eating Flag state to yourself and your teammates in the surrounding area: when attacked by the Great Qianyuan, it will add the Sun-eating Flag · Forbidden: prohibiting the use of the Great Qianyuan.<br>(The process of releasing the move is in <font color="#FF3030">Red Overlord</font> state).<br>You can interrupt the release process with this set of skills.<br>(This move cannot be used in mid-air).
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_hide_11=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, one must be cautious and cunning. Add the <font color="#FFAE00">benefit the world</font> state to oneself: within 30 seconds, reduce 35% of damage taken and reflect the damage taken, with a cooldown of 45 seconds. (The process of using this move is in <font color="#FF3030">red tyrant</font> state.)<br>During the release, this move can be interrupted by using other skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Can be used in states of slowing, disabling light work, immobilization, disarming, sealing moves, dizziness, being hit, being pushed back, being knocked down, and being knocked away, and can remove corresponding states</font>.<br>While releasing the move, it will also add a continuous <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state to teammates within a 20-meter radius for 20 seconds. The more teammates added, the weaker the effect of the benefit the world state, the longer the cooldown time, and the effect of the benefit the world state on teammates will also clear most abnormal states, allowing them to recover from being hit, pushed back, knocked down, and knocked away, and adding a 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state (ineffective for teammates who are currently locked onto attacking enemies or in a tyrant state).<br>While in the benefit the world state, if one is damaged by the Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill, they will be added with a 2-minute Sun Devouring Flag · Forbidden: unable to use the Great Qian Yuan and a 1-minute Sun Devouring state: [Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill] move's knock away, knock down, and push back effects will be ineffective.
desc_CS_jh_sfgp07_hide_12=<font color="#a3ca44">-Who can understand the mysteries of black and white, the cycle of life and death, the square and the circle-</font><br>As an observer, one must be cautious and cunning. Add the <font color="#FFAE00">benefit the world</font> state to oneself: within 30 seconds, reduce 35% of damage taken and reflect the damage taken, with a cooldown of 45 seconds. (The process of using this move is in <font color="#FF3030">red tyrant</font> state.)<br>During the release, this move can be interrupted by using other skills.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Can be used in states of slowing, disabling light work, immobilization, disarming, sealing moves, dizziness, being hit, being pushed back, being knocked down, and being knocked away, and can remove corresponding states</font>.<br>While releasing the move, it will also add a continuous <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state to teammates within a 20-meter radius for 20 seconds. The more teammates added, the weaker the effect of the benefit the world state, the longer the cooldown time, and the effect of the benefit the world state on teammates will also clear most abnormal states, allowing them to recover from being hit, pushed back, knocked down, and knocked away, and adding a 3-second <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant</font> state (ineffective for teammates who are currently locked onto attacking enemies or in a tyrant state).<br>While in the benefit the world state, if one is damaged by the Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill, they will be added with a 2-minute Sun Devouring Flag · Forbidden: unable to use the Great Qian Yuan and a 1-minute Sun Devouring state: [Nine Yang · Ultimate Skill] move's knock away, knock down, and push back effects will be ineffective.
