desc_CS_jh_sfgp08_1=<font color="#a3ca44">-Is it difficult to establish a foothold on Shangshan, and call for the wind and rain to fly up like a dragon-</font><br>Highly hidden clouds flow, where do the immortals play? Causes {@0: damage} to enemies within range, each hit <font color="#FFAE00">paralyzes</font> the target, and finally scatters the surrounding enemies with a <font color="#f9fc00">knockback</font> (ignores parry) <br> (The process of using this move is in a <font color="#FF3030">red dominant state</font>) <br> (This move cannot be used in mid-air) <br> (The move has a high critical hit rate)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp08_10=<font color="#a3ca44">-Is it difficult to establish a foothold on Shangshan, calling for the wind and rain to fly up like a dragon-</font><br>Highly hidden clouds flow, where do the immortals play? Causes {@0: damage} to enemies within range, each hit <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the target without parrying, and finally disperses the surrounding enemies with a <font color="#f9fc00">knockback</font> (ignores parrying) <br> (The attack process is in a <font color="#FF3030">red dominant state</font> and the evasion rate is greatly increased) <br> (The move has a high critical hit rate and accuracy)
desc_CS_jh_sfgp08_11=<font color="#a3ca44">-Is it difficult to establish a foothold on Shangshan, calling for the wind and rain to fly the dragon-</font><br>Highly hidden clouds flow, where do the immortals play? Causes {@0: damage} to enemies within range, each hit <font color="#f9fc00">stuns</font> the target without being blocked, and finally disperses the surrounding enemies with a <font color="#f9fc00">knockback</font> (ignores blocking)<br> (The process of using this move is in a <font color="#FF3030">red dominant state</font> and the evasion rate is greatly increased)<br> (The move has a high critical hit rate)<br> (Enemies who are stunned by the dragon's journey through the sea or are within the range of the move will have their internal energy disrupted and cannot switch internal skills)
