desc_CS_kl_hqxxp01_1=Focus on self-restraint, never losing control. Causes {@0: damage} to enemies within a 15-meter range in front and adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-restraint</font> to enemies who do not parry: reduces their speed by 15%, lasts for 10 seconds, and can stack up to 3 layers. <br> The move can be charged to increase its power. If the charge is successful: can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> enemies who do not parry.
