desc_CS_kl_hqxxp03_1=Harmony in shades, peace in distance. Causes {@0: damage} to enemies within the selected area, and adds the <font color="#FFAE00">peace in distance</font> state when breaking through the enemy's defense: within 5 seconds, if they approach within 10 meters of themselves, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font> for 3 seconds.
