desc_CS_kl_hqxxp04_1=Constantly alert, undisturbed in solitude. Draw the sword from the qin, and the sword energy will surge, causing {@0: damage} to enemies within a 15-meter range in front. If the enemy does not defend, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>.
