desc_CS_kl_hqxxp05_1=Looking through the path of desire, the mind becomes clear. Successfully defending oneself results in gaining a layer of <font color="#f9fc00">self-confidence</font> that lasts for 30 seconds and can stack up to 5 layers. While in this state of <font color="#f9fc00">self-confidence</font>, the skill can be used again, releasing a mirror image of oneself to the selected area, causing damage to enemies within 5 meters and suppressing them to the ground. The mirror image can be recalled within 2 seconds of release, clearing and immunizing oneself from most movement control effects.
desc_CS_kl_hqxxp05_10=Looking through the path of desire, the mind becomes clear. Successfully defending oneself grants a layer of <font color="#f9fc00">self-confidence</font> for 30 seconds, which can stack up to 5 layers. While in this state of <font color="#f9fc00">self-confidence</font>, the skill can be used again, releasing a mirror image of oneself to the selected area, causing damage to enemies within 5 meters and suppressing them to the ground. The mirror image can be recalled within 2 seconds of release, clearing and immunizing oneself from most movement control effects and leaving behind a <font color="#f9fc00">cold spring</font> that lasts for 5 seconds: teammates within the cold spring can dodge all hidden weapon attacks. Upgrading increases damage.
