desc_CS_kl_hqxxp06_1=All worries are forgotten, and delusions are eliminated. Inflict {@0: damage} to the target. If the target does not parry and is not in the <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody</font> state, they will resonate with oneself and enter the 10-second <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody</font> state.<br>Elusive Melody: Increases the target's <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> by 100%. When the target attacks, if the used move is not a Kunlun School qin-based martial art, they will gain a <font color="#FFAE00">Liver and Intestine Break</font> state, reducing their <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 10%. This effect can stack up to 3 times and lasts for 10 seconds. When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 stacks, it will also reduce the target's <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 100% for their next attack within 10 seconds.<br>When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 stacks or if the distance between the two parties exceeds 15 meters, the Elusive Melody state will be removed from both parties.
desc_CS_kl_hqxxp06_10=All worries are forgotten, and delusions are eliminated. Inflict {@0: damage} to the target. If the target does not parry and is not in the <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody</font> state, they will resonate with oneself and enter the 10-second <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody</font> state.<br>Elusive Melody: Increases the target's <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> by 100%. When the target attacks, if the used move is not a Kunlun School qin-based martial art, they will gain a <font color="#FFAE00">Liver and Intestine Break</font> state, reducing their <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 10%. This effect can stack up to 3 times and lasts for 10 seconds. When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 stacks, it will also reduce the target's <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 100% for their next attack within 10 seconds.<br>When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 stacks or if the distance between the two parties exceeds 15 meters, the Elusive Melody state will be removed from both parties.
desc_CS_kl_hqxxp06_11=All worries are forgotten, and delusions are eliminated. Inflict {@0: damage} to the target. If the target does not parry and is not in the <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody</font> state, they will resonate with oneself and enter the 10-second <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody</font> state.<br>Elusive Melody: Increases the target's <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> by 100%. When the target attacks, if the used move is not a Kunlun School qin-based martial art, they will gain a <font color="#FFAE00">Liver and Intestine Break</font> state, reducing their <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 10%. This effect can stack up to 3 times and lasts for 10 seconds. When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 stacks, it will also reduce the target's <font color="#f9fc00">accuracy</font> by 100% for their next attack within 10 seconds.<br>When the Liver and Intestine Break state reaches 3 stacks or if the distance between the two parties exceeds 15 meters, the Elusive Melody state will be removed from both parties.
