desc_CS_kl_hqxxp06_hide_1=All worries are forgotten, and delusions are eliminated. Use on a teammate to restore a certain amount of health and resonate with them, entering the 10-second <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody (Friend)</font> state.<br>Elusive Melody (Friend): Reduces the target's internal force consumption by 50%. When the target attacks with a Kunlun School qin-based martial art, they and oneself will gain a <font color="#FFAE00">Harmonious Melody</font> state, increasing the damage of all Kunlun qin-based martial arts by 10%. This effect can stack up to 3 times and lasts for 10 seconds. When the Harmonious Melody state reaches 3 stacks, it will also allow both parties to use a Kunlun qin-based martial art without being affected by negative effects for their next attack within 10 seconds. When the Harmonious Melody state reaches 3 stacks or if the distance between the two parties exceeds 15 meters, the Elusive Melody (Friend) state will be removed from both parties.<br>If the target has already triggered the <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody (Friend)</font> state within the past 15 seconds, the <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Melody (Friend)</font> state cannot be added.
