desc_CS_kl_hqxxp07_1=Cold rain and cool snow, far and continuous. Release a mirror of oneself to the selected area, causing {@0: damage package} to enemies within 5 meters. If it hits an enemy who does not parry and does not have a cold spring, it will briefly <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> them, and the final blow will <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> any unparried targets nearby.
desc_CS_kl_hqxxp07_10=Cold rain and cool snow, far and continuous. Release a mirror of oneself to the selected area, causing {@0: damage package} to enemies within 5 meters. If it hits an enemy who does not parry and does not have a cold spring, it will briefly <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> them, and the final blow will <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> any unparried targets nearby.<br>At the same time, leave a <font color="#f9fc00">cold spring</font> in the selected area for 7 seconds: teammates in the cold spring can dodge all hidden weapon attacks.<br>When using this move, enter the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state.
desc_CS_kl_hqxxp07_11=Cold rain and cool snow, far and continuous. Release a mirror of oneself to the selected area, causing {@0: damage package} to enemies within 5 meters. If it hits an enemy who does not parry and does not have a cold spring, it will briefly <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> them, and the final blow will <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> any unparried targets nearby.<br>At the same time, leave a <font color="#f9fc00">cold spring</font> in the selected area for 7 seconds: teammates in the cold spring can dodge all hidden weapon attacks.<br>When using this move, enter the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state.
