desc_CS_kl_hyjf01_1=Sending joy to the clouds, forgetting like flowing water. Splatter sword energy to deal {@0: damage package} to enemies within 15 meters in front, and if the target does not parry, add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>: reduce speed by 10%, lasts for 15 seconds, up to 5 layers.
