desc_CS_kl_hyjf02_1=One-way chivalry, clouds can be given to others. Continuously strike the target with a sword, causing {@0: damage package}, and if the target does not parry and is affected by <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>, the final blow can restore a small amount of internal energy for oneself. The more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font> the target has, the better the recovery effect.<br>(This move can be used with light work to quickly approach opponents.)
