desc_CS_kl_hyjf03_1=Morning and evening, treading through the clouds. Sweep enemies within 5 meters in front, causing {@0: damage package}, and if the enemy attempts to parry, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">blinded</font> for 3 seconds and add five layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Blindness</font>: Lose sight of the target and be deprived of vision.
