desc_CS_kl_hyjf04_1=Watching the sea from afar, overflowing with meaning. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Defense into Offense"</font> state: when in a parrying state and attacked by an enemy, you can dismantle the enemy's move, briefly <font color="#f9fc00">blind</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> any unparried enemies within 2 seconds. The state lasts for 5 seconds.<br>(Anti-counter move, effective range of 6 meters, ineffective against the Yellow Emperor's Body, can be countered by virtual moves. Increasing the number of moves can increase the counterattack damage.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Blindness</font>: Lose sight of the target and be deprived of vision.
desc_CS_kl_hyjf04_10=Watching the sea from afar, overflowing with meaning. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Defense into Offense"</font> state: when in a parrying state and attacked by an enemy, you can dismantle the enemy's move, briefly <font color="#f9fc00">blind</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> any unparried enemies within 2 seconds. The state lasts for 5 seconds.<br>(Anti-counter move, effective range of 6 meters, ineffective against the Yellow Emperor's Body, can be countered by virtual moves. Increasing the number of moves can increase the counterattack damage.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Blindness</font>: Lose sight of the target and be deprived of vision.
desc_CS_kl_hyjf04_11=Watching the sea from afar, overflowing with meaning. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Defense into Offense"</font> state: when in a parrying state and attacked by an enemy, you can dismantle the enemy's move, briefly <font color="#f9fc00">blind</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> any unparried enemies within 2 seconds. The state lasts for 5 seconds.<br>(Anti-counter move, effective range of 6 meters, ineffective against the Yellow Emperor's Body, can be countered by virtual moves. Increasing the number of moves can increase the counterattack damage.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Blindness</font>: Lose sight of the target and be deprived of vision.
desc_CS_kl_hyjf04_12=Watching the sea from afar, overflowing with meaning. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Defense into Offense"</font> state: when in a parrying state and attacked by an enemy, you can dismantle the enemy's move, briefly <font color="#f9fc00">blind</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> any unparried enemies within 2 seconds. The state lasts for 5 seconds.<br>(Anti-counter move, effective range of 6 meters, ineffective against the Yellow Emperor's Body, can be countered by virtual moves. Increasing the number of moves can increase the counterattack damage.)<br><font color="#f9fc00">Blindness</font>: Lose sight of the target and be deprived of vision.
