desc_CS_kl_hyjf05_1=Wind sweeping through the clouds, the vast sea pouring out. Dance with the sword to cause {@0: damage package} to surrounding targets, adding one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font> to any unparried enemies with each strike. The move will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> any unparried targets with three or more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>.<br>If used within 5 seconds after successfully countering an enemy with <font color="#f9fc00">[Overflowing with Meaning]</font>, the move will enter the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state and the damage will increase over time.<br>Can move freely while using this move.
