desc_CS_kl_hyjf06_1=Body transcends the mundane, casting shadows on the waves. A sudden attack that deals {@0: damage}. If the target does not parry, it will <font color="#f9fc00">seal their moves</font> for 2 seconds and add 2 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font>. If the target does not parry and is under the <font color="#FFAE00">blindness</font> effect, it can also <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> them for 2 seconds.
