desc_CS_kl_hyjf07_1=The Chu River is clear, its heart like a mirror. A series of attacks that deal {@0: damage}. If the target does not parry, an additional effect will be triggered based on the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font> layers on the target.<br>One or more layers: When using this move, a small amount of health will be restored. The more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font>, the better the healing effect.<br>Two or more layers: Increases critical hit rate when using this move. The more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font>, the better the critical hit effect.<br>Three or more layers: The finishing move will remove all <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font> layers and <font color="#f9fc00">blind</font> the target. The more layers consumed, the longer the blindness effect.
