desc_CS_kl_syl01_1=The sun shines brightly, invigorating the spring air. Deals {@0: damage} to surrounding enemies and briefly <font color="#FFAE00">stuns</font> any unparried enemies.<br>While in <font color="#FF3030">Ink and Color</font> state, successfully using this move will automatically trigger <font color="#f9fc00">【Bright Sun】</font>: Gain <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> any unparried enemies nearby.<br>(Different body types [81-100] will have different special modifications to this move's effect)
