desc_CS_kl_syl02_1=Sweeping away the mundane, reaching for the heavens. Deals {@0: damage} to the target.<br>(This move can be used with lightness skills to quickly approach an opponent.)<br>While in <font color="#FF3030">Ink and Color</font> state, this move becomes a long-range charge move that can pull a single enemy within 15 meters towards you for an attack.
