desc_CS_kl_syl03_1=Fish playing in the cold spring, leaping and throwing. Deals {@0: damage} to the target. If the target does not parry, it will <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font>.<br>While in <font color="#FF3030">Ink and Color</font> state, this move becomes a long-range single-target move.
