desc_CS_kl_syl04_1=The flat fields are lush and green, a refreshing sight. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 5 meters in front of you.<br>While in <font color="#FF3030">Ink and Color</font> state, the damage of this move is increased and hitting a knocked down enemy will restore 3 points of <font color="#FF3030">rage</font> for yourself.
