desc_CS_kl_syl05_1=Sitting alone in the clear night, inviting the moon to share one's sorrows. Successfully blocking an attack adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">sorrow</font> to oneself. When not blocking, taking damage consumes a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">sorrow</font> and restores a certain amount of health (the maximum amount restored increases with the skill level).
