desc_CS_kl_syl06_1=Regretting the early spring, the scattered red petals. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 5 meters, and successfully breaking their defense will <font color="#f9fc00">disable their lightness technique</font> for 3 seconds. <br>While in the <font color="#FF3030">rich and colorful</font> state, the release of techniques is faster, and successfully breaking an enemy's defense will <font color="#FFAE00">immobilize</font> them for 3 seconds.
