desc_CS_kl_syl07_1=Climbing the tower in the bamboo forest, admiring the distant rhyme. Increases <font color="#FFAE00">hit rate</font> by 50%. While in the <font color="#FF3030">rich and colorful</font> state, an additional 3 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">climbing</font> are obtained. Each layer of climbing reduces the <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> of techniques by 30%, and decreases by one layer every 3 seconds. Each time it decreases, an additional layer of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font> is obtained.
