desc_CS_kl_syl07_9=Climbing the tower in the bamboo forest, admiring the distant rhyme. Increases <font color="#FFAE00">hit rate</font> by 50%. While in the <font color="#FF3030">rich and colorful</font> state, an additional 3 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">climbing</font> are obtained. Each layer of climbing reduces the <font color="#FFAE00">internal force consumption</font> of techniques by 30%, and decreases by one layer every 3 seconds. Each time it decreases, an additional layer of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font> is obtained.
desc_CS_kl_syl08_1=Good ink brings out the colors, good wine dispels worries. Deals {@0: damage} to targets within 5 meters, and when the technique is released, it <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> enemies who did not block. At the same time, a blue dragon mark is drawn under one's feet and enters the <font color="#FF3030">rich and colorful</font> state: under this state, the effects of this set of techniques will change, and each use will accumulate a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font>. <br>After 10 seconds of using the technique, it can be used again to add the finishing touch to the blue dragon: the blue dragon soars into the sky, <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> enemies who did not block and causing additional damage based on the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font> (the additional damage only affects players, triggered when the first hit is successful, and each layer of finishing touch causes damage equal to 1.5% of one's lost health. If there are more than 5 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font>, the additional damage will <font color="#FF3030">ignore the target's defense</font>). <br>The blue dragon mark lasts for 18 seconds and will dissipate if not used. <br>When the technique is released, it is in the <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant body</font> state. <br>(Different body types [81-100] will have different special modifications to the effects of this technique).
desc_CS_kl_syl08_10=Good ink brings out the colors, good wine dispels worries. Deals {@0: damage} to targets within 5 meters, and when the technique is released, it <font color="#f9fc00">knocks down</font> enemies who did not block. At the same time, a blue dragon mark is drawn under one's feet and enters the <font color="#FF3030">rich and colorful</font> state: under this state, the effects of this set of techniques will change, and each use will accumulate a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font>. <br>After 10 seconds of using the technique, it can be used again to add the finishing touch to the blue dragon: the blue dragon soars into the sky, <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> enemies who did not block and causing additional damage based on the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font> (the additional damage only affects players, triggered when the first hit is successful, and each layer of finishing touch causes damage equal to 1.5% of one's lost health. If there are more than 5 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">finishing touch</font>, the additional damage will <font color="#FF3030">ignore the target's defense</font>). <br>The blue dragon mark lasts for 18 seconds and will dissipate if not used. <br>When the technique is released, it is in the <font color="#f9fc00">yellow tyrant body</font> state. <br>(Different body types [81-100] will have different special modifications to the effects of this technique).
