desc_CS_kl_wltf01_1=The mountains and rivers are boundless, and the heavens are filled with divine power. Sweeps enemies within 5 meters in front, dealing {@0: damage}, and there is a 15% chance of accumulating a strand of <font color="#FFAE00">divine power</font> when hitting an unblocked target. <br>Only when using the technique <font color="#FFAE00">[Standing Alone at the Top]</font> can divine power be added.
