desc_CS_kl_wltf02_1=The basics of Geometry are like a distant journey, where the soul returns after it has gone. It can fly up to 5 meters in front of the enemy, causing {@0: damage package}, and when it breaks through the enemy's defense, it will <font color="#f9fc00">fly away</font>.
