desc_CS_kl_wltf04_1=A flat boat, enjoying the wonders. Rush towards the selected area and cause {@0: damage package} to the enemy, and <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> any enemy who has not defended.<br> When successfully knocking down an enemy, if you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> eruption stage, you can immediately regain your energy (it cannot be triggered again within 10 seconds after triggering it).<br> The move is faster when released in the air.
