desc_CS_kl_wltf04_sky_9=A flat boat, enjoying the wonders. Rush towards the selected area and cause {@0: damage package} to the enemy, and <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> any enemy who has not defended.<br> When successfully knocking down an enemy, if you are in the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> eruption stage, you can immediately regain your energy (it cannot be triggered again within 10 seconds after triggering it).<br> The move is faster when released in the air.
desc_CS_kl_wltf05_1=May the cold wind carry me, reaching for the moon with my hand. When successfully blocking, accumulate a strand of <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> for 15 seconds, which can stack up to 5 layers. After successfully breaking through the defense with this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Thousand Miles of Sight]</font> or hitting a target without defense with this set of moves <font color="#f9fc00">[Eight Directions of Swaying]</font>, the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> will erupt, increasing the power of the moves by 10% for each layer and adding additional damage with each hit. <br> The <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> will dissipate after the eruption for 10 seconds. <br> It is not possible to obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">power of the spirit</font> again within 15 seconds after the eruption. <br> Upgrading the moves will increase the additional damage.
