desc_CS_kl_ymchj01_1=Standing alone in the world, unmoved. Causes {@0: damage package} to enemies within 20 meters in front, and adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Reflection</font> effect to targets who have not defended: reduces 15% <font color="#FFAE00">movement speed</font> and 3% <font color="#FFAE00">internal defense</font>, lasts for 10 seconds, and can stack up to 5 layers.
