desc_CS_kl_ymchj03_1=Vague thoughts, each in their own world. Causes {@0: damage package} to the target. If the target has not defended and has <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Reflection</font>, the last hit of the move will <font color="#f9fc00">push back</font> the target.<br> (This move can be used with light work to quickly approach the opponent).
