desc_CS_kl_ymchj04_1=Looking back at Wuling, the distant waves are green. Causes {@0: damage package} to the target and enemies within 5 meters, and makes enemies who have not defended <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use light work</font> for 3 seconds.<br> If the move hits an airborne enemy who has not defended, they will dance for 5 seconds (calm down, they will wake up if they take damage).<br> If the move hits a fallen enemy, they will be unable to get up.
