desc_CS_kl_ymchj05_9=Burning incense and reading books, watching cranes behind the curtain. Successfully blocking will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> to yourself: when you are critically hit, it will create a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> for yourself, and the target's attack on the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Reflection</font> to the target. Moon Soak lasts for 15 seconds and can stack up to 5 layers.<br> The absorption capacity of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> increases with the level of the move and the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font>. When the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, all <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> effects will be removed and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds.<br> Switching styles will remove the effects of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> and the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font>.
desc_CS_kl_ymchj06_1=The cicadas sing alone, and the world is quiet. Instantly move behind the target and deal {@0: damage} to the target and enemies within a 5-meter radius. At the same time, <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> any enemies who do not block.<br>If the target has <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Retreat</font>, the user gains the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> effect when attacking.
