desc_CS_kl_ymchj07_1=The weak waters of the Three Thousand, I remember the deep mountains. The sound of the qin echoes softly: <font color="#FFAE00">Cannot be locked onto by charging moves</font>, and the user continuously gains the <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> state: attempting to attack the user will consume one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> and cause them to <font color="#f9fc00">dance gracefully</font> for 3 seconds (lost in the flowers, even if they take damage they will not wake up) and add one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Retreat</font> to them. The <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> state lasts for 3 seconds and can stack up to 3 layers, and is cleared when the move is used. Can be interrupted by using [The World is Quiet] or [A Thousand Days of Drunkenness].
desc_CS_kl_ymchj07_10=The weak waters of the Three Thousand, I remember the deep mountains. The sound of the qin echoes softly: <font color="#FFAE00">Cannot be locked onto by charging moves</font>, and the user continuously gains the <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> state: attempting to attack the user will consume one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> and cause them to <font color="#f9fc00">dance gracefully</font> for 3 seconds (lost in the flowers, even if they take damage they will not wake up) and add one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Retreat</font> to them. The <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> state lasts for 3 seconds and can stack up to 3 layers, and is cleared when the move is used. Can be interrupted by using [The World is Quiet] or [A Thousand Days of Drunkenness].
