desc_CS_kl_ymchj08_1=The wine in the mountains, a thousand days of drunkenness. Deals {@0: damage} to surrounding targets and continuously causes any unblocked targets to <font color="#f9fc00">dance gracefully</font> (lost in the heart, even if they take damage they will not wake up). If the user has <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font>, each layer of Moon Soak reduces the damage taken by 10% when attacking (does not consume Moon Soak).<br>When released, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state and cannot move.
desc_CS_kl_ymchj08_10=The wine in the mountains, a thousand days of drunkenness. Deals {@0: damage} to surrounding targets and continuously causes any unblocked targets to <font color="#f9fc00">dance gracefully</font> (lost in the heart, even if they take damage they will not wake up). If the user has <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font>, each layer of Moon Soak reduces the damage taken by 10% when attacking (does not consume Moon Soak).<br>When released, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state and cannot move.
