desc_CS_lzy_tyhgrc_pbxb001_1=Looking at each other without recognition, singing a long song and thinking of picking the weaver. The user deals {@0: damage} to the current target;<br>If the target does not block, the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font> state is added;<br><font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font>: decreases movement speed.
desc_CS_lzy_tyhgrc_pbxb002_1=The east wind accompanies the roses, to the roses, spring is already pitiful. Deals {@0: damage} to all targets in a 5*5 rectangular area in front of the user,<br>If the target's defense is broken, the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font> state is added;<br><font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font>: decreases movement speed.
desc_CS_lzy_tyhgrc_pbxb003_1=Last night, in a dream by the idle pool, the fallen flowers were pitiful, but spring never returned home. The user deals {@0: damage} to the target, and if the target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font> state and does not block, this move deals an additional 0.3 times damage.<br>(This move can be used with light work to quickly approach the opponent.)
desc_CS_lzy_tyhgrc_pbxb004_1=Fishing leisurely on the blue stream, suddenly riding a boat to dream of the edge of the sun. The user deals {@0: damage} to the target, and this move can be charged. When the charge is successful, the user adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Riding Boat"</font> state and <font color="#f9fc00">knocks back</font> all unblocked targets within range.
desc_CS_single_tyhg1_1=The Five Bright Fans cover the Nine Dragon Seat, the Pearl Curtain hangs the Coral Hook. Within 10 seconds, increase your internal strength by 5% and restore 5% of your internal energy.
desc_CS_single_tyhg1_2=The Five Bright Fans cover the Nine Dragon Seat, the Pearl Curtain hangs the Coral Hook. Within 10 seconds, increase your internal strength by 10% and restore 10% of your internal energy.
desc_CS_single_tyhg1_3=The Five Bright Fans cover the Nine Dragon Seat, the Pearl Curtain hangs the Coral Hook. Within 10 seconds, increase your internal strength by 15% and restore 15% of your internal energy.
desc_CS_single_tyhg2_1=The incense burner rises with the sun, and the waterfall sprays into a rainbow. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 10-meter range in front of the user, <font color="#f9fc00">knocking down</font> any unblocked targets and adding the <font color="#FFAE00">"Waterfall into Rainbow"</font> state to them for 10 seconds: decreases evasion rate.<br>This move has a high chance of critical hit and is very accurate.
desc_CS_single_tyhg2_2=The incense burner rises with the sun, and the waterfall sprays into a rainbow. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 10-meter range in front of the user, <font color="#f9fc00">knocking down</font> any unblocked targets and adding the <font color="#FFAE00">"Waterfall into Rainbow"</font> state to them for 10 seconds: decreases evasion rate.<br>This move has a high chance of critical hit and is very accurate.
desc_CS_single_tyhg2_3=The incense burner rises with the sun, and the waterfall sprays into a rainbow. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 10-meter range in front of the user, <font color="#f9fc00">knocking down</font> any unblocked targets and adding the <font color="#FFAE00">"Waterfall into Rainbow"</font> state to them for 10 seconds: decreases evasion rate.<br>This move has a high chance of critical hit and is very accurate.
desc_CS_single_tyhg3_1=Birds play in the new leaves, fish jump in the clear ripples. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 5-meter range around the user, and causes any unblocked targets to be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds.<br>When released, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state.
desc_CS_single_tyhg3_2=Birds play in the new leaves, fish jump in the clear ripples. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 5-meter range around the user, and causes any unblocked targets to be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds.<br>When released, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state.
desc_CS_single_tyhg3_3=Birds play in the new leaves, fish jump in the clear ripples. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 5-meter range around the user, and causes any unblocked targets to be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 3 seconds.<br>When released, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state.
