desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj02_1=The east wind accompanies the roses, to the roses, spring is already pitiful. Deals {@0: damage} to all targets in a 5*5 rectangular area in front of the user,<br>If the target's defense is broken, the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font> state is added;<br><font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font>: decreases movement speed.
