desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj03_1=As time passes and the river flows, the pen falls on the nine heavens. With a focused mind and a falling pen, one enters the state of "falling pen on the nine heavens": when successfully blocking an enemy's attack, one can obtain "Fuyao": an additional 16 points of Yin damage when attacking (affected by close combat and internal power bonuses).
