desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj04_1=With a flick of the brush, the flying birds are paid for, and the book returns with a strong silver hook. With a swift stroke of the pen, a radius of 5 meters is selected on the ground to create a formation area, which, when activated, causes {@0: damage}; targets within the area are added with the <font color="#FFAE00">"With a flick of the brush, the flying birds are paid for"</font> effect: friendly targets recover health every 2 seconds (additional health recovery in forbidden areas and demonic scenes), while enemy targets take damage every 2 seconds. <br> If the user has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Riding the Boat"</font> effect and is in a forbidden area or demonic scene, when the formation is activated, friendly targets are added with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Flying Birds"</font> effect: increased critical strike rate for both internal and external skills; <br> If the target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weeds"</font> effect, when the formation is activated, the enemy target is <font color="#f9fc00">immobilized</font> if they do not block, and the formation lasts for 8 seconds.
