desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj05_4=The wind is slanted and the rain is heavy, the meaning goes beyond the brush and ink. The ink is used like a splash, and a radius of 5 meters is selected on the ground to create a formation area, which, when activated, causes {@0: damage} to targets within the area and adds the <font color="#FFAE00">"Beyond the Brush and Ink" </font> effect: friendly targets receive reduced damage when attacked, while enemy targets have their internal and external defense reduced by 15%; <br> If the user has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Riding the Boat"</font> effect, when the formation is activated, friendly targets are added with the <font color="#FFAE00">"Ink Flowers"</font> effect and recover health when attacked (additional health recovery in forbidden areas and demonic scenes), but this effect can only be triggered once; <br> If the target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weeds"</font> effect, when the formation is activated, the enemy target is <font color="#f9fc00">knocked down</font>, and the formation lasts for 8 seconds.
