desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj06_1=Last night, in a dream by the idle pool, the fallen flowers were pitiful, but spring never returned home. The user deals {@0: damage} to the target, and if the target has the <font color="#FFAE00">"Picking Weaver"</font> state and does not block, this move deals an additional 0.3 times damage.<br>(This move can be used with light work to quickly approach the opponent.)
