desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj07_1=In my free time, I fish on the blue stream, and suddenly I dream of riding a boat at the edge of the sun. The target in front of the user is dealt {@0: damage}, and this move can be charged up. If the charge is successful, the user gains the <font color="#FFAE00">"Riding the Boat"</font> effect and all non-blocking targets within range are <font color="#f9fc00">knocked back</font>.
