desc_CS_tyhg_mwybj08_1=The wine is strong and spring enters my dreams, the window is broken and I search for the moon. The brush strokes are unrestrained, and a radius of 5 meters is selected on the ground to deal {@0: damage} to enemy targets within the area, causing a brief <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> to non-blocking targets; then, a formation is activated within the selected area, and friendly targets within the formation area recover a large amount of health (additional health recovery in forbidden areas and demonic scenes). <br> If the user is in a forbidden area or demonic scene, friendly targets within the formation area gain the <font color="#FFAE00">"Strong Wine, Spring Dreams" </font> effect: continuously recover rage for 5 seconds while the formation lasts.
