desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq01_1=Floating in the distant sky, seeing clearly for thousands of miles. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 20 meters and adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font> to the target for 10 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 layers; when hitting an unblocked target, adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Vast Ocean</font> effect: reduces 10% of <font color="#FFAE00">yin defense</font> for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 layers.
