desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq02_1=Breaking through the clouds and pushing the moon, the waves are calm and the water meets the sky. Deals {@0: damage} to the target, and if the target does not block, the final hit will <font color="#f9fc00">disable lightness skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br> (This move can be used to quickly approach opponents using lightness skills)
