desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq03_1=Wrapped in the autumn night, dreaming of a thousand miles of mountains and rivers. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 20 meters in front of you, and the final hit can consume 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the unblocked target (can only be triggered once on the same target within 5 seconds) <br> When <font color="#FFAE00">Ethereal</font> is active, the user is immune to <font color="#f9fc00">knockback</font> effects when using this move.
