desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq04_1=The sky is falling and the clouds are descending, the wind is strong and the sea is rising. Play fiercely, dealing {@0: damage} to surrounding targets and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> unblocked targets; if the target has <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font>, for every layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font> present, the target's <font color="#FFAE00">movement speed</font> is reduced by 25% for 3 seconds; if the target is unblocked and has 3 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font>, the effect changes to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> for 3 seconds.
