desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq05_1=But in my life, besides enjoying the beauty of nature, I have achieved nothing. Deals {@0: damage} to the target, and the final hit will <font color="#f9fc00">disrupt the target's key bindings</font> for 1 second for every layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> present, up to a maximum of 3 seconds. <br> If the user has 3 or more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> when using this move, they will enter the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Tyrant Body</font> state.
