desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq06_1=The Jade Hall is unparalleled, the Three Mountains are on the sea, and the ethereal is elusive. For 5 seconds, the user continuously gains the <font color="#FFAE00">Ethereal</font> state: each layer increases <font color="#FFAE00">internal attack accuracy</font> by 10%, up to a maximum of 5 layers, and the <font color="#FFAE00">Ethereal</font> state lasts for 3 seconds. <br> When the user has 3 or more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Ethereal</font>, the final hits of <font color="#f9fc00">Fierce Wind</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">Intoxicated Moon</font> will <font color="#FFAE00">seal the target's moves</font> for 2 seconds.
