desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq07_1=The scroll hangs like a rainbow for a thousand feet, only the ice pot is visible, and the path of the cloud sea is confusing. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 15 meters in front of you, and if the defense is broken, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use lightness skills</font> for 2 seconds.
