desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_1=Sending this life to the distant horizon, because of the distance, the handkerchief is more stained. When entering the "gazing at the sea of clouds" state, successfully parrying enemy attacks can gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">sea of clouds</font> state, lasting for 9 seconds, up to 3 layers can be stacked. <br> For each layer of <font color="#FFAE00">sea of clouds</font> state, when using the skills "Floating Sky and Vast Sea" and "Autumn Night Dream", an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> can be obtained.
desc_CS_tyhg_yszyq08_10=Sending this life to the distant horizon, because of the distance, the handkerchief is more stained. When entering the "gazing at the sea of clouds" state, successfully parrying enemy attacks can gain 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">sea of clouds</font> state, lasting for 13.5 seconds, up to 5 layers can be stacked. <br> For each layer of <font color="#FFAE00">sea of clouds</font> state, when using the skills "Floating Sky and Vast Sea" and "Autumn Night Dream", an additional 5% <font color="#f9fc00">internal power critical strike rate</font> can be obtained.
