desc_Npc_kl_hyjf01_1=Sending smoke and clouds, forgetting each other like flowing water. Sword energy splashes and deals {@0: damage} to enemies within a 15-meter range in front. If the target fails to defend, they will be marked with a <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font> for 15 seconds, up to a maximum of 5 stacks.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf02_1=Chivalrous love goes one way, clouds can be given to others. Continuously attacking the target with a sword deals {@0: damage}. If the target fails to defend and is marked with <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>, the final hit of the skill can restore a small amount of internal energy to oneself. The more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font> the target has, the better the restorative effect.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf03_1=Morning and evening, treading through the clouds. Sweep enemies within 5 meters in front, causing {@0: damage package}, and if the enemy attempts to parry, they will be <font color="#f9fc00">blinded</font> for 3 seconds and add five layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>.<br><font color="#f9fc00">Blindness</font>: Lose sight of the target and be deprived of vision.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf04_1=Watching the sea from afar, overflowing with emotions. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Defense into Offense"</font> state: when in a defensive stance and attacked by an enemy, the enemy's attack can be dismantled, temporarily <font color="#f9fc00">blinding</font> enemies within a 6-meter range who are not in a defensive stance for 2 seconds. This state lasts for 5 seconds. <br> (Anti-counterattack style, effective range of 6 meters, ineffective against powerful attacks, can be countered by feints. Increasing the number of defensive stances can increase counterattack damage.) <br> <font color="#f9fc00">Blinding</font>: Losing sight of the target and being deprived of vision.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf04_hide_1=Watching the sea from afar, overflowing with emotions. Enter the <font color="#FFAE00">"Defense into Offense"</font> state: when in a defensive stance and attacked by an enemy, the enemy's attack can be dismantled, temporarily <font color="#f9fc00">blinding</font> enemies within a 6-meter range who are not in a defensive stance for 2 seconds. This state lasts for 5 seconds. <br> (Anti-counterattack style, effective range of 6 meters, ineffective against powerful attacks, can be countered by feints. Increasing the number of defensive stances can increase counterattack damage.) <br> <font color="#f9fc00">Blinding</font>: Losing sight of the target and being deprived of vision.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf05_1=The wind sweeps away the clouds, the vast sea pours out. Dancing with a sword deals {@0: damage} to surrounding targets, adding one stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font> to enemies who fail to defend with each hit. The skill will <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> enemies who have three or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font> and are not in a defensive stance. <br> If used within 5 seconds after successfully counterattacking an enemy with <font color="#f9fc00">[Overflowing Emotions]</font>, the damage of the skill will increase with each use. <br> Can move freely while using the skill.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf06_1=Free from worldly distractions, the shadow hangs over the sea. A surprise attack deals {@0: damage} to the target. If the target fails to defend, they will be <font color="#FFAE00">immobilized</font> for 2 seconds and marked with 2 stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Washing Tassel</font>. If the target is not in a defensive stance and is <font color="#FFAE00">blinded</font>, they will also be <font color="#f9fc00">stunned</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_kl_hyjf07_1=The Chu River is clear, its heart like a mirror. A series of attacks that deal {@0: damage}. If the target does not parry, an additional effect will be triggered based on the number of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font> layers on the target.<br>One or more layers: When using this move, a small amount of health will be restored. The more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font>, the better the healing effect.<br>Two or more layers: Increases critical hit rate when using this move. The more layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font>, the better the critical hit effect.<br>Three or more layers: The finishing move will remove all <font color="#FFAE00">Zhuoying</font> layers and <font color="#f9fc00">blind</font> the target. The more layers consumed, the longer the blindness effect.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq01_1=Floating in the distant sky, seeing clearly for thousands of miles. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 20 meters and adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font> to the target for 10 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 layers; when hitting an unblocked target, adds 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Vast Ocean</font> effect: reduces 10% of <font color="#FFAE00">yin defense</font> for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 3 layers.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq02_1=Breaking through the clouds and pushing the moon, the waves are calm and the water meets the sky. Deals {@0: damage} to the target, and if the target does not block, the final hit will <font color="#f9fc00">disable lightness skills</font> for 3 seconds. <br> (This move can be used to quickly approach opponents using lightness skills)
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq03_1=Wrapped in the autumn night, dreaming of a thousand miles of mountains and rivers. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 20 meters in front of you, and the final hit can consume 1 layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> to <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> the unblocked target (can only be triggered once on the same target within 5 seconds) <br> When <font color="#FFAE00">Ethereal</font> is active, the user is immune to <font color="#f9fc00">knockback</font> effects when using this move.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq04_1=The sky is falling and the clouds are descending, the wind is strong and the sea is rising. Play fiercely, dealing {@0: damage} to surrounding targets and <font color="#f9fc00">knocking back</font> unblocked targets; if the target has <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font>, for every layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font> present, the target's <font color="#FFAE00">movement speed</font> is reduced by 25% for 3 seconds; if the target is unblocked and has 3 layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Floating Sky</font>, the effect changes to <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> for 3 seconds.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq05_1=But I feel that my life is like a lake and sea, apart from enjoying the beauty of nature, I have achieved nothing. Deals {@0: damage} to the target. When the final hit is made, for every stack of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> on oneself, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">disoriented</font> for 1 second. <br> If there are 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Cloud Sea</font> on oneself when released, the release will be in <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Powerful Body</font> state.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq06_1=The Jade Hall is unparalleled, the Three Mountains are on the sea, and the void is elusive. For 5 seconds, oneself continuously gains the <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Void</font> state: each stack increases the <font color="#FFAE00">internal attack hit rate</font> by 10%, up to a maximum of 5 stacks. The <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Void</font> state lasts for 3 seconds. <br> When oneself has 3 or more stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Elusive Void</font>, the final hits of <font color="#f9fc00">[Joyful Victory]</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">[Enjoying the Beauty of Nature]</font> will <font color="#FFAE00">paralyze</font> the target for 1 second.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq07_1=The scroll hangs like a rainbow for a thousand feet, only the ice pot is visible, and the path of the cloud sea is confusing. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 15 meters in front of you, and if the defense is broken, the target will be <font color="#f9fc00">unable to use lightness skills</font> for 2 seconds.
desc_Npc_tyhg_yszyq08_1=The Cloud Sea looks out, sending this life away. Where does the white crane fly in the sky? The wind blows and the shadows sway, as if they are dancing in the snow. The weary traveler longs to return home, but it has been a dream for ten years.
desc_event_detective11_1=Cult disciples seeing through hidden identity
desc_fwz_cloth_457_1=A light kite flies in the blue sky, a colorful dress laments the absence of a loved one.
desc_fwz_cloth_886_1=A promise unfulfilled, unseen by anyone, a quiet game of chess unravels the heart's knots.
desc_fwz_cloth_888_1=A solitary traveler, a lonely shadow of a wild goose.
desc_fwz_cloth_899_1=Thirty-six jade heavens, six Brahma gather to become immortals.
desc_fwz_cloth_900_1=Where does the white crane fly in the empty sky? Its shadow dancing in the wind, resembling falling snow.
desc_fwz_weapon_848b_1=A weary traveler yearns for home, after ten years of dreaming.
desc_fwz_weapon_893_1=Hidden scales hide the colors.
desc_fwz_weapon_904_1=There should be another song in the qin, but it teaches the fairy to fly in the sky.
desc_fwz_weapon_908_1=The bright river shares reflections, and the heart is at ease.
desc_fwz_weapon_909_1=The silver river song flies every night, and the jade pool ripples every morning.
