desc_npc_jh_wsgf01_1=When parry successfully, <br>you have a chance to activate <font color="#FFAE00">Oath</font> status: recover allies' and your HP and Energy (3% of the max HP and Energy).
desc_npc_jh_wsgf02_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When it does heavy damage to enemies (players only): clear the catch breath time of <font color="#f9fc00">Overcome Obstacles</font>, and increase the critical hit rate of <font color="#f9fc00">Overcome Obstacles</font>. <br>(Clear after critical hit is triggered.)
