desc_npc_jh_wsgf05_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting targets, <font color="#f9fc00">disable their Flying Skills</font> for 4 seconds and grant them <font color="#FFAE00">Submerge Army</font> status (doesn't work on leaders): continuously lose HP. And you have 8% chances to clear the catch breath time of <font color="#f9fc00">Overcome Obstacles</font> per each bleeding. The status lasts for 12 seconds.
