desc_npc_jh_wsgf07_1=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting enemies without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font>. <br>The more enemies nearby, the more damage it deals. <br>Every time it does heavy damage to an enemy (players only), you will recover HP and Energy (20% of max HP and Energy), and reset the duration of <font color="#FF3030">Guan Yu Epiphany</font> (You can only reset when you have <font color="#FF3030">Guan Yu Epiphany</font> status.).
desc_npc_jh_wsgf07_10=Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to targets. <br>When hitting enemies without Endurance, <font color="#f9fc00">knock them down</font>. <br>The more enemies nearby, the more damage it deals. <br>Every time it does heavy damage to an enemy (players only), you will recover HP and Energy (20% of max HP and Energy), and reset the duration of <font color="#FF3030">Guan Yu Epiphany</font> (You can only reset when you have <font color="#FF3030">Guan Yu Epiphany</font> status.).
