desc_npc_jh_wsgf08_1=You get <font color="#FF3030">Epiphany of Guan Yu</font> status: get <font color="#FF3030">Red Super Armor</font> status, clear and immune to most debuffs and reduce 40% of damage you take. Lasts for 8 seconds.
desc_npc_ythc_jz_001_1=<s>
desc_npc_ythc_yc_001_1=Target slowed
desc_pet_dissmiss_mouse2_1=It's time for the rotation.
desc_pet_mouse2_act01_1=Where is my knife?!
desc_pet_mouse2_act02_1=The life of a rat is hopeless~
desc_schoolwar_skill_kunlun_1=The wine in the mountains, a thousand days of drunkenness. Deals {@0: damage} to surrounding targets and continuously causes any unblocked targets to <font color="#f9fc00">dance gracefully</font> (lost in the heart, even if they take damage they will not wake up). If the user has <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font>, each layer of Moon Soak reduces the damage taken by 10% when attacking (does not consume Moon Soak).<br>When released, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state and cannot move.
desc_skill_0401_hd01_1=Internal cultivation and training
desc_skill_adv_dzw_01_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal a large amount of damage to the current target, and instantly kill other targets within 5 meters.
desc_skill_adv_dzw_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal a large amount of damage to all targets within range. If the target does not block, their lightness skill will be disabled for 15 seconds.
desc_skill_adv_dzw_03_1=Charge for 5 seconds to deal a large amount of damage to all targets within a rectangular area in front. If any target is hit, the user gains the "Charge" status, increasing dodge by 50% for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_adv_dzw_04_1=Charge for 1 second to add the "Concealment · Flaw" status to oneself. Attacks have a chance to deal additional damage. If the user has the "Charge" status, it will be replaced with the "Concealment · Phantom" status for 15 seconds, increasing dodge by 100%.
desc_skill_adv_dzw_05_1=Deals a small amount of damage to the current target.
desc_skill_clone047_dbsl_01_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal a large amount of damage to enemies within 15 meters in front, and add a layer of "Ravine" that lasts for 30 seconds. Can stack up to 5 layers.
desc_skill_clone047_dbsl_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal heavy damage to the current target. If the target is affected by "Ravine" and does not block, the final hit of the skill will add the "Seal" status, reducing damage by 30% and preventing health recovery.
desc_skill_clone047_dbsl_03_1=Enemies within 15 meters in front will be affected. If they attempt to block, they will be blinded for 8 seconds and add 5 layers of "Ravine". Blindness: Lose sight of the target and have their vision stripped away.
desc_skill_clone047_dbsl_04_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal a small amount of damage to targets within range. Each hit adds a layer of "Ravine". If the target has 3 or more layers, they will be knocked back by the attack.
desc_skill_clone047_dbsl_05_1=Deals a large amount of damage to the target. If the target is affected by "Ravine", they will be prevented from using skills and stunned for 5 seconds when the "Ravine" reaches 5 layers.
desc_skill_clone047_dbsl_06_1=Charge for 5 seconds to continuously attack the target and deal a large amount of damage. The number of layers of "Ravine" on the target will trigger additional effects when the skill is used. If there is at least 1 layer, the target will be knocked down. The more layers consumed, the longer the target will be knocked down.
desc_skill_clone047_ltn_01_1=Charge for 2 seconds to gather a layer of sword energy around oneself, causing all targets within 5 meters to lose 2% of their health per second.
desc_skill_clone047_ltn_02_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal a large amount of damage to all targets within a 10-meter radius. If the target does not block, they will be knocked back and their movement speed will be reduced by 50%.
desc_skill_clone047_ltn_03_1=Charge for 5 seconds to deal damage to all targets in a frontal fan-shaped area. If the target's health is below 50%, their health will be reduced to 1.
desc_skill_clone047_ltn_04_1=Charge for 5 seconds to deal a moderate amount of damage to all targets in the surrounding area. If the target's internal energy is below 50%, they will be instantly killed.
desc_skill_clone047_ltn_05_1=Charge for 5 seconds. If internal energy is less than 10%, restore 30% of your own internal energy. If internal energy is greater than 50%, all targets in the surrounding area will lose 20% of their health.
desc_skill_clone047_ltn_06_1=After charging for 1 second, instantly kill all targets on the field. When the shield is broken, this skill can be interrupted.
desc_skill_clone047_wh_01_1=Increase your own evasion. When attacking, there is a chance to deal double damage and absorb 50% of the damage as health.
desc_skill_clone047_wh_02_1=Instantly deal a large amount of damage to the target in front of you. If the target does not block, they will be inflicted with the "Wang" status.
desc_skill_clone047_wh_03_1=Charge for 3 seconds to pull all unblocked targets within a 20-meter radius towards you, then stab the ground with your dual blades to deal a large amount of damage. If more than one target is hit, all targets will have their health reduced to 1 at the end of the move. If the target has the "Wang" status, they will be instantly killed.
desc_skill_clone047_wh_04_1=Use the dual blades to lock the target in place, then attack with a single palm to deal a small amount of damage. If the target has the "Wang" status, all targets within a 30-meter radius will take a small amount of damage and be inflicted with the "Du Hun" status, reducing their movement speed by 760% and disabling lightness skills.
desc_skill_clone047_wh_05_1=Randomly select 1-2 targets in the surrounding area and deal a small amount of damage. After 3 seconds, a circle of burning blood will form under their feet, reducing their external and internal defense by 100%.
desc_skill_clone047_wh_06_1=Deal a small amount of damage to the current target and absorb 10% of the damage as health.
desc_skill_jhzb_001_1=Add the "Gathering Strength" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Gathering Strength: Increases health and internal energy by 100%. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_002_1=Add the "Siphoning" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Siphoning: Absorbs damage and restores your own health and internal energy when attacking. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_003_1=Add the "Wheat Spike" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Wheat Spike: Causes a 5% loss of health to all targets in the surrounding area every 10 seconds. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_004_1=Add the "Perseverance" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Perseverance: Gain the effect of the Yellow Tyrant Body. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_005_1=Add the "Indomitable" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Indomitable: Gain the effect of the Red Tyrant Body. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_006_1=Add the "Return to Source" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Return to Source: Restore 5% of health and internal energy every 3 seconds. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_007_1=Add the "Defend" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Defend: Reduce damage taken by 80%. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_008_1=Add the "Fury" status to yourself. <font color="#ff3030">(Using this skill requires 100L official silver)</font><br>Fury: Double damage dealt. Lasts for 10 minutes.
desc_skill_jhzb_boss_001_1=Remove most of the buffs from the current target.
desc_skill_jhzb_boss_002_1=Add a slow poison to the current target, causing them to lose 1% of their health per second and have a chance to fall when using lightness skills.
desc_skill_jhzb_boss_003_1=Deal a small amount of damage to the current target. If the target blocks, they will also lose a small amount of internal energy.
desc_skill_jhzb_boss_004_1=Charge for 3 seconds to deal a small amount of damage to the current target and disable lightness skills for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_jhzb_boss_005_1=Charge for 1 second to knock the current target into the air and deal a small amount of damage.
desc_skill_jhzb_boss_006_1=Charge for 2 seconds to deal a small amount of damage to all targets within a 120° fan-shaped area.
desc_skill_jhzb_npc_001_1=Ignore defense and directly cause a loss of 1.5 health points.
desc_skill_jhzb_npc_002_1=Cause dizziness to a target that has not blocked, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_jhzb_npc_003_1=Cause blindness to a single target, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_jhzb_npc_004_1=Disarm a target, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_jhzb_npc_005_1=Disable a target's skills, lasting for 5 seconds.
desc_skill_jhzb_npc_006_1=Knock the target into the air, and if the target blocks, break their defense.
desc_skill_lzy_bhhd_zd_1=Gather luck at the Baihui acupoint and burst out, cutting off all meridians and causing instant death.
desc_skill_tianya_haigui_001_1=Poisoned hidden weapon, capable of causing a large amount of damage.
desc_skill_ty_dy_01_1=Torch
desc_skill_ythc_boss_001_1=After charging for 2 seconds, stun the current target and deal a small amount of damage.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_002_1=After charging for 5 seconds, cause a large amount of damage to a target that has not blocked.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_003_1=After charging for 1 second, deal a small amount of damage to the target, and if the target's health is below 30%, restore 10% of own health.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_004_1=After charging for 1 second, cancel all anger and lightness values of the target.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_005_1=After charging for 5 seconds, cause a killing blow to all targets in the front area.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_006_1=After charging for 5 seconds, cause a large amount of damage to targets in the front area, and if the target's internal strength exceeds 80%, directly cancel 50% of their internal strength.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_007_1=After charging for 5 seconds, knock targets in the front area into the air, and if the target blocks, knock them into the air and break their defense for 60 seconds.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_008_1=After charging for 5 seconds, stun targets in the front area, and if the target's health is below 30%, reduce it to 1.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_009_1=After charging for 5 seconds, cause a killing blow to all targets in the front area.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_010_1=After charging for 5 seconds, push back the current target and cause a large amount of damage.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_011_1=After charging for 5 seconds, reduce the target's field of vision and cause a large amount of damage.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_012_1=After charging for 2 seconds, cause a small amount of damage to targets in front and cancel all anger.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_013_1=After charging for 5 seconds, cause a killing blow to all targets in the front area.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_014_1=After charging for 5 seconds, disarm the target and cause a large amount of damage.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_015_1=After charging for 5 seconds, cause a large amount of damage, and if the target is in the air, knock them down and cause damage again.
desc_skill_ythc_boss_016_1=After charging for 2 seconds, cause a small amount of damage to the surrounding area and cancel all lightness values.
desc_skill_ythc_tj_001_1=A ninjutsu hiding technique from the East Sea, which makes oneself disappear from others' sight and clears all hatred. Attacking or being attacked will reveal oneself again, lasting for 20 seconds.
desc_skill_ythc_tj_002_1=A secret medicine from the Shen family fortress, which can immediately alleviate injuries and restore all health and internal strength.
desc_skill_ythc_tj_003_1=After charging for 2 seconds, cause a killing blow to all enemies within a 20-meter radius. (Damage to bosses is halved)
desc_skill_ythc_tj_004_1=Throw a smoke bomb at the target, causing all targets within a 10-meter radius to be stunned for 20 seconds. (This skill can only be used once per night mission)
desc_skill_ythc_tj_005_1=A bomb that can quickly release air currents in all directions, pushing back all targets within a 20-meter radius. The user can also use smoke as cover to avoid most skill damage for 20 seconds. (This skill can only be used once per night exploration.)
desc_skill_ythc_tj_006_1=Throw a magic ball at the target, pulling all enemy targets within a 20-meter radius towards the center and causing them to lose health. (This skill can only be used once per night exploration.)
desc_wuji_CS_by_wgl01_1=The power of the sword is greater than that of the gods. The flying sword attack deals {@0: damage}. <br> This move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> targets in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Master"</font> state. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Dance</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets who are <font color="#FF3030">patrolling the land</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">immobilize</font> them.
desc_wuji_CS_by_wgl01_10=The power of the sword is greater than that of the gods. The flying sword attack deals {@0: damage}. <br> This move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> targets in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Master"</font> state. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Dance</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets who are <font color="#FF3030">patrolling the land</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">immobilize</font> them.
