desc_wuji_CS_by_wgl01_5=The power of the sword is greater than that of the gods. The flying sword attack deals {@0: damage}. <br> This move can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> targets in the <font color="#FFAE00">"Celestial Master"</font> state. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Dance</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> targets who are <font color="#FF3030">patrolling the land</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">immobilize</font> them.
