desc_wuji_CS_by_wgl02_1=Clouds and mist reach the eyebrows, and demons enter the room at night. The attack deals {@0: damage} to the target within 20 meters. <br> (This move can be used to quickly approach opponents using lightness skills.) <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Dance</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; this move can be used to quickly approach opponents using lightness skills.
