desc_wuji_CS_by_wgl06_1=The land is vast and cannot be fully respected. The sword attack splashes enemies in front, dealing {@0: damage}. <br> When the move hits an unguarded enemy, it <font color="#f9fc00">immobilizes</font> them for 2 seconds. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Ghost Dance</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; can <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> unguarded targets in the air.
