desc_wuji_CS_gb_lhz01_1=Deal {@0:伤害包} damage to target;<br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>, skill will also affect enemies near target.
desc_wuji_CS_gb_lhz01_10=Fiery Rage Psychological Attack, Palm Spits Force does {@0:伤害包} damage to your target. <br>If you have <font color="#FFAE00">“Lotus Chi," </font>your Chi will extend to targets near your opponent. <br>(you will no longer use up <font color="#FFAE00">“Lotus Chi"</font>)
