desc_wuji_CS_kl_hqxxp01_1=Focus on oneself and never lose. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 15 meters in front and adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-restraint</font> to unguarded enemies: slows them down by 15% for 10 seconds, stackable up to 3 layers. <br> The move can be charged to increase its power. If the charge is successful, it can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unguarded enemies. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Qin Xin</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; the move becomes a 20-meter single-target skill, and the damage can splash up to 5 enemy players within a 5-meter radius of the target.
desc_wuji_CS_kl_hqxxp01_10=Focus on oneself and never lose. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 15 meters in front and adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-restraint</font> to unguarded enemies: slows them down by 15% for 10 seconds, stackable up to 3 layers. <br> The move can be charged to increase its power. If the charge is successful, it can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unguarded enemies. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Qin Xin</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; the move becomes a 20-meter single-target skill, and the damage can splash up to 5 enemy players within a 5-meter radius of the target.
