desc_wuji_CS_kl_hqxxp01_9=Focus on oneself and never lose. Deals {@0: damage} to enemies within 15 meters in front and adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">self-restraint</font> to unguarded enemies: slows them down by 15% for 10 seconds, stackable up to 3 layers. <br> The move can be charged to increase its power. If the charge is successful, it can <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unguarded enemies. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Qin Xin</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; the move becomes a 20-meter single-target skill, and the damage can splash up to 5 enemy players within a 5-meter radius of the target.
desc_wuji_CS_kl_hqxxp07_1=The cold rain and snow continue from afar. Release a mirror image of oneself to the selected area, dealing {@0: damage} to enemies within 5 meters. If the move hits an unguarded enemy and there is no Cold Spring, it will briefly <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> them, and the final hit of the move will <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unguarded targets in the area. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Qin Xin</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; increases the range of the selected area; the duration of Cold Spring generated by this move is extended to 30 seconds, but only one Cold Spring can exist at a time.
desc_wuji_CS_kl_hqxxp07_10=The cold rain and snow continue from afar. Release a mirror image of oneself to the selected area, dealing {@0: damage} to enemies within 5 meters. If the move hits an unguarded enemy and there is no Cold Spring, it will briefly <font color="#FFAE00">stun</font> them, and the final hit of the move will <font color="#f9fc00">knock back</font> unguarded targets in the area. <br> While using the move, leave behind a <font color="#f9fc00">Cold Spring</font> in the selected area for 7 seconds: teammates in the Cold Spring can dodge all hidden weapon attacks. <br> While using the move, the user is in the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> state. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Qin Xin</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; increases the range of the selected area; the duration of Cold Spring generated by this move is extended to 30 seconds, but only one Cold Spring can exist at a time.
