desc_wuji_CS_kl_hqxxp08_1=Flowers bloom and fall, without speaking of right and wrong. Deals {@0: damage} to the target. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Qin Xin</font>: Slightly increases the damage of the move; greatly increases the hit rate.
