desc_wuji_CS_kl_ymchj05_1=Burning incense and reading, watching cranes behind the curtain. Successfully blocking an attack adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> to oneself: when hit by a critical strike, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> will be activated, and the target's attacks will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Retreat</font> to them. Moon Soak can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds. <br> The absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> increases with the level of the move and the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font>. When the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, all <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> effects are removed and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds. <br> Switching moves removes the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> effects. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Moon Sea</font>: Increases the absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font>; when the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> effect is not removed and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_kl_ymchj05_10=Burning incense and reading, watching cranes behind the curtain. Successfully blocking an attack adds a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> to oneself: when hit by a critical strike, a <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> will be activated, and the target's attacks will add a layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Retreat</font> to them. Moon Soak can stack up to 5 layers and lasts for 15 seconds. <br> The absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> increases with the level of the move and the number of layers of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font>. When the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, all <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> effects are removed and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds. <br> Switching moves removes the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> and <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> effects. <br> <font color="#FF00FF">Moon Sea</font>: Increases the absorption amount of the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font>; when the <font color="#f9fc00">shield</font> dissipates, the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Soak</font> effect is not removed and cannot be obtained again within 5 seconds.
