desc_wuji_CS_kl_ymchj06_1=The cicadas sing alone, and the world is quiet. Instantly move behind the target and deal {@0: damage} to the target and enemies within a 5-meter radius. At the same time, <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> any enemies who do not defend against the attack. If the target has the <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Return</font> effect, the user will gain the <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Emperor's Body</font> effect when attacking. <font color="#FF00FF">Moon Sea</font>: Slightly increase the damage of attacks; enemies who are knocked down will also have their <font color="#FFAE00">soft defense</font> reduced by 15% for 5 seconds.
