desc_wuji_CS_kl_ymchj07_1=The weak waters of the Three Thousand, only memories of the deep mountains. The sound of the qin echoes softly: <font color="#FFAE00">Cannot be locked in a charging attack</font>, the user will continuously gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> effect: attempting to attack the user will consume one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> and cause them to <font color="#f9fc00">dance</font> for 3 seconds (lost in the flowers, even if they take damage they will not wake up) and add one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Return</font> to them. The <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> effect can stack up to 3 layers and will be removed when the attack ends. Can be interrupted by using [Quiet World] or [A Thousand Days of Drunkenness]. <font color="#FF00FF">Moon Sea</font>: When the attack ends or is interrupted, for each layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> effect, the user's <font color="#FFAE00">accuracy</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">evasion</font> will increase by 5% for 3 seconds.
desc_wuji_CS_kl_ymchj07_10=The weak waters of the Three Thousand, only memories of the deep mountains. The sound of the qin echoes softly: <font color="#FFAE00">Cannot be locked in a charging attack</font>, the user will continuously gain the <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> effect: attempting to attack the user will consume one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> and cause them to <font color="#f9fc00">dance</font> for 3 seconds (lost in the flowers, even if they take damage they will not wake up) and add one layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Moon Return</font> to them. The <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> effect can stack up to 3 layers and will be removed when the attack ends. Can be interrupted by using [Quiet World] or [A Thousand Days of Drunkenness]. <font color="#FF00FF">Moon Sea</font>: When the attack ends or is interrupted, for each layer of <font color="#FFAE00">Flower Moon Beauty</font> effect, the user's <font color="#FFAE00">accuracy</font> and <font color="#FFAE00">evasion</font> will increase by 5% for 3 seconds.
