desc_CS_jh_dldm01_1=Pummeling fists fly at the enemy, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage.<br>If the enemy does not parry, he will fall under the <font color="#FFAE00">Residual Might of the Iron Fist</font> state: Enemies hit by the <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Claw Explores Darkness</font> attack will suffer even greater damage.<br>If the enemy is under five stacks of <font color="#FFAE00">Ghost Approaching</font>, he will be beaten back.
