desc_CS_jh_sjjc08_1=Charges for 1.5 seconds and then fires an arrow forward, dealing {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 25 meters. Non-parrying enemies will have their skills <font color="#f9fc00">interrupted</font> and they will be <font color="#f9fc00">sent flying</font>. You get <font color="#f9fc00">Yellow Armor</font> while firing.<br>This skill cannot be charged up while in the air and damage will be weakened. Additionally, you will only be able to <font color="#f9fc00">knock down</font> non-parrying enemies.
