desc_CS_sjy_klbx07_1=Wounded dragon screamed. You accumulate energy and scream: When your HP is higher than or equal to 50%, 30% of the current HP will be consumed after the scream to obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Howl</font> status: Get 50 points of Rage and increase the damage of your skills by 25% for 8 seconds; <br>When the percentage of your own HP is lower than 50%, 50% of the current Energy will be consumed after the scream to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> status: Recover 80% of lost of HP and Energy, but the damage received during the period is increased by 100%. When a lethal attack is received, you will die directly. After 8 seconds, HP and Energy will recover to <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> state before the start.
desc_CS_sjy_klbx07_10=Wounded dragon screamed. You accumulate energy and scream: When your HP is higher than or equal to 50%, 15% of the current HP will be consumed after the scream to obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Howl</font> status: Get 50 points of Rage and increase the damage of your skills by 25% for 8 seconds; <br>When the percentage of your own HP is lower than 50%, 20% of the current Energy will be consumed after the scream to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> status: Recover 80% of lost of HP and Energy, but the damage received during the period is increased by 100%. When a lethal attack is received, you will die directly. After 8 seconds, HP and Energy will recover to <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> state before the start.
desc_CS_sjy_klbx07_11=Wounded dragon screamed. You accumulate energy and scream: When your HP is higher than or equal to 50%, 10% of the current HP will be consumed after the scream to obtain the <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Howl</font> status: Get 50 points of Rage and increase the damage of your skills by 25% for 8 seconds; <br>When the percentage of your own HP is lower than 50%, 10% of the current Energy will be consumed after the scream to obtain <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> status: Recover 80% of lost of HP and Energy, but the damage received during the period is increased by 100%. When a lethal attack is received, you will die directly. After 8 seconds, HP and Energy will recover to <font color="#FFAE00">Dragon Reflects Light</font> state before the start.
