desc_CS_sl_chpdg02_1=Inflict {@0:伤害包} damage to targets trapped in a whirlwind. <br>The first attack will <font color="#f9fc00">stun</font> the target. Second attack will have a chacne to <font color="#f9fc00">throw</font> the target.
desc_CS_sl_chpdg02_10=The fire buring likes thunder. Save the world to show mercy. Deals {@0:伤害包} damage to enemies within 5 meters. <br>The first hit can <font color="#f9fc00">Stun</font> enemies, the second hit can <font color="#f9fc00">Launch Up</font> enemies.
