desc_wuji_CS_gb_lhz08_1=Drag nearby enemies to you, dealing {@0:伤害包}, temporarily increase the power of lotus skills by 20%; <br>If you have learned <font color="#FFAE00">Give the Buddha Borrowed Flowers</font>, you gain extra <font color="#FFAE00">Lotus Chi</font>. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Ultimate Domination</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Drawing back skill becomes faster. When casting skill, you receive Yellow Armor.
