desc_wuji_CS_jh_sjjc02_1=Broken bamboo, growing bamboo, achieving your goals, Chenyin ballad technique. Inflict {@0:伤害包}on enemies within 20 meters in front of you, and inflicts non-parry targets with <font color="#FFAE00">Broken Tendons</font>: Decrease movement speed for 10%. Lasts 5 seconds. Can stack 5 times. <br><font color="#FF00FF">Mind and Vision</font>: Slightly increases the Skill damage and their range to 25 meters.
