desc_wuji_CS_jz_lyfh07_1=Dance with the sword, attack while moving and deal {@0:伤害包} damage to surrounding enemies. Enemies will take more damage if their legs are paralyzed. <br> (This attack cannot be interrupted by any skill.) <br><font color="#FF00FF">Falling Dust</font>: Skill Damage increases slightly. Each attack disables Flying Skills of unparried enemies for 2 seconds.
